<p begin="00:26:37.919" end="00:26:42.159" style="s2">pseudo dragon himself. They mocked him,</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.159" end="00:26:44.159" style="s2">telling him to give up. Rhett even</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.159" end="00:26:46.000" style="s2">sneered at Zeke, asking if this was the</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.159" end="00:26:48.080" style="s2">same man he claimed could pass, and if</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.000" end="00:26:50.080" style="s2">Rangus was truly stronger than them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.080" end="00:26:52.320" style="s2">Zeke stayed silent for a moment, then</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.080" end="00:26:54.240" style="s2">told them to stop spouting nonsense. The</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.320" end="00:26:56.240" style="s2">examiner informed Rangus that he only</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.240" end="00:26:58.080" style="s2">had one attempt left and asked if he</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.240" end="00:26:59.919" style="s2">still wanted to continue. Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.080" end="00:27:01.440" style="s2">couldn&#39;t answer. Overwhelmed by</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.919" end="00:27:03.440" style="s2">embarrassment and the ridicule of</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.440" end="00:27:05.039" style="s2">others. He lowered his head. But then</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.440" end="00:27:07.440" style="s2">Zeke walked up to him and asked what he</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.039" end="00:27:09.760" style="s2">was doing. He questioned why Rangus was</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.440" end="00:27:11.279" style="s2">using a sword instead of a spear, why he</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.760" end="00:27:12.960" style="s2">would choose a weapon that didn&#39;t suit</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.279" end="00:27:15.360" style="s2">him, and why he would take a test</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.960" end="00:27:17.520" style="s2">without any plan at all. Retin watched</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.360" end="00:27:19.440" style="s2">mockingly as Zeke told Rangus that in</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.520" end="00:27:20.960" style="s2">his current condition, he wouldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.440" end="00:27:22.960" style="s2">scratch the stone no matter how many</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.960" end="00:27:25.120" style="s2">times he tried. Rhett and his group</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.960" end="00:27:26.720" style="s2">laughed again, calling Zeke an idiot,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.120" end="00:27:28.880" style="s2">reminding him that Rangus knew nothing</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.720" end="00:27:30.720" style="s2">about using a spear. His weak father</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.880" end="00:27:32.720" style="s2">only ever taught him swordsmanship, they</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.720" end="00:27:34.480" style="s2">said, and switching weapons now wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.720" end="00:27:36.000" style="s2">change the outcome. But Zeke ignored</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.480" end="00:27:38.000" style="s2">their jeers and called out to the</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.000" end="00:27:40.400" style="s2">examiner, asking if it was against the</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.000" end="00:27:42.799" style="s2">rules to change weapons. The examiner</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.400" end="00:27:44.799" style="s2">said it wasn&#39;t. Then Rangus is lucky,&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.799" end="00:27:46.720" style="s2">Zeke said with a grin. He turned to</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.799" end="00:27:48.640" style="s2">Rangus and asked if he trusted him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.720" end="00:27:50.159" style="s2">Memories of all the humiliation he and</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.640" end="00:27:52.480" style="s2">his father had suffered flashed through</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.159" end="00:27:54.399" style="s2">Rangus&#39; mind. Gritting his teeth, he</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.480" end="00:27:56.159" style="s2">stood tall and said he would trust Zeke.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.399" end="00:27:58.480" style="s2">He would fight with a spear just as Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.159" end="00:27:59.840" style="s2">told him to. Rangus told us that his</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.480" end="00:28:02.000" style="s2">father never managed to enter the</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.840" end="00:28:03.679" style="s2">dragon&#39;s nest. Because of that, people</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.000" end="00:28:05.919" style="s2">called him a pseudo dragon and laughed</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.679" end="00:28:07.760" style="s2">at him. But despite all the humiliation,</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.919" end="00:28:10.159" style="s2">his father endured everything just to</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.760" end="00:28:11.919" style="s2">raise Rangus properly. That&#39;s why Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.159" end="00:28:14.240" style="s2">swore to prove to everyone that he,</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.919" end="00:28:16.960" style="s2">Rangus, the son raised with care by his</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.240" end="00:28:18.960" style="s2">father, is also a true dragon. He stood</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.960" end="00:28:21.520" style="s2">up once more, gripping the spear tightly</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.960" end="00:28:23.279" style="s2">in his hands, and declared that today he</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.520" end="00:28:25.440" style="s2">would prove that neither he nor his</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.279" end="00:28:27.120" style="s2">father were fake dragons. He also</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.440" end="00:28:29.120" style="s2">realized that if he tried again with a</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.120" end="00:28:31.440" style="s2">sword, the result would only be the same</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.120" end="00:28:33.679" style="s2">as before. So this time, he decided to</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.440" end="00:28:35.200" style="s2">trust Zeke completely. The only problem</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.679" end="00:28:37.840" style="s2">was that he didn&#39;t know how to use a</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.200" end="00:28:39.679" style="s2">spear. Zeke called out to him and as he</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.840" end="00:28:41.200" style="s2">pointed toward the enchanted stone, he</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.679" end="00:28:43.440" style="s2">told Rangus that there was nothing else</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.200" end="00:28:45.039" style="s2">he needed to do. Just thrust the spear</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.440" end="00:28:46.880" style="s2">straight into the stone without thinking</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.039" end="00:28:48.960" style="s2">about anything else. Just pierce it</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.880" end="00:28:51.120" style="s2">straight through,&quot; Zeke said firmly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.960" end="00:28:53.279" style="s2">Rangus tightened his grip on the spear.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.120" end="00:28:54.960" style="s2">He knew that under normal circumstances,</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.279" end="00:28:56.880" style="s2">stabbing the stone directly wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.960" end="00:28:58.240" style="s2">cause even the slightest damage,</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.880" end="00:29:00.399" style="s2">especially since it had a strong</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.240" end="00:29:02.559" style="s2">regeneration element. But Zeke was the</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.399" end="00:29:04.159" style="s2">first person to ever stand up for him,</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.559" end="00:29:06.640" style="s2">even though they had just met that very</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.159" end="00:29:09.200" style="s2">day. It was something new and unfamiliar</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.640" end="00:29:11.120" style="s2">to him. But because of that, he chose to</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.200" end="00:29:12.880" style="s2">place his full trust in Zeke and believe</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.120" end="00:29:14.720" style="s2">in his own strength this time. He</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.880" end="00:29:16.159" style="s2">gathered his source power into the spear</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.720" end="00:29:18.720" style="s2">and immediately noticed something</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.159" end="00:29:20.880" style="s2">strange. For years, he had wielded a</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.720" end="00:29:23.120" style="s2">sword. Yet, he had never managed to wrap</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.880" end="00:29:25.200" style="s2">it in this much source energy. Something</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.120" end="00:29:27.679" style="s2">he was now effortlessly doing with the</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.200" end="00:29:29.679" style="s2">spear. With a determined shout, Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.679" end="00:29:31.679" style="s2">unleashed his full power and struck the</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.679" end="00:29:33.520" style="s2">stone with everything he had. Rhettton</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.679" end="00:29:35.440" style="s2">nearly died laughing, saying exactly</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.520" end="00:29:37.360" style="s2">what he had predicted. The changing</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.440" end="00:29:39.360" style="s2">weapons wouldn&#39;t help him pass the test.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.360" end="00:29:41.600" style="s2">But Rangus didn&#39;t stop. He felt</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.360" end="00:29:43.200" style="s2">something different, something powerful.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.600" end="00:29:45.520" style="s2">The spear in his hands felt like an</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.200" end="00:29:47.200" style="s2">extension of his own body. Then, as he</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.520" end="00:29:49.120" style="s2">drove the weapon forward with all his</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.200" end="00:29:51.520" style="s2">strength, the spear pierced through the</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.120" end="00:29:53.120" style="s2">enchanted stone completely. The shock on</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.520" end="00:29:55.440" style="s2">Rhettin&#39;s face and those of his</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.120" end="00:29:56.799" style="s2">companions was priceless. Even the</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.440" end="00:29:58.880" style="s2">examiners couldn&#39;t hide their</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.799" end="00:30:00.880" style="s2">astonishment, delighted by what they had</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.880" end="00:30:02.799" style="s2">just witnessed. Rangus hadn&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.880" end="00:30:04.720" style="s2">scratched the stone. He had pierced</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.799" end="00:30:06.880" style="s2">straight through it. Zeke immediately</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.720" end="00:30:08.720" style="s2">praised him. While Rangus himself could</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.880" end="00:30:10.399" style="s2">hardly believe what he&#39;d done, even</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.720" end="00:30:12.559" style="s2">after the examiner officially declared</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.399" end="00:30:15.039" style="s2">that he had passed, Rangus still asked</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.559" end="00:30:17.200" style="s2">in disbelief if he had really succeeded.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.039" end="00:30:19.279" style="s2">Zeke smiled, wrapped an arm around his</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.200" end="00:30:21.600" style="s2">shoulder and confirmed it. Overwhelmed</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.279" end="00:30:23.679" style="s2">with joy, Rangus nearly cried as he</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.600" end="00:30:25.440" style="s2">hugged Zeke tightly, shouting over and</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.679" end="00:30:27.440" style="s2">over that he had done it, that he had</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.440" end="00:30:29.360" style="s2">passed the test. Rhettton&#39;s group,</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.440" end="00:30:31.440" style="s2">however, refused to believe it. They</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.360" end="00:30:33.679" style="s2">called it luck, but Retin himself stayed</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.440" end="00:30:36.000" style="s2">silent, shaking with rage. He couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.679" end="00:30:38.159" style="s2">accept that, just as Zeke had said,</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.000" end="00:30:40.559" style="s2">Rangus was actually stronger than them,</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.159" end="00:30:42.240" style="s2">and that his result was far better. The</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.559" end="00:30:44.480" style="s2">examiner then announced that the test</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.240" end="00:30:46.000" style="s2">had officially ended. Afterward, he</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.480" end="00:30:48.000" style="s2">declared that the entrance ceremony</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.000" end="00:30:50.480" style="s2">would begin shortly. Zeke immediately</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.000" end="00:30:52.320" style="s2">asked if the test was truly over. Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.480" end="00:30:54.000" style="s2">replied that it seemed so, but added</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.320" end="00:30:56.640" style="s2">that there would probably be more tests</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.000" end="00:30:58.640" style="s2">once they entered the dragon&#39;s nest.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.640" end="00:31:00.399" style="s2">Soon, a group of men emerged from a dark</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.640" end="00:31:02.240" style="s2">hallway. When they stepped into the</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.399" end="00:31:04.080" style="s2">light, the examiner announced that the</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.240" end="00:31:05.919" style="s2">head of the Elragon family would now</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.080" end="00:31:08.320" style="s2">deliver a speech to congratulate those</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.919" end="00:31:10.080" style="s2">who passed. The moment Zeke saw the man,</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.320" end="00:31:12.640" style="s2">he asked who the person with the cold,</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.080" end="00:31:14.159" style="s2">dark expression was. Rangis, clearly</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.640" end="00:31:16.320" style="s2">nervous, replied that it was the family</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.159" end="00:31:18.480" style="s2">head himself. That&#39;s the family head.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.320" end="00:31:20.720" style="s2">Zeke said, &quot;Why does he look like that?</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.480" end="00:31:23.200" style="s2">He&#39;s not even smiling. He looks colder</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.720" end="00:31:25.120" style="s2">than ice.&quot; Rangus immediately covered</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.200" end="00:31:27.279" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s mouth, whispering that it would</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.120" end="00:31:29.679" style="s2">be best if he stayed quiet, repeating</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.279" end="00:31:31.360" style="s2">his plea for him to stop talking. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.679" end="00:31:33.120" style="s2">nodded. When he looked again at the</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.360" end="00:31:34.559" style="s2">group, he remarked that these people</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.120" end="00:31:36.720" style="s2">represented the current power of the</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.559" end="00:31:38.480" style="s2">Lragon family. Some of them were at the</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.720" end="00:31:40.960" style="s2">sevenstar level, while others were</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.480" end="00:31:43.279" style="s2">six-star. To Zeke, their strength was</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.960" end="00:31:46.000" style="s2">impressive, especially since the current</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.279" end="00:31:48.320" style="s2">family head, Balsa Lragon, was an</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.000" end="00:31:50.399" style="s2">eight-star level powerhouse. A thousand</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.320" end="00:31:52.559" style="s2">years ago, only a handful of people had</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.399" end="00:31:54.240" style="s2">ever reached that level. Still, Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.559" end="00:31:56.080" style="s2">wasn&#39;t sure how many existed in this</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.240" end="00:31:58.240" style="s2">current era. &quot;I don&#39;t like this family</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.080" end="00:32:00.399" style="s2">head,&quot; Zeke muttered. But before he</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.240" end="00:32:02.159" style="s2">could say more, Rangus tried to hush him</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.399" end="00:32:03.840" style="s2">again. Zeke sighed and thought to</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.159" end="00:32:05.919" style="s2">himself that he never expected this man</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.840" end="00:32:08.240" style="s2">to be his father in this lifetime. A</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.919" end="00:32:10.480" style="s2">dark, fiery aura radiated from Balsa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.240" end="00:32:12.559" style="s2">body, making the entire area feel heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.480" end="00:32:14.399" style="s2">The examiner quickly ordered everyone to</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.559" end="00:32:16.399" style="s2">stay silent because Master Balsa was</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.399" end="00:32:18.880" style="s2">about to speak. When Balsa stepped</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.399" end="00:32:20.880" style="s2">forward, he uttered only a few words.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.880" end="00:32:23.440" style="s2">They must all strive to become the flesh</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.880" end="00:32:25.440" style="s2">and blood of the Lragon family. As he</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.440" end="00:32:27.919" style="s2">spoke, the terrifying pressure of his</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.440" end="00:32:30.080" style="s2">aura spread across the hall. Zeke wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.919" end="00:32:32.399" style="s2">affected, but many of the examinees</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.080" end="00:32:34.240" style="s2">trembled in fear, some struggling to</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.399" end="00:32:36.159" style="s2">breathe as their bodies froze under the</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.240" end="00:32:38.080" style="s2">immense pressure. Zeke noticed that even</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.159" end="00:32:39.760" style="s2">Rangus was affected. He couldn&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.080" end="00:32:41.279" style="s2">how easily everyone around him was</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.760" end="00:32:43.519" style="s2">overwhelmed by the family head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.279" end="00:32:45.360" style="s2">presence. More than that, Zeke could</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.519" end="00:32:47.440" style="s2">sense an intense hatred hidden within</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.360" end="00:32:49.440" style="s2">Balsa&#39;s aura. He didn&#39;t know the reason</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.440" end="00:32:50.960" style="s2">behind it, but even so, he couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.440" end="00:32:53.120" style="s2">bring himself to like the man who was</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.960" end="00:32:55.120" style="s2">supposedly his father. When Balsa turned</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.120" end="00:32:57.200" style="s2">away, another man stepped forward and</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.120" end="00:32:59.039" style="s2">drew everyone&#39;s attention. He had blonde</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.200" end="00:33:00.720" style="s2">hair and cheerfully thanked Balsza for</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.039" end="00:33:02.799" style="s2">his words. He then said that Master</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.720" end="00:33:05.120" style="s2">Balsa had high expectations for them</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.799" end="00:33:07.360" style="s2">all, and that just like his master, he</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.120" end="00:33:09.360" style="s2">would also keep his own speech short. As</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.360" end="00:33:11.120" style="s2">Zeke wondered who this man was, the</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.360" end="00:33:13.600" style="s2">speaker simply told everyone to train</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.120" end="00:33:15.519" style="s2">hard and grow stronger. &quot;That&#39;s it,&quot; one</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.600" end="00:33:17.200" style="s2">of the examiners muttered. The man</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.519" end="00:33:18.880" style="s2">smiled and said that people who worry</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.200" end="00:33:20.559" style="s2">too much about small things go bald</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.880" end="00:33:22.880" style="s2">early, so he wouldn&#39;t bother with long</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.559" end="00:33:24.480" style="s2">speeches. Zeke couldn&#39;t understand what</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.880" end="00:33:26.559" style="s2">was wrong with them, but at least the</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.480" end="00:33:28.480" style="s2">atmosphere in the hall had lightened up.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.559" end="00:33:30.080" style="s2">The examiner then announced that the new</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.480" end="00:33:32.080" style="s2">students would now be assigned to their</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.080" end="00:33:34.080" style="s2">dormitories. Everyone whose number was</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.080" end="00:33:35.519" style="s2">called had to head there immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.080" end="00:33:37.360" style="s2">Zeke asked if they wouldn&#39;t all be</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.519" end="00:33:39.600" style="s2">staying in the same dormatory, and</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.360" end="00:33:42.559" style="s2">Rangus explained that there were four,</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.600" end="00:33:44.399" style="s2">east, west, south, and north dorms.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.559" end="00:33:46.080" style="s2">Every student accepted into the academy</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.399" end="00:33:48.480" style="s2">was allowed to live in one of those four</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.080" end="00:33:50.799" style="s2">halls. When Zeke&#39;s number was called, he</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.480" end="00:33:53.279" style="s2">stood up and waved goodbye to Rangus. He</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.799" end="00:33:54.720" style="s2">was assigned to the east hall. As he</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.279" end="00:33:56.559" style="s2">walked through the corridor, he</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.720" end="00:33:58.559" style="s2">commented that a lot had changed in this</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.559" end="00:34:00.320" style="s2">place over the past thousand years.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.559" end="00:34:02.080" style="s2">After finding his room, he said that he</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.320" end="00:34:04.159" style="s2">must have gotten lost since it took him</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.080" end="00:34:05.760" style="s2">a while to arrive. and his roommate had</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.159" end="00:34:07.679" style="s2">probably gotten there first. When he</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.760" end="00:34:09.440" style="s2">opened the door, he cheerfully greeted</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.679" end="00:34:11.520" style="s2">his new roommate and apologized for</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.440" end="00:34:13.839" style="s2">being late. He then said that from today</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.520" end="00:34:16.000" style="s2">on they&#39;d be sharing the same room, but</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.839" end="00:34:17.520" style="s2">to his surprise, his new roommate turned</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.000" end="00:34:19.760" style="s2">out to be none other than Rangis</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.520" end="00:34:21.440" style="s2">himself. Zeke couldn&#39;t help but laugh,</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.760" end="00:34:23.200" style="s2">saying it seemed like fate kept linking</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.440" end="00:34:24.800" style="s2">them together. He asked if there was</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.200" end="00:34:26.320" style="s2">anything else scheduled for the day, and</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.800" end="00:34:28.960" style="s2">Rangus confirmed that their training</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.320" end="00:34:30.960" style="s2">would start tomorrow. &quot;Is that so?&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.960" end="00:34:32.639" style="s2">said casually, prompting Rangus to ask</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.960" end="00:34:34.879" style="s2">if he hadn&#39;t listened to the examiner&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.639" end="00:34:37.440" style="s2">earlier explanation. Zeke admitted that</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.879" end="00:34:39.040" style="s2">he hadn&#39;t on purpose. Rangus sighed and</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.440" end="00:34:40.960" style="s2">said they should get some rest early</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.040" end="00:34:43.520" style="s2">since training would begin the next day.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.960" end="00:34:45.679" style="s2">As Zeke gazed out the window, he thought</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.520" end="00:34:47.679" style="s2">about his plan to escape from the Lragon</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.679" end="00:34:49.200" style="s2">family and travel the world. But after</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.679" end="00:34:50.879" style="s2">what he&#39;d learned about the enchanted</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.200" end="00:34:53.200" style="s2">stone with regenerative properties and</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.879" end="00:34:54.560" style="s2">the healing potion, he realized he had</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.200" end="00:34:56.879" style="s2">discovered many interesting things</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.560" end="00:34:58.560" style="s2">during the exam. If he truly wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.879" end="00:35:00.000" style="s2">understand all the changes that had</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.560" end="00:35:02.079" style="s2">taken place over the past thousand</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.000" end="00:35:03.839" style="s2">years, he thought, then maybe staying</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.079" end="00:35:06.320" style="s2">with the Elragonon family for a while</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.839" end="00:35:08.240" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be such a bad idea after all. A</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.320" end="00:35:10.000" style="s2">month passed at the academy, and their</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.240" end="00:35:12.240" style="s2">training continued to grow harsher,</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.000" end="00:35:13.680" style="s2">holding heavy dumbbells in both hands.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.240" end="00:35:15.280" style="s2">The instructor explained that the</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.680" end="00:35:16.800" style="s2">dragon&#39;s breath he was teaching them was</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.280" end="00:35:19.440" style="s2">one of the most important techniques</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.800" end="00:35:21.520" style="s2">ever created by the 15th Lragon family</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.440" end="00:35:23.119" style="s2">head. After reminding them that they had</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.520" end="00:35:24.960" style="s2">to master the technique under any</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.119" end="00:35:27.119" style="s2">condition, the instructor&#39;s attention</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.960" end="00:35:28.960" style="s2">was drawn to a few students. Some of</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.119" end="00:35:31.200" style="s2">them, he noticed, had already mastered</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.960" end="00:35:33.680" style="s2">Dragon&#39;s breath, especially the young</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.200" end="00:35:35.680" style="s2">woman he called Master Lea. Her</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.680" end="00:35:37.280" style="s2">overflowing energy suggested that she</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.680" end="00:35:39.440" style="s2">was close to reaching the two star</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.280" end="00:35:40.960" style="s2">level. But aside from her, one other</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.440" end="00:35:43.440" style="s2">student caught his eye, and he could</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.960" end="00:35:45.040" style="s2">hardly believe what he was seeing. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.440" end="00:35:46.960" style="s2">was training while not only holding the</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.040" end="00:35:48.720" style="s2">dumbbells, but also balancing large</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.960" end="00:35:50.480" style="s2">stones on his head and arms. The</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.720" end="00:35:52.000" style="s2">instructor stared in disbelief and</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.480" end="00:35:54.079" style="s2">muttered to himself that the blood of</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.000" end="00:35:56.800" style="s2">the family head truly ran in Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.079" end="00:35:58.480" style="s2">veins. However, it was said that no one</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.800" end="00:36:00.720" style="s2">had ever taught Zeke anything since he</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.480" end="00:36:02.720" style="s2">was a child, which is why everything he</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.720" end="00:36:04.720" style="s2">was witnessing now felt unfamiliar to</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.720" end="00:36:06.400" style="s2">him. Zeke, on the other hand, couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.720" end="00:36:08.079" style="s2">believe that the technique he once</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.400" end="00:36:09.760" style="s2">called the Dragon King&#39;s breathing</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.079" end="00:36:11.839" style="s2">technique had been further developed by</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.760" end="00:36:13.520" style="s2">the succeeding family heads and that it</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.839" end="00:36:15.520" style="s2">was now being taught to other branches</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.520" end="00:36:17.520" style="s2">of the family as well. According to</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.520" end="00:36:19.200" style="s2">Zeke, breathing techniques were methods</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.520" end="00:36:21.119" style="s2">that gathered the source power from the</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.200" end="00:36:22.960" style="s2">surroundings into the body. Once</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.119" end="00:36:25.119" style="s2">circulated, this source power would</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.960" end="00:36:26.880" style="s2">strengthen a person&#39;s own inner energy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.119" end="00:36:28.880" style="s2">The effectiveness of such techniques</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.880" end="00:36:30.960" style="s2">depended on an individual&#39;s ability and</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.880" end="00:36:32.560" style="s2">intellect. That was why the great</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.960" end="00:36:34.720" style="s2">families of this world kept their</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.560" end="00:36:37.359" style="s2">techniques secret, never allowing them</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.720" end="00:36:39.839" style="s2">to be learned by outsiders or those not</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.359" end="00:36:41.839" style="s2">belonging to their bloodline. Zeke also</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.839" end="00:36:43.920" style="s2">realized that the dragon&#39;s breath was a</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.839" end="00:36:46.160" style="s2">safe and simple technique, easy enough</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.920" end="00:36:48.480" style="s2">to master, but it was useless to him if</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.160" end="00:36:50.160" style="s2">it could only be used while resting. His</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.480" end="00:36:51.440" style="s2">own version of the breathing technique</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.160" end="00:36:53.359" style="s2">allowed him to manipulate the</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.440" end="00:36:55.680" style="s2">surrounding source power even while</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.359" end="00:36:57.839" style="s2">moving. Because of that, it was far more</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.680" end="00:37:00.240" style="s2">complex and powerful in actual combat,</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.839" end="00:37:02.240" style="s2">but also much harder to learn. Only a</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.240" end="00:37:04.000" style="s2">few had ever mastered it. He thought the</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.240" end="00:37:06.079" style="s2">current generation must have simplified</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.000" end="00:37:07.839" style="s2">his original version so that even the</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.079" end="00:37:09.599" style="s2">family&#39;s branch members could learn it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.839" end="00:37:11.839" style="s2">And that decision had clearly helped</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.599" end="00:37:13.280" style="s2">strengthen the Eldragon family. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.839" end="00:37:15.760" style="s2">couldn&#39;t help but feel a strange</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.280" end="00:37:17.359" style="s2">satisfaction. He never imagined that the</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.760" end="00:37:18.880" style="s2">techniques he had discovered long ago</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.359" end="00:37:20.800" style="s2">would still have an impact after a</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.880" end="00:37:22.320" style="s2">thousand years. It made him wonder if</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.800" end="00:37:24.320" style="s2">the other martial arts techniques he</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.320" end="00:37:26.480" style="s2">created had also evolved over time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.320" end="00:37:28.720" style="s2">&quot;Interesting,&quot; he muttered to himself,</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.480" end="00:37:30.880" style="s2">amused by the thought. Leica, meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.720" end="00:37:32.800" style="s2">quietly observed Zeke from a distance.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.880" end="00:37:34.320" style="s2">Later in the cafeteria, the other</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.800" end="00:37:36.240" style="s2">students were astonished by how much</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.320" end="00:37:38.320" style="s2">food Zeke was eating. As he continued</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.240" end="00:37:39.839" style="s2">devouring his meal, he noticed Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.320" end="00:37:42.240" style="s2">sitting silently across from him.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.839" end="00:37:44.640" style="s2">&quot;What&#39;s wrong?&quot; Zeke asked. &quot;You won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.240" end="00:37:46.160" style="s2">get strong if you don&#39;t eat.&quot; Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.640" end="00:37:48.400" style="s2">simply asked if Zeke didn&#39;t find his</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.160" end="00:37:50.240" style="s2">stamina strange. &quot;That&#39;s it,&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.400" end="00:37:52.640" style="s2">replied. &quot;You just need to eat more if</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.240" end="00:37:55.119" style="s2">you want to get stronger. Train harder.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.640" end="00:37:56.880" style="s2">Push yourself.&quot; He even offered some of</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.119" end="00:37:58.720" style="s2">his food to Rangus, but the latter</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.880" end="00:38:00.720" style="s2">politely declined, saying he&#39;d had</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.720" end="00:38:01.839" style="s2">enough. As Zeke thought about how some</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.720" end="00:38:03.520" style="s2">of the students were already</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.839" end="00:38:05.680" style="s2">well-trained even before entering the</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.520" end="00:38:08.000" style="s2">academy, &quot;A girl suddenly approached</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.680" end="00:38:10.800" style="s2">them.&quot; &quot;You&#39;re quite impressive,&quot; Leica</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.000" end="00:38:12.480" style="s2">said, her tone calm yet confident. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.800" end="00:38:14.640" style="s2">blinked. &quot;And who are you supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.480" end="00:38:16.079" style="s2">be?&quot; he asked casually. Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.640" end="00:38:18.000" style="s2">immediately choked on his food,</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.079" end="00:38:20.400" style="s2">whispering nervously. &quot;You don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.000" end="00:38:21.760" style="s2">who she is?&quot; &quot;That&#39;s Master Lea, the</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.400" end="00:38:23.920" style="s2">daughter of the family head Lord</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.760" end="00:38:25.599" style="s2">Balsza.&quot; &quot;Oh,&quot; Zeke said indifferently.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.920" end="00:38:27.760" style="s2">&quot;What do you want me to do about that?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.599" end="00:38:29.760" style="s2">&quot;I don&#39;t know her.&quot; Rangus began</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.760" end="00:38:31.599" style="s2">sweating profusely. You can&#39;t talk like</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.760" end="00:38:33.280" style="s2">that. Master Lea is one of the</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.599" end="00:38:35.040" style="s2">candidates to become the next family</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.280" end="00:38:37.680" style="s2">head. She&#39;s not someone you can just</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.040" end="00:38:39.680" style="s2">speak to casually. Is that so? Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.680" end="00:38:42.160" style="s2">replied. Well, I&#39;m a family head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.680" end="00:38:44.079" style="s2">child, too. An illegitimate one, though?</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.160" end="00:38:46.400" style="s2">Rangus froze in shock while Leica looked</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.079" end="00:38:48.560" style="s2">at him curiously. Is that true? She</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.400" end="00:38:50.640" style="s2">asked. You&#39;re really the family head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.560" end="00:38:53.760" style="s2">illegitimate son? The narrator&#39;s voice</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.640" end="00:38:55.920" style="s2">continued. Lea Typhen Lragon, one of the</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.760" end="00:38:58.320" style="s2">candidates to inherit the Lragon family,</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.920" end="00:39:00.480" style="s2">was now standing before Zeke herself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.320" end="00:39:02.880" style="s2">Why would I lie about that? Zeke said,</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.480" end="00:39:05.040" style="s2">shrugging. Leica frowned slightly. Then</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.880" end="00:39:06.960" style="s2">tell me, how could an illegitimate child</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.040" end="00:39:08.960" style="s2">like you destroy the magic stone with</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.960" end="00:39:10.960" style="s2">your bare hands? How could someone not</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.960" end="00:39:13.280" style="s2">from a renowned family possess such</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.960" end="00:39:15.599" style="s2">strength? Because I&#39;m Zeke, he replied</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.280" end="00:39:18.400" style="s2">confidently, turning back to Rangus.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.599" end="00:39:20.960" style="s2">Stop staring and finish your food. Both</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.400" end="00:39:23.440" style="s2">Lea and Rangus fell silent for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.960" end="00:39:25.359" style="s2">Then Leica suddenly smiled. &quot;You really</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.440" end="00:39:27.119" style="s2">are an interesting person,&quot; she said</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.359" end="00:39:28.720" style="s2">before sitting down beside him. &quot;How</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.119" end="00:39:30.640" style="s2">about serving under me? I&#39;ll make you</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.720" end="00:39:32.560" style="s2">one of my followers.&quot; Zeke raised an</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.640" end="00:39:34.560" style="s2">eyebrow. &quot;What exactly do you mean by</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.560" end="00:39:36.320" style="s2">that?&quot; &quot;I want you to join me,&quot; she</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.560" end="00:39:38.560" style="s2">said. &quot;Be my ally, and I&#39;ll be your</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.320" end="00:39:40.720" style="s2">backer. Every illegitimate child needs</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.560" end="00:39:42.640" style="s2">allies and influence, don&#39;t they? Use</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.720" end="00:39:44.800" style="s2">your strength to help me become the next</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.640" end="00:39:46.720" style="s2">family head, and once I do, I&#39;ll help</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.800" end="00:39:48.880" style="s2">you achieve your own dreams.&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.720" end="00:39:51.599" style="s2">didn&#39;t even hesitate. &quot;No,&quot; he said</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.880" end="00:39:52.960" style="s2">flatly. Leica frowned again. Why not?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.599" end="00:39:55.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you want to become the</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.960" end="00:39:57.760" style="s2">family head yourself. As her aura flared</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.440" end="00:39:58.960" style="s2">with a faint crackling energy, Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.760" end="00:40:00.880" style="s2">could tell that she was close to</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.960" end="00:40:02.800" style="s2">reaching two star level. For someone her</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.880" end="00:40:05.200" style="s2">age to release an aura like that, she</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.800" end="00:40:07.040" style="s2">was indeed impressive. Still, Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.200" end="00:40:09.040" style="s2">remained calm. You can think and do</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.040" end="00:40:10.880" style="s2">whatever you want, he said. But I have</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.040" end="00:40:14.079" style="s2">no interest in being family head or any</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.880" end="00:40:16.079" style="s2">kind of title. Why? Lea asked coldly.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.079" end="00:40:17.920" style="s2">Zeke stabbed his knife into the table.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.079" end="00:40:20.000" style="s2">because I don&#39;t need to serve anyone,&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.920" end="00:40:22.640" style="s2">he said, his voice steady but sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.000" end="00:40:25.280" style="s2">&quot;I&#39;m the strongest person there is.&quot; The</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.640" end="00:40:27.280" style="s2">cafeteria went silent. Even Lea couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.280" end="00:40:29.119" style="s2">believe what she was feeling. Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.280" end="00:40:31.200" style="s2">presence had completely overwhelmed her</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.119" end="00:40:33.280" style="s2">for a moment. Rangus immediately stepped</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.200" end="00:40:35.280" style="s2">in to diffuse the tension, urging both</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.280" end="00:40:37.599" style="s2">of them to calm down. But Leica wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.280" end="00:40:39.359" style="s2">the type to back off. Embarrassed and</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.599" end="00:40:41.359" style="s2">angered by what just happened. She</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.359" end="00:40:43.119" style="s2">decided to challenge Zeke to a duel.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.359" end="00:40:45.359" style="s2">Zeke, however, didn&#39;t seem to care and</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.119" end="00:40:47.599" style="s2">simply continued eating. Moments later,</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.359" end="00:40:49.839" style="s2">a commotion spread across the campus.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.599" end="00:40:51.280" style="s2">Where are they going? One student asked.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.839" end="00:40:53.040" style="s2">To the training grounds, another</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.280" end="00:40:55.040" style="s2">replied. There&#39;s going to be a duel</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.040" end="00:40:57.599" style="s2">between the younger generation. Master</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.040" end="00:40:59.680" style="s2">Lea herself is fighting. What? Master</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.599" end="00:41:01.359" style="s2">Lea from the Typhen family? Someone</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.680" end="00:41:03.119" style="s2">exclaimed. Who&#39;s brave enough to</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.359" end="00:41:04.800" style="s2">challenge her? When they arrived at the</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.119" end="00:41:06.800" style="s2">training grounds, everyone whispered</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.800" end="00:41:08.800" style="s2">among themselves, wondering who would</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.800" end="00:41:10.560" style="s2">face her. Zeke, meanwhile, couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.800" end="00:41:12.640" style="s2">believe Leica was actually serious about</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.560" end="00:41:14.560" style="s2">the duel. &quot;Are you all right with this?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.640" end="00:41:17.040" style="s2">Rangus asked nervously. You&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.560" end="00:41:19.440" style="s2">fighting Master Lea. Even if you call</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.040" end="00:41:22.160" style="s2">her Master, I don&#39;t know who she is,&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.440" end="00:41:23.680" style="s2">Zeke replied bluntly. Rang sighed. &quot;You</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.160" end="00:41:25.040" style="s2">should at least show some respect now</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.680" end="00:41:27.760" style="s2">that I know you&#39;re also the family</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.040" end="00:41:30.000" style="s2">head&#39;s son.&quot; &quot;Do what you want,&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.760" end="00:41:31.760" style="s2">said. Still, Rangus tried to explain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.000" end="00:41:33.839" style="s2">&quot;What&#39;s important now is that you</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.760" end="00:41:35.680" style="s2">understand who you&#39;re up against. Master</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.839" end="00:41:38.640" style="s2">Lea isn&#39;t just anyone. She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.680" end="00:41:40.400" style="s2">daughter of Lord Balsa Elragon and she</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.640" end="00:41:42.800" style="s2">also carries the blood of the Typhen</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.400" end="00:41:45.200" style="s2">family, one of the four great families</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.800" end="00:41:47.040" style="s2">supporting the Lragons. She&#39;s a prodigy</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.200" end="00:41:48.640" style="s2">who mastered all forms of the Typhen</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.040" end="00:41:50.800" style="s2">family&#39;s hereditary lightning great</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.640" end="00:41:52.160" style="s2">sword technique at a young age. Like her</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.800" end="00:41:55.040" style="s2">father&#39;s other children, she has</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.160" end="00:41:56.480" style="s2">terrifying talent. Zeke tilted his head.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.040" end="00:41:58.160" style="s2">I didn&#39;t understand a word of that</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.480" end="00:42:00.880" style="s2">except that she&#39;s the family head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.160" end="00:42:02.720" style="s2">daughter. Rangus stared at him. How do</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.880" end="00:42:04.960" style="s2">you not know any of this? Because I</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.720" end="00:42:07.040" style="s2">don&#39;t, Zeke said plainly. So, don&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.960" end="00:42:08.720" style="s2">me. Rangus blinked as Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.040" end="00:42:11.280" style="s2">laughed. But since I don&#39;t know anything</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.720" end="00:42:13.359" style="s2">about her, he said with a grin. That&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.280" end="00:42:15.200" style="s2">just make the fight more fun. Sounds</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.359" end="00:42:17.520" style="s2">exciting. Rangus could only sigh and</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.200" end="00:42:18.960" style="s2">worry. No matter how strong Zeke was,</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.520" end="00:42:21.119" style="s2">Master Leica was on another level</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.960" end="00:42:23.440" style="s2">entirely. Why did you even accept her</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.119" end="00:42:25.440" style="s2">challenge? He asked. I never run from a</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.440" end="00:42:28.079" style="s2">fight, Zeke answered. And it looks like</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.440" end="00:42:29.680" style="s2">my challenger&#39;s ready anyway. At that</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.079" end="00:42:31.920" style="s2">moment, Leica stood with her sword</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.680" end="00:42:33.839" style="s2">planted firmly in the ground, her aura</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.920" end="00:42:36.000" style="s2">flared, lightning crackling faintly</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.839" end="00:42:38.960" style="s2">around her. &quot;Are you two done talking?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.000" end="00:42:40.880" style="s2">she asked coldly. Leica shouted, asking</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.960" end="00:42:43.359" style="s2">if they were finally done talking, and</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.880" end="00:42:45.440" style="s2">Zeke replied that he was ready. Ranges,</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.359" end="00:42:47.440" style="s2">trembling in fear and shock, immediately</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.440" end="00:42:49.280" style="s2">ran away from them, warning Zeke to be</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.440" end="00:42:51.040" style="s2">careful in their fight. Zeke then turned</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.280" end="00:42:53.200" style="s2">to Leica and asked why she was so</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.040" end="00:42:54.720" style="s2">determined to fight him. Lea explained</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.200" end="00:42:57.200" style="s2">that she wanted to become the next</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.720" end="00:42:59.440" style="s2">family head of the Lragon family. And to</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.200" end="00:43:01.440" style="s2">achieve that, she needed to defeat Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.440" end="00:43:03.680" style="s2">and make him one of her followers. &quot;What</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.440" end="00:43:05.440" style="s2">do you mean by that?&quot; Zeke asked,</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.680" end="00:43:07.839" style="s2">wondering what his connection was to her</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.440" end="00:43:10.000" style="s2">dream of becoming the family head. Leica</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.839" end="00:43:11.839" style="s2">questioned him back, asking if he truly</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.000" end="00:43:14.000" style="s2">had no idea about the current situation</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.839" end="00:43:15.839" style="s2">of their family and whether being an</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.000" end="00:43:18.160" style="s2">illegitimate child was the reason he was</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.839" end="00:43:20.000" style="s2">so unaware. Zeke simply answered that he</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.160" end="00:43:22.079" style="s2">didn&#39;t, admitting that his knowledge</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.000" end="00:43:24.240" style="s2">about their family was limited. Because</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.079" end="00:43:26.000" style="s2">of that, Leica began explaining. She</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.240" end="00:43:27.839" style="s2">said that including both of them, there</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.000" end="00:43:30.480" style="s2">were five candidates to become the next</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.839" end="00:43:32.000" style="s2">family head. Except for Zeke, all of her</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.480" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">siblings were connected to the four</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.000" end="00:43:36.160" style="s2">major branch families of the Lragon</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.920" end="00:43:37.760" style="s2">clan. The position of family head was so</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.160" end="00:43:39.839" style="s2">important that it became a source of</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.760" end="00:43:41.680" style="s2">conflict among those branches. For that</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.839" end="00:43:43.520" style="s2">reason, all of Zeke&#39;s siblings had</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.680" end="00:43:45.359" style="s2">entered the dragon&#39;s nest to study and</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:46.960" style="s2">represent their respective families.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.359" end="00:43:49.200" style="s2">Since the fight for succession had</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.960" end="00:43:50.960" style="s2">turned into a fierce competition, Leica</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.200" end="00:43:52.800" style="s2">needed strong allies to stand against</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.960" end="00:43:54.240" style="s2">her older brothers. Zeke quickly</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.800" end="00:43:55.839" style="s2">understood that this was a power</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.240" end="00:43:58.160" style="s2">struggle between the four main branches</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.839" end="00:44:00.079" style="s2">of the Lragon family. He found it all</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.160" end="00:44:02.319" style="s2">too complicated and wasn&#39;t even sure if</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.079" end="00:44:04.079" style="s2">he wanted to understand it. Leica then</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.319" end="00:44:06.400" style="s2">continued, saying that as one of the</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.079" end="00:44:08.240" style="s2">candidates for family head, she needed</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.400" end="00:44:10.319" style="s2">to strengthen not only her knowledge and</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.240" end="00:44:12.400" style="s2">power, but also her influence by</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.319" end="00:44:14.160" style="s2">gathering strong followers. Without</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.400" end="00:44:16.000" style="s2">another word, she charged straight</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.160" end="00:44:17.520" style="s2">towards Zeke, declaring that she would</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.000" end="00:44:19.599" style="s2">defeat him right then and there to make</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.520" end="00:44:21.920" style="s2">him one of her subordinates. But Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.599" end="00:44:23.359" style="s2">easily dodged her powerful strike, as</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.920" end="00:44:25.359" style="s2">well as the flurry of attacks that</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.359" end="00:44:27.280" style="s2">followed. Still, Leica refused to let</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.359" end="00:44:29.040" style="s2">him escape. The onlookers couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.280" end="00:44:31.280" style="s2">believe what they were seeing. The speed</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.040" end="00:44:33.520" style="s2">of their movements was incredible. Lea&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.280" end="00:44:35.680" style="s2">attacks, despite her heavy greatsword,</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.520" end="00:44:37.680" style="s2">flowed so smoothly and rapidly that it</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.680" end="00:44:39.599" style="s2">seemed almost effortless. As they</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.680" end="00:44:41.599" style="s2">watched the battle between the siblings,</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.599" end="00:44:44.000" style="s2">the crowd began to murmur about Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.599" end="00:44:45.599" style="s2">precise control over her source power,</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.000" end="00:44:47.680" style="s2">noting how her strikes were becoming</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.599" end="00:44:49.520" style="s2">faster and stronger over time. They</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.680" end="00:44:51.119" style="s2">could only marvel at the power of a true</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.520" end="00:44:53.359" style="s2">daughter of the family head from one of</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.119" end="00:44:55.440" style="s2">the main branches. Some even said the</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.359" end="00:44:57.440" style="s2">fight&#39;s result was already obvious. What</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.440" end="00:44:59.520" style="s2">they didn&#39;t know, however, was that</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.440" end="00:45:01.520" style="s2">Leica herself was growing increasingly</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.520" end="00:45:03.359" style="s2">frustrated. She couldn&#39;t understand how</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.520" end="00:45:05.520" style="s2">Zeke kept dodging every single one of</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.359" end="00:45:07.680" style="s2">her attacks or why it felt like he was</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.520" end="00:45:09.599" style="s2">simply toying with her. Rangis, who was</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.680" end="00:45:11.839" style="s2">watching from a distance, couldn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.599" end="00:45:13.680" style="s2">but be amazed, his earlier worries</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.839" end="00:45:15.760" style="s2">fading away as he saw Zeke&#39;s calm</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.680" end="00:45:17.760" style="s2">movements. Zeke then remarked that the</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.760" end="00:45:19.839" style="s2">martial arts Leica was using were unlike</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.760" end="00:45:21.680" style="s2">anything he had seen before. He admitted</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.839" end="00:45:23.760" style="s2">that her movements were far faster than</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.680" end="00:45:26.160" style="s2">those of any ordinary one-star level</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.760" end="00:45:27.920" style="s2">fighter. But Lea, irritated, shouted for</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.160" end="00:45:30.000" style="s2">him to stop talking and focus on their</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.920" end="00:45:32.160" style="s2">fight. Zeke clenched his fist and said</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.000" end="00:45:33.839" style="s2">he was already focused. And that was</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.160" end="00:45:36.000" style="s2">exactly why he could unleash such a</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.839" end="00:45:37.920" style="s2">powerful strike so easily. His punch</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.000" end="00:45:40.160" style="s2">landed squarely and Leica immediately</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.920" end="00:45:42.079" style="s2">gagged from the force. She fell to her</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.160" end="00:45:44.400" style="s2">knees, gripping her sword and stomach in</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.079" end="00:45:46.480" style="s2">pain. The spectators gasped and began</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.400" end="00:45:48.640" style="s2">whispering among themselves, wondering</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.480" end="00:45:50.640" style="s2">how Zeke managed to avoid all of Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.640" end="00:45:53.359" style="s2">attacks and who this mysterious boy</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.640" end="00:45:55.040" style="s2">truly was. As Leica struggled to stand,</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.359" end="00:45:56.880" style="s2">she asked why none of her strikes could</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.040" end="00:45:58.960" style="s2">land. Compared to other one-star</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.880" end="00:46:01.040" style="s2">fighters, she knew she was much faster.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.960" end="00:46:02.880" style="s2">So, logically, Zeke shouldn&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.040" end="00:46:04.880" style="s2">keep up. Zeke admitted that she was</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.880" end="00:46:07.359" style="s2">indeed faster than any one star he had</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.880" end="00:46:09.200" style="s2">ever seen. But in his eyes, she was</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.359" end="00:46:11.200" style="s2">still just a one-star. &quot;You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.200" end="00:46:12.720" style="s2">one-star, too,&quot; Leica snapped, saying</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.200" end="00:46:14.560" style="s2">that Zeke shouldn&#39;t be able to match her</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.720" end="00:46:16.640" style="s2">speed and movements. &quot;There&#39;s a simple</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.560" end="00:46:18.640" style="s2">reason for that,&quot; Zeke replied. &quot;Your</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.640" end="00:46:20.960" style="s2">breathing, the movement of your eyes,</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.640" end="00:46:22.880" style="s2">even the shift of your muscles.&quot; &quot;I can</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.960" end="00:46:25.040" style="s2">read them all. By observing these small</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.880" end="00:46:27.040" style="s2">details, I can predict your next move.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.040" end="00:46:29.280" style="s2">It&#39;s all based on experience.&quot; &quot;Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.040" end="00:46:31.680" style="s2">make me laugh,&quot; Leica shouted, launching</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.280" end="00:46:33.839" style="s2">another fast strike toward him. But Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.680" end="00:46:35.440" style="s2">easily dodged again, saying that just</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.839" end="00:46:37.760" style="s2">like his words a moment ago, he could</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.440" end="00:46:39.359" style="s2">see and read her every move. In the next</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.760" end="00:46:41.599" style="s2">instant, he countered with another</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.359" end="00:46:43.680" style="s2">powerful attack that sent Lea crashing</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.599" end="00:46:46.000" style="s2">into the wall with a violent force. The</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.680" end="00:46:48.079" style="s2">spectators screamed in shock, asking if</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.000" end="00:46:50.160" style="s2">Leica had really been defeated. Master</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.079" end="00:46:52.800" style="s2">Zeke, that was amazing. You beat Master</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.160" end="00:46:54.400" style="s2">Lea. Rangus shouted in excitement, but</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.800" end="00:46:56.720" style="s2">Zeke calmly said that it wasn&#39;t over</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.400" end="00:46:59.119" style="s2">yet. Their fight wasn&#39;t finished. As the</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.720" end="00:47:01.520" style="s2">dust cleared, Leica stood once again,</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.119" end="00:47:03.040" style="s2">bruised, but defiant. Zeke noted that</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.520" end="00:47:05.119" style="s2">she had focused her source power into</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.040" end="00:47:07.200" style="s2">her core, allowing her to endure his</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.119" end="00:47:08.880" style="s2">attack without suffering serious damage.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.200" end="00:47:11.119" style="s2">He smiled slightly and admitted that</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.880" end="00:47:13.200" style="s2">Leica was truly an extraordinary girl.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.119" end="00:47:15.440" style="s2">&quot;That&#39;s enough, Master Lea,&quot; Rangus</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.200" end="00:47:16.720" style="s2">pleaded. But Zeke told him to move back,</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.440" end="00:47:18.880" style="s2">warning that he could get caught in</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.720" end="00:47:20.960" style="s2">their next exchange. Zeke then noticed</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.880" end="00:47:23.040" style="s2">an intense surge of aura flowing from</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.960" end="00:47:24.960" style="s2">Leica. He wondered if she had just</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.040" end="00:47:26.880" style="s2">advanced to the two star level. The</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.960" end="00:47:28.800" style="s2">spectators noticed it, too. They</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.880" end="00:47:30.319" style="s2">couldn&#39;t be mistaken. The glowing mark</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.800" end="00:47:32.079" style="s2">on her body was proof that she had</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.319" end="00:47:34.319" style="s2">indeed become a two star with a white</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.079" end="00:47:35.839" style="s2">aura. The two star level was a stage</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.319" end="00:47:37.440" style="s2">where one could channel source power</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.839" end="00:47:40.240" style="s2">into their martial arts, even</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.440" end="00:47:42.079" style="s2">manifesting it outside their body as a</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.240" end="00:47:44.480" style="s2">thanked Zeke, saying that because of</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.079" end="00:47:46.640" style="s2">him, she had achieved the two star level</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.480" end="00:47:49.040" style="s2">earlier than expected. But because of</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.640" end="00:47:51.200" style="s2">that, she declared, &quot;You no longer have</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.040" end="00:47:53.520" style="s2">any chance of winning.&quot; With her aura</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.200" end="00:47:55.920" style="s2">blazing, she charged toward Zeke, her</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.520" end="00:47:58.160" style="s2">great sword surrounded by radiant power.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.920" end="00:48:00.319" style="s2">Zeke only laughed. He looked genuinely</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.160" end="00:48:02.160" style="s2">thrilled. &quot;You&#39;ve really improved,&quot; he</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.319" end="00:48:04.400" style="s2">said with excitement, dodging another</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.160" end="00:48:06.960" style="s2">rapid strike. &quot;Your speed is incredible</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.400" end="00:48:08.640" style="s2">now.&quot; &quot;But his expression suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.960" end="00:48:11.280" style="s2">changed when he felt a sting on his</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.640" end="00:48:13.520" style="s2">cheek. A shallow cut. &quot;I know I dodged</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.280" end="00:48:15.440" style="s2">that attack,&quot; Zeke thought to himself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.520" end="00:48:16.720" style="s2">Leica smirked and asked if he could</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.440" end="00:48:18.800" style="s2">finally see the difference in their</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.720" end="00:48:20.480" style="s2">strength. &quot;This is my true ability,&quot; she</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.800" end="00:48:22.480" style="s2">said proudly. &quot;Now that I&#39;ve become a</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.480" end="00:48:23.920" style="s2">full two star and gained my aura, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.480" end="00:48:26.240" style="s2">show you the real power of the true</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.920" end="00:48:28.160" style="s2">thunder greats sword technique.&quot; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.240" end="00:48:30.480" style="s2">then I get to witness a martial art I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.160" end="00:48:32.640" style="s2">never seen before, Zeke said, smiling in</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.480" end="00:48:34.480" style="s2">excitement. To him, this was turning out</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.640" end="00:48:36.720" style="s2">to be the most thrilling and enjoyable</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.480" end="00:48:38.240" style="s2">moment of their fight. Leica suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.720" end="00:48:40.880" style="s2">unleashed the lightning greatsword</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.240" end="00:48:42.800" style="s2">technique. Lightning flash, her sword</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.880" end="00:48:45.200" style="s2">crackling with blinding golden energy as</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.800" end="00:48:46.960" style="s2">she charged forward. Zeke was instantly</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.200" end="00:48:48.880" style="s2">enveloped in a storm of lightning,</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.960" end="00:48:51.119" style="s2">forcing him to retreat a step back as he</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.880" end="00:48:52.559" style="s2">shouted, &quot;Wait a second. What kind of</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.119" end="00:48:54.559" style="s2">technique was that? How can you</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.559" end="00:48:56.400" style="s2">manipulate lightning like that? Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.559" end="00:48:58.400" style="s2">this too much for a sparring match?</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.400" end="00:49:00.319" style="s2">Leica smirked, driving her sword into</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.400" end="00:49:02.480" style="s2">the ground as golden light surged around</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.319" end="00:49:04.559" style="s2">her. You seem surprised, she said</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.480" end="00:49:06.640" style="s2">calmly, summoning another move,</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.559" end="00:49:08.400" style="s2">lightning net. Sparks erupted from the</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.640" end="00:49:10.960" style="s2">earth, forming a glowing web of</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.400" end="00:49:13.440" style="s2">electricity that shot toward Zeke, but</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.960" end="00:49:15.839" style="s2">he narrowly dodged it. As he landed, he</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.440" end="00:49:17.760" style="s2">muttered to himself. Her power has grown</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.839" end="00:49:20.079" style="s2">tremendously. Her strength now is</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.760" end="00:49:22.559" style="s2">nothing like before. At this rate, this</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.079" end="00:49:24.640" style="s2">fight won&#39;t be easy. The audience</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.559" end="00:49:26.559" style="s2">murmured in awe, unable to hide their</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.640" end="00:49:28.480" style="s2">astonishment. Ever since Leica had</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.559" end="00:49:30.240" style="s2">advanced to two star level, the tide of</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.480" end="00:49:32.079" style="s2">the battle had completely turned.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.240" end="00:49:33.920" style="s2">Rangus, who had been watching anxiously,</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.079" end="00:49:36.160" style="s2">began to worry. Zeke noticed that</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.920" end="00:49:38.480" style="s2">Leica&#39;s movements were simple. Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.160" end="00:49:40.640" style="s2">new compared to her onestar self. But</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.480" end="00:49:42.559" style="s2">every swing of her blade now carried far</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.640" end="00:49:44.319" style="s2">greater force. Her lightning greats</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.559" end="00:49:47.119" style="s2">sword technique was overflowing with</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.319" end="00:49:49.040" style="s2">power. Her aura amplifying each strike.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.119" end="00:49:51.359" style="s2">What surprised Zeke even more was the</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.040" end="00:49:53.040" style="s2">speed. Leica was moving faster than he</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.359" end="00:49:55.280" style="s2">could have anticipated, and her</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.040" end="00:49:57.599" style="s2">lightning felt strangely mysterious.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.280" end="00:49:59.599" style="s2">Still, he remained confident. Even if</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.599" end="00:50:01.520" style="s2">she could cloak herself in thunder, he</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.599" end="00:50:03.520" style="s2">was sure he could counter it. Yet,</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.520" end="00:50:05.520" style="s2">curiosity filled him. What kind of power</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.520" end="00:50:07.280" style="s2">was this? What kind of lightning could</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.520" end="00:50:09.520" style="s2">she command? While evading her</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.280" end="00:50:12.319" style="s2">continuous assault, he studied her every</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.520" end="00:50:14.480" style="s2">move, analyzing her aura and its rhythm.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.319" end="00:50:16.640" style="s2">Leica, noticing Zeke&#39;s calm smile as he</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.480" end="00:50:18.880" style="s2">danced away from her attacks, frowned.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.640" end="00:50:20.880" style="s2">Still smiling. You look too relaxed for</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.880" end="00:50:22.960" style="s2">someone in a duel, she sneered. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.880" end="00:50:25.200" style="s2">see how long that lasts. She dashed</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.960" end="00:50:27.119" style="s2">forward once more, her sword blazing</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.200" end="00:50:29.280" style="s2">with light as she used swift thunder,</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.119" end="00:50:31.040" style="s2">enveloping herself in golden lightning.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.280" end="00:50:32.880" style="s2">But again, Zeke evaded at the last</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.040" end="00:50:35.359" style="s2">moment. She&#39;s as fast as lightning</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.880" end="00:50:37.599" style="s2">itself, he thought, only for Leica to</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.359" end="00:50:39.599" style="s2">swing her sword mid charge. The blow</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.599" end="00:50:41.440" style="s2">struck true this time, sending Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.599" end="00:50:43.280" style="s2">flying backward with a powerful shock</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.440" end="00:50:45.599" style="s2">wave that scattered dust and debris</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.280" end="00:50:47.680" style="s2">across the field. Ranges gasped and</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.599" end="00:50:49.200" style="s2">rushed towards Zeke out of sheer panic.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.680" end="00:50:51.520" style="s2">But one of the spectators grabbed his</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.200" end="00:50:53.520" style="s2">arm to stop him. Meanwhile, Zeke stood</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.520" end="00:50:55.680" style="s2">up, his clothes scorched, but his will</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.520" end="00:50:57.440" style="s2">unshaken. Leica charged again,</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.680" end="00:50:59.599" style="s2">unleashing another lightning flash,</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.440" end="00:51:01.599" style="s2">striking him headon. Yet, Zeke still</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.599" end="00:51:03.680" style="s2">stood tall afterward. &quot;How is he still</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.599" end="00:51:05.839" style="s2">standing?&quot; Leica muttered, her brow</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.680" end="00:51:07.839" style="s2">furrowed in disbelief. Rangus ran toward</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.839" end="00:51:10.079" style="s2">them, shouting, &quot;Master Lea, stop!&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.839" end="00:51:11.920" style="s2">&quot;That&#39;s enough. We&#39;ve already seen your</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.079" end="00:51:14.480" style="s2">strength.&quot; But Leica snapped back</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.920" end="00:51:16.079" style="s2">coldly. Do you not understand, Rangus?</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.480" end="00:51:18.319" style="s2">Stopping mid battle would be an insult</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.079" end="00:51:20.400" style="s2">to Zeke. Desperate, Rangus turned to</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.319" end="00:51:22.640" style="s2">Zeke and begged. Please, Master Zeke,</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.400" end="00:51:24.880" style="s2">surrender. That&#39;s enough. Leica</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.640" end="00:51:27.040" style="s2">chuckled. He&#39;s right. Judging by your</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.880" end="00:51:29.119" style="s2">condition, surrendering would be wise.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.040" end="00:51:31.119" style="s2">If you kneel and pledge loyalty to me,</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.119" end="00:51:33.760" style="s2">I&#39;ll stop. But Zeke only smiled</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.119" end="00:51:35.760" style="s2">silently. Lea&#39;s eyes hardened. Even as</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.760" end="00:51:38.240" style="s2">an illegitimate child, you&#39;re truly a</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.760" end="00:51:40.079" style="s2">proud Lragon, she said with a hint of</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.240" end="00:51:42.480" style="s2">mockery. She raised her great sword</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.079" end="00:51:44.559" style="s2">high, her aura surging. If that&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.480" end="00:51:46.640" style="s2">you want, then I&#39;ll use my full strength</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.559" end="00:51:48.319" style="s2">to end this. Lightning roared from the</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.640" end="00:51:51.119" style="s2">heavens as Leica summoned her first</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.319" end="00:51:53.040" style="s2">secret art. Heaven&#39;s thunder. A colossal</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.119" end="00:51:54.800" style="s2">surge of golden energy descended,</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.040" end="00:51:57.040" style="s2">shattering the stones beneath Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.800" end="00:51:59.359" style="s2">feet. Thunderbolt struck his body in a</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.040" end="00:52:01.280" style="s2">storm of divine fury. Rangus cried out</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.359" end="00:52:03.359" style="s2">in terror, watching his friend&#39;s body</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.280" end="00:52:05.599" style="s2">engulfed by golden lightning. Smoke</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.359" end="00:52:07.680" style="s2">rising from his charred form. Leica</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.599" end="00:52:09.839" style="s2">drove her sword into the ground, exhaled</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.680" end="00:52:12.559" style="s2">deeply, and said softly, &quot;I&#39;m sorry,</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.839" end="00:52:14.319" style="s2">Zeke, but this is the end.&quot; But then, a</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.559" end="00:52:17.200" style="s2">voice echoed through the crackling air.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.319" end="00:52:19.760" style="s2">&quot;Is that so?&quot; In an instant, a brilliant</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.200" end="00:52:21.680" style="s2">golden lightning aura exploded skyward.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.760" end="00:52:24.319" style="s2">Leica&#39;s eyes widened in shock as she</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.680" end="00:52:26.400" style="s2">turned around. &quot;Impossible! How can this</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.319" end="00:52:28.559" style="s2">be?&quot; &quot;How do you have a lightning aura?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.400" end="00:52:30.720" style="s2">she stammered. Zeke stood, smiling</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.559" end="00:52:32.400" style="s2">calmly as golden arcs danced across his</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.720" end="00:52:34.640" style="s2">skin. &quot;So, this is what you call</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.400" end="00:52:36.880" style="s2">lightning aura?&quot; he said casually. If</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.640" end="00:52:39.040" style="s2">you&#39;re asking how I got it, I honestly</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.880" end="00:52:40.960" style="s2">don&#39;t know. His tone was calm, but his</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.040" end="00:52:43.359" style="s2">words sent ripples through the crowd.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.960" end="00:52:45.280" style="s2">Impossible, Leica whispered, unable to</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.359" end="00:52:47.599" style="s2">believe what she was seeing. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.280" end="00:52:49.200" style="s2">smirked. Truth is, I let you hit me on</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.599" end="00:52:51.839" style="s2">purpose. I wanted to study your</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.200" end="00:52:54.000" style="s2">lightning, how it flows, how it behaves.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.839" end="00:52:57.040" style="s2">And somehow I learned to use it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.000" end="00:52:58.800" style="s2">That&#39;s absurd. Leica snapped inwardly.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.040" end="00:53:00.400" style="s2">Zeke explained to himself that he had</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.800" end="00:53:02.000" style="s2">deliberately taken Leica&#39;s attacks</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.400" end="00:53:03.680" style="s2">because her lightning intrigued him.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.000" end="00:53:05.680" style="s2">While enduring her strikes, he</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.680" end="00:53:07.839" style="s2">continuously activated his Dragon King&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.680" end="00:53:09.520" style="s2">breath technique. The strange resonance</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.839" end="00:53:11.440" style="s2">between his breathing and her lightning</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.520" end="00:53:13.280" style="s2">caused golden energy to gather in his</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.440" end="00:53:15.359" style="s2">body. Before he knew it, he could</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.280" end="00:53:17.440" style="s2">manipulate the lightning himself. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.359" end="00:53:19.200" style="s2">Leica has a unique constitution, he</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.440" end="00:53:21.280" style="s2">thought. And judging from her family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.200" end="00:53:23.119" style="s2">great sword technique, it&#39;s likely their</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.280" end="00:53:25.599" style="s2">whole bloodline shares this lightning</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.119" end="00:53:27.680" style="s2">affinity. Zeke walked toward her</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.599" end="00:53:29.680" style="s2">confidently. I never expected lightning</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.680" end="00:53:31.520" style="s2">type source power to be this incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.680" end="00:53:33.599" style="s2">This duel turned out to be the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.520" end="00:53:36.000" style="s2">training. With a grin, he added, &quot;Thanks</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.599" end="00:53:38.000" style="s2">to you, Lea. I&#39;ve reached two star level</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.000" end="00:53:40.000" style="s2">myself.&quot; Golden lightning flared around</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.000" end="00:53:42.160" style="s2">him as he declared, &quot;Our battle isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.000" end="00:53:43.920" style="s2">over yet.&quot; Leica roared and charged</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.160" end="00:53:45.680" style="s2">again, her great sword glowing with</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.920" end="00:53:47.440" style="s2">power, unleashing another blinding</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.680" end="00:53:48.960" style="s2">attack, but Zeke sidestepped</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.440" end="00:53:51.520" style="s2">effortlessly and prepared a</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.960" end="00:53:53.119" style="s2">counter-strike. However, as he moved, he</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.520" end="00:53:54.559" style="s2">suddenly vanished in a flash and</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.119" end="00:53:56.720" style="s2">reappeared on the opposite end of the</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.559" end="00:53:59.040" style="s2">arena. &quot;What just happened?&quot; he</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.720" end="00:54:00.960" style="s2">muttered. He then realized, &quot;When one</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.040" end="00:54:02.480" style="s2">gains immense source power, it</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.960" end="00:54:04.720" style="s2">strengthens the body&#39;s muscles and</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.480" end="00:54:06.800" style="s2">nerves. This new lightning aura must</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.720" end="00:54:09.119" style="s2">have changed my physiology. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.800" end="00:54:11.680" style="s2">fully control my speed yet.&quot; In the</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.119" end="00:54:13.599" style="s2">stands, Rangus was speechless. He</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.680" end="00:54:15.599" style="s2">couldn&#39;t follow their movements anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.599" end="00:54:17.520" style="s2">Both fighters were blurs of golden light</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.599" end="00:54:19.760" style="s2">and thunder. &quot;Am I just imagining</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.520" end="00:54:22.079" style="s2">things, or has Lea not landed a single</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.760" end="00:54:24.000" style="s2">hit lately?&quot; he wondered. Frustrated,</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.079" end="00:54:26.559" style="s2">Leica shouted, &quot;Are you mocking me,</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.000" end="00:54:29.040" style="s2">Zeke? Stop toying with me.&quot; I&#39;m not,</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.559" end="00:54:31.520" style="s2">Zeke replied calmly. But I will admit,</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.040" end="00:54:33.520" style="s2">you&#39;re a real threat. He then lunged</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.520" end="00:54:35.119" style="s2">forward, delivering a powerful kick, but</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.520" end="00:54:36.960" style="s2">Leica blocked it with her sword, the</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.119" end="00:54:38.880" style="s2">force pushing her backward. Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.960" end="00:54:41.200" style="s2">straightened, smirking. I think it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.880" end="00:54:43.599" style="s2">time to end this. End this? Lea</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.200" end="00:54:45.359" style="s2">repeated, narrowing her eyes. Yes, Zeke</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.599" end="00:54:47.280" style="s2">replied. I&#39;ve been thinking of creating</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.359" end="00:54:49.280" style="s2">a new technique for a while now, and</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.280" end="00:54:51.760" style="s2">this seems like the perfect time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.280" end="00:54:54.960" style="s2">Creating a new technique? She said in</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.760" end="00:54:56.880" style="s2">disbelief. Zeke nodded. Exactly. He</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.960" end="00:54:59.359" style="s2">paused for a moment, then murmured.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.880" end="00:55:01.760" style="s2">Should I call it a first form or maybe a</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.359" end="00:55:03.520" style="s2">special form? Leica blinked, confused.</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.760" end="00:55:05.040" style="s2">Did he even receive proper combat</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.520" end="00:55:06.880" style="s2">training? From which family could he</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.040" end="00:55:08.559" style="s2">have learned that? She wondered, her</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.880" end="00:55:10.480" style="s2">thoughts spinning. Before she could</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.559" end="00:55:12.720" style="s2">react, Zeke appeared beside her in a</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.480" end="00:55:14.720" style="s2">flash, lightning surging in his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.720" end="00:55:17.280" style="s2">Dragon destruction combat arts special</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.720" end="00:55:19.200" style="s2">form, lightning peak, he shouted. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.280" end="00:55:21.359" style="s2">attack struck her directly, wrapping her</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.200" end="00:55:23.200" style="s2">in a fierce storm of golden thunder. Her</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.359" end="00:55:24.800" style="s2">body trembled violently, her sword</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.200" end="00:55:26.880" style="s2">slipping from her grasp as she fell to</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.800" end="00:55:28.880" style="s2">her knees before him, electricity still</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.880" end="00:55:30.960" style="s2">crackling around her. The arena fell</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.880" end="00:55:33.920" style="s2">silent. Rangus and the others stared in</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.960" end="00:55:36.000" style="s2">disbelief. Zeke had won. Leica, lying on</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.920" end="00:55:37.760" style="s2">the ground, exhaled shakily. After a few</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.000" end="00:55:40.160" style="s2">moments, she forced herself to sit up,</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.760" end="00:55:41.760" style="s2">trembling. &quot;I can&#39;t believe I lost. I</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.160" end="00:55:45.040" style="s2">was supposed to become the next family</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.760" end="00:55:47.119" style="s2">head. I can&#39;t lose. Not to anyone,&quot; she</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.040" end="00:55:49.040" style="s2">thought bitterly. Zeke approached her,</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.119" end="00:55:51.280" style="s2">offering his hand. &quot;You are amazing,</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.040" end="00:55:53.119" style="s2">Lea. truly strong,&quot; he said sincerely.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.280" end="00:55:56.480" style="s2">&quot;It&#39;s always exciting to learn something</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.119" end="00:55:58.640" style="s2">new. This fight was worth it.&quot; Smiling</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.480" end="00:56:00.640" style="s2">warmly, he added. &quot;It&#39;d be boring if</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.640" end="00:56:02.880" style="s2">this was the last time we fought. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.640" end="00:56:05.040" style="s2">have another sparring match sometime.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.880" end="00:56:06.960" style="s2">Leica froze, her cheeks turning red as</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.040" end="00:56:08.880" style="s2">she stared at his outstretched hand.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.960" end="00:56:11.119" style="s2">Despite her defeat, she had a faint of</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.880" end="00:56:13.359" style="s2">happiness on her face. Perhaps out of</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.119" end="00:56:16.240" style="s2">pride or perhaps for the first time,</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.359" end="00:56:17.680" style="s2">admiration. Once again, Zeke said that</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.240" end="00:56:19.839" style="s2">they should have another sparring match</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.680" end="00:56:21.200" style="s2">soon. With a confident smile, he added</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.839" end="00:56:24.079" style="s2">that he couldn&#39;t wait for their next</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.200" end="00:56:26.079" style="s2">bout. Leica, though a bit shy, extended</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.079" end="00:56:27.839" style="s2">her hand toward him, admitting that she</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.079" end="00:56:29.680" style="s2">was no match for him and that she</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.839" end="00:56:31.520" style="s2">willingly accepted her defeat.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.680" end="00:56:33.680" style="s2">Meanwhile, several hours later, deep</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.520" end="00:56:36.079" style="s2">inside a dimensional rift, Balza,</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.680" end="00:56:37.680" style="s2">Elragon, the father of Leica and Zeke,</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.079" end="00:56:40.000" style="s2">and the current head of the Elragon</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.680" end="00:56:42.319" style="s2">family, stood surrounded by countless</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.000" end="00:56:44.079" style="s2">strange and feral monsters. As the</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.319" end="00:56:45.760" style="s2">creatures charged toward him, Balsza&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.079" end="00:56:48.160" style="s2">eyes began to glow with an intense</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.760" end="00:56:50.480" style="s2">light, releasing a crushing wave of aura</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.160" end="00:56:52.480" style="s2">and dragon pressure. He instantly froze</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.480" end="00:56:55.040" style="s2">every creature in place. Drawing his</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.480" end="00:56:57.520" style="s2">sword, Balsza invoked the first form,</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.040" end="00:57:00.319" style="s2">Genesis of the Dragon Destruction combat</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.520" end="00:57:02.160" style="s2">arts. With a single fluid swing, all the</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.319" end="00:57:04.799" style="s2">monsters around him were cleaved cleanly</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.160" end="00:57:07.200" style="s2">in half. As he sheathed his sword, the</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.799" end="00:57:09.440" style="s2">Lragon family soldiers rushed forward to</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.200" end="00:57:10.880" style="s2">finish off any remaining monsters that</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.440" end="00:57:12.960" style="s2">might have survived their master&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.880" end="00:57:15.119" style="s2">strike. Balsa turned toward the exit of</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.960" end="00:57:16.559" style="s2">the rift, but before he could leave, one</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.119" end="00:57:18.400" style="s2">of the soldiers called out to him,</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.559" end="00:57:20.400" style="s2">saying that he had an important report.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.400" end="00:57:22.240" style="s2">Balsa stopped walking and asked what it</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.400" end="00:57:23.839" style="s2">was about. The soldier informed him that</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.240" end="00:57:26.240" style="s2">Lady Leica had reached the two star</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.839" end="00:57:28.480" style="s2">level. Upon hearing this, Balsa froze</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.240" end="00:57:30.960" style="s2">midstep. His glowing eyes flickered and</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.480" end="00:57:33.440" style="s2">his response came out cold and detached.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.960" end="00:57:35.520" style="s2">&quot;So what of it?&quot; The soldier, clearly</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.440" end="00:57:37.680" style="s2">nervous, explained that reaching the two</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.520" end="00:57:39.599" style="s2">star level at only 7 years old was an</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.680" end="00:57:41.680" style="s2">extraordinary achievement. He added that</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.599" end="00:57:43.599" style="s2">with Leica&#39;s talent, once she graduated</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.680" end="00:57:45.760" style="s2">from Dragon&#39;s Nest, she would likely</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.599" end="00:57:48.559" style="s2">reach the four-star level, or perhaps</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.760" end="00:57:51.119" style="s2">even the five-star level. Balsa&#39;s reply</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.559" end="00:57:52.960" style="s2">was chilling. Talent means nothing. The</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.119" end="00:57:55.119" style="s2">next time you report to me, I expect to</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.960" end="00:57:56.720" style="s2">hear how she can be of use to us. If all</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.119" end="00:57:59.280" style="s2">you bring are worthless updates like</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.720" end="00:58:01.280" style="s2">this, you&#39;d better leave my sight.&quot; The</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.280" end="00:58:03.440" style="s2">soldier fell silent as Balsa continued</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.280" end="00:58:05.359" style="s2">toward the rift&#39;s exit. But before he</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.440" end="00:58:07.440" style="s2">could step through, the soldier quickly</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.359" end="00:58:09.599" style="s2">added that Leica had recently lost in a</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.440" end="00:58:11.359" style="s2">sparring match. Balsa stopped abruptly</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.599" end="00:58:13.599" style="s2">and turned his head slightly, his</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.359" end="00:58:15.520" style="s2">expression unreadable. &quot;Did she lose to</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.599" end="00:58:18.079" style="s2">one of her brothers?&quot; he asked. The</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.520" end="00:58:19.760" style="s2">soldier shook his head. &quot;No, master. She</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.079" end="00:58:22.640" style="s2">was defeated by someone her own age.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.760" end="00:58:24.559" style="s2">&quot;By Lord Zeke.&quot; &quot;Zeek,&quot; Balsa repeated,</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.640" end="00:58:27.200" style="s2">his voice low. &quot;The son of that woman.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.559" end="00:58:29.200" style="s2">&quot;Memories surfaced of a humble maid,</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.200" end="00:58:31.280" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s mother.&quot; &quot;That woman truly was</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.200" end="00:58:33.599" style="s2">gifted in battle,&quot; he muttered. &quot;But she</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.280" end="00:58:35.599" style="s2">died after giving birth to the boy.&quot; He</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.599" end="00:58:37.440" style="s2">turned fully to face the soldier, his</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.599" end="00:58:38.880" style="s2">tone sharp. Tell me who could have</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.440" end="00:58:40.720" style="s2">possibly trained Zeke to defeat a</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.880" end="00:58:42.880" style="s2">two-star cultivator. The soldier</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.720" end="00:58:44.880" style="s2">hesitated before answering. No one,</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.880" end="00:58:47.119" style="s2">master. Lord Zeke has never received</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.880" end="00:58:48.640" style="s2">formal training. He defeated Lady Lea</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.119" end="00:58:51.200" style="s2">through his own strength and skill</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.640" end="00:58:53.920" style="s2">alone. In fact, he too has already</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.200" end="00:58:56.000" style="s2">reached the twoar level. I see, Balsa</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.920" end="00:58:58.000" style="s2">said flatly. Then turning his back once</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.000" end="00:59:00.640" style="s2">more, he declared. Begin the first</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.000" end="00:59:02.799" style="s2">trial. The soldier was visibly startled.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.640" end="00:59:04.720" style="s2">Master Balsa, forgive my intrusion, but</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.799" end="00:59:06.000" style="s2">isn&#39;t it too soon for the first trial?</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.720" end="00:59:07.760" style="s2">It&#39;s only been a month since the</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.000" end="00:59:09.119" style="s2">students began their combat training.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.760" end="00:59:12.160" style="s2">Most of them haven&#39;t even reached the</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.119" end="00:59:14.799" style="s2">one-star level yet. Ballsa cut him off.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.160" end="00:59:17.359" style="s2">I do not care. Death chooses no timing,</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.799" end="00:59:19.520" style="s2">no level, no favorites. Only the strong</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.359" end="00:59:21.119" style="s2">deserve to survive. Star levels mean</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.520" end="00:59:23.040" style="s2">nothing if they can&#39;t endure the first</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.119" end="00:59:25.280" style="s2">trial. Those who fail aren&#39;t worthy of</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.040" end="00:59:27.359" style="s2">the Lragon name. Yes, master, the</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.280" end="00:59:29.520" style="s2">soldier replied quickly. But then Balza</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.359" end="00:59:31.200" style="s2">added, also summon Freya. Tell her to</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.520" end="00:59:33.920" style="s2">return immediately. The soldier&#39;s eyes</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.200" end="00:59:35.839" style="s2">widened in disbelief. Freya? Master, do</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.920" end="00:59:38.079" style="s2">you mean that Freya? Balsa nodded.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.839" end="00:59:40.319" style="s2">Indeed, if Zeke could defeat Leica using</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.079" end="00:59:42.559" style="s2">only his own strength, then he&#39;s far</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.319" end="00:59:44.559" style="s2">more intriguing than I expected. I want</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.559" end="00:59:46.799" style="s2">Freya to design and supervise the first</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.559" end="00:59:48.799" style="s2">trial herself. And I expect her to</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.799" end="00:59:50.880" style="s2">personally observe every participant.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.799" end="00:59:52.880" style="s2">The soldier bowed deeply. As you</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.880" end="00:59:55.040" style="s2">command, Master Balsa. For the first</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.880" end="00:59:57.680" style="s2">time in a long while, a faint smile</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.040" end="00:59:59.680" style="s2">appeared on Balsa&#39;s lips. A rare, almost</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.680" end="01:00:01.839" style="s2">warm expression flickered across his</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.680" end="01:00:03.680" style="s2">face as he said softly, &quot;He&#39;s the most</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.839" end="01:00:05.599" style="s2">interesting one of all.&quot; The next day at</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.680" end="01:00:07.599" style="s2">Dragon&#39;s Nest, the students continued</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.599" end="01:00:09.839" style="s2">their combat training under Rangus.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.599" end="01:00:11.680" style="s2">Zeke, however, was off to the side</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.839" end="01:00:13.200" style="s2">practicing his breathing technique.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.680" end="01:00:14.880" style="s2">Sitting in a wallsit position, he</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.200" end="01:00:16.880" style="s2">balanced a massive boulder on his head</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.880" end="01:00:18.799" style="s2">while holding dumbbells in both hands.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.880" end="01:00:20.640" style="s2">His unwavering focus drew the attention</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.799" end="01:00:22.960" style="s2">of Rangis and the others who couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.640" end="01:00:25.040" style="s2">help but watch him in silence. With his</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.960" end="01:00:27.040" style="s2">eyes closed, Zeke contemplated the</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.040" end="01:00:30.160" style="s2">technique they were studying, the strike</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.040" end="01:00:32.000" style="s2">dragon combat arts. As he recalled, this</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.160" end="01:00:34.160" style="s2">technique was originally created by the</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.000" end="01:00:36.559" style="s2">15th family head. Though labeled as a</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.160" end="01:00:38.960" style="s2">combat art, it was in truth a body</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.559" end="01:00:40.880" style="s2">enhancement method. Simple yet well-</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.960" end="01:00:43.040" style="s2">constructed, allowing even young</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.880" end="01:00:45.119" style="s2">cultivators to grasp it. Ranges called</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.040" end="01:00:47.440" style="s2">out. Zeke, aren&#39;t you going to train?</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.119" end="01:00:49.920" style="s2">Zeke opened one eye. What do you mean? I</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.440" end="01:00:51.599" style="s2">mean combat training, Rangus clarified.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.920" end="01:00:53.920" style="s2">We&#39;re practicing the strike dragon</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.599" end="01:00:56.079" style="s2">combat arts. I already learned that,</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.920" end="01:00:58.160" style="s2">Zeke replied casually. Rangus was</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.079" end="01:00:59.920" style="s2">stunned. What? But it was only taught to</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.160" end="01:01:02.079" style="s2">us this morning. How could you have</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.920" end="01:01:04.000" style="s2">mastered it already? Because I&#39;m me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.079" end="01:01:05.520" style="s2">Zeke said with a smirk. But what&#39;s more</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.000" end="01:01:08.240" style="s2">important right now is that your source</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.520" end="01:01:10.799" style="s2">power is flowing incorrectly. My what?</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.240" end="01:01:12.480" style="s2">Rangus asked confused. Zeke set down the</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.799" end="01:01:14.720" style="s2">heavy boulder from his head and told</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.480" end="01:01:17.040" style="s2">Rangus to turn around. Placing his hand</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.720" end="01:01:18.960" style="s2">on Rangus back. Zeke channeled his aura</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.040" end="01:01:21.200" style="s2">through Rangus&#39; body, correcting the</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.960" end="01:01:23.040" style="s2">flow of energy. There, he said, &quot;That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.200" end="01:01:24.960" style="s2">how your aura should circulate.&quot; Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.040" end="01:01:26.720" style="s2">turned to face him, grateful. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.960" end="01:01:28.720" style="s2">really mastered the strike dragon combat</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.720" end="01:01:30.880" style="s2">arts, haven&#39;t you? That&#39;s incredible.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.720" end="01:01:33.440" style="s2">Zeke frowned playfully. Are you doubting</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.880" end="01:01:36.240" style="s2">me? What kind of friend are you? No, not</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.440" end="01:01:38.160" style="s2">at all, Rangus quickly said. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.240" end="01:01:40.240" style="s2">aside from my father, no one&#39;s ever</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.160" end="01:01:42.160" style="s2">taught me like that before. That&#39;s why I</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.240" end="01:01:44.319" style="s2">want to learn everything I can. You,</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.160" end="01:01:46.720" style="s2">Lord Zeke, already have your own martial</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.319" end="01:01:48.480" style="s2">arts, strong enough to defeat Lady Lea.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.720" end="01:01:50.319" style="s2">I just thought the strike dragon combat</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.480" end="01:01:52.640" style="s2">arts might be too simple and boring for</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.319" end="01:01:54.480" style="s2">someone like you. It&#39;s not boring, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.640" end="01:01:56.319" style="s2">replied. Actually, I admire its</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.480" end="01:01:58.559" style="s2">stability. It reminds me of my own</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.319" end="01:02:00.319" style="s2">dragon destruction combat arts, though</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.559" end="01:02:01.920" style="s2">my children never liked that technique.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.319" end="01:02:04.240" style="s2">They said it was too difficult and</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.920" end="01:02:06.240" style="s2">complicated. The dragon destruction</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.240" end="01:02:08.240" style="s2">combat arts was indeed a complex and</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.240" end="01:02:10.720" style="s2">demanding technique, but it possessed</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.240" end="01:02:13.280" style="s2">immense power. It consisted of four main</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.720" end="01:02:15.839" style="s2">forms, and during his battle with Leica,</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.280" end="01:02:18.079" style="s2">Zeke had created a fifth. Beyond that,</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.839" end="01:02:20.160" style="s2">there was even a secret, its final form,</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.079" end="01:02:21.839" style="s2">a terrifying and destructive ability,</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.160" end="01:02:24.240" style="s2">the same one he had once used to slay</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.839" end="01:02:25.920" style="s2">the divine dragon in his past life. He</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.240" end="01:02:27.680" style="s2">wondered silently how his descendants</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.920" end="01:02:29.760" style="s2">had handled his other dragon techniques</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.680" end="01:02:31.520" style="s2">over time. Perhaps they had modified</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.760" end="01:02:34.480" style="s2">them. The thought only made him more</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.520" end="01:02:35.920" style="s2">excited. Anyway, he said, &quot;Since I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.480" end="01:02:37.760" style="s2">already mastered the strike dragon</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.920" end="01:02:40.079" style="s2">combat arts, I&#39;ll continue with my</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.760" end="01:02:41.520" style="s2">physical training.&quot; He smiled faintly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.079" end="01:02:43.359" style="s2">Everyone has their own way of learning</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.520" end="01:02:45.280" style="s2">techniques. But before he could</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.359" end="01:02:48.319" style="s2">continue, Rangus suddenly shouted his</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.280" end="01:02:50.240" style="s2">name. &quot;Seek, please teach me. I know</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.319" end="01:02:52.720" style="s2">it&#39;s a shameless request, but I want to</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.240" end="01:02:54.480" style="s2">get stronger. Even just a little.&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.720" end="01:02:56.240" style="s2">looked at him for a moment, then nodded.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.480" end="01:02:58.640" style="s2">&quot;All right, I&#39;ll teach you.&quot; Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.240" end="01:03:00.720" style="s2">blinked in surprise. &quot;Wait, you mean it?</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.640" end="01:03:02.559" style="s2">You&#39;ll really teach me?&quot; &quot;Of course,&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.720" end="01:03:04.799" style="s2">Zeke replied. &quot;Why do you look so</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.559" end="01:03:06.960" style="s2">surprised?&quot; &quot;You were the one who asked.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.799" end="01:03:09.599" style="s2">I I just didn&#39;t think you&#39;d agree so</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.960" end="01:03:11.680" style="s2">easily,&quot; Rangus said sheepishly. &quot;I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.599" end="01:03:13.920" style="s2">not lying,&quot; Zeke said. and I know you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.680" end="01:03:15.760" style="s2">worth teaching. Just then, Lea</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.920" end="01:03:18.000" style="s2">approached them. Though hesitant, she</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.760" end="01:03:19.599" style="s2">spoke up. &quot;Zeek, I&#39;d like you to teach</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.000" end="01:03:22.079" style="s2">me, too.&quot; Rangus turned to her,</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.599" end="01:03:24.720" style="s2">startled. &quot;You too, Lady Lea? Is there a</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.079" end="01:03:26.319" style="s2">problem?&quot; she asked calmly. Honestly, I</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.720" end="01:03:28.240" style="s2">used to think that no one my age could</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.319" end="01:03:30.400" style="s2">defeat me. As a candidate to become the</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.240" end="01:03:32.559" style="s2">next head of the Elragon family, I was</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.400" end="01:03:35.119" style="s2">confident in my power. But yesterday&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.559" end="01:03:36.319" style="s2">match, it shattered my pride. &quot;I still</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.119" end="01:03:38.400" style="s2">don&#39;t know how you managed to use</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.319" end="01:03:40.720" style="s2">lightning aura, or how you wield it even</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.400" end="01:03:42.640" style="s2">better than I do,&quot; Zeke sighed. So now</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.720" end="01:03:44.880" style="s2">this is my fault,&quot; he muttered half-</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.640" end="01:03:46.960" style="s2">jokingly. &quot;Determined,&quot; Lea continued.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.880" end="01:03:49.119" style="s2">&quot;I want to become stronger. Strong</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.960" end="01:03:51.839" style="s2">enough to defeat our older brothers and</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.119" end="01:03:54.240" style="s2">you as well, Zeke. Please teach me.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.839" end="01:03:56.240" style="s2">Zeke fell silent for a moment. Deep in</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.240" end="01:03:58.480" style="s2">thought since Zeke didn&#39;t answer right</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.240" end="01:04:00.559" style="s2">away, Leica asked if he was really fine</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.480" end="01:04:02.079" style="s2">with it. Even though he was also a</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.559" end="01:04:05.119" style="s2">candidate to become the next head of the</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.079" end="01:04:06.960" style="s2">Lragon family, Rangus agreed with her.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.119" end="01:04:09.440" style="s2">Realizing that even though Zeke was an</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.960" end="01:04:11.599" style="s2">illegitimate child, Balsa Elragon was</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.440" end="01:04:13.760" style="s2">still his father, which technically made</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.599" end="01:04:16.079" style="s2">Zeke one of the successors, whether he</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.760" end="01:04:17.920" style="s2">liked it or not. Zeke calmly replied</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.079" end="01:04:19.680" style="s2">that he didn&#39;t mind. But the real</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.920" end="01:04:21.760" style="s2">question was whether Leica&#39;s body was in</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.680" end="01:04:23.520" style="s2">good condition to train, saying that</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.760" end="01:04:25.359" style="s2">from what he saw in their match, her</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.520" end="01:04:27.359" style="s2">injuries would normally take at least a</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.359" end="01:04:28.799" style="s2">month to heal. Leica shook her head and</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.359" end="01:04:30.559" style="s2">said she had already used a healing</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.799" end="01:04:32.960" style="s2">potion, so there was no need for him to</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.559" end="01:04:35.200" style="s2">worry. Zeke and Rangus exchanged a look,</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.960" end="01:04:37.200" style="s2">whispering to each other. Zeke asked if</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.200" end="01:04:39.440" style="s2">that medicine truly had such absurd</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.200" end="01:04:41.039" style="s2">effectiveness. But Rangus replied that</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.440" end="01:04:43.200" style="s2">if Zeke was referring to the basic</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.039" end="01:04:44.720" style="s2">potion given during the entrance exam,</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.200" end="01:04:46.799" style="s2">it definitely wasn&#39;t strong enough to</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.720" end="01:04:48.720" style="s2">heal Leica&#39;s wounds so quickly because</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.799" end="01:04:50.240" style="s2">she was the daughter of the family head.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.720" end="01:04:52.559" style="s2">She must have used a much stronger kind</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.240" end="01:04:54.319" style="s2">of potion. Zeke sighed in amazement,</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.559" end="01:04:56.799" style="s2">muttering that this era truly was</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.319" end="01:04:58.400" style="s2">something else. Leica nodded, admitting</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.799" end="01:05:00.559" style="s2">that without the potion, she would have</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.400" end="01:05:03.200" style="s2">been bedridden for at least a month. But</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.559" end="01:05:04.960" style="s2">now what mattered most was her request.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.200" end="01:05:07.200" style="s2">whether Zeke would agree to train her as</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.960" end="01:05:09.200" style="s2">well. She knew that he too needed to</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.200" end="01:05:11.359" style="s2">train, but she wanted to grow stronger</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.200" end="01:05:13.200" style="s2">under his guidance. Zeke agreed without</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.359" end="01:05:15.200" style="s2">hesitation, saying that he never turned</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.200" end="01:05:17.359" style="s2">down young people with ambition. Both</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.200" end="01:05:19.200" style="s2">Lea and Rangus were surprised by his</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.359" end="01:05:21.200" style="s2">answer. Leica pointed out that he was</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.200" end="01:05:23.280" style="s2">also young like them, while Rangus added</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.200" end="01:05:25.359" style="s2">that they were about the same age. Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.280" end="01:05:27.440" style="s2">chuckled and agreed. Then, with a</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.359" end="01:05:29.119" style="s2">teasing tone, Zeke asked if she was</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.440" end="01:05:31.359" style="s2">truly sure about having him as her</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.119" end="01:05:33.520" style="s2">instructor. After all, he was the one</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.359" end="01:05:35.440" style="s2">who defeated her. Leica replied firmly</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.520" end="01:05:37.440" style="s2">that she didn&#39;t care about that. She</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.440" end="01:05:38.799" style="s2">didn&#39;t have the luxury to be picky if</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.440" end="01:05:41.200" style="s2">she wanted to become the next head of</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.799" end="01:05:43.599" style="s2">the Lragon family. She had to become</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.200" end="01:05:44.960" style="s2">stronger no matter what it took. Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.599" end="01:05:46.720" style="s2">remembered how during their first</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.960" end="01:05:48.880" style="s2">encounter, she had mentioned her dream</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.720" end="01:05:50.799" style="s2">of becoming family head. He asked why</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.880" end="01:05:53.119" style="s2">she seemed so obsessed with that goal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.799" end="01:05:55.680" style="s2">Without hesitation, Leica answered that</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.119" end="01:05:57.280" style="s2">if she failed to become family head, she</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.680" end="01:05:59.520" style="s2">would only be used for a political</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.280" end="01:06:01.520" style="s2">marriage. She spoke bitterly, saying</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.520" end="01:06:03.119" style="s2">that in the best case scenario, she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.520" end="01:06:05.280" style="s2">probably be forced to marry one of her</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.119" end="01:06:07.280" style="s2">cousins. But the worst case would be</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.280" end="01:06:09.359" style="s2">marrying a man she didn&#39;t even know.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.280" end="01:06:11.119" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s expression darkened, anger</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.359" end="01:06:13.200" style="s2">flickering in his eyes as he asked what</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.119" end="01:06:15.039" style="s2">she meant by that. Leica said it was</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.200" end="01:06:17.599" style="s2">natural considering how valuable the</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.039" end="01:06:19.520" style="s2">Lragon bloodline was, especially within</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.599" end="01:06:21.359" style="s2">the four branches of the family. Their</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.520" end="01:06:23.440" style="s2">source power was special. It could be</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.359" end="01:06:25.039" style="s2">used in countless ways. That&#39;s why the</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.440" end="01:06:27.520" style="s2">family was obsessed with keeping their</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.039" end="01:06:29.280" style="s2">bloodline pure. Rangess shuddered,</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.520" end="01:06:31.680" style="s2">sensing the terrifying aura that</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.280" end="01:06:33.520" style="s2">suddenly emanated from Zeke. His voice</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.680" end="01:06:36.000" style="s2">turned cold and sharp as he said that</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.520" end="01:06:38.240" style="s2">the Lragon family had truly begun doing</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.000" end="01:06:40.319" style="s2">disgusting things like this. He clenched</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.240" end="01:06:42.240" style="s2">his fists, saying he would destroy such</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.319" end="01:06:43.680" style="s2">filthy and meaningless traditions. But</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.240" end="01:06:46.000" style="s2">before the atmosphere could grow</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.680" end="01:06:47.440" style="s2">heavier, several instructors arrived,</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.000" end="01:06:49.599" style="s2">immediately drawing everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.440" end="01:06:51.520" style="s2">attention. Leica blinked in surprise,</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.599" end="01:06:52.960" style="s2">wondering why they had come, while Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.520" end="01:06:54.640" style="s2">muttered that the timing couldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.960" end="01:06:56.799" style="s2">worse. He worried that they might have</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.640" end="01:06:58.880" style="s2">overheard what he just said. Then from</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.799" end="01:07:00.960" style="s2">behind them, a woman with fiery red hair</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.880" end="01:07:03.039" style="s2">appeared. One instructor stepped forward</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.960" end="01:07:04.960" style="s2">and announced that starting today, they</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.039" end="01:07:07.200" style="s2">would have a new instructor. Despite how</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.960" end="01:07:08.799" style="s2">busy this person was, she had taken the</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.200" end="01:07:10.799" style="s2">time to teach them personally, so they</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.799" end="01:07:12.559" style="s2">should be grateful. As the red-haired</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.799" end="01:07:14.160" style="s2">woman approached, she reached out her</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.559" end="01:07:17.280" style="s2">hand toward Lea and asked if she was</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.160" end="01:07:19.440" style="s2">Lady Lea. Feeling a wave of danger, Lea</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.280" end="01:07:20.880" style="s2">instinctively leaped backward. Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.440" end="01:07:23.359" style="s2">stepped forward protectively while</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.880" end="01:07:25.280" style="s2">Rangus grabbed onto his arm in fear. The</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.359" end="01:07:27.200" style="s2">red-haired woman smiled faintly,</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.280" end="01:07:29.119" style="s2">praising Leica&#39;s sharp reaction and</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.200" end="01:07:31.599" style="s2">saying her aura quality wasn&#39;t bad at</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.119" end="01:07:33.520" style="s2">all. Zeke frowned slightly. He hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.599" end="01:07:35.839" style="s2">even sensed her presence until now.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.520" end="01:07:37.599" style="s2">Rangus nervously asked who she was. The</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.839" end="01:07:40.240" style="s2">instructor then introduced her as Lady</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.599" end="01:07:42.480" style="s2">Freya. Freya Fuick of the Black Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.240" end="01:07:44.400" style="s2">Corps. Freya gave a polite smile and</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.480" end="01:07:46.160" style="s2">greeted everyone, saying she was pleased</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.400" end="01:07:47.680" style="s2">to meet them all. She then looked</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.160" end="01:07:49.839" style="s2">straight at Zeke and asked if he was</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.680" end="01:07:51.359" style="s2">Lord Zeke. When he confirmed it, she</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.839" end="01:07:53.520" style="s2">asked if he wasn&#39;t surprised by her</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.359" end="01:07:55.359" style="s2">sudden appearance. Zeke replied calmly</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.520" end="01:07:57.200" style="s2">that nothing she did was surprising.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.359" end="01:07:59.200" style="s2">Freya froze for a moment as Zeke&#39;s eyes</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.200" end="01:08:00.799" style="s2">began to glow faintly, and he commented</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.200" end="01:08:02.960" style="s2">that her stealth technique was rather</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.799" end="01:08:05.200" style="s2">interesting. Freya quickly realized why</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.960" end="01:08:07.680" style="s2">even the family head, Bala Elragon, was</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.200" end="01:08:10.000" style="s2">interested in this boy. Meanwhile, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.680" end="01:08:11.839" style="s2">analyzed her movements. He noticed her</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.000" end="01:08:13.920" style="s2">source power was concentrated in her</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.839" end="01:08:16.000" style="s2">lower body, following a flow pattern he</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.920" end="01:08:18.159" style="s2">had never seen before. That must be why</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.000" end="01:08:19.920" style="s2">her footsteps made no sound at all. A</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.159" end="01:08:21.440" style="s2">spark of excitement lit up his eyes as</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.920" end="01:08:23.839" style="s2">he wondered what kind of martial arts</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.440" end="01:08:25.679" style="s2">she used. Freya then took command of the</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.839" end="01:08:27.759" style="s2">class. She confirmed that she would be</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.679" end="01:08:29.120" style="s2">their new instructor. The students began</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.759" end="01:08:32.159" style="s2">whispering among themselves in</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.120" end="01:08:33.520" style="s2">disbelief. Lady Freya, the Tempest Wind,</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.159" end="01:08:35.199" style="s2">was known as one of the strongest</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.520" end="01:08:36.960" style="s2">warriors in the family. The other</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.199" end="01:08:38.640" style="s2">instructor confirmed that Freya was a</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.960" end="01:08:40.880" style="s2">six-star practitioner under the Black</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.640" end="01:08:43.040" style="s2">Dragon Corps, the elite unit serving</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.880" end="01:08:45.120" style="s2">directly under the Family Head himself.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.040" end="01:08:46.799" style="s2">The students were in awe, unable to</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.120" end="01:08:48.799" style="s2">understand why someone of her rank would</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.799" end="01:08:50.719" style="s2">come teach at their academy. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.799" end="01:08:52.960" style="s2">smiled faintly and said she would indeed</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.719" end="01:08:54.880" style="s2">train them, but under one condition,</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.960" end="01:08:57.040" style="s2">they had to pass a simple test. The</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.880" end="01:08:59.520" style="s2">students gasped at her words. She told</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.040" end="01:09:01.040" style="s2">them not to worry. The test was simple.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.520" end="01:09:03.120" style="s2">They just needed to bring crystal like</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.040" end="01:09:05.199" style="s2">the one she&#39;s holding and survive for</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.120" end="01:09:07.359" style="s2">one full month inside the poison dragon</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.199" end="01:09:09.520" style="s2">mountain. Rangus went pale at the name</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.359" end="01:09:10.960" style="s2">while Zeke felt a sense of nostalgia.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.520" end="01:09:12.799" style="s2">The poison dragon mountain, he</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.960" end="01:09:14.799" style="s2">explained, was home to countless</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.799" end="01:09:16.480" style="s2">poisonous creatures. Even brushing</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.799" end="01:09:18.640" style="s2">against a single leaf could kill an</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.480" end="01:09:20.960" style="s2">ordinary human instantly. It was a</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.640" end="01:09:23.040" style="s2">region of pure danger. Zeke recalled how</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.960" end="01:09:24.640" style="s2">in his previous life, he had often used</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.040" end="01:09:26.560" style="s2">that place as his personal training</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.640" end="01:09:28.640" style="s2">ground. Still, he thought this test</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.560" end="01:09:31.359" style="s2">might be too cruel for young students.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.640" end="01:09:33.600" style="s2">Freya explained the rules. Each student</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.359" end="01:09:35.440" style="s2">would receive one crystal orb. If their</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.600" end="01:09:37.279" style="s2">orb broke or was lost, they would</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.440" end="01:09:39.040" style="s2">immediately be disqualified. When</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.279" end="01:09:41.120" style="s2">someone nervously asked what happened to</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.040" end="01:09:43.040" style="s2">those disqualified, Freya replied</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.120" end="01:09:44.799" style="s2">bluntly, they would be expelled from the</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.040" end="01:09:46.239" style="s2">dragon&#39;s nest. She added that they</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.799" end="01:09:48.080" style="s2">didn&#39;t need to worry about the poison</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.239" end="01:09:49.839" style="s2">itself. If they properly used the</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.080" end="01:09:51.839" style="s2">dragon&#39;s breath breathing technique,</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.839" end="01:09:53.440" style="s2">they would be fine. As long as they held</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.839" end="01:09:55.840" style="s2">on to their orbs and controlled their</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.440" end="01:09:57.440" style="s2">breathing, they could survive. Lea</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.840" end="01:09:59.600" style="s2">pointed out that aside from poisonous</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.440" end="01:10:01.440" style="s2">plants, there were monsters there, too.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.600" end="01:10:03.040" style="s2">Freya&#39;s eyes turned sharp as she said</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.440" end="01:10:04.880" style="s2">they would need to defeat those monsters</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.040" end="01:10:07.040" style="s2">themselves since that was the only way</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.880" end="01:10:09.360" style="s2">they could secure food. Without hunting,</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.040" end="01:10:11.440" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t last even a few days. The</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.360" end="01:10:13.360" style="s2">students were horrified. Retin muttered</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.440" end="01:10:15.120" style="s2">that it was impossible. Many doubted</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.360" end="01:10:16.800" style="s2">whether their basic combat technique,</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.120" end="01:10:18.640" style="s2">the strike dragon, could even hurt the</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.800" end="01:10:20.800" style="s2">creatures living there. Freya smirked</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.640" end="01:10:22.960" style="s2">and told them not to panic. They had 5</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.800" end="01:10:24.560" style="s2">days to prepare. During that time, they</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.960" end="01:10:26.640" style="s2">could each choose a basic weapon art</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.560" end="01:10:28.480" style="s2">from the Lragon family archives to</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.640" end="01:10:30.480" style="s2">learn. If they mastered it, their</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.480" end="01:10:32.719" style="s2">survival chances would improve. But if</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.480" end="01:10:34.480" style="s2">they failed to learn it within 5 days,</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.719" end="01:10:36.400" style="s2">she would not take responsibility for</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.480" end="01:10:38.080" style="s2">whatever happened in the mountain. One</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.400" end="01:10:39.520" style="s2">student asked timidly if Freya would</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.080" end="01:10:41.679" style="s2">help them in case things got too</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.520" end="01:10:43.600" style="s2">dangerous. Freya chuckled darkly,</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.679" end="01:10:45.920" style="s2">saying, &quot;You&#39;re in the Dragon&#39;s Nest,</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.600" end="01:10:48.080" style="s2">the land of the Lragon family. Here, the</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.920" end="01:10:50.080" style="s2">weak do not last. Only the strong</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.080" end="01:10:51.840" style="s2">survive. If you can&#39;t defeat a few</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.080" end="01:10:53.679" style="s2">monsters on your own, then you might as</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.840" end="01:10:55.679" style="s2">well sleep peacefully beside them in the</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.679" end="01:10:58.239" style="s2">bed of poison. The students trembled in</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.679" end="01:11:00.159" style="s2">terror, sweat dripping down their faces.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.239" end="01:11:02.239" style="s2">Rangus was on the verge of tears while</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.159" end="01:11:04.239" style="s2">Leica stayed silent in deep thought.</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.239" end="01:11:06.080" style="s2">Zeke frowned to himself, wondering if</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.239" end="01:11:08.159" style="s2">this was still the same Elragon family</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.080" end="01:11:10.239" style="s2">he once knew. It felt so different from</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.159" end="01:11:12.080" style="s2">when he had been the family head. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.239" end="01:11:13.840" style="s2">then said that was all for now. She</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.080" end="01:11:15.679" style="s2">began distributing martial arts books</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.840" end="01:11:17.360" style="s2">for every weapon type and told them to</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.679" end="01:11:19.199" style="s2">step forward to pick whichever technique</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.360" end="01:11:21.920" style="s2">they wanted to learn. As students</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.199" end="01:11:24.080" style="s2">crowded around, Rangus hesitated, unsure</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.920" end="01:11:26.159" style="s2">what to choose. Zeke advised him to take</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.080" end="01:11:28.159" style="s2">a spear technique, reminding him that he</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.159" end="01:11:30.159" style="s2">used a spear during the entrance exam.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.159" end="01:11:31.840" style="s2">Rangus quickly agreed and thanked him.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.159" end="01:11:33.120" style="s2">Leica said she would pick a great sword</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.840" end="01:11:35.679" style="s2">technique since she already knew the</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.120" end="01:11:38.000" style="s2">lightning great sword&#39;s basic forms. But</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.679" end="01:11:40.880" style="s2">Zeke stopped her, suggesting she try axe</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.000" end="01:11:42.320" style="s2">arts instead. Leica asked why, and Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.880" end="01:11:44.400" style="s2">explained that it would help cover her</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.320" end="01:11:46.320" style="s2">current weaknesses. Since it was Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.400" end="01:11:48.159" style="s2">who suggested it, she didn&#39;t argue and</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.320" end="01:11:50.239" style="s2">just nodded, quietly, trusting his</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.159" end="01:11:52.400" style="s2">words. Freya then asked if everyone had</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.239" end="01:11:54.159" style="s2">chosen their books. When they confirmed,</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.400" end="01:11:56.159" style="s2">she told them to make good use of the</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.159" end="01:11:58.080" style="s2">remaining 5 days. Their survival</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.159" end="01:12:00.400" style="s2">depended entirely on mastering those</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.080" end="01:12:01.920" style="s2">techniques. If they failed to do so,</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.400" end="01:12:04.080" style="s2">they would die pathetically in the</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.920" end="01:12:05.520" style="s2">poison dragon mountain. Just as she was</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.080" end="01:12:07.360" style="s2">about to leave, Freya suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.520" end="01:12:09.120" style="s2">remembered something and turned back.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.360" end="01:12:10.560" style="s2">She warned them that during the test,</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.120" end="01:12:12.800" style="s2">their seniors would be trying to steal</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.560" end="01:12:14.480" style="s2">their crystal orbs. Rangus was stunned</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.800" end="01:12:16.159" style="s2">and asked what she meant. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.480" end="01:12:17.760" style="s2">explained that their 10-year-old senior</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.159" end="01:12:19.760" style="s2">group would also be taking the same</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.760" end="01:12:21.440" style="s2">test, but their task was to hunt down</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.760" end="01:12:23.199" style="s2">and steal the orbs from the younger</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.440" end="01:12:24.960" style="s2">batch. She added that the younger</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.199" end="01:12:26.640" style="s2">students outnumbered the seniors, and</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.960" end="01:12:29.120" style="s2">since the poison dragon mountain was</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.640" end="01:12:31.440" style="s2">vast, they might get lucky and avoid</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.120" end="01:12:32.960" style="s2">confrontation. Still, their seniors</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.440" end="01:12:34.880" style="s2">would use everything they had to find</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.960" end="01:12:37.120" style="s2">and attack them. After saying that,</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.880" end="01:12:39.360" style="s2">Freya turned and left. Rangus looked</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.120" end="01:12:40.800" style="s2">terrified, sweat dripping down his face</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.360" end="01:12:43.040" style="s2">as he asked what they were supposed to</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.800" end="01:12:45.440" style="s2">do now. Not only did they have to deal</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.040" end="01:12:47.600" style="s2">with poisonous monsters, but also with</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.440" end="01:12:49.120" style="s2">upper classmen hunting them. Leica</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.600" end="01:12:51.040" style="s2">frowned and said that every upper</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.120" end="01:12:52.960" style="s2">classman was at least one star level or</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.040" end="01:12:54.640" style="s2">higher. If they ganged up on her, she</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.960" end="01:12:56.320" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t last long, and most of their</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.640" end="01:12:58.640" style="s2">classmates probably wouldn&#39;t survive</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.320" end="01:13:00.960" style="s2">either. Zeke nodded, saying she had a</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.640" end="01:13:02.719" style="s2">point. If Leica couldn&#39;t fight alone,</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.960" end="01:13:04.640" style="s2">then she should form a group of two or</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.719" end="01:13:06.239" style="s2">three. Cooperation wasn&#39;t forbidden</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.640" end="01:13:07.920" style="s2">after all. they could help each other</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.239" end="01:13:10.239" style="s2">hunt monsters and defend against</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.920" end="01:13:12.239" style="s2">seniors. When Rangus asked about Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.239" end="01:13:15.040" style="s2">plan, Zeke simply said that he intended</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.239" end="01:13:16.880" style="s2">to go solo and enjoy the exam. Leica</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.040" end="01:13:18.880" style="s2">sighed and admitted that somehow that</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.880" end="01:13:21.440" style="s2">sounded just like him. Before they began</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.880" end="01:13:23.520" style="s2">training, Zeke suggested they eat first.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.440" end="01:13:25.360" style="s2">As they walked away, Lea glanced at</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.520" end="01:13:27.520" style="s2">Rangus and asked if he didn&#39;t think Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.360" end="01:13:30.800" style="s2">was a little strange sometimes. Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.520" end="01:13:32.800" style="s2">shrugged and replied, &quot;Yeah, sometimes.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.800" end="01:13:34.880" style="s2">5 days later, the students gathered</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.800" end="01:13:36.719" style="s2">before the poison dragon mountain. Their</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.880" end="01:13:39.280" style="s2">emotions mixed between fear and</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.719" end="01:13:41.360" style="s2">determination. Freya stood before them,</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.280" end="01:13:42.800" style="s2">a confident smile on her face, and</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.360" end="01:13:45.440" style="s2">declared that the weather was perfect</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.800" end="01:13:47.120" style="s2">for the test to begin. Nervously, Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.440" end="01:13:49.760" style="s2">said that the exam was finally about to</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.120" end="01:13:51.280" style="s2">begin. Even though this was Zeke&#39;s plan,</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.760" end="01:13:53.120" style="s2">he couldn&#39;t help but wonder if it was</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.280" end="01:13:55.679" style="s2">really okay for someone like him to be</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.120" end="01:13:57.440" style="s2">part of Lady Leica&#39;s team. After all,</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.679" end="01:13:59.520" style="s2">there were many nobleborn students she</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.440" end="01:14:01.280" style="s2">could have chosen instead of him, a mere</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.520" end="01:14:03.760" style="s2">commoner who hadn&#39;t even reached one</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.280" end="01:14:05.600" style="s2">star yet. We&#39;re the same, Rangus,&quot; said</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.760" end="01:14:07.440" style="s2">another student. When Rangus turned</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.600" end="01:14:09.840" style="s2">around, he recognized them as Raymond</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.440" end="01:14:12.480" style="s2">and Seline. Seline, who came from the</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.840" end="01:14:14.400" style="s2">east hall of Dragons Nest, admitted she</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.480" end="01:14:16.640" style="s2">was also a commoner and couldn&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.400" end="01:14:18.480" style="s2">she&#39;d been chosen to join Lady Lea in</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.640" end="01:14:20.560" style="s2">the upcoming trial at Poison Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.480" end="01:14:23.360" style="s2">Mountain. Raymond, also from the East</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.560" end="01:14:25.040" style="s2">Hall, smiled as he looked at Lady Lea.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.360" end="01:14:26.719" style="s2">But Leica quickly said that it didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.040" end="01:14:28.800" style="s2">matter whether her teammates were nobles</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.719" end="01:14:30.480" style="s2">or commoners. She had chosen them</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.800" end="01:14:33.280" style="s2">because she recognized their potential</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.480" end="01:14:35.199" style="s2">and abilities. Hearing this, Rangus fell</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.280" end="01:14:37.040" style="s2">silent for a moment, then gripped his</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.199" end="01:14:39.120" style="s2">spear tightly and declared that he</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.040" end="01:14:41.199" style="s2">understood and that he would do his best</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.120" end="01:14:43.120" style="s2">not to become a burden to their group.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.199" end="01:14:45.600" style="s2">Raymond followed, saying he would give</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.120" end="01:14:47.840" style="s2">his all to meet Leica&#39;s expectations.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.600" end="01:14:49.520" style="s2">Leica smiled brightly and said, &quot;I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.840" end="01:14:51.199" style="s2">counting on you all.&quot; Then she turned to</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.520" end="01:14:53.440" style="s2">Zeke and asked if he was truly planning</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.199" end="01:14:55.120" style="s2">to take the trial alone. Zeke nodded</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.440" end="01:14:58.000" style="s2">confidently, saying he couldn&#39;t wait for</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.120" end="01:14:59.760" style="s2">it to begin. Selene, still nervous,</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.000" end="01:15:01.440" style="s2">admitted she admired both Zeke and</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.760" end="01:15:03.520" style="s2">Leica. While she was trembling in</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.440" end="01:15:05.520" style="s2">anxiety, Zeke was brave enough to face</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.520" end="01:15:07.199" style="s2">Poison Dragon Mountain on his own.</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.520" end="01:15:09.199" style="s2">Raymond remarked that it was natural for</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.199" end="01:15:11.360" style="s2">them to be confident since the blood of</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.199" end="01:15:13.440" style="s2">family heads flowed through their veins.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.360" end="01:15:15.280" style="s2">But Leica quickly interjected, telling</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.440" end="01:15:18.159" style="s2">him not to compare her to Zeke because</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.280" end="01:15:20.080" style="s2">even she felt nervous. &quot;You&#39;re nervous?&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.159" end="01:15:22.320" style="s2">Zeke asked. &quot;Is there even a reason to</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.080" end="01:15:23.920" style="s2">be nervous? Aside from you, everyone</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.320" end="01:15:25.760" style="s2">here seems like a group of promising</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.920" end="01:15:27.280" style="s2">students.&quot; However, they all replied</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.760" end="01:15:29.520" style="s2">that there were plenty of reasons to be</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.280" end="01:15:31.280" style="s2">nervous about the upcoming trial. Leica</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.520" end="01:15:33.440" style="s2">then asked Zeke if he truly thought the</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.280" end="01:15:35.280" style="s2">students she picked were skilled. Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.440" end="01:15:37.040" style="s2">immediately confirmed it and thought to</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.280" end="01:15:38.640" style="s2">himself that Leica had successfully</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.040" end="01:15:40.640" style="s2">gathered some of the most promising</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.640" end="01:15:42.239" style="s2">students in the academy. He realized</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.640" end="01:15:44.159" style="s2">that her eye for talent was indeed</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.239" end="01:15:46.239" style="s2">remarkable. He praised their group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.159" end="01:15:48.239" style="s2">offense and defense, saying the trial</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.239" end="01:15:50.400" style="s2">would surely be easy for them. &quot;You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.239" end="01:15:52.400" style="s2">right,&quot; Rangus replied with a drop of</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.400" end="01:15:54.640" style="s2">sweat running down his cheek. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.400" end="01:15:56.320" style="s2">always been too confident, Zeke. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.640" end="01:15:58.239" style="s2">then asked if all the participants have</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.320" end="01:16:00.239" style="s2">arrived and soon noticed that many of</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.239" end="01:16:01.840" style="s2">the students had already formed groups.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.239" end="01:16:03.920" style="s2">Since some weren&#39;t yet masters of their</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.840" end="01:16:06.000" style="s2">weapon arts, forming teams wasn&#39;t a bad</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.920" end="01:16:07.440" style="s2">idea. Freya then stepped forward and</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.000" end="01:16:09.520" style="s2">announced that the trial would begin</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.440" end="01:16:11.520" style="s2">shortly. She explained once again that</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.520" end="01:16:13.360" style="s2">their task was to survive for one full</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.520" end="01:16:15.360" style="s2">month in Poison Dragon Mountain and</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.360" end="01:16:17.840" style="s2">protect their crystal orbs. They would</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.360" end="01:16:20.000" style="s2">only pass if their orbs remained intact.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.840" end="01:16:21.840" style="s2">Every orb was identical, meaning that if</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.000" end="01:16:24.000" style="s2">one lost theirs, it could be stolen by</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.840" end="01:16:26.080" style="s2">others. Many students grew anxious upon</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.000" end="01:16:27.679" style="s2">hearing this. While Zeke realized that</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.080" end="01:16:29.760" style="s2">this meant stealing orbs from other</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.679" end="01:16:31.600" style="s2">participants was fair game, Freya</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.760" end="01:16:32.800" style="s2">continued, saying that after the new</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.600" end="01:16:35.280" style="s2">students entered the mountain and</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.800" end="01:16:37.920" style="s2">settled, upper classmen would also enter</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.280" end="01:16:39.760" style="s2">to steal their crystal orbs. The upper</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.920" end="01:16:41.280" style="s2">classmen mocked them, saying that since</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.760" end="01:16:43.360" style="s2">most of the new students hadn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.280" end="01:16:45.120" style="s2">reached one star, taking their orbs</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.360" end="01:16:47.440" style="s2">would be easy. Hearing this filled</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.120" end="01:16:50.159" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s classmates with mixed emotions,</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.440" end="01:16:52.239" style="s2">fear, excitement, and unease. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.159" end="01:16:53.760" style="s2">concluded the explanation, and as soon</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.239" end="01:16:55.760" style="s2">as she announced that the trial had</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.760" end="01:16:57.760" style="s2">officially begun, the students dashed</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.760" end="01:16:59.840" style="s2">toward Poison Dragon Mountain. Watching</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.760" end="01:17:01.840" style="s2">them go, Zeke heard Leica tell him to</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.840" end="01:17:03.600" style="s2">make sure he survived. He smiled and</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.840" end="01:17:05.679" style="s2">said he would, but that they should</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.600" end="01:17:07.840" style="s2">survive as well. Leica then called out</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.679" end="01:17:09.920" style="s2">to her team, and as Zeke told them to be</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.840" end="01:17:12.159" style="s2">careful, Freya noticed him. &quot;It&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.920" end="01:17:14.400" style="s2">turn to enter, Zeke,&quot; she said. Right,</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.159" end="01:17:16.960" style="s2">Zeke replied, apologizing for getting a</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.400" end="01:17:19.600" style="s2">bit carried away. Carried away? Freya</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.960" end="01:17:21.679" style="s2">asked. Aren&#39;t you nervous at all? No,</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.600" end="01:17:23.440" style="s2">Zeke replied with a calm smile before</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.679" end="01:17:25.440" style="s2">walking toward the mountain. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.440" end="01:17:27.600" style="s2">watched him go, thinking to herself that</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.440" end="01:17:29.840" style="s2">he was indeed a peculiar boy. That</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.600" end="01:17:32.000" style="s2">night, at the camp outside Poison Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.840" end="01:17:33.840" style="s2">Mountain, one of the instructors asked</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.000" end="01:17:35.840" style="s2">Freya if the new students would be all</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.840" end="01:17:37.440" style="s2">right. When she asked what he meant, he</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.840" end="01:17:39.840" style="s2">said the trial seemed too early for</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.440" end="01:17:41.600" style="s2">beginners. Another instructor agreed,</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.840" end="01:17:44.080" style="s2">pointing out that most had only been in</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.600" end="01:17:46.400" style="s2">Dragon&#39;s Nest for a few months, that few</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.080" end="01:17:49.040" style="s2">had achieved even one star, and that</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.400" end="01:17:50.239" style="s2">they lacked real combat experience. He</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.040" end="01:17:52.560" style="s2">wondered how many would actually</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.239" end="01:17:54.400" style="s2">survive. Freya reassured them, saying</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.560" end="01:17:55.920" style="s2">there was no need to worry. Although the</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.400" end="01:17:58.000" style="s2">mountain was filled with poisonous</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.920" end="01:18:00.719" style="s2">creatures, most of them were only one or</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.000" end="01:18:02.880" style="s2">two star-le beasts, not strong enough to</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.719" end="01:18:04.480" style="s2">pose serious danger. With a cheerful</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.880" end="01:18:07.120" style="s2">smile, she said the students would do</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.480" end="01:18:08.640" style="s2">fine. Then under her breath, she</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.120" end="01:18:11.520" style="s2">whispered that she would eventually</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.640" end="01:18:14.080" style="s2">release that thing. When an instructor</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.520" end="01:18:16.960" style="s2">asked what she said, Freya simply smiled</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.080" end="01:18:18.800" style="s2">and replied, &quot;Nothing.&quot; She then</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.960" end="01:18:20.320" style="s2">announced that it was time for the upper</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.800" end="01:18:22.400" style="s2">classmen to begin their part of the</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.320" end="01:18:24.159" style="s2">trial. The older students immediately</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.400" end="01:18:26.159" style="s2">ran off toward the mountain, their eyes</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.159" end="01:18:28.159" style="s2">gleaming as they carried their weapons.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.159" end="01:18:30.320" style="s2">Watching them leave, Freya murmured, &quot;I</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.159" end="01:18:32.719" style="s2">wonder how many will survive. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.320" end="01:18:34.800" style="s2">wait to see the results.&quot; Meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.719" end="01:18:37.120" style="s2">inside the poison dragon mountain, as</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.800" end="01:18:39.280" style="s2">the upper classmen began their hunt, one</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.120" end="01:18:41.520" style="s2">of them spotted their first target. It</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.280" end="01:18:43.360" style="s2">was none other than Zeke, still standing</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.520" end="01:18:44.960" style="s2">motionless at the foot of the mountain.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.360" end="01:18:47.360" style="s2">The newbies entered the mountain long</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.960" end="01:18:49.199" style="s2">ago,&quot; one said mockingly. &quot;Is this guy</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.360" end="01:18:51.120" style="s2">stupid or what?&quot; Another raised his</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.199" end="01:18:53.199" style="s2">crossbow and prepared to shoot. But</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.120" end="01:18:55.360" style="s2">before the arrow could reach him, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.199" end="01:18:57.760" style="s2">effortlessly caught it midair. As the</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.360" end="01:18:59.360" style="s2">upperassman stared in disbelief, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.760" end="01:19:01.600" style="s2">snapped the arrow in half and said,</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.360" end="01:19:03.520" style="s2">&quot;I&#39;ve been waiting for you.&quot; One of them</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.600" end="01:19:05.360" style="s2">asked what he meant, but another shouted</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.520" end="01:19:06.880" style="s2">that it didn&#39;t matter. Didn&#39;t they see</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.360" end="01:19:08.960" style="s2">how he caught that arrow? Without</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.880" end="01:19:10.800" style="s2">wasting a second, Zeke dashed forward,</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.960" end="01:19:12.719" style="s2">his eyes sharp with excitement. &quot;Now</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.800" end="01:19:14.800" style="s2">then,&quot; he said with a smirk. &quot;Let&#39;s play</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.719" end="01:19:16.719" style="s2">together.&quot; In the deeper part of Poison</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.800" end="01:19:18.159" style="s2">Dragon Mountain, Seline and her group</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.719" end="01:19:20.320" style="s2">were under attack by the mountains</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.159" end="01:19:22.320" style="s2">monsters. After Seline slew a massive</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.320" end="01:19:24.480" style="s2">froglike creature, another one suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.320" end="01:19:26.320" style="s2">leapt from behind her. Raymond swiftly</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.480" end="01:19:28.719" style="s2">raised his shield, blocking the attack</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.320" end="01:19:31.040" style="s2">and saving Seline just in time. With a</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.719" end="01:19:32.800" style="s2">powerful swing, he bashed the monster to</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.040" end="01:19:35.120" style="s2">the ground and drove his shield straight</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.800" end="01:19:36.880" style="s2">into its body, killing it instantly.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.120" end="01:19:38.960" style="s2">Seeing that Rangus was easily defeating</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.880" end="01:19:41.120" style="s2">his own opponent, Raymon smiled in</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.960" end="01:19:43.280" style="s2">satisfaction. Leica then praised them</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.120" end="01:19:45.360" style="s2">for their excellent teamwork, and Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.280" end="01:19:47.040" style="s2">gratefully thanked her. However, his</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.360" end="01:19:48.960" style="s2">eyes widened when he saw the mountain of</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.040" end="01:19:51.120" style="s2">slain frog monsters that Lea had</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.960" end="01:19:53.600" style="s2">single-handedly defeated. Selena,</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.120" end="01:19:56.159" style="s2">impressed, remarked that Lea&#39;s power was</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.600" end="01:19:58.239" style="s2">truly on another level, just as they had</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.159" end="01:19:59.679" style="s2">expected. Raymond agreed, saying that</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.239" end="01:20:01.760" style="s2">while they were busy fighting a few</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.679" end="01:20:04.159" style="s2">monsters, Leica had already wiped out</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.760" end="01:20:06.320" style="s2">most of them by herself. Leica simply</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.159" end="01:20:08.560" style="s2">shrugged, saying it was only natural.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.320" end="01:20:10.080" style="s2">After all, she was a two-star warrior,</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.560" end="01:20:12.159" style="s2">and these creatures were nothing more</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.080" end="01:20:13.920" style="s2">than a warm-up for her. She also noted</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.159" end="01:20:15.440" style="s2">that since the exam had started a week</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.920" end="01:20:17.360" style="s2">ago, everyone had improved</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.440" end="01:20:19.040" style="s2">significantly, especially Seline and</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.360" end="01:20:21.040" style="s2">Raymond, who had both reached one star</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.040" end="01:20:22.560" style="s2">level. Seline gratefully acknowledged</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.040" end="01:20:24.000" style="s2">Leica, saying they wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.560" end="01:20:25.920" style="s2">advanced so quickly without her</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.000" end="01:20:28.159" style="s2">guidance. and Raymond echoed her</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.920" end="01:20:30.719" style="s2">gratitude. Rangis, however, remained</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.159" end="01:20:32.640" style="s2">silent, quietly, thinking how far he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.719" end="01:20:34.880" style="s2">fallen behind now that both Seline and</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.640" end="01:20:37.199" style="s2">Raymond had achieved their first stars.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.880" end="01:20:39.280" style="s2">Seline noticed his downcast expression</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.199" end="01:20:41.360" style="s2">and gently told him that he would surely</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.280" end="01:20:43.600" style="s2">get stronger in time and reach one star</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.360" end="01:20:45.600" style="s2">level, too. Raymond agreed, telling him</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.600" end="01:20:47.360" style="s2">to be patient and keep working hard.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.600" end="01:20:49.360" style="s2">Hearing their encouragement, Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.360" end="01:20:51.920" style="s2">smiled again and thanked them both.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.360" end="01:20:53.760" style="s2">Leica then spoke, saying that Rangus had</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.920" end="01:20:56.000" style="s2">managed to defeat three giant frog</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.760" end="01:20:58.159" style="s2">monsters, even without a star, which was</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.000" end="01:21:00.320" style="s2">truly impressive. She added that before</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.159" end="01:21:01.840" style="s2">the exam began, Rangus had trained</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.320" end="01:21:03.840" style="s2">personally with Zeke and had already</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.840" end="01:21:05.679" style="s2">perfected his spear handling, so it was</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.840" end="01:21:07.920" style="s2">only a matter of time before he became a</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.679" end="01:21:10.560" style="s2">one-star. Moved by her faith in him,</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.920" end="01:21:12.880" style="s2">Rangus nearly teared up. As Leica looked</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.560" end="01:21:14.880" style="s2">toward the sky, she noted that night was</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.880" end="01:21:16.880" style="s2">fast approaching and told everyone they</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.880" end="01:21:18.640" style="s2">needed to head back to base. Selene</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.880" end="01:21:20.320" style="s2">agreed, warning that Poison Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.640" end="01:21:22.480" style="s2">Mountain was far too dangerous after</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.320" end="01:21:24.480" style="s2">dark. While they were on their way back,</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.480" end="01:21:26.159" style="s2">Leica suddenly stopped. Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.480" end="01:21:28.239" style="s2">immediately asked what was wrong, but</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.159" end="01:21:30.000" style="s2">Leica didn&#39;t answer. Her expression</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.239" end="01:21:31.679" style="s2">darkened as she stared ahead and</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.000" end="01:21:33.600" style="s2">demanded to know what a certain student</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.679" end="01:21:35.360" style="s2">was doing near their base. A moment</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.600" end="01:21:37.280" style="s2">later, a figure emerged from the tall</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.360" end="01:21:39.199" style="s2">grass. Ranges and the others were</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.280" end="01:21:41.199" style="s2">startled, and Seline and Raymon</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.199" end="01:21:42.800" style="s2">instinctively drew their weapons. The</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.199" end="01:21:44.640" style="s2">student stepped out with a smirk,</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.800" end="01:21:46.400" style="s2">holding his weapon loosely as he said he</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.640" end="01:21:48.880" style="s2">hadn&#39;t expected Lea to notice him so</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.400" end="01:21:50.640" style="s2">soon. Lea immediately recognized him as</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.880" end="01:21:52.480" style="s2">one of the upperassmen and asked if he</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.640" end="01:21:54.960" style="s2">had come to steal their crystal. When he</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.480" end="01:21:57.040" style="s2">confirmed it, she realized that at last</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.960" end="01:21:59.840" style="s2">an upperassman had decided to attack</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.040" end="01:22:02.239" style="s2">their group, and this one was a twoar.</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.840" end="01:22:04.000" style="s2">The upperassman grinned, saying that</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.239" end="01:22:06.159" style="s2">their current exam required them to</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.000" end="01:22:07.760" style="s2">steal the crystals from first years.</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.159" end="01:22:09.280" style="s2">Though he hadn&#39;t expected his first</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.760" end="01:22:11.520" style="s2">target to be none other than Lady</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.280" end="01:22:13.040" style="s2">Leica&#39;s group, Leica asked if he still</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.520" end="01:22:15.040" style="s2">planned to stay even after realizing</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.040" end="01:22:16.880" style="s2">whose base he had invaded. She warned</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.040" end="01:22:18.960" style="s2">him that a single upperassman wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.880" end="01:22:20.880" style="s2">stand a chance against her team. But the</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.960" end="01:22:23.040" style="s2">upperassman&#39;s grin widened as his</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.880" end="01:22:25.360" style="s2">expression turned menacing. &quot;Who said I</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.040" end="01:22:27.199" style="s2">was alone?&quot; he replied. From the grass</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.360" end="01:22:29.600" style="s2">behind him emerged three more upper</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.199" end="01:22:31.600" style="s2">classmen, all one star level. Their</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.600" end="01:22:33.199" style="s2">leader sneered, saying that even Lady</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.600" end="01:22:34.719" style="s2">Leica would have trouble fighting them</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.199" end="01:22:36.960" style="s2">since her teammates were nothing but</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.719" end="01:22:38.400" style="s2">burdens. Drawing his sword, he shouted</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.960" end="01:22:40.639" style="s2">for them to surrender and hand over</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.400" end="01:22:42.719" style="s2">their crystal orbs. He then charged at</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.639" end="01:22:44.880" style="s2">Leica with a powerful attack, but she</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.719" end="01:22:46.480" style="s2">evaded effortlessly and ordered Seline</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.880" end="01:22:48.639" style="s2">and the others to maintain their battle</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.480" end="01:22:51.840" style="s2">formation while she handled him.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.639" end="01:22:53.520" style="s2">Meanwhile, Rangis, still without a star,</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.840" end="01:22:56.000" style="s2">struggled to defend against the attacks</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.520" end="01:22:57.440" style="s2">of his opponent. The upperassman taunted</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.000" end="01:22:59.199" style="s2">him, saying it would be better to</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.440" end="01:23:02.080" style="s2">surrender and hand over his crystal.</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.199" end="01:23:03.840" style="s2">Rangus hesitated, unsure of what to do,</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.080" end="01:23:06.400" style="s2">until he remembered a conversation he</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.840" end="01:23:08.159" style="s2">once had with Zeke. Back then, Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.400" end="01:23:10.320" style="s2">had asked Zeke if there was any way for</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.159" end="01:23:12.639" style="s2">someone weaker like him to defeat</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.320" end="01:23:14.480" style="s2">stronger opponents. He admitted he was</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.639" end="01:23:16.400" style="s2">still starless and worried that if</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.480" end="01:23:18.719" style="s2">stronger enemies appeared, he&#39;d only</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.400" end="01:23:19.920" style="s2">drag his team down. Zeke&#39;s reply had</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.719" end="01:23:21.760" style="s2">shocked him, &quot;Then you should</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.920" end="01:23:24.000" style="s2">surrender.&quot; Zeke explained that if the</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.760" end="01:23:26.159" style="s2">opponent was far stronger, three star or</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.000" end="01:23:28.560" style="s2">four-star, then surrendering was the</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.159" end="01:23:30.880" style="s2">only logical choice since a starless</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.560" end="01:23:32.719" style="s2">person could never hope to win. However,</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.880" end="01:23:34.880" style="s2">he added that if Rangis ever faced an</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.719" end="01:23:36.960" style="s2">opponent around one star level, there</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.880" end="01:23:39.199" style="s2">was still a chance. When Rangus asked</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.960" end="01:23:41.360" style="s2">how, Zeke simply said, &quot;It&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.199" end="01:23:43.920" style="s2">unusual. You just have to exploit an</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.360" end="01:23:46.400" style="s2">opening.&quot; &quot;An opening?&quot; Rangus had asked</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.920" end="01:23:48.159" style="s2">confused. &quot;Exactly,&quot; Zeke replied. If</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.400" end="01:23:50.320" style="s2">you can find and exploit an opening in</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.159" end="01:23:52.480" style="s2">your opponent&#39;s defense, you can defeat</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.320" end="01:23:54.480" style="s2">them, even if they&#39;re a two star. When</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.480" end="01:23:56.320" style="s2">Rangus asked how he was supposed to find</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.480" end="01:23:59.120" style="s2">such an opening, Zeke&#39;s answer was</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.320" end="01:24:01.040" style="s2">simple. Endure. Keep enduring until your</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.120" end="01:24:03.280" style="s2">opponent shows one. Rangus had been</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.040" end="01:24:05.600" style="s2">doubtful, but Zeke continued, &quot;There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.280" end="01:24:07.600" style="s2">no other way. You can&#39;t force an opening</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.600" end="01:24:10.000" style="s2">against someone stronger. You can only</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.600" end="01:24:11.760" style="s2">endure until they make a mistake. If you</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.000" end="01:24:13.520" style="s2">can&#39;t even do that, then defeating</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.760" end="01:24:15.600" style="s2">someone stronger will always be a</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.520" end="01:24:17.440" style="s2">fantasy for you,&quot; Zeke added. If your</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.600" end="01:24:19.679" style="s2">opponent is someone special like Leica,</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.440" end="01:24:22.320" style="s2">then you won&#39;t last long. But against an</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.679" end="01:24:24.159" style="s2">ordinary twostar, you should be fine. He</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.320" end="01:24:26.320" style="s2">then told Rangus that confidence in his</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.159" end="01:24:28.159" style="s2">own strength was crucial and gave him</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.320" end="01:24:30.080" style="s2">one last piece of advice. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.159" end="01:24:31.760" style="s2">overthink it. Don&#39;t think about how to</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.080" end="01:24:34.080" style="s2">create an opening or the difference in</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.760" end="01:24:36.080" style="s2">power. Just wait patiently, and when it</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.080" end="01:24:38.960" style="s2">appears, thrust your spear straight into</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.080" end="01:24:40.960" style="s2">it. Now, in the midst of battle, Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.960" end="01:24:43.520" style="s2">clenched his fists as Zeke&#39;s words</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.960" end="01:24:45.440" style="s2">echoed in his mind. Since he was weaker,</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.520" end="01:24:47.440" style="s2">he had no choice but to endure every</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.440" end="01:24:49.280" style="s2">attack and wait for the right moment.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.440" end="01:24:51.120" style="s2">The upper classmen grew more and more</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.280" end="01:24:53.199" style="s2">frustrated as Rangus continued to</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.120" end="01:24:55.040" style="s2">withstand his blows. &quot;Just fall down</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.199" end="01:24:57.199" style="s2">already,&quot; he shouted in anger,</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.040" end="01:24:59.600" style="s2">unleashing a powerful strike. But in</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.199" end="01:25:02.159" style="s2">that instant, Rangus saw it, the opening</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.600" end="01:25:04.159" style="s2">Zeke had spoken of. Without hesitation,</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.159" end="01:25:05.760" style="s2">he gathered all his strength and thrust</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.159" end="01:25:07.679" style="s2">his spear straight into his opponent&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.760" end="01:25:09.199" style="s2">body. The upperassman coughed up</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.679" end="01:25:12.000" style="s2">collapsed, losing consciousness</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.199" end="01:25:14.560" style="s2">instantly. As he fell, a radiant light</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.000" end="01:25:17.120" style="s2">glowed on Rangus&#39; chest. The mark of his</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.560" end="01:25:19.120" style="s2">newly awakened one star. Lea noticed</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.120" end="01:25:21.199" style="s2">immediately, surprised yet proud that</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.120" end="01:25:23.280" style="s2">Rangus had taken down his opponent.</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.199" end="01:25:25.679" style="s2">Meanwhile, the leader of the upperassman</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.280" end="01:25:27.840" style="s2">was in disbelief, unable to understand</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.679" end="01:25:30.080" style="s2">why Leica&#39;s power felt so overwhelming</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.840" end="01:25:32.080" style="s2">despite them both being two star level.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.080" end="01:25:33.760" style="s2">Leica realized that ever since mastering</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.080" end="01:25:35.440" style="s2">the axarts technique Zeke had</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.760" end="01:25:37.440" style="s2">recommended, she had learned to channel</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.440" end="01:25:39.199" style="s2">greater force and energy into her great</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.440" end="01:25:40.960" style="s2">sword, which explained the vast</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.199" end="01:25:42.560" style="s2">difference in power. She told her</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.960" end="01:25:44.880" style="s2">opponent that it was his misfortune to</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.560" end="01:25:46.320" style="s2">have chosen her group as a target. Then,</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.880" end="01:25:48.480" style="s2">summoning golden lightning around her</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.320" end="01:25:50.560" style="s2">sword, she declared, &quot;This battle ends</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.480" end="01:25:52.239" style="s2">here.&quot; Her blade struck with blinding</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.560" end="01:25:54.400" style="s2">force, and the enemy leader fell</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.239" end="01:25:56.239" style="s2">unconscious. After ensuring the enemies</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.400" end="01:25:58.239" style="s2">were defeated, Leica rushed back to her</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.239" end="01:25:59.920" style="s2">team and asked if everyone was safe.</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.239" end="01:26:01.760" style="s2">Once confirmed, the group cheered in</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.920" end="01:26:03.840" style="s2">relief. They had just won their first</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.760" end="01:26:05.600" style="s2">battle against upper classmen. Selene</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.840" end="01:26:07.280" style="s2">and Raymond congratulated Rangus on</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.600" end="01:26:09.199" style="s2">reaching one star level, and Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.280" end="01:26:11.360" style="s2">thanked them with a bright smile. Leica</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.199" end="01:26:13.280" style="s2">looked at her team proudly, realizing</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.360" end="01:26:16.000" style="s2">that now all of her members had finally</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.280" end="01:26:17.760" style="s2">manifested their first stars. With that,</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.000" end="01:26:19.920" style="s2">she said that the next battles ahead</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.760" end="01:26:21.760" style="s2">would be much easier. Then, with a</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.920" end="01:26:24.320" style="s2">thoughtful expression, she wondered</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.760" end="01:26:26.400" style="s2">aloud how Zeke was doing. Meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.320" end="01:26:28.320" style="s2">elsewhere in Poison Dragon Mountain, a</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.400" end="01:26:30.320" style="s2">terrified upperassman was running for</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.320" end="01:26:32.480" style="s2">his life. Tears streamed down his face</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.320" end="01:26:34.800" style="s2">as he muttered repeatedly, &quot;Please don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.480" end="01:26:36.800" style="s2">come here. Zeke, don&#39;t come here.&quot; He</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.800" end="01:26:38.960" style="s2">cursed under his breath, trembling in</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.800" end="01:26:41.600" style="s2">fear, asking himself just what kind of</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.960" end="01:26:43.520" style="s2">monster that boy named Zeke really was.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.600" end="01:26:45.520" style="s2">Moments later, the upper classmen were</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.520" end="01:26:47.280" style="s2">running frantically, shouting for help,</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.520" end="01:26:49.440" style="s2">hoping and praying that Zeke would not</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.280" end="01:26:51.679" style="s2">follow them. As Zeke dragged along one</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.440" end="01:26:54.320" style="s2">of the upperassmen he had just defeated,</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.679" end="01:26:56.560" style="s2">the others cursed in fear and confusion,</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.320" end="01:26:59.040" style="s2">asking what kind of monster or demon he</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.560" end="01:27:01.280" style="s2">was. Holding the corpse of a giant snake</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.040" end="01:27:03.360" style="s2">beast in one hand, Zeke grinned and</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.280" end="01:27:05.199" style="s2">mockingly asked what their problem was,</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.360" end="01:27:07.440" style="s2">wondering aloud if no one else wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.199" end="01:27:09.440" style="s2">play with him. The upperassmen, now</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.440" end="01:27:11.360" style="s2">completely terrified, called him insane</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.440" end="01:27:13.440" style="s2">as they continued to flee. Some</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.360" end="01:27:15.199" style="s2">questioned why a lowerassman like Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.440" end="01:27:17.440" style="s2">was the one hunting them down when it</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.199" end="01:27:19.040" style="s2">should be the other way around. that the</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.440" end="01:27:21.840" style="s2">upperassmen were supposed to be the</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.040" end="01:27:23.360" style="s2">hunters, not the hunted. Suddenly, one</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.840" end="01:27:25.440" style="s2">of the fleeing upper classmen tripped</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.360" end="01:27:28.000" style="s2">and fell. As he struggled to get back on</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.440" end="01:27:30.000" style="s2">his feet, he froze. The moment he lifted</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.000" end="01:27:31.760" style="s2">his head, Zeke was already standing</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.000" end="01:27:33.760" style="s2">right in front of him. With his crimson</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.760" end="01:27:35.280" style="s2">eyes faintly glowing, Zeke sighed and</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.760" end="01:27:37.520" style="s2">said he was getting tired of chasing</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.280" end="01:27:39.920" style="s2">him. He reached out his hand, offering</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.520" end="01:27:42.159" style="s2">to help the upperassman stand up, but</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.920" end="01:27:43.920" style="s2">calmly added that once he did, he would</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.159" end="01:27:45.760" style="s2">have to fight him. The upperassman&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.920" end="01:27:47.440" style="s2">eyes widened in pure horror before his</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.760" end="01:27:49.600" style="s2">body went limp and he collapsed</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.440" end="01:27:51.520" style="s2">unconscious on the ground. Zeke tilted</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.600" end="01:27:53.199" style="s2">his head in confusion, muttering to</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.520" end="01:27:55.120" style="s2">himself and wondering what just happened</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.199" end="01:27:56.560" style="s2">to the man. He looked around and asked</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.120" end="01:27:58.560" style="s2">out loud what was going on with the</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.560" end="01:28:00.000" style="s2">upperassmen, questioning why they had</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.560" end="01:28:02.159" style="s2">suddenly become so defensive and</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.000" end="01:28:03.760" style="s2">cowardly. Calling them pathetic, he</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.159" end="01:28:05.920" style="s2">mocked how aggressive they were the</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.760" end="01:28:08.080" style="s2">first time they saw him, only to end up</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.920" end="01:28:09.600" style="s2">running away in fear. He then smirked</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.080" end="01:28:11.760" style="s2">and shouted for the others not to leave</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.600" end="01:28:13.679" style="s2">him behind. Just then, Zeke felt a faint</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.760" end="01:28:15.520" style="s2">presence nearby. Turning toward his</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.679" end="01:28:16.960" style="s2">side, he asked whoever was watching him</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.520" end="01:28:18.639" style="s2">why they didn&#39;t come closer if they</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.960" end="01:28:20.880" style="s2">wanted a better look. When he received</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.639" end="01:28:22.560" style="s2">no reply, Zeke chuckled and said that</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.880" end="01:28:24.480" style="s2">since the observer was still watching</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.560" end="01:28:25.840" style="s2">without interfering, it must mean there</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.480" end="01:28:28.159" style="s2">was nothing wrong with what he was</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.840" end="01:28:30.080" style="s2">doing. With that, he said he would stop</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.159" end="01:28:32.080" style="s2">holding back and continue his little</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.080" end="01:28:33.600" style="s2">game with the upperassman. From the</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.080" end="01:28:35.920" style="s2">direction where Zeke had sensed the</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.600" end="01:28:37.360" style="s2">presence, a man emerged. It was one of</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.920" end="01:28:39.679" style="s2">the overseers monitoring the</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.360" end="01:28:41.520" style="s2">examination. Beads of sweat rolled down</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.679" end="01:28:43.600" style="s2">his cheek as he whispered to himself,</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.520" end="01:28:46.000" style="s2">unable to comprehend what kind of child</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.600" end="01:28:47.760" style="s2">Zeke was. He had witnessed Zeke defeat</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.000" end="01:28:49.679" style="s2">upperassmen who were supposed to be far</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.760" end="01:28:51.760" style="s2">stronger than him. And even more</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.679" end="01:28:54.000" style="s2">astonishingly, Zeke had sensed his</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.760" end="01:28:55.920" style="s2">hidden presence. Realizing the gravity</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.000" end="01:28:57.520" style="s2">of what he had just seen, the overseer</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.920" end="01:28:59.679" style="s2">decided he had to report everything</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.520" end="01:29:02.000" style="s2">immediately. Meanwhile, at the camp</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.679" end="01:29:03.679" style="s2">outside Poison Dragon Mountain, Freya</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.000" end="01:29:05.520" style="s2">was taken aback when several observers</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.679" end="01:29:07.280" style="s2">arrived to make their report. According</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.520" end="01:29:10.159" style="s2">to them, it had been 1 week since the</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.280" end="01:29:12.480" style="s2">examination began. At present, 30% of</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.159" end="01:29:14.080" style="s2">the lowerassmen had already dropped out.</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.480" end="01:29:15.920" style="s2">While the remaining ones were gradually</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.080" end="01:29:18.080" style="s2">adapting to both their environment and</p>
<p begin="01:29:15.920" end="01:29:19.920" style="s2">the dangers of poison dragon mountain,</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.080" end="01:29:21.920" style="s2">one of the observers added that they did</p>
<p begin="01:29:19.920" end="01:29:24.239" style="s2">not expect many more lowerassmen to</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.920" end="01:29:26.239" style="s2">withdraw from the test. When Freya asked</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.239" end="01:29:28.560" style="s2">about the upper classmen, however, the</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.239" end="01:29:30.639" style="s2">observers exchanged uneasy glances and</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.560" end="01:29:32.400" style="s2">couldn&#39;t answer her directly. Freya&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.639" end="01:29:34.480" style="s2">expression darkened and she ordered them</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.400" end="01:29:36.159" style="s2">to speak clearly. Finally, one of them</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.480" end="01:29:38.639" style="s2">admitted that the upperassmen were</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.159" end="01:29:41.120" style="s2">constantly fleeing. Freya frowned,</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.639" end="01:29:43.520" style="s2">momentarily lost in thought, and asked</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.120" end="01:29:45.760" style="s2">why they were running away. What exactly</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.520" end="01:29:47.920" style="s2">were they escaping from? She pointed out</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.760" end="01:29:50.480" style="s2">that to her knowledge, there were no</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.920" end="01:29:52.719" style="s2">monsters within Poison Dragon Mountain</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.480" end="01:29:54.400" style="s2">to threaten the upperassmen. One of the</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.719" end="01:29:56.320" style="s2">observers then explained that they were</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.400" end="01:29:59.040" style="s2">not running from a monster. They were</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.320" end="01:30:00.800" style="s2">running from Lord Zeke. Freya raised an</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.040" end="01:30:02.639" style="s2">eyebrow and asked why they would flee</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.800" end="01:30:04.000" style="s2">from him. The observer took a deep</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.639" end="01:30:05.760" style="s2">breath and said that Zeke had been</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.000" end="01:30:08.080" style="s2">relentlessly attacking and hunting the</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.760" end="01:30:10.080" style="s2">upperassmen. At first, they tried to</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.080" end="01:30:12.080" style="s2">fight back, but eventually they had no</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.080" end="01:30:13.840" style="s2">choice but to run. Another observer</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.080" end="01:30:16.320" style="s2">spoke up, asking what kind of person</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.840" end="01:30:18.239" style="s2">Lord Zeke even was. Based on what he had</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.320" end="01:30:20.000" style="s2">seen, Zeke seemed to be enjoying</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.239" end="01:30:22.239" style="s2">himself, gleefully cutting down</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.000" end="01:30:23.920" style="s2">upperassmen and hunting them like prey.</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.239" end="01:30:26.400" style="s2">For him, it was something completely</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.920" end="01:30:28.159" style="s2">unprecedented. A second observer nodded</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.400" end="01:30:30.320" style="s2">in agreement, saying that even though</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.159" end="01:30:32.960" style="s2">Zeke was the son of the Lragon family</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.320" end="01:30:35.120" style="s2">head, he was far from normal. To them,</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.960" end="01:30:37.360" style="s2">Zeke was no longer just a prodigy. He</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.120" end="01:30:39.920" style="s2">was something beyond, a true monster in</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.360" end="01:30:42.239" style="s2">human form. Freya listened quietly, then</p>
<p begin="01:30:39.920" end="01:30:43.920" style="s2">spoke with a calm but serious tone. She</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.239" end="01:30:45.520" style="s2">admitted that she had also suspected</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.920" end="01:30:47.520" style="s2">Zeke was unusual from the very</p>
<p begin="01:30:45.520" end="01:30:49.280" style="s2">beginning. Unlike the others, he had</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.520" end="01:30:50.880" style="s2">chosen to take the exam alone and</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.280" end="01:30:52.880" style="s2">appeared completely relaxed upon</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.880" end="01:30:54.880" style="s2">entering Poison Dragon Mountain. That</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.880" end="01:30:56.719" style="s2">could only mean one thing. Zeke never</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.880" end="01:30:58.719" style="s2">planned to hide from the upperassmen.</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.719" end="01:31:00.480" style="s2">From the very start, his intention had</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.719" end="01:31:02.320" style="s2">been to hunt them down himself,</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.480" end="01:31:04.560" style="s2">remembering the look in Zeke&#39;s eyes when</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.320" end="01:31:07.120" style="s2">they first met. Freya couldn&#39;t help but</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.560" end="01:31:09.360" style="s2">think that the boy was indeed a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.120" end="01:31:11.760" style="s2">Suddenly, one of the observers frowned,</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.360" end="01:31:13.920" style="s2">asking what that strange sound was.</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.760" end="01:31:15.360" style="s2">Freya&#39;s lips curved into a faint smile</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.920" end="01:31:17.199" style="s2">as she said that what they were hearing</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.360" end="01:31:18.960" style="s2">was something she had been waiting for.</p>
<p begin="01:31:17.199" end="01:31:20.239" style="s2">A man then approached and asked Lady</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.960" end="01:31:22.320" style="s2">Freya where they should place the</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.239" end="01:31:24.080" style="s2">massive cage they had brought. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.320" end="01:31:25.760" style="s2">told them to leave it where it was and</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.080" end="01:31:27.679" style="s2">thanked them for their work. When the</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.760" end="01:31:29.679" style="s2">observers turned to look at the cage,</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.679" end="01:31:31.360" style="s2">their eyes widened in shock. They</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.679" end="01:31:33.440" style="s2">immediately asked what kind of creature</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.360" end="01:31:35.360" style="s2">was inside, and some even questioned</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.440" end="01:31:37.280" style="s2">whether Freya truly intended to release</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.360" end="01:31:39.280" style="s2">it into the mountain, as the creature&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.280" end="01:31:41.920" style="s2">aura alone revealed it to be at least a</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.280" end="01:31:43.840" style="s2">threestar level beast, far too powerful</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.920" end="01:31:46.159" style="s2">for any of the students to handle. But</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.840" end="01:31:47.920" style="s2">Freya, clearly pleased, reassured them</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.159" end="01:31:49.600" style="s2">that there was nothing to worry about.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.920" end="01:31:51.199" style="s2">Adjustments had already been made to the</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.600" end="01:31:53.120" style="s2">creature. It would only target</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.199" end="01:31:55.520" style="s2">individuals of two star level strength</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.120" end="01:31:57.360" style="s2">or higher. Ordinary students would not</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.520" end="01:31:59.199" style="s2">suffer serious harm. One of the</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.360" end="01:32:00.800" style="s2">observers then asked why such a creature</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.199" end="01:32:03.360" style="s2">was suddenly being released during the</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.800" end="01:32:05.199" style="s2">exam. Freya replied calmly that it was a</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.360" end="01:32:06.719" style="s2">direct order from their family head,</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.199" end="01:32:08.960" style="s2">Balsa.</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.719" end="01:32:10.639" style="s2">In her mind, she wanted to witness the</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.960" end="01:32:12.960" style="s2">abilities of the boy whom their soldiers</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.639" end="01:32:14.719" style="s2">had already begun calling a monster. She</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.960" end="01:32:17.120" style="s2">wanted to see whether Zeke could survive</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.719" end="01:32:18.880" style="s2">against such a being. With that thought,</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.120" end="01:32:20.639" style="s2">she ordered that the mysterious creature</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.880" end="01:32:22.960" style="s2">be released into Poison Dragon Mountain</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.639" end="01:32:25.120" style="s2">at dawn. The next morning, deep within</p>
<p begin="01:32:22.960" end="01:32:27.120" style="s2">Poison Dragon Mountain, Rangus and his</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.120" end="01:32:29.040" style="s2">team suddenly stopped in their tracks as</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.120" end="01:32:31.120" style="s2">the ground trembled violently beneath</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.040" end="01:32:33.040" style="s2">them. Leica frowned, saying she had a</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.120" end="01:32:35.040" style="s2">bad feeling about the tremor. Raymond</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.040" end="01:32:37.440" style="s2">wondered if perhaps the upperassman had</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.040" end="01:32:39.040" style="s2">caused it, but Rangus shook his head,</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.440" end="01:32:41.679" style="s2">saying it was most likely the work of a</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.040" end="01:32:43.679" style="s2">beast, probably a massive anger boore.</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.679" end="01:32:45.360" style="s2">Still, Leica couldn&#39;t shake off her</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.679" end="01:32:47.600" style="s2">unease and said that something about it</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.360" end="01:32:49.840" style="s2">felt different. A moment later, a second</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.600" end="01:32:51.679" style="s2">stronger quake shook the mountain. As a</p>
<p begin="01:32:49.840" end="01:32:54.080" style="s2">giant tree began to fall toward them,</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.679" end="01:32:55.760" style="s2">Leica&#39;s instincts kicked in. She shouted</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.080" end="01:32:57.360" style="s2">for everyone to move, and the group</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.760" end="01:32:59.040" style="s2">jumped aside just in time as the</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.360" end="01:33:00.960" style="s2">enormous trunk crashed down where they</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.040" end="01:33:02.800" style="s2">had been standing seconds earlier. When</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.960" end="01:33:05.280" style="s2">they turned around, Leica froze in</p>
<p begin="01:33:02.800" end="01:33:07.520" style="s2">disbelief. Seline gasped and asked what</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.280" end="01:33:09.440" style="s2">kind of creature it was, while Rangus&#39;</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.520" end="01:33:12.000" style="s2">face went pale and sweat dripped down</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.440" end="01:33:14.000" style="s2">his temples. In a trembling voice, he</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.000" end="01:33:15.600" style="s2">said they needed to run immediately</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.000" end="01:33:18.320" style="s2">because standing before them was a</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.600" end="01:33:20.639" style="s2">colossal golem. Meanwhile, on the other</p>
<p begin="01:33:18.320" end="01:33:22.320" style="s2">side of Poison Dragon Mountain, as Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.639" end="01:33:24.480" style="s2">sat at top a pile of monsters and</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.320" end="01:33:26.000" style="s2">upperassmen he had defeated, he remarked</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.480" end="01:33:28.400" style="s2">that he was growing bored with the</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.000" end="01:33:30.239" style="s2">current situation of the examination.</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.400" end="01:33:32.719" style="s2">Since no more upper classmen dared to</p>
<p begin="01:33:30.239" end="01:33:34.080" style="s2">face or challenge our protagonist, and</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.719" end="01:33:35.840" style="s2">because he could no longer sense the</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.080" end="01:33:37.520" style="s2">presence of the observers of the exam,</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.840" end="01:33:39.520" style="s2">who seemed to be simply letting him do</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.520" end="01:33:42.000" style="s2">whatever he pleased, Zeke found the</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.520" end="01:33:44.239" style="s2">entire situation rather disappointing</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.000" end="01:33:45.920" style="s2">until suddenly he sensed a presence from</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.239" end="01:33:47.760" style="s2">the opposite side of Poison Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.920" end="01:33:49.760" style="s2">Mountain, causing him to immediately</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.760" end="01:33:52.239" style="s2">question what kind of strange aura it</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.760" end="01:33:54.800" style="s2">was. At first, he thought it belonged to</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.239" end="01:33:56.560" style="s2">a twostar level creature, but eventually</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.800" end="01:33:58.880" style="s2">he realized that the presence came from</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.560" end="01:34:00.560" style="s2">a three-star entity. He instantly</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.880" end="01:34:02.480" style="s2">wondered if three star monsters were</p>
<p begin="01:34:00.560" end="01:34:04.560" style="s2">truly supposed to exist within Poison</p>
<p begin="01:34:02.480" end="01:34:06.400" style="s2">Dragon Mountain. He also questioned</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.560" end="01:34:08.320" style="s2">whether the aura he sensed belonged to</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.400" end="01:34:10.159" style="s2">an unknown being that had lived within</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.320" end="01:34:12.480" style="s2">Poison Dragon Mountain for a thousand</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.159" end="01:34:14.320" style="s2">years. Zeke then thought that all the</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.480" end="01:34:16.400" style="s2">examinees would surely struggle against</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.320" end="01:34:18.239" style="s2">a three star level creature and even</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.400" end="01:34:20.639" style="s2">Leica herself would definitely not be</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.239" end="01:34:22.080" style="s2">able to handle it. He also said that the</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.639" end="01:34:24.159" style="s2">instructors should have made sure that</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.080" end="01:34:26.080" style="s2">no three star level creatures existed</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.159" end="01:34:28.719" style="s2">within Poison Dragon Mountain before the</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.080" end="01:34:30.639" style="s2">examination began. But after pausing in</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.719" end="01:34:32.480" style="s2">brief contemplation, he questioned</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.639" end="01:34:34.239" style="s2">whether Freya and the other instructors</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.480" end="01:34:36.159" style="s2">had intentionally allowed a three-star</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.239" end="01:34:38.560" style="s2">creature to remain on Poison Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.159" end="01:34:40.480" style="s2">Mountain as part of the exam. He then</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.560" end="01:34:42.639" style="s2">admitted that he had no idea what the</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.480" end="01:34:44.560" style="s2">instructors were thinking. Still, he</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.639" end="01:34:46.159" style="s2">found it perfect because it meant he</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.560" end="01:34:48.480" style="s2">would once again have an opponent to</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.159" end="01:34:50.320" style="s2">entertain himself with. Zeke also</p>
<p begin="01:34:48.480" end="01:34:52.480" style="s2">realized that the presence he sensed was</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.320" end="01:34:54.159" style="s2">far from where he currently was. And he</p>
<p begin="01:34:52.480" end="01:34:56.560" style="s2">wondered aloud why the creature did not</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.159" end="01:34:58.000" style="s2">simply appear near his location. But he</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.560" end="01:35:00.159" style="s2">stated that he couldn&#39;t just sit and</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.000" end="01:35:02.719" style="s2">wait. And because he wished to face a</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.159" end="01:35:04.480" style="s2">three starle monster, Zeke declared that</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.719" end="01:35:06.880" style="s2">he would go to it and that the creature</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.480" end="01:35:08.080" style="s2">should wait for him. Meanwhile, Selene</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.880" end="01:35:10.159" style="s2">had launched an attack toward the</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.080" end="01:35:12.400" style="s2">Gollum, but even with the full force of</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.159" end="01:35:13.760" style="s2">her strike, it had no effect. She</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.400" end="01:35:15.679" style="s2">couldn&#39;t believe that she failed to</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.760" end="01:35:18.159" style="s2">inflict even a scratch on the Gollum&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.679" end="01:35:19.679" style="s2">body. Raymon also charged in and struck</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.159" end="01:35:21.520" style="s2">the Gollum with his shield, using all</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.679" end="01:35:23.600" style="s2">his strength, yet his attack was just as</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.520" end="01:35:25.520" style="s2">ineffective as Seline&#39;s. This prompted</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.600" end="01:35:28.080" style="s2">Leica to use her aura and lightning to</p>
<p begin="01:35:25.520" end="01:35:30.320" style="s2">attack. After noticing that the Gollum&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.080" end="01:35:32.320" style="s2">arm had sustained a scratch, Leica</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.320" end="01:35:34.239" style="s2">concluded that with Aura, she was able</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.320" end="01:35:36.960" style="s2">to cause damage to the Gollum&#39;s outer</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.239" end="01:35:39.040" style="s2">shell. In other words, only two star</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.960" end="01:35:40.639" style="s2">levels like her could inflict any harm,</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.040" end="01:35:42.719" style="s2">and her one-star companions were</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.639" end="01:35:44.480" style="s2">incapable of doing so. Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.719" end="01:35:46.800" style="s2">immediately called out to Lady Lea to</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.480" end="01:35:49.120" style="s2">ask what they should do next. Lea</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.800" end="01:35:50.480" style="s2">instructed them to listen to her orders.</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.120" end="01:35:52.320" style="s2">She said that after she gained the</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.480" end="01:35:54.560" style="s2">golem&#39;s attention, they would need to</p>
<p begin="01:35:52.320" end="01:35:56.960" style="s2">seize the opportunity to escape.</p>
<p begin="01:35:54.560" end="01:35:59.280" style="s2">However, Rangis insisted that they could</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.960" end="01:36:01.920" style="s2">not do that, nor could they abandon Lady</p>
<p begin="01:35:59.280" end="01:36:03.520" style="s2">Lea to face the Golem alone. Lea told</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.920" end="01:36:05.360" style="s2">them that they would only become burdens</p>
<p begin="01:36:03.520" end="01:36:07.199" style="s2">to her in the fight, and she ordered</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.360" end="01:36:09.520" style="s2">them to observe the Golem&#39;s arm that she</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.199" end="01:36:11.679" style="s2">had previously attacked. She added that</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.520" end="01:36:14.400" style="s2">even with her aura, all she managed was</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.679" end="01:36:16.400" style="s2">a scratch and that as one star levels,</p>
