<p begin="01:36:20.400" end="01:36:24.400" style="s2">creature, they could still support Lea</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.400" end="01:36:26.480" style="s2">in battle, ensuring that every attack</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.400" end="01:36:28.800" style="s2">she launched would land successfully.</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.480" end="01:36:30.320" style="s2">When Lea asked what they meant, Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.800" end="01:36:32.880" style="s2">stated that he would do everything in</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.320" end="01:36:34.639" style="s2">his power not to become a burden. Selen</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.880" end="01:36:36.239" style="s2">agreed, saying that if they worked</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.639" end="01:36:38.080" style="s2">together to make sure Lady Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.239" end="01:36:40.159" style="s2">attacks hit their mark, then they would</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.080" end="01:36:41.679" style="s2">surely gain a chance to win. Because of</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.159" end="01:36:43.440" style="s2">the determination and trust her</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.679" end="01:36:45.520" style="s2">companions showed her, Leica couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.440" end="01:36:47.199" style="s2">help but smile, saying she understood</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.520" end="01:36:49.119" style="s2">what they wanted. She said she would</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.199" end="01:36:51.520" style="s2">rely on them to provide support so her</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.119" end="01:36:53.520" style="s2">attacks would land. As Lea gathered her</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.520" end="01:36:55.920" style="s2">aura and lightning into her sword,</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.520" end="01:36:57.520" style="s2">Raymon prepared to defend while Rangus</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.920" end="01:37:00.000" style="s2">and Seline readied themselves for their</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.520" end="01:37:01.679" style="s2">offensive support. After Leica finished</p>
<p begin="01:37:00.000" end="01:37:03.679" style="s2">concentrating all her power into her</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.679" end="01:37:05.679" style="s2">sword, she instructed them to begin</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.679" end="01:37:07.440" style="s2">their renewed assault on the golem.</p>
<p begin="01:37:05.679" end="01:37:08.960" style="s2">Leica quickly advanced to the front to</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.440" end="01:37:10.560" style="s2">face the golem, but the creature</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.960" end="01:37:12.800" style="s2">immediately launched an attack toward</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.560" end="01:37:14.719" style="s2">her. Raymond used his shield to protect</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.800" end="01:37:16.400" style="s2">her, but because he was still only a</p>
