<p begin="01:37:16.400" end="01:37:20.639" style="s2">withstand the golem&#39;s three-star power.</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.880" end="01:37:22.239" style="s2">Rangus and Seline dashed forward to</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.639" end="01:37:24.639" style="s2">attack the golem and draw its attention</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.239" end="01:37:26.880" style="s2">away. Meanwhile, Leica swiftly moved</p>
