<p begin="01:37:26.880" end="01:37:30.960" style="s2">She unleashed her lightning great sword</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.800" end="01:37:32.719" style="s2">technique, Heaven&#39;s Thunder, striking</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.960" end="01:37:35.360" style="s2">the golem from behind with her full</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.719" end="01:37:37.119" style="s2">strength. A powerful explosion erupted</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.360" end="01:37:39.199" style="s2">within the forest of poison dragon</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.119" end="01:37:40.960" style="s2">mountain. After Leica managed to knock</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.199" end="01:37:42.800" style="s2">down the golem, and once the smoke had</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.960" end="01:37:44.960" style="s2">cleared, the damage she had caused to</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.800" end="01:37:46.560" style="s2">the forest was evident. Ranges</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.960" end="01:37:48.480" style="s2">immediately approached her to ask if she</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.560" end="01:37:50.159" style="s2">was all right, and Leica said she was</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.480" end="01:37:52.320" style="s2">fine, though she had used up all the</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.159" end="01:37:54.400" style="s2">source power in her entire body. She</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.320" end="01:37:56.400" style="s2">then asked how Raymond was doing. With</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.400" end="01:37:58.239" style="s2">Seline supporting him, Raymond replied</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.400" end="01:38:00.000" style="s2">that he was doing all right as well. But</p>
<p begin="01:37:58.239" end="01:38:01.760" style="s2">when Lea said that they should return to</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.000" end="01:38:04.159" style="s2">their base, she suddenly sensed the</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.760" end="01:38:06.480" style="s2">golem&#39;s presence again behind them. She</p>
<p begin="01:38:04.159" end="01:38:08.719" style="s2">quickly shoved Rangus away, resulting in</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.480" end="01:38:10.560" style="s2">Lea being the one seized by the golem.</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.719" end="01:38:12.080" style="s2">As the golem held her, she couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.560" end="01:38:14.320" style="s2">believe that it was still capable of</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.080" end="01:38:16.800" style="s2">moving. She realized she had grown too</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.320" end="01:38:18.320" style="s2">complacent after her attack. Seline also</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.800" end="01:38:20.400" style="s2">couldn&#39;t believe that after being hit by</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.320" end="01:38:23.040" style="s2">Leica&#39;s full power strike, the Gollum</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.400" end="01:38:24.960" style="s2">was still alive and able to move. Rangis</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.040" end="01:38:26.800" style="s2">immediately tried to save Lady Lea by</p>
<p begin="01:38:24.960" end="01:38:29.119" style="s2">attacking the golem with his spear. But</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.800" end="01:38:31.679" style="s2">the golem swung Lea rapidly, preventing</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.119" end="01:38:34.000" style="s2">him from landing a blow. As Rangis grew</p>
<p begin="01:38:31.679" end="01:38:35.520" style="s2">increasingly concerned for Lea, a tree</p>
<p begin="01:38:34.000" end="01:38:37.520" style="s2">suddenly came hurtling toward their</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.520" end="01:38:40.320" style="s2">direction. When the tree struck the</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.520" end="01:38:42.159" style="s2">golem, it released Lea from its grip.</p>
<p begin="01:38:40.320" end="01:38:44.480" style="s2">Ranjis quickly helped her stand and move</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.159" end="01:38:46.560" style="s2">away from the creature. Lea, still</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.480" end="01:38:48.159" style="s2">confused, wondered aloud what had</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.560" end="01:38:50.480" style="s2">happened and how she managed to escape</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.159" end="01:38:52.080" style="s2">the golem&#39;s hold. Then Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.480" end="01:38:54.400" style="s2">asked what kind of situation they were</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.080" end="01:38:56.239" style="s2">dealing with. Rangus and Lea immediately</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.400" end="01:38:58.480" style="s2">recognized our protagonist upon hearing</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.239" end="01:39:00.639" style="s2">his voice. But instead of checking on</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.480" end="01:39:02.560" style="s2">Leica&#39;s condition, Zeke was far too</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.639" end="01:39:04.880" style="s2">delighted by the sight of the monster.</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.560" end="01:39:06.560" style="s2">With his eyes glowing in excitement, he</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.880" end="01:39:08.480" style="s2">immediately asked what kind of clay</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.560" end="01:39:10.080" style="s2">puppet he was looking at. Just moments</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.480" end="01:39:11.440" style="s2">before Zeke arrived at the location</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.080" end="01:39:13.360" style="s2">where he sensed the presence of the</p>
<p begin="01:39:11.440" end="01:39:15.440" style="s2">golem, he caught sight of a golden</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.360" end="01:39:17.679" style="s2">lightning aura. He immediately realized</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.440" end="01:39:19.199" style="s2">that this aura belonged to Lea and he</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.679" end="01:39:20.960" style="s2">couldn&#39;t believe that Lea&#39;s group would</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.199" end="01:39:23.199" style="s2">be the first to encounter and clash with</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.960" end="01:39:25.119" style="s2">the monster. As Zeke continued sprinting</p>
<p begin="01:39:23.199" end="01:39:27.119" style="s2">at full speed, he said that in his</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.119" end="01:39:28.960" style="s2">previous life, he could have reached the</p>
<p begin="01:39:27.119" end="01:39:31.199" style="s2">location of the aura he sensed in an</p>
<p begin="01:39:28.960" end="01:39:33.440" style="s2">instant. But now, he could do nothing</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.199" end="01:39:35.360" style="s2">but run toward the monster&#39;s location,</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.440" end="01:39:37.199" style="s2">something he found utterly pathetic in</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.360" end="01:39:38.719" style="s2">his current state. He also thought about</p>
<p begin="01:39:37.199" end="01:39:41.360" style="s2">how Leica&#39;s group was filled with</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.719" end="01:39:43.679" style="s2">promising youngsters. Even so, their</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.360" end="01:39:45.760" style="s2">opponent was a three-star level monster,</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.679" end="01:39:48.000" style="s2">so he had no idea how long they would be</p>
