<p begin="01:39:48.000" end="01:39:51.840" style="s2">something came to mind, causing him to</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.159" end="01:39:53.679" style="s2">stop abruptly as he remembered a</p>
<p begin="01:39:51.840" end="01:39:55.280" style="s2">technique he had recently learned. He</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.679" end="01:39:57.119" style="s2">immediately grabbed the trunk of a huge</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.280" end="01:39:58.960" style="s2">tree. And after pulling it out from the</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.119" end="01:40:00.960" style="s2">ground, he used his physical strength</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.960" end="01:40:02.800" style="s2">along with the new technique to hurl the</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.960" end="01:40:04.719" style="s2">massive tree toward the monster. While</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.800" end="01:40:06.560" style="s2">watching the tree fly through the air,</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.719" end="01:40:08.800" style="s2">Zeke commented that the result of the</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.560" end="01:40:10.480" style="s2">new technique wasn&#39;t bad at all. He also</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.800" end="01:40:12.159" style="s2">said he didn&#39;t make a wrong decision</p>
