<p begin="01:40:14.159" end="01:40:17.840" style="s2">technique. The technique known as</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.840" end="01:40:20.159" style="s2">nurturing dragon throwing arts.</p>
<p begin="01:40:17.840" end="01:40:22.080" style="s2">According to Zeke, the basic Eldreon</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.159" end="01:40:24.320" style="s2">combat manuals were given to them as</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.080" end="01:40:26.800" style="s2">preparation for the exam. The nurturing</p>
