<p begin="01:40:38.719" end="01:40:42.560" style="s2">fighter possessing a body similar to</p>
<p begin="01:40:40.320" end="01:40:44.080" style="s2">melee fighters. However, he quickly</p>
<p begin="01:40:42.560" end="01:40:46.000" style="s2">realized that throwing a tree at the</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.080" end="01:40:48.159" style="s2">monster wouldn&#39;t be enough. So, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:40:46.000" end="01:40:50.320" style="s2">resumed running toward Leica&#39;s location.</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.159" end="01:40:52.239" style="s2">Rangus, still unable to believe Zeke had</p>
