<p begin="01:41:18.159" end="01:41:22.400" style="s2">was extremely dangerous. But even though</p>
<p begin="01:41:20.080" end="01:41:24.400" style="s2">the golem unleashed a powerful attack,</p>
<p begin="01:41:22.400" end="01:41:26.239" style="s2">Zeke casually caught its fist with one</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.400" end="01:41:28.239" style="s2">hand, remarking that the creature was</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.239" end="01:41:30.400" style="s2">indeed tough. Because of the golem&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.239" end="01:41:32.320" style="s2">hardness, Zeke quickly realized that he</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.400" end="01:41:34.320" style="s2">needed to use aura in order to gradually</p>
<p begin="01:41:32.320" end="01:41:36.239" style="s2">break through its defenses. With a swing</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.320" end="01:41:38.320" style="s2">of his arm as he pushed away the golem&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.239" end="01:41:40.400" style="s2">fist, he commented that fighting and</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.320" end="01:41:43.440" style="s2">defeating the golem using normal methods</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.400" end="01:41:45.760" style="s2">would be too boring. Leica, exasperated,</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.440" end="01:41:47.520" style="s2">said that Zeke was always too reckless.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.760" end="01:41:49.119" style="s2">While Rangus couldn&#39;t believe that Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.520" end="01:41:50.719" style="s2">actually found the Gollum boring to</p>
