<p begin="01:41:56.159" end="01:42:00.560" style="s2">that because of its large size, the</p>
<p begin="01:41:58.159" end="01:42:02.639" style="s2">creature was definitely dangerous. Even</p>
<p begin="01:42:00.560" end="01:42:04.639" style="s2">so, he didn&#39;t hesitate to raise his arms</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.639" end="01:42:06.560" style="s2">and block the attack headon, resulting</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.639" end="01:42:08.800" style="s2">in a powerful impact that shook the</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.560" end="01:42:10.960" style="s2">area. While defending himself, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:42:08.800" end="01:42:12.960" style="s2">stated that the place was too dangerous,</p>
