<p begin="01:42:36.000" end="01:42:39.679" style="s2">into the air, he declared that it was</p>
<p begin="01:42:37.840" end="01:42:41.920" style="s2">time to find out whether its interior</p>
<p begin="01:42:39.679" end="01:42:43.679" style="s2">was just as hard. He then activated the</p>
<p begin="01:42:41.920" end="01:42:46.080" style="s2">first form of the dragon destruction</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.679" end="01:42:48.080" style="s2">combat arts burst world, striking the</p>
<p begin="01:42:46.080" end="01:42:50.639" style="s2">monster and causing a massive explosion</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.080" end="01:42:52.239" style="s2">upon impact. In Zeke&#39;s mind, instead of</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.639" end="01:42:54.080" style="s2">dragging out the battle by slowly</p>
<p begin="01:42:52.239" end="01:42:55.760" style="s2">breaking through the golem&#39;s defenses,</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.080" end="01:42:57.679" style="s2">it was better to use burst world to</p>
