<p begin="01:43:04.000" end="01:43:07.920" style="s2">fighting this way made the battle far</p>
<p begin="01:43:05.679" end="01:43:10.239" style="s2">more enjoyable. Meanwhile, one month</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.920" end="01:43:12.320" style="s2">later, at the Eldreon State main</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.239" end="01:43:14.159" style="s2">building, Zeke was irritated as he</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.320" end="01:43:16.000" style="s2">questioned why he had been summoned and</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.159" end="01:43:17.760" style="s2">had his training interrupted. It was</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.000" end="01:43:20.080" style="s2">then explained that the one-month exam</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.760" end="01:43:22.159" style="s2">at Poison Dragon Mountain had concluded</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.080" end="01:43:24.480" style="s2">safely. After the three star golem</p>
