<p begin="01:43:24.480" end="01:43:28.320" style="s2">occurred. The number of seven-year-old</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.239" end="01:43:29.760" style="s2">class members had dropped to 30% from</p>
<p begin="01:43:28.320" end="01:43:31.679" style="s2">the beginning due to the harsh</p>
<p begin="01:43:29.760" end="01:43:33.199" style="s2">environment of Poison Dragon Mountain.</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.679" end="01:43:35.199" style="s2">But because they were exposed to</p>
<p begin="01:43:33.199" end="01:43:37.360" style="s2">constant danger and the brink of death,</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.199" end="01:43:39.679" style="s2">the remaining 30% of the 7-year-old</p>
<p begin="01:43:37.360" end="01:43:41.679" style="s2">class achieved good results and reached</p>
<p begin="01:43:39.679" end="01:43:43.760" style="s2">one star level. And after the exam</p>
