<p begin="01:43:57.040" end="01:44:01.440" style="s2">requested that he address the family</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.719" end="01:44:03.440" style="s2">head as master head. Although Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:44:01.440" end="01:44:05.280" style="s2">argued that it was practically the same.</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.440" end="01:44:07.199" style="s2">In Freya&#39;s mind, the reason for the</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.280" end="01:44:08.880" style="s2">summons was already obvious, but she</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.199" end="01:44:10.480" style="s2">still explained that Zeke was called</p>
