<p begin="01:44:39.280" end="01:44:43.199" style="s2">argued that attacking upper classmen</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.040" end="01:44:45.199" style="s2">wasn&#39;t forbidden. But Freya replied that</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.199" end="01:44:46.800" style="s2">no one would ever expect a lowerassman</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.199" end="01:44:49.360" style="s2">to muster the courage to attack an</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.800" end="01:44:51.280" style="s2">upperassman. Freya could only sigh and</p>
<p begin="01:44:49.360" end="01:44:52.800" style="s2">as she turned away, she told him that</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.280" end="01:44:54.480" style="s2">his awful attitude needed to be</p>
