<p begin="01:45:05.119" end="01:45:08.960" style="s2">that even though he was still young, his</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.960" end="01:45:10.719" style="s2">terrible attitude could get him killed.</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.960" end="01:45:12.560" style="s2">She said she did not want to witness him</p>
<p begin="01:45:10.719" end="01:45:14.560" style="s2">being executed by his own father just</p>
<p begin="01:45:12.560" end="01:45:16.400" style="s2">because of his behavior. Zeke, on the</p>
