<p begin="01:45:21.920" end="01:45:25.679" style="s2">after addressing Balsa as master head,</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.080" end="01:45:28.080" style="s2">introduced herself as a member of the</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.679" end="01:45:29.600" style="s2">Black Dragon Corps, Freya Wink, and</p>
<p begin="01:45:28.080" end="01:45:31.679" style="s2">stated that they had come in response to</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.600" end="01:45:33.520" style="s2">the master head summons. Balsa then</p>
