<p begin="01:45:33.520" end="01:45:37.440" style="s2">that they may enter. After Freya opened</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.679" end="01:45:38.960" style="s2">the door and they stepped into the room.</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.440" end="01:45:40.400" style="s2">She immediately stated that she had</p>
<p begin="01:45:38.960" end="01:45:42.320" style="s2">brought Zeke according to the master</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.400" end="01:45:44.080" style="s2">head&#39;s orders. While Balsza was still</p>
