<p begin="01:45:44.080" end="01:45:47.280" style="s2">and seriously asked him why he had</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.679" end="01:45:49.520" style="s2">attacked the upperassman during the</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.280" end="01:45:51.199" style="s2">examination. Zeke fell silent for a</p>
<p begin="01:45:49.520" end="01:45:53.199" style="s2">moment, then said that everyone kept</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.199" end="01:45:55.040" style="s2">asking him the same repeated questions.</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.199" end="01:45:56.480" style="s2">So instead of answering, he decided to</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.040" end="01:45:58.320" style="s2">ask his father whether he was not</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.480" end="01:46:00.320" style="s2">allowed to attack the upperassman during</p>
<p begin="01:45:58.320" end="01:46:02.159" style="s2">the exam. When Balsza asked what he</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.320" end="01:46:03.760" style="s2">meant by that, Zeke explained that the</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.159" end="01:46:05.520" style="s2">condition for passing the test was to</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.760" end="01:46:07.440" style="s2">survive in Poison Dragon Mountain for</p>
<p begin="01:46:05.520" end="01:46:09.280" style="s2">one month and keep their crystal orbs</p>
<p begin="01:46:07.440" end="01:46:11.440" style="s2">safe. And aside from that, he had not</p>
<p begin="01:46:09.280" end="01:46:12.960" style="s2">heard of any other rules. Therefore, he</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.440" end="01:46:14.639" style="s2">simply followed the rules of the exam</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.960" end="01:46:16.560" style="s2">and used his time in whatever way he</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.639" end="01:46:18.159" style="s2">wanted while the test was ongoing. He</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.560" end="01:46:19.840" style="s2">added that if there were any prohibited</p>
<p begin="01:46:18.159" end="01:46:21.600" style="s2">actions during the exam, they should</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.840" end="01:46:24.080" style="s2">have stated them clearly before the test</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.600" end="01:46:26.560" style="s2">even began. Upon hearing Zeke&#39;s words,</p>
<p begin="01:46:24.080" end="01:46:28.400" style="s2">Freya felt intense fear and anxiety, and</p>
<p begin="01:46:26.560" end="01:46:29.920" style="s2">she immediately shouted, demanding to</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.400" end="01:46:31.119" style="s2">know what he was saying and why he was</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.920" end="01:46:33.520" style="s2">speaking like that in front of the</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.119" end="01:46:35.199" style="s2">Master Head. At that moment, Balls&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.520" end="01:46:37.199" style="s2">eyes suddenly narrowed as he released</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.199" end="01:46:39.040" style="s2">his terrifying dragon aura. And because</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.199" end="01:46:40.800" style="s2">of the pressure from it, Freya collapsed</p>
<p begin="01:46:39.040" end="01:46:42.560" style="s2">to her knees, thinking that the master</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.800" end="01:46:44.880" style="s2">head&#39;s aura was so strong that it could</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.560" end="01:46:46.560" style="s2">kill Zeke. Contrary to her expectations,</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.880" end="01:46:48.480" style="s2">however, the protagonist remained</p>
<p begin="01:46:46.560" end="01:46:50.480" style="s2">standing, and Balsa&#39;s pressure had no</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.480" end="01:46:52.400" style="s2">effect on him. On top of that, Zeke even</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.480" end="01:46:54.159" style="s2">told Balsa to stop trying to intimidate</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.400" end="01:46:56.239" style="s2">him because it was becoming extremely</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.159" end="01:46:58.320" style="s2">annoying, causing Balsa&#39;s expression to</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.239" end="01:47:00.239" style="s2">darken in both shock and irritation.</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.320" end="01:47:02.000" style="s2">While Freya was still kneeling, Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.239" end="01:47:04.080" style="s2">asked if Balsa had really summoned him</p>
<p begin="01:47:02.000" end="01:47:06.000" style="s2">just to ask such meaningless questions.</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.080" end="01:47:07.920" style="s2">Balsa then asked how Zeke had done it,</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.000" end="01:47:10.080" style="s2">but Zeke did not understand the question</p>
<p begin="01:47:07.920" end="01:47:11.600" style="s2">and inquired what he was talking about.</p>
<p begin="01:47:10.080" end="01:47:13.760" style="s2">Balsa stated that according to the</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.600" end="01:47:15.760" style="s2">reports, Zeke had not only defeated the</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.760" end="01:47:17.920" style="s2">upperassman, but had even brought down a</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.760" end="01:47:19.679" style="s2">three-star golem. and he also asked how</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.920" end="01:47:21.440" style="s2">Zeke was able to remain standing and</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.679" end="01:47:23.600" style="s2">calm in front of him after he released</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.440" end="01:47:25.520" style="s2">such intense pressure. He then seriously</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.600" end="01:47:27.760" style="s2">demanded to know how someone like Zeke,</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.520" end="01:47:29.520" style="s2">a mere child born out of wedlock, had</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.760" end="01:47:32.000" style="s2">obtained such incomprehensible strength</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.520" end="01:47:33.440" style="s2">and power. Zeke simply asked if Balsa</p>
<p begin="01:47:32.000" end="01:47:35.360" style="s2">really wanted to know the reason for his</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.440" end="01:47:37.280" style="s2">strength and said it was very simple,</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.360" end="01:47:39.199" style="s2">the only reason being that he was Zeke,</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.280" end="01:47:40.960" style="s2">which caused Balsa to furrow his brows</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.199" end="01:47:42.719" style="s2">in frustration while Zeke&#39;s gaze</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.960" end="01:47:44.719" style="s2">sharpened as he stood by his arrogant</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.719" end="01:47:46.639" style="s2">answer. After a moment of silence</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.719" end="01:47:48.480" style="s2">staring between them, Balsza finally</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.639" end="01:47:50.560" style="s2">said that Zeke&#39;s personality really was</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.480" end="01:47:52.080" style="s2">as terrible as the reports claimed. Yet,</p>
<p begin="01:47:50.560" end="01:47:54.239" style="s2">he would still reward him for defeating</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.080" end="01:47:56.320" style="s2">the golem. Balsa told him that he could</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.239" end="01:47:58.320" style="s2">choose what he wanted. Either take any</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.320" end="01:48:00.080" style="s2">single item from the dragon treasury or</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.320" end="01:48:02.159" style="s2">gain access to the second floor of the</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.080" end="01:48:03.840" style="s2">dragon hall, which made Freya silently</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.159" end="01:48:05.760" style="s2">question what was happening and why</p>
<p begin="01:48:03.840" end="01:48:07.679" style="s2">Balsa was actually rewarding him.</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.760" end="01:48:09.119" style="s2">According to Freya, both the Dragon Hall</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.679" end="01:48:11.040" style="s2">and the Dragon Treasury were</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.119" end="01:48:12.960" style="s2">repositories of rare items collected by</p>
<p begin="01:48:11.040" end="01:48:14.639" style="s2">the Lragon family for more than a</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.960" end="01:48:17.280" style="s2">thousand years, beginning with the</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.639" end="01:48:18.960" style="s2">patriarch Gilfas Lragon. She explained</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.280" end="01:48:20.800" style="s2">that the Dragon Hall contained various</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.960" end="01:48:22.480" style="s2">kinds of books, including those now</p>
<p begin="01:48:20.800" end="01:48:24.480" style="s2">considered forbidden techniques, while</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.480" end="01:48:26.320" style="s2">the Dragon Treasury held relics from</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.480" end="01:48:28.639" style="s2">previous family heads of the Lragon</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.320" end="01:48:30.800" style="s2">family, including legendary weapons,</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.639" end="01:48:32.639" style="s2">spirit medicines, artifacts, and other</p>
<p begin="01:48:30.800" end="01:48:34.239" style="s2">items from different eras. These</p>
<p begin="01:48:32.639" end="01:48:36.239" style="s2">facilities also contained the secret</p>
<p begin="01:48:34.239" end="01:48:37.920" style="s2">treasures of the Elragon family, which</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.239" end="01:48:39.360" style="s2">was why they were heavily guarded and</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.920" end="01:48:41.199" style="s2">only a few people were given the</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.360" end="01:48:42.880" style="s2">opportunity to enter, as one had to</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.199" end="01:48:44.719" style="s2">demonstrate extremely excellent results</p>
<p begin="01:48:42.880" end="01:48:46.639" style="s2">to even gain access to the second floor</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.719" end="01:48:48.400" style="s2">or higher levels of the dragon hall.</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.639" end="01:48:50.159" style="s2">Freya could not believe that despite all</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.400" end="01:48:52.159" style="s2">the disrespect Zeke had shown to his</p>
<p begin="01:48:50.159" end="01:48:54.320" style="s2">father, Master Balsa still considered</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.159" end="01:48:55.920" style="s2">him an outstanding child. Zeke then said</p>
<p begin="01:48:54.320" end="01:48:57.760" style="s2">that if Balsa was going to give him a</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.920" end="01:48:59.760" style="s2">reward, there was no need to be stingy</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.760" end="01:49:01.199" style="s2">and make him choose and asked why he</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.760" end="01:49:03.280" style="s2">could not just be given access to both</p>
<p begin="01:49:01.199" end="01:49:04.800" style="s2">the Dragon Hall and the Dragon Treasury.</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.280" end="01:49:06.639" style="s2">Balsa, however, stated that he could</p>
<p begin="01:49:04.800" end="01:49:08.400" style="s2">only choose one and then told them they</p>
<p begin="01:49:06.639" end="01:49:10.080" style="s2">could leave. But Zeke suddenly pointed</p>
<p begin="01:49:08.400" end="01:49:12.000" style="s2">at him, unable to believe that their</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.080" end="01:49:13.600" style="s2">conversation was already over, saying</p>
<p begin="01:49:12.000" end="01:49:15.760" style="s2">that he still had many things he wanted</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.600" end="01:49:17.360" style="s2">to say. This angered Freya and she</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.760" end="01:49:19.040" style="s2">immediately grabbed Zeke by the collar</p>
<p begin="01:49:17.360" end="01:49:20.480" style="s2">and while pulling him away, cheerfully</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.040" end="01:49:22.080" style="s2">said that it was a great honor for him</p>
<p begin="01:49:20.480" end="01:49:23.760" style="s2">to receive a reward directly from the</p>
<p begin="01:49:22.080" end="01:49:25.119" style="s2">master head, adding that she now</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.760" end="01:49:26.800" style="s2">understood his orders and that they</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.119" end="01:49:28.880" style="s2">would be leaving. As she turned her back</p>
<p begin="01:49:26.800" end="01:49:30.560" style="s2">and dragged Zeke along, he said that if</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.880" end="01:49:32.560" style="s2">that was the case, there was just one</p>
<p begin="01:49:30.560" end="01:49:34.239" style="s2">last thing he wanted to say to Balsa.</p>
<p begin="01:49:32.560" end="01:49:35.760" style="s2">And he stated that as long as Balsa</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.239" end="01:49:37.600" style="s2">continued to kill off his own emotions</p>
<p begin="01:49:35.760" end="01:49:39.280" style="s2">the way he was doing, he would never</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.600" end="01:49:41.280" style="s2">become any stronger no matter what he</p>
<p begin="01:49:39.280" end="01:49:43.520" style="s2">did. Balsa was shocked as he released</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.280" end="01:49:45.199" style="s2">his aura once more only to find that his</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.520" end="01:49:47.360" style="s2">dragon aura had been suppressed by the</p>
<p begin="01:49:45.199" end="01:49:49.360" style="s2">protagonist&#39;s divine dragon. Freya</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.360" end="01:49:51.360" style="s2">trembling told Zeke to be quiet and</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.360" end="01:49:53.280" style="s2">after they left Balsa&#39;s room, the father</p>
<p begin="01:49:51.360" end="01:49:54.719" style="s2">of the protagonist remained silent,</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.280" end="01:49:56.480" style="s2">questioning to himself what kind of</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.719" end="01:49:58.639" style="s2">presence he had felt from Zeke.</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.480" end="01:50:00.560" style="s2">Meanwhile, as they exited the main hall,</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.639" end="01:50:02.159" style="s2">Freya shouted, asking what had been</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.560" end="01:50:04.080" style="s2">going through Zeke&#39;s mind and why he had</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.159" end="01:50:05.440" style="s2">been so rude to the master head and</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.080" end="01:50:06.960" style="s2">asked if he had not listened to her</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.440" end="01:50:09.040" style="s2">warnings before they entered Balls&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:50:06.960" end="01:50:10.800" style="s2">room. Zeke merely asked what she was</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.040" end="01:50:12.480" style="s2">talking about, saying that he had done</p>
<p begin="01:50:10.800" end="01:50:14.000" style="s2">everything he could to hold himself back</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.480" end="01:50:16.159" style="s2">so that he could behave properly in</p>
<p begin="01:50:14.000" end="01:50:17.760" style="s2">front of Balsa, which made Freya ask if</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.159" end="01:50:19.760" style="s2">that really counted as him restraining</p>
<p begin="01:50:17.760" end="01:50:21.840" style="s2">himself, and why he could speak politely</p>
<p begin="01:50:19.760" end="01:50:24.159" style="s2">to the instructors and even to her, yet</p>
<p begin="01:50:21.840" end="01:50:26.159" style="s2">be so disrespectful to the headmaster.</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.159" end="01:50:28.080" style="s2">Zeke simply replied that Balsza was his</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.159" end="01:50:29.840" style="s2">father, so the way he spoke to him was</p>
<p begin="01:50:28.080" end="01:50:32.000" style="s2">different. Because of Zeke&#39;s abilities</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.840" end="01:50:34.320" style="s2">and personality, Freya could only say</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.000" end="01:50:36.719" style="s2">that he truly was not an ordinary child</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.320" end="01:50:38.400" style="s2">and asked who he really was. Zeke,</p>
<p begin="01:50:36.719" end="01:50:40.719" style="s2">however, asked if she was seriously</p>
<p begin="01:50:38.400" end="01:50:43.040" style="s2">questioning who he was, and as he always</p>
<p begin="01:50:40.719" end="01:50:45.199" style="s2">said, he was Zeke, which left Freya</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.040" end="01:50:47.280" style="s2">speechless. In her mind, all of them had</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.199" end="01:50:49.040" style="s2">drunk ancient dragon blood as infants,</p>
<p begin="01:50:47.280" end="01:50:51.119" style="s2">and they had no ability to defy the</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.040" end="01:50:53.199" style="s2">master head, because Balsa possessed the</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.119" end="01:50:55.440" style="s2">power of the dragon king, a superior</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.199" end="01:50:57.040" style="s2">species among all ancient dragons. And</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.440" end="01:50:59.040" style="s2">even Zeke should not have been able to</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.040" end="01:51:01.199" style="s2">oppose him. That was why she wondered</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.040" end="01:51:02.800" style="s2">what kind of child Zeke truly was,</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.199" end="01:51:04.719" style="s2">someone who could stand calmly in front</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.800" end="01:51:06.480" style="s2">of the master head. When Freya fell</p>
<p begin="01:51:04.719" end="01:51:08.159" style="s2">silent, Zeke asked if there was a</p>
<p begin="01:51:06.480" end="01:51:09.920" style="s2">problem, but she replied that there was</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.159" end="01:51:11.520" style="s2">none while thinking that she needed to</p>
<p begin="01:51:09.920" end="01:51:13.440" style="s2">thoroughly investigate Zeke&#39;s birth</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.520" end="01:51:15.600" style="s2">records. She then asked which reward</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.440" end="01:51:17.119" style="s2">Zeke would choose, once again explaining</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.600" end="01:51:19.360" style="s2">that he could either enter the Dragon</p>
<p begin="01:51:17.119" end="01:51:21.199" style="s2">Hall up to the second floor or enter the</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.360" end="01:51:23.280" style="s2">Dragon Treasury to take any item he</p>
<p begin="01:51:21.199" end="01:51:25.199" style="s2">wanted, but he could only choose one.</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.280" end="01:51:27.520" style="s2">When Zeke asked if he could have both,</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.199" end="01:51:29.280" style="s2">Freya said no, so he had no choice but</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.520" end="01:51:31.040" style="s2">to select the Dragon Hall as it</p>
<p begin="01:51:29.280" end="01:51:32.560" style="s2">contained knowledge. Zeke then thought</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.040" end="01:51:34.480" style="s2">that he lacked understanding of the</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.560" end="01:51:36.000" style="s2">current era. And for now, he wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.480" end="01:51:37.440" style="s2">learn about the new medicines and tools</p>
<p begin="01:51:36.000" end="01:51:39.360" style="s2">that had been created over the past</p>
<p begin="01:51:37.440" end="01:51:41.760" style="s2">thousand years, but he could only choose</p>
<p begin="01:51:39.360" end="01:51:43.119" style="s2">one. At that moment, Rangus arrived,</p>
<p begin="01:51:41.760" end="01:51:44.719" style="s2">unable to believe that they would</p>
<p begin="01:51:43.119" end="01:51:47.119" style="s2">actually be allowed into the Dragon Hall</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.719" end="01:51:48.880" style="s2">of the Lragon family. When Zeke asked if</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.119" end="01:51:50.320" style="s2">he was happy, Rangus immediately</p>
<p begin="01:51:48.880" end="01:51:52.320" style="s2">confirmed it and said that the strike</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.320" end="01:51:54.000" style="s2">dragon combat arts and nurturing dragon</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.320" end="01:51:55.840" style="s2">spear arts he had learned were already</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.000" end="01:51:57.520" style="s2">amazing and now he would have the chance</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.840" end="01:51:59.199" style="s2">to learn even better martial arts from</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.520" end="01:52:00.560" style="s2">the dragon hall, adding that he could</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.199" end="01:52:02.800" style="s2">not believe they would receive such</p>
<p begin="01:52:00.560" end="01:52:05.280" style="s2">great rewards after passing the exam.</p>
<p begin="01:52:02.800" end="01:52:06.719" style="s2">Soon after, Leica also arrived excitedly</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.280" end="01:52:08.400" style="s2">wondering how much knowledge she would</p>
