<p begin="01:58:42.400" end="01:58:46.800" style="s2">sword arts inside and the book he</p>
<p begin="01:58:44.560" end="01:58:49.280" style="s2">borrowed was also Lragon style,</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.800" end="01:58:51.520" style="s2">specifically about guardian shield arts.</p>
<p begin="01:58:49.280" end="01:58:53.040" style="s2">Zeke greeted them awkwardly, thinking to</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.520" end="01:58:54.880" style="s2">himself that all the techniques they</p>
<p begin="01:58:53.040" end="01:58:57.679" style="s2">borrowed were ones he created in his</p>
<p begin="01:58:54.880" end="01:58:59.840" style="s2">past life as mere pastimes. When Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:58:57.679" end="01:59:01.599" style="s2">asked which book Leica chose, she</p>
<p begin="01:58:59.840" end="01:59:03.599" style="s2">happily said she picked the Heavywave</p>
<p begin="01:59:01.599" end="01:59:06.159" style="s2">Great Sword Arts, created by the first</p>
<p begin="01:59:03.599" end="01:59:08.639" style="s2">patriarch of the Lragon family, Gilus</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.159" end="01:59:10.639" style="s2">Lragon. In the present time, it was</p>
<p begin="01:59:08.639" end="01:59:12.639" style="s2">known as the Heavywave Great Sword Arts</p>
<p begin="01:59:10.639" end="01:59:15.119" style="s2">revised and improved version by their</p>
<p begin="01:59:12.639" end="01:59:16.880" style="s2">15th family head. She added that she</p>
<p begin="01:59:15.119" end="01:59:18.800" style="s2">also possessed their family&#39;s hereditary</p>
<p begin="01:59:16.880" end="01:59:21.599" style="s2">martial arts, so she could use the book</p>
<p begin="01:59:18.800" end="01:59:23.199" style="s2">for research. Zeke fell silent, thinking</p>
<p begin="01:59:21.599" end="01:59:25.199" style="s2">about how another one of his techniques</p>
<p begin="01:59:23.199" end="01:59:27.360" style="s2">had been revised by the 15th family</p>
<p begin="01:59:25.199" end="01:59:29.840" style="s2">head, just like his dragon&#39;s breath and</p>
<p begin="01:59:27.360" end="01:59:31.360" style="s2">strike dragon combat arts. He also</p>
<p begin="01:59:29.840" end="01:59:32.800" style="s2">remembered seeing many books in the</p>
<p begin="01:59:31.360" end="01:59:34.719" style="s2">Dragon Hall related to his other</p>
<p begin="01:59:32.800" end="01:59:36.639" style="s2">techniques from the past, but most of</p>
<p begin="01:59:34.719" end="01:59:38.880" style="s2">them now had improved versions placed</p>
<p begin="01:59:36.639" end="01:59:40.719" style="s2">alongside the originals. He wondered if</p>
<p begin="01:59:38.880" end="01:59:42.960" style="s2">the 15th family head was behind all</p>
<p begin="01:59:40.719" end="01:59:45.040" style="s2">those improved versions, finding the man</p>
<p begin="01:59:42.960" end="01:59:47.119" style="s2">more and more intriguing. When Zeke</p>
<p begin="01:59:45.040" end="01:59:48.639" style="s2">glanced back at the dragon hall, he</p>
<p begin="01:59:47.119" end="01:59:50.080" style="s2">thought that he originally assumed</p>
<p begin="01:59:48.639" end="01:59:51.760" style="s2">things would become boring after</p>
<p begin="01:59:50.080" end="01:59:53.360" style="s2">entering it. But now he could no longer</p>
<p begin="01:59:51.760" end="01:59:56.239" style="s2">wait for the next chance to go back</p>
<p begin="01:59:53.360" end="01:59:58.719" style="s2">inside. 5 years later, as Leica walked</p>
<p begin="01:59:56.239" end="02:00:00.800" style="s2">down a hallway, she suddenly stopped and</p>
<p begin="01:59:58.719" end="02:00:03.040" style="s2">wondered where Zeke and Rangus were.</p>
<p begin="02:00:00.800" end="02:00:05.199" style="s2">Just then, their classmates arrived and</p>
<p begin="02:00:03.040" end="02:00:06.880" style="s2">greeted Lady Lea, informing her that</p>
<p begin="02:00:05.199" end="02:00:08.880" style="s2">Lord Zeke and the others were currently</p>
<p begin="02:00:06.880" end="02:00:11.199" style="s2">at the training ground practicing.</p>
<p begin="02:00:08.880" end="02:00:13.520" style="s2">Again, Lea Typhona muttered before</p>
<p begin="02:00:11.199" end="02:00:15.440" style="s2">thanking her classmates. She was now 12</p>
<p begin="02:00:13.520" end="02:00:17.599" style="s2">years old. When she arrived at the</p>
<p begin="02:00:15.440" end="02:00:20.400" style="s2">training ground, she immediately saw</p>
<p begin="02:00:17.599" end="02:00:22.560" style="s2">Rangus, Reald, and Seline preparing to</p>
<p begin="02:00:20.400" end="02:00:25.360" style="s2">attack our protagonist, Zeke, who was</p>
<p begin="02:00:22.560" end="02:00:27.599" style="s2">now also 12 years old. Meanwhile, in</p>
<p begin="02:00:25.360" end="02:00:29.760" style="s2">Balsa&#39;s office, he received a report</p>
<p begin="02:00:27.599" end="02:00:31.119" style="s2">about the appearance of a special rift.</p>
<p begin="02:00:29.760" end="02:00:32.639" style="s2">When he asked the person on the other</p>
<p begin="02:00:31.119" end="02:00:35.199" style="s2">end whether the report was truly</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.639" end="02:00:37.360" style="s2">reliable, it was immediately confirmed.</p>
<p begin="02:00:35.199" end="02:00:39.520" style="s2">The man reporting was Ain, captain of</p>
<p begin="02:00:37.360" end="02:00:41.520" style="s2">the Black Dragon Corps, who stated that</p>
<p begin="02:00:39.520" end="02:00:43.760" style="s2">according to their investigation, there</p>
<p begin="02:00:41.520" end="02:00:46.239" style="s2">was roughly an 80% chance that water</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.760" end="02:00:48.560" style="s2">magic existed inside this newly appeared</p>
<p begin="02:00:46.239" end="02:00:50.239" style="s2">special rift. Balsa responded that the</p>
<p begin="02:00:48.560" end="02:00:52.560" style="s2">location where the rift had appeared was</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.239" end="02:00:54.639" style="s2">an extremely troublesome spot, and he</p>
<p begin="02:00:52.560" end="02:00:57.040" style="s2">questioned why. Out of all the places</p>
<p begin="02:00:54.639" end="02:00:59.520" style="s2">within their territory, the special rift</p>
<p begin="02:00:57.040" end="02:01:01.520" style="s2">had manifested there. Still, they could</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.520" end="02:01:03.280" style="s2">not afford to ignore it as there was a</p>
<p begin="02:01:01.520" end="02:01:05.520" style="s2">high probability that magic water</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.280" end="02:01:07.760" style="s2">existed inside the rift. According to</p>
<p begin="02:01:05.520" end="02:01:10.000" style="s2">Balsza, anyone who drinks magic water</p>
<p begin="02:01:07.760" end="02:01:12.080" style="s2">becomes a mage because those who consume</p>
<p begin="02:01:10.000" end="02:01:14.000" style="s2">it gain a special constitution that</p>
<p begin="02:01:12.080" end="02:01:16.320" style="s2">allows them to convert source power into</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.000" end="02:01:17.920" style="s2">a different force known as mana. He</p>
<p begin="02:01:16.320" end="02:01:20.320" style="s2">further explained that the emergence of</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.920" end="02:01:22.320" style="s2">man- based magic introduced entirely new</p>
<p begin="02:01:20.320" end="02:01:24.080" style="s2">techniques to the world and at the same</p>
<p begin="02:01:22.320" end="02:01:25.920" style="s2">time sparked fierce territorial</p>
<p begin="02:01:24.080" end="02:01:28.639" style="s2">struggles over the sources of magic</p>
<p begin="02:01:25.920" end="02:01:30.639" style="s2">water known as magic springs. In this</p>
<p begin="02:01:28.639" end="02:01:32.639" style="s2">age of magic, the number of mages</p>
<p begin="02:01:30.639" end="02:01:35.040" style="s2">directly determines a house&#39;s military</p>
<p begin="02:01:32.639" end="02:01:37.119" style="s2">strength. However, within Eldreon</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.040" end="02:01:39.360" style="s2">territory, not a single magic spring</p>
<p begin="02:01:37.119" end="02:01:41.280" style="s2">existed. For a house like the Eldragon</p>
<p begin="02:01:39.360" end="02:01:43.119" style="s2">family, which possessed no magic</p>
<p begin="02:01:41.280" end="02:01:45.360" style="s2">springs, there was only one way to</p>
<p begin="02:01:43.119" end="02:01:48.239" style="s2">obtain magic water, conquering special</p>
<p begin="02:01:45.360" end="02:01:50.639" style="s2">rifts. At present, the number of Eldrian</p>
<p begin="02:01:48.239" end="02:01:53.040" style="s2">mages was extremely small, and including</p>
<p begin="02:01:50.639" end="02:01:55.119" style="s2">Balsa himself, all of them were hardened</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.040" end="02:01:58.000" style="s2">veterans who had obtained magic water</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.119" end="02:01:59.920" style="s2">through special rift conquests. Even so,</p>
<p begin="02:01:58.000" end="02:02:01.760" style="s2">in terms of sheer numbers, they were</p>
<p begin="02:01:59.920" end="02:02:04.320" style="s2">being overwhelmed by other houses that</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.760" end="02:02:06.639" style="s2">owned magic springs. For this reason,</p>
<p begin="02:02:04.320" end="02:02:09.280" style="s2">conquering special rifts was Eldreon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:02:06.639" end="02:02:11.199" style="s2">top priority mission. However, as Ain</p>
<p begin="02:02:09.280" end="02:02:13.199" style="s2">had reported, the location where the</p>
<p begin="02:02:11.199" end="02:02:15.440" style="s2">special rift appeared, the abundant</p>
<p begin="02:02:13.199" end="02:02:16.880" style="s2">dragon forest was far too troublesome.</p>
<p begin="02:02:15.440" end="02:02:18.560" style="s2">There had even been a small border</p>
<p begin="02:02:16.880" end="02:02:20.560" style="s2">skirmish in the surrounding region just</p>
<p begin="02:02:18.560" end="02:02:22.400" style="s2">the other day. The abundant dragon</p>
<p begin="02:02:20.560" end="02:02:25.119" style="s2">forest was a vast woodland that lay</p>
<p begin="02:02:22.400" end="02:02:26.639" style="s2">mostly within Lragon territory, but part</p>
<p begin="02:02:25.119" end="02:02:29.040" style="s2">of it stretched into the lands of</p>
<p begin="02:02:26.639" end="02:02:31.040" style="s2">another house. Those who claimed broader</p>
<p begin="02:02:29.040" end="02:02:33.440" style="s2">ownership of the forest and referred to</p>
<p begin="02:02:31.040" end="02:02:35.679" style="s2">it as the great abundant forest were the</p>
<p begin="02:02:33.440" end="02:02:37.920" style="s2">Kerberous family. Ain added that the</p>
<p begin="02:02:35.679" end="02:02:39.920" style="s2">rift itself was certainly within Eldreon</p>
<p begin="02:02:37.920" end="02:02:41.840" style="s2">lands, but considering its scale and</p>
<p begin="02:02:39.920" end="02:02:43.760" style="s2">position, the special domain formed</p>
<p begin="02:02:41.840" end="02:02:46.080" style="s2">around it might extend into Kerberous</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.760" end="02:02:47.760" style="s2">territory. Knowing those mongrels, there</p>
<p begin="02:02:46.080" end="02:02:49.679" style="s2">was a high chance they would swarm</p>
<p begin="02:02:47.760" end="02:02:51.440" style="s2">toward it. Balsa remarked that their</p>
<p begin="02:02:49.679" end="02:02:54.000" style="s2">noses were the only thing they were good</p>
<p begin="02:02:51.440" end="02:02:56.719" style="s2">for, and in any case, they would detect</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.000" end="02:02:58.719" style="s2">the special rift sooner or later. Thus,</p>
<p begin="02:02:56.719" end="02:03:00.960" style="s2">the Eldragon family had to prepare with</p>
<p begin="02:02:58.719" end="02:03:03.040" style="s2">a struggle against them in mind since it</p>
<p begin="02:03:00.960" end="02:03:05.119" style="s2">was a special rift. Both sides would</p>
<p begin="02:03:03.040" end="02:03:06.880" style="s2">have limited options, but they needed to</p>
<p begin="02:03:05.119" end="02:03:09.040" style="s2">act before the Kerberous family caught</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.880" end="02:03:11.119" style="s2">on. With that decided, Balsza</p>
<p begin="02:03:09.040" end="02:03:13.280" style="s2">immediately instructed Ain to inform all</p>
<p begin="02:03:11.119" end="02:03:15.040" style="s2">dragons nests at once and announced that</p>
<p begin="02:03:13.280" end="02:03:17.360" style="s2">a selection exam would be held as soon</p>
<p begin="02:03:15.040" end="02:03:19.840" style="s2">as possible. Meanwhile, at the training</p>
<p begin="02:03:17.360" end="02:03:21.599" style="s2">grounds, Leica commented that Rangus and</p>
<p begin="02:03:19.840" end="02:03:23.520" style="s2">the others really went all out every</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.599" end="02:03:25.599" style="s2">time they trained with Zeke. In the</p>
<p begin="02:03:23.520" end="02:03:27.599" style="s2">middle of it all, Zeke remained calm as</p>
<p begin="02:03:25.599" end="02:03:28.800" style="s2">he waited for their attacks. As the</p>
<p begin="02:03:27.599" end="02:03:30.159" style="s2">three of them attacked, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:03:28.800" end="02:03:32.400" style="s2">simultaneously from different</p>
<p begin="02:03:30.159" end="02:03:34.239" style="s2">directions, Zeke&#39;s expression darkened</p>
<p begin="02:03:32.400" end="02:03:36.239" style="s2">as he strengthened his body and accepted</p>
<p begin="02:03:34.239" end="02:03:38.320" style="s2">all of their blows at once. With the</p>
<p begin="02:03:36.239" end="02:03:40.480" style="s2">sharp tip of Rangus&#39; spear pressed and</p>
<p begin="02:03:38.320" end="02:03:42.159" style="s2">embedded into the hero&#39;s cheek, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:03:40.480" end="02:03:44.159" style="s2">remarked that their coordination was</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.159" end="02:03:46.320" style="s2">good, but that Rangus was putting too</p>
<p begin="02:03:44.159" end="02:03:49.119" style="s2">much force into his spear, which ruined</p>
<p begin="02:03:46.320" end="02:03:51.920" style="s2">the true strength of spear arts. At the</p>
<p begin="02:03:49.119" end="02:03:54.480" style="s2">time, Rangus was 11 years old. As for</p>
<p begin="02:03:51.920" end="02:03:56.320" style="s2">Seline, who was 12, Zeke advised her</p>
<p begin="02:03:54.480" end="02:03:58.480" style="s2">that she focused too much on speed and</p>
<p begin="02:03:56.320" end="02:04:00.480" style="s2">the number of strikes, leaving no weight</p>
<p begin="02:03:58.480" end="02:04:02.880" style="s2">behind her attacks, and that she needed</p>
<p begin="02:04:00.480" end="02:04:05.440" style="s2">to find a proper balance. Raymond, who</p>
<p begin="02:04:02.880" end="02:04:07.119" style="s2">was also 12, was told by Zeke that his</p>
<p begin="02:04:05.440" end="02:04:09.840" style="s2">movements and use of the shield were</p>
<p begin="02:04:07.119" end="02:04:11.520" style="s2">good and correct. Even so, Zeke stated</p>
<p begin="02:04:09.840" end="02:04:13.520" style="s2">that all of them were still far too</p>
<p begin="02:04:11.520" end="02:04:16.080" style="s2">passive, and he told them to get more</p>
<p begin="02:04:13.520" end="02:04:17.920" style="s2">accustomed to attacking. Once again, he</p>
<p begin="02:04:16.080" end="02:04:20.159" style="s2">instructed them to come at him. As</p>
<p begin="02:04:17.920" end="02:04:21.679" style="s2">Rangus charged forward again, Lea</p>
<p begin="02:04:20.159" end="02:04:24.159" style="s2">remarked that watching their training</p>
<p begin="02:04:21.679" end="02:04:26.000" style="s2">was still completely insane. When Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:04:24.159" end="02:04:27.840" style="s2">asked what exactly she found so crazy</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.000" end="02:04:29.679" style="s2">about it, Leica replied that letting</p>
<p begin="02:04:27.840" end="02:04:32.000" style="s2">himself get hit bare-bodied without</p>
<p begin="02:04:29.679" end="02:04:33.760" style="s2">using source power was total madness.</p>
<p begin="02:04:32.000" end="02:04:35.440" style="s2">Zeke simply asked what she was talking</p>
<p begin="02:04:33.760" end="02:04:37.679" style="s2">about and said that this was proper</p>
<p begin="02:04:35.440" end="02:04:39.360" style="s2">training for him. Shouting toward Lea</p>
<p begin="02:04:37.679" end="02:04:41.040" style="s2">while flexing his muscles beneath his</p>
<p begin="02:04:39.360" end="02:04:43.199" style="s2">shirt, he told her that she should</p>
<p begin="02:04:41.040" end="02:04:45.199" style="s2">witness the fruits of his training. Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:04:43.199" end="02:04:47.199" style="s2">added that because of this training, his</p>
<p begin="02:04:45.199" end="02:04:49.440" style="s2">body had become sturdy even without</p>
<p begin="02:04:47.199" end="02:04:50.960" style="s2">source power. Lea complained that Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:04:49.440" end="02:04:52.639" style="s2">should at least have them stop attacking</p>
<p begin="02:04:50.960" end="02:04:54.880" style="s2">while they were talking. But at that</p>
<p begin="02:04:52.639" end="02:04:57.199" style="s2">very moment, Rangis delivered a powerful</p>
<p begin="02:04:54.880" end="02:04:58.719" style="s2">spear strike from behind Zeke. Rangus</p>
<p begin="02:04:57.199" end="02:05:00.719" style="s2">declared that Leica should look closely</p>
<p begin="02:04:58.719" end="02:05:03.599" style="s2">at his attack to see just how insane</p>
<p begin="02:05:00.719" end="02:05:05.520" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s body truly was. This caused Leica</p>
<p begin="02:05:03.599" end="02:05:07.199" style="s2">to shut her eyes and clutch her head,</p>
<p begin="02:05:05.520" end="02:05:09.520" style="s2">muttering that all of them were truly</p>
<p begin="02:05:07.199" end="02:05:11.840" style="s2">abnormal. Not only did Zeke refuse to</p>
<p begin="02:05:09.520" end="02:05:13.440" style="s2">use any bodily defense, but Rangus and</p>
<p begin="02:05:11.840" end="02:05:15.840" style="s2">the others continued attacking him with</p>
<p begin="02:05:13.440" end="02:05:17.599" style="s2">full force. Raymon suddenly asked how</p>
<p begin="02:05:15.840" end="02:05:19.599" style="s2">Zeke could possess such incredible</p>
<p begin="02:05:17.599" end="02:05:21.440" style="s2">defense without using source power,</p>
<p begin="02:05:19.599" end="02:05:23.280" style="s2">while Seline said that it was far too</p>
<p begin="02:05:21.440" end="02:05:25.520" style="s2">mysterious to be explained by the human</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.280" end="02:05:27.840" style="s2">body. Leica told them not to lump Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:05:25.520" end="02:05:29.599" style="s2">in with humans because Zeke was not one</p>
<p begin="02:05:27.840" end="02:05:31.840" style="s2">of them. She then asked if they knew</p>
<p begin="02:05:29.599" end="02:05:33.199" style="s2">what the seniors used to call Zeke and</p>
<p begin="02:05:31.840" end="02:05:35.280" style="s2">revealed that he was known as the</p>
<p begin="02:05:33.199" end="02:05:37.119" style="s2">Eastern Hall&#39;s demon child. This</p>
<p begin="02:05:35.280" end="02:05:38.800" style="s2">prompted Zeke to ask whether that title</p>
<p begin="02:05:37.119" end="02:05:40.639" style="s2">was meant as an insult before</p>
