<p begin="02:12:14.480" end="02:12:18.079" style="s2">decided, all they could do was give</p>
<p begin="02:12:16.320" end="02:12:20.159" style="s2">their best against the upper classmen in</p>
<p begin="02:12:18.079" end="02:12:21.679" style="s2">the preliminaries. Leica then said that</p>
<p begin="02:12:20.159" end="02:12:23.679" style="s2">it seemed she would once again be</p>
<p begin="02:12:21.679" end="02:12:25.040" style="s2">fighting alongside her teammates, and</p>
<p begin="02:12:23.679" end="02:12:27.040" style="s2">she immediately asked the other</p>
<p begin="02:12:25.040" end="02:12:29.599" style="s2">lowerassmen if any of them also wanted</p>
<p begin="02:12:27.040" end="02:12:31.679" style="s2">to join the preliminaries. However, the</p>
<p begin="02:12:29.599" end="02:12:33.440" style="s2">other lowerassmen were too nervous,</p>
<p begin="02:12:31.679" end="02:12:34.880" style="s2">whispering among themselves and saying</p>
<p begin="02:12:33.440" end="02:12:36.960" style="s2">that they had no chance of winning</p>
<p begin="02:12:34.880" end="02:12:38.800" style="s2">against the upper classmen, especially</p>
<p begin="02:12:36.960" end="02:12:41.520" style="s2">since there were three star levels among</p>
<p begin="02:12:38.800" end="02:12:43.360" style="s2">them. Hearing this, Zeke let out a sigh</p>
<p begin="02:12:41.520" end="02:12:45.280" style="s2">and asked his fellow lowerassmen why</p>
<p begin="02:12:43.360" end="02:12:47.119" style="s2">they lacked motivation. He told them</p>
<p begin="02:12:45.280" end="02:12:48.960" style="s2">that fighting stronger opponents was</p>
<p begin="02:12:47.119" end="02:12:50.880" style="s2">where they gained the most and added</p>
<p begin="02:12:48.960" end="02:12:52.639" style="s2">that for now, he wanted to see the</p>
<p begin="02:12:50.880" end="02:12:54.960" style="s2">so-called abilities of their upper</p>
<p begin="02:12:52.639" end="02:12:56.880" style="s2">classmen. After the upper classmen took</p>
<p begin="02:12:54.960" end="02:12:59.119" style="s2">out their weapons, they spoke among</p>
<p begin="02:12:56.880" end="02:13:01.280" style="s2">themselves, saying that the selfishness</p>
<p begin="02:12:59.119" end="02:13:03.679" style="s2">of lowerassmen these days was such a</p>
<p begin="02:13:01.280" end="02:13:05.440" style="s2">pain. No matter how hard the lowerassmen</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.679" end="02:13:07.520" style="s2">tried, there was no way they could win</p>
<p begin="02:13:05.440" end="02:13:09.440" style="s2">against them. As Rangis and the others</p>
<p begin="02:13:07.520" end="02:13:11.119" style="s2">gathered together, trembling from the</p>
<p begin="02:13:09.440" end="02:13:13.520" style="s2">anxiety they felt about facing the</p>
<p begin="02:13:11.119" end="02:13:15.599" style="s2">upperassmen, one of the upper classmen</p>
<p begin="02:13:13.520" end="02:13:18.079" style="s2">mockingly said that they should go easy</p>
<p begin="02:13:15.599" end="02:13:20.079" style="s2">on the lowerassmen. Another upperassman</p>
<p begin="02:13:18.079" end="02:13:22.480" style="s2">laughed and agreed, adding that aside</p>
<p begin="02:13:20.079" end="02:13:25.199" style="s2">from Lady Lea, the lowerassmen were all</p>
<p begin="02:13:22.480" end="02:13:27.199" style="s2">like babies, only at two star levels.</p>
<p begin="02:13:25.199" end="02:13:29.040" style="s2">Zeke noticed the reactions of Rangis and</p>
<p begin="02:13:27.199" end="02:13:30.719" style="s2">the others. So, he asked them why they</p>
<p begin="02:13:29.040" end="02:13:32.560" style="s2">looked so gloomy and whether they were</p>
<p begin="02:13:30.719" end="02:13:34.400" style="s2">worried about the battle. Rangis</p>
<p begin="02:13:32.560" end="02:13:36.079" style="s2">immediately confirmed it, saying that</p>
<p begin="02:13:34.400" end="02:13:38.480" style="s2">their opponents were all three star</p>
<p begin="02:13:36.079" end="02:13:40.480" style="s2">upperassmen, so it was only natural to</p>
<p begin="02:13:38.480" end="02:13:42.159" style="s2">feel worried. Zeke then reminded them</p>
<p begin="02:13:40.480" end="02:13:44.320" style="s2">that they had trained hard with him for</p>
<p begin="02:13:42.159" end="02:13:46.880" style="s2">the past 5 years and had done well in</p>
<p begin="02:13:44.320" end="02:13:48.400" style="s2">their training. Because of that, he said</p>
<p begin="02:13:46.880" end="02:13:50.560" style="s2">they needed to have more faith in</p>
<p begin="02:13:48.400" end="02:13:52.320" style="s2">themselves. Seline and Raymond were</p>
<p begin="02:13:50.560" end="02:13:54.320" style="s2">immediately encouraged by Zeke&#39;s words</p>
<p begin="02:13:52.320" end="02:13:56.079" style="s2">and reminder, while Rangis still could</p>
<p begin="02:13:54.320" end="02:13:58.000" style="s2">not completely shake off the nervousness</p>
<p begin="02:13:56.079" end="02:13:59.679" style="s2">he felt about the upcoming fight.</p>
<p begin="02:13:58.000" end="02:14:01.679" style="s2">Suddenly, one of the upper classmen</p>
<p begin="02:13:59.679" end="02:14:03.360" style="s2">shouted, telling them to stop chattering</p>
<p begin="02:14:01.679" end="02:14:05.599" style="s2">because they were just wasting precious</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.360" end="02:14:07.920" style="s2">time, and that upperassmen did not have</p>
<p begin="02:14:05.599" end="02:14:09.440" style="s2">time to waste on lowerassmen. He told</p>
<p begin="02:14:07.920" end="02:14:11.119" style="s2">them to hurry up and start the fight</p>
<p begin="02:14:09.440" end="02:14:13.920" style="s2">already, saying they would teach the</p>
<p begin="02:14:11.119" end="02:14:15.920" style="s2">lowerassmen their proper place. However,</p>
<p begin="02:14:13.920" end="02:14:17.040" style="s2">in less than a minute, the spectators</p>
<p begin="02:14:15.920" end="02:14:19.119" style="s2">could not believe what they were</p>
<p begin="02:14:17.040" end="02:14:20.960" style="s2">witnessing, immediately questioning what</p>
<p begin="02:14:19.119" end="02:14:22.800" style="s2">was happening and how the lowerassmen</p>
<p begin="02:14:20.960" end="02:14:25.119" style="s2">had managed to defeat the upper classmen</p>
<p begin="02:14:22.800" end="02:14:26.719" style="s2">so easily. Some of those watching even</p>
<p begin="02:14:25.119" end="02:14:28.719" style="s2">wondered if the upper classmen were</p>
<p begin="02:14:26.719" end="02:14:30.400" style="s2">really this weak this year, but others</p>
<p begin="02:14:28.719" end="02:14:32.560" style="s2">said it was not that the upper classmen</p>
<p begin="02:14:30.400" end="02:14:34.960" style="s2">were weak, rather that the lowerassmen</p>
<p begin="02:14:32.560" end="02:14:37.280" style="s2">they faced were simply monsters. Our</p>
<p begin="02:14:34.960" end="02:14:39.119" style="s2">protagonist wore a wide smile, clearly</p>
<p begin="02:14:37.280" end="02:14:40.719" style="s2">delighted by the result of the battle,</p>
<p begin="02:14:39.119" end="02:14:42.960" style="s2">and he immediately praised and</p>
<p begin="02:14:40.719" end="02:14:45.119" style="s2">congratulated Rangus and the others. In</p>
<p begin="02:14:42.960" end="02:14:46.639" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s mind, Rangus&#39; deflection</p>
<p begin="02:14:45.119" end="02:14:48.960" style="s2">techniques and his eye for spotting</p>
<p begin="02:14:46.639" end="02:14:50.560" style="s2">openings had become much sharper. Seline</p>
<p begin="02:14:48.960" end="02:14:52.800" style="s2">was also handling the multistrike</p>
<p begin="02:14:50.560" end="02:14:54.320" style="s2">windflower sword arts very well, and</p>
<p begin="02:14:52.800" end="02:14:56.000" style="s2">Zeke thought it was impressive how</p>
<p begin="02:14:54.320" end="02:14:58.159" style="s2">Raymond could smoothly switch between</p>
<p begin="02:14:56.000" end="02:15:00.400" style="s2">his shield and sword arts. According to</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.159" end="02:15:02.320" style="s2">Zeke, all of them had shown magnificent</p>
<p begin="02:15:00.400" end="02:15:04.079" style="s2">results from their training. And at this</p>
<p begin="02:15:02.320" end="02:15:06.480" style="s2">rate, if they gained confidence through</p>
<p begin="02:15:04.079" end="02:15:08.639" style="s2">real combat, it would only benefit them</p>
<p begin="02:15:06.480" end="02:15:10.719" style="s2">further. Zeke also thought that Leica</p>
<p begin="02:15:08.639" end="02:15:12.719" style="s2">had grown stronger as well, and with her</p>
<p begin="02:15:10.719" end="02:15:14.960" style="s2">lightning aura, she could defeat her</p>
<p begin="02:15:12.719" end="02:15:16.400" style="s2">opponents in a single attack. While the</p>
<p begin="02:15:14.960" end="02:15:18.400" style="s2">other upper classmen were still in</p>
<p begin="02:15:16.400" end="02:15:20.400" style="s2">disbelief at the speed and ferocity of</p>
<p begin="02:15:18.400" end="02:15:22.079" style="s2">the fight they had witnessed, Leica</p>
<p begin="02:15:20.400" end="02:15:24.159" style="s2">commented that she believed it was only</p>
<p begin="02:15:22.079" end="02:15:25.760" style="s2">right to defeat her opponent decisively</p>
<p begin="02:15:24.159" end="02:15:28.320" style="s2">in order to teach them a lesson for</p>
<p begin="02:15:25.760" end="02:15:29.840" style="s2">their arrogance. However, Rick could not</p>
<p begin="02:15:28.320" end="02:15:32.239" style="s2">accept the result of the battle.</p>
<p begin="02:15:29.840" end="02:15:34.000" style="s2">According to him, there was no way three</p>
<p begin="02:15:32.239" end="02:15:36.800" style="s2">star upper classmen would lose to two</p>
<p begin="02:15:34.000" end="02:15:38.719" style="s2">star lowerassmen. At that moment, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:15:36.800" end="02:15:40.719" style="s2">walked toward him and said that Rick was</p>
<p begin="02:15:38.719" end="02:15:42.719" style="s2">naive because even after seeing the</p>
<p begin="02:15:40.719" end="02:15:44.880" style="s2">results with his own eyes, he was still</p>
<p begin="02:15:42.719" end="02:15:47.040" style="s2">spouting such nonsense. As Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:15:44.880" end="02:15:48.639" style="s2">approached Rick, he said that age and</p>
<p begin="02:15:47.040" end="02:15:51.520" style="s2">the number of stars were merely</p>
<p begin="02:15:48.639" end="02:15:53.760" style="s2">indicators because in actual combat, the</p>
<p begin="02:15:51.520" end="02:15:56.079" style="s2">strong were simply the victors. Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:15:53.760" end="02:15:58.000" style="s2">added that if the upperassmen were weak,</p>
<p begin="02:15:56.079" end="02:16:00.000" style="s2">then they would lose and that was all</p>
<p begin="02:15:58.000" end="02:16:02.079" style="s2">there was to it. Rick suddenly pointed</p>
<p begin="02:16:00.000" end="02:16:04.239" style="s2">his finger at Zeke, shouting and calling</p>
<p begin="02:16:02.079" end="02:16:06.320" style="s2">him stupid. He insisted that the number</p>
<p begin="02:16:04.239" end="02:16:07.920" style="s2">of stars was equivalent to power and</p>
<p begin="02:16:06.320" end="02:16:10.400" style="s2">asked if Zeke did not even know</p>
<p begin="02:16:07.920" end="02:16:12.639" style="s2">something so basic. Zeke calmly replied</p>
<p begin="02:16:10.400" end="02:16:14.719" style="s2">that whether Rick had stars or not, if</p>
<p begin="02:16:12.639" end="02:16:17.040" style="s2">his heart was destroyed, he would die</p>
<p begin="02:16:14.719" end="02:16:18.800" style="s2">all the same. Rick fell silent for a</p>
<p begin="02:16:17.040" end="02:16:20.880" style="s2">moment when Zeke told him not to lose</p>
<p begin="02:16:18.800" end="02:16:23.199" style="s2">sight of the essence of strength because</p>
<p begin="02:16:20.880" end="02:16:25.599" style="s2">in combat, strength was simply whether</p>
<p begin="02:16:23.199" end="02:16:27.920" style="s2">one could win or not and nothing more.</p>
<p begin="02:16:25.599" end="02:16:29.840" style="s2">Rick then shouted again, telling Zeke to</p>
<p begin="02:16:27.920" end="02:16:31.760" style="s2">shut up and demanding to know who Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:16:29.840" end="02:16:34.160" style="s2">thought he was. Rick said he was an</p>
<p begin="02:16:31.760" end="02:16:35.920" style="s2">upperassman, so a brat like Zeke should</p>
<p begin="02:16:34.160" end="02:16:37.840" style="s2">not try to twist logic because it would</p>
<p begin="02:16:35.920" end="02:16:39.519" style="s2">not work on him. He added that he had</p>
<p begin="02:16:37.840" end="02:16:41.359" style="s2">been going easy on the lowerassmen</p>
<p begin="02:16:39.519" end="02:16:43.760" style="s2">because they were just kids, but because</p>
<p begin="02:16:41.359" end="02:16:45.920" style="s2">of Zeke&#39;s words, it was now too late for</p>
<p begin="02:16:43.760" end="02:16:48.319" style="s2">Zeke to cry later as he would not hold</p>
<p begin="02:16:45.920" end="02:16:50.000" style="s2">back anymore. Zeke simply replied that</p>
<p begin="02:16:48.319" end="02:16:52.160" style="s2">he was already tired of their war of</p>
<p begin="02:16:50.000" end="02:16:53.920" style="s2">words. He said that children should act</p>
<p begin="02:16:52.160" end="02:16:56.080" style="s2">like children and move their bodies</p>
<p begin="02:16:53.920" end="02:16:58.080" style="s2">before their mouths. And since only the</p>
<p begin="02:16:56.080" end="02:16:59.840" style="s2">two of them were left in the arena, he</p>
<p begin="02:16:58.080" end="02:17:02.319" style="s2">asked Rick to show the martial arts he</p>
<p begin="02:16:59.840" end="02:17:04.479" style="s2">had mastered and was so proud of as well</p>
<p begin="02:17:02.319" end="02:17:06.880" style="s2">as how much he had trained. This only</p>
<p begin="02:17:04.479" end="02:17:09.359" style="s2">made Rick boil with rage, shouting at</p>
<p begin="02:17:06.880" end="02:17:11.200" style="s2">Zeke not to underestimate him. Rick</p>
<p begin="02:17:09.359" end="02:17:13.599" style="s2">immediately charged forward with his</p>
<p begin="02:17:11.200" end="02:17:16.000" style="s2">great strength technique, using all his</p>
<p begin="02:17:13.599" end="02:17:18.160" style="s2">power. However, before Rick&#39;s attack</p>
<p begin="02:17:16.000" end="02:17:20.080" style="s2">could even land, Zeke&#39;s eyes suddenly</p>
<p begin="02:17:18.160" end="02:17:22.160" style="s2">emitted a golden light. And with a</p>
<p begin="02:17:20.080" end="02:17:24.319" style="s2">single punch to Rick&#39;s face, Rick was</p>
<p begin="02:17:22.160" end="02:17:26.639" style="s2">sent flying across the arena. After</p>
<p begin="02:17:24.319" end="02:17:28.880" style="s2">that, Zeke even laughed, saying that</p>
<p begin="02:17:26.639" end="02:17:31.120" style="s2">Rick had indeed trained well. Because of</p>
<p begin="02:17:28.880" end="02:17:33.280" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s remark, the entire audience fell</p>
<p begin="02:17:31.120" end="02:17:35.359" style="s2">silent, as did Rick, who remained</p>
<p begin="02:17:33.280" end="02:17:37.280" style="s2">kneeling on the ground. Other students</p>
<p begin="02:17:35.359" end="02:17:39.280" style="s2">quickly agreed with Leica&#39;s comment that</p>
<p begin="02:17:37.280" end="02:17:41.359" style="s2">Zeke was truly ridiculous for saying</p>
<p begin="02:17:39.280" end="02:17:43.120" style="s2">Rick had trained well, because before</p>
<p begin="02:17:41.359" end="02:17:45.040" style="s2">Rick could even show the results of his</p>
<p begin="02:17:43.120" end="02:17:46.719" style="s2">training at the Dragon&#39;s Nest, he had</p>
<p begin="02:17:45.040" end="02:17:48.559" style="s2">already been defeated by Zeke.</p>
<p begin="02:17:46.719" end="02:17:50.639" style="s2">Meanwhile, at the West Hall training</p>
<p begin="02:17:48.559" end="02:17:52.719" style="s2">grounds, students could be seen groaning</p>
<p begin="02:17:50.639" end="02:17:54.240" style="s2">in pain, clutching various parts of</p>
<p begin="02:17:52.719" end="02:17:56.000" style="s2">their bodies from the injuries they</p>
<p begin="02:17:54.240" end="02:17:58.000" style="s2">sustained after the battle. After</p>
<p begin="02:17:56.000" end="02:17:59.519" style="s2">letting out a deep sigh, one man said</p>
<p begin="02:17:58.000" end="02:18:01.439" style="s2">that every single one of them was</p>
<p begin="02:17:59.519" end="02:18:03.359" style="s2">useless. This man was one of the</p>
<p begin="02:18:01.439" end="02:18:06.399" style="s2">candidates for the next family head,</p>
<p begin="02:18:03.359" end="02:18:08.399" style="s2">Veneil Fafnild Elragon. Soon after,</p>
<p begin="02:18:06.399" end="02:18:10.559" style="s2">other students arrived, and one of them</p>
<p begin="02:18:08.399" end="02:18:12.319" style="s2">addressed him as Lord Veneil, reporting</p>
<p begin="02:18:10.559" end="02:18:15.120" style="s2">that the selection here was already</p>
<p begin="02:18:12.319" end="02:18:17.599" style="s2">complete. This man, Allan, Venil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:18:15.120" end="02:18:19.439" style="s2">right-hand man, was a three-star level.</p>
<p begin="02:18:17.599" end="02:18:21.359" style="s2">And behind him were the other three star</p>
<p begin="02:18:19.439" end="02:18:23.679" style="s2">students who had passed the selection,</p>
<p begin="02:18:21.359" end="02:18:26.080" style="s2">including Retin, who was only 12 years</p>
<p begin="02:18:23.679" end="02:18:28.160" style="s2">old. Veneil immediately noticed Retin</p>
<p begin="02:18:26.080" end="02:18:30.559" style="s2">and called him over, asking if he was</p>
<p begin="02:18:28.160" end="02:18:32.559" style="s2">truly already a three-star level despite</p>
<p begin="02:18:30.559" end="02:18:34.800" style="s2">being a lowerassman. When Retin</p>
<p begin="02:18:32.559" end="02:18:36.399" style="s2">confirmed it, Veneil praised him, saying</p>
<p begin="02:18:34.800" end="02:18:38.479" style="s2">that he liked competent people like</p>
<p begin="02:18:36.399" end="02:18:40.240" style="s2">Retin. Veneil added that if Rhettin</p>
<p begin="02:18:38.479" end="02:18:42.319" style="s2">proved useful, he would make him one of</p>
<p begin="02:18:40.240" end="02:18:44.399" style="s2">his subordinates. Retin immediately</p>
<p begin="02:18:42.319" end="02:18:45.760" style="s2">bowed and thanked Veneil, thinking to</p>
<p begin="02:18:44.399" end="02:18:47.519" style="s2">himself that Lord Veneil had</p>
<p begin="02:18:45.760" end="02:18:49.599" style="s2">acknowledged his strength and that with</p>
<p begin="02:18:47.519" end="02:18:51.679" style="s2">Lord Veneil here, there was no way the</p>
<p begin="02:18:49.599" end="02:18:53.359" style="s2">West Hall would lose to the other halls.</p>
<p begin="02:18:51.679" end="02:18:55.040" style="s2">Rhettin also believed that if they</p>
<p begin="02:18:53.359" end="02:18:57.040" style="s2">achieved great results in the special</p>
<p begin="02:18:55.040" end="02:18:59.359" style="s2">mission, Lord Veneil would become the</p>
<p begin="02:18:57.040" end="02:19:01.280" style="s2">next head of the Eldra family. And when</p>
<p begin="02:18:59.359" end="02:19:03.359" style="s2">that happened, he would become a direct</p>
<p begin="02:19:01.280" end="02:19:05.280" style="s2">subordinate of the family head. Alan</p>
<p begin="02:19:03.359" end="02:19:06.800" style="s2">then stepped closer to Veneil and said</p>
<p begin="02:19:05.280" end="02:19:08.719" style="s2">there was something he needed to inform</p>
<p begin="02:19:06.800" end="02:19:11.280" style="s2">him about. When Veneil asked what it</p>
<p begin="02:19:08.719" end="02:19:13.040" style="s2">was, Alan whispered that apparently Lady</p>
<p begin="02:19:11.280" end="02:19:15.359" style="s2">Leica would be participating in the East</p>
<p begin="02:19:13.040" end="02:19:17.519" style="s2">Hall selection team. This made Venil</p>
<p begin="02:19:15.359" end="02:19:19.840" style="s2">scratch his head in irritation and with</p>
<p begin="02:19:17.519" end="02:19:21.599" style="s2">annoyance clearly visible on his face,</p>
<p begin="02:19:19.840" end="02:19:23.840" style="s2">he said that Lea was an endlessly</p>
<p begin="02:19:21.599" end="02:19:25.760" style="s2">annoying pest to him. He then stood up</p>
<p begin="02:19:23.840" end="02:19:28.000" style="s2">and said that it did not matter because</p>
<p begin="02:19:25.760" end="02:19:29.840" style="s2">no matter how excellent Leica was, they</p>
<p begin="02:19:28.000" end="02:19:31.599" style="s2">would be the ones to win. Veneil</p>
<p begin="02:19:29.840" end="02:19:33.599" style="s2">declared once more that they would win</p>
<p begin="02:19:31.599" end="02:19:35.439" style="s2">and complete the special mission and</p>
<p begin="02:19:33.599" end="02:19:37.280" style="s2">prove to his older brothers that the</p>
<p begin="02:19:35.439" end="02:19:38.960" style="s2">seat of the next family head truly</p>
<p begin="02:19:37.280" end="02:19:40.719" style="s2">belonged to him. On the day of the</p>
<p begin="02:19:38.960" end="02:19:42.240" style="s2">selection, all of the participants</p>
<p begin="02:19:40.719" end="02:19:44.000" style="s2">gathered along with the students of</p>
<p begin="02:19:42.240" end="02:19:45.920" style="s2">Dragons Nest from the various dragon</p>
<p begin="02:19:44.000" end="02:19:47.920" style="s2">halls. Because of the sheer number of</p>
<p begin="02:19:45.920" end="02:19:49.359" style="s2">students who came to watch, Rangus</p>
<p begin="02:19:47.920" end="02:19:50.720" style="s2">couldn&#39;t help but feel nervous as he</p>
<p begin="02:19:49.359" end="02:19:52.960" style="s2">muttered that there were so many people</p>
<p begin="02:19:50.720" end="02:19:54.399" style="s2">in the arena. Leica then explained that</p>
<p begin="02:19:52.960" end="02:19:55.920" style="s2">most of the students from the different</p>
<p begin="02:19:54.399" end="02:19:58.080" style="s2">halls had gathered to witness the</p>
<p begin="02:19:55.920" end="02:19:59.600" style="s2">selection and she also added that since</p>
<p begin="02:19:58.080" end="02:20:01.600" style="s2">some kids had dropped out during the</p>
<p begin="02:19:59.600" end="02:20:02.960" style="s2">exams. She could say that the number of</p>
<p begin="02:20:01.600" end="02:20:05.600" style="s2">students had already been greatly</p>
<p begin="02:20:02.960" end="02:20:07.120" style="s2">reduced. Asking Rangus if he agreed.</p>
<p begin="02:20:05.600" end="02:20:09.040" style="s2">Instead of answering her question,</p>
<p begin="02:20:07.120" end="02:20:10.720" style="s2">Rangus thought to himself that Leica was</p>
<p begin="02:20:09.040" end="02:20:12.479" style="s2">right and that those who had dropped out</p>
<p begin="02:20:10.720" end="02:20:14.640" style="s2">of Dragon&#39;s Nest weren&#39;t here because</p>
<p begin="02:20:12.479" end="02:20:17.200" style="s2">they were called pseudo dragons, just</p>
<p begin="02:20:14.640" end="02:20:19.600" style="s2">like his dad. Lea immediately noticed</p>
<p begin="02:20:17.200" end="02:20:21.680" style="s2">the sadness on Rangus&#39; face. So, she</p>
<p begin="02:20:19.600" end="02:20:23.359" style="s2">quickly changed the topic, patting him</p>
<p begin="02:20:21.680" end="02:20:24.960" style="s2">on the back as she said that what</p>
<p begin="02:20:23.359" end="02:20:27.120" style="s2">mattered was that they had been chosen</p>
<p begin="02:20:24.960" end="02:20:29.040" style="s2">as representatives of the East Hall and</p>
<p begin="02:20:27.120" end="02:20:30.880" style="s2">that they should be proud of themselves.</p>
<p begin="02:20:29.040" end="02:20:32.319" style="s2">Rangus immediately agreed and said that</p>
<p begin="02:20:30.880" end="02:20:34.560" style="s2">he would do everything he could in the</p>
<p begin="02:20:32.319" end="02:20:36.000" style="s2">upcoming selection. Soon after, they</p>
<p begin="02:20:34.560" end="02:20:37.760" style="s2">noticed their protagonist standing</p>
<p begin="02:20:36.000" end="02:20:40.000" style="s2">quietly among the participants of the</p>
<p begin="02:20:37.760" end="02:20:41.840" style="s2">selection. When they approached Zeke,</p>
<p begin="02:20:40.000" end="02:20:43.840" style="s2">Rangus immediately asked if something</p>
<p begin="02:20:41.840" end="02:20:46.319" style="s2">was wrong. While Leica also remarked</p>
<p begin="02:20:43.840" end="02:20:48.319" style="s2">that Zeke seemed unusually quiet today,</p>
<p begin="02:20:46.319" end="02:20:49.920" style="s2">Zeke replied that there was no problem</p>
<p begin="02:20:48.319" end="02:20:51.520" style="s2">and that he was simply gauging the</p>
<p begin="02:20:49.920" end="02:20:53.680" style="s2">fighting strength of the students around</p>
<p begin="02:20:51.520" end="02:20:55.760" style="s2">him. Suddenly, Rangus collapsed in shock</p>
<p begin="02:20:53.680" end="02:20:57.920" style="s2">when they heard a loud voice saying, &quot;As</p>
<p begin="02:20:55.760" end="02:20:59.840" style="s2">expected of Lord Zeke, to think that he</p>
<p begin="02:20:57.920" end="02:21:01.520" style="s2">can also do such a thing.&quot; When Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:20:59.840" end="02:21:03.680" style="s2">turned toward the source of the voice,</p>
<p begin="02:21:01.520" end="02:21:06.000" style="s2">he saw two students running toward them.</p>
<p begin="02:21:03.680" end="02:21:08.080" style="s2">At the same time, Zeke casually remarked</p>
<p begin="02:21:06.000" end="02:21:09.920" style="s2">that things had certainly changed. The</p>
<p begin="02:21:08.080" end="02:21:11.280" style="s2">two upper classmen, who were also</p>
<p begin="02:21:09.920" end="02:21:12.640" style="s2">members of the selection and were</p>
<p begin="02:21:11.280" end="02:21:14.800" style="s2">currently running toward him,</p>
<p begin="02:21:12.640" end="02:21:16.720" style="s2">immediately agreed with what Zeke said.</p>
<p begin="02:21:14.800" end="02:21:18.560" style="s2">Rick added that after their battle, they</p>
<p begin="02:21:16.720" end="02:21:19.920" style="s2">had reconsidered their way of thinking,</p>
<p begin="02:21:18.560" end="02:21:21.840" style="s2">and even though he was part of El</p>
<p begin="02:21:19.920" end="02:21:24.000" style="s2">Dragon, he genuinely respected the</p>
<p begin="02:21:21.840" end="02:21:26.319" style="s2">Strong. Zeke simply replied that it</p>
<p begin="02:21:24.000" end="02:21:28.720" style="s2">wasn&#39;t a bad thing, so it was fine.</p>
<p begin="02:21:26.319" end="02:21:30.640" style="s2">Meanwhile, Rangus burst into tears as he</p>
<p begin="02:21:28.720" end="02:21:32.880" style="s2">clung to Zeke&#39;s legs, saying that he was</p>
<p begin="02:21:30.640" end="02:21:35.040" style="s2">truly shocked by Rick&#39;s sudden shout. As</p>
<p begin="02:21:32.880" end="02:21:36.800" style="s2">they helped Ranga stand up, Zeke thought</p>
<p begin="02:21:35.040" end="02:21:38.240" style="s2">to himself that every participant in the</p>
<p begin="02:21:36.800" end="02:21:40.080" style="s2">selection from the different dragon</p>
<p begin="02:21:38.240" end="02:21:42.160" style="s2">halls was at the three-star level except</p>
<p begin="02:21:40.080" end="02:21:44.160" style="s2">for those from the east hall. As he</p>
<p begin="02:21:42.160" end="02:21:46.080" style="s2">expected, there were no four-star</p>
<p begin="02:21:44.160" end="02:21:47.840" style="s2">students among the participants, but</p>
<p begin="02:21:46.080" end="02:21:49.920" style="s2">there were several who already had one</p>
<p begin="02:21:47.840" end="02:21:51.200" style="s2">foot in that realm. That was why Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:21:49.920" end="02:21:53.040" style="s2">was excited to see what kind of</p>
<p begin="02:21:51.200" end="02:21:55.120" style="s2">techniques he would witness this time.</p>
<p begin="02:21:53.040" end="02:21:57.040" style="s2">While they continued talking, a girl</p>
<p begin="02:21:55.120" end="02:21:58.960" style="s2">suddenly hugged Lea from behind, and</p>
<p begin="02:21:57.040" end="02:22:01.200" style="s2">Leica immediately recognized her as</p>
<p begin="02:21:58.960" end="02:22:03.280" style="s2">Sandy. Because of Leica and Sandy&#39;s loud</p>
<p begin="02:22:01.200" end="02:22:05.520" style="s2">voices, Zeke also turned his attention</p>
<p begin="02:22:03.280" end="02:22:07.280" style="s2">toward them. While still hugging Leica,</p>
<p begin="02:22:05.520" end="02:22:08.960" style="s2">Sandy said that it had been a long time</p>
<p begin="02:22:07.280" end="02:22:11.200" style="s2">since they last saw each other and asked</p>
<p begin="02:22:08.960" end="02:22:13.520" style="s2">how Leica had been. She also asked if</p>
<p begin="02:22:11.200" end="02:22:15.600" style="s2">anyone was bullying Lea, but Lea simply</p>
<p begin="02:22:13.520" end="02:22:17.680" style="s2">replied that she was fine. When Selene</p>
<p begin="02:22:15.600" end="02:22:20.080" style="s2">asked who the person hugging Leica was,</p>
<p begin="02:22:17.680" end="02:22:22.399" style="s2">Lea immediately introduced her as Sandy,</p>
<p begin="02:22:20.080" end="02:22:24.640" style="s2">her cousin Sandy Tyona, the daughter of</p>
<p begin="02:22:22.399" end="02:22:27.040" style="s2">the Typhona family head. This shocked</p>
<p begin="02:22:24.640" end="02:22:28.560" style="s2">Rangus and the others as Sandy was also</p>
<p begin="02:22:27.040" end="02:22:31.359" style="s2">a member of one of the four great</p>
<p begin="02:22:28.560" end="02:22:33.760" style="s2">families. With a serious tone, Sandy</p>
<p begin="02:22:31.359" end="02:22:35.200" style="s2">asked Leica who these kids were and Lea</p>
<p begin="02:22:33.760" end="02:22:37.840" style="s2">answered that they were her companions</p>
<p begin="02:22:35.200" end="02:22:40.000" style="s2">and also her friends. Sandy then asked</p>
<p begin="02:22:37.840" end="02:22:41.359" style="s2">if Leica was sure they were her friends,</p>
<p begin="02:22:40.000" end="02:22:43.439" style="s2">saying that while it was good to get</p>
<p begin="02:22:41.359" end="02:22:45.520" style="s2">along with other kids, they lacked the</p>
<p begin="02:22:43.439" end="02:22:47.359" style="s2">ability to be Leica&#39;s companions since</p>
<p begin="02:22:45.520" end="02:22:49.200" style="s2">Lea was one of the candidates to become</p>
<p begin="02:22:47.359" end="02:22:51.520" style="s2">the next family head of the Eldreon</p>
<p begin="02:22:49.200" end="02:22:52.960" style="s2">family. Zeke immediately intervened,</p>
<p begin="02:22:51.520" end="02:22:54.880" style="s2">saying that it would only become clear</p>
<p begin="02:22:52.960" end="02:22:56.960" style="s2">when they fought. When Sandy asked who</p>
<p begin="02:22:54.880" end="02:22:58.960" style="s2">he was, Leica quickly said that he was</p>
<p begin="02:22:56.960" end="02:23:01.280" style="s2">Zeke and also one of the candidates like</p>
<p begin="02:22:58.960" end="02:23:03.280" style="s2">her. Sandy then asked if he really was a</p>
<p begin="02:23:01.280" end="02:23:05.040" style="s2">candidate and whether he was the rumored</p>
<p begin="02:23:03.280" end="02:23:07.120" style="s2">illegitimate child of the current family</p>
<p begin="02:23:05.040" end="02:23:08.880" style="s2">head. She bluntly stated that she never</p>
<p begin="02:23:07.120" end="02:23:11.200" style="s2">thought a mere bastard like Zeke would</p>
<p begin="02:23:08.880" end="02:23:13.600" style="s2">still be alive. Despite Sandy&#39;s harsh</p>
<p begin="02:23:11.200" end="02:23:15.280" style="s2">words, Zeke remained smiling. While</p>
<p begin="02:23:13.600" end="02:23:16.880" style="s2">Leica was clearly shocked and</p>
<p begin="02:23:15.280" end="02:23:18.319" style="s2">immediately asked Sandy why she was</p>
<p begin="02:23:16.880" end="02:23:20.640" style="s2">acting like that in front of her friends</p>
<p begin="02:23:18.319" end="02:23:22.319" style="s2">and Zeke. Sandy was surprised by Lea&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:23:20.640" end="02:23:24.240" style="s2">reaction and said that even if Zeke was</p>
<p begin="02:23:22.319" end="02:23:26.399" style="s2">an illegitimate child, he was still</p>
<p begin="02:23:24.240" end="02:23:27.680" style="s2">Leica&#39;s rival. She added that Leica</p>
<p begin="02:23:26.399" end="02:23:29.359" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be able to defeat the other</p>
<p begin="02:23:27.680" end="02:23:31.520" style="s2">family head candidates with such an</p>
<p begin="02:23:29.359" end="02:23:33.680" style="s2">attitude. Sandy also remarked that</p>
<p begin="02:23:31.520" end="02:23:35.600" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s group was of poor quality, as</p>
<p begin="02:23:33.680" end="02:23:37.359" style="s2">none of them were even three star level</p>
<p begin="02:23:35.600" end="02:23:39.680" style="s2">and asked if the East Hall students were</p>
<p begin="02:23:37.359" end="02:23:41.840" style="s2">really that weak now. Zeke suddenly cut</p>
<p begin="02:23:39.680" end="02:23:43.280" style="s2">in, pouting slightly as he warned Sandy</p>
<p begin="02:23:41.840" end="02:23:45.280" style="s2">that if she kept looking down on them</p>
<p begin="02:23:43.280" end="02:23:46.720" style="s2">the way she was now, she would end up</p>
<p begin="02:23:45.280" end="02:23:48.800" style="s2">having the rug pulled out from under</p>
<p begin="02:23:46.720" end="02:23:50.800" style="s2">her. Sandy&#39;s expression immediately</p>
<p begin="02:23:48.800" end="02:23:52.479" style="s2">darkened, her eyes narrowing as she</p>
<p begin="02:23:50.800" end="02:23:54.319" style="s2">asked Zeke to repeat what he had just</p>
<p begin="02:23:52.479" end="02:23:56.160" style="s2">said, questioning whether a mere</p>
<p begin="02:23:54.319" end="02:23:57.840" style="s2">illegitimate child with no backing other</p>
<p begin="02:23:56.160" end="02:23:59.920" style="s2">than the family head&#39;s blood was</p>
<p begin="02:23:57.840" end="02:24:02.000" style="s2">actually daring to lecture her. Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:23:59.920" end="02:24:04.640" style="s2">calmly replied that what he said wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:24:02.000" end="02:24:06.479" style="s2">advice, but a warning. This caused Sandy</p>
<p begin="02:24:04.640" end="02:24:08.160" style="s2">to flare up in anger, but another</p>
<p begin="02:24:06.479" end="02:24:09.760" style="s2">student quickly stepped in and said that</p>
<p begin="02:24:08.160" end="02:24:11.680" style="s2">Sandy shouldn&#39;t cause trouble for the</p>
<p begin="02:24:09.760" end="02:24:13.680" style="s2">other teams. The student introduced</p>
<p begin="02:24:11.680" end="02:24:15.600" style="s2">himself as Edgis Vanlade, a</p>
<p begin="02:24:13.680" end="02:24:17.920" style="s2">representative of the North Hall. As</p>
<p begin="02:24:15.600" end="02:24:20.080" style="s2">Rangis tried to recall who Edges was,</p>
<p begin="02:24:17.920" end="02:24:21.280" style="s2">Sandy told him not to interfere, saying</p>
<p begin="02:24:20.080" end="02:24:23.760" style="s2">that they were in the middle of an</p>
<p begin="02:24:21.280" end="02:24:25.840" style="s2">important conversation. Edgis, however,</p>
<p begin="02:24:23.760" end="02:24:27.680" style="s2">smiled and said he couldn&#39;t let it slide</p>
<p begin="02:24:25.840" end="02:24:29.359" style="s2">since the selection battle was about to</p>
<p begin="02:24:27.680" end="02:24:31.040" style="s2">begin. As the students continued</p>
<p begin="02:24:29.359" end="02:24:33.120" style="s2">chatting while waiting for the selection</p>
<p begin="02:24:31.040" end="02:24:35.760" style="s2">to start, a man suddenly arrived and</p>
<p begin="02:24:33.120" end="02:24:38.080" style="s2">drew everyone&#39;s attention. Reangis, Lea,</p>
<p begin="02:24:35.760" end="02:24:40.080" style="s2">and Sandy all fell silent while Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:24:38.080" end="02:24:41.840" style="s2">smiled brightly, excited for the battle</p>
<p begin="02:24:40.080" end="02:24:43.840" style="s2">to come. The man who announced that the</p>
<p begin="02:24:41.840" end="02:24:45.600" style="s2">selection battle would now begin was</p>
<p begin="02:24:43.840" end="02:24:48.560" style="s2">none other than the captain of the gold</p>
<p begin="02:24:45.600" end="02:24:50.720" style="s2">dragon corps teach also known as the</p>
<p begin="02:24:48.560" end="02:24:52.720" style="s2">educator. Mench announced that from this</p>
<p begin="02:24:50.720" end="02:24:54.720" style="s2">moment on the selection battle would</p>
<p begin="02:24:52.720" end="02:24:56.399" style="s2">officially begin. He then explained to</p>
<p begin="02:24:54.720" end="02:24:58.479" style="s2">everyone that the matches would follow a</p>
<p begin="02:24:56.399" end="02:25:00.880" style="s2">tournament style elimination format</p>
<p begin="02:24:58.479" end="02:25:02.880" style="s2">combining all four halls. According to</p>
<p begin="02:25:00.880" end="02:25:04.880" style="s2">him, the four halls would be split into</p>
<p begin="02:25:02.880" end="02:25:06.560" style="s2">two groups and the halls that emerged</p>
<p begin="02:25:04.880" end="02:25:08.560" style="s2">victorious from each group would face</p>
<p begin="02:25:06.560" end="02:25:10.479" style="s2">each other in the finals. He added that</p>
<p begin="02:25:08.560" end="02:25:12.720" style="s2">the battle format would be one-on-one</p>
<p begin="02:25:10.479" end="02:25:14.800" style="s2">duels where each hall would send out its</p>
<p begin="02:25:12.720" end="02:25:16.479" style="s2">fighters one at a time following a</p>
<p begin="02:25:14.800" end="02:25:18.560" style="s2">predetermined order of the seven</p>
<p begin="02:25:16.479" end="02:25:20.160" style="s2">participants from each hall. Mench</p>
<p begin="02:25:18.560" end="02:25:22.240" style="s2">further explained that the hall which</p>
<p begin="02:25:20.160" end="02:25:24.160" style="s2">defeated four opponents first would be</p>
<p begin="02:25:22.240" end="02:25:26.399" style="s2">declared the winner and once the match</p>
<p begin="02:25:24.160" end="02:25:28.479" style="s2">began, no changes to the fighting order</p>
<p begin="02:25:26.399" end="02:25:30.000" style="s2">would be allowed. Because of this, the</p>
<p begin="02:25:28.479" end="02:25:31.600" style="s2">fighting order itself had to be</p>
<p begin="02:25:30.000" end="02:25:34.080" style="s2">carefully considered as part of each</p>
<p begin="02:25:31.600" end="02:25:35.760" style="s2">hall&#39;s strategy. As a final point,</p>
<p begin="02:25:34.080" end="02:25:37.439" style="s2">Menrich revealed that those selected</p>
<p begin="02:25:35.760" end="02:25:39.520" style="s2">through this match would be assigned a</p>
<p begin="02:25:37.439" end="02:25:41.680" style="s2">special mission, one that was extremely</p>
<p begin="02:25:39.520" end="02:25:43.200" style="s2">important to the Eldra Dragon family.</p>
<p begin="02:25:41.680" end="02:25:44.880" style="s2">Anyone who took part in this mission</p>
<p begin="02:25:43.200" end="02:25:47.439" style="s2">would make a significant contribution to</p>
<p begin="02:25:44.880" end="02:25:49.359" style="s2">the family. And for Leica and Veniel,</p>
<p begin="02:25:47.439" end="02:25:51.760" style="s2">gaining such contributions meant taking</p>
<p begin="02:25:49.359" end="02:25:53.760" style="s2">a major step closer to the head seat.</p>
<p begin="02:25:51.760" end="02:25:55.439" style="s2">After that, Menrich said they would now</p>
<p begin="02:25:53.760" end="02:25:57.439" style="s2">determine the brackets and called</p>
<p begin="02:25:55.439" end="02:25:59.680" style="s2">forward the representatives of each hall</p>
<p begin="02:25:57.439" end="02:26:02.160" style="s2">in order to draw a stone from the box.</p>
<p begin="02:25:59.680" end="02:26:04.240" style="s2">The first he called was Venil Fafneield,</p>
<p begin="02:26:02.160" end="02:26:05.840" style="s2">the representative of the West Hall. As</p>
<p begin="02:26:04.240" end="02:26:08.000" style="s2">Veneil approached the officer holding</p>
<p begin="02:26:05.840" end="02:26:10.399" style="s2">the box, he immediately reached inside</p>
<p begin="02:26:08.000" end="02:26:12.399" style="s2">and took a stone. Afterward, Menrich</p>
<p begin="02:26:10.399" end="02:26:14.720" style="s2">promptly sent him back to his position.</p>
<p begin="02:26:12.399" end="02:26:16.399" style="s2">As Vanil walked away, a bead of sweat</p>
<p begin="02:26:14.720" end="02:26:18.160" style="s2">rolled down Leica&#39;s face as she stared</p>
<p begin="02:26:16.399" end="02:26:19.680" style="s2">at her older brother, who was also</p>
<p begin="02:26:18.160" end="02:26:22.000" style="s2">looking back at her and her group with a</p>
<p begin="02:26:19.680" end="02:26:24.000" style="s2">malicious smile. Zeke quickly noticed</p>
<p begin="02:26:22.000" end="02:26:26.399" style="s2">this and asked Leica if she knew that</p>
<p begin="02:26:24.000" end="02:26:28.000" style="s2">man. Leica immediately confirmed it and</p>
<p begin="02:26:26.399" end="02:26:29.600" style="s2">told Zeke that the man was the West</p>
<p begin="02:26:28.000" end="02:26:31.520" style="s2">Hall&#39;s head candidate she had mentioned</p>
<p begin="02:26:29.600" end="02:26:34.720" style="s2">before, none other than Veneil Fafnild</p>
<p begin="02:26:31.520" end="02:26:36.479" style="s2">Eldrian. I see, Zeke replied simply, a</p>
<p begin="02:26:34.720" end="02:26:38.720" style="s2">faint smile forming on his face as he</p>
<p begin="02:26:36.479" end="02:26:40.560" style="s2">thought about it. Aside from Veneil, the</p>
<p begin="02:26:38.720" end="02:26:43.040" style="s2">West Hall had many strong warriors</p>
<p begin="02:26:40.560" end="02:26:44.240" style="s2">overall. Not only that, Zeke could also</p>
<p begin="02:26:43.040" end="02:26:46.240" style="s2">tell that the other halls were</p>
<p begin="02:26:44.240" end="02:26:47.760" style="s2">well-trained, too, though everyone could</p>
<p begin="02:26:46.240" end="02:26:50.240" style="s2">clearly feel the difference in power</p>
<p begin="02:26:47.760" end="02:26:52.000" style="s2">between them. Soon, Zeke&#39;s gaze landed</p>
<p begin="02:26:50.240" end="02:26:53.600" style="s2">on Retin, and he thought that it had</p>
<p begin="02:26:52.000" end="02:26:56.160" style="s2">been a while since he last saw that</p>
<p begin="02:26:53.600" end="02:26:57.680" style="s2">face. According to Zeke, Retin already</p>
<p begin="02:26:56.160" end="02:26:59.600" style="s2">had considerable skill during the</p>
<p begin="02:26:57.680" end="02:27:01.520" style="s2">entrance exam, but to have reached the</p>
<p begin="02:26:59.600" end="02:27:03.600" style="s2">three star level at the age of 12 made</p>
<p begin="02:27:01.520" end="02:27:05.760" style="s2">Zeke smile, thinking that Retin must</p>
<p begin="02:27:03.600" end="02:27:07.520" style="s2">have trained extremely hard as well.</p>
<p begin="02:27:05.760" end="02:27:09.680" style="s2">Just then, Retin suddenly noticed</p>
<p begin="02:27:07.520" end="02:27:11.680" style="s2">Rangus, and his expression darkened with</p>
<p begin="02:27:09.680" end="02:27:12.960" style="s2">hostility as he questioned why Rangus</p>
<p begin="02:27:11.680" end="02:27:14.960" style="s2">was even included in the current</p>
<p begin="02:27:12.960" end="02:27:17.200" style="s2">selection. Students who recognized</p>
<p begin="02:27:14.960" end="02:27:18.720" style="s2">Rangess were also shocked, some even</p>
<p begin="02:27:17.200" end="02:27:20.720" style="s2">shouting in surprise as they wondered</p>
<p begin="02:27:18.720" end="02:27:22.960" style="s2">what Rangis was doing in the arena.</p>
<p begin="02:27:20.720" end="02:27:25.200" style="s2">Because of this, Rangus once again felt</p>
<p begin="02:27:22.960" end="02:27:27.280" style="s2">nervous. When Raymon noticed it, he</p>
<p begin="02:27:25.200" end="02:27:29.280" style="s2">immediately asked if Rangus was okay.</p>
<p begin="02:27:27.280" end="02:27:31.359" style="s2">Rangus hesitantly replied that he was</p>
<p begin="02:27:29.280" end="02:27:33.680" style="s2">fine while Rhett continued to stare at</p>
<p begin="02:27:31.359" end="02:27:35.439" style="s2">him with clear malicious intent. Soon</p>
<p begin="02:27:33.680" end="02:27:37.600" style="s2">after, Menrich called the representative</p>
<p begin="02:27:35.439" end="02:27:39.760" style="s2">of the north hall. After Edges drew a</p>
<p begin="02:27:37.600" end="02:27:41.600" style="s2">stone from the box, Menrich then called</p>
<p begin="02:27:39.760" end="02:27:44.160" style="s2">the representative of the south hall,</p>
<p begin="02:27:41.600" end="02:27:45.680" style="s2">who likewise took a stone. Finally, he</p>
<p begin="02:27:44.160" end="02:27:48.000" style="s2">called the last representative from the</p>
<p begin="02:27:45.680" end="02:27:49.600" style="s2">east hall. When Leica heard this, she</p>
<p begin="02:27:48.000" end="02:27:51.600" style="s2">immediately told Zeke that he was being</p>
<p begin="02:27:49.600" end="02:27:53.760" style="s2">called forward, causing Zeke to look at</p>
<p begin="02:27:51.600" end="02:27:55.920" style="s2">her in confusion as he asked why he had</p>
<p begin="02:27:53.760" end="02:27:57.760" style="s2">to be their representative. Leica calmly</p>
<p begin="02:27:55.920" end="02:27:59.200" style="s2">replied that the reason was simple. It</p>
<p begin="02:27:57.760" end="02:28:00.880" style="s2">was because he was the strongest in</p>
<p begin="02:27:59.200" end="02:28:02.800" style="s2">their group. Eric and the others</p>
<p begin="02:28:00.880" end="02:28:04.960" style="s2">immediately agreed with her. While Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:28:02.800" end="02:28:06.720" style="s2">questioned whether in situations like</p>
<p begin="02:28:04.960" end="02:28:08.399" style="s2">this it would be better to send the</p>
<p begin="02:28:06.720" end="02:28:10.000" style="s2">youngest member of the group instead.</p>
<p begin="02:28:08.399" end="02:28:11.680" style="s2">Leica merely asked what he meant by</p>
<p begin="02:28:10.000" end="02:28:13.439" style="s2">that, then added that they were all</p>
<p begin="02:28:11.680" end="02:28:15.280" style="s2">about the same age anyway before</p>
<p begin="02:28:13.439" end="02:28:17.600" style="s2">ordering Zeke to go forward and take a</p>
<p begin="02:28:15.280" end="02:28:19.280" style="s2">stone. With no other choice, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:28:17.600" end="02:28:21.280" style="s2">accepted his role as the East Hall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:28:19.280" end="02:28:23.439" style="s2">representative and stepped forward.</p>
<p begin="02:28:21.280" end="02:28:25.359" style="s2">However, Sandy suddenly questioned why</p>
<p begin="02:28:23.439" end="02:28:27.200" style="s2">an illegitimate child like Zeke was</p>
<p begin="02:28:25.359" end="02:28:29.680" style="s2">chosen as their representative instead</p>
<p begin="02:28:27.200" end="02:28:31.120" style="s2">of Leica herself. Lea simply replied</p>
<p begin="02:28:29.680" end="02:28:33.760" style="s2">that it was because Zeke was the</p>
<p begin="02:28:31.120" end="02:28:35.840" style="s2">strongest among them. Even so, Sandy did</p>
<p begin="02:28:33.760" end="02:28:37.439" style="s2">not believe her. According to Sandy,</p>
<p begin="02:28:35.840" end="02:28:39.439" style="s2">Zeke was not even at the three-star</p>
<p begin="02:28:37.439" end="02:28:41.280" style="s2">level like Leica. She also reminded</p>
<p begin="02:28:39.439" end="02:28:43.200" style="s2">Leica that the selection was effectively</p>
<p begin="02:28:41.280" end="02:28:45.760" style="s2">a head candidate battle between her and</p>
<p begin="02:28:43.200" end="02:28:48.160" style="s2">Venil and that at this rate, Leica would</p>
<p begin="02:28:45.760" end="02:28:49.840" style="s2">surely lose. Lea merely smiled and said</p>
<p begin="02:28:48.160" end="02:28:51.760" style="s2">that it was fine and that there would be</p>
<p begin="02:28:49.840" end="02:28:54.000" style="s2">no problem, confidently declaring that</p>
<p begin="02:28:51.760" end="02:28:56.000" style="s2">their team was strong. After Zeke took</p>
<p begin="02:28:54.000" end="02:28:57.840" style="s2">the last stone from the box, Menrich</p>
<p begin="02:28:56.000" end="02:28:59.359" style="s2">instructed each hall&#39;s representative to</p>
<p begin="02:28:57.840" end="02:29:01.680" style="s2">channel their source power into the</p>
<p begin="02:28:59.359" end="02:29:04.000" style="s2">stone they had drawn. As they did so,</p>
<p begin="02:29:01.680" end="02:29:06.319" style="s2">the stones began to glow, turning either</p>
<p begin="02:29:04.000" end="02:29:08.240" style="s2">blue or red. Mench then explained that</p>
<p begin="02:29:06.319" end="02:29:10.080" style="s2">the colors would determine the brackets,</p>
<p begin="02:29:08.240" end="02:29:12.479" style="s2">announcing that the first match would be</p>
<p begin="02:29:10.080" end="02:29:14.479" style="s2">East Hall versus North Hall, followed by</p>
<p begin="02:29:12.479" end="02:29:15.920" style="s2">West Hall versus South Hall. Upon</p>
<p begin="02:29:14.479" end="02:29:17.760" style="s2">learning that their first opponent would</p>
<p begin="02:29:15.920" end="02:29:19.040" style="s2">be the North Hall, Zeke&#39;s group</p>
<p begin="02:29:17.760" end="02:29:21.280" style="s2">immediately turned their attention</p>
<p begin="02:29:19.040" end="02:29:22.800" style="s2">towards Sandy and Edges&#39;s team. They</p>
<p begin="02:29:21.280" end="02:29:24.800" style="s2">soon noticed a particularly tall</p>
<p begin="02:29:22.800" end="02:29:26.960" style="s2">student, and upon seeing his appearance</p>
<p begin="02:29:24.800" end="02:29:28.399" style="s2">and the sharpness of his gaze, Rangus</p>
<p begin="02:29:26.960" end="02:29:30.479" style="s2">shuddered in shock and asked if that</p>
<p begin="02:29:28.399" end="02:29:32.960" style="s2">tall man was truly a student of Dragon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:29:30.479" end="02:29:34.560" style="s2">Nest. Leica confirmed it, though she had</p>
<p begin="02:29:32.960" end="02:29:36.960" style="s2">not expected that they would be facing</p>
<p begin="02:29:34.560" end="02:29:39.040" style="s2">Sandy&#39;s team in the very first match.</p>
<p begin="02:29:36.960" end="02:29:41.120" style="s2">Meanwhile, Sandy released her lightning</p>
<p begin="02:29:39.040" end="02:29:43.040" style="s2">aura and told Leica that this was a good</p>
<p begin="02:29:41.120" end="02:29:45.120" style="s2">opportunity to wake her up. Pointing at</p>
<p begin="02:29:43.040" end="02:29:47.040" style="s2">Leica&#39;s team, Sandy declared that she</p>
<p begin="02:29:45.120" end="02:29:48.560" style="s2">would thoroughly crush Lea so that she</p>
<p begin="02:29:47.040" end="02:29:51.760" style="s2">would remember her position and purpose</p>
<p begin="02:29:48.560" end="02:29:53.520" style="s2">in life. Leica, however, did not waver.</p>
<p begin="02:29:51.760" end="02:29:56.080" style="s2">As her golden lightning aura surged</p>
<p begin="02:29:53.520" end="02:29:57.920" style="s2">forth, she told Sandy to bring it on. At</p>
<p begin="02:29:56.080" end="02:30:00.720" style="s2">the same time, while holding the blue</p>
<p begin="02:29:57.920" end="02:30:02.000" style="s2">stone, Zeke noticed Edges smiling calmly</p>
<p begin="02:30:00.720" end="02:30:03.920" style="s2">as he said that it looked like they</p>
<p begin="02:30:02.000" end="02:30:05.439" style="s2">would be fighting in the first match and</p>
<p begin="02:30:03.920" end="02:30:07.920" style="s2">that he was really looking forward to</p>
<p begin="02:30:05.439" end="02:30:10.080" style="s2">it. Seeing Edges&#39;s reaction and hearing</p>
<p begin="02:30:07.920" end="02:30:11.920" style="s2">his words, Zeke replied that it seemed</p>
<p begin="02:30:10.080" end="02:30:13.600" style="s2">like they would get along, adding that</p>
<p begin="02:30:11.920" end="02:30:15.680" style="s2">he too was looking forward to the battle</p>
<p begin="02:30:13.600" end="02:30:17.280" style="s2">and could not wait to fight anymore.</p>
<p begin="02:30:15.680" end="02:30:19.600" style="s2">Meanwhile, after a brief moment of</p>
<p begin="02:30:17.280" end="02:30:21.200" style="s2">silence filled the entire arena, Menrich</p>
<p begin="02:30:19.600" end="02:30:23.359" style="s2">declared that the first match would take</p>
<p begin="02:30:21.200" end="02:30:24.560" style="s2">place between East Hall and North Hall.</p>
<p begin="02:30:23.359" end="02:30:26.640" style="s2">As soon as everyone heard the</p>
<p begin="02:30:24.560" end="02:30:28.080" style="s2">announcement, Eric immediately told Lord</p>
<p begin="02:30:26.640" end="02:30:30.399" style="s2">Zeke that he would do everything he</p>
<p begin="02:30:28.080" end="02:30:32.399" style="s2">could to win his fight. However, despite</p>
<p begin="02:30:30.399" end="02:30:34.479" style="s2">his determined words, his expression</p>
<p begin="02:30:32.399" end="02:30:36.160" style="s2">betrayed him, causing sweat to trickle</p>
<p begin="02:30:34.479" end="02:30:38.000" style="s2">down Leica&#39;s cheek as she nervously</p>
<p begin="02:30:36.160" end="02:30:40.080" style="s2">asked Zeke if Eric would really be all</p>
<p begin="02:30:38.000" end="02:30:42.080" style="s2">right since his anxiety was clearly</p>
<p begin="02:30:40.080" end="02:30:44.560" style="s2">visible. Zeke simply agreed with her</p>
<p begin="02:30:42.080" end="02:30:46.080" style="s2">observation. Soon after, Menrich asked</p>
<p begin="02:30:44.560" end="02:30:48.000" style="s2">whether both groups were ready for the</p>
<p begin="02:30:46.080" end="02:30:49.359" style="s2">match. And once Eric stepped into the</p>
<p begin="02:30:48.000" end="02:30:51.359" style="s2">center of the arena to face his</p>
<p begin="02:30:49.359" end="02:30:53.359" style="s2">opponent, Menrich immediately ordered</p>
<p begin="02:30:51.359" end="02:30:54.960" style="s2">the start of the battle. Eric charged at</p>
<p begin="02:30:53.359" end="02:30:57.280" style="s2">his opponent right away after gathering</p>
<p begin="02:30:54.960" end="02:30:58.399" style="s2">his source power into his fist. As Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:30:57.280" end="02:31:00.479" style="s2">and the others watched from the</p>
<p begin="02:30:58.399" end="02:31:02.080" style="s2">sidelines, Zeke couldn&#39;t help but wonder</p>
<p begin="02:31:00.479" end="02:31:04.000" style="s2">what the outcome of Eric&#39;s match would</p>
<p begin="02:31:02.080" end="02:31:05.920" style="s2">be. Leica responded by saying that</p>
<p begin="02:31:04.000" end="02:31:07.520" style="s2">judging by their appearances, it was</p>
<p begin="02:31:05.920" end="02:31:09.840" style="s2">going to be a tough fight, and she</p>
<p begin="02:31:07.520" end="02:31:11.439" style="s2">quickly asked for Zeke&#39;s opinion. Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:31:09.840" end="02:31:13.280" style="s2">simply replied that there was no such</p>
<p begin="02:31:11.439" end="02:31:14.960" style="s2">thing as a guaranteed victory in any</p>
<p begin="02:31:13.280" end="02:31:17.120" style="s2">battle unless they were talking about</p>
<p begin="02:31:14.960" end="02:31:19.600" style="s2">himself since he was confident that his</p>
<p begin="02:31:17.120" end="02:31:21.200" style="s2">wins were always absolute. Leica then</p>
<p begin="02:31:19.600" end="02:31:23.680" style="s2">clarified that she wasn&#39;t referring to</p>
<p begin="02:31:21.200" end="02:31:25.840" style="s2">him but to Eric. So Zeke decided to just</p>
<p begin="02:31:23.680" end="02:31:27.760" style="s2">focus on watching the fight. Zeke added</p>
<p begin="02:31:25.840" end="02:31:29.280" style="s2">that in terms of skill alone, North</p>
<p begin="02:31:27.760" end="02:31:31.359" style="s2">Hall&#39;s fighter wasn&#39;t much different</p>
<p begin="02:31:29.280" end="02:31:33.439" style="s2">from Eric and if Eric fought the way he</p>
<p begin="02:31:31.359" end="02:31:35.520" style="s2">normally did, he should be able to win.</p>
<p begin="02:31:33.439" end="02:31:36.880" style="s2">Leica immediately agreed, but pointed</p>
<p begin="02:31:35.520" end="02:31:38.800" style="s2">out that this was their first time</p>
<p begin="02:31:36.880" end="02:31:40.479" style="s2">fighting in front of such a large crowd,</p>
<p begin="02:31:38.800" end="02:31:42.880" style="s2">and the pressure of representing their</p>
<p begin="02:31:40.479" end="02:31:44.640" style="s2">team was also a heavy burden. As Eric</p>
<p begin="02:31:42.880" end="02:31:46.479" style="s2">continued to receive relentless attacks</p>
<p begin="02:31:44.640" end="02:31:48.640" style="s2">from his opponent, Zeke admitted that</p>
<p begin="02:31:46.479" end="02:31:50.640" style="s2">Leica&#39;s words were true, though he also</p>
<p begin="02:31:48.640" end="02:31:52.720" style="s2">mentioned that Sandy and Edgis Vanblade</p>
<p begin="02:31:50.640" end="02:31:54.720" style="s2">were exceptions. Zeke explained that</p>
<p begin="02:31:52.720" end="02:31:56.640" style="s2">both Sandy and Edges were already on the</p>
<p begin="02:31:54.720" end="02:31:58.640" style="s2">verge of reaching the four-star level,</p>
<p begin="02:31:56.640" end="02:32:00.160" style="s2">meaning they wouldn&#39;t be easily shaken.</p>
<p begin="02:31:58.640" end="02:32:02.240" style="s2">He also remembered that Sandy was</p>
