<p begin="02:58:18.240" end="02:58:22.080" style="s2">were filled with admiration and joy as</p>
<p begin="02:58:20.319" end="02:58:24.399" style="s2">they had not expected Zeke to defeat</p>
<p begin="02:58:22.080" end="02:58:26.319" style="s2">Edgis. Leica commented that Zeke had</p>
<p begin="02:58:24.399" end="02:58:28.800" style="s2">once again destroyed the arena and that</p>
<p begin="02:58:26.319" end="02:58:30.720" style="s2">he was strange in so many ways. Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:58:28.800" end="02:58:32.399" style="s2">immediately asked what she meant, adding</p>
<p begin="02:58:30.720" end="02:58:34.319" style="s2">that what mattered most was that he had</p>
<p begin="02:58:32.399" end="02:58:36.000" style="s2">won. He then said that whatever Leica</p>
<p begin="02:58:34.319" end="02:58:37.760" style="s2">meant was not important right now</p>
<p begin="02:58:36.000" end="02:58:39.600" style="s2">because what they needed to focus on was</p>
<p begin="02:58:37.760" end="02:58:42.240" style="s2">watching the upcoming match between West</p>
<p begin="02:58:39.600" end="02:58:44.080" style="s2">Hall and South Hall. That&#39;s right, Lea</p>
<p begin="02:58:42.240" end="02:58:46.160" style="s2">agreed, adding that another candidate</p>
<p begin="02:58:44.080" end="02:58:47.920" style="s2">for the position of family head would be</p>
<p begin="02:58:46.160" end="02:58:50.560" style="s2">participating in the next match none</p>
<p begin="02:58:47.920" end="02:58:52.880" style="s2">other than Vanil Fafnid Eldreon. After</p>
<p begin="02:58:50.560" end="02:58:54.399" style="s2">the battle between Edgis and Zeke, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:58:52.880" end="02:58:56.160" style="s2">asked Rangis if he had gone a bit</p>
<p begin="02:58:54.399" end="02:58:58.080" style="s2">overboard because with that level of</p>
<p begin="02:58:56.160" end="02:59:00.000" style="s2">destruction in the arena, he thought it</p>
<p begin="02:58:58.080" end="02:59:02.319" style="s2">would not be repaired anytime soon.</p>
<p begin="02:59:00.000" end="02:59:03.840" style="s2">However, Rangus told him it was fine and</p>
<p begin="02:59:02.319" end="02:59:06.000" style="s2">asked Zeke to look toward the side of</p>
<p begin="02:59:03.840" end="02:59:07.439" style="s2">the arena. Zeke was completely stunned</p>
<p begin="02:59:06.000" end="02:59:09.120" style="s2">and immediately asked how it was</p>
<p begin="02:59:07.439" end="02:59:11.279" style="s2">possible and how they had managed to</p>
<p begin="02:59:09.120" end="02:59:13.279" style="s2">restore the arena so quickly. Rangus</p>
<p begin="02:59:11.279" end="02:59:14.880" style="s2">then explained that the entire arena had</p>
<p begin="02:59:13.279" end="02:59:16.880" style="s2">been built using a rare stone called</p>
<p begin="02:59:14.880" end="02:59:18.640" style="s2">etherite and when someone infused it</p>
<p begin="02:59:16.880" end="02:59:20.720" style="s2">with source power, it could restore</p>
<p begin="02:59:18.640" end="02:59:22.319" style="s2">itself to its original form. Upon</p>
<p begin="02:59:20.720" end="02:59:24.080" style="s2">hearing this, the protagonist</p>
<p begin="02:59:22.319" end="02:59:25.840" style="s2">immediately realized that this was yet</p>
<p begin="02:59:24.080" end="02:59:27.439" style="s2">another incredible material that had</p>
<p begin="02:59:25.840" end="02:59:29.279" style="s2">appeared during the thousand years he</p>
<p begin="02:59:27.439" end="02:59:31.279" style="s2">had been gone. As Zeke continued to</p>
<p begin="02:59:29.279" end="02:59:33.120" style="s2">marvel at the site, Rangus added that</p>
<p begin="02:59:31.279" end="02:59:34.960" style="s2">using such an expensive material to</p>
<p begin="02:59:33.120" end="02:59:37.600" style="s2">construct an arena of this size was</p>
<p begin="02:59:34.960" end="02:59:39.040" style="s2">truly astonishing. While smiling, Zeke</p>
<p begin="02:59:37.600" end="02:59:41.200" style="s2">said that Westall seemed to have the</p>
<p begin="02:59:39.040" end="02:59:42.479" style="s2">best overall quality, but South Hall</p>
<p begin="02:59:41.200" end="02:59:44.240" style="s2">also had some strong-l lookinging</p>
<p begin="02:59:42.479" end="02:59:46.640" style="s2">fighters. So, he wondered how their</p>
<p begin="02:59:44.240" end="02:59:48.720" style="s2">battle would turn out. However, contrary</p>
<p begin="02:59:46.640" end="02:59:50.640" style="s2">to Zeke&#39;s expectations, the match</p>
<p begin="02:59:48.720" end="02:59:53.040" style="s2">between West Hall and South Hall became</p>
<p begin="02:59:50.640" end="02:59:54.880" style="s2">utterly one-sided. At the conclusion of</p>
<p begin="02:59:53.040" end="02:59:57.200" style="s2">the battle between West Hall and South</p>
<p begin="02:59:54.880" end="02:59:58.960" style="s2">Hall, Mench couldn&#39;t shake off a growing</p>
<p begin="02:59:57.200" end="03:00:01.279" style="s2">sense of doubt. He felt that something</p>
<p begin="02:59:58.960" end="03:00:03.200" style="s2">about Veneil&#39;s match was off. More than</p>
<p begin="03:00:01.279" end="03:00:05.200" style="s2">that, he found it hard to believe how</p>
<p begin="03:00:03.200" end="03:00:06.720" style="s2">overwhelmingly one-sided the fight had</p>
<p begin="03:00:05.200" end="03:00:08.479" style="s2">been. He couldn&#39;t help but question</p>
<p begin="03:00:06.720" end="03:00:10.240" style="s2">whether Venil truly possessed enough</p>
<p begin="03:00:08.479" end="03:00:12.880" style="s2">strength to defeat Llaya Sonar that</p>
<p begin="03:00:10.240" end="03:00:14.560" style="s2">easily. Meanwhile, Vanil calmly asked</p>
<p begin="03:00:12.880" end="03:00:16.720" style="s2">Menrich if he was going to announce the</p>
<p begin="03:00:14.560" end="03:00:18.640" style="s2">winner. Snapping out of his thoughts,</p>
<p begin="03:00:16.720" end="03:00:20.160" style="s2">Mench looked away briefly before</p>
<p begin="03:00:18.640" end="03:00:22.720" style="s2">declaring that the victor of the match</p>
<p begin="03:00:20.160" end="03:00:24.560" style="s2">was West Hall, led by Venil. He then</p>
<p begin="03:00:22.720" end="03:00:26.479" style="s2">added that the final battle between East</p>
<p begin="03:00:24.560" end="03:00:28.399" style="s2">Hall and West Hall would begin in 1</p>
<p begin="03:00:26.479" end="03:00:30.319" style="s2">hour. As the announcement settled over</p>
<p begin="03:00:28.399" end="03:00:32.880" style="s2">the arena, the spectators remained</p>
<p begin="03:00:30.319" end="03:00:34.720" style="s2">unusually quiet, still unable to process</p>
<p begin="03:00:32.880" end="03:00:36.880" style="s2">what they had just witnessed. In</p>
<p begin="03:00:34.720" end="03:00:38.800" style="s2">contrast, Laya&#39;s teammates were deeply</p>
<p begin="03:00:36.880" end="03:00:40.960" style="s2">worried about her condition. One of them</p>
<p begin="03:00:38.800" end="03:00:43.040" style="s2">carried her away carefully while Leica</p>
<p begin="03:00:40.960" end="03:00:44.640" style="s2">stared in disbelief, unable to accept</p>
<p begin="03:00:43.040" end="03:00:47.040" style="s2">that Laya had been defeated so</p>
<p begin="03:00:44.640" end="03:00:49.359" style="s2">effortlessly. Zeke, on the other hand,</p>
<p begin="03:00:47.040" end="03:00:51.359" style="s2">remained silent, observing everything.</p>
<p begin="03:00:49.359" end="03:00:53.120" style="s2">In Zeke&#39;s mind, he was certain something</p>
<p begin="03:00:51.359" end="03:00:54.880" style="s2">was wrong. The gap in strength and</p>
<p begin="03:00:53.120" end="03:00:56.800" style="s2">abilities between Laya and Veneil should</p>
<p begin="03:00:54.880" end="03:00:59.279" style="s2">not have been that wide. Yet, for some</p>
<p begin="03:00:56.800" end="03:01:01.439" style="s2">unknown reason, Laya&#39;s source power flow</p>
<p begin="03:00:59.279" end="03:01:03.040" style="s2">had been completely unstable. In that</p>
<p begin="03:01:01.439" end="03:01:04.319" style="s2">state, there was little doubt that</p>
<p begin="03:01:03.040" end="03:01:06.240" style="s2">something had gone wrong with her</p>
<p begin="03:01:04.319" end="03:01:08.160" style="s2">compared to her normal condition, which</p>
<p begin="03:01:06.240" end="03:01:10.560" style="s2">explained why the fight had ended. so</p>
<p begin="03:01:08.160" end="03:01:13.120" style="s2">one-sidedly. Zeke also suspected that</p>
<p begin="03:01:10.560" end="03:01:15.200" style="s2">Menrich, acting as referee, had noticed</p>
<p begin="03:01:13.120" end="03:01:16.880" style="s2">something unusual. This left him quietly</p>
<p begin="03:01:15.200" end="03:01:19.279" style="s2">wondering what had truly happened during</p>
<p begin="03:01:16.880" end="03:01:20.880" style="s2">Venil and Leela&#39;s battle. Even Reynold</p>
<p begin="03:01:19.279" end="03:01:22.960" style="s2">couldn&#39;t believe that Lady Laya from the</p>
<p begin="03:01:20.880" end="03:01:25.279" style="s2">Sonar family would appear so helpless as</p>
<p begin="03:01:22.960" end="03:01:27.520" style="s2">they had just seen. He remarked that as</p>
<p begin="03:01:25.279" end="03:01:29.279" style="s2">expected, a next head candidate was on a</p>
<p begin="03:01:27.520" end="03:01:31.200" style="s2">completely different level from them.</p>
<p begin="03:01:29.279" end="03:01:33.760" style="s2">However, Selene pointed out that the</p>
<p begin="03:01:31.200" end="03:01:35.760" style="s2">fight had felt too one-sided. Leica</p>
<p begin="03:01:33.760" end="03:01:37.760" style="s2">agreed, but said that perhaps that was</p>
<p begin="03:01:35.760" end="03:01:39.439" style="s2">simply the reality. It was their first</p>
<p begin="03:01:37.760" end="03:01:41.600" style="s2">time witnessing the true strength of the</p>
<p begin="03:01:39.439" end="03:01:43.040" style="s2">prominent figures from other halls. So</p>
<p begin="03:01:41.600" end="03:01:45.359" style="s2">it was difficult to determine whether</p>
<p begin="03:01:43.040" end="03:01:47.040" style="s2">something was actually wrong. Eric then</p>
<p begin="03:01:45.359" end="03:01:49.359" style="s2">mentioned that speaking of next head</p>
<p begin="03:01:47.040" end="03:01:51.920" style="s2">candidates that included Lord Zeke and</p>
<p begin="03:01:49.359" end="03:01:53.920" style="s2">Lady Lea as well, meaning Lord Venil</p>
<p begin="03:01:51.920" end="03:01:56.479" style="s2">must also possess incredible power like</p>
<p begin="03:01:53.920" end="03:01:58.640" style="s2">them. Though hesitant, Seline and Lea</p>
<p begin="03:01:56.479" end="03:02:00.000" style="s2">eventually nodded in agreement. Ranges,</p>
<p begin="03:01:58.640" end="03:02:02.160" style="s2">however, remained silent and</p>
<p begin="03:02:00.000" end="03:02:03.920" style="s2">absent-minded. When Eric asked what was</p>
<p begin="03:02:02.160" end="03:02:05.840" style="s2">troubling him, Rangus said it was</p>
<p begin="03:02:03.920" end="03:02:08.240" style="s2">nothing, just that Lord Veneil was</p>
<p begin="03:02:05.840" end="03:02:10.640" style="s2">astonishingly strong, and in fact,</p>
<p begin="03:02:08.240" end="03:02:12.399" style="s2">everyone from West Hall seemed powerful.</p>
<p begin="03:02:10.640" end="03:02:14.560" style="s2">His words unintentionally dampened</p>
<p begin="03:02:12.399" end="03:02:16.319" style="s2">Reynold&#39;s spirit, prompting Ranges to</p>
<p begin="03:02:14.560" end="03:02:18.240" style="s2">quickly apologize for sounding so</p>
<p begin="03:02:16.319" end="03:02:20.319" style="s2">weak-hearted right before their upcoming</p>
<p begin="03:02:18.240" end="03:02:22.160" style="s2">match. Leica then said that Ranges</p>
<p begin="03:02:20.319" end="03:02:24.000" style="s2">wasn&#39;t wrong. She admitted that she had</p>
<p begin="03:02:22.160" end="03:02:25.920" style="s2">lost her last match, too. And as</p>
<p begin="03:02:24.000" end="03:02:28.080" style="s2">frustrating as it was, she was still</p>
<p begin="03:02:25.920" end="03:02:30.000" style="s2">nowhere near West Hall&#39;s level. Eric</p>
<p begin="03:02:28.080" end="03:02:32.000" style="s2">responded that if Leica was saying that</p>
<p begin="03:02:30.000" end="03:02:34.160" style="s2">then he felt the same. He couldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="03:02:32.000" end="03:02:37.040" style="s2">defeat any of them despite having more</p>
<p begin="03:02:34.160" end="03:02:38.880" style="s2">stars. Even so, he had no intention of</p>
<p begin="03:02:37.040" end="03:02:40.399" style="s2">losing. Just like Rangis and the others</p>
<p begin="03:02:38.880" end="03:02:42.399" style="s2">who managed to overcome stronger</p>
<p begin="03:02:40.399" end="03:02:44.479" style="s2">opponents, he wanted to do the same.</p>
<p begin="03:02:42.399" end="03:02:46.720" style="s2">They could still defeat West Hall. His</p>
<p begin="03:02:44.479" end="03:02:48.479" style="s2">determination reignited Seline&#39;s spirit.</p>
<p begin="03:02:46.720" end="03:02:50.240" style="s2">As Zeke watched them, he thought that</p>
<p begin="03:02:48.479" end="03:02:52.160" style="s2">their fighting spirit was finally in the</p>
<p begin="03:02:50.240" end="03:02:54.399" style="s2">right place. It seemed that Marin and</p>
<p begin="03:02:52.160" end="03:02:56.080" style="s2">Eric might truly grow from this battle.</p>
<p begin="03:02:54.399" end="03:02:58.560" style="s2">However, the bigger concern right now</p>
<p begin="03:02:56.080" end="03:03:00.640" style="s2">was Leica. To Zeke, it didn&#39;t seem like</p>
<p begin="03:02:58.560" end="03:03:02.560" style="s2">Leica had noticed Yla&#39;s abnormal source</p>
<p begin="03:03:00.640" end="03:03:04.240" style="s2">power at all. If she believed everything</p>
<p begin="03:03:02.560" end="03:03:06.240" style="s2">that happened was purely Vanil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:03:04.240" end="03:03:08.319" style="s2">strength, then her shaken reaction made</p>
<p begin="03:03:06.240" end="03:03:10.319" style="s2">sense. But since Zeke himself didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:03:08.319" end="03:03:12.479" style="s2">know the full details, he couldn&#39;t offer</p>
<p begin="03:03:10.319" end="03:03:14.640" style="s2">careless advice. He quietly wondered</p>
<p begin="03:03:12.479" end="03:03:17.040" style="s2">what he should do. Rangus soon noticed</p>
<p begin="03:03:14.640" end="03:03:19.040" style="s2">Lea&#39;s unusual expression and asked if</p>
<p begin="03:03:17.040" end="03:03:20.880" style="s2">she was all right. Lea immediately</p>
<p begin="03:03:19.040" end="03:03:22.720" style="s2">replied that she was fine and as she</p>
<p begin="03:03:20.880" end="03:03:24.800" style="s2">walked away said she just needed to</p>
<p begin="03:03:22.720" end="03:03:27.120" style="s2">clear her head. Later, in a garden</p>
<p begin="03:03:24.800" end="03:03:29.040" style="s2">outside the arena, Leica sat alone by a</p>
<p begin="03:03:27.120" end="03:03:30.640" style="s2">fountain. She couldn&#39;t believe that</p>
<p begin="03:03:29.040" end="03:03:32.800" style="s2">Veneil had grown strong enough to</p>
<p begin="03:03:30.640" end="03:03:34.640" style="s2">overwhelm Laya the way he did. Even</p>
<p begin="03:03:32.800" end="03:03:36.479" style="s2">Edgis had been unable to completely</p>
<p begin="03:03:34.640" end="03:03:38.160" style="s2">overpower Laya without suffering a</p>
<p begin="03:03:36.479" end="03:03:40.399" style="s2">scratch. Yet, Venil had done it</p>
<p begin="03:03:38.160" end="03:03:42.399" style="s2">effortlessly. The last time Lea fought</p>
<p begin="03:03:40.399" end="03:03:44.880" style="s2">Veneil was when they were 5 years old,</p>
<p begin="03:03:42.399" end="03:03:47.120" style="s2">and she had lost. Since then, she had</p>
<p begin="03:03:44.880" end="03:03:49.279" style="s2">trained relentlessly, determined to one</p>
<p begin="03:03:47.120" end="03:03:50.880" style="s2">day defeat him. She had believed she had</p>
<p begin="03:03:49.279" end="03:03:52.240" style="s2">finally caught up. Yet, what she</p>
<p begin="03:03:50.880" end="03:03:54.240" style="s2">witnessed today shattered that</p>
<p begin="03:03:52.240" end="03:03:56.479" style="s2">confidence. If the match order remained</p>
<p begin="03:03:54.240" end="03:03:59.200" style="s2">unchanged, Vanil&#39;s opponent would likely</p>
<p begin="03:03:56.479" end="03:04:00.880" style="s2">be Zeke. Strangely, she felt relieved at</p>
<p begin="03:03:59.200" end="03:04:02.800" style="s2">that thought since it meant she wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:04:00.880" end="03:04:04.880" style="s2">have to face Venil herself, but she</p>
<p begin="03:04:02.800" end="03:04:06.479" style="s2">hated herself for feeling that relief.</p>
<p begin="03:04:04.880" end="03:04:08.800" style="s2">It was as if she had already admitted</p>
<p begin="03:04:06.479" end="03:04:11.200" style="s2">defeat despite her long-standing desire</p>
<p begin="03:04:08.800" end="03:04:12.640" style="s2">to overcome him. Suddenly, Vanil</p>
<p begin="03:04:11.200" end="03:04:15.040" style="s2">appeared and asked what she was doing</p>
<p begin="03:04:12.640" end="03:04:16.800" style="s2">there. With a mocking tone, he commented</p>
<p begin="03:04:15.040" end="03:04:18.960" style="s2">that she looked awfully serious while</p>
<p begin="03:04:16.800" end="03:04:20.800" style="s2">sitting alone. Lea&#39;s eyes narrowed as</p>
<p begin="03:04:18.960" end="03:04:22.800" style="s2">she demanded to know what he wanted,</p>
<p begin="03:04:20.800" end="03:04:24.640" style="s2">stating that they had nothing to discuss</p>
<p begin="03:04:22.800" end="03:04:26.720" style="s2">and that she had no intention of talking</p>
<p begin="03:04:24.640" end="03:04:28.640" style="s2">to him. Veneil smirked and told her not</p>
<p begin="03:04:26.720" end="03:04:30.800" style="s2">to be so prickly. If he became the head</p>
<p begin="03:04:28.640" end="03:04:33.359" style="s2">of the Eldreon family, she might end up</p>
<p begin="03:04:30.800" end="03:04:35.200" style="s2">as his wife. At those words, Leica stood</p>
<p begin="03:04:33.359" end="03:04:36.800" style="s2">abruptly and told him to be silent,</p>
<p begin="03:04:35.200" end="03:04:39.040" style="s2">declaring that she would be the one to</p>
<p begin="03:04:36.800" end="03:04:40.960" style="s2">become family head. She began walking</p>
<p begin="03:04:39.040" end="03:04:42.960" style="s2">away, but Venil stopped her with his</p>
<p begin="03:04:40.960" end="03:04:44.640" style="s2">words. He said he knew she was thinking</p>
<p begin="03:04:42.960" end="03:04:46.319" style="s2">that she couldn&#39;t defeat him. He</p>
<p begin="03:04:44.640" end="03:04:48.399" style="s2">couldn&#39;t blame her since she had failed</p>
<p begin="03:04:46.319" end="03:04:50.479" style="s2">to beat him back then either. Surely she</p>
<p begin="03:04:48.399" end="03:04:51.920" style="s2">had seen what he did to Laya. As he</p>
<p begin="03:04:50.479" end="03:04:53.760" style="s2">casually draped an arm over her</p>
<p begin="03:04:51.920" end="03:04:55.200" style="s2">shoulder, he said he was certain she was</p>
