<p begin="03:04:59.680" end="03:05:04.000" style="s2">quiet. Vanil then bluntly stated that</p>
<p begin="03:05:01.760" end="03:05:06.080" style="s2">she should just admit it back then, now</p>
<p begin="03:05:04.000" end="03:05:08.000" style="s2">and forever. She would never surpass</p>
<p begin="03:05:06.080" end="03:05:10.000" style="s2">him. He told her to give up and submit</p>
<p begin="03:05:08.000" end="03:05:11.600" style="s2">to him, promising that if she did, he</p>
<p begin="03:05:10.000" end="03:05:13.760" style="s2">would treat her well. Tightening his</p>
<p begin="03:05:11.600" end="03:05:15.439" style="s2">grip on her shoulder as he spoke. Lea</p>
<p begin="03:05:13.760" end="03:05:17.520" style="s2">immediately shoved his hand away and</p>
<p begin="03:05:15.439" end="03:05:19.279" style="s2">shouted at him to stop talking. Veneil</p>
<p begin="03:05:17.520" end="03:05:21.760" style="s2">merely remarked that her reaction wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:05:19.279" end="03:05:24.319" style="s2">cute at all. Without another word, Leica</p>
<p begin="03:05:21.760" end="03:05:25.840" style="s2">walked away. As she left, Venil coldly</p>
<p begin="03:05:24.319" end="03:05:27.279" style="s2">muttered that after placing his arm</p>
<p begin="03:05:25.840" end="03:05:29.120" style="s2">around her and gripping her shoulder</p>
<p begin="03:05:27.279" end="03:05:30.880" style="s2">like that, it was already the end for</p>
<p begin="03:05:29.120" end="03:05:32.479" style="s2">her. He then turned to his subordinate</p>
<p begin="03:05:30.880" end="03:05:34.319" style="s2">and said they both knew what needed to</p>
<p begin="03:05:32.479" end="03:05:35.920" style="s2">be done next. The subordinate replied</p>
<p begin="03:05:34.319" end="03:05:37.520" style="s2">that Venil could leave everything to</p>
<p begin="03:05:35.920" end="03:05:39.040" style="s2">them. He then asked whether they</p>
