<p begin="03:05:43.359" end="03:05:46.880" style="s2">they could handle Zeke during the match</p>
<p begin="03:05:45.120" end="03:05:48.479" style="s2">or even set things up while fighting</p>
<p begin="03:05:46.880" end="03:05:50.720" style="s2">him. Although he admitted it would be</p>
