<p begin="03:06:57.760" end="03:07:01.359" style="s2">and loudly asked what had happened to</p>
<p begin="03:06:59.439" end="03:07:03.040" style="s2">all the confidence he had shown earlier.</p>
<p begin="03:07:01.359" end="03:07:05.279" style="s2">When Eric admitted that it had only been</p>
<p begin="03:07:03.040" end="03:07:07.200" style="s2">an act, Zeke shouted and asked him why</p>
<p begin="03:07:05.279" end="03:07:09.359" style="s2">he was even fighting in the first place.</p>
<p begin="03:07:07.200" end="03:07:11.359" style="s2">Was he fighting just to lose? Eric</p>
<p begin="03:07:09.359" end="03:07:13.520" style="s2">immediately replied that it was not like</p>
<p begin="03:07:11.359" end="03:07:15.359" style="s2">that. Zeke then told him that if he was</p>
<p begin="03:07:13.520" end="03:07:17.040" style="s2">going to fight, then regardless of the</p>
<p begin="03:07:15.359" end="03:07:18.800" style="s2">difference in strength, he had to fight</p>
<p begin="03:07:17.040" end="03:07:21.120" style="s2">to win, and that was what truly</p>
<p begin="03:07:18.800" end="03:07:22.960" style="s2">mattered. Because of those words, even</p>
<p begin="03:07:21.120" end="03:07:24.800" style="s2">though a large bump had formed on Eric&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:07:22.960" end="03:07:27.279" style="s2">head from the punch, he suddenly felt</p>
<p begin="03:07:24.800" end="03:07:29.600" style="s2">his spirit rise again and said that Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:07:27.279" end="03:07:31.680" style="s2">was right. He was going to fight to win.</p>
<p begin="03:07:29.600" end="03:07:33.760" style="s2">Zeke laughed and told him that was more</p>
<p begin="03:07:31.680" end="03:07:36.479" style="s2">like it. Eric needed to have confidence</p>
<p begin="03:07:33.760" end="03:07:38.479" style="s2">in himself. After all, Eric had trained</p>
<p begin="03:07:36.479" end="03:07:40.560" style="s2">hard before, so he should believe in his</p>
<p begin="03:07:38.479" end="03:07:42.080" style="s2">own abilities. Eric quickly agreed with</p>
<p begin="03:07:40.560" end="03:07:44.640" style="s2">everything Zeke had said and thanked</p>
<p begin="03:07:42.080" end="03:07:46.240" style="s2">him. Suddenly, however, Eric fell silent</p>
