<p begin="03:08:10.160" end="03:08:14.319" style="s2">win his fight. Zeke replied that was</p>
<p begin="03:08:12.399" end="03:08:16.240" style="s2">good, then told Eric to go out there and</p>
<p begin="03:08:14.319" end="03:08:18.160" style="s2">win. As Eric walked toward the middle of</p>
