<p begin="03:08:34.000" end="03:08:37.600" style="s2">a foolish question. Then he calmly said</p>
<p begin="03:08:36.240" end="03:08:40.080" style="s2">that the answer should be obvious</p>
<p begin="03:08:37.600" end="03:08:41.600" style="s2">because he was Zeke. Hearing that, Leica</p>
<p begin="03:08:40.080" end="03:08:43.120" style="s2">could not believe she had even bothered</p>
<p begin="03:08:41.600" end="03:08:45.760" style="s2">asking such a question in the first</p>
