<p begin="03:08:53.600" end="03:08:58.319" style="s2">earlier match. Even so, this time, Eric</p>
<p begin="03:08:56.240" end="03:09:00.720" style="s2">felt confident that he would not lose.</p>
<p begin="03:08:58.319" end="03:09:02.560" style="s2">Just then, Eric&#39;s opponent mocked him,</p>
<p begin="03:09:00.720" end="03:09:04.319" style="s2">saying that Eric was acting pretty cocky</p>
<p begin="03:09:02.560" end="03:09:06.479" style="s2">for someone who had lost to a North Hall</p>
<p begin="03:09:04.319" end="03:09:08.479" style="s2">punk before. Eric firmly told him to</p>
<p begin="03:09:06.479" end="03:09:10.720" style="s2">shut up, saying that he was not the same</p>
<p begin="03:09:08.479" end="03:09:12.479" style="s2">person he had been back then. Still, his</p>
<p begin="03:09:10.720" end="03:09:14.479" style="s2">opponent questioned whether Eric was</p>
<p begin="03:09:12.479" end="03:09:16.319" style="s2">really so sure about that. At that</p>
<p begin="03:09:14.479" end="03:09:18.080" style="s2">moment, Metric announced that the first</p>
<p begin="03:09:16.319" end="03:09:19.760" style="s2">match between East Hall and West Hall</p>
<p begin="03:09:18.080" end="03:09:21.840" style="s2">would now begin. Eric&#39;s opponent</p>
<p begin="03:09:19.760" end="03:09:23.439" style="s2">immediately launched forward. Eric was</p>
<p begin="03:09:21.840" end="03:09:25.279" style="s2">momentarily shocked by the man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:09:23.439" end="03:09:27.200" style="s2">incredible speed, and before he could</p>
