<p begin="03:09:27.200" end="03:09:31.040" style="s2">insect brawl dagger technique called</p>
<p begin="03:09:28.960" end="03:09:32.640" style="s2">Mantis Slash to attack. While saying</p>
<p begin="03:09:31.040" end="03:09:34.880" style="s2">that someone like Eric could never</p>
<p begin="03:09:32.640" end="03:09:36.399" style="s2">change in just a few hours, Eric was</p>
