<p begin="03:09:36.399" end="03:09:39.920" style="s2">attack. His opponent could not believe</p>
<p begin="03:09:38.160" end="03:09:42.479" style="s2">that Eric had managed to defend himself</p>
<p begin="03:09:39.920" end="03:09:44.319" style="s2">using his aura. Nevertheless, he did not</p>
