<p begin="03:10:22.880" end="03:10:26.399" style="s2">received another blow from his opponent,</p>
<p begin="03:10:24.720" end="03:10:28.319" style="s2">who confidently declared that there was</p>
<p begin="03:10:26.399" end="03:10:30.479" style="s2">no way an attack like Eric&#39;s would ever</p>
<p begin="03:10:28.319" end="03:10:32.399" style="s2">hit him. Eric realized that at this</p>
