<p begin="03:10:59.120" end="03:11:03.600" style="s2">flash in an attempt to break through</p>
<p begin="03:11:00.880" end="03:11:06.000" style="s2">Eric&#39;s defense. However, after taking</p>
<p begin="03:11:03.600" end="03:11:07.760" style="s2">the attack headon, Eric suddenly smiled</p>
<p begin="03:11:06.000" end="03:11:09.439" style="s2">and said that he had finally caught him.</p>
<p begin="03:11:07.760" end="03:11:11.439" style="s2">His opponent was shocked when Eric</p>
<p begin="03:11:09.439" end="03:11:12.880" style="s2">grabbed and restrained his weapon. Eric</p>
<p begin="03:11:11.439" end="03:11:15.040" style="s2">then declared that it was time for him</p>
<p begin="03:11:12.880" end="03:11:17.200" style="s2">to take Eric&#39;s attack. Gathering all the</p>
