<p begin="03:11:17.200" end="03:11:21.680" style="s2">Eric unleashed the great power fist</p>
<p begin="03:11:19.040" end="03:11:23.600" style="s2">technique called great power fist. The</p>
<p begin="03:11:21.680" end="03:11:25.439" style="s2">powerful blow sent his opponent flying</p>
<p begin="03:11:23.600" end="03:11:27.760" style="s2">straight into the wall of the arena. The</p>
