<p begin="03:11:31.439" end="03:11:35.840" style="s2">was Eric from East Hall. Eric&#39;s opponent</p>
<p begin="03:11:33.760" end="03:11:38.000" style="s2">had lost consciousness. His eyes rolled</p>
