<p begin="03:17:48.640" end="03:17:53.040" style="s2">technique a few years ago after reading</p>
<p begin="03:17:50.720" end="03:17:54.399" style="s2">many books. As Rangus wondered where he</p>
<p begin="03:17:53.040" end="03:17:56.560" style="s2">should even begin commenting on what</p>
<p begin="03:17:54.399" end="03:17:58.560" style="s2">Zeke had just done, Zeke told him that</p>
<p begin="03:17:56.560" end="03:18:00.319" style="s2">more importantly, the reason he used the</p>
<p begin="03:17:58.560" end="03:18:02.560" style="s2">technique was to give Ranges a piece of</p>
<p begin="03:18:00.319" end="03:18:04.720" style="s2">advice. When Rangis asked what advice he</p>
<p begin="03:18:02.560" end="03:18:07.040" style="s2">meant, Zeke said, &quot;There is a saying,</p>
<p begin="03:18:04.720" end="03:18:09.120" style="s2">clouds drift freely and water flows</p>
<p begin="03:18:07.040" end="03:18:11.760" style="s2">gently.&quot; Rangis began wondering what</p>
<p begin="03:18:09.120" end="03:18:13.680" style="s2">exactly Zeke meant by that proverb. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:18:11.760" end="03:18:15.680" style="s2">continued saying that clouds drift</p>
<p begin="03:18:13.680" end="03:18:17.840" style="s2">without a care and water flows ever so</p>
<p begin="03:18:15.680" end="03:18:19.439" style="s2">gently. He added that whenever Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:18:17.840" end="03:18:21.760" style="s2">was struggling, he should picture that</p>
<p begin="03:18:19.439" end="03:18:24.000" style="s2">image in his mind. Just then, Menrich</p>
<p begin="03:18:21.760" end="03:18:25.520" style="s2">asked what Rangis was doing. Rangus</p>
<p begin="03:18:24.000" end="03:18:27.760" style="s2">immediately apologized and quickly</p>
<p begin="03:18:25.520" end="03:18:29.200" style="s2">assumed his battle stance. Menrich then</p>
<p begin="03:18:27.760" end="03:18:31.439" style="s2">announced that the second battle between</p>
<p begin="03:18:29.200" end="03:18:32.800" style="s2">West Hall and East Hall would begin. The</p>
<p begin="03:18:31.439" end="03:18:34.800" style="s2">moment Rangas heard the start of the</p>
<p begin="03:18:32.800" end="03:18:36.960" style="s2">match, he moved forward and used his</p>
<p begin="03:18:34.800" end="03:18:39.439" style="s2">cloudwater spear style technique called</p>
<p begin="03:18:36.960" end="03:18:41.760" style="s2">water pierce to attack Retin. Retin was</p>
<p begin="03:18:39.439" end="03:18:43.359" style="s2">briefly surprised by Ranjas&#39; speed, but</p>
<p begin="03:18:41.760" end="03:18:45.279" style="s2">he easily countered the attack and</p>
<p begin="03:18:43.359" end="03:18:47.520" style="s2">deflected the spear. Rettton then told</p>
<p begin="03:18:45.279" end="03:18:49.439" style="s2">Ranjis not to get cocky, calling him a</p>
<p begin="03:18:47.520" end="03:18:51.040" style="s2">little weakling, he used his serpent</p>
<p begin="03:18:49.439" end="03:18:53.200" style="s2">strike sword style technique called</p>
<p begin="03:18:51.040" end="03:18:55.200" style="s2">ambush pierce. His aura took the shape</p>
<p begin="03:18:53.200" end="03:18:57.600" style="s2">of a snake as it shot directly toward</p>
<p begin="03:18:55.200" end="03:18:59.439" style="s2">Rangus&#39; chest. As Ranges defended</p>
<p begin="03:18:57.600" end="03:19:01.600" style="s2">himself against the attack, Rhett</p>
<p begin="03:18:59.439" end="03:19:03.680" style="s2">sneered and said that was all Ranges had</p>
<p begin="03:19:01.600" end="03:19:05.760" style="s2">behind his big talk. He mocked him</p>
<p begin="03:19:03.680" end="03:19:07.520" style="s2">further, saying Rangus looked pathetic</p>
<p begin="03:19:05.760" end="03:19:09.840" style="s2">and calling him a little runt as he</p>
<p begin="03:19:07.520" end="03:19:12.080" style="s2">charged forward to attack again. Rangus</p>
<p begin="03:19:09.840" end="03:19:14.479" style="s2">remained silent, raising his spear once</p>
<p begin="03:19:12.080" end="03:19:16.560" style="s2">more to prepare for the incoming strike.</p>
<p begin="03:19:14.479" end="03:19:18.000" style="s2">However, when Retin used another serpent</p>
<p begin="03:19:16.560" end="03:19:20.399" style="s2">strike sword style technique called</p>
<p begin="03:19:18.000" end="03:19:22.399" style="s2">serpentine slash, Rangus was caught off</p>
<p begin="03:19:20.399" end="03:19:24.399" style="s2">guard. The attack twisted and curved</p>
<p begin="03:19:22.399" end="03:19:26.239" style="s2">like a snake, making it impossible for</p>
<p begin="03:19:24.399" end="03:19:28.319" style="s2">him to block properly, and he was struck</p>
<p begin="03:19:26.239" end="03:19:29.680" style="s2">in the side. Ranges immediately thought</p>
<p begin="03:19:28.319" end="03:19:31.760" style="s2">that he was certain he had defended</p>
<p begin="03:19:29.680" end="03:19:33.359" style="s2">against the attack. Yet somehow Retton</p>
<p begin="03:19:31.760" end="03:19:35.760" style="s2">had changed the direction of his strike</p>
<p begin="03:19:33.359" end="03:19:37.279" style="s2">mid attack. Retin mockingly asked what</p>
<p begin="03:19:35.760" end="03:19:39.279" style="s2">was wrong with him and told Ranges to</p>
<p begin="03:19:37.279" end="03:19:41.520" style="s2">try hitting him back if he even could.</p>
<p begin="03:19:39.279" end="03:19:42.880" style="s2">Determined not to lose, Rangess declared</p>
<p begin="03:19:41.520" end="03:19:44.800" style="s2">that he could still attack and hit</p>
<p begin="03:19:42.880" end="03:19:47.120" style="s2">Retin. He immediately used another</p>
<p begin="03:19:44.800" end="03:19:49.200" style="s2">cloudwater spear style technique called</p>
<p begin="03:19:47.120" end="03:19:51.120" style="s2">flowing clouds and water. But before</p>
<p begin="03:19:49.200" end="03:19:53.359" style="s2">their weapons could clash, Retin</p>
<p begin="03:19:51.120" end="03:19:55.359" style="s2">suddenly smiled. In the next instant,</p>
<p begin="03:19:53.359" end="03:19:57.760" style="s2">his attack curved again and changed</p>
<p begin="03:19:55.359" end="03:19:59.840" style="s2">direction, striking Rangus once more and</p>
<p begin="03:19:57.760" end="03:20:01.439" style="s2">sending him flying away. The explosion</p>
<p begin="03:19:59.840" end="03:20:03.439" style="s2">that followed caused Leica and the</p>
<p begin="03:20:01.439" end="03:20:05.279" style="s2">others to worry greatly while Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:20:03.439" end="03:20:07.359" style="s2">simply remained silent as he watched the</p>
<p begin="03:20:05.279" end="03:20:09.040" style="s2">battle. After the dust slowly cleared,</p>
<p begin="03:20:07.359" end="03:20:10.800" style="s2">Ranges could be seen kneeling on the</p>
<p begin="03:20:09.040" end="03:20:12.479" style="s2">ground while holding onto his spear.</p>
<p begin="03:20:10.800" end="03:20:14.319" style="s2">Ranges thought to himself that he had</p>
<p begin="03:20:12.479" end="03:20:16.319" style="s2">tried to deflect and counter Retin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:20:14.319" end="03:20:18.399" style="s2">attacks, but every move he made was</p>
<p begin="03:20:16.319" end="03:20:20.160" style="s2">being turned against him. Retin asked if</p>
<p begin="03:20:18.399" end="03:20:22.160" style="s2">Rangus had been thinking about using his</p>
<p begin="03:20:20.160" end="03:20:24.479" style="s2">movements to counterattack. Laughing</p>
<p begin="03:20:22.160" end="03:20:26.640" style="s2">mockingly, he told Rangis to give him a</p>
<p begin="03:20:24.479" end="03:20:28.399" style="s2">break. He called Rangis a poor guy</p>
<p begin="03:20:26.640" end="03:20:30.160" style="s2">before revealing that his specialty was</p>
<p begin="03:20:28.399" end="03:20:32.080" style="s2">countering. Retin then said it was</p>
<p begin="03:20:30.160" end="03:20:34.160" style="s2">unfortunate for Rangis because he was</p>
<p begin="03:20:32.080" end="03:20:36.239" style="s2">several levels above him in every way.</p>
<p begin="03:20:34.160" end="03:20:38.080" style="s2">Meanwhile, Rangis struggled to stay</p>
<p begin="03:20:36.239" end="03:20:39.680" style="s2">standing, gripping his spear so he</p>
<p begin="03:20:38.080" end="03:20:42.239" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t collapse. He said that what</p>
<p begin="03:20:39.680" end="03:20:44.399" style="s2">Retin claimed was impossible. However,</p>
<p begin="03:20:42.239" end="03:20:46.319" style="s2">Retin suddenly stepped forward, grabbed</p>
<p begin="03:20:44.399" end="03:20:48.000" style="s2">Rangas by the hair, and said he didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:20:46.319" end="03:20:50.319" style="s2">know what kind of delusion Rangis was</p>
<p begin="03:20:48.000" end="03:20:52.000" style="s2">living in. He mockingly declared that a</p>
<p begin="03:20:50.319" end="03:20:54.560" style="s2">child of a pseudo dragon could never</p>
<p begin="03:20:52.000" end="03:20:56.479" style="s2">become strong. According to him, Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:20:54.560" end="03:20:58.720" style="s2">was nothing in the end, just a weakling</p>
<p begin="03:20:56.479" end="03:21:00.800" style="s2">like his father. Even while struggling,</p>
<p begin="03:20:58.720" end="03:21:02.720" style="s2">Rang told Rhett not to dare insult his</p>
<p begin="03:21:00.800" end="03:21:04.640" style="s2">father. But while holding Ranges by the</p>
<p begin="03:21:02.720" end="03:21:06.960" style="s2">hair, Reton punched him in the face and</p>
<p begin="03:21:04.640" end="03:21:08.960" style="s2">called him a fake dragon. Ranges fell to</p>
<p begin="03:21:06.960" end="03:21:10.640" style="s2">the ground. Yet, Retin continued kicking</p>
<p begin="03:21:08.960" end="03:21:12.720" style="s2">and attacking him repeatedly while</p>
<p begin="03:21:10.640" end="03:21:14.720" style="s2">shouting that a fake dragon like Ranges</p>
<p begin="03:21:12.720" end="03:21:16.640" style="s2">could never defeat the real thing. As</p>
<p begin="03:21:14.720" end="03:21:18.560" style="s2">Ranges continued to receive heavy blows</p>
<p begin="03:21:16.640" end="03:21:20.720" style="s2">from Retin, he began to think to himself</p>
<p begin="03:21:18.560" end="03:21:22.560" style="s2">that he really was hopeless after all.</p>
<p begin="03:21:20.720" end="03:21:24.000" style="s2">He thought he had grown stronger, but</p>
<p begin="03:21:22.560" end="03:21:26.239" style="s2">perhaps it had all been a delusion</p>
<p begin="03:21:24.000" end="03:21:27.760" style="s2">because he was still weak. Tears slowly</p>
<p begin="03:21:26.239" end="03:21:29.520" style="s2">streamed down his face as the thought</p>
<p begin="03:21:27.760" end="03:21:32.239" style="s2">echoed in his mind that he was just a</p>
<p begin="03:21:29.520" end="03:21:34.479" style="s2">fake dragon after all. At that moment, a</p>
<p begin="03:21:32.239" end="03:21:35.920" style="s2">memory resurfaced. It was a time when he</p>
<p begin="03:21:34.479" end="03:21:37.680" style="s2">and his father were fishing by the</p>
<p begin="03:21:35.920" end="03:21:40.080" style="s2">riverbank. His father had asked if</p>
<p begin="03:21:37.680" end="03:21:41.920" style="s2">Rangus liked fishing and Rangus&#39; father</p>
<p begin="03:21:40.080" end="03:21:44.000" style="s2">said that he liked it too. He told</p>
<p begin="03:21:41.920" end="03:21:45.760" style="s2">Rangus that as he could see he loved</p>
<p begin="03:21:44.000" end="03:21:47.680" style="s2">fishing while gazing at the clouds in</p>
<p begin="03:21:45.760" end="03:21:50.000" style="s2">the flowing water just like he was doing</p>
<p begin="03:21:47.680" end="03:21:51.840" style="s2">at that moment. When Rangus asked if his</p>
<p begin="03:21:50.000" end="03:21:53.520" style="s2">father liked clouds and water, his</p>
<p begin="03:21:51.840" end="03:21:55.840" style="s2">father smiled and said that clouds</p>
<p begin="03:21:53.520" end="03:21:57.920" style="s2">always drift so serenely and the river</p>
<p begin="03:21:55.840" end="03:22:00.000" style="s2">water continues flowing endlessly.</p>
<p begin="03:21:57.920" end="03:22:02.000" style="s2">Watching them, he said, made him realize</p>
<p begin="03:22:00.000" end="03:22:04.319" style="s2">that human worries were actually very</p>
<p begin="03:22:02.000" end="03:22:06.160" style="s2">small and trivial things. When Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:22:04.319" end="03:22:08.080" style="s2">asked what he meant, his father simply</p>
<p begin="03:22:06.160" end="03:22:09.840" style="s2">replied that maybe someday Rangis would</p>
<p begin="03:22:08.080" end="03:22:11.760" style="s2">understand it as well. Back in the</p>
<p begin="03:22:09.840" end="03:22:13.279" style="s2">present, Rangus lay on the ground</p>
<p begin="03:22:11.760" end="03:22:15.359" style="s2">covered in blood as he whispered the</p>
<p begin="03:22:13.279" end="03:22:17.200" style="s2">words drifting and flowing. Menrich</p>
<p begin="03:22:15.359" end="03:22:19.520" style="s2">remained silent as he carefully observed</p>
<p begin="03:22:17.200" end="03:22:21.359" style="s2">the battle. Soon after, Retin grabbed</p>
<p begin="03:22:19.520" end="03:22:23.279" style="s2">Rangis again and declared that this was</p>
<p begin="03:22:21.359" end="03:22:25.040" style="s2">where their fight would end. As Retin</p>
<p begin="03:22:23.279" end="03:22:26.880" style="s2">gathered his aura into his fist for the</p>
<p begin="03:22:25.040" end="03:22:28.960" style="s2">finishing blow, he said that a fake</p>
<p begin="03:22:26.880" end="03:22:30.399" style="s2">dragon would always remain a fake. He</p>
<p begin="03:22:28.960" end="03:22:32.319" style="s2">added that Rang should crawl through</p>
<p begin="03:22:30.399" end="03:22:34.399" style="s2">life on his hands and knees. But when</p>
<p begin="03:22:32.319" end="03:22:36.560" style="s2">Rangis opened his eyes, he remembered</p>
<p begin="03:22:34.399" end="03:22:39.040" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s words before the battle began.</p>
<p begin="03:22:36.560" end="03:22:40.880" style="s2">Just like water flowing gently, Rangis&#39;</p>
<p begin="03:22:39.040" end="03:22:43.120" style="s2">aura began to flow smoothly through his</p>
<p begin="03:22:40.880" end="03:22:45.359" style="s2">body. Before Retin&#39;s attack could land,</p>
<p begin="03:22:43.120" end="03:22:47.600" style="s2">Rangis managed to block it. Rhettton did</p>
<p begin="03:22:45.359" end="03:22:49.600" style="s2">not expect Ranges&#39;s sudden defense, and</p>
<p begin="03:22:47.600" end="03:22:51.520" style="s2">upon sensing the aura coming from him,</p>
<p begin="03:22:49.600" end="03:22:53.840" style="s2">he quickly stepped back and retreated to</p>
<p begin="03:22:51.520" end="03:22:55.680" style="s2">pick up his sword. Meanwhile, Menrix</p>
<p begin="03:22:53.840" end="03:22:57.680" style="s2">smiled in surprise at the unexpected</p>
<p begin="03:22:55.680" end="03:22:59.520" style="s2">turn of events. He had just seen the</p>
<p begin="03:22:57.680" end="03:23:01.520" style="s2">third star on Ranges&#39;s chest shine</p>
<p begin="03:22:59.520" end="03:23:03.200" style="s2">brightly. Clear proof that Ranges had</p>
<p begin="03:23:01.520" end="03:23:04.640" style="s2">broken through to the three-star level</p>
<p begin="03:23:03.200" end="03:23:06.640" style="s2">right in the middle of his battle with</p>
<p begin="03:23:04.640" end="03:23:08.720" style="s2">Retin. Rhettin&#39;s face darkened</p>
<p begin="03:23:06.640" end="03:23:10.800" style="s2">instantly, his expression twisting with</p>
<p begin="03:23:08.720" end="03:23:12.479" style="s2">rage at what he had just witnessed. More</p>
<p begin="03:23:10.800" end="03:23:14.319" style="s2">than anything, he could not believe that</p>
<p begin="03:23:12.479" end="03:23:15.920" style="s2">Rangis had actually broken through to</p>
<p begin="03:23:14.319" end="03:23:17.920" style="s2">the three-star level in the middle of</p>
<p begin="03:23:15.920" end="03:23:20.319" style="s2">their battle. The realization only</p>
<p begin="03:23:17.920" end="03:23:22.160" style="s2">fueled his anger. Further, he refused to</p>
<p begin="03:23:20.319" end="03:23:24.239" style="s2">accept that Rangus now stood on the same</p>
<p begin="03:23:22.160" end="03:23:26.080" style="s2">level as him. There&#39;s no way some fake</p>
<p begin="03:23:24.239" end="03:23:28.160" style="s2">is standing on the same level as me.</p>
<p begin="03:23:26.080" end="03:23:30.160" style="s2">Retin snarled, declaring that he would</p>
<p begin="03:23:28.160" end="03:23:32.000" style="s2">never acknowledge it. As he prepared to</p>
<p begin="03:23:30.160" end="03:23:34.000" style="s2">strike again, he shouted that he would</p>
<p begin="03:23:32.000" end="03:23:36.080" style="s2">never accept that someone he once mocked</p>
<p begin="03:23:34.000" end="03:23:38.239" style="s2">had reached the same three-star rank.</p>
<p begin="03:23:36.080" end="03:23:40.720" style="s2">Without hesitation, Retin unleashed his</p>
<p begin="03:23:38.239" end="03:23:42.319" style="s2">serpent strike swordstyle serpentine/</p>
<p begin="03:23:40.720" end="03:23:44.640" style="s2">sending a swift and twisting attack</p>
<p begin="03:23:42.319" end="03:23:46.800" style="s2">toward Rangis. Despite having one eye</p>
<p begin="03:23:44.640" end="03:23:48.479" style="s2">nearly shut from his injuries, Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:23:46.800" end="03:23:50.399" style="s2">reacted with remarkable speed,</p>
<p begin="03:23:48.479" end="03:23:53.040" style="s2">effortlessly evading the strike even as</p>
<p begin="03:23:50.399" end="03:23:55.279" style="s2">it shifted direction. Retin was stunned.</p>
<p begin="03:23:53.040" end="03:23:57.680" style="s2">That same attack had landed before. Yet</p>
<p begin="03:23:55.279" end="03:23:59.520" style="s2">now Rangis avoided it so easily. A</p>
<p begin="03:23:57.680" end="03:24:01.439" style="s2">thought crossed his mind. Had Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:23:59.520" end="03:24:03.760" style="s2">already read the pattern of his attacks.</p>
<p begin="03:24:01.439" end="03:24:05.520" style="s2">The idea was unbearable. Refusing to</p>
<p begin="03:24:03.760" end="03:24:07.600" style="s2">accept it, Retin launched another</p>
<p begin="03:24:05.520" end="03:24:09.600" style="s2">assault. This time using rampaging</p>
<p begin="03:24:07.600" end="03:24:11.359" style="s2">serpent flash. As he rained down</p>
<p begin="03:24:09.600" end="03:24:13.600" style="s2">relentless strikes, he shouted for</p>
<p begin="03:24:11.359" end="03:24:15.200" style="s2">Rangess to try and withstand this one.</p>
<p begin="03:24:13.600" end="03:24:17.439" style="s2">But once again, Rangis moved with</p>
<p begin="03:24:15.200" end="03:24:19.359" style="s2">uncanny fluidity, dodging every blow</p>
<p begin="03:24:17.439" end="03:24:21.760" style="s2">with motions as soft and natural as</p>
<p begin="03:24:19.359" end="03:24:23.439" style="s2">clouds drifting and water flowing. Lea</p>
<p begin="03:24:21.760" end="03:24:25.439" style="s2">could hardly believe what she was seeing</p>
<p begin="03:24:23.439" end="03:24:27.520" style="s2">while Zeke calmly observed and remarked</p>
<p begin="03:24:25.439" end="03:24:29.840" style="s2">that Ranges had just taken a step closer</p>
<p begin="03:24:27.520" end="03:24:31.840" style="s2">to the essence. Curious, Leica</p>
<p begin="03:24:29.840" end="03:24:33.520" style="s2">immediately asked what he meant, Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:24:31.840" end="03:24:35.520" style="s2">explained that clouds drift freely and</p>
<p begin="03:24:33.520" end="03:24:38.000" style="s2">water flows gently, never stopping no</p>
<p begin="03:24:35.520" end="03:24:39.680" style="s2">matter what happens. Like them, Rangus</p>
<p begin="03:24:38.000" end="03:24:41.600" style="s2">was learning to accept incoming force</p>
<p begin="03:24:39.680" end="03:24:43.840" style="s2">and let it pass through him, adapting</p>
<p begin="03:24:41.600" end="03:24:45.520" style="s2">fluidly with every movement. Zeke added</p>
<p begin="03:24:43.840" end="03:24:47.359" style="s2">that he himself had demonstrated a</p>
<p begin="03:24:45.520" end="03:24:49.120" style="s2">glimpse of it earlier, but Ranges had</p>
<p begin="03:24:47.359" end="03:24:51.920" style="s2">fully made it his own in this battle.</p>
<p begin="03:24:49.120" end="03:24:53.600" style="s2">Hearing this, Leica was left in awe,</p>
<p begin="03:24:51.920" end="03:24:55.279" style="s2">sweat forming on her cheek as she</p>
<p begin="03:24:53.600" end="03:24:57.359" style="s2">admitted she couldn&#39;t believe Rangess</p>
<p begin="03:24:55.279" end="03:24:59.520" style="s2">had achieved that in such a short time.</p>
<p begin="03:24:57.359" end="03:25:01.279" style="s2">However, Zeke pointed out that Rangis</p>
<p begin="03:24:59.520" end="03:25:03.200" style="s2">didn&#39;t even seem aware of it yet, and</p>
<p begin="03:25:01.279" end="03:25:05.600" style="s2">that his level of focus was truly</p>
<p begin="03:25:03.200" end="03:25:07.359" style="s2">extraordinary. Rhett, on the other hand,</p>
<p begin="03:25:05.600" end="03:25:09.279" style="s2">could only curse in frustration as he</p>
<p begin="03:25:07.359" end="03:25:11.680" style="s2">watched everything unfold. For reasons</p>
<p begin="03:25:09.279" end="03:25:14.080" style="s2">he couldn&#39;t explain, fear began creeping</p>
<p begin="03:25:11.680" end="03:25:16.000" style="s2">into his heart. Shouting desperately, he</p>
<p begin="03:25:14.080" end="03:25:18.399" style="s2">warned Rangus not to come any closer as</p>
<p begin="03:25:16.000" end="03:25:20.479" style="s2">he unleashed a barrage of attacks. Yet,</p>
<p begin="03:25:18.399" end="03:25:22.560" style="s2">just like before, every strike was</p>
<p begin="03:25:20.479" end="03:25:24.800" style="s2">easily avoided. When Retin&#39;s sword</p>
<p begin="03:25:22.560" end="03:25:26.640" style="s2">finally clashed with Rangus&#39; spear, he</p>
<p begin="03:25:24.800" end="03:25:28.880" style="s2">couldn&#39;t withstand the force behind it.</p>
<p begin="03:25:26.640" end="03:25:30.800" style="s2">As he prepared to attack again, Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:25:28.880" end="03:25:33.200" style="s2">suddenly laughed in excitement, saying</p>
<p begin="03:25:30.800" end="03:25:35.439" style="s2">that this was exactly it, because water</p>
<p begin="03:25:33.200" end="03:25:37.359" style="s2">doesn&#39;t always flow calmly. Seeing the</p>
<p begin="03:25:35.439" end="03:25:39.600" style="s2">attack Ranges was about to unleash,</p>
<p begin="03:25:37.359" end="03:25:41.439" style="s2">Retin panicked. He turned and ran,</p>
<p begin="03:25:39.600" end="03:25:43.920" style="s2">cursing and questioning how Ranges had</p>
<p begin="03:25:41.439" end="03:25:45.920" style="s2">become this strong. Meanwhile, Ranges</p>
<p begin="03:25:43.920" end="03:25:47.760" style="s2">slowly formed a swirling water tornado</p>
<p begin="03:25:45.920" end="03:25:49.840" style="s2">at the center of the arena. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:25:47.760" end="03:25:51.760" style="s2">declared that once water grows wild, no</p>
<p begin="03:25:49.840" end="03:25:53.840" style="s2">one can stand against its current. The</p>
<p begin="03:25:51.760" end="03:25:55.520" style="s2">attack struck Rhett square in the chest,</p>
<p begin="03:25:53.840" end="03:25:57.439" style="s2">sending him flying as he coughed up</p>
<p begin="03:25:55.520" end="03:25:59.200" style="s2">blood before losing consciousness.</p>
<p begin="03:25:57.439" end="03:26:00.800" style="s2">Seeing Rhett&#39;s condition, Mench</p>
<p begin="03:25:59.200" end="03:26:02.720" style="s2">immediately declared the match over and</p>
<p begin="03:26:00.800" end="03:26:04.800" style="s2">announced East Hall as the winner.</p>
<p begin="03:26:02.720" end="03:26:06.720" style="s2">Rangus stood there in shock, unable to</p>
<p begin="03:26:04.800" end="03:26:08.720" style="s2">fully grasp what had just happened. As</p>
<p begin="03:26:06.720" end="03:26:11.200" style="s2">he questioned everything, Lea and the</p>
<p begin="03:26:08.720" end="03:26:13.520" style="s2">others ran toward him, calling his name.</p>
<p begin="03:26:11.200" end="03:26:15.279" style="s2">Leica excitedly praised him, saying he</p>
<p begin="03:26:13.520" end="03:26:16.960" style="s2">was amazing and congratulating him on</p>
<p begin="03:26:15.279" end="03:26:18.880" style="s2">reaching the three-star level and</p>
<p begin="03:26:16.960" end="03:26:21.520" style="s2">winning right after. She called it the</p>
<p begin="03:26:18.880" end="03:26:23.279" style="s2">best outcome possible. But Rangis, still</p>
<p begin="03:26:21.520" end="03:26:24.720" style="s2">confused, asked if she was really</p>
<p begin="03:26:23.279" end="03:26:26.479" style="s2">talking about him, if he had truly</p>
<p begin="03:26:24.720" end="03:26:28.479" style="s2">broken through and won. When he looked</p>
<p begin="03:26:26.479" end="03:26:30.720" style="s2">over at Reton lying unconscious,</p>
<p begin="03:26:28.479" end="03:26:32.319" style="s2">disbelief filled his eyes. He couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:26:30.720" end="03:26:34.080" style="s2">believe he had defeated someone who had</p>
<p begin="03:26:32.319" end="03:26:36.319" style="s2">mocked and hurt him since childhood back</p>
<p begin="03:26:34.080" end="03:26:38.479" style="s2">in their village. Even so, he kept</p>
<p begin="03:26:36.319" end="03:26:40.399" style="s2">asking if he had really won. Selene</p>
<p begin="03:26:38.479" end="03:26:42.640" style="s2">happily confirmed it, saying his match</p>
<p begin="03:26:40.399" end="03:26:44.080" style="s2">was incredible. Stuttering, Rangus</p>
<p begin="03:26:42.640" end="03:26:46.399" style="s2">finally admitted that he had truly</p>
<p begin="03:26:44.080" end="03:26:48.399" style="s2">defeated Retin. As he stared at him,</p>
<p begin="03:26:46.399" end="03:26:50.880" style="s2">memories flooded back, and before he</p>
<p begin="03:26:48.399" end="03:26:52.399" style="s2">knew it, tears began to fall. Eric</p>
<p begin="03:26:50.880" end="03:26:54.479" style="s2">immediately put an arm around him and</p>
<p begin="03:26:52.399" end="03:26:56.399" style="s2">asked why he was crying, then curiously</p>
<p begin="03:26:54.479" end="03:26:58.960" style="s2">questioned what that crazy move earlier</p>
<p begin="03:26:56.399" end="03:27:01.359" style="s2">had been. Still unaware, Ranges asked</p>
<p begin="03:26:58.960" end="03:27:03.200" style="s2">what he meant. Leica added that she also</p>
<p begin="03:27:01.359" end="03:27:05.279" style="s2">wanted to know what that attack was.</p>
<p begin="03:27:03.200" end="03:27:07.680" style="s2">Reald described it as a massive water</p>
<p begin="03:27:05.279" end="03:27:09.920" style="s2">dragon surging upward like a waterfall,</p>
<p begin="03:27:07.680" end="03:27:12.319" style="s2">saying it looked insane and incredibly</p>
<p begin="03:27:09.920" end="03:27:14.000" style="s2">cool. Rangus could only shake his head,</p>
<p begin="03:27:12.319" end="03:27:15.920" style="s2">insisting he didn&#39;t know any move like</p>
<p begin="03:27:14.000" end="03:27:18.000" style="s2">that. But Reald was certain that was</p>
<p begin="03:27:15.920" end="03:27:19.600" style="s2">exactly what it looked like. Then Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:27:18.000" end="03:27:21.920" style="s2">finally spoke, revealing that the</p>
<p begin="03:27:19.600" end="03:27:24.560" style="s2">technique Rangus used was called rising</p>
<p begin="03:27:21.920" end="03:27:26.239" style="s2">dragon pierce. Smiling, he explained</p>
<p begin="03:27:24.560" end="03:27:28.319" style="s2">that it originally came from the second</p>
<p begin="03:27:26.239" end="03:27:30.080" style="s2">volume of the cloudwater spear style,</p>
<p begin="03:27:28.319" end="03:27:32.560" style="s2">even though Ranges had only studied the</p>
<p begin="03:27:30.080" end="03:27:34.479" style="s2">first volume. Ranges was surprised while</p>
<p begin="03:27:32.560" end="03:27:36.399" style="s2">Leica immediately questioned how Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:27:34.479" end="03:27:37.840" style="s2">knew about the second volume. Zeke,</p>
<p begin="03:27:36.399" end="03:27:39.760" style="s2">however, couldn&#39;t tell them that he was</p>
<p begin="03:27:37.840" end="03:27:41.760" style="s2">the one who had created the technique.</p>
<p begin="03:27:39.760" end="03:27:43.920" style="s2">Leica then realized just how incredible</p>
<p begin="03:27:41.760" end="03:27:46.319" style="s2">Ranges was. He had reached the second</p>
<p begin="03:27:43.920" end="03:27:48.000" style="s2">volume purely through self-study. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:27:46.319" end="03:27:50.160" style="s2">went on to explain inwardly that the</p>
<p begin="03:27:48.000" end="03:27:52.319" style="s2">Cloudwater spear style was a martial art</p>
<p begin="03:27:50.160" end="03:27:53.760" style="s2">he had created in his previous life,</p>
<p begin="03:27:52.319" end="03:27:56.160" style="s2">though he didn&#39;t remember ever writing</p>
<p begin="03:27:53.760" end="03:27:58.080" style="s2">it into a book. Most likely, later</p>
<p begin="03:27:56.160" end="03:28:00.319" style="s2">generations had documented and divided</p>
<p begin="03:27:58.080" end="03:28:02.080" style="s2">it into multiple volumes, hiding its</p>
<p begin="03:28:00.319" end="03:28:04.239" style="s2">true essence in the upper levels, so</p>
<p begin="03:28:02.080" end="03:28:06.479" style="s2">immature fighters wouldn&#39;t access it.</p>
<p begin="03:28:04.239" end="03:28:08.080" style="s2">Yet, despite that, Rangus had carved a</p>
<p begin="03:28:06.479" end="03:28:10.399" style="s2">path to that hidden essence through his</p>
<p begin="03:28:08.080" end="03:28:12.080" style="s2">own strength alone. To Zeke, it was a</p>
<p begin="03:28:10.399" end="03:28:14.399" style="s2">wonderful sight, such young talent</p>
<p begin="03:28:12.080" end="03:28:16.560" style="s2">blooming before his eyes. Just then,</p>
<p begin="03:28:14.399" end="03:28:18.160" style="s2">Menick called out to East Hall, asking</p>
<p begin="03:28:16.560" end="03:28:20.479" style="s2">how long they plan to stand around</p>
<p begin="03:28:18.160" end="03:28:22.319" style="s2">chatting. Seline quickly apologized</p>
<p begin="03:28:20.479" end="03:28:23.760" style="s2">while Eric suddenly suggested they ride</p>
<p begin="03:28:22.319" end="03:28:26.319" style="s2">this momentum and finish off their</p>
<p begin="03:28:23.760" end="03:28:28.800" style="s2">opponents. Selene nodded, agreeing to do</p>
<p begin="03:28:26.319" end="03:28:31.120" style="s2">her best. Starting from Ranges&#39;s match,</p>
<p begin="03:28:28.800" end="03:28:33.200" style="s2">East Hall&#39;s morale soared to its peak.</p>
<p begin="03:28:31.120" end="03:28:35.120" style="s2">However, West Hall also rallied after</p>
<p begin="03:28:33.200" end="03:28:37.359" style="s2">their loss, and the battles grew even</p>
<p begin="03:28:35.120" end="03:28:39.439" style="s2">fiercer. In the fourth match, Seline</p>
<p begin="03:28:37.359" end="03:28:41.760" style="s2">fought well, but narrowly lost, leaving</p>
<p begin="03:28:39.439" end="03:28:43.760" style="s2">Veneil sighing in disappointment. But in</p>
<p begin="03:28:41.760" end="03:28:45.840" style="s2">the fifth match, Reynold pushed himself</p>
<p begin="03:28:43.760" end="03:28:47.439" style="s2">to the limit and managed to secure a</p>
<p begin="03:28:45.840" end="03:28:49.840" style="s2">hard-fought victory, bringing the</p>
<p begin="03:28:47.439" end="03:28:51.840" style="s2">outcome to the final rounds. As Rangus</p>
<p begin="03:28:49.840" end="03:28:53.439" style="s2">supported him, Reald admitted he barely</p>
<p begin="03:28:51.840" end="03:28:55.680" style="s2">pulled it off, earning praise from</p>
<p begin="03:28:53.439" end="03:28:58.000" style="s2">Rangus. While Eric lifted his shield and</p>
<p begin="03:28:55.680" end="03:28:59.920" style="s2">sword with renewed determination, Selene</p>
<p begin="03:28:58.000" end="03:29:01.840" style="s2">apologized to everyone, saying that if</p>
<p begin="03:28:59.920" end="03:29:04.239" style="s2">she had won, the match would already be</p>
<p begin="03:29:01.840" end="03:29:06.080" style="s2">over. Leica reassured her, saying she</p>
<p begin="03:29:04.239" end="03:29:08.080" style="s2">had fought well, and reminding her that</p>
<p begin="03:29:06.080" end="03:29:10.319" style="s2">the rule was to reach four wins. They</p>
<p begin="03:29:08.080" end="03:29:12.080" style="s2">were now at three wins and two losses.</p>
<p begin="03:29:10.319" end="03:29:14.080" style="s2">victory was right in front of them.</p>
<p begin="03:29:12.080" end="03:29:15.840" style="s2">Leica confidently declared that all that</p>
<p begin="03:29:14.080" end="03:29:17.600" style="s2">remained was for her to win and end</p>
<p begin="03:29:15.840" end="03:29:19.760" style="s2">everything, telling them to leave it to</p>
<p begin="03:29:17.600" end="03:29:22.000" style="s2">her. At that moment, Zeke called out to</p>
<p begin="03:29:19.760" end="03:29:23.760" style="s2">her. When Lea asked what he wanted, she</p>
<p begin="03:29:22.000" end="03:29:25.920" style="s2">suddenly blushed as he stepped close to</p>
<p begin="03:29:23.760" end="03:29:28.080" style="s2">her, asking if she felt all right or if</p>
<p begin="03:29:25.920" end="03:29:30.479" style="s2">anything seemed off. Letting out a small</p>
<p begin="03:29:28.080" end="03:29:32.560" style="s2">sigh, Leica said she was fine and fully</p>
<p begin="03:29:30.479" end="03:29:34.160" style="s2">prepared as always, gently pushing him</p>
<p begin="03:29:32.560" end="03:29:36.399" style="s2">away and pointing out that he was</p>
<p begin="03:29:34.160" end="03:29:38.720" style="s2">standing too close. She assured him not</p>
<p begin="03:29:36.399" end="03:29:40.800" style="s2">to worry, promising she wouldn&#39;t lose.</p>
<p begin="03:29:38.720" end="03:29:43.120" style="s2">Rangus then cheered her on, asking her</p>
<p begin="03:29:40.800" end="03:29:44.960" style="s2">to do her best. Zeke, however, remained</p>
<p begin="03:29:43.120" end="03:29:46.720" style="s2">silent. As Leica walked toward the</p>
<p begin="03:29:44.960" end="03:29:48.800" style="s2">center of the arena, he couldn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="03:29:46.720" end="03:29:50.319" style="s2">but wonder to himself what this strange</p>
<p begin="03:29:48.800" end="03:29:52.000" style="s2">feeling was something unfamiliar</p>
<p begin="03:29:50.319" end="03:29:54.239" style="s2">stirring within him. Because his</p>
<p begin="03:29:52.000" end="03:29:56.720" style="s2">teammate had lost to Reald, Allan was</p>
<p begin="03:29:54.239" end="03:29:58.640" style="s2">furious. Without hesitation, he kicked</p>
<p begin="03:29:56.720" end="03:30:01.040" style="s2">the defeated fighter and coldly called</p>
<p begin="03:29:58.640" end="03:30:02.960" style="s2">him a useless pawn. As the man slammed</p>
<p begin="03:30:01.040" end="03:30:05.520" style="s2">against the wall, Allan added that he</p>
<p begin="03:30:02.960" end="03:30:07.200" style="s2">was worthless. Still, Alan declared that</p>
<p begin="03:30:05.520" end="03:30:09.040" style="s2">as long as he won his upcoming fight</p>
<p begin="03:30:07.200" end="03:30:11.359" style="s2">against Leica, everything would return</p>
<p begin="03:30:09.040" end="03:30:13.600" style="s2">to how it should be. Suddenly, Leica cut</p>
<p begin="03:30:11.359" end="03:30:15.120" style="s2">in. With a confident smile, she told</p>
<p begin="03:30:13.600" end="03:30:16.640" style="s2">Alan that what he wanted would never</p>
<p begin="03:30:15.120" end="03:30:18.560" style="s2">happen because she would be the one to</p>
<p begin="03:30:16.640" end="03:30:20.479" style="s2">win their battle. Pulling her sword from</p>
<p begin="03:30:18.560" end="03:30:22.720" style="s2">where it was embedded in the ground, she</p>
<p begin="03:30:20.479" end="03:30:24.399" style="s2">prepared herself. And at that moment,</p>
<p begin="03:30:22.720" end="03:30:26.080" style="s2">Metric officially announced the start of</p>
<p begin="03:30:24.399" end="03:30:28.479" style="s2">the match between West Hall and East</p>
<p begin="03:30:26.080" end="03:30:30.560" style="s2">Hall Allen versus Leica. In an instant,</p>
<p begin="03:30:28.479" end="03:30:32.560" style="s2">Leica vanished from where she stood and</p>
<p begin="03:30:30.560" end="03:30:34.640" style="s2">launched her attack. As she charged</p>
<p begin="03:30:32.560" end="03:30:36.399" style="s2">toward Allan, he immediately noticed her</p>
<p begin="03:30:34.640" end="03:30:38.640" style="s2">incredible speed. While defending</p>
<p begin="03:30:36.399" end="03:30:40.720" style="s2">against her strike, a bead of sweat ran</p>
<p begin="03:30:38.640" end="03:30:42.880" style="s2">down his cheek as he realized that this</p>
<p begin="03:30:40.720" end="03:30:45.279" style="s2">was the lightning aura user. Leica, the</p>
<p begin="03:30:42.880" end="03:30:47.120" style="s2">one said to surpass even Sandy in power.</p>
<p begin="03:30:45.279" end="03:30:49.120" style="s2">After deflecting her attack, Alan</p>
<p begin="03:30:47.120" end="03:30:51.279" style="s2">quickly moved behind her. As Leica</p>
<p begin="03:30:49.120" end="03:30:53.840" style="s2">landed, Alan leapt back, creating</p>
<p begin="03:30:51.279" end="03:30:56.080" style="s2">distance. But Lea did not stop. She</p>
<p begin="03:30:53.840" end="03:30:58.160" style="s2">continued her assault once again using</p>
<p begin="03:30:56.080" end="03:30:59.920" style="s2">her lightning aura to strike. Allan</p>
<p begin="03:30:58.160" end="03:31:01.840" style="s2">began to think that in terms of raw</p>
<p begin="03:30:59.920" end="03:31:04.399" style="s2">strength, he might actually lose this</p>
<p begin="03:31:01.840" end="03:31:05.920" style="s2">fight. Fortunately for him, Lord Vanil</p>
<p begin="03:31:04.399" end="03:31:08.239" style="s2">had already taken action before the</p>
<p begin="03:31:05.920" end="03:31:10.800" style="s2">match even began. Whatever ability Vanil</p>
<p begin="03:31:08.239" end="03:31:12.720" style="s2">had used on Leica now took effect. Leica</p>
<p begin="03:31:10.800" end="03:31:14.399" style="s2">was visibly shocked, questioning what</p>
<p begin="03:31:12.720" end="03:31:16.160" style="s2">had just happened while the audience</p>
<p begin="03:31:14.399" end="03:31:18.560" style="s2">quickly noticed that her lightning aura</p>
<p begin="03:31:16.160" end="03:31:20.800" style="s2">had completely vanished. Seeing this,</p>
<p begin="03:31:18.560" end="03:31:22.960" style="s2">Vanil gave Alan a signal to attack.</p>
<p begin="03:31:20.800" end="03:31:24.880" style="s2">Without hesitation, Alan charged</p>
<p begin="03:31:22.960" end="03:31:27.120" style="s2">forward, declaring that Lea couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:31:24.880" end="03:31:28.960" style="s2">beat him. Absolutely not. Even without</p>
<p begin="03:31:27.120" end="03:31:30.560" style="s2">her aura, Leica used her physical</p>
<p begin="03:31:28.960" end="03:31:32.960" style="s2">strength to block Allen&#39;s attack with</p>
<p begin="03:31:30.560" end="03:31:35.040" style="s2">her sword. However, Alan suddenly kicked</p>
<p begin="03:31:32.960" end="03:31:37.120" style="s2">her in the stomach, forcing her back.</p>
<p begin="03:31:35.040" end="03:31:39.279" style="s2">Her allies grew increasingly worried as</p>
<p begin="03:31:37.120" end="03:31:41.920" style="s2">they watched. Eric clenched his teeth in</p>
<p begin="03:31:39.279" end="03:31:43.920" style="s2">frustration while Zeke remained silent.</p>
<p begin="03:31:41.920" end="03:31:45.359" style="s2">Holding her stomach, Leica kept asking</p>
<p begin="03:31:43.920" end="03:31:47.359" style="s2">herself why she couldn&#39;t use her</p>
<p begin="03:31:45.359" end="03:31:49.120" style="s2">lightning aura. Alan repeated that she</p>
<p begin="03:31:47.359" end="03:31:50.960" style="s2">would never defeat him, then unleashed a</p>
<p begin="03:31:49.120" end="03:31:53.120" style="s2">barrage of attacks across her body.</p>
<p begin="03:31:50.960" end="03:31:55.279" style="s2">Unable to use her aura, Leica had no</p>
<p begin="03:31:53.120" end="03:31:56.800" style="s2">choice but to endure each blow. It was</p>
<p begin="03:31:55.279" end="03:31:58.399" style="s2">explained that a warrior&#39;s body is</p>
<p begin="03:31:56.800" end="03:32:00.239" style="s2">deeply connected to the source power</p>
<p begin="03:31:58.399" end="03:32:02.319" style="s2">within them and every movement is</p>
<p begin="03:32:00.239" end="03:32:04.399" style="s2">enhanced by that power. If a warrior</p>
<p begin="03:32:02.319" end="03:32:06.080" style="s2">loses their source power mid battle,</p>
<p begin="03:32:04.399" end="03:32:08.160" style="s2">every attack from their opponent can</p>
<p begin="03:32:06.080" end="03:32:10.319" style="s2">become a fatal blow. Alan struck at</p>
<p begin="03:32:08.160" end="03:32:12.640" style="s2">Leica&#39;s head once more. Despite one of</p>
<p begin="03:32:10.319" end="03:32:14.640" style="s2">her eyes closing from the damage, Leica</p>
<p begin="03:32:12.640" end="03:32:16.399" style="s2">remained determined to win. She told</p>
<p begin="03:32:14.640" end="03:32:18.319" style="s2">herself that she only needed to defend</p>
<p begin="03:32:16.399" end="03:32:20.640" style="s2">against Allen&#39;s attacks until her source</p>
<p begin="03:32:18.319" end="03:32:23.279" style="s2">power and lightning aura returned. Sandy</p>
<p begin="03:32:20.640" end="03:32:25.439" style="s2">and Edges grew more alarmed. Sandy said</p>
<p begin="03:32:23.279" end="03:32:27.439" style="s2">something was wrong. Leica was acting</p>
<p begin="03:32:25.439" end="03:32:28.720" style="s2">strange. Edgis agreed and wondered if</p>
<p begin="03:32:27.439" end="03:32:30.479" style="s2">her source power had stopped</p>
<p begin="03:32:28.720" end="03:32:32.880" style="s2">functioning, questioning how that could</p>
<p begin="03:32:30.479" end="03:32:34.880" style="s2">have happened. Meanwhile, after enduring</p>
<p begin="03:32:32.880" end="03:32:36.319" style="s2">Allen&#39;s relentless assault, Leica</p>
