<p begin="03:32:36.319" end="03:32:40.239" style="s2">middle of the arena. She coughed and</p>
<p begin="03:32:38.160" end="03:32:41.920" style="s2">struggled to breathe. Even Allan was</p>
<p begin="03:32:40.239" end="03:32:43.600" style="s2">surprised that she could withstand so</p>
<p begin="03:32:41.920" end="03:32:45.279" style="s2">much without her source power, as</p>
