<p begin="03:32:45.279" end="03:32:49.680" style="s2">Venil as a candidate for the next head.</p>
<p begin="03:32:47.359" end="03:32:51.600" style="s2">When Allan glanced toward Venil, he saw</p>
<p begin="03:32:49.680" end="03:32:53.920" style="s2">him smiling grimly as he gave a clear</p>
<p begin="03:32:51.600" end="03:32:55.840" style="s2">order to kill Leica. Allan&#39;s expression</p>
<p begin="03:32:53.920" end="03:32:57.840" style="s2">darkened. He admitted that Leica had</p>
<p begin="03:32:55.840" end="03:33:00.080" style="s2">held out for quite some time, but this</p>
<p begin="03:32:57.840" end="03:33:02.160" style="s2">was as far as she would go. Rangus could</p>
<p begin="03:33:00.080" end="03:33:04.239" style="s2">no longer contain his worry and shouted,</p>
<p begin="03:33:02.160" end="03:33:06.720" style="s2">pleading for the match to be stopped as</p>
<p begin="03:33:04.239" end="03:33:08.720" style="s2">he tried to rush toward Leica. However,</p>
<p begin="03:33:06.720" end="03:33:10.880" style="s2">Reald blocked him, stating that he could</p>
<p begin="03:33:08.720" end="03:33:13.200" style="s2">not interfere. Zeke, who had remained</p>
<p begin="03:33:10.880" end="03:33:15.439" style="s2">silent until now, suddenly darkened in</p>
<p begin="03:33:13.200" end="03:33:17.680" style="s2">expression. His eyes glowed with anger</p>
<p begin="03:33:15.439" end="03:33:19.840" style="s2">and his fists ignited with aura as he</p>
<p begin="03:33:17.680" end="03:33:22.000" style="s2">saw Alan preparing his next attack.</p>
<p begin="03:33:19.840" end="03:33:24.399" style="s2">Leica, sitting helplessly in the center</p>
<p begin="03:33:22.000" end="03:33:26.000" style="s2">of the arena, was filled with fear. She</p>
<p begin="03:33:24.399" end="03:33:28.479" style="s2">could barely move her body as Alan</p>
<p begin="03:33:26.000" end="03:33:30.479" style="s2">closed in. Just then, a golden bolt of</p>
<p begin="03:33:28.479" end="03:33:32.399" style="s2">lightning flashed across the arena. In</p>
<p begin="03:33:30.479" end="03:33:35.120" style="s2">an instant, Sandy appeared in front of</p>
