<p begin="03:33:36.720" end="03:33:41.520" style="s2">to do. Alan was momentarily stunned and</p>
<p begin="03:33:39.040" end="03:33:43.760" style="s2">halted his attack. Zeke let out a quiet</p>
<p begin="03:33:41.520" end="03:33:45.680" style="s2">sigh of relief, realizing he no longer</p>
