<p begin="03:33:49.680" end="03:33:54.479" style="s2">Hall. Alan questioned Sandy, asking why</p>
<p begin="03:33:52.319" end="03:33:56.080" style="s2">she was interfering. Sandy angrily</p>
<p begin="03:33:54.479" end="03:33:57.760" style="s2">replied that Alan should not pretend</p>
<p begin="03:33:56.080" end="03:33:59.760" style="s2">innocence. He had clearly tried to kill</p>
<p begin="03:33:57.760" end="03:34:02.399" style="s2">Leica, and she demanded that he confirm</p>
<p begin="03:33:59.760" end="03:34:04.640" style="s2">it. The audience fell silent in shock.</p>
<p begin="03:34:02.399" end="03:34:06.399" style="s2">Alan smirked and accused Sandy of being</p>
<p begin="03:34:04.640" end="03:34:08.080" style="s2">overly violent in her thinking,</p>
<p begin="03:34:06.399" end="03:34:10.239" style="s2">insisting that he would never do such a</p>
<p begin="03:34:08.080" end="03:34:12.000" style="s2">thing to a family head candidate. At</p>
<p begin="03:34:10.239" end="03:34:14.399" style="s2">that moment, Edges stepped into the</p>
<p begin="03:34:12.000" end="03:34:16.479" style="s2">arena and questioned Allan as well. From</p>
<p begin="03:34:14.399" end="03:34:18.960" style="s2">his position, the last strike had looked</p>
<p begin="03:34:16.479" end="03:34:20.640" style="s2">far too dangerous. Allan grew irritated</p>
<p begin="03:34:18.960" end="03:34:22.560" style="s2">and asked if they were accusing him.</p>
<p begin="03:34:20.640" end="03:34:24.479" style="s2">Edges calmly replied that if Alan</p>
