<p begin="03:34:42.880" end="03:34:47.439" style="s2">They simply crush the enemy completely.</p>
<p begin="03:34:45.120" end="03:34:50.160" style="s2">According to Veneil, Westall fights as</p>
<p begin="03:34:47.439" end="03:34:52.720" style="s2">if every match is a real battle. Sandy,</p>
<p begin="03:34:50.160" end="03:34:54.239" style="s2">still furious, argued that even so,</p>
<p begin="03:34:52.720" end="03:34:56.800" style="s2">there should be limits that this was a</p>
<p begin="03:34:54.239" end="03:34:58.640" style="s2">match, not a death duel. Venil mocked</p>
<p begin="03:34:56.800" end="03:35:00.640" style="s2">them, calling them soft and saying that</p>
<p begin="03:34:58.640" end="03:35:02.880" style="s2">was exactly why they lose. Edges</p>
<p begin="03:35:00.640" end="03:35:05.359" style="s2">remained silent, but Sandy&#39;s anger only</p>
<p begin="03:35:02.880" end="03:35:06.800" style="s2">grew. Veneil continued, saying they were</p>
<p begin="03:35:05.359" end="03:35:08.800" style="s2">not playing pretend war, they were</p>
<p begin="03:35:06.800" end="03:35:10.399" style="s2">fighting for real. He laughed, then</p>
<p begin="03:35:08.800" end="03:35:12.560" style="s2">added that while this was not a kill</p>
<p begin="03:35:10.399" end="03:35:14.479" style="s2">orbe killed situation, they were still</p>
<p begin="03:35:12.560" end="03:35:16.880" style="s2">holding back. So, it wasn&#39;t as if they</p>
<p begin="03:35:14.479" end="03:35:18.880" style="s2">were trying to kill Leica. However, with</p>
<p begin="03:35:16.880" end="03:35:21.359" style="s2">a grim expression, he admitted that</p>
<p begin="03:35:18.880" end="03:35:23.520" style="s2">something might have been a bit broken.</p>
<p begin="03:35:21.359" end="03:35:25.200" style="s2">Hearing this, Sandy reached her limit</p>
<p begin="03:35:23.520" end="03:35:26.880" style="s2">and released her lightning aura in</p>
<p begin="03:35:25.200" end="03:35:29.520" style="s2">anger. Before the situation could</p>
<p begin="03:35:26.880" end="03:35:31.359" style="s2">escalate, Mench released his own aura,</p>
<p begin="03:35:29.520" end="03:35:33.760" style="s2">silencing everyone with overwhelming</p>
<p begin="03:35:31.359" end="03:35:35.040" style="s2">pressure. In a cold voice, he demanded</p>
