<p begin="03:35:35.040" end="03:35:39.200" style="s2">permission for such pointless chatter.</p>
<p begin="03:35:37.120" end="03:35:41.359" style="s2">Despite this, Sandy insisted that</p>
<p begin="03:35:39.200" end="03:35:43.760" style="s2">Allen&#39;s earlier attack had clear killing</p>
<p begin="03:35:41.359" end="03:35:45.359" style="s2">intent. Mentric dismissed her, stating</p>
<p begin="03:35:43.760" end="03:35:47.520" style="s2">that someone who did not belong in the</p>
