<p begin="03:35:52.720" end="03:35:57.040" style="s2">alone. Edgis immediately apologized.</p>
<p begin="03:35:55.439" end="03:35:59.200" style="s2">Mentric then declared the match over</p>
<p begin="03:35:57.040" end="03:36:00.960" style="s2">West Hall had won. He ordered everyone</p>
<p begin="03:35:59.200" end="03:36:03.600" style="s2">not involved in the next match to leave</p>
<p begin="03:36:00.960" end="03:36:05.439" style="s2">at once. Edges quickly lifted Leica and</p>
