<p begin="03:36:15.600" end="03:36:19.680" style="s2">she needed time to recover, so he would</p>
<p begin="03:36:17.600" end="03:36:21.120" style="s2">take her straight to the infirmary. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:36:19.680" end="03:36:23.200" style="s2">remarked that Edges might face</p>
<p begin="03:36:21.120" end="03:36:25.439" style="s2">consequences for what he and Sandy had</p>
<p begin="03:36:23.200" end="03:36:27.520" style="s2">done. Edges simply smiled and told him</p>
<p begin="03:36:25.439" end="03:36:29.680" style="s2">not to worry, adding that he knew Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:36:27.520" end="03:36:32.160" style="s2">had also been ready to step in. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:36:29.680" end="03:36:34.080" style="s2">jokingly denied it. As Edges carried Lea</p>
