<p begin="03:36:34.080" end="03:36:38.720" style="s2">about all of this felt wrong. Alan was</p>
<p begin="03:36:36.479" end="03:36:40.800" style="s2">strong. Yes, but for Lea to be</p>
<p begin="03:36:38.720" end="03:36:42.800" style="s2">overwhelmed like that was impossible.</p>
<p begin="03:36:40.800" end="03:36:44.479" style="s2">Edges agreed, saying that something had</p>
<p begin="03:36:42.800" end="03:36:46.479" style="s2">already felt off since the very first</p>
<p begin="03:36:44.479" end="03:36:48.479" style="s2">match with Laya. There was definitely</p>
<p begin="03:36:46.479" end="03:36:50.960" style="s2">something going on with West Hall. While</p>
<p begin="03:36:48.479" end="03:36:52.960" style="s2">Leica remained unconscious, Edges warned</p>
<p begin="03:36:50.960" end="03:36:55.520" style="s2">Zeke to be careful in his upcoming fight</p>
<p begin="03:36:52.960" end="03:36:57.840" style="s2">against Venil. Zeke gave a slight nod,</p>
