<p begin="03:36:57.840" end="03:37:01.359" style="s2">walked toward the center of the arena,</p>
<p begin="03:36:59.520" end="03:37:03.120" style="s2">Vanil pointed his weapon at him and</p>
<p begin="03:37:01.359" end="03:37:04.880" style="s2">declared that it was unfortunate Zeke</p>
