<p begin="03:37:04.880" end="03:37:09.840" style="s2">East Hall&#39;s loss was already guaranteed.</p>
<p begin="03:37:07.279" end="03:37:11.279" style="s2">Zeke ignored him completely. Instead, he</p>
<p begin="03:37:09.840" end="03:37:14.160" style="s2">casually stretched right in front of</p>
<p begin="03:37:11.279" end="03:37:16.319" style="s2">him. Veneil fell silent, veins bulging</p>
<p begin="03:37:14.160" end="03:37:18.319" style="s2">on his face in irritation. Metric then</p>
<p begin="03:37:16.319" end="03:37:20.319" style="s2">announced the seventh match between East</p>
