<p begin="03:37:24.880" end="03:37:29.359" style="s2">straight to Veneil&#39;s jaw, causing him to</p>
<p begin="03:37:26.960" end="03:37:31.520" style="s2">spit blood. Zeke coldly remarked that</p>
<p begin="03:37:29.359" end="03:37:33.359" style="s2">Venil&#39;s smug attitude really irritated</p>
<p begin="03:37:31.520" end="03:37:35.120" style="s2">him, and he wanted to see how long he</p>
<p begin="03:37:33.359" end="03:37:36.880" style="s2">could keep it up. The force of the blow</p>
<p begin="03:37:35.120" end="03:37:38.720" style="s2">sent Veneil flying into the wall at the</p>
<p begin="03:37:36.880" end="03:37:40.880" style="s2">far end of the arena, triggering a</p>
<p begin="03:37:38.720" end="03:37:43.200" style="s2">massive explosion. The audience was left</p>
<p begin="03:37:40.880" end="03:37:45.200" style="s2">in complete shock, their jaws dropping,</p>
<p begin="03:37:43.200" end="03:37:47.279" style="s2">while even Mench widened his eyes in</p>
<p begin="03:37:45.200" end="03:37:48.960" style="s2">disbelief at what he had just witnessed.</p>
<p begin="03:37:47.279" end="03:37:51.439" style="s2">Zeke then added that for someone who</p>
<p begin="03:37:48.960" end="03:37:53.520" style="s2">talked so much about real combat, Venil</p>
<p begin="03:37:51.439" end="03:37:55.120" style="s2">had left himself completely open and</p>
<p begin="03:37:53.520" end="03:37:57.520" style="s2">asked if this was the kind of real</p>
<p begin="03:37:55.120" end="03:37:59.520" style="s2">combat he liked. Before receiving a</p>
<p begin="03:37:57.520" end="03:38:01.600" style="s2">devastating attack from Zeke, Vanil</p>
<p begin="03:37:59.520" end="03:38:03.200" style="s2">first heard him ask and confirm whether</p>
<p begin="03:38:01.600" end="03:38:05.279" style="s2">those from the West Hall were truly</p>
<p begin="03:38:03.200" end="03:38:07.439" style="s2">fighting as if it were real combat.</p>
<p begin="03:38:05.279" end="03:38:09.120" style="s2">Because of this, confusion was clearly</p>
<p begin="03:38:07.439" end="03:38:11.520" style="s2">written across Veneil&#39;s face at the</p>
<p begin="03:38:09.120" end="03:38:13.279" style="s2">question from our protagonist until Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:38:11.520" end="03:38:15.359" style="s2">stated that he would also fight Venal in</p>
<p begin="03:38:13.279" end="03:38:17.439" style="s2">real combat mode and asked if he was</p>
<p begin="03:38:15.359" end="03:38:18.880" style="s2">sure he wouldn&#39;t regret it. Venil then</p>
<p begin="03:38:17.439" end="03:38:20.640" style="s2">questioned what Zeke meant and</p>
<p begin="03:38:18.880" end="03:38:22.479" style="s2">arrogantly replied that Zeke would be</p>
<p begin="03:38:20.640" end="03:38:24.399" style="s2">the one to regret this battle while</p>
<p begin="03:38:22.479" end="03:38:26.800" style="s2">silently wondering to himself what Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:38:24.399" end="03:38:28.880" style="s2">was talking about. Zeke then spoke again</p>
<p begin="03:38:26.800" end="03:38:30.560" style="s2">and as he clenched his fists, his eyes</p>
<p begin="03:38:28.880" end="03:38:33.120" style="s2">faintly glowed while his expression</p>
<p begin="03:38:30.560" end="03:38:35.760" style="s2">darkened. Suddenly, Allan shouted, &quot;Lord</p>
<p begin="03:38:33.120" end="03:38:37.600" style="s2">Veneil,&quot; with both shock and concern.</p>
<p begin="03:38:35.760" end="03:38:39.600" style="s2">Although Zeke launched a powerful attack</p>
<p begin="03:38:37.600" end="03:38:41.200" style="s2">toward Veneil, the latter still managed</p>
<p begin="03:38:39.600" end="03:38:43.279" style="s2">to counter with a strong move of his</p>
<p begin="03:38:41.200" end="03:38:45.439" style="s2">own, a fast-moving sphere of wind</p>
<p begin="03:38:43.279" end="03:38:47.520" style="s2">rushing toward Zeke. However, before it</p>
<p begin="03:38:45.439" end="03:38:49.439" style="s2">could hit, Zeke simply tilted his head</p>
<p begin="03:38:47.520" end="03:38:51.040" style="s2">slightly, effortlessly dodging the</p>
<p begin="03:38:49.439" end="03:38:53.359" style="s2">attack as it crashed into the arena</p>
<p begin="03:38:51.040" end="03:38:55.279" style="s2">wall. When Vanil stood up, he cursed</p>
<p begin="03:38:53.359" end="03:38:57.439" style="s2">under his breath. Despite clearly</p>
<p begin="03:38:55.279" end="03:38:59.120" style="s2">feeling the impact of Zeke&#39;s strike, he</p>
<p begin="03:38:57.439" end="03:39:00.960" style="s2">couldn&#39;t understand how Zeke was still</p>
<p begin="03:38:59.120" end="03:39:02.880" style="s2">standing in the center of the arena.</p>
<p begin="03:39:00.960" end="03:39:04.960" style="s2">Venil knew he had countered as quickly</p>
<p begin="03:39:02.880" end="03:39:06.720" style="s2">as possible when Zeke attacked him. So,</p>
<p begin="03:39:04.960" end="03:39:09.040" style="s2">how was it that Zeke remained completely</p>
<p begin="03:39:06.720" end="03:39:10.880" style="s2">unharmed? Zeke then remarked that he now</p>
<p begin="03:39:09.040" end="03:39:12.720" style="s2">understood Venil possessed wind type</p>
<p begin="03:39:10.880" end="03:39:14.880" style="s2">source power and asked if he was from</p>
<p begin="03:39:12.720" end="03:39:16.479" style="s2">one of the four great families. He also</p>
<p begin="03:39:14.880" end="03:39:19.279" style="s2">questioned whether that was the special</p>
<p begin="03:39:16.479" end="03:39:21.760" style="s2">source power of Veneil&#39;s clan. Venil,</p>
<p begin="03:39:19.279" end="03:39:24.720" style="s2">still furious, simply called Zeke a</p>
<p begin="03:39:21.760" end="03:39:27.200" style="s2">bastard. In response, Zeke mocked him,</p>
<p begin="03:39:24.720" end="03:39:28.800" style="s2">asking how real combat felt, adding that</p>
<p begin="03:39:27.200" end="03:39:30.800" style="s2">he had even tried to match Veneil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:39:28.800" end="03:39:32.960" style="s2">style a bit for his sake. This only</p>
<p begin="03:39:30.800" end="03:39:35.040" style="s2">fueled Veneil&#39;s anger further. As he</p>
<p begin="03:39:32.960" end="03:39:37.279" style="s2">demanded an explanation, he suddenly</p>
<p begin="03:39:35.040" end="03:39:39.680" style="s2">froze. Zeke had already moved behind him</p>
<p begin="03:39:37.279" end="03:39:41.600" style="s2">in an instant. Glancing back slightly.</p>
<p begin="03:39:39.680" end="03:39:43.680" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s eyes glowed again as he calmly</p>
<p begin="03:39:41.600" end="03:39:45.680" style="s2">said, &quot;That&#39;s the second time.&quot; He then</p>
<p begin="03:39:43.680" end="03:39:47.920" style="s2">struck Veneil at the back of the neck,</p>
<p begin="03:39:45.680" end="03:39:50.000" style="s2">sending him flying across the arena. As</p>
<p begin="03:39:47.920" end="03:39:52.160" style="s2">Venil skiitted to a halt, he questioned</p>
<p begin="03:39:50.000" end="03:39:53.920" style="s2">what kind of absurdity this was. how</p>
<p begin="03:39:52.160" end="03:39:56.160" style="s2">someone like him was being handled so</p>
<p begin="03:39:53.920" end="03:39:58.160" style="s2">easily by Zeke. When Vanil stood once</p>
<p begin="03:39:56.160" end="03:40:00.160" style="s2">more, Zeke immediately closed the</p>
<p begin="03:39:58.160" end="03:40:02.160" style="s2">distance again. As he prepared another</p>
<p begin="03:40:00.160" end="03:40:03.920" style="s2">attack, Zeke remarked that thinking in</p>
<p begin="03:40:02.160" end="03:40:05.840" style="s2">the middle of a real fight wouldn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="03:40:03.920" end="03:40:08.080" style="s2">and asked if Venil had always felt safe</p>
<p begin="03:40:05.840" end="03:40:09.680" style="s2">until now. Then Zeke delivered another</p>
<p begin="03:40:08.080" end="03:40:12.319" style="s2">powerful punch straight to Veneil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:40:09.680" end="03:40:14.160" style="s2">chest. The impact shook his entire body.</p>
<p begin="03:40:12.319" end="03:40:16.000" style="s2">His eyes turned white as he coughed up</p>
<p begin="03:40:14.160" end="03:40:18.399" style="s2">blood, collapsing to his knees in front</p>
<p begin="03:40:16.000" end="03:40:20.640" style="s2">of Zeke. &quot;That makes three times,&quot; Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:40:18.399" end="03:40:22.399" style="s2">said. Trembling from pain, Venil</p>
<p begin="03:40:20.640" end="03:40:24.640" style="s2">demanded to know what Zeke was talking</p>
<p begin="03:40:22.399" end="03:40:26.960" style="s2">about, what exactly he was counting.</p>
<p begin="03:40:24.640" end="03:40:28.880" style="s2">Zeke simply replied that it was obvious.</p>
<p begin="03:40:26.960" end="03:40:31.279" style="s2">He was counting how many times Veneil</p>
<p begin="03:40:28.880" end="03:40:33.279" style="s2">had already died in this battle. Venil,</p>
<p begin="03:40:31.279" end="03:40:35.279" style="s2">still confused, listened as Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:40:33.279" end="03:40:37.600" style="s2">explained. The first was when he struck</p>
<p begin="03:40:35.279" end="03:40:39.600" style="s2">his face. The second was the blow to his</p>
<p begin="03:40:37.600" end="03:40:41.520" style="s2">neck, and the third was the attack to</p>
<p begin="03:40:39.600" end="03:40:43.279" style="s2">his heart. Zeke added that the only</p>
<p begin="03:40:41.520" end="03:40:46.239" style="s2">reason Vanil was still alive was because</p>
<p begin="03:40:43.279" end="03:40:48.319" style="s2">of the rules. Enraged, Veneil shouted</p>
<p begin="03:40:46.239" end="03:40:49.520" style="s2">that there was no way that was true. But</p>
<p begin="03:40:48.319" end="03:40:51.840" style="s2">Zeke kicked him in the face</p>
<p begin="03:40:49.520" end="03:40:54.319" style="s2">mid-sentence, declaring that Venil was</p>
<p begin="03:40:51.840" end="03:40:56.239" style="s2">right. This was real combat, and break</p>
<p begin="03:40:54.319" end="03:40:58.160" style="s2">time was over. Talking to your enemy</p>
<p begin="03:40:56.239" end="03:41:00.239" style="s2">wasn&#39;t part of it. The force of the kick</p>
<p begin="03:40:58.160" end="03:41:01.920" style="s2">sent Veneil rolling across the arena.</p>
<p begin="03:41:00.239" end="03:41:03.840" style="s2">Sandy&#39;s expression darkened as she</p>
<p begin="03:41:01.920" end="03:41:06.000" style="s2">watched, unable to believe what she was</p>
<p begin="03:41:03.840" end="03:41:07.520" style="s2">seeing. Sweat trickled down her face as</p>
<p begin="03:41:06.000" end="03:41:09.279" style="s2">she said that the battle between Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:41:07.520" end="03:41:11.439" style="s2">and Veneil could no longer be called a</p>
<p begin="03:41:09.279" end="03:41:13.200" style="s2">fight. Edges agreed, adding that</p>
<p begin="03:41:11.439" end="03:41:14.800" style="s2">compared to this, his own match with</p>
<p begin="03:41:13.200" end="03:41:16.720" style="s2">Zeke felt like nothing more than a</p>
<p begin="03:41:14.800" end="03:41:18.640" style="s2">friendly spar. He went on to say that</p>
<p begin="03:41:16.720" end="03:41:20.880" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s strength was unreasonable, that</p>
<p begin="03:41:18.640" end="03:41:22.479" style="s2">he was the very definition of unfair.</p>
<p begin="03:41:20.880" end="03:41:25.040" style="s2">Standing in the middle of the arena with</p>
<p begin="03:41:22.479" end="03:41:26.560" style="s2">a faint smile, Zeke asked Veneil if he</p>
<p begin="03:41:25.040" end="03:41:28.800" style="s2">was starting to understand what real</p>
<p begin="03:41:26.560" end="03:41:30.720" style="s2">combat truly was. As Veneil lay</p>
<p begin="03:41:28.800" end="03:41:32.800" style="s2">trembling on the ground, struggling from</p>
<p begin="03:41:30.720" end="03:41:35.040" style="s2">his injuries, Zeke acknowledged that</p>
<p begin="03:41:32.800" end="03:41:36.880" style="s2">crushing the enemy completely was indeed</p>
<p begin="03:41:35.040" end="03:41:39.279" style="s2">important on a battlefield, just as</p>
<p begin="03:41:36.880" end="03:41:40.800" style="s2">Veneil had said. He added that Venil and</p>
<p begin="03:41:39.279" end="03:41:42.880" style="s2">the others from West Hall would likely</p>
<p begin="03:41:40.800" end="03:41:44.960" style="s2">become excellent warriors in the future.</p>
<p begin="03:41:42.880" end="03:41:46.960" style="s2">As Veneil tried to crawl toward him,</p>
<p begin="03:41:44.960" end="03:41:48.960" style="s2">Zeke briefly closed his eyes and pointed</p>
<p begin="03:41:46.960" end="03:41:50.800" style="s2">out that they were not on a battlefield.</p>
<p begin="03:41:48.960" end="03:41:53.040" style="s2">Their match was under the supervision of</p>
<p begin="03:41:50.800" end="03:41:54.960" style="s2">instructors with healing potions readily</p>
<p begin="03:41:53.040" end="03:41:56.800" style="s2">available. He described it as a very</p>
<p begin="03:41:54.960" end="03:41:59.359" style="s2">soft environment for someone like Veneil</p>
<p begin="03:41:56.800" end="03:42:01.600" style="s2">to be talking about real combat. Venil,</p>
<p begin="03:41:59.359" end="03:42:03.840" style="s2">still struggling, told Zeke to shut up,</p>
<p begin="03:42:01.600" end="03:42:06.000" style="s2">but Zeke continued, saying that the real</p>
<p begin="03:42:03.840" end="03:42:08.000" style="s2">combat Veneil spoke of was far removed</p>
<p begin="03:42:06.000" end="03:42:09.760" style="s2">from reality, that he was merely running</p>
<p begin="03:42:08.000" end="03:42:11.760" style="s2">away from his own weakness. He then</p>
<p begin="03:42:09.760" end="03:42:13.920" style="s2">asked if he was wrong. Instead of</p>
<p begin="03:42:11.760" end="03:42:16.080" style="s2">answering, Venil shouted repeatedly for</p>
<p begin="03:42:13.920" end="03:42:18.800" style="s2">Zeke to be silent, his anger reaching</p>
<p begin="03:42:16.080" end="03:42:20.399" style="s2">its peak. Suddenly, a green whirlwind</p>
<p begin="03:42:18.800" end="03:42:22.640" style="s2">formed behind him, leaving the</p>
<p begin="03:42:20.399" end="03:42:24.800" style="s2">spectators stunned. Veneil declared that</p>
<p begin="03:42:22.640" end="03:42:27.040" style="s2">someone like Zeke, a bastard child, had</p>
<p begin="03:42:24.800" end="03:42:28.640" style="s2">no right to lecture him. Zeke calmly</p>
<p begin="03:42:27.040" end="03:42:30.640" style="s2">asked if Veneil was going through a</p>
<p begin="03:42:28.640" end="03:42:32.560" style="s2">rebellious phase, saying that if that</p>
<p begin="03:42:30.640" end="03:42:34.239" style="s2">were the case, nothing he said would get</p>
<p begin="03:42:32.560" end="03:42:36.160" style="s2">through anyway. He added that as</p>
<p begin="03:42:34.239" end="03:42:38.720" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s opponent, it was fine for him</p>
<p begin="03:42:36.160" end="03:42:40.720" style="s2">to release all his frustration. Venil,</p>
<p begin="03:42:38.720" end="03:42:42.239" style="s2">preparing his attack, told Zeke to shut</p>
<p begin="03:42:40.720" end="03:42:43.680" style="s2">up and stop acting like he knew</p>
<p begin="03:42:42.239" end="03:42:46.319" style="s2">everything. He then unleashed his</p>
<p begin="03:42:43.680" end="03:42:48.800" style="s2">windrending fan art, Stormblade, sending</p>
<p begin="03:42:46.319" end="03:42:50.960" style="s2">a barrage of wind attacks at Zeke. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:42:48.800" end="03:42:53.439" style="s2">easily leapt into the air, dodging every</p>
<p begin="03:42:50.960" end="03:42:55.359" style="s2">strike. While airborne, Venil thought to</p>
<p begin="03:42:53.439" end="03:42:57.840" style="s2">himself that he only needed one chance,</p>
<p begin="03:42:55.359" end="03:43:00.080" style="s2">just a moment to touch Zeke. Elsewhere,</p>
<p begin="03:42:57.840" end="03:43:01.840" style="s2">Rangis, unable to understand what was</p>
<p begin="03:43:00.080" end="03:43:03.200" style="s2">happening, asked why the ground was</p>
<p begin="03:43:01.840" end="03:43:05.040" style="s2">tearing apart when he couldn&#39;t see</p>
<p begin="03:43:03.200" end="03:43:07.200" style="s2">anything. Edgis explained that it was</p>
<p begin="03:43:05.040" end="03:43:09.200" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s power, the wind aura of the</p>
<p begin="03:43:07.200" end="03:43:11.279" style="s2">Thanold family, one of the four great</p>
<p begin="03:43:09.200" end="03:43:13.600" style="s2">houses. He added that wind aura was</p>
<p begin="03:43:11.279" end="03:43:16.239" style="s2">invisible, so it was natural that Ranges</p>
<p begin="03:43:13.600" end="03:43:17.920" style="s2">couldn&#39;t see it. Sandy, still irritated,</p>
<p begin="03:43:16.239" end="03:43:20.160" style="s2">called it a nasty power that suited</p>
<p begin="03:43:17.920" end="03:43:22.000" style="s2">Venil perfectly. Edges laughed and told</p>
<p begin="03:43:20.160" end="03:43:23.600" style="s2">her not to say things like that, though</p>
<p begin="03:43:22.000" end="03:43:25.359" style="s2">he admitted that regardless of whether</p>
<p begin="03:43:23.600" end="03:43:27.920" style="s2">it was annoying, it was difficult to</p>
<p begin="03:43:25.359" end="03:43:30.160" style="s2">deal with. Veneil&#39;s continuous invisible</p>
<p begin="03:43:27.920" end="03:43:32.080" style="s2">attacks made him a tough opponent.</p>
<p begin="03:43:30.160" end="03:43:34.560" style="s2">Hearing this, Ranges grew even more</p>
<p begin="03:43:32.080" end="03:43:36.080" style="s2">worried. Meanwhile, in the arena, Venil</p>
<p begin="03:43:34.560" end="03:43:37.920" style="s2">was baffled. None of his attacks were</p>
<p begin="03:43:36.080" end="03:43:40.080" style="s2">hitting Zeke, even though Zeke couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:43:37.920" end="03:43:41.600" style="s2">see them. Zeke simply replied that he</p>
<p begin="03:43:40.080" end="03:43:43.680" style="s2">only needed to follow the flow of the</p>
<p begin="03:43:41.600" end="03:43:46.239" style="s2">air. Veneil couldn&#39;t believe it, calling</p>
<p begin="03:43:43.680" end="03:43:48.160" style="s2">it nonsense. Suddenly, Zeke struck</p>
<p begin="03:43:46.239" end="03:43:50.000" style="s2">Veneil on the head and pointed out that</p>
<p begin="03:43:48.160" end="03:43:52.000" style="s2">his defense was wide open again.</p>
<p begin="03:43:50.000" end="03:43:53.840" style="s2">Clutching his head, Venil declared he</p>
<p begin="03:43:52.000" end="03:43:55.920" style="s2">had truly had enough of Zeke. He</p>
<p begin="03:43:53.840" end="03:43:58.000" style="s2">launched a rapid series of attacks, but</p>
<p begin="03:43:55.920" end="03:44:00.160" style="s2">Zeke avoided them effortlessly, hands</p>
<p begin="03:43:58.000" end="03:44:02.239" style="s2">behind his back and eyes closed as if</p>
<p begin="03:44:00.160" end="03:44:04.239" style="s2">playing around. After being cursed at</p>
<p begin="03:44:02.239" end="03:44:06.560" style="s2">again, Zeke remarked that Veneil really</p>
<p begin="03:44:04.239" end="03:44:08.720" style="s2">was in a rebellious phase. When Veneil</p>
<p begin="03:44:06.560" end="03:44:10.960" style="s2">finally stopped attacking, Zeke asked if</p>
<p begin="03:44:08.720" end="03:44:13.120" style="s2">he felt better. But Venal only grew more</p>
<p begin="03:44:10.960" end="03:44:14.800" style="s2">furious, threatening to kill him. Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:44:13.120" end="03:44:16.880" style="s2">responded that Veneil&#39;s stubborn will</p>
<p begin="03:44:14.800" end="03:44:18.640" style="s2">was admirable in a warrior. As he</p>
<p begin="03:44:16.880" end="03:44:20.720" style="s2">delivered another blow, he added that</p>
<p begin="03:44:18.640" end="03:44:22.800" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s body had long since reached its</p>
<p begin="03:44:20.720" end="03:44:25.439" style="s2">limit. Veneil dropped to his knees once</p>
<p begin="03:44:22.800" end="03:44:27.359" style="s2">more. Zeke suggested ending the match,</p>
<p begin="03:44:25.439" end="03:44:29.760" style="s2">saying continuing would only cause more</p>
<p begin="03:44:27.359" end="03:44:32.160" style="s2">suffering. But suddenly, a mysterious</p>
<p begin="03:44:29.760" end="03:44:34.319" style="s2">purple aura emerged as Venil grabbed</p>
<p begin="03:44:32.160" end="03:44:36.560" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s leg. Zeke didn&#39;t notice anything</p>
<p begin="03:44:34.319" end="03:44:38.640" style="s2">unusual at first and asked if he still</p>
<p begin="03:44:36.560" end="03:44:41.120" style="s2">wanted to continue. As the purple aura</p>
<p begin="03:44:38.640" end="03:44:43.040" style="s2">intensified, Veneil&#39;s face darkened and</p>
<p begin="03:44:41.120" end="03:44:44.720" style="s2">he began laughing like a demon. When</p>
<p begin="03:44:43.040" end="03:44:46.720" style="s2">Zeke questioned what was happening,</p>
