<p begin="03:44:52.720" end="03:44:56.640" style="s2">his source power to defend, but</p>
<p begin="03:44:54.640" end="03:44:58.560" style="s2">something felt off. He couldn&#39;t use it.</p>
<p begin="03:44:56.640" end="03:45:00.720" style="s2">With no choice, he blocked the attack</p>
<p begin="03:44:58.560" end="03:45:02.479" style="s2">using only his physical strength. Ranjis</p>
<p begin="03:45:00.720" end="03:45:04.720" style="s2">and Eric were shocked that Veneil had</p>
<p begin="03:45:02.479" end="03:45:06.319" style="s2">landed a successful hit. Edges noticed</p>
<p begin="03:45:04.720" end="03:45:08.479" style="s2">something strange about Zeke and pointed</p>
<p begin="03:45:06.319" end="03:45:11.040" style="s2">it out. When Selene asked what he meant,</p>
<p begin="03:45:08.479" end="03:45:13.279" style="s2">Leica and Marin arrived. Leica being</p>
