<p begin="03:45:16.880" end="03:45:20.880" style="s2">rather than knowing, she realized he was</p>
<p begin="03:45:18.960" end="03:45:22.720" style="s2">the same as her. During her earlier</p>
<p begin="03:45:20.880" end="03:45:24.800" style="s2">match, she had suddenly been unable to</p>
