<p begin="03:46:47.120" end="03:46:51.359" style="s2">confused. How did Zeke figure it out?</p>
<p begin="03:46:49.600" end="03:46:53.279" style="s2">According to him, that poison shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:46:51.359" end="03:46:55.760" style="s2">have been detectable at all. Then,</p>
