<p begin="03:47:03.680" end="03:47:07.359" style="s2">Zeke added that he had figured out the</p>
<p begin="03:47:05.359" end="03:47:09.439" style="s2">poison only activates when source power</p>
<p begin="03:47:07.359" end="03:47:11.120" style="s2">is stirred. He admitted that it had even</p>
