<p begin="03:48:33.199" end="03:48:37.680" style="s2">strength. If Veniel relied entirely on</p>
<p begin="03:48:35.520" end="03:48:40.319" style="s2">his poison, then he still had a long way</p>
<p begin="03:48:37.680" end="03:48:42.560" style="s2">to go. Venal froze for a moment, stunned</p>
<p begin="03:48:40.319" end="03:48:44.319" style="s2">by those words before asking what Zeke</p>
