<p begin="03:50:36.560" end="03:50:41.279" style="s2">observed, Sandy, unable to hold back,</p>
<p begin="03:50:39.279" end="03:50:43.920" style="s2">asked what Zeke was planning to do.</p>
<p begin="03:50:41.279" end="03:50:45.439" style="s2">Inside the cloud of poison, Vanil spoke.</p>
<p begin="03:50:43.920" end="03:50:47.600" style="s2">He admitted that Zeke was right. He</p>
