<p begin="03:50:52.080" end="03:50:56.880" style="s2">came to poison, he had confidence. As</p>
<p begin="03:50:54.560" end="03:50:58.720" style="s2">long as he had it, he wouldn&#39;t lose. In</p>
<p begin="03:50:56.880" end="03:51:00.720" style="s2">truth, he hadn&#39;t wanted to use this</p>
<p begin="03:50:58.720" end="03:51:03.279" style="s2">technique, but he had no choice. He</p>
<p begin="03:51:00.720" end="03:51:05.359" style="s2">explained that even he, as the creator,</p>
