<p begin="03:51:24.239" end="03:51:28.239" style="s2">final trump card. Veneil couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:51:26.080" end="03:51:30.399" style="s2">believe what he was seeing. As Zeke spat</p>
<p begin="03:51:28.239" end="03:51:32.080" style="s2">out the needles, Venil collapsed to the</p>
<p begin="03:51:30.399" end="03:51:34.000" style="s2">ground in front of him. His face</p>
<p begin="03:51:32.080" end="03:51:36.239" style="s2">darkened, his eyes trembling as he</p>
<p begin="03:51:34.000" end="03:51:38.160" style="s2">watched Zeke&#39;s hands slowly move closer.</p>
<p begin="03:51:36.239" end="03:51:39.760" style="s2">But instead of attacking, Zeke placed</p>
<p begin="03:51:38.160" end="03:51:41.760" style="s2">his hands on Veneil&#39;s shoulders and</p>
<p begin="03:51:39.760" end="03:51:43.760" style="s2">spoke seriously, telling him to listen</p>
<p begin="03:51:41.760" end="03:51:45.439" style="s2">carefully. Kneeling in front of him,</p>
<p begin="03:51:43.760" end="03:51:47.520" style="s2">Zeke said that Venil had one big</p>
<p begin="03:51:45.439" end="03:51:49.520" style="s2">misunderstanding. When Venil asked what</p>
<p begin="03:51:47.520" end="03:51:51.359" style="s2">he meant, Zeke explained that becoming</p>
<p begin="03:51:49.520" end="03:51:53.680" style="s2">strong didn&#39;t require talent in martial</p>
<p begin="03:51:51.359" end="03:51:55.760" style="s2">arts, nor did it require special ability</p>
<p begin="03:51:53.680" end="03:51:58.160" style="s2">with source power. All that mattered was</p>
<p begin="03:51:55.760" end="03:52:00.160" style="s2">the desire to win every single fight.</p>
<p begin="03:51:58.160" end="03:52:01.840" style="s2">That, he said, was the first thing</p>
<p begin="03:52:00.160" end="03:52:03.359" style="s2">Veneil needed to learn because it was</p>
<p begin="03:52:01.840" end="03:52:06.000" style="s2">the path that would lead him to true</p>
<p begin="03:52:03.359" end="03:52:07.760" style="s2">strength. Then Zeke suddenly shouted,</p>
<p begin="03:52:06.000" end="03:52:09.520" style="s2">telling him that his claim of having no</p>
<p begin="03:52:07.760" end="03:52:11.680" style="s2">talent for martial arts was complete</p>
<p begin="03:52:09.520" end="03:52:13.760" style="s2">nonsense. The real problem was that he</p>
<p begin="03:52:11.680" end="03:52:15.359" style="s2">was using the wrong weapon. He suggested</p>
<p begin="03:52:13.760" end="03:52:17.279" style="s2">that Veneil should use something with a</p>
<p begin="03:52:15.359" end="03:52:18.880" style="s2">longer handle and then casually added</p>
<p begin="03:52:17.279" end="03:52:21.359" style="s2">that an umbrella would suit him quite</p>
<p begin="03:52:18.880" end="03:52:23.680" style="s2">well. Venil blinked in shock, asking if</p>
<p begin="03:52:21.359" end="03:52:26.080" style="s2">he was serious. Zeke simply replied that</p>
<p begin="03:52:23.680" end="03:52:28.319" style="s2">it was no joke. It might sound unusual,</p>
<p begin="03:52:26.080" end="03:52:30.880" style="s2">but like his iron fan, it was a weapon</p>
<p begin="03:52:28.319" end="03:52:32.720" style="s2">with a long history. With a small smile,</p>
<p begin="03:52:30.880" end="03:52:34.399" style="s2">he added that almost anything in this</p>
<p begin="03:52:32.720" end="03:52:36.640" style="s2">world could be turned into a weapon.</p>
<p begin="03:52:34.399" end="03:52:38.720" style="s2">Veneil fell silent, wondering if there</p>
<p begin="03:52:36.640" end="03:52:40.560" style="s2">really was a weapon suited for him. Then</p>
<p begin="03:52:38.720" end="03:52:42.319" style="s2">Zeke placed a hand on his head and said</p>
<p begin="03:52:40.560" end="03:52:44.239" style="s2">that despite what he thought on the</p>
<p begin="03:52:42.319" end="03:52:46.160" style="s2">battlefield, he was more of a warrior</p>
<p begin="03:52:44.239" end="03:52:48.640" style="s2">than anyone else. That statement left</p>
<p begin="03:52:46.160" end="03:52:51.040" style="s2">him speechless. Zeke continued, saying</p>
<p begin="03:52:48.640" end="03:52:52.720" style="s2">that in real combat, Venil&#39;s mindset</p>
<p begin="03:52:51.040" end="03:52:54.800" style="s2">wasn&#39;t wrong. As long as he won,</p>
<p begin="03:52:52.720" end="03:52:56.800" style="s2">anything was acceptable. But if he clung</p>
<p begin="03:52:54.800" end="03:52:59.040" style="s2">too tightly to pride, he would never be</p>
<p begin="03:52:56.800" end="03:53:00.880" style="s2">able to protect anything. To win and to</p>
<p begin="03:52:59.040" end="03:53:03.279" style="s2">protect what mattered, he had to use</p>
<p begin="03:53:00.880" end="03:53:05.120" style="s2">every tool at his disposal. His thinking</p>
<p begin="03:53:03.279" end="03:53:07.120" style="s2">wasn&#39;t wrong. He was simply using it in</p>
<p begin="03:53:05.120" end="03:53:09.199" style="s2">the wrong place. Zeke then stood up and</p>
<p begin="03:53:07.120" end="03:53:11.040" style="s2">held out his hand, asking Veneil to come</p>
<p begin="03:53:09.199" end="03:53:12.720" style="s2">with him. Veneil stared at him in</p>
<p begin="03:53:11.040" end="03:53:14.239" style="s2">confusion as Zeke said that if he</p>
<p begin="03:53:12.720" end="03:53:16.080" style="s2">followed him, he would make him as</p>
<p begin="03:53:14.239" end="03:53:17.760" style="s2">strong as he ever wanted to be. When</p>
<p begin="03:53:16.080" end="03:53:19.760" style="s2">Venil asked if he could truly become</p>
<p begin="03:53:17.760" end="03:53:21.680" style="s2">like him, Zeke confirmed it without</p>
<p begin="03:53:19.760" end="03:53:23.760" style="s2">hesitation, even pointing out that he</p>
<p begin="03:53:21.680" end="03:53:26.000" style="s2">was already far stronger. He added that</p>
<p begin="03:53:23.760" end="03:53:27.359" style="s2">once his training began, Venil wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:53:26.000" end="03:53:28.800" style="s2">have time to complain about talent</p>
<p begin="03:53:27.359" end="03:53:30.960" style="s2">anymore because he would train him</p>
<p begin="03:53:28.800" end="03:53:32.960" style="s2">relentlessly until he became strong.</p>
<p begin="03:53:30.960" end="03:53:35.040" style="s2">Veneil stood there in shock, thinking</p>
<p begin="03:53:32.960" end="03:53:36.720" style="s2">that Zeke spoke boldly. But as he</p>
<p begin="03:53:35.040" end="03:53:38.720" style="s2">reflected on those words and remembered</p>
<p begin="03:53:36.720" end="03:53:40.560" style="s2">his desire to grow stronger and earn his</p>
<p begin="03:53:38.720" end="03:53:42.479" style="s2">mother&#39;s acknowledgement, he slowly</p>
<p begin="03:53:40.560" end="03:53:45.040" style="s2">reached out his hand to accept Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:53:42.479" end="03:53:47.120" style="s2">offer. But just before their hands could</p>
<p begin="03:53:45.040" end="03:53:48.880" style="s2">meet, Zeke suddenly delivered a swift</p>
<p begin="03:53:47.120" end="03:53:50.239" style="s2">uppercut, saying that he had almost</p>
<p begin="03:53:48.880" end="03:53:52.479" style="s2">forgotten they were still in the middle</p>
<p begin="03:53:50.239" end="03:53:54.640" style="s2">of a match. Veneil couldn&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="03:53:52.479" end="03:53:56.640" style="s2">After everything Zeke had said, he still</p>
<p begin="03:53:54.640" end="03:53:58.800" style="s2">attacked him. But Zeke simply stated</p>
<p begin="03:53:56.640" end="03:54:00.800" style="s2">that a match was a match. Once Venil</p>
<p begin="03:53:58.800" end="03:54:02.880" style="s2">woke up, he should come find him. As</p>
<p begin="03:54:00.800" end="03:54:05.199" style="s2">Veneil fell unconscious, the poison</p>
<p begin="03:54:02.880" end="03:54:07.040" style="s2">within his body was expelled. Menrich</p>
<p begin="03:54:05.199" end="03:54:08.399" style="s2">immediately declared the match over.</p>
<p begin="03:54:07.040" end="03:54:10.399" style="s2">Though even he couldn&#39;t believe that</p>
<p begin="03:54:08.399" end="03:54:12.160" style="s2">Zeke had managed to detoxify everything</p>
<p begin="03:54:10.399" end="03:54:13.520" style="s2">with just a single punch. He then</p>
<p begin="03:54:12.160" end="03:54:15.600" style="s2">announced that this concluded the</p>
<p begin="03:54:13.520" end="03:54:17.760" style="s2">selection matches and that the east hall</p>
<p begin="03:54:15.600" end="03:54:19.680" style="s2">was pressurious, the ultimate champion</p>
<p begin="03:54:17.760" end="03:54:21.359" style="s2">of the selection. The participants from</p>
<p begin="03:54:19.680" end="03:54:23.359" style="s2">the different halls of the dragon&#39;s nest</p>
<p begin="03:54:21.359" end="03:54:25.120" style="s2">returned as the defeated, carrying with</p>
<p begin="03:54:23.359" end="03:54:27.359" style="s2">them the weight of their losses.</p>
<p begin="03:54:25.120" end="03:54:29.359" style="s2">Meanwhile, as night fell, Zeke and his</p>
<p begin="03:54:27.359" end="03:54:31.920" style="s2">group gathered together and held a small</p>
<p begin="03:54:29.359" end="03:54:33.520" style="s2">feast to celebrate their victory. Before</p>
<p begin="03:54:31.920" end="03:54:34.960" style="s2">the celebration could even begin after</p>
<p begin="03:54:33.520" end="03:54:36.800" style="s2">the selection matches had just</p>
<p begin="03:54:34.960" end="03:54:39.199" style="s2">concluded, no one could help but glance</p>
<p begin="03:54:36.800" end="03:54:41.199" style="s2">at Zeke. At the same time, questions</p>
<p begin="03:54:39.199" end="03:54:43.279" style="s2">began to surface. Wasn&#39;t it East Hall</p>
<p begin="03:54:41.199" end="03:54:45.439" style="s2">that had won the selection matches? Then</p>
<p begin="03:54:43.279" end="03:54:47.439" style="s2">why were they, along with students from</p>
<p begin="03:54:45.439" end="03:54:49.439" style="s2">other halls, summoned to attend the</p>
<p begin="03:54:47.439" end="03:54:50.960" style="s2">celebration as well? Edges simply</p>
<p begin="03:54:49.439" end="03:54:52.960" style="s2">laughed and admitted that he didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="03:54:50.960" end="03:54:54.960" style="s2">the reason either. As everyone continued</p>
<p begin="03:54:52.960" end="03:54:56.880" style="s2">to look towards Zeke, he calmly said</p>
<p begin="03:54:54.960" end="03:54:59.199" style="s2">that he assumed Menrich would explain</p>
<p begin="03:54:56.880" end="03:55:01.120" style="s2">everything to them tonight. Meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="03:54:59.199" end="03:55:03.439" style="s2">Zeke kept eating the food laid out in</p>
<p begin="03:55:01.120" end="03:55:05.359" style="s2">front of them, completely unfazed. He</p>
<p begin="03:55:03.439" end="03:55:06.640" style="s2">soon noticed that his companions, as</p>
<p begin="03:55:05.359" end="03:55:08.880" style="s2">well as the students from the other</p>
<p begin="03:55:06.640" end="03:55:11.120" style="s2">halls of Dragon&#39;s Nest, had yet to start</p>
<p begin="03:55:08.880" end="03:55:13.279" style="s2">eating. With his mouth still full, he</p>
<p begin="03:55:11.120" end="03:55:15.120" style="s2">asked what was wrong and why no one was</p>
<p begin="03:55:13.279" end="03:55:16.640" style="s2">touching the food, even pointing out</p>
<p begin="03:55:15.120" end="03:55:18.640" style="s2">that it would all get cold if they</p>
<p begin="03:55:16.640" end="03:55:20.560" style="s2">didn&#39;t start soon. Lea, however,</p>
<p begin="03:55:18.640" end="03:55:22.319" style="s2">suddenly spoke up, saying she couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:55:20.560" end="03:55:24.319" style="s2">understand how Zeke could eat so calmly</p>
<p begin="03:55:22.319" end="03:55:26.000" style="s2">at a time like this and asked if he</p>
<p begin="03:55:24.319" end="03:55:28.399" style="s2">wasn&#39;t even curious about what they were</p>
<p begin="03:55:26.000" end="03:55:30.319" style="s2">about to be told. Zeke simply continued</p>
<p begin="03:55:28.399" end="03:55:32.640" style="s2">eating, prompting Leica to let out a</p>
<p begin="03:55:30.319" end="03:55:35.040" style="s2">helpless sigh. Just then, the door</p>
<p begin="03:55:32.640" end="03:55:36.960" style="s2">opened and Mench entered, apologizing</p>
<p begin="03:55:35.040" end="03:55:38.800" style="s2">for making the students wait. He told</p>
<p begin="03:55:36.960" end="03:55:40.640" style="s2">them to begin eating, only to notice</p>
<p begin="03:55:38.800" end="03:55:42.720" style="s2">that Zeke was already devouring the food</p>
<p begin="03:55:40.640" end="03:55:44.560" style="s2">beside him, so he casually added that</p>
<p begin="03:55:42.720" end="03:55:46.560" style="s2">everyone else should eat well, too. As</p>
<p begin="03:55:44.560" end="03:55:48.399" style="s2">the meal went on, Metric explained that</p>
<p begin="03:55:46.560" end="03:55:50.000" style="s2">the feast was also meant to reward them</p>
<p begin="03:55:48.399" end="03:55:52.319" style="s2">for participating in the selection</p>
<p begin="03:55:50.000" end="03:55:53.840" style="s2">matches. Soon after, he called for</p>
<p begin="03:55:52.319" end="03:55:55.439" style="s2">everyone&#39;s attention and announced that</p>
<p begin="03:55:53.840" end="03:55:57.520" style="s2">he would begin explaining the special</p>
<p begin="03:55:55.439" end="03:55:58.960" style="s2">mission. Edges raised his hand and asked</p>
<p begin="03:55:57.520" end="03:56:00.880" style="s2">if they were even allowed to hear about</p>
<p begin="03:55:58.960" end="03:56:02.720" style="s2">it, to which Menrich replied that there</p>
<p begin="03:56:00.880" end="03:56:04.720" style="s2">was no problem Edges himself might end</p>
<p begin="03:56:02.720" end="03:56:06.960" style="s2">up participating. This left Edges</p>
<p begin="03:56:04.720" end="03:56:09.040" style="s2">confused. Menrich then revealed that a</p>
<p begin="03:56:06.960" end="03:56:10.720" style="s2">few days ago, a special rift had been</p>
<p begin="03:56:09.040" end="03:56:12.560" style="s2">discovered on the Eldreon family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:56:10.720" end="03:56:14.560" style="s2">grounds. The announcement shocked</p>
<p begin="03:56:12.560" end="03:56:16.560" style="s2">everyone, including Zeke, who recalled</p>
<p begin="03:56:14.560" end="03:56:18.479" style="s2">reading about rifts in books before.</p>
<p begin="03:56:16.560" end="03:56:20.479" style="s2">Mench continued, saying that while</p>
<p begin="03:56:18.479" end="03:56:22.399" style="s2">everyone likely knew a bit about rifts,</p>
<p begin="03:56:20.479" end="03:56:24.239" style="s2">special rifts were different. Simply</p>
<p begin="03:56:22.399" end="03:56:26.399" style="s2">put, they could not be cleared by normal</p>
<p begin="03:56:24.239" end="03:56:28.080" style="s2">means. Leica asked what he meant, and</p>
<p begin="03:56:26.399" end="03:56:29.920" style="s2">Menrich explained that this particular</p>
<p begin="03:56:28.080" end="03:56:31.520" style="s2">rift would only allow seven people to</p>
<p begin="03:56:29.920" end="03:56:33.600" style="s2">enter, and all of them had to be</p>
<p begin="03:56:31.520" end="03:56:36.080" style="s2">three-star level or lower. Anyone</p>
<p begin="03:56:33.600" end="03:56:38.479" style="s2">fourstar or above or exceeding the set</p>
<p begin="03:56:36.080" end="03:56:40.479" style="s2">number would be forcibly pushed out. If</p>
<p begin="03:56:38.479" end="03:56:42.560" style="s2">the conditions weren&#39;t met, entry was</p>
<p begin="03:56:40.479" end="03:56:44.880" style="s2">impossible, not even the family head</p>
<p begin="03:56:42.560" end="03:56:47.279" style="s2">could enter. Therefore, any attempt had</p>
<p begin="03:56:44.880" end="03:56:49.120" style="s2">to strictly follow these rules. He added</p>
<p begin="03:56:47.279" end="03:56:51.439" style="s2">that although the Eldreon family did</p>
<p begin="03:56:49.120" end="03:56:53.359" style="s2">have some three star soldiers, rifts had</p>
<p begin="03:56:51.439" end="03:56:55.359" style="s2">been appearing more frequently lately,</p>
<p begin="03:56:53.359" end="03:56:57.279" style="s2">leaving them short-handed. That was why</p>
<p begin="03:56:55.359" end="03:56:58.960" style="s2">the students had been chosen. He also</p>
<p begin="03:56:57.279" end="03:57:01.120" style="s2">revealed that the special rift most</p>
<p begin="03:56:58.960" end="03:57:03.680" style="s2">likely contained magic water, something</p>
<p begin="03:57:01.120" end="03:57:05.600" style="s2">necessary to awaken magic power. At the</p>
<p begin="03:57:03.680" end="03:57:07.760" style="s2">mention of magic water, the students</p>
<p begin="03:57:05.600" end="03:57:09.680" style="s2">were visibly shaken. Zeke immediately</p>
<p begin="03:57:07.760" end="03:57:11.680" style="s2">said he had read about it before and</p>
<p begin="03:57:09.680" end="03:57:13.760" style="s2">Mench confirmed that he was correct by</p>
<p begin="03:57:11.680" end="03:57:15.840" style="s2">consuming magic water. One could gain</p>
<p begin="03:57:13.760" end="03:57:17.760" style="s2">the ability to convert source power into</p>
<p begin="03:57:15.840" end="03:57:19.920" style="s2">magic power, which was essential to</p>
<p begin="03:57:17.760" end="03:57:22.000" style="s2">becoming a magician. Hearing this,</p>
<p begin="03:57:19.920" end="03:57:24.000" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s eyes lit up as thoughts of magic</p>
<p begin="03:57:22.000" end="03:57:25.520" style="s2">filled his mind. Menrich went on to</p>
<p begin="03:57:24.000" end="03:57:27.920" style="s2">explain that the world was ruled by</p>
<p begin="03:57:25.520" end="03:57:29.920" style="s2">eight great houses, including theirs,</p>
<p begin="03:57:27.920" end="03:57:32.319" style="s2">the Eldragon family, collectively known</p>
<p begin="03:57:29.920" end="03:57:34.080" style="s2">as the eight gates of dominion. However,</p>
<p begin="03:57:32.319" end="03:57:36.080" style="s2">while the other houses all possessed</p>
<p begin="03:57:34.080" end="03:57:38.319" style="s2">magic springs that naturally produced</p>
<p begin="03:57:36.080" end="03:57:40.239" style="s2">magic water, the Eldreon family had</p>
<p begin="03:57:38.319" end="03:57:42.080" style="s2">none. That was why this mission was</p>
<p begin="03:57:40.239" end="03:57:44.080" style="s2">critical. They had to clear the special</p>
<p begin="03:57:42.080" end="03:57:46.239" style="s2">rift and retrieve the magic water.</p>
<p begin="03:57:44.080" end="03:57:48.319" style="s2">Failure was not an option. Mentric&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:57:46.239" end="03:57:49.840" style="s2">expression then turned serious as he</p>
<p begin="03:57:48.319" end="03:57:51.520" style="s2">added that the rift had appeared near</p>
<p begin="03:57:49.840" end="03:57:53.199" style="s2">the border of another of the eight gates</p>
<p begin="03:57:51.520" end="03:57:55.279" style="s2">of Dominion, the territory of the</p>
<p begin="03:57:53.199" end="03:57:56.880" style="s2">Kerberous family. It was almost certain</p>
<p begin="03:57:55.279" end="03:57:59.040" style="s2">that they would be targeting the rift as</p>
<p begin="03:57:56.880" end="03:58:00.640" style="s2">well. With that in mind, the selection</p>
<p begin="03:57:59.040" end="03:58:02.720" style="s2">matches had been held to identify</p>
<p begin="03:58:00.640" end="03:58:05.199" style="s2">capable three star and below individuals</p>
<p begin="03:58:02.720" end="03:58:07.359" style="s2">from Dragon&#39;s Nest. Edgis and Sandy</p>
<p begin="03:58:05.199" end="03:58:09.199" style="s2">exchanged glances, and Edges pointed out</p>
<p begin="03:58:07.359" end="03:58:11.359" style="s2">that the seven members of East Hall who</p>
<p begin="03:58:09.199" end="03:58:14.000" style="s2">had won would likely be the ones sent to</p>
<p begin="03:58:11.359" end="03:58:15.600" style="s2">clear the rift. Sandy smiled, seeing</p>
<p begin="03:58:14.000" end="03:58:17.359" style="s2">this mission as a major step toward</p>
<p begin="03:58:15.600" end="03:58:19.359" style="s2">helping Leica get closer to becoming the</p>
<p begin="03:58:17.359" end="03:58:21.120" style="s2">next family head. However, Metric</p>
<p begin="03:58:19.359" end="03:58:23.120" style="s2">clarified that although East Hall had</p>
<p begin="03:58:21.120" end="03:58:24.560" style="s2">won, it didn&#39;t automatically mean all</p>
<p begin="03:58:23.120" end="03:58:27.520" style="s2">seven of them would form the strike</p>
<p begin="03:58:24.560" end="03:58:29.279" style="s2">team. Even so, Edges remained hopeful</p>
<p begin="03:58:27.520" end="03:58:31.600" style="s2">while Sandy thought about how she could</p>
<p begin="03:58:29.279" end="03:58:33.520" style="s2">support Leica. Menrich then stood up and</p>
<p begin="03:58:31.600" end="03:58:35.520" style="s2">struck the table, declaring that from</p>
<p begin="03:58:33.520" end="03:58:37.199" style="s2">this point forward, under East Hall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="03:58:35.520" end="03:58:39.680" style="s2">leadership, they would form the strike</p>
<p begin="03:58:37.199" end="03:58:41.120" style="s2">team regardless of wins or losses. The</p>
<p begin="03:58:39.680" end="03:58:42.640" style="s2">purpose of the matches had been to</p>
<p begin="03:58:41.120" end="03:58:44.479" style="s2">observe everyone&#39;s strengths and</p>
<p begin="03:58:42.640" end="03:58:46.720" style="s2">fighting styles as a basis for team</p>
<p begin="03:58:44.479" end="03:58:48.319" style="s2">formation. Glancing at Venil, he</p>
<p begin="03:58:46.720" end="03:58:49.680" style="s2">remarked that some individuals hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:58:48.319" end="03:58:52.399" style="s2">been able to fully display their</p>
<p begin="03:58:49.680" end="03:58:54.479" style="s2">abilities. Then turning to Zeke who was</p>
<p begin="03:58:52.399" end="03:58:55.840" style="s2">still eating, Mench declared that Zeke</p>
<p begin="03:58:54.479" end="03:58:58.239" style="s2">would choose the members of the strike</p>
<p begin="03:58:55.840" end="03:58:59.600" style="s2">team. This shocked Zeke who immediately</p>
<p begin="03:58:58.239" end="03:59:01.920" style="s2">questioned why he had to make the</p>
<p begin="03:58:59.600" end="03:59:03.840" style="s2">decision. The room fell silent as Metric</p>
<p begin="03:59:01.920" end="03:59:05.840" style="s2">asked why he found it surprising. As</p>
<p begin="03:59:03.840" end="03:59:07.359" style="s2">East Hall&#39;s representative, it was only</p>
<p begin="03:59:05.840" end="03:59:09.600" style="s2">natural that he would lead and choose</p>
<p begin="03:59:07.359" end="03:59:11.600" style="s2">the team. However, Zeke said that wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="03:59:09.600" end="03:59:14.160" style="s2">what he intended. And after glancing at</p>
<p begin="03:59:11.600" end="03:59:16.239" style="s2">Lea, he suddenly came up with an idea.</p>
<p begin="03:59:14.160" end="03:59:18.080" style="s2">With a grin, he suggested that Lea</p>
<p begin="03:59:16.239" end="03:59:20.160" style="s2">should choose the members instead. This</p>
<p begin="03:59:18.080" end="03:59:22.319" style="s2">startled Lea, who questioned why it had</p>
<p begin="03:59:20.160" end="03:59:24.080" style="s2">to be her. Zeke simply asked if he would</p>
<p begin="03:59:22.319" end="03:59:26.160" style="s2">be part of the mission, to which Leica</p>
<p begin="03:59:24.080" end="03:59:27.760" style="s2">replied that it was obvious he would be.</p>
<p begin="03:59:26.160" end="03:59:29.199" style="s2">She then asked if he was really okay</p>
<p begin="03:59:27.760" end="03:59:31.279" style="s2">with her making the decisions and</p>
<p begin="03:59:29.199" end="03:59:33.279" style="s2">leading the team. Zeke responded that</p>
<p begin="03:59:31.279" end="03:59:35.279" style="s2">whether it was okay or not didn&#39;t matter</p>
<p begin="03:59:33.279" end="03:59:37.199" style="s2">if he were the one to choose, he&#39;d just</p>
<p begin="03:59:35.279" end="03:59:39.199" style="s2">make himself the only member. This</p>
<p begin="03:59:37.199" end="03:59:41.279" style="s2">shocked Leica, who immediately pointed</p>
<p begin="03:59:39.199" end="03:59:42.640" style="s2">out that knowing him, he&#39;d probably</p>
<p begin="03:59:41.279" end="03:59:44.560" style="s2">enter the rift alone if it were</p>
<p begin="03:59:42.640" end="03:59:46.720" style="s2">possible. As Leica began thinking about</p>
<p begin="03:59:44.560" end="03:59:48.800" style="s2">who to choose, Zeke added that if she</p>
<p begin="03:59:46.720" end="03:59:50.720" style="s2">aimed to become the next family head,</p>
<p begin="03:59:48.800" end="03:59:52.800" style="s2">this was a perfect opportunity to train</p>
<p begin="03:59:50.720" end="03:59:54.479" style="s2">her judgment. He then asked Menrich if</p>
<p begin="03:59:52.800" end="03:59:56.640" style="s2">he minded letting Leica take the role</p>
<p begin="03:59:54.479" end="03:59:58.720" style="s2">instead. Menrix said he didn&#39;t mind and</p>
<p begin="03:59:56.640" end="04:00:00.160" style="s2">asked if Zeke was sure, reminding him</p>
<p begin="03:59:58.720" end="04:00:01.920" style="s2">that leading this mission would bring</p>
<p begin="04:00:00.160" end="04:00:03.920" style="s2">him one step closer to becoming the</p>
<p begin="04:00:01.920" end="04:00:06.319" style="s2">family head. But with the expression of</p>
<p begin="04:00:03.920" end="04:00:07.680" style="s2">someone far older than his years, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:00:06.319" end="04:00:09.760" style="s2">said he had no interest in that</p>
<p begin="04:00:07.680" end="04:00:12.080" style="s2">position. This stunned everyone,</p>
<p begin="04:00:09.760" end="04:00:14.080" style="s2">including Veneil. Edges quickly asked if</p>
<p begin="04:00:12.080" end="04:00:15.840" style="s2">he was serious. Sandy echoed the</p>
<p begin="04:00:14.080" end="04:00:18.080" style="s2">question, and Leica herself sought</p>
<p begin="04:00:15.840" end="04:00:19.760" style="s2">confirmation. Zeke calmly replied that</p>
<p begin="04:00:18.080" end="04:00:21.840" style="s2">it wasn&#39;t a big deal to him. It all</p>
<p begin="04:00:19.760" end="04:00:24.000" style="s2">depended on what he personally valued.</p>
<p begin="04:00:21.840" end="04:00:25.920" style="s2">Edgis insisted that becoming family head</p>
<p begin="04:00:24.000" end="04:00:28.239" style="s2">would mean having everything the Eldreon</p>
<p begin="04:00:25.920" end="04:00:30.239" style="s2">family possessed, but Zeke firmly stated</p>
<p begin="04:00:28.239" end="04:00:32.239" style="s2">that he didn&#39;t need any of it. There was</p>
<p begin="04:00:30.239" end="04:00:34.479" style="s2">only one thing he wanted, the end of the</p>
<p begin="04:00:32.239" end="04:00:37.120" style="s2">Marshall path. His words left everyone</p>
<p begin="04:00:34.479" end="04:00:38.880" style="s2">in stunned silence. Zeke then reassured</p>
<p begin="04:00:37.120" end="04:00:40.880" style="s2">Leica not to worry about him and told</p>
<p begin="04:00:38.880" end="04:00:43.199" style="s2">her to focus on choosing her team.</p>
<p begin="04:00:40.880" end="04:00:44.560" style="s2">Accepting his words, Lea stood and began</p>
<p begin="04:00:43.199" end="04:00:46.800" style="s2">selecting the members of the strike</p>
<p begin="04:00:44.560" end="04:00:48.479" style="s2">team. Meanwhile, within the Kerberous</p>
<p begin="04:00:46.800" end="04:00:50.160" style="s2">family, the family had questioned</p>
<p begin="04:00:48.479" end="04:00:52.399" style="s2">whether the report he had received was</p>
<p begin="04:00:50.160" end="04:00:54.160" style="s2">true. His subordinate confirmed that a</p>
<p begin="04:00:52.399" end="04:00:56.319" style="s2">special rift had indeed appeared in the</p>
<p begin="04:00:54.160" end="04:00:58.160" style="s2">great abundant forest. When asked if the</p>
<p begin="04:00:56.319" end="04:01:00.160" style="s2">lizards had already begun moving, a term</p>
<p begin="04:00:58.160" end="04:01:02.160" style="s2">he used to refer to Balsza, the head of</p>
<p begin="04:01:00.160" end="04:01:04.160" style="s2">the Eldreon family, the subordinate</p>
<p begin="04:01:02.160" end="04:01:05.920" style="s2">broke into a cold sweat. A heavy</p>
<p begin="04:01:04.160" end="04:01:07.760" style="s2">pressure filled the room as the Kerrous</p>
<p begin="04:01:05.920" end="04:01:09.920" style="s2">family head demanded to know why he was</p>
<p begin="04:01:07.760" end="04:01:12.000" style="s2">only being informed now. The subordinate</p>
<p begin="04:01:09.920" end="04:01:13.840" style="s2">immediately apologized, explaining that</p>
<p begin="04:01:12.000" end="04:01:16.239" style="s2">the Eldragon family had deliberately</p>
<p begin="04:01:13.840" end="04:01:18.160" style="s2">misled them, causing the delay. After</p>
<p begin="04:01:16.239" end="04:01:20.319" style="s2">hearing this, the family had remarked</p>
<p begin="04:01:18.160" end="04:01:22.239" style="s2">that he had heard of such tactics before</p>
<p begin="04:01:20.319" end="04:01:24.560" style="s2">and noted how unusually active the</p>
<p begin="04:01:22.239" end="04:01:26.560" style="s2">Eldreon family had been in the forest.</p>
<p begin="04:01:24.560" end="04:01:28.880" style="s2">It all made sense now. He called them</p>
<p begin="04:01:26.560" end="04:01:30.319" style="s2">crafty pests. The subordinate added that</p>
<p begin="04:01:28.880" end="04:01:32.800" style="s2">there was a high chance the rift</p>
<p begin="04:01:30.319" end="04:01:34.800" style="s2">contained magic water. Hearing this, the</p>
<p begin="04:01:32.800" end="04:01:36.960" style="s2">family head said that in that case, the</p>
<p begin="04:01:34.800" end="04:01:38.720" style="s2">Eldreon family would stop at nothing to</p>
<p begin="04:01:36.960" end="04:01:40.640" style="s2">secure it. He then asked about the</p>
<p begin="04:01:38.720" end="04:01:42.800" style="s2">conditions for entering the rift and was</p>
<p begin="04:01:40.640" end="04:01:45.199" style="s2">told that it required seven individuals,</p>
<p begin="04:01:42.800" end="04:01:46.720" style="s2">all at three star level or below. The</p>
<p begin="04:01:45.199" end="04:01:48.560" style="s2">family head noted that while the</p>
<p begin="04:01:46.720" end="04:01:50.560" style="s2">condition wasn&#39;t particularly difficult,</p>
<p begin="04:01:48.560" end="04:01:52.399" style="s2">the Eldregan family had still beaten</p>
<p begin="04:01:50.560" end="04:01:54.160" style="s2">them to it and likely filled all</p>
<p begin="04:01:52.399" end="04:01:55.920" style="s2">available slots. However, the</p>
<p begin="04:01:54.160" end="04:01:57.439" style="s2">subordinate revealed that the Eldreon</p>
<p begin="04:01:55.920" end="04:02:00.000" style="s2">family didn&#39;t have enough soldiers to</p>
<p begin="04:01:57.439" end="04:02:02.000" style="s2">spare and were instead sending trainees.</p>
<p begin="04:02:00.000" end="04:02:03.359" style="s2">The family had confirmed this and</p>
<p begin="04:02:02.000" end="04:02:05.040" style="s2">questioned whether they were truly</p>
<p begin="04:02:03.359" end="04:02:07.199" style="s2">planning to clear a special rift with</p>
<p begin="04:02:05.040" end="04:02:08.960" style="s2">inexperienced youths. When assured that</p>
<p begin="04:02:07.199" end="04:02:10.640" style="s2">the information was accurate, he was</p>
<p begin="04:02:08.960" end="04:02:12.239" style="s2">asked what their next move should be,</p>
<p begin="04:02:10.640" end="04:02:14.239" style="s2">whether they should quickly assemble a</p>
<p begin="04:02:12.239" end="04:02:16.000" style="s2">team. The family had replied that even</p>
<p begin="04:02:14.239" end="04:02:18.720" style="s2">if they did, they would already be too</p>
<p begin="04:02:16.000" end="04:02:20.960" style="s2">late. However, if the Lragon family was</p>
<p begin="04:02:18.720" end="04:02:22.960" style="s2">indeed sending trainees, then Balsa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:02:20.960" end="04:02:24.399" style="s2">heir would undoubtedly be among them.</p>
<p begin="04:02:22.960" end="04:02:26.399" style="s2">When the subordinate asked what he</p>
<p begin="04:02:24.399" end="04:02:28.319" style="s2">meant, the family had instead asked how</p>
<p begin="04:02:26.399" end="04:02:30.000" style="s2">many deception bracelets they had left.</p>
<p begin="04:02:28.319" end="04:02:32.319" style="s2">The subordinate answered that they had</p>
<p begin="04:02:30.000" end="04:02:34.399" style="s2">four remaining. Upon hearing this, the</p>
<p begin="04:02:32.319" end="04:02:36.399" style="s2">family head issued his command. Use all</p>
<p begin="04:02:34.399" end="04:02:37.920" style="s2">the deception bracelets if necessary, so</p>
<p begin="04:02:36.399" end="04:02:40.080" style="s2">long as they could eliminate Balsa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:02:37.920" end="04:02:41.520" style="s2">children. The subordinate hesitated,</p>
<p begin="04:02:40.080" end="04:02:43.359" style="s2">pointing out that they didn&#39;t know when</p>
<p begin="04:02:41.520" end="04:02:45.359" style="s2">they would obtain more. But the family</p>
<p begin="04:02:43.359" end="04:02:47.040" style="s2">head dismissed the concern, saying that</p>
<p begin="04:02:45.359" end="04:02:49.120" style="s2">if they hoarded them, they would only</p>
<p begin="04:02:47.040" end="04:02:51.520" style="s2">gather dust. It was better to use them</p>
<p begin="04:02:49.120" end="04:02:53.760" style="s2">now where they would truly matter. with</p>
<p begin="04:02:51.520" end="04:02:55.359" style="s2">a cruel smile. He added that he wondered</p>
<p begin="04:02:53.760" end="04:02:56.960" style="s2">what kind of expression that lizard</p>
<p begin="04:02:55.359" end="04:02:58.399" style="s2">bastard would make when his child was</p>
<p begin="04:02:56.960" end="04:03:00.640" style="s2">killed and that it would be quite</p>
<p begin="04:02:58.399" end="04:03:03.279" style="s2">entertaining to witness Balza Eldreon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:03:00.640" end="04:03:05.040" style="s2">reaction. The day after the celebration,</p>
<p begin="04:03:03.279" end="04:03:06.800" style="s2">Zeke told everyone that they would all</p>
<p begin="04:03:05.040" end="04:03:08.479" style="s2">have to become much stronger. And he</p>
<p begin="04:03:06.800" end="04:03:10.160" style="s2">first called on Eric and Marin,</p>
<p begin="04:03:08.479" end="04:03:12.560" style="s2">instructing them to return to basic</p>
<p begin="04:03:10.160" end="04:03:14.000" style="s2">training. He explained that like Rangis</p>
<p begin="04:03:12.560" end="04:03:16.000" style="s2">and the others, they would be running</p>
<p begin="04:03:14.000" end="04:03:18.000" style="s2">every day and building up their muscles,</p>
<p begin="04:03:16.000" end="04:03:19.600" style="s2">adding that with a solid foundation,</p>
<p begin="04:03:18.000" end="04:03:21.760" style="s2">they would be able to handle stronger</p>
<p begin="04:03:19.600" end="04:03:23.199" style="s2">techniques. Eric immediately questioned</p>
<p begin="04:03:21.760" end="04:03:24.960" style="s2">whether they were really going to train</p>
<p begin="04:03:23.199" end="04:03:26.960" style="s2">the same way Rangis and the others had</p>
<p begin="04:03:24.960" end="04:03:28.960" style="s2">trained before. But Zeke responded with</p>
<p begin="04:03:26.960" end="04:03:31.199" style="s2">a question of his own, asking if there</p>
<p begin="04:03:28.960" end="04:03:32.960" style="s2">was something wrong. Meanwhile, Rangus</p>
<p begin="04:03:31.199" end="04:03:34.880" style="s2">and the others were smiling behind Eric</p>
<p begin="04:03:32.960" end="04:03:36.399" style="s2">and Marin, leaving the two with no</p>
<p begin="04:03:34.880" end="04:03:38.000" style="s2">choice but to say that there was no</p>
<p begin="04:03:36.399" end="04:03:39.359" style="s2">problem, even though their answer</p>
<p begin="04:03:38.000" end="04:03:42.080" style="s2">clearly went against their true</p>
<p begin="04:03:39.359" end="04:03:44.319" style="s2">feelings. Even so, Zeke was pleased with</p>
<p begin="04:03:42.080" end="04:03:46.399" style="s2">their response. Soon after, he grabbed</p>
<p begin="04:03:44.319" end="04:03:48.319" style="s2">and pulled aside a red cloak, revealing</p>
<p begin="04:03:46.399" end="04:03:50.319" style="s2">a massive boulder, and then called</p>
<p begin="04:03:48.319" end="04:03:52.160" style="s2">Raymond over, telling him that he would</p>
<p begin="04:03:50.319" end="04:03:54.319" style="s2">be using the regeneration stone prepared</p>
<p begin="04:03:52.160" end="04:03:55.920" style="s2">by their instructor. Raymond immediately</p>
<p begin="04:03:54.319" end="04:03:57.920" style="s2">asked if he would really be using a</p>
<p begin="04:03:55.920" end="04:03:59.840" style="s2">regeneration stone for his training. And</p>
<p begin="04:03:57.920" end="04:04:01.520" style="s2">Zeke confirmed it, saying that he</p>
<p begin="04:03:59.840" end="04:04:03.439" style="s2">remembered how it worked and thought it</p>
<p begin="04:04:01.520" end="04:04:05.600" style="s2">would be perfect. As Zeke picked up a</p>
<p begin="04:04:03.439" end="04:04:07.600" style="s2">small shield, he explained that as they</p>
<p begin="04:04:05.600" end="04:04:09.199" style="s2">all knew, the regeneration stone could</p>
<p begin="04:04:07.600" end="04:04:11.199" style="s2">reflect any impact dealt to it,</p>
<p begin="04:04:09.199" end="04:04:12.560" style="s2">multiplied a h 100 times over, and that</p>
<p begin="04:04:11.199" end="04:04:14.560" style="s2">it was something they could not break</p>
<p begin="04:04:12.560" end="04:04:16.160" style="s2">without using source power. Yet, he was</p>
<p begin="04:04:14.560" end="04:04:18.319" style="s2">about to strike it without using any</p>
<p begin="04:04:16.160" end="04:04:20.080" style="s2">source power at all, which made Eric and</p>
<p begin="04:04:18.319" end="04:04:21.840" style="s2">Marin wonder what he was planning.</p>
<p begin="04:04:20.080" end="04:04:24.160" style="s2">Gathering his physical strength into his</p>
<p begin="04:04:21.840" end="04:04:26.000" style="s2">arm, Zeke struck the regeneration stone</p>
<p begin="04:04:24.160" end="04:04:27.840" style="s2">with the small shield, causing a</p>
<p begin="04:04:26.000" end="04:04:29.840" style="s2">powerful gust of wind to surge through</p>
<p begin="04:04:27.840" end="04:04:31.920" style="s2">the surroundings. Marin could hardly</p>
<p begin="04:04:29.840" end="04:04:34.080" style="s2">believe it, realizing that Zeke had hit</p>
<p begin="04:04:31.920" end="04:04:36.239" style="s2">the regeneration stone normally and that</p>
<p begin="04:04:34.080" end="04:04:37.920" style="s2">without using source power, the recoil</p>
<p begin="04:04:36.239" end="04:04:39.840" style="s2">should have been overwhelming. As</p>
<p begin="04:04:37.920" end="04:04:41.840" style="s2">everyone stood watching, Raymond was</p>
<p begin="04:04:39.840" end="04:04:43.439" style="s2">left stunned by what he saw. Quickly</p>
<p begin="04:04:41.840" end="04:04:45.279" style="s2">realizing that Zeke had endured the</p>
<p begin="04:04:43.439" end="04:04:47.920" style="s2">reflected shock from the regeneration</p>
<p begin="04:04:45.279" end="04:04:49.199" style="s2">stone using only his shield. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="04:04:47.920" end="04:04:50.880" style="s2">showed them the cracked shield and</p>
<p begin="04:04:49.199" end="04:04:52.880" style="s2">explained that just like what he had</p>
<p begin="04:04:50.880" end="04:04:54.960" style="s2">done, he wanted Raymond to train by</p>
<p begin="04:04:52.880" end="04:04:57.279" style="s2">taking the shock headon or by deflecting</p>
<p begin="04:04:54.960" end="04:04:59.359" style="s2">it. Raymond acknowledged this, thinking</p>
<p begin="04:04:57.279" end="04:05:01.359" style="s2">to himself that from now on he would</p>
<p begin="04:04:59.359" end="04:05:03.199" style="s2">follow what Zeke had demonstrated.</p>
<p begin="04:05:01.359" end="04:05:04.800" style="s2">Seline, on the other hand, remarked that</p>
<p begin="04:05:03.199" end="04:05:07.040" style="s2">she had never imagined there was a way</p>
<p begin="04:05:04.800" end="04:05:09.040" style="s2">to train using a regeneration stone. But</p>
<p begin="04:05:07.040" end="04:05:11.359" style="s2">at that moment, Zeke also called her</p>
<p begin="04:05:09.040" end="04:05:13.279" style="s2">forward. Seline responded immediately,</p>
<p begin="04:05:11.359" end="04:05:15.040" style="s2">and Zeke instructed her to repeatedly</p>
<p begin="04:05:13.279" end="04:05:17.120" style="s2">thrust her sword at the regeneration</p>
<p begin="04:05:15.040" end="04:05:19.120" style="s2">stone. He allowed her to use her source</p>
<p begin="04:05:17.120" end="04:05:21.359" style="s2">power, but emphasized that she needed to</p>
<p begin="04:05:19.120" end="04:05:23.359" style="s2">focus all her aim on a single point and</p>
<p begin="04:05:21.359" end="04:05:25.040" style="s2">not let any of her attacks wander.</p>
<p begin="04:05:23.359" end="04:05:27.040" style="s2">Seline quickly agreed and drew her</p>
<p begin="04:05:25.040" end="04:05:29.040" style="s2">sword, launching a series of rapid</p>
<p begin="04:05:27.040" end="04:05:31.279" style="s2">strikes at the regeneration stone, but</p>
<p begin="04:05:29.040" end="04:05:33.359" style="s2">her attacks landed on different areas.</p>
<p begin="04:05:31.279" end="04:05:35.040" style="s2">As Zeke pointed out her strikes, he</p>
<p begin="04:05:33.359" end="04:05:37.600" style="s2">explained that even when trying to focus</p>
<p begin="04:05:35.040" end="04:05:39.840" style="s2">on one spot, it was not easy, and Seline</p>
<p begin="04:05:37.600" end="04:05:41.279" style="s2">immediately acknowledged this. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="04:05:39.840" end="04:05:43.279" style="s2">said that her training would be to learn</p>
<p begin="04:05:41.279" end="04:05:45.199" style="s2">how to always strike a single point.</p>
<p begin="04:05:43.279" end="04:05:46.880" style="s2">Borrowing Seline&#39;s sword, he walked</p>
<p begin="04:05:45.199" end="04:05:48.560" style="s2">toward the regeneration stone and</p>
<p begin="04:05:46.880" end="04:05:50.560" style="s2">remarked that it had already repaired</p>
<p begin="04:05:48.560" end="04:05:52.640" style="s2">the damage she had dealt, adding that no</p>
<p begin="04:05:50.560" end="04:05:54.399" style="s2">matter how many times he saw it, he</p>
<p begin="04:05:52.640" end="04:05:56.479" style="s2">never got used to it, and that this was</p>
<p begin="04:05:54.399" end="04:05:58.479" style="s2">exactly why it was perfect for training.</p>
<p begin="04:05:56.479" end="04:06:00.720" style="s2">He then told Seline to watch closely,</p>
<p begin="04:05:58.479" end="04:06:02.800" style="s2">and in the next instant, he unleashed a</p>
<p begin="04:06:00.720" end="04:06:04.720" style="s2">series of rapid attacks with her sword,</p>
<p begin="04:06:02.800" end="04:06:06.800" style="s2">each one landing precisely on the same</p>
<p begin="04:06:04.720" end="04:06:09.040" style="s2">point of the regeneration stone, leaving</p>
<p begin="04:06:06.800" end="04:06:11.120" style="s2">Seline stunned and nearly at a loss for</p>
<p begin="04:06:09.040" end="04:06:12.880" style="s2">words in her amazement. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="04:06:11.120" end="04:06:14.399" style="s2">explained that her flower sword style</p>
<p begin="04:06:12.880" end="04:06:16.160" style="s2">tended to focus on the number of</p>
<p begin="04:06:14.399" end="04:06:18.319" style="s2">strikes, but it would be better for her</p>
<p begin="04:06:16.160" end="04:06:20.080" style="s2">to learn to value each blow and aim it</p>
<p begin="04:06:18.319" end="04:06:22.399" style="s2">properly, and Seline nodded in</p>
<p begin="04:06:20.080" end="04:06:23.840" style="s2">agreement. Zeke then called Rangus, who</p>
<p begin="04:06:22.399" end="04:06:25.760" style="s2">answered immediately while wondering</p>
<p begin="04:06:23.840" end="04:06:27.520" style="s2">what kind of training he would receive.</p>
<p begin="04:06:25.760" end="04:06:29.120" style="s2">But he was completely shocked when Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:06:27.520" end="04:06:31.120" style="s2">pulled out a feather and said that it</p>
<p begin="04:06:29.120" end="04:06:32.800" style="s2">would be used for his training. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:06:31.120" end="04:06:34.720" style="s2">used windsource power to make the</p>
<p begin="04:06:32.800" end="04:06:36.720" style="s2">feather float, and Rangus quickly</p>
<p begin="04:06:34.720" end="04:06:39.199" style="s2">noticed that it was the same windsource</p>
<p begin="04:06:36.720" end="04:06:40.720" style="s2">power used by Lord Venil. Raymond asked</p>
<p begin="04:06:39.199" end="04:06:42.800" style="s2">when Zeke had learned to use winds</p>
<p begin="04:06:40.720" end="04:06:44.319" style="s2">source power. And Zeke casually replied</p>
<p begin="04:06:42.800" end="04:06:46.319" style="s2">that he had acquired it after fighting</p>
<p begin="04:06:44.319" end="04:06:48.640" style="s2">Veneil, explaining that after taking</p>
<p begin="04:06:46.319" end="04:06:50.479" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s wind aura headon, he found that</p>
<p begin="04:06:48.640" end="04:06:52.960" style="s2">he could use it as well, which caused</p>
<p begin="04:06:50.479" end="04:06:55.439" style="s2">Ranges to stare in shock, finding the</p>
<p begin="04:06:52.960" end="04:06:56.880" style="s2">situation completely unbelievable. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:06:55.439" end="04:06:59.120" style="s2">then placed the feather on the tip of</p>
<p begin="04:06:56.880" end="04:07:01.359" style="s2">Rangis&#39; spear and explained that what he</p>
<p begin="04:06:59.120" end="04:07:03.520" style="s2">wanted Ranges to do was to train himself</p>
<p begin="04:07:01.359" end="04:07:05.120" style="s2">to go with the flow. Rangus realized</p>
<p begin="04:07:03.520" end="04:07:06.960" style="s2">that the feather was so light that it</p>
<p begin="04:07:05.120" end="04:07:08.560" style="s2">would be difficult to control. Yet, he</p>
<p begin="04:07:06.960" end="04:07:10.239" style="s2">needed to move it freely, and he</p>
<p begin="04:07:08.560" end="04:07:12.399" style="s2">wondered what it meant to let himself go</p>
<p begin="04:07:10.239" end="04:07:14.000" style="s2">with the flow. Zeke explained that it</p>
<p begin="04:07:12.399" end="04:07:15.520" style="s2">was not about following the flow or</p>
<p begin="04:07:14.000" end="04:07:17.520" style="s2">trying to seize it, but about</p>
<p begin="04:07:15.520" end="04:07:19.120" style="s2">surrendering himself to it, and that if</p>
<p begin="04:07:17.520" end="04:07:20.720" style="s2">he could master that, he would</p>
<p begin="04:07:19.120" end="04:07:23.359" style="s2">eventually be able to create the flow</p>
<p begin="04:07:20.720" end="04:07:25.120" style="s2">himself. Narrowing his eyes, Zeke then</p>
<p begin="04:07:23.359" end="04:07:27.120" style="s2">split the feather into two in a single</p>
<p begin="04:07:25.120" end="04:07:29.199" style="s2">instant, causing sweat to run down</p>
<p begin="04:07:27.120" end="04:07:31.279" style="s2">Ranges&#39;s cheek as he stared in disbelief</p>
<p begin="04:07:29.199" end="04:07:33.359" style="s2">at what he had just witnessed. At that</p>
<p begin="04:07:31.279" end="04:07:35.439" style="s2">moment, Lea arrived and called out to</p>
<p begin="04:07:33.359" end="04:07:37.359" style="s2">Zeke, saying that if they did not hurry,</p>
<p begin="04:07:35.439" end="04:07:39.199" style="s2">they would be late. And Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:07:37.359" end="04:07:41.120" style="s2">remembered that he needed to leave.</p>
<p begin="04:07:39.199" end="04:07:43.199" style="s2">Quickly, tossing Ranges&#39;s spear back to</p>
<p begin="04:07:41.120" end="04:07:45.040" style="s2">him. As he ran off, he reminded them</p>
<p begin="04:07:43.199" end="04:07:47.040" style="s2">that they all knew their drills and told</p>
<p begin="04:07:45.040" end="04:07:49.040" style="s2">them to train hard while he was gone.</p>
<p begin="04:07:47.040" end="04:07:50.399" style="s2">Rangus and Eric nodded, even though the</p>
<p begin="04:07:49.040" end="04:07:52.399" style="s2">training assigned to them weighed</p>
<p begin="04:07:50.399" end="04:07:53.920" style="s2">heavily on their minds, and Rangis felt</p>
<p begin="04:07:52.399" end="04:07:55.760" style="s2">that he might not be able to accomplish</p>
<p begin="04:07:53.920" end="04:07:57.920" style="s2">what had been asked of him, leaving him</p>
<p begin="04:07:55.760" end="04:07:59.359" style="s2">in tears. While Eric tried to calm him</p>
<p begin="04:07:57.920" end="04:08:00.880" style="s2">despite having his own doubts about</p>
<p begin="04:07:59.359" end="04:08:03.359" style="s2">whether he could handle his training as</p>
<p begin="04:08:00.880" end="04:08:05.359" style="s2">well. Meanwhile, as Zeke and Lea walked</p>
<p begin="04:08:03.359" end="04:08:06.640" style="s2">through a corridor, Leica asked what he</p>
<p begin="04:08:05.359" end="04:08:09.120" style="s2">had been doing that almost made them</p>
<p begin="04:08:06.640" end="04:08:10.640" style="s2">late. And Zeke apologized, explaining</p>
<p begin="04:08:09.120" end="04:08:12.319" style="s2">that he had been assigning training to</p>
<p begin="04:08:10.640" end="04:08:14.080" style="s2">Rangess and the others for the time they</p>
<p begin="04:08:12.319" end="04:08:16.080" style="s2">would be away. He then shifted the</p>
<p begin="04:08:14.080" end="04:08:17.359" style="s2">topic, commenting that Leica&#39;s lineup</p>
<p begin="04:08:16.080" end="04:08:19.199" style="s2">for the strike team was quite</p>
<p begin="04:08:17.359" end="04:08:21.359" style="s2">interesting, and Leica proudly declared</p>
<p begin="04:08:19.199" end="04:08:23.359" style="s2">that her lineup was perfect, calling it</p>
<p begin="04:08:21.359" end="04:08:24.960" style="s2">the best team she could assemble. As</p>
<p begin="04:08:23.359" end="04:08:26.640" style="s2">they continued walking, they were</p>
<p begin="04:08:24.960" end="04:08:28.319" style="s2">spotted by the rest of the strike team</p>
<p begin="04:08:26.640" end="04:08:30.080" style="s2">assigned to the special mission. And</p>
<p begin="04:08:28.319" end="04:08:32.319" style="s2">Edges greeted them while Leica</p>
<p begin="04:08:30.080" end="04:08:34.479" style="s2">apologized for being late, explaining</p>
<p begin="04:08:32.319" end="04:08:37.199" style="s2">that she had to fetch Zeke. The strike</p>
<p begin="04:08:34.479" end="04:08:40.080" style="s2">team consisted of Sandy, Edgis, Laya,</p>
<p begin="04:08:37.199" end="04:08:42.080" style="s2">Venil, Allan, Zeke, and Leica. And upon</p>
<p begin="04:08:40.080" end="04:08:44.479" style="s2">regrouping, they immediately prepared to</p>
<p begin="04:08:42.080" end="04:08:46.399" style="s2">depart. Earlier that day, Mric had</p>
<p begin="04:08:44.479" end="04:08:48.160" style="s2">informed Balsza that the strike team had</p>
<p begin="04:08:46.399" end="04:08:49.840" style="s2">already set out, adding that they had</p>
<p begin="04:08:48.160" end="04:08:51.359" style="s2">also received word that the Muts had</p>
<p begin="04:08:49.840" end="04:08:53.520" style="s2">detected the presence of the special</p>
<p begin="04:08:51.359" end="04:08:55.279" style="s2">rift. Balsa remarked that it was sooner</p>
<p begin="04:08:53.520" end="04:08:57.359" style="s2">than he had expected, but even if they</p>
<p begin="04:08:55.279" end="04:08:59.359" style="s2">rushed over now, the strike team would</p>
<p begin="04:08:57.359" end="04:09:01.600" style="s2">already be inside the rift. One of the</p>
<p begin="04:08:59.359" end="04:09:03.760" style="s2">men present confirmed this, but raised a</p>
<p begin="04:09:01.600" end="04:09:05.600" style="s2">concern, saying that after the rift was</p>
<p begin="04:09:03.760" end="04:09:07.520" style="s2">cleared, there was a chance the muts</p>
<p begin="04:09:05.600" end="04:09:09.120" style="s2">might appear to steal the spoils, and</p>
<p begin="04:09:07.520" end="04:09:10.560" style="s2">that it would be best if the strike team</p>
<p begin="04:09:09.120" end="04:09:12.560" style="s2">and the soldiers stationed around the</p>
<p begin="04:09:10.560" end="04:09:14.080" style="s2">rift&#39;s perimeter could link up quickly,</p>
<p begin="04:09:12.560" end="04:09:16.640" style="s2">though he was unsure if that would be</p>
<p begin="04:09:14.080" end="04:09:18.319" style="s2">possible. Balsa fell silent for a moment</p>
<p begin="04:09:16.640" end="04:09:20.239" style="s2">before asking about the strength of the</p>
<p begin="04:09:18.319" end="04:09:21.760" style="s2">strike team. And Mench responded that</p>
<p begin="04:09:20.239" end="04:09:23.920" style="s2">they had gathered the very best of the</p>
<p begin="04:09:21.760" end="04:09:25.840" style="s2">three star ranks, so there should be no</p>
<p begin="04:09:23.920" end="04:09:27.840" style="s2">problem in conquering the rift, adding</p>
<p begin="04:09:25.840" end="04:09:29.840" style="s2">that even if they encountered the muts,</p>
<p begin="04:09:27.840" end="04:09:32.000" style="s2">they would be able to hold their ground.</p>
<p begin="04:09:29.840" end="04:09:33.439" style="s2">However, Balsza remained doubtful and</p>
<p begin="04:09:32.000" end="04:09:35.600" style="s2">questioned whether that would still be</p>
<p begin="04:09:33.439" end="04:09:37.279" style="s2">the case with a two star among them. But</p>
<p begin="04:09:35.600" end="04:09:38.800" style="s2">Menrich dismissed the concern and</p>
<p begin="04:09:37.279" end="04:09:40.800" style="s2">confirmed that the strike team could</p>
<p begin="04:09:38.800" end="04:09:42.960" style="s2">handle it, even suggesting that Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:09:40.800" end="04:09:44.800" style="s2">alone might be enough to face the Muts,</p>
<p begin="04:09:42.960" end="04:09:46.880" style="s2">which shocked both Balsa and the man</p>
<p begin="04:09:44.800" end="04:09:48.560" style="s2">beside him. Menrich continued,</p>
<p begin="04:09:46.880" end="04:09:50.800" style="s2">explaining that after observing all of</p>
<p begin="04:09:48.560" end="04:09:52.560" style="s2">Balsa&#39;s children over the years, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:09:50.800" end="04:09:54.720" style="s2">was the first whose true limits he could</p>
<p begin="04:09:52.560" end="04:09:56.640" style="s2">not begin to grasp. And the man beside</p>
<p begin="04:09:54.720" end="04:09:58.960" style="s2">Balsza questioned whether Zeke was truly</p>
<p begin="04:09:56.640" end="04:10:00.960" style="s2">only at a twostar level, which Metric</p>
<p begin="04:09:58.960" end="04:10:02.800" style="s2">confirmed, adding that watching Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:10:00.960" end="04:10:04.960" style="s2">made him realize once again that rank</p>
<p begin="04:10:02.800" end="04:10:07.120" style="s2">did not necessarily equate to strength,</p>
<p begin="04:10:04.960" end="04:10:09.439" style="s2">leaving the man beside Balsa silent with</p>
<p begin="04:10:07.120" end="04:10:11.040" style="s2">sweat forming on his brow. Menrich then</p>
<p begin="04:10:09.439" end="04:10:13.199" style="s2">narrowed his eyes and revealed that when</p>
<p begin="04:10:11.040" end="04:10:14.880" style="s2">he first witnessed Zeke&#39;s techniques, he</p>
<p begin="04:10:13.199" end="04:10:16.640" style="s2">felt the same sensation he had</p>
<p begin="04:10:14.880" end="04:10:18.640" style="s2">experienced when he first saw Balsa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:10:16.640" end="04:10:20.399" style="s2">dragon destruction combat arts, which</p>
<p begin="04:10:18.640" end="04:10:22.399" style="s2">shocked everyone present, including</p>
<p begin="04:10:20.399" end="04:10:24.560" style="s2">Baltza himself, who immediately</p>
<p begin="04:10:22.399" end="04:10:26.479" style="s2">questioned what Menrich meant since the</p>
<p begin="04:10:24.560" end="04:10:28.560" style="s2">dragon destruction combat arts were a</p>
<p begin="04:10:26.479" end="04:10:30.880" style="s2">secret style passed down only from one</p>
<p begin="04:10:28.560" end="04:10:32.479" style="s2">head of the Lragon family to the next,</p>
<p begin="04:10:30.880" end="04:10:34.560" style="s2">strictly concealed and said to be</p>
<p begin="04:10:32.479" end="04:10:36.560" style="s2">impossible for ordinary people to learn.</p>
<p begin="04:10:34.560" end="04:10:38.800" style="s2">The man beside Balsa dismissed the claim</p>
<p begin="04:10:36.560" end="04:10:40.479" style="s2">as absurd, questioning whether Menrik</p>
<p begin="04:10:38.800" end="04:10:42.479" style="s2">was suggesting that Zeke had mastered</p>
<p begin="04:10:40.479" end="04:10:43.920" style="s2">something so powerful. But Menrich</p>
<p begin="04:10:42.479" end="04:10:46.080" style="s2">admitted that it had shocked him as</p>
<p begin="04:10:43.920" end="04:10:48.160" style="s2">well, and having seen Balsa&#39;s techniques</p>
<p begin="04:10:46.080" end="04:10:50.080" style="s2">countless times, he was certain of what</p>
<p begin="04:10:48.160" end="04:10:51.920" style="s2">he had witnessed, even stating that</p>
<p begin="04:10:50.080" end="04:10:54.399" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s martial arts were on par with</p>
<p begin="04:10:51.920" end="04:10:56.800" style="s2">Balsa&#39;s dragon destruction combat arts,</p>
<p begin="04:10:54.399" end="04:10:58.399" style="s2">leaving Balsza momentarily speechless.</p>
<p begin="04:10:56.800" end="04:11:00.720" style="s2">Menrich then thought to himself that</p>
<p begin="04:10:58.399" end="04:11:02.080" style="s2">Zeke might even surpass Balsa, though he</p>
<p begin="04:11:00.720" end="04:11:04.319" style="s2">quickly dismissed the idea as</p>
<p begin="04:11:02.080" end="04:11:06.399" style="s2">imagination. While Balsa revealed that a</p>
<p begin="04:11:04.319" end="04:11:08.319" style="s2">few years ago, he had Freya investigate</p>
<p begin="04:11:06.399" end="04:11:10.080" style="s2">every detail of Zeke&#39;s background,</p>
<p begin="04:11:08.319" end="04:11:11.920" style="s2">including his birth records. Yet,</p>
<p begin="04:11:10.080" end="04:11:13.439" style="s2">nothing of value was found, and there</p>
<p begin="04:11:11.920" end="04:11:15.120" style="s2">was no trace that Zeke had learned</p>
<p begin="04:11:13.439" end="04:11:17.520" style="s2">martial arts from anyone before entering</p>
<p begin="04:11:15.120" end="04:11:19.040" style="s2">the dragon&#39;s nest. The man beside Balsa</p>
<p begin="04:11:17.520" end="04:11:20.720" style="s2">wondered if that meant Zeke had learned</p>
<p begin="04:11:19.040" end="04:11:22.319" style="s2">everything on his own. But Menrich</p>
<p begin="04:11:20.720" end="04:11:24.800" style="s2">instead looked up at a portrait of the</p>
<p begin="04:11:22.319" end="04:11:26.399" style="s2">first patriarch, Gilfus Eldreon, and</p>
<p begin="04:11:24.800" end="04:11:28.239" style="s2">remarked that it was almost as if Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:11:26.399" end="04:11:30.640" style="s2">were the reincarnation of both the first</p>
<p begin="04:11:28.239" end="04:11:32.880" style="s2">patriarch and the 15th head, which</p>
<p begin="04:11:30.640" end="04:11:35.359" style="s2">caused Balsa&#39;s expression to darken as</p>
<p begin="04:11:32.880" end="04:11:37.600" style="s2">he repeated the word reincarnation in a</p>
<p begin="04:11:35.359" end="04:11:39.279" style="s2">questioning tone. Balsa stood up from</p>
<p begin="04:11:37.600" end="04:11:41.680" style="s2">his chair and gazed at the portrait of</p>
<p begin="04:11:39.279" end="04:11:43.840" style="s2">Gilus Eldregan, the first patriarch of</p>
<p begin="04:11:41.680" end="04:11:45.840" style="s2">the Eldregan family. Under his breath,</p>
<p begin="04:11:43.840" end="04:11:48.080" style="s2">he muttered the word reincarnation,</p>
<p begin="04:11:45.840" end="04:11:50.160" style="s2">dismissing it as a ridiculous idea.</p>
<p begin="04:11:48.080" end="04:11:52.319" style="s2">Silence fell over Menick and the captain</p>
<p begin="04:11:50.160" end="04:11:54.640" style="s2">standing beside him until Balsza let out</p>
<p begin="04:11:52.319" end="04:11:56.720" style="s2">a faint smirk and remarked that if Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:11:54.640" end="04:11:58.720" style="s2">truly possessed that level of power,</p>
<p begin="04:11:56.720" end="04:12:00.160" style="s2">then those wild dogs from the Kerberous</p>
<p begin="04:11:58.720" end="04:12:02.239" style="s2">family wouldn&#39;t even be worth worrying</p>
<p begin="04:12:00.160" end="04:12:04.080" style="s2">about. One week later, at the location</p>
<p begin="04:12:02.239" end="04:12:06.000" style="s2">where the special rift had appeared,</p>
<p begin="04:12:04.080" end="04:12:07.920" style="s2">soldiers of the Lragon family had</p>
<p begin="04:12:06.000" end="04:12:09.760" style="s2">already gathered. Freya was searching</p>
<p begin="04:12:07.920" end="04:12:11.600" style="s2">for the vice captain of the Black Dragon</p>
<p begin="04:12:09.760" end="04:12:13.120" style="s2">Corps, but one of the soldiers reported</p>
<p begin="04:12:11.600" end="04:12:15.040" style="s2">that the vice captain had suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:12:13.120" end="04:12:16.560" style="s2">disappeared at some point. Another</p>
<p begin="04:12:15.040" end="04:12:18.640" style="s2">soldier quickly ordered the others to</p>
<p begin="04:12:16.560" end="04:12:20.319" style="s2">begin searching. Freya then commented</p>
<p begin="04:12:18.640" end="04:12:22.399" style="s2">that they were also supposed to receive</p>
<p begin="04:12:20.319" end="04:12:24.319" style="s2">reinforcements, expressing her concern</p>
<p begin="04:12:22.399" end="04:12:26.560" style="s2">that the situation might turn into a</p>
<p begin="04:12:24.319" end="04:12:27.920" style="s2">problem. Just then, she noticed a group</p>
<p begin="04:12:26.560" end="04:12:30.000" style="s2">approaching and said that it looked like</p>
<p begin="04:12:27.920" end="04:12:31.920" style="s2">they had finally arrived. As the group</p>
<p begin="04:12:30.000" end="04:12:33.920" style="s2">drew closer, Freya pointed out that if</p>
<p begin="04:12:31.920" end="04:12:35.840" style="s2">they had sprinted the entire way, they</p>
<p begin="04:12:33.920" end="04:12:38.000" style="s2">could have arrived faster, asking if</p>
<p begin="04:12:35.840" end="04:12:40.239" style="s2">they were aware of that. Leica responded</p>
<p begin="04:12:38.000" end="04:12:41.920" style="s2">calmly, saying they had no intention of</p>
<p begin="04:12:40.239" end="04:12:44.160" style="s2">exhausting all their stamina before the</p>
<p begin="04:12:41.920" end="04:12:46.720" style="s2">mission even began. She addressed Freya</p>
<p begin="04:12:44.160" end="04:12:48.479" style="s2">as instructor Freya and asked why she</p>
<p begin="04:12:46.720" end="04:12:50.160" style="s2">was there. Freya replied that she was</p>
<p begin="04:12:48.479" end="04:12:51.920" style="s2">currently on duty and not acting as an</p>
<p begin="04:12:50.160" end="04:12:53.600" style="s2">instructor. She explained that she had</p>
<p begin="04:12:51.920" end="04:12:55.680" style="s2">been assigned to guard the special rift</p>
<p begin="04:12:53.600" end="04:12:57.680" style="s2">and its surrounding domain. Leica</p>
<p begin="04:12:55.680" end="04:13:00.000" style="s2">murmured in realization, noting that</p>
<p begin="04:12:57.680" end="04:13:01.840" style="s2">this must be the special domain. Freya</p>
<p begin="04:13:00.000" end="04:13:04.000" style="s2">elaborated that certain special rifts</p>
<p begin="04:13:01.840" end="04:13:06.000" style="s2">can influence the outside world, forming</p>
<p begin="04:13:04.000" end="04:13:08.159" style="s2">a domain around them, and that this rift</p>
<p begin="04:13:06.000" end="04:13:10.159" style="s2">was one of those cases. As Zeke observed</p>
<p begin="04:13:08.159" end="04:13:12.000" style="s2">the pitch black trees within the domain,</p>
<p begin="04:13:10.159" end="04:13:14.239" style="s2">he was reminded of the anger boar he had</p>
<p begin="04:13:12.000" end="04:13:16.080" style="s2">fought before. The eerie dark mist</p>
<p begin="04:13:14.239" end="04:13:17.359" style="s2">surrounding the area felt identical,</p>
<p begin="04:13:16.080" end="04:13:19.199" style="s2">leading him to conclude that the</p>
<p begin="04:13:17.359" end="04:13:21.680" style="s2">creature&#39;s power had likely originated</p>
<p begin="04:13:19.199" end="04:13:23.680" style="s2">from a rift as well. Zeke then asked why</p>
<p begin="04:13:21.680" end="04:13:24.960" style="s2">Freya herself was guarding the domain.</p>
<p begin="04:13:23.680" end="04:13:27.120" style="s2">She answered that it was to keep the</p>
<p begin="04:13:24.960" end="04:13:29.359" style="s2">Kerbras family in check and interfere</p>
<p begin="04:13:27.120" end="04:13:31.680" style="s2">with their plans. When Lea asked what</p>
<p begin="04:13:29.359" end="04:13:33.279" style="s2">she meant by interfere, Freya explained</p>
<p begin="04:13:31.680" end="04:13:35.680" style="s2">that if they managed to clear the rift</p>
<p begin="04:13:33.279" end="04:13:37.199" style="s2">and obtain the magic water, the Eldreon</p>
<p begin="04:13:35.680" end="04:13:38.960" style="s2">family&#39;s military strength would</p>
<p begin="04:13:37.199" end="04:13:41.199" style="s2">increase significantly, something the</p>
<p begin="04:13:38.960" end="04:13:42.640" style="s2">Kerberous family wanted to prevent. She</p>
<p begin="04:13:41.199" end="04:13:44.800" style="s2">added that they were also dealing with</p>
<p begin="04:13:42.640" end="04:13:47.040" style="s2">monsters being spit out from the domain.</p>
<p begin="04:13:44.800" end="04:13:48.640" style="s2">When Zeke asked what that meant, Freya</p>
<p begin="04:13:47.040" end="04:13:50.319" style="s2">explained that the special rift only</p>
<p begin="04:13:48.640" end="04:13:52.560" style="s2">allowed seven fighters of three star</p>
<p begin="04:13:50.319" end="04:13:54.640" style="s2">level to enter. Edges confirmed that he</p>
<p begin="04:13:52.560" end="04:13:56.399" style="s2">had heard the same information before.</p>
<p begin="04:13:54.640" end="04:13:58.319" style="s2">To demonstrate, Freya reached out and</p>
<p begin="04:13:56.399" end="04:14:00.479" style="s2">touched the barrier of the domain, only</p>
<p begin="04:13:58.319" end="04:14:02.239" style="s2">to be repelled immediately, explaining</p>
<p begin="04:14:00.479" end="04:14:04.800" style="s2">that those with higher star levels were</p>
<p begin="04:14:02.239" end="04:14:06.720" style="s2">rejected. She continued, saying that the</p>
<p begin="04:14:04.800" end="04:14:09.120" style="s2">same applied to monsters any creature</p>
<p begin="04:14:06.720" end="04:14:11.040" style="s2">fourstar or above could not enter. Entry</p>
<p begin="04:14:09.120" end="04:14:13.199" style="s2">into the rift was strictly first come,</p>
<p begin="04:14:11.040" end="04:14:15.600" style="s2">first served, and until the group inside</p>
<p begin="04:14:13.199" end="04:14:17.439" style="s2">either cleared it or was wiped out. No</p>
<p begin="04:14:15.600" end="04:14:19.439" style="s2">one else could enter. When Zeke reached</p>
<p begin="04:14:17.439" end="04:14:21.040" style="s2">out to touch the barrier himself, he</p>
<p begin="04:14:19.439" end="04:14:23.040" style="s2">immediately recognized it as something</p>
<p begin="04:14:21.040" end="04:14:24.560" style="s2">that chose who could pass through. He</p>
<p begin="04:14:23.040" end="04:14:26.560" style="s2">also recalled being told that it was</p>
<p begin="04:14:24.560" end="04:14:28.880" style="s2">impossible to break it by force, but</p>
<p begin="04:14:26.560" end="04:14:31.120" style="s2">hearing that only made him want to try.</p>
<p begin="04:14:28.880" end="04:14:32.720" style="s2">Noticing his expression, Freya began to</p>
<p begin="04:14:31.120" end="04:14:34.399" style="s2">sweat and warned him that he should</p>
<p begin="04:14:32.720" end="04:14:36.640" style="s2">listen properly when people explained</p>
<p begin="04:14:34.399" end="04:14:38.399" style="s2">things. Zeke simply winked and gave a</p>
<p begin="04:14:36.640" end="04:14:40.479" style="s2">thumbs up, insisting that he had been</p>
<p begin="04:14:38.399" end="04:14:42.000" style="s2">listening, though Freya knew better. She</p>
<p begin="04:14:40.479" end="04:14:44.080" style="s2">then said that since they didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="04:14:42.000" end="04:14:45.439" style="s2">when the Kerberous forces might arrive,</p>
<p begin="04:14:44.080" end="04:14:47.359" style="s2">it would be best for them to enter</p>
<p begin="04:14:45.439" end="04:14:49.520" style="s2">immediately if they were ready. When she</p>
<p begin="04:14:47.359" end="04:14:51.600" style="s2">asked if they were prepared, Lea and the</p>
<p begin="04:14:49.520" end="04:14:53.279" style="s2">others confirmed that they were. Without</p>
<p begin="04:14:51.600" end="04:14:55.760" style="s2">delay, they stepped into the special</p>
<p begin="04:14:53.279" end="04:14:58.000" style="s2">domain while Freya wished them luck.</p>
<p begin="04:14:55.760" end="04:15:00.159" style="s2">Inside, animals corrupted by the black</p>
<p begin="04:14:58.000" end="04:15:02.159" style="s2">mist began attacking the team. Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:15:00.159" end="04:15:04.080" style="s2">faced one of the monsters headon.</p>
<p begin="04:15:02.159" end="04:15:06.000" style="s2">Standing firm with his new weapon.</p>
<p begin="04:15:04.080" end="04:15:07.760" style="s2">Channeling his wind source power, he</p>
<p begin="04:15:06.000" end="04:15:09.520" style="s2">unleashed a devastating strike that</p>
<p begin="04:15:07.760" end="04:15:11.199" style="s2">crushed the creature&#39;s head. Watching</p>
<p begin="04:15:09.520" end="04:15:13.359" style="s2">the display, Allan applauded</p>
<p begin="04:15:11.199" end="04:15:15.359" style="s2">enthusiastically, praising Lord Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:15:13.359" end="04:15:17.120" style="s2">as brilliant as always. But Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:15:15.359" end="04:15:19.600" style="s2">remained silent, staring at his</p>
<p begin="04:15:17.120" end="04:15:21.439" style="s2">unfamiliar weapon. Edgis, who had also</p>
<p begin="04:15:19.600" end="04:15:23.439" style="s2">witnessed the fight, clicked his tongue</p>
<p begin="04:15:21.439" end="04:15:24.800" style="s2">as he recalled seeing Zeke and Venil</p>
<p begin="04:15:23.439" end="04:15:27.120" style="s2">speaking in the hallway before the</p>
<p begin="04:15:24.800" end="04:15:28.800" style="s2">mission. Back then, Veneil had asked</p>
<p begin="04:15:27.120" end="04:15:30.720" style="s2">what exactly Zeke had given him, and</p>
<p begin="04:15:28.800" end="04:15:32.319" style="s2">Zeke simply replied that he intended to</p>
<p begin="04:15:30.720" end="04:15:34.159" style="s2">train him, just as he had mentioned</p>
<p begin="04:15:32.319" end="04:15:36.319" style="s2">during their previous fight. After</p>
<p begin="04:15:34.159" end="04:15:38.319" style="s2">handing over the new weapon, Vanil had</p>
<p begin="04:15:36.319" end="04:15:40.319" style="s2">questioned whether Zeke was serious, to</p>
<p begin="04:15:38.319" end="04:15:42.560" style="s2">which Zeke confidently affirmed that he</p>
<p begin="04:15:40.319" end="04:15:44.239" style="s2">always followed through on his words. He</p>
<p begin="04:15:42.560" end="04:15:46.479" style="s2">explained that this mission presented a</p>
<p begin="04:15:44.239" end="04:15:48.640" style="s2">rare opportunity for real combat, and</p>
<p begin="04:15:46.479" end="04:15:50.880" style="s2">for that reason, he wanted Venil to use</p>
<p begin="04:15:48.640" end="04:15:53.359" style="s2">the staff. Veneil had immediately grown</p>
<p begin="04:15:50.880" end="04:15:55.279" style="s2">irritated, asking if Zeke truly expected</p>
<p begin="04:15:53.359" end="04:15:57.600" style="s2">him to use a weapon he had never touched</p>
<p begin="04:15:55.279" end="04:15:59.520" style="s2">before on such a critical mission. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:15:57.600" end="04:16:01.520" style="s2">confirmed it without hesitation, which</p>
<p begin="04:15:59.520" end="04:16:03.199" style="s2">only angered Veneil further. In</p>
<p begin="04:16:01.520" end="04:16:05.040" style="s2">frustration, Venil threw the staff to</p>
<p begin="04:16:03.199" end="04:16:07.040" style="s2">the ground, accusing Zeke of mocking</p>
<p begin="04:16:05.040" end="04:16:08.880" style="s2">him, then turned to leave, muttering</p>
<p begin="04:16:07.040" end="04:16:11.040" style="s2">that he had no intention of using such a</p>
<p begin="04:16:08.880" end="04:16:13.120" style="s2">strange weapon. Before he could get far,</p>
<p begin="04:16:11.040" end="04:16:15.359" style="s2">however, Zeke infused the staff with</p>
<p begin="04:16:13.120" end="04:16:17.600" style="s2">wind source power. Feeling the surge of</p>
<p begin="04:16:15.359" end="04:16:19.920" style="s2">wind aura behind him, Venil turned back</p>
<p begin="04:16:17.600" end="04:16:22.239" style="s2">in confusion, asking why Zeke was using</p>
<p begin="04:16:19.920" end="04:16:24.479" style="s2">wind energy. Zeke dismissed the question</p>
<p begin="04:16:22.239" end="04:16:27.120" style="s2">and simply told him to use it. Vanil</p>
<p begin="04:16:24.479" end="04:16:28.880" style="s2">refused again, visibly annoyed, but Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:16:27.120" end="04:16:31.040" style="s2">persisted no matter how many times he</p>
<p begin="04:16:28.880" end="04:16:32.640" style="s2">declined. Eventually, the argument</p>
<p begin="04:16:31.040" end="04:16:34.479" style="s2">escalated to the point where Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:16:32.640" end="04:16:36.319" style="s2">dropped to his knees in frustration,</p>
<p begin="04:16:34.479" end="04:16:37.840" style="s2">saying they weren&#39;t getting anywhere. He</p>
<p begin="04:16:36.319" end="04:16:39.279" style="s2">pointed out that Zeke had mentioned</p>
<p begin="04:16:37.840" end="04:16:41.920" style="s2">umbrellas back during the selection</p>
<p begin="04:16:39.279" end="04:16:43.600" style="s2">exam. Zeke confirmed it, explaining that</p>
<p begin="04:16:41.920" end="04:16:45.840" style="s2">since they didn&#39;t have umbrellas here,</p>
<p begin="04:16:43.600" end="04:16:47.760" style="s2">the staff would serve as a substitute as</p>
<p begin="04:16:45.840" end="04:16:50.319" style="s2">the handling was similar. For the time</p>
<p begin="04:16:47.760" end="04:16:52.399" style="s2">being, Venil would train using it. As</p>
<p begin="04:16:50.319" end="04:16:53.920" style="s2">Veneil stood, he questioned how he was</p>
<p begin="04:16:52.399" end="04:16:56.000" style="s2">supposed to train with a weapon he had</p>
<p begin="04:16:53.920" end="04:16:58.560" style="s2">no experience with, pointing out that he</p>
<p begin="04:16:56.000" end="04:17:00.399" style="s2">lacked even the most basic fundamentals.</p>
<p begin="04:16:58.560" end="04:17:02.319" style="s2">Zeke, however, confidently assured him</p>
<p begin="04:17:00.399" end="04:17:04.000" style="s2">that there was no need to worry, as he</p>
<p begin="04:17:02.319" end="04:17:05.840" style="s2">had already created a fighting style</p>
<p begin="04:17:04.000" end="04:17:08.720" style="s2">specifically tailored for him called the</p>
<p begin="04:17:05.840" end="04:17:11.120" style="s2">ghost umbrella style. In Edges&#39;s mind,</p>
<p begin="04:17:08.720" end="04:17:12.960" style="s2">the idea sounded absurd, as creating a</p>
<p begin="04:17:11.120" end="04:17:15.279" style="s2">martial art from scratch was no simple</p>
<p begin="04:17:12.960" end="04:17:17.359" style="s2">feat. Yet, as he observed Veneil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:17:15.279" end="04:17:19.359" style="s2">movements, he noticed they were sharper</p>
<p begin="04:17:17.359" end="04:17:21.760" style="s2">than before, blending perfectly with his</p>
<p begin="04:17:19.359" end="04:17:23.680" style="s2">wind aura. Veneil himself couldn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="04:17:21.760" end="04:17:26.000" style="s2">but wonder if Zeke had truly created a</p>
<p begin="04:17:23.680" end="04:17:28.080" style="s2">brand new martial art just for him. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:17:26.000" end="04:17:30.080" style="s2">then praised Venil&#39;s last strike while</p>
<p begin="04:17:28.080" end="04:17:32.080" style="s2">Allan eagerly asked if the Ghost Wind</p>
<p begin="04:17:30.080" end="04:17:33.920" style="s2">umbrella style was real. When Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:17:32.080" end="04:17:36.000" style="s2">confirmed it, both Allan and Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:17:33.920" end="04:17:37.920" style="s2">exchanged glances with Allan questioning</p>
<p begin="04:17:36.000" end="04:17:40.000" style="s2">what kind of person Zeke really was to</p>
<p begin="04:17:37.920" end="04:17:42.000" style="s2">create martial arts so effortlessly.</p>
<p begin="04:17:40.000" end="04:17:44.239" style="s2">Vanil admitted that he had no idea.</p>
<p begin="04:17:42.000" end="04:17:46.239" style="s2">Nearby, Laya had been quietly listening.</p>
<p begin="04:17:44.239" end="04:17:48.319" style="s2">When Zeke noticed her, he asked if her</p>
<p begin="04:17:46.239" end="04:17:50.159" style="s2">name was indeed Laya, and she confirmed</p>
<p begin="04:17:48.319" end="04:17:52.159" style="s2">it. They fell into a brief silence</p>
<p begin="04:17:50.159" end="04:17:54.880" style="s2">before Laya asked if Zeke had truly</p>
<p begin="04:17:52.159" end="04:17:56.640" style="s2">created the new style. As usual, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:17:54.880" end="04:17:58.800" style="s2">confirmed it casually, and when she</p>
<p begin="04:17:56.640" end="04:18:00.800" style="s2">asked how, he simply replied that it was</p>
<p begin="04:17:58.800" end="04:18:02.720" style="s2">obvious because he was Zeke. Laya</p>
<p begin="04:18:00.800" end="04:18:04.640" style="s2">clapped in amazement while Sandy</p>
<p begin="04:18:02.720" end="04:18:06.800" style="s2">scoffed, saying Zeke was talking</p>
<p begin="04:18:04.640" end="04:18:08.479" style="s2">nonsense again, insisting that creating</p>
<p begin="04:18:06.800" end="04:18:10.640" style="s2">a martial art from scratch was</p>
<p begin="04:18:08.479" end="04:18:12.720" style="s2">impossible. Edges chimed in, pointing</p>
<p begin="04:18:10.640" end="04:18:14.560" style="s2">out that it somehow made sense given</p>
<p begin="04:18:12.720" end="04:18:16.640" style="s2">what they had witnessed. Changing the</p>
<p begin="04:18:14.560" end="04:18:18.560" style="s2">subject, Sandy looked at Venil and</p>
<p begin="04:18:16.640" end="04:18:21.120" style="s2">warned that regardless of the new style,</p>
<p begin="04:18:18.560" end="04:18:23.600" style="s2">he shouldn&#39;t drag them down. Irritated,</p>
<p begin="04:18:21.120" end="04:18:25.520" style="s2">Venil asked her to repeat herself with a</p>
<p begin="04:18:23.600" end="04:18:27.199" style="s2">mocking tone. Sandy said he couldn&#39;t</p>
