<p begin="04:18:34.800" end="04:18:39.120" style="s2">Alan, who had been holding back, finally</p>
<p begin="04:18:37.199" end="04:18:42.000" style="s2">spoke up, telling Sandy to watch her</p>
<p begin="04:18:39.120" end="04:18:43.920" style="s2">mouth. Unfazed, Sandy asked if the truth</p>
