<p begin="04:18:45.840" end="04:18:50.479" style="s2">master under control. Leica quickly</p>
<p begin="04:18:48.000" end="04:18:52.239" style="s2">stepped in, urging Sandy to stop, while</p>
<p begin="04:18:50.479" end="04:18:54.000" style="s2">Edges reminded them that this wasn&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="04:18:52.239" end="04:18:56.159" style="s2">time to argue they were part of the same</p>
<p begin="04:18:54.000" end="04:18:58.960" style="s2">team on a dangerous mission and needed</p>
<p begin="04:18:56.159" end="04:19:00.319" style="s2">to cooperate. Sandy, however, refused,</p>
