<p begin="04:19:33.439" end="04:19:38.159" style="s2">resist taking a jab at Sandy, which only</p>
<p begin="04:19:35.760" end="04:19:40.000" style="s2">enraged her further. As tensions rose</p>
<p begin="04:19:38.159" end="04:19:42.159" style="s2">again, Leica couldn&#39;t help but wonder if</p>
<p begin="04:19:40.000" end="04:19:44.319" style="s2">this was truly the right team. Zeke</p>
