<p begin="04:19:46.319" end="04:19:50.080" style="s2">long shadow over them. At this rate,</p>
<p begin="04:19:48.560" end="04:19:52.000" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t be able to trust one</p>
<p begin="04:19:50.080" end="04:19:53.920" style="s2">another. He also noticed that despite</p>
<p begin="04:19:52.000" end="04:19:55.920" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s attitude, he seemed to be</p>
<p begin="04:19:53.920" end="04:19:58.080" style="s2">struggling internally. Zeke understood</p>
<p begin="04:19:55.920" end="04:19:59.920" style="s2">that with such an unbalanced team, the</p>
<p begin="04:19:58.080" end="04:20:01.520" style="s2">situation was risky. But if they could</p>
<p begin="04:19:59.920" end="04:20:03.279" style="s2">come to understand and accept each</p>
<p begin="04:20:01.520" end="04:20:04.800" style="s2">other, they might become comrades</p>
<p begin="04:20:03.279" end="04:20:06.640" style="s2">capable of trusting one another with</p>
<p begin="04:20:04.800" end="04:20:08.640" style="s2">their lives. As they continued toward</p>
<p begin="04:20:06.640" end="04:20:10.880" style="s2">the center of the domain, they spotted a</p>
<p begin="04:20:08.640" end="04:20:13.439" style="s2">bright light in the distance. Excited,</p>
<p begin="04:20:10.880" end="04:20:15.520" style="s2">Lea urged everyone to move closer. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:20:13.439" end="04:20:17.680" style="s2">observed it carefully, remarking that it</p>
<p begin="04:20:15.520" end="04:20:19.760" style="s2">must be the rift itself, noting how it</p>
