<p begin="04:20:19.760" end="04:20:23.520" style="s2">serious expression, Leica warned that</p>
<p begin="04:20:21.760" end="04:20:25.920" style="s2">once they entered, anything could</p>
<p begin="04:20:23.520" end="04:20:27.840" style="s2">happen, urging everyone to stay sharp.</p>
<p begin="04:20:25.920" end="04:20:30.239" style="s2">Zeke clenches his hands with excitement</p>
<p begin="04:20:27.840" end="04:20:32.159" style="s2">and agreed with Leica. Just then, Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:20:30.239" end="04:20:34.000" style="s2">eyes suddenly glow as he sensed a new</p>
<p begin="04:20:32.159" end="04:20:35.840" style="s2">presence from afar entering the special</p>
<p begin="04:20:34.000" end="04:20:37.920" style="s2">domain. But when Leela asked if</p>
