<p begin="04:20:46.560" end="04:20:51.199" style="s2">glanced downward, fear evident on his</p>
<p begin="04:20:49.040" end="04:20:53.279" style="s2">face, while Sandy was already shouting</p>
<p begin="04:20:51.199" end="04:20:55.279" style="s2">in panic. Before any of them could</p>
<p begin="04:20:53.279" end="04:20:57.199" style="s2">react, they were suddenly plummeting</p>
<p begin="04:20:55.279" end="04:20:59.920" style="s2">from the sky toward a dense forest</p>
<p begin="04:20:57.199" end="04:21:01.920" style="s2">below. Fighting to stay composed, Leica</p>
