<p begin="04:21:01.920" end="04:21:05.760" style="s2">calm down so they could figure out a</p>
<p begin="04:21:03.520" end="04:21:08.000" style="s2">safe way to land. But just as she tried</p>
<p begin="04:21:05.760" end="04:21:10.399" style="s2">to take control of the situation, her</p>
<p begin="04:21:08.000" end="04:21:12.239" style="s2">eyes widened again in disbelief. A</p>
<p begin="04:21:10.399" end="04:21:14.000" style="s2">massive creature resembling a giant</p>
<p begin="04:21:12.239" end="04:21:16.800" style="s2">chicklet had clamped its beak around</p>
<p begin="04:21:14.000" end="04:21:18.560" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s head. Sandy immediately yelled,</p>
<p begin="04:21:16.800" end="04:21:21.680" style="s2">asking what was happening now, while</p>
<p begin="04:21:18.560" end="04:21:24.239" style="s2">Leica shouted Zeke&#39;s name. Surprisingly,</p>
