<p begin="04:21:31.439" end="04:21:36.319" style="s2">to get serious. But Zeke casually</p>
<p begin="04:21:33.920" end="04:21:38.319" style="s2">replied that he was off duty. Edges then</p>
<p begin="04:21:36.319" end="04:21:40.239" style="s2">called out to Leica, reminding her that</p>
