<p begin="04:21:40.239" end="04:21:44.640" style="s2">the fall. As the forest rapidly</p>
<p begin="04:21:42.319" end="04:21:46.880" style="s2">approached, he anxiously asked what they</p>
<p begin="04:21:44.640" end="04:21:48.800" style="s2">should do. Leica clicked her tongue,</p>
<p begin="04:21:46.880" end="04:21:52.000" style="s2">unable to come up with a solution on the</p>
<p begin="04:21:48.800" end="04:21:53.840" style="s2">spot. Venil, growing impatient, snapped</p>
<p begin="04:21:52.000" end="04:21:56.080" style="s2">at everyone, saying they were all</p>
<p begin="04:21:53.840" end="04:21:58.720" style="s2">useless. Before ordering Allan to use</p>
