<p begin="04:24:31.199" end="04:24:36.080" style="s2">almost in unison, they answered that</p>
<p begin="04:24:33.279" end="04:24:38.080" style="s2">Zeke was a monster. Sandy blinked,</p>
<p begin="04:24:36.080" end="04:24:40.319" style="s2">wondering if she was the strange one for</p>
<p begin="04:24:38.080" end="04:24:42.080" style="s2">thinking otherwise. Edges then added</p>
<p begin="04:24:40.319" end="04:24:44.159" style="s2">that regardless, they would need to</p>
<p begin="04:24:42.080" end="04:24:45.840" style="s2">regroup with Zeke eventually, but their</p>
<p begin="04:24:44.159" end="04:24:48.720" style="s2">current problem was that they had no</p>
<p begin="04:24:45.840" end="04:24:50.479" style="s2">idea where to go. At that moment, Laya</p>
<p begin="04:24:48.720" end="04:24:52.239" style="s2">called out to him, saying that while</p>
<p begin="04:24:50.479" end="04:24:54.239" style="s2">they were falling, she had spotted</p>
<p begin="04:24:52.239" end="04:24:56.880" style="s2">something in the distance, a pillar of</p>
<p begin="04:24:54.239" end="04:24:59.520" style="s2">light. Alan nodded, saying he had seen</p>
<p begin="04:24:56.880" end="04:25:01.439" style="s2">it, too. But after the chaotic fall, he</p>
<p begin="04:24:59.520" end="04:25:04.159" style="s2">couldn&#39;t keep track of its direction.</p>
<p begin="04:25:01.439" end="04:25:06.399" style="s2">Unexpectedly, Laya pointed confidently</p>
<p begin="04:25:04.159" end="04:25:08.399" style="s2">ahead, saying the pillar of light was in</p>
<p begin="04:25:06.399" end="04:25:10.479" style="s2">that direction. Alan looked at her in</p>
<p begin="04:25:08.399" end="04:25:12.319" style="s2">disbelief, asking if she had really</p>
<p begin="04:25:10.479" end="04:25:14.960" style="s2">managed to track direction even while</p>
<p begin="04:25:12.319" end="04:25:16.640" style="s2">falling. Laya confirmed it, explaining</p>
<p begin="04:25:14.960" end="04:25:19.199" style="s2">that she had taken a quick look around</p>
<p begin="04:25:16.640" end="04:25:21.520" style="s2">and memorized it. Leica added that the</p>
<p begin="04:25:19.199" end="04:25:23.520" style="s2">bird carrying Zeke had flown toward that</p>
<p begin="04:25:21.520" end="04:25:25.600" style="s2">same light. So, while they still needed</p>
<p begin="04:25:23.520" end="04:25:27.760" style="s2">to reunite with him, their best course</p>
<p begin="04:25:25.600" end="04:25:29.760" style="s2">of action for now was to head toward the</p>
<p begin="04:25:27.760" end="04:25:31.520" style="s2">pillar. She reasoned that there was no</p>
<p begin="04:25:29.760" end="04:25:33.840" style="s2">way Zeke would ignore something that</p>
<p begin="04:25:31.520" end="04:25:35.920" style="s2">unusual. And both Venil and Edgis</p>
<p begin="04:25:33.840" end="04:25:38.239" style="s2">immediately agreed. Meanwhile, high</p>
<p begin="04:25:35.920" end="04:25:40.880" style="s2">above, Zeke was still being carried by</p>
<p begin="04:25:38.239" end="04:25:43.120" style="s2">the giant bird. Rather than panicking,</p>
<p begin="04:25:40.880" end="04:25:44.960" style="s2">he found the situation intriguing,</p>
<p begin="04:25:43.120" end="04:25:47.279" style="s2">noting how their mission had taken an</p>
<p begin="04:25:44.960" end="04:25:49.680" style="s2">unexpected turn the moment they entered</p>
<p begin="04:25:47.279" end="04:25:51.120" style="s2">the rift. He admitted that even he had</p>
<p begin="04:25:49.680" end="04:25:53.520" style="s2">never sensed something coming from</p>
<p begin="04:25:51.120" end="04:25:55.760" style="s2">beyond dimensions before, making this a</p>
<p begin="04:25:53.520" end="04:25:58.080" style="s2">valuable experience. Despite being</p>
<p begin="04:25:55.760" end="04:26:00.399" style="s2">separated from Leica and the others, he</p>
<p begin="04:25:58.080" end="04:26:02.640" style="s2">was confident they would manage somehow.</p>
<p begin="04:26:00.399" end="04:26:05.199" style="s2">Suddenly, the bird came to an abrupt</p>
<p begin="04:26:02.640" end="04:26:07.199" style="s2">stop midair. Zeke casually asked if</p>
<p begin="04:26:05.199" end="04:26:09.439" style="s2">their little sky trip was over, but</p>
<p begin="04:26:07.199" end="04:26:12.080" style="s2">instead of responding, the birds simply</p>
<p begin="04:26:09.439" end="04:26:13.600" style="s2">released him. As he began to fall again,</p>
<p begin="04:26:12.080" end="04:26:16.479" style="s2">Zeke guessed they had reached their</p>
<p begin="04:26:13.600" end="04:26:18.399" style="s2">destination. Looking down, he spotted a</p>
<p begin="04:26:16.479" end="04:26:21.520" style="s2">large nest with three small birds</p>
<p begin="04:26:18.399" end="04:26:23.359" style="s2">inside, chirping loudly. Fixing his gaze</p>
<p begin="04:26:21.520" end="04:26:25.120" style="s2">on them, he noticed their eager</p>
<p begin="04:26:23.359" end="04:26:28.080" style="s2">expressions and the way they drooled</p>
<p begin="04:26:25.120" end="04:26:30.479" style="s2">with anticipation. In that instant, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:26:28.080" end="04:26:32.720" style="s2">realized exactly what was happening. He</p>
<p begin="04:26:30.479" end="04:26:35.040" style="s2">wasn&#39;t just a passenger. He was about to</p>
<p begin="04:26:32.720" end="04:26:36.319" style="s2">become their next meal. Before Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:26:35.040" end="04:26:38.319" style="s2">could become the next meal for the</p>
<p begin="04:26:36.319" end="04:26:40.239" style="s2">smaller birds, he smacked each of them</p>
<p begin="04:26:38.319" end="04:26:42.239" style="s2">away and even gave the mother bird a</p>
<p begin="04:26:40.239" end="04:26:43.920" style="s2">heavy multi-tiered bump on the head,</p>
<p begin="04:26:42.239" end="04:26:45.520" style="s2">casually remarking to himself that he</p>
<p begin="04:26:43.920" end="04:26:47.600" style="s2">had nearly been turned into food the</p>
<p begin="04:26:45.520" end="04:26:49.520" style="s2">moment he arrived. Tears immediately</p>
<p begin="04:26:47.600" end="04:26:51.279" style="s2">welled up in the mother bird&#39;s eye as</p>
<p begin="04:26:49.520" end="04:26:53.120" style="s2">one side of her face twitched from the</p>
<p begin="04:26:51.279" end="04:26:54.880" style="s2">punch, leaving her dazed while the</p>
<p begin="04:26:53.120" end="04:26:56.880" style="s2">smaller birds chirped in panic around</p>
<p begin="04:26:54.880" end="04:26:58.720" style="s2">her. Zeke then walked toward the edge of</p>
<p begin="04:26:56.880" end="04:27:00.640" style="s2">the cliff and quietly observed his</p>
<p begin="04:26:58.720" end="04:27:02.399" style="s2">surroundings, realizing that he had</p>
<p begin="04:27:00.640" end="04:27:04.640" style="s2">truly been thrown into one hell of</p>
<p begin="04:27:02.399" end="04:27:05.840" style="s2">another world. It was only then that he</p>
<p begin="04:27:04.640" end="04:27:07.920" style="s2">remembered the warning about the</p>
<p begin="04:27:05.840" end="04:27:10.000" style="s2">monsters called chaos existing inside</p>
<p begin="04:27:07.920" end="04:27:12.000" style="s2">the rift as well. And after turning his</p>
<p begin="04:27:10.000" end="04:27:13.359" style="s2">head toward the birds behind him, he</p>
<p begin="04:27:12.000" end="04:27:15.520" style="s2">wondered if they were the creatures he</p>
<p begin="04:27:13.359" end="04:27:17.680" style="s2">had been told about. The birds instantly</p>
<p begin="04:27:15.520" end="04:27:19.760" style="s2">chirped in protest and shook their heads</p>
<p begin="04:27:17.680" end="04:27:21.920" style="s2">repeatedly, almost as if they understood</p>
<p begin="04:27:19.760" end="04:27:23.840" style="s2">exactly what he was asking. Somehow</p>
<p begin="04:27:21.920" end="04:27:25.439" style="s2">understanding their reaction, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:27:23.840" end="04:27:27.279" style="s2">crouched down and gently touched the</p>
<p begin="04:27:25.439" end="04:27:28.800" style="s2">mother bird&#39;s feathers, thinking that</p>
<p begin="04:27:27.279" end="04:27:30.640" style="s2">they looked far too adorable and</p>
<p begin="04:27:28.800" end="04:27:32.560" style="s2">harmless to be the terrifying chaos</p>
<p begin="04:27:30.640" end="04:27:34.399" style="s2">monsters he had heard about. As he</p>
<p begin="04:27:32.560" end="04:27:36.080" style="s2">continued observing them more closely,</p>
<p begin="04:27:34.399" end="04:27:38.239" style="s2">he quickly realized that the birds were</p>
<p begin="04:27:36.080" end="04:27:40.080" style="s2">in terrible condition. Their bodies were</p>
<p begin="04:27:38.239" end="04:27:42.080" style="s2">painfully thin, their feathers were</p>
<p begin="04:27:40.080" end="04:27:44.239" style="s2">dirty and damaged, and old wounds</p>
<p begin="04:27:42.080" end="04:27:45.680" style="s2">covered nearly every part of them. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:27:44.239" end="04:27:47.279" style="s2">then asked himself what kind of</p>
<p begin="04:27:45.680" end="04:27:49.120" style="s2">situation had pushed them into such</p>
<p begin="04:27:47.279" end="04:27:50.960" style="s2">miserable shape. But before he could</p>
<p begin="04:27:49.120" end="04:27:53.199" style="s2">think further, he suddenly sensed</p>
<p begin="04:27:50.960" end="04:27:54.479" style="s2">something strange lingering nearby. He</p>
<p begin="04:27:53.199" end="04:27:56.159" style="s2">muttered that he had been feeling a</p>
<p begin="04:27:54.479" end="04:27:58.560" style="s2">weird presence tailing them for a while</p>
<p begin="04:27:56.159" end="04:28:00.479" style="s2">now. And at that exact moment, a group</p>
<p begin="04:27:58.560" end="04:28:02.560" style="s2">of unknown creatures came flying toward</p>
<p begin="04:28:00.479" end="04:28:04.399" style="s2">them at incredible speed. The mother</p>
<p begin="04:28:02.560" end="04:28:06.319" style="s2">bird immediately let out a loud screech</p>
<p begin="04:28:04.399" end="04:28:08.399" style="s2">to warn him about the incoming danger.</p>
<p begin="04:28:06.319" end="04:28:10.720" style="s2">And as Zeke turned around, he finally</p>
<p begin="04:28:08.399" end="04:28:12.720" style="s2">saw them clearly. Several insect-like</p>
<p begin="04:28:10.720" end="04:28:14.560" style="s2">monsters covered in a dark purple aura</p>
<p begin="04:28:12.720" end="04:28:16.640" style="s2">were rapidly approaching the cliff,</p>
<p begin="04:28:14.560" end="04:28:18.880" style="s2">accompanied by a giant mantis radiating</p>
<p begin="04:28:16.640" end="04:28:20.880" style="s2">an even more sinister presence. The</p>
<p begin="04:28:18.880" end="04:28:23.040" style="s2">moment the creatures landed, the giant</p>
<p begin="04:28:20.880" end="04:28:24.640" style="s2">mantis released a sharp and terrifying</p>
<p begin="04:28:23.040" end="04:28:27.120" style="s2">hiss that echoed through the mountain</p>
<p begin="04:28:24.640" end="04:28:28.960" style="s2">air. Despite the tension, Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="04:28:27.120" end="04:28:31.520" style="s2">stared at the monsters with curiosity</p>
<p begin="04:28:28.960" end="04:28:33.439" style="s2">and awe rather than fear. Upon glancing</p>
<p begin="04:28:31.520" end="04:28:35.439" style="s2">back at the trembling birds behind him,</p>
<p begin="04:28:33.439" end="04:28:37.600" style="s2">he quickly realized that the insects had</p>
<p begin="04:28:35.439" end="04:28:39.920" style="s2">been hunting them this entire time. To</p>
<p begin="04:28:37.600" end="04:28:41.600" style="s2">him, bugs hunting birds as prey was</p>
<p begin="04:28:39.920" end="04:28:43.120" style="s2">already strange enough, but the</p>
<p begin="04:28:41.600" end="04:28:44.479" style="s2">disgusting aura surrounding those</p>
<p begin="04:28:43.120" end="04:28:46.159" style="s2">creatures immediately made him</p>
<p begin="04:28:44.479" end="04:28:49.040" style="s2">understand that these insects were the</p>
<p begin="04:28:46.159" end="04:28:50.319" style="s2">true chaos monsters. At a single glance,</p>
<p begin="04:28:49.040" end="04:28:52.080" style="s2">he could already tell that the</p>
<p begin="04:28:50.319" end="04:28:54.159" style="s2">locust-like creatures were all three</p>
<p begin="04:28:52.080" end="04:28:55.920" style="s2">star level monsters, while the giant</p>
<p begin="04:28:54.159" end="04:28:58.399" style="s2">mantis standing behind them had reached</p>
<p begin="04:28:55.920" end="04:29:00.159" style="s2">four star level. Zeke silently assessed</p>
<p begin="04:28:58.399" end="04:29:02.000" style="s2">the situation around him, and because</p>
<p begin="04:29:00.159" end="04:29:04.560" style="s2">the birds were nothing but skin and</p>
<p begin="04:29:02.000" end="04:29:06.399" style="s2">bones and barely capable of standing, he</p>
<p begin="04:29:04.560" end="04:29:08.479" style="s2">found himself unable to immediately</p>
<p begin="04:29:06.399" end="04:29:10.399" style="s2">decide what to do. He wondered if he</p>
<p begin="04:29:08.479" end="04:29:12.399" style="s2">should simply leave the birds behind and</p>
<p begin="04:29:10.399" end="04:29:14.080" style="s2">escape on his own, or if he should stay</p>
<p begin="04:29:12.399" end="04:29:15.920" style="s2">and help them fight against the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:29:14.080" end="04:29:17.760" style="s2">monsters. But before he could reach a</p>
<p begin="04:29:15.920" end="04:29:19.680" style="s2">conclusion, the birds suddenly spread</p>
<p begin="04:29:17.760" end="04:29:21.520" style="s2">their wings while chirping fiercely. And</p>
<p begin="04:29:19.680" end="04:29:23.680" style="s2">the wounded mother bird stepped forward</p>
<p begin="04:29:21.520" end="04:29:25.600" style="s2">despite her condition, preparing herself</p>
<p begin="04:29:23.680" end="04:29:27.279" style="s2">to protect her chicks, even if it cost</p>
<p begin="04:29:25.600" end="04:29:29.120" style="s2">her life. When Zeke saw their</p>
<p begin="04:29:27.279" end="04:29:30.880" style="s2">determination to keep fighting despite</p>
<p begin="04:29:29.120" end="04:29:32.960" style="s2">being cornered, he looked back at the</p>
<p begin="04:29:30.880" end="04:29:35.040" style="s2">smaller birds and admitted that he liked</p>
<p begin="04:29:32.960" end="04:29:36.960" style="s2">their resolve. Because of that, he</p>
<p begin="04:29:35.040" end="04:29:38.960" style="s2">decided that he would lend them a hand,</p>
<p begin="04:29:36.960" end="04:29:40.560" style="s2">even if only for a little while. The</p>
<p begin="04:29:38.960" end="04:29:42.640" style="s2">moment the chaos monsters launched</p>
<p begin="04:29:40.560" end="04:29:44.319" style="s2">themselves forward to attack, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:29:42.640" end="04:29:46.319" style="s2">immediately felt their killing intent</p>
<p begin="04:29:44.319" end="04:29:47.840" style="s2">stabbing against his skin, as if</p>
<p begin="04:29:46.319" end="04:29:49.920" style="s2">slaughter and destruction were the only</p>
<p begin="04:29:47.840" end="04:29:51.760" style="s2">instincts driving their existence. With</p>
<p begin="04:29:49.920" end="04:29:53.760" style="s2">a calm expression, he casually remarked</p>
<p begin="04:29:51.760" end="04:29:55.840" style="s2">to himself that this was what true chaos</p>
<p begin="04:29:53.760" end="04:29:57.680" style="s2">felt like. As one of the locust monsters</p>
<p begin="04:29:55.840" end="04:29:59.600" style="s2">rushed toward him, Zeke instantly</p>
<p begin="04:29:57.680" end="04:30:01.520" style="s2">intercepted it and grabbed it tightly by</p>
<p begin="04:29:59.600" end="04:30:03.600" style="s2">the neck. While holding the creature in</p>
<p begin="04:30:01.520" end="04:30:05.439" style="s2">place, he loosened his grip for a brief</p>
<p begin="04:30:03.600" end="04:30:07.600" style="s2">second before delivering a devastating</p>
<p begin="04:30:05.439" end="04:30:09.520" style="s2">punch that completely decapitated the</p>
<p begin="04:30:07.600" end="04:30:11.439" style="s2">monster in a single blow. Blood</p>
<p begin="04:30:09.520" end="04:30:13.680" style="s2">immediately splashed across his body and</p>
<p begin="04:30:11.439" end="04:30:15.840" style="s2">face as a green aura glowed faintly</p>
<p begin="04:30:13.680" end="04:30:18.239" style="s2">within his eyes. Yet, instead of fearing</p>
<p begin="04:30:15.840" end="04:30:20.000" style="s2">him, the remaining chaos monsters only</p>
<p begin="04:30:18.239" end="04:30:21.760" style="s2">became more enraged after seeing one of</p>
<p begin="04:30:20.000" end="04:30:23.439" style="s2">their own killed. The mother bird</p>
<p begin="04:30:21.760" end="04:30:25.359" style="s2">nervously chirped as if she could sense</p>
<p begin="04:30:23.439" end="04:30:26.880" style="s2">the monster&#39;s growing hostility,</p>
<p begin="04:30:25.359" end="04:30:29.040" style="s2">especially after the swarm began</p>
<p begin="04:30:26.880" end="04:30:31.120" style="s2">charging towards Zeke all at once.</p>
<p begin="04:30:29.040" end="04:30:33.359" style="s2">However, before the insects could even</p>
<p begin="04:30:31.120" end="04:30:35.359" style="s2">reach him, Zeke&#39;s eyes suddenly glowed</p>
<p begin="04:30:33.359" end="04:30:37.600" style="s2">with a brilliant golden light, and above</p>
<p begin="04:30:35.359" end="04:30:39.840" style="s2">him appeared the massive phantom image</p>
<p begin="04:30:37.600" end="04:30:41.920" style="s2">of a dragon&#39;s eye. An overwhelming wave</p>
<p begin="04:30:39.840" end="04:30:44.080" style="s2">of dragon aura exploded outward from his</p>
<p begin="04:30:41.920" end="04:30:45.760" style="s2">body, crashing directly into the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:30:44.080" end="04:30:47.840" style="s2">monsters with enough force to freeze</p>
<p begin="04:30:45.760" end="04:30:49.760" style="s2">even the four-star giant mantis in</p>
<p begin="04:30:47.840" end="04:30:52.319" style="s2">place. Standing there with one eye</p>
<p begin="04:30:49.760" end="04:30:54.239" style="s2">glowing gold, Zeke calmly pointed toward</p>
<p begin="04:30:52.319" end="04:30:56.159" style="s2">the swarm and warned them to turn back</p>
<p begin="04:30:54.239" end="04:30:57.680" style="s2">while they still had the chance, making</p>
<p begin="04:30:56.159" end="04:30:59.600" style="s2">it clear that he would allow them to</p>
<p begin="04:30:57.680" end="04:31:01.840" style="s2">leave alive if they retreated now. But</p>
<p begin="04:30:59.600" end="04:31:03.199" style="s2">if they continued insisting on fighting,</p>
<p begin="04:31:01.840" end="04:31:05.279" style="s2">then he would personally keep them</p>
<p begin="04:31:03.199" end="04:31:07.279" style="s2">company for as long as he pleased. The</p>
<p begin="04:31:05.279" end="04:31:09.199" style="s2">giant mantis seemed to understand every</p>
<p begin="04:31:07.279" end="04:31:11.279" style="s2">word hidden behind that pressure because</p>
<p begin="04:31:09.199" end="04:31:13.279" style="s2">it immediately lowered its head, shook</p>
<p begin="04:31:11.279" end="04:31:15.520" style="s2">nervously, and avoided looking directly</p>
<p begin="04:31:13.279" end="04:31:17.199" style="s2">at him. After seeing their reaction,</p>
<p begin="04:31:15.520" end="04:31:19.359" style="s2">Zeke casually remarked that they had</p>
<p begin="04:31:17.199" end="04:31:21.600" style="s2">made a wise decision and instructed them</p>
<p begin="04:31:19.359" end="04:31:23.840" style="s2">to disappear immediately. Terrified by</p>
<p begin="04:31:21.600" end="04:31:25.600" style="s2">the dragon aura crushing them, the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:31:23.840" end="04:31:28.000" style="s2">monsters hurriedly flapped their wings</p>
<p begin="04:31:25.600" end="04:31:29.920" style="s2">and fled the area as fast as they could.</p>
<p begin="04:31:28.000" end="04:31:32.000" style="s2">While watching them retreat, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:31:29.920" end="04:31:34.560" style="s2">noticed that even their escape somehow</p>
<p begin="04:31:32.000" end="04:31:35.920" style="s2">carried an unnecessarily dramatic flare,</p>
<p begin="04:31:34.560" end="04:31:37.600" style="s2">though he admitted that he did not</p>
<p begin="04:31:35.920" end="04:31:39.920" style="s2">really mind since the fight had already</p>
<p begin="04:31:37.600" end="04:31:42.080" style="s2">ended. Wiping the sweat from his face.</p>
<p begin="04:31:39.920" end="04:31:43.840" style="s2">He quietly realized that unleashing</p>
<p begin="04:31:42.080" end="04:31:45.920" style="s2">dragon pressure in his current weakened</p>
<p begin="04:31:43.840" end="04:31:48.000" style="s2">state was still somewhat exhausting for</p>
<p begin="04:31:45.920" end="04:31:49.600" style="s2">him. The mother bird then chirped softly</p>
<p begin="04:31:48.000" end="04:31:51.520" style="s2">to get his attention before gently</p>
<p begin="04:31:49.600" end="04:31:53.359" style="s2">bowing her head and pointing her beak</p>
<p begin="04:31:51.520" end="04:31:55.600" style="s2">toward the dead chaos monster lying</p>
<p begin="04:31:53.359" end="04:31:58.479" style="s2">nearby. While the smaller birds chirped</p>
<p begin="04:31:55.600" end="04:32:00.080" style="s2">beside her excitedly, slightly confused,</p>
<p begin="04:31:58.479" end="04:32:01.600" style="s2">Zeke wondered what they wanted before</p>
<p begin="04:32:00.080" end="04:32:03.279" style="s2">realizing that they were asking for</p>
<p begin="04:32:01.600" end="04:32:04.720" style="s2">permission to eat the corpse. He</p>
<p begin="04:32:03.279" end="04:32:06.720" style="s2">casually told them that they could eat</p>
<p begin="04:32:04.720" end="04:32:08.159" style="s2">it if they wanted, and the smaller birds</p>
<p begin="04:32:06.720" end="04:32:10.560" style="s2">immediately rushed toward the dead</p>
<p begin="04:32:08.159" end="04:32:12.720" style="s2">locust and began devouring it hungrily.</p>
<p begin="04:32:10.560" end="04:32:14.399" style="s2">As Zeke silently watched them eat, he</p>
<p begin="04:32:12.720" end="04:32:16.319" style="s2">gradually pieced together what must have</p>
<p begin="04:32:14.399" end="04:32:18.080" style="s2">happened. The starving mother bird had</p>
<p begin="04:32:16.319" end="04:32:19.760" style="s2">most likely flown into the forest,</p>
<p begin="04:32:18.080" end="04:32:22.080" style="s2">searching desperately for food for her</p>
<p begin="04:32:19.760" end="04:32:23.840" style="s2">chicks, only to be ambushed by the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:32:22.080" end="04:32:26.479" style="s2">insects and barely managed to escape</p>
<p begin="04:32:23.840" end="04:32:28.479" style="s2">back to the cliff alive. Then during her</p>
<p begin="04:32:26.479" end="04:32:30.399" style="s2">desperate retreat, she had luckily</p>
<p begin="04:32:28.479" end="04:32:32.560" style="s2">caught what she thought was prey, only</p>
<p begin="04:32:30.399" end="04:32:34.319" style="s2">for that prey to turn out to be him.</p>
<p begin="04:32:32.560" end="04:32:36.239" style="s2">After the chicks finished eating, they</p>
<p begin="04:32:34.319" end="04:32:37.840" style="s2">quickly fell asleep from exhaustion and</p>
<p begin="04:32:36.239" end="04:32:39.840" style="s2">while quietly observing the sleeping</p>
<p begin="04:32:37.840" end="04:32:41.520" style="s2">birds. Zeke thought to himself that</p>
<p begin="04:32:39.840" end="04:32:43.439" style="s2">although he had almost become bait for</p>
<p begin="04:32:41.520" end="04:32:45.760" style="s2">them earlier, perhaps meeting them was</p>
<p begin="04:32:43.439" end="04:32:47.199" style="s2">still some kind of fate. At that moment,</p>
<p begin="04:32:45.760" end="04:32:48.880" style="s2">he decided that he needed to do</p>
<p begin="04:32:47.199" end="04:32:50.640" style="s2">something for them. He then asked the</p>
<p begin="04:32:48.880" end="04:32:52.080" style="s2">mother bird if they were still hungry,</p>
<p begin="04:32:50.640" end="04:32:53.760" style="s2">and the bird tilted her head in</p>
<p begin="04:32:52.080" end="04:32:55.600" style="s2">confusion as if she did not understand</p>
<p begin="04:32:53.760" end="04:32:57.359" style="s2">what he meant until Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:32:55.600" end="04:32:59.040" style="s2">declared that they were going hunting.</p>
<p begin="04:32:57.359" end="04:33:00.960" style="s2">The mother bird instantly let out a</p>
<p begin="04:32:59.040" end="04:33:03.520" style="s2">loud, shocked chirp upon hearing his</p>
<p begin="04:33:00.960" end="04:33:05.039" style="s2">words. But Zeke simply smiled widely and</p>
<p begin="04:33:03.520" end="04:33:06.799" style="s2">announced that he would personally whip</p>
<p begin="04:33:05.039" end="04:33:08.799" style="s2">her into shape so she would never have</p>
<p begin="04:33:06.799" end="04:33:10.959" style="s2">to worry about food for her chicks ever</p>
<p begin="04:33:08.799" end="04:33:12.639" style="s2">again. Meanwhile, deep within the</p>
<p begin="04:33:10.959" end="04:33:14.400" style="s2">mountains hidden inside the rift,</p>
<p begin="04:33:12.639" end="04:33:16.799" style="s2">another group was casually slaughtering</p>
<p begin="04:33:14.400" end="04:33:18.799" style="s2">chaos monsters blocking their path. Not</p>
<p begin="04:33:16.799" end="04:33:20.639" style="s2">long after, members of Kerberus finally</p>
<p begin="04:33:18.799" end="04:33:22.080" style="s2">came into view. One of them sighing</p>
<p begin="04:33:20.639" end="04:33:23.520" style="s2">while holding a pocket watch as he</p>
<p begin="04:33:22.080" end="04:33:25.760" style="s2">stared at the strange rift that</p>
<p begin="04:33:23.520" end="04:33:27.680" style="s2">stretched high into the sky itself. He</p>
<p begin="04:33:25.760" end="04:33:29.840" style="s2">calmly adjusted the position of his hat</p>
<p begin="04:33:27.680" end="04:33:31.680" style="s2">before informing his companions that now</p>
<p begin="04:33:29.840" end="04:33:33.840" style="s2">that the chaos monsters surrounding the</p>
<p begin="04:33:31.680" end="04:33:35.760" style="s2">area had been dealt with, it was finally</p>
<p begin="04:33:33.840" end="04:33:37.600" style="s2">time for them to begin the lizard hunt.</p>
<p begin="04:33:35.760" end="04:33:38.799" style="s2">One week later, Sandy and the others</p>
<p begin="04:33:37.600" end="04:33:40.719" style="s2">continued fighting against the</p>
<p begin="04:33:38.799" end="04:33:42.561" style="s2">caterpillar-like chaos monsters without</p>
<p begin="04:33:40.719" end="04:33:44.639" style="s2">rest. And after Sandy sliced down</p>
<p begin="04:33:42.561" end="04:33:46.320" style="s2">another wave of the grotesque creatures,</p>
<p begin="04:33:44.639" end="04:33:47.920" style="s2">she finally snapped and loudly</p>
<p begin="04:33:46.320" end="04:33:49.840" style="s2">questioned what kind of hellish place</p>
<p begin="04:33:47.920" end="04:33:51.600" style="s2">they had been thrown into. Vanil,</p>
<p begin="04:33:49.840" end="04:33:53.279" style="s2">startled by her sudden scream,</p>
<p begin="04:33:51.600" end="04:33:55.279" style="s2">immediately told her to keep it down and</p>
<p begin="04:33:53.279" end="04:33:56.959" style="s2">stop shouting so much, saying that she</p>
<p begin="04:33:55.279" end="04:33:58.719" style="s2">had screamed more during the past week</p>
<p begin="04:33:56.959" end="04:34:00.639" style="s2">than she had swung her sword. On the</p>
<p begin="04:33:58.719" end="04:34:02.719" style="s2">other hand, Edges noticed that the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:34:00.639" end="04:34:03.920" style="s2">monsters simply never stopped coming,</p>
<p begin="04:34:02.719" end="04:34:06.000" style="s2">even though they had been fighting</p>
<p begin="04:34:03.920" end="04:34:07.840" style="s2">non-stop for an entire week already.</p>
<p begin="04:34:06.000" end="04:34:09.520" style="s2">Laya confirmed it with an exhausted</p>
<p begin="04:34:07.840" end="04:34:11.199" style="s2">expression and admitted that she was</p>
<p begin="04:34:09.520" end="04:34:13.199" style="s2">completely sick of dealing with chaos</p>
<p begin="04:34:11.199" end="04:34:14.719" style="s2">monsters. Edgis only laughed before</p>
<p begin="04:34:13.199" end="04:34:16.400" style="s2">slashing apart another bug-like</p>
<p begin="04:34:14.719" end="04:34:18.561" style="s2">creature, then shifted his gaze toward</p>
<p begin="04:34:16.400" end="04:34:20.160" style="s2">Leica, covered in golden aura, Leica</p>
<p begin="04:34:18.561" end="04:34:21.840" style="s2">charged forward with her great sword and</p>
<p begin="04:34:20.160" end="04:34:24.000" style="s2">unleashed a thunder net annihilation</p>
<p begin="04:34:21.840" end="04:34:25.840" style="s2">toward the monsters, summoning violent</p>
<p begin="04:34:24.000" end="04:34:27.680" style="s2">golden lightning that instantly wiped</p>
<p begin="04:34:25.840" end="04:34:29.520" style="s2">out every chaos creature surrounding</p>
<p begin="04:34:27.680" end="04:34:31.439" style="s2">her. After the monsters collapsed one</p>
<p begin="04:34:29.520" end="04:34:33.119" style="s2">after another, she wiped the sweat and</p>
<p begin="04:34:31.439" end="04:34:35.119" style="s2">asked if everyone was still all right.</p>
<p begin="04:34:33.119" end="04:34:37.119" style="s2">While watching her, Edges was honestly</p>
<p begin="04:34:35.119" end="04:34:38.959" style="s2">amazed that she could still move after</p>
<p begin="04:34:37.119" end="04:34:41.039" style="s2">releasing that much power. Though deep</p>
<p begin="04:34:38.959" end="04:34:43.199" style="s2">inside, he only hoped that she was not</p>
<p begin="04:34:41.039" end="04:34:45.039" style="s2">forcing herself too hard simply because</p>
<p begin="04:34:43.199" end="04:34:47.199" style="s2">she was the leader. Sandy then walked</p>
<p begin="04:34:45.039" end="04:34:49.199" style="s2">toward Leica while loudly declaring that</p>
<p begin="04:34:47.199" end="04:34:50.959" style="s2">she was absolutely not all right, adding</p>
<p begin="04:34:49.199" end="04:34:53.039" style="s2">that this had easily become the worst</p>
<p begin="04:34:50.959" end="04:34:54.959" style="s2">experience of her entire life before</p>
<p begin="04:34:53.039" end="04:34:57.039" style="s2">asking if every rift was like this on</p>
<p begin="04:34:54.959" end="04:34:58.639" style="s2">the inside. Leica shook her head and</p>
<p begin="04:34:57.039" end="04:35:00.561" style="s2">explained that the type of mixed realm</p>
<p begin="04:34:58.639" end="04:35:02.561" style="s2">they ended up in depended entirely on</p>
<p begin="04:35:00.561" end="04:35:04.400" style="s2">the rift itself and that the chaotic</p>
<p begin="04:35:02.561" end="04:35:06.639" style="s2">worlds beyond the rifts were all</p>
<p begin="04:35:04.400" end="04:35:08.320" style="s2">extremely dangerous. Edges casually</p>
<p begin="04:35:06.639" end="04:35:10.000" style="s2">grabbed Sandy&#39;s shoulder and told her</p>
<p begin="04:35:08.320" end="04:35:11.920" style="s2">that she had simply gotten unlucky this</p>
<p begin="04:35:10.000" end="04:35:13.279" style="s2">time, especially since she hated bugs</p>
<p begin="04:35:11.920" end="04:35:15.359" style="s2">more than anything. The moment he</p>
<p begin="04:35:13.279" end="04:35:17.039" style="s2">touched her shoulder, Sandy&#39;s whole body</p>
<p begin="04:35:15.359" end="04:35:18.639" style="s2">trembled in disgust before she</p>
<p begin="04:35:17.039" end="04:35:20.799" style="s2">immediately started shouting at him</p>
<p begin="04:35:18.639" end="04:35:23.119" style="s2">again. However, when Leica calmly called</p>
<p begin="04:35:20.799" end="04:35:24.480" style="s2">out her name, Sandy instantly stopped</p>
<p begin="04:35:23.119" end="04:35:25.840" style="s2">and reluctantly admitted that</p>
<p begin="04:35:24.480" end="04:35:27.920" style="s2">complaining would not finish their</p>
<p begin="04:35:25.840" end="04:35:29.359" style="s2">mission. Edges laughed again, inwardly</p>
<p begin="04:35:27.920" end="04:35:31.039" style="s2">thankful that Leica was there to keep</p>
<p begin="04:35:29.359" end="04:35:32.480" style="s2">Sandy under control. He then looked</p>
<p begin="04:35:31.039" end="04:35:33.680" style="s2">toward the others and remarked that it</p>
<p begin="04:35:32.480" end="04:35:35.600" style="s2">would be nice if they could finally</p>
<p begin="04:35:33.680" end="04:35:37.840" style="s2">leave the forest already. At that exact</p>
<p begin="04:35:35.600" end="04:35:39.920" style="s2">moment, Veneil suddenly sensed something</p>
<p begin="04:35:37.840" end="04:35:41.600" style="s2">strange and slowly turned around, using</p>
<p begin="04:35:39.920" end="04:35:43.439" style="s2">his wind aura to examine the</p>
<p begin="04:35:41.600" end="04:35:45.039" style="s2">surroundings. He eventually confirmed</p>
<p begin="04:35:43.439" end="04:35:46.639" style="s2">that the airflow felt completely</p>
<p begin="04:35:45.039" end="04:35:48.799" style="s2">different compared to before and</p>
<p begin="04:35:46.639" end="04:35:51.039" style="s2">declared that the exit had to be nearby.</p>
<p begin="04:35:48.799" end="04:35:53.039" style="s2">Sandy, still doubtful, asked if he was</p>
<p begin="04:35:51.039" end="04:35:54.561" style="s2">really sure, while also warning him not</p>
<p begin="04:35:53.039" end="04:35:56.799" style="s2">to get too close to her while he was</p>
<p begin="04:35:54.561" end="04:35:58.719" style="s2">still covered in disgusting bug guts.</p>
<p begin="04:35:56.799" end="04:36:00.561" style="s2">Irritated, Venil snapped back and</p>
<p begin="04:35:58.719" end="04:36:02.480" style="s2">questioned why he would even lie after</p>
<p begin="04:36:00.561" end="04:36:04.719" style="s2">already suffering through an entire week</p>
<p begin="04:36:02.480" end="04:36:06.959" style="s2">of Sandy&#39;s non-stop screaming. Despite</p>
<p begin="04:36:04.719" end="04:36:08.639" style="s2">that, Sandy only smiled brightly,</p>
<p begin="04:36:06.959" end="04:36:10.320" style="s2">relieved that her nightmare of bugs</p>
<p begin="04:36:08.639" end="04:36:12.000" style="s2">might finally be ending. The group</p>
<p begin="04:36:10.320" end="04:36:13.359" style="s2">immediately rushed through the forest as</p>
<p begin="04:36:12.000" end="04:36:14.799" style="s2">fast as they could, and after</p>
<p begin="04:36:13.359" end="04:36:16.639" style="s2">continuously following the direction</p>
<p begin="04:36:14.799" end="04:36:18.320" style="s2">Veneil pointed toward, they eventually</p>
<p begin="04:36:16.639" end="04:36:20.480" style="s2">noticed a bright light shining ahead of</p>
<p begin="04:36:18.320" end="04:36:22.160" style="s2">them. Sandy and Leica became excited</p>
<p begin="04:36:20.480" end="04:36:24.000" style="s2">after realizing that they had finally</p>
<p begin="04:36:22.160" end="04:36:26.160" style="s2">found the exit and could finally leave</p>
<p begin="04:36:24.000" end="04:36:27.680" style="s2">the cursed forest behind. Feeling as</p>
<p begin="04:36:26.160" end="04:36:30.000" style="s2">though this was the luckiest moment of</p>
<p begin="04:36:27.680" end="04:36:32.000" style="s2">her life, Sandy happily ran ahead while</p>
<p begin="04:36:30.000" end="04:36:34.400" style="s2">loudly saying goodbye to the disgusting</p>
<p begin="04:36:32.000" end="04:36:36.160" style="s2">bugs. However, the joy on her face</p>
<p begin="04:36:34.400" end="04:36:38.240" style="s2">disappeared the instant she exited the</p>
<p begin="04:36:36.160" end="04:36:40.400" style="s2">forest and realized that beyond it was</p>
<p begin="04:36:38.240" end="04:36:42.160" style="s2">nothing but a vast rocky terrain. While</p>
<p begin="04:36:40.400" end="04:36:44.160" style="s2">the pillar of light still remained far</p>
<p begin="04:36:42.160" end="04:36:45.840" style="s2">away in the distance, Sandy immediately</p>
<p begin="04:36:44.160" end="04:36:47.840" style="s2">asked what they were supposed to do now.</p>
<p begin="04:36:45.840" end="04:36:49.359" style="s2">And in response, Edges sighed and</p>
<p begin="04:36:47.840" end="04:36:51.119" style="s2">remarked that this place looked like an</p>
<p begin="04:36:49.359" end="04:36:52.719" style="s2">entirely new headache waiting for them.</p>
<p begin="04:36:51.119" end="04:36:54.639" style="s2">While staring at the massive purple</p>
<p begin="04:36:52.719" end="04:36:56.240" style="s2">pillar of light, Alan pointed out that</p>
<p begin="04:36:54.639" end="04:36:58.561" style="s2">it was the same pillar they had seen</p>
<p begin="04:36:56.240" end="04:37:00.160" style="s2">while falling into the rift. Laya agreed</p>
<p begin="04:36:58.561" end="04:37:02.000" style="s2">and mentioned that they were much closer</p>
<p begin="04:37:00.160" end="04:37:03.439" style="s2">to it now. Lea then asked if the light</p>
<p begin="04:37:02.000" end="04:37:05.279" style="s2">they were seeing was truly what she</p>
<p begin="04:37:03.439" end="04:37:07.199" style="s2">thought it was. And Edges confirmed her</p>
<p begin="04:37:05.279" end="04:37:09.119" style="s2">suspicion, explaining that now that they</p>
<p begin="04:37:07.199" end="04:37:10.719" style="s2">were this close, it was obvious that the</p>
<p begin="04:37:09.119" end="04:37:12.561" style="s2">light was coming from the chaos stone</p>
<p begin="04:37:10.719" end="04:37:14.400" style="s2">their teacher had told them about. A few</p>
<p begin="04:37:12.561" end="04:37:16.080" style="s2">days earlier, before the special rift</p>
<p begin="04:37:14.400" end="04:37:18.000" style="s2">operation departed from the Eldregan</p>
<p begin="04:37:16.080" end="04:37:19.760" style="s2">main estate, Menrich had explained to</p>
<p begin="04:37:18.000" end="04:37:21.439" style="s2">the group that simply recovering the</p>
<p begin="04:37:19.760" end="04:37:23.039" style="s2">magic water would not be enough to</p>
<p begin="04:37:21.439" end="04:37:24.799" style="s2">complete the mission. Zeke had asked</p>
<p begin="04:37:23.039" end="04:37:26.480" style="s2">what else they needed to do, and Leica</p>
<p begin="04:37:24.799" end="04:37:28.561" style="s2">explained that closing the rift itself</p>
<p begin="04:37:26.480" end="04:37:30.639" style="s2">was part of clearing it. Mench confirmed</p>
<p begin="04:37:28.561" end="04:37:32.561" style="s2">her explanation and further stated that</p>
<p begin="04:37:30.639" end="04:37:34.320" style="s2">they needed to destroy the chaos stone</p>
<p begin="04:37:32.561" end="04:37:35.760" style="s2">responsible for maintaining the rift.</p>
<p begin="04:37:34.320" end="04:37:37.439" style="s2">The moment the chaos stone was</p>
<p begin="04:37:35.760" end="04:37:39.439" style="s2">mentioned, Zeke suddenly recalled</p>
<p begin="04:37:37.439" end="04:37:40.879" style="s2">reading about it somewhere before. Edges</p>
<p begin="04:37:39.439" end="04:37:42.480" style="s2">then explained to him that the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:37:40.879" end="04:37:44.000" style="s2">stone was an ore believed to be</p>
<p begin="04:37:42.480" end="04:37:46.080" style="s2">responsible for creating rifts</p>
<p begin="04:37:44.000" end="04:37:47.840" style="s2">throughout the world. Curious, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:37:46.080" end="04:37:49.359" style="s2">asked Menrick if the Chaos Stone was</p>
<p begin="04:37:47.840" end="04:37:51.199" style="s2">merely the source of the rift, but</p>
<p begin="04:37:49.359" end="04:37:52.719" style="s2">Menrich shook his head and clarified</p>
<p begin="04:37:51.199" end="04:37:54.719" style="s2">that it was far more dangerous than</p>
<p begin="04:37:52.719" end="04:37:56.799" style="s2">that. If anything, the Chaos Stone</p>
<p begin="04:37:54.719" end="04:37:58.561" style="s2">itself was the true threat hidden within</p>
<p begin="04:37:56.799" end="04:38:00.320" style="s2">every rift, pointing toward an</p>
<p begin="04:37:58.561" end="04:38:01.840" style="s2">illustration inside the book. Menrich</p>
<p begin="04:38:00.320" end="04:38:03.600" style="s2">explained that the Chaos Stone</p>
<p begin="04:38:01.840" end="04:38:05.680" style="s2">constantly released enormous amounts of</p>
<p begin="04:38:03.600" end="04:38:07.600" style="s2">energy in order to keep the rift open.</p>
<p begin="04:38:05.680" end="04:38:09.520" style="s2">That same energy slowly devoured the</p>
<p begin="04:38:07.600" end="04:38:11.680" style="s2">surrounding ecosystem inside the mixed</p>
<p begin="04:38:09.520" end="04:38:13.920" style="s2">realm, twisting every living being it</p>
<p begin="04:38:11.680" end="04:38:16.320" style="s2">touched into chaos creatures. And chaos</p>
<p begin="04:38:13.920" end="04:38:18.080" style="s2">itself possessed only a single instinct,</p>
<p begin="04:38:16.320" end="04:38:19.920" style="s2">slaughter. They endlessly slaughtered</p>
<p begin="04:38:18.080" end="04:38:21.600" style="s2">and devoured entire worlds before</p>
<p begin="04:38:19.920" end="04:38:23.359" style="s2">eventually seeking another world to</p>
<p begin="04:38:21.600" end="04:38:25.119" style="s2">invade. Once they found a path through</p>
<p begin="04:38:23.359" end="04:38:27.279" style="s2">the rift, they would cross over and</p>
<p begin="04:38:25.119" end="04:38:28.719" style="s2">begin invading Earth itself. Sandy</p>
<p begin="04:38:27.279" end="04:38:30.879" style="s2">commented that it sounded like an</p>
<p begin="04:38:28.719" end="04:38:32.320" style="s2">absolutely horrible thing to deal with,</p>
<p begin="04:38:30.879" end="04:38:34.400" style="s2">especially since they needed to search</p>
<p begin="04:38:32.320" end="04:38:36.719" style="s2">for both the magic water and the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:38:34.400" end="04:38:38.400" style="s2">stone at the same time. However, Edgis</p>
<p begin="04:38:36.719" end="04:38:40.240" style="s2">explained that the situation was not</p>
<p begin="04:38:38.400" end="04:38:42.160" style="s2">necessarily that troublesome. Showing</p>
<p begin="04:38:40.240" end="04:38:43.920" style="s2">her another image inside the book, he</p>
<p begin="04:38:42.160" end="04:38:46.080" style="s2">explained that magic water naturally</p>
<p begin="04:38:43.920" end="04:38:47.600" style="s2">formed near Chaos Stones. Menrich</p>
<p begin="04:38:46.080" end="04:38:49.439" style="s2">confirmed it and instructed them to</p>
<p begin="04:38:47.600" end="04:38:51.600" style="s2">prioritize finding the Chaos Stone</p>
<p begin="04:38:49.439" end="04:38:53.119" style="s2">first. Although every chaos stone looked</p>
<p begin="04:38:51.600" end="04:38:55.039" style="s2">completely different from one another,</p>
<p begin="04:38:53.119" end="04:38:57.359" style="s2">they all shared a single trait. They</p>
<p begin="04:38:55.039" end="04:38:58.879" style="s2">constantly emitted powerful energy. Once</p>
<p begin="04:38:57.359" end="04:39:00.639" style="s2">someone got close enough, they would</p>
<p begin="04:38:58.879" end="04:39:02.879" style="s2">immediately recognize it as a chaos</p>
<p begin="04:39:00.639" end="04:39:04.799" style="s2">stone. Back in the rift, Veneil pointed</p>
<p begin="04:39:02.879" end="04:39:06.400" style="s2">toward the massive pillar of light and</p>
<p begin="04:39:04.799" end="04:39:08.160" style="s2">stated that all they needed to do now</p>
<p begin="04:39:06.400" end="04:39:10.561" style="s2">was follow the light directly to its</p>
<p begin="04:39:08.160" end="04:39:12.719" style="s2">source. Sandy silently glanced at Veneil</p>
<p begin="04:39:10.561" end="04:39:14.080" style="s2">and Allen from behind, secretly amazed</p>
<p begin="04:39:12.719" end="04:39:15.680" style="s2">that the two of them were actually</p>
<p begin="04:39:14.080" end="04:39:17.600" style="s2">capable of discussing something other</p>
<p begin="04:39:15.680" end="04:39:19.279" style="s2">than trash for once. But when Vanil</p>
<p begin="04:39:17.600" end="04:39:21.359" style="s2">suddenly asked what she was staring at,</p>
<p begin="04:39:19.279" end="04:39:22.959" style="s2">she immediately ignored him. Edges then</p>
<p begin="04:39:21.359" end="04:39:24.799" style="s2">commented that it would be perfect if</p>
<p begin="04:39:22.959" end="04:39:27.359" style="s2">they managed to reunite with Zeke near</p>
<p begin="04:39:24.799" end="04:39:28.879" style="s2">the Chaos Stone itself. Meanwhile, Leica</p>
<p begin="04:39:27.359" end="04:39:30.959" style="s2">quietly hoped that Zeke had already</p>
<p begin="04:39:28.879" end="04:39:32.719" style="s2">noticed the Chaos Stone by now. Laya</p>
<p begin="04:39:30.959" end="04:39:34.480" style="s2">glanced toward Venil and asked if he was</p>
<p begin="04:39:32.719" end="04:39:36.480" style="s2">worried about Zeke. But before she could</p>
<p begin="04:39:34.480" end="04:39:38.400" style="s2">even finish speaking, Vanil immediately</p>
<p begin="04:39:36.480" end="04:39:39.840" style="s2">told her to shut up. Sandy happily</p>
<p begin="04:39:38.400" end="04:39:41.760" style="s2">pointed out that at least there were no</p>
<p begin="04:39:39.840" end="04:39:43.440" style="s2">bugs in this rocky area, unlike the</p>
<p begin="04:39:41.760" end="04:39:45.280" style="s2">nightmare forest they had just escaped</p>
<p begin="04:39:43.440" end="04:39:46.798" style="s2">from. Laya also admitted that she was</p>
<p begin="04:39:45.280" end="04:39:48.480" style="s2">thankful for that because she was</p>
<p begin="04:39:46.798" end="04:39:50.798" style="s2">already exhausted from fighting bugs</p>
<p begin="04:39:48.480" end="04:39:52.400" style="s2">non-stop for an entire week. However,</p>
<p begin="04:39:50.798" end="04:39:54.320" style="s2">Edges quickly brushed aside their</p>
<p begin="04:39:52.400" end="04:39:55.920" style="s2">optimism and warned them that according</p>
<p begin="04:39:54.320" end="04:39:58.000" style="s2">to the information they received,</p>
<p begin="04:39:55.920" end="04:40:00.160" style="s2">powerful chaos monsters usually gathered</p>
<p begin="04:39:58.000" end="04:40:02.240" style="s2">near chaos stones after being twisted by</p>
<p begin="04:40:00.160" end="04:40:03.760" style="s2">its energy. Venil clicked his tongue and</p>
<p begin="04:40:02.240" end="04:40:06.000" style="s2">called the entire thing a complete</p>
<p begin="04:40:03.760" end="04:40:08.000" style="s2">hassle. At the same time, Leica suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:40:06.000" end="04:40:09.840" style="s2">felt an unpleasant chill from the area</p>
<p begin="04:40:08.000" end="04:40:11.200" style="s2">and warned everyone to stay alert as</p>
<p begin="04:40:09.840" end="04:40:12.798" style="s2">they carefully advanced toward the</p>
<p begin="04:40:11.200" end="04:40:14.240" style="s2">pillar of light. The group slowly</p>
<p begin="04:40:12.798" end="04:40:16.240" style="s2">explored the rocky terrain while</p>
<p begin="04:40:14.240" end="04:40:17.840" style="s2">remaining cautious. And after some time,</p>
<p begin="04:40:16.240" end="04:40:19.360" style="s2">even Veneil and the others became</p>
<p begin="04:40:17.840" end="04:40:20.798" style="s2">surprised that they had managed to make</p>
<p begin="04:40:19.360" end="04:40:22.798" style="s2">it all the way there without running</p>
<p begin="04:40:20.798" end="04:40:24.958" style="s2">into any danger. Standing before the</p>
<p begin="04:40:22.798" end="04:40:27.040" style="s2">giant chaos stone radiating a sinister</p>
<p begin="04:40:24.958" end="04:40:29.520" style="s2">purple aura, they were all amazed by its</p>
<p begin="04:40:27.040" end="04:40:31.680" style="s2">enormous size and the overwhelming evil</p>
<p begin="04:40:29.520" end="04:40:33.520" style="s2">energy surrounding it. Feeling strangely</p>
<p begin="04:40:31.680" end="04:40:35.040" style="s2">confident, Sandy asked where all the</p>
<p begin="04:40:33.520" end="04:40:36.958" style="s2">monsters were and remarked that the</p>
<p begin="04:40:35.040" end="04:40:39.120" style="s2">whole thing was becoming anticlimactic.</p>
<p begin="04:40:36.958" end="04:40:41.120" style="s2">But at that exact moment, a massive</p>
<p begin="04:40:39.120" end="04:40:43.040" style="s2">beetle-like shadow suddenly leapt across</p>
<p begin="04:40:41.120" end="04:40:44.638" style="s2">the rocky cliffs above them. Leica</p>
<p begin="04:40:43.040" end="04:40:46.240" style="s2">immediately sensed it and warned</p>
<p begin="04:40:44.638" end="04:40:47.920" style="s2">everyone that something was overhead.</p>
<p begin="04:40:46.240" end="04:40:49.680" style="s2">The group instantly drew their weapons</p>
<p begin="04:40:47.920" end="04:40:51.760" style="s2">while searching the cliffs for enemies.</p>
<p begin="04:40:49.680" end="04:40:53.680" style="s2">Then suddenly, a violent explosion</p>
<p begin="04:40:51.760" end="04:40:55.200" style="s2">erupted directly in front of them. Leica</p>
<p begin="04:40:53.680" end="04:40:56.878" style="s2">immediately tensed up and prepared</p>
<p begin="04:40:55.200" end="04:40:58.560" style="s2">herself for battle, but when the smoke</p>
<p begin="04:40:56.878" end="04:41:00.240" style="s2">slowly cleared away, they were shocked</p>
<p begin="04:40:58.560" end="04:41:01.920" style="s2">to see Zeke casually standing there</p>
<p begin="04:41:00.240" end="04:41:03.840" style="s2">while waving at them with a bright smile</p>
<p begin="04:41:01.920" end="04:41:05.680" style="s2">on his face. Relief instantly spread</p>
<p begin="04:41:03.840" end="04:41:07.760" style="s2">across the group as they realized he was</p>
<p begin="04:41:05.680" end="04:41:09.600" style="s2">safe. Aside from Veneil and Allan,</p>
<p begin="04:41:07.760" end="04:41:11.280" style="s2">everyone quickly rushed toward him while</p>
<p begin="04:41:09.600" end="04:41:13.520" style="s2">expressing how glad they were to see him</p>
<p begin="04:41:11.280" end="04:41:15.360" style="s2">alive. Zeke smiled and told them that he</p>
<p begin="04:41:13.520" end="04:41:17.120" style="s2">was glad to see them too, adding that</p>
<p begin="04:41:15.360" end="04:41:19.040" style="s2">they still looked lively enough.</p>
<p begin="04:41:17.120" end="04:41:20.958" style="s2">However, with a completely exhausted</p>
<p begin="04:41:19.040" end="04:41:23.040" style="s2">face, Venil questioned whether they</p>
<p begin="04:41:20.958" end="04:41:24.320" style="s2">really looked lively at all, while Laya</p>
<p begin="04:41:23.040" end="04:41:26.400" style="s2">admitted that they were already</p>
<p begin="04:41:24.320" end="04:41:27.920" style="s2">completely wrecked. Only then did Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:41:26.400" end="04:41:29.840" style="s2">finally notice how exhausted and</p>
<p begin="04:41:27.920" end="04:41:31.840" style="s2">battered everyone looked. But before he</p>
<p begin="04:41:29.840" end="04:41:33.600" style="s2">could continue speaking, Allan suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:41:31.840" end="04:41:35.440" style="s2">interrupted him and pointed towards</p>
<p begin="04:41:33.600" end="04:41:37.360" style="s2">something behind Zeke while asking if</p>
<p begin="04:41:35.440" end="04:41:39.360" style="s2">what he was seeing was actually real.</p>
<p begin="04:41:37.360" end="04:41:41.200" style="s2">Zeke remained silent for a moment before</p>
<p begin="04:41:39.360" end="04:41:42.638" style="s2">casually glancing behind himself and</p>
<p begin="04:41:41.200" end="04:41:44.160" style="s2">explaining that he had accidentally</p>
<p begin="04:41:42.638" end="04:41:46.000" style="s2">killed it a little while ago. The</p>
<p begin="04:41:44.160" end="04:41:47.840" style="s2">instant Sandy saw the gigantic dead</p>
<p begin="04:41:46.000" end="04:41:49.440" style="s2">beetle lying there, every hair on her</p>
<p begin="04:41:47.840" end="04:41:51.120" style="s2">body stood up and she immediately</p>
<p begin="04:41:49.440" end="04:41:52.878" style="s2">screamed in horror at the sight of the</p>
<p begin="04:41:51.120" end="04:41:54.400" style="s2">massive creature Zeke had defeated.</p>
<p begin="04:41:52.878" end="04:41:56.320" style="s2">Edges guessed that the beetle was</p>
<p begin="04:41:54.400" end="04:41:58.080" style="s2">probably the powerful chaos monster they</p>
<p begin="04:41:56.320" end="04:41:59.840" style="s2">had heard about and asked if Zeke had</p>
<p begin="04:41:58.080" end="04:42:01.360" style="s2">really taken it down alone. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:41:59.840" end="04:42:03.360" style="s2">casually answered that the creature</p>
<p begin="04:42:01.360" end="04:42:05.360" style="s2">attacked him first, so he simply dealt</p>
<p begin="04:42:03.360" end="04:42:06.718" style="s2">with it. Hearing that answer, Leica then</p>
<p begin="04:42:05.360" end="04:42:08.638" style="s2">asked if the reason they had not</p>
<p begin="04:42:06.718" end="04:42:10.480" style="s2">encountered any chaos monsters on their</p>
<p begin="04:42:08.638" end="04:42:12.480" style="s2">way there was because Zeke had already</p>
<p begin="04:42:10.480" end="04:42:14.080" style="s2">wiped them all out beforehand. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:42:12.480" end="04:42:15.840" style="s2">merely replied that he might have taken</p>
<p begin="04:42:14.080" end="04:42:17.520" style="s2">care of a few on the way and that it was</p>
<p begin="04:42:15.840" end="04:42:19.360" style="s2">probably the reason. After hearing him</p>
<p begin="04:42:17.520" end="04:42:21.040" style="s2">talk about defeating terrifying chaos</p>
<p begin="04:42:19.360" end="04:42:22.958" style="s2">monsters as though it were nothing, the</p>
<p begin="04:42:21.040" end="04:42:25.440" style="s2">entire group silently realized once</p>
<p begin="04:42:22.958" end="04:42:27.360" style="s2">again that Zeke was completely insane.</p>
<p begin="04:42:25.440" end="04:42:29.200" style="s2">Zeke then pointed toward the giant rock</p>
<p begin="04:42:27.360" end="04:42:30.718" style="s2">behind him and asked if it was the chaos</p>
<p begin="04:42:29.200" end="04:42:32.480" style="s2">stone they had been searching for,</p>
<p begin="04:42:30.718" end="04:42:34.080" style="s2">adding that he figured it was important,</p>
<p begin="04:42:32.480" end="04:42:36.160" style="s2">so he waited there for the others to</p>
<p begin="04:42:34.080" end="04:42:37.920" style="s2">arrive. Edgis immediately confirmed it</p>
<p begin="04:42:36.160" end="04:42:39.760" style="s2">and declared that there was absolutely</p>
<p begin="04:42:37.920" end="04:42:41.520" style="s2">no doubt that it was truly a chaos</p>
<p begin="04:42:39.760" end="04:42:43.120" style="s2">stone. Zeke then pointed beneath the</p>
<p begin="04:42:41.520" end="04:42:44.638" style="s2">stone and asked if the glowing liquid</p>
<p begin="04:42:43.120" end="04:42:46.958" style="s2">below it was the water they were looking</p>
<p begin="04:42:44.638" end="04:42:48.798" style="s2">for. Slightly surprised, Leica asked</p>
<p begin="04:42:46.958" end="04:42:50.718" style="s2">what water he was talking about. Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:42:48.798" end="04:42:52.320" style="s2">walked closer to the chaos stone and</p>
<p begin="04:42:50.718" end="04:42:54.000" style="s2">casually pointed toward the glowing</p>
<p begin="04:42:52.320" end="04:42:55.520" style="s2">liquid beneath it before immediately</p>
<p begin="04:42:54.000" end="04:42:57.600" style="s2">touching it with his finger while</p>
<p begin="04:42:55.520" end="04:42:59.440" style="s2">staring at it curiously. Seeing that,</p>
<p begin="04:42:57.600" end="04:43:01.200" style="s2">Leica quickly took out several bottles</p>
<p begin="04:42:59.440" end="04:43:03.520" style="s2">and exclaimed that there was far more</p>
<p begin="04:43:01.200" end="04:43:05.520" style="s2">magic water than she expected. As Leica</p>
<p begin="04:43:03.520" end="04:43:06.958" style="s2">began collecting the magic water, Edges</p>
<p begin="04:43:05.520" end="04:43:08.718" style="s2">explained that a person needed to drink</p>
<p begin="04:43:06.958" end="04:43:10.480" style="s2">a certain amount in order to receive the</p>
<p begin="04:43:08.718" end="04:43:12.000" style="s2">full effect of the magic water and that</p>
<p begin="04:43:10.480" end="04:43:14.240" style="s2">even this amount might only be enough</p>
<p begin="04:43:12.000" end="04:43:16.240" style="s2">for a few people. Completely exhausted,</p>
<p begin="04:43:14.240" end="04:43:18.320" style="s2">Sandy immediately told Edges that none</p>
<p begin="04:43:16.240" end="04:43:19.840" style="s2">of that mattered anymore and urged Lea</p>
<p begin="04:43:18.320" end="04:43:21.440" style="s2">to hurry up and finish collecting the</p>
<p begin="04:43:19.840" end="04:43:23.360" style="s2">water so they could finally leave this</p>
<p begin="04:43:21.440" end="04:43:25.200" style="s2">place. Once Leica finished, she</p>
<p begin="04:43:23.360" end="04:43:27.040" style="s2">carefully observed the liquid inside the</p>
<p begin="04:43:25.200" end="04:43:29.040" style="s2">bottles and explained that according to</p>
<p begin="04:43:27.040" end="04:43:30.878" style="s2">rumors, the color of magic water</p>
<p begin="04:43:29.040" end="04:43:32.798" style="s2">determined what type of magic attribute</p>
<p begin="04:43:30.878" end="04:43:34.480" style="s2">a person could awaken. However, the</p>
<p begin="04:43:32.798" end="04:43:36.160" style="s2">water they collected appeared almost</p>
<p begin="04:43:34.480" end="04:43:38.160" style="s2">completely clear. While examining</p>
<p begin="04:43:36.160" end="04:43:39.760" style="s2">another bottle himself, Edges corrected</p>
<p begin="04:43:38.160" end="04:43:41.600" style="s2">her and pointed out that the water</p>
<p begin="04:43:39.760" end="04:43:43.600" style="s2">actually possessed a strange color.</p>
<p begin="04:43:41.600" end="04:43:45.200" style="s2">Sandy agreed, while Laya also admitted</p>
<p begin="04:43:43.600" end="04:43:47.200" style="s2">that its color looked unusual.</p>
<p begin="04:43:45.200" end="04:43:48.878" style="s2">Meanwhile, Venil and Allan argued that</p>
<p begin="04:43:47.200" end="04:43:50.878" style="s2">regardless of the color, there was no</p>
<p begin="04:43:48.878" end="04:43:52.718" style="s2">doubt that it was genuine magic water.</p>
<p begin="04:43:50.878" end="04:43:54.400" style="s2">As the others continued discussing it,</p>
<p begin="04:43:52.718" end="04:43:56.080" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s eyes suddenly widened after</p>
<p begin="04:43:54.400" end="04:43:58.320" style="s2">sensing something dangerous. Without</p>
<p begin="04:43:56.080" end="04:43:59.680" style="s2">hesitation, he immediately grabbed Leica</p>
<p begin="04:43:58.320" end="04:44:02.000" style="s2">and pulled her down to the ground to</p>
<p begin="04:43:59.680" end="04:44:03.440" style="s2">evade. Confused, Leica quickly asked</p>
<p begin="04:44:02.000" end="04:44:05.280" style="s2">what was happening. But in the next</p>
<p begin="04:44:03.440" end="04:44:07.280" style="s2">instant, a golden beam of light</p>
<p begin="04:44:05.280" end="04:44:09.120" style="s2">violently shot past them. The attack</p>
<p begin="04:44:07.280" end="04:44:10.958" style="s2">exploded exactly where Leica had been</p>
<p begin="04:44:09.120" end="04:44:12.480" style="s2">standing moments earlier, instantly</p>
<p begin="04:44:10.958" end="04:44:14.718" style="s2">making her realize that she would have</p>
<p begin="04:44:12.480" end="04:44:16.798" style="s2">died if Zeke had not reacted in time.</p>
<p begin="04:44:14.718" end="04:44:18.638" style="s2">Moments later, a group of men slowly</p>
<p begin="04:44:16.798" end="04:44:20.000" style="s2">emerged from the rocky terrain. The</p>
<p begin="04:44:18.638" end="04:44:21.840" style="s2">leader of the group, who had just</p>
<p begin="04:44:20.000" end="04:44:23.360" style="s2">launched the sneak attack, mockingly</p>
<p begin="04:44:21.840" end="04:44:25.360" style="s2">questioned how the little lizards had</p>
<p begin="04:44:23.360" end="04:44:27.040" style="s2">managed to dodge his attack. Edgis and</p>
<p begin="04:44:25.360" end="04:44:28.560" style="s2">the others instantly drew their weapons</p>
<p begin="04:44:27.040" end="04:44:30.480" style="s2">and prepared for battle against the</p>
<p begin="04:44:28.560" end="04:44:32.240" style="s2">members of Kerberus, while Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="04:44:30.480" end="04:44:33.840" style="s2">smiled with excitement at the upcoming</p>
<p begin="04:44:32.240" end="04:44:35.200" style="s2">fight and remarked that it had taken</p>
<p begin="04:44:33.840" end="04:44:37.840" style="s2">them long enough to finally show</p>
<p begin="04:44:35.200" end="04:44:39.200" style="s2">themselves. Once again, Zeke told the</p>
<p begin="04:44:37.840" end="04:44:40.718" style="s2">group of men in black that they had</p>
<p begin="04:44:39.200" end="04:44:42.480" style="s2">taken long enough to finally show</p>
<p begin="04:44:40.718" end="04:44:44.240" style="s2">themselves, causing the leader of the</p>
<p begin="04:44:42.480" end="04:44:46.400" style="s2">group to question what exactly he meant</p>
<p begin="04:44:44.240" end="04:44:48.160" style="s2">by that. While Sandy was still confused</p>
<p begin="04:44:46.400" end="04:44:50.400" style="s2">and asking who the men in black even</p>
<p begin="04:44:48.160" end="04:44:52.080" style="s2">were, Edges immediately felt a chill run</p>
<p begin="04:44:50.400" end="04:44:54.400" style="s2">down his spine as he realized how</p>
<p begin="04:44:52.080" end="04:44:56.480" style="s2">terrible the timing of this ambush was.</p>
<p begin="04:44:54.400" end="04:44:57.920" style="s2">Without hesitation, he began suspecting</p>
<p begin="04:44:56.480" end="04:45:00.080" style="s2">that the attackers were members of the</p>
<p begin="04:44:57.920" end="04:45:02.000" style="s2">Kerberous family. His mind quickly</p>
<p begin="04:45:00.080" end="04:45:04.000" style="s2">recalled Freya&#39;s earlier warning that</p>
<p begin="04:45:02.000" end="04:45:05.920" style="s2">only seven fighters below the three star</p>
<p begin="04:45:04.000" end="04:45:07.600" style="s2">rank were allowed to enter the rift and</p>
<p begin="04:45:05.920" end="04:45:08.798" style="s2">that no one other than their own group</p>
<p begin="04:45:07.600" end="04:45:11.360" style="s2">should have been capable of getting</p>
<p begin="04:45:08.798" end="04:45:12.718" style="s2">inside. As Edges&#39;s expression darkened,</p>
<p begin="04:45:11.360" end="04:45:14.320" style="s2">he could not understand how the</p>
<p begin="04:45:12.718" end="04:45:16.080" style="s2">Kerberous family had managed to enter</p>
<p begin="04:45:14.320" end="04:45:17.760" style="s2">the rift when the quota of seven</p>
<p begin="04:45:16.080" end="04:45:19.840" style="s2">fighters had already been completely</p>
<p begin="04:45:17.760" end="04:45:21.680" style="s2">filled. More importantly, the group</p>
<p begin="04:45:19.840" end="04:45:24.160" style="s2">standing before them was clearly made up</p>
<p begin="04:45:21.680" end="04:45:25.600" style="s2">of four star and even five-star fighters</p>
<p begin="04:45:24.160" end="04:45:27.840" style="s2">with their leader giving off an</p>
<p begin="04:45:25.600" end="04:45:30.160" style="s2">especially overwhelming pressure. Just</p>
<p begin="04:45:27.840" end="04:45:31.920" style="s2">then, the leader calmly revealed that he</p>
<p begin="04:45:30.160" end="04:45:33.600" style="s2">already knew they were curious about how</p>
<p begin="04:45:31.920" end="04:45:35.920" style="s2">they had managed to enter the rift in</p>
<p begin="04:45:33.600" end="04:45:37.600" style="s2">the first place. Raising his hand, he</p>
<p begin="04:45:35.920" end="04:45:39.600" style="s2">showed them a golden bracelet embedded</p>
<p begin="04:45:37.600" end="04:45:41.360" style="s2">with a green gemstone. When Leica</p>
<p begin="04:45:39.600" end="04:45:43.360" style="s2">wondered if the bracelet was the reason,</p>
<p begin="04:45:41.360" end="04:45:46.080" style="s2">the enemy leader explained that the item</p>
<p begin="04:45:43.360" end="04:45:48.000" style="s2">was called a bracelet of deception, an</p>
<p begin="04:45:46.080" end="04:45:50.000" style="s2">extremely rare consumable treasure that</p>
<p begin="04:45:48.000" end="04:45:52.000" style="s2">allowed its wearer to bypass the entry</p>
<p begin="04:45:50.000" end="04:45:54.000" style="s2">restrictions of special rifts. The</p>
<p begin="04:45:52.000" end="04:45:55.680" style="s2">higher the wearer&#39;s star rank, the more</p>
<p begin="04:45:54.000" end="04:45:57.280" style="s2">powerful the bracelet needed to be,</p>
<p begin="04:45:55.680" end="04:45:59.600" style="s2">while the gemstone determined the</p>
<p begin="04:45:57.280" end="04:46:01.040" style="s2">maximum star rank it could conceal. It</p>
<p begin="04:45:59.600" end="04:46:03.280" style="s2">was a rare item acquired through the</p>
<p begin="04:46:01.040" end="04:46:04.958" style="s2">Kerberous family&#39;s own hidden channels,</p>
<p begin="04:46:03.280" end="04:46:07.360" style="s2">though its effect vanished completely</p>
<p begin="04:46:04.958" end="04:46:09.440" style="s2">after a single use. Edges could hardly</p>
<p begin="04:46:07.360" end="04:46:11.360" style="s2">believe such an item even existed, while</p>
<p begin="04:46:09.440" end="04:46:13.120" style="s2">Venil raised his staff and pointed it</p>
<p begin="04:46:11.360" end="04:46:14.958" style="s2">toward the group, questioning whether</p>
<p begin="04:46:13.120" end="04:46:17.120" style="s2">they were idiots for openly revealing</p>
<p begin="04:46:14.958" end="04:46:18.798" style="s2">information like that. However, the</p>
<p begin="04:46:17.120" end="04:46:20.798" style="s2">enemy leader merely glanced at his</p>
<p begin="04:46:18.798" end="04:46:22.320" style="s2">pocket watch before coldly remarking</p>
<p begin="04:46:20.798" end="04:46:24.320" style="s2">that none of the information mattered</p>
<p begin="04:46:22.320" end="04:46:26.320" style="s2">anyway because everyone standing there</p>
<p begin="04:46:24.320" end="04:46:27.840" style="s2">was going to die inside the rift. The</p>
<p begin="04:46:26.320" end="04:46:29.920" style="s2">moment the leader snapped his watch</p>
<p begin="04:46:27.840" end="04:46:32.320" style="s2">shut, Zeke immediately sensed something</p>
<p begin="04:46:29.920" end="04:46:34.160" style="s2">dangerous and instantly shoved Lea away</p>
<p begin="04:46:32.320" end="04:46:35.920" style="s2">from him. Before she could even process</p>
<p begin="04:46:34.160" end="04:46:38.000" style="s2">what had happened, the enemy leader</p>
<p begin="04:46:35.920" end="04:46:40.080" style="s2">unleashed a surprise attack using a rock</p>
<p begin="04:46:38.000" end="04:46:42.000" style="s2">cannon. A stone engulfed in golden</p>
<p begin="04:46:40.080" end="04:46:44.480" style="s2">energy shot to the air with incredible</p>
<p begin="04:46:42.000" end="04:46:46.560" style="s2">speed and slammed directly onto Zeke as</p>
<p begin="04:46:44.480" end="04:46:48.480" style="s2">he raised his arms to defend himself.</p>
<p begin="04:46:46.560" end="04:46:50.560" style="s2">Leica cried out in shock upon seeing him</p>
<p begin="04:46:48.480" end="04:46:52.320" style="s2">get hit. But before she could even react</p>
<p begin="04:46:50.560" end="04:46:53.760" style="s2">further, one of the men in black</p>
<p begin="04:46:52.320" end="04:46:56.080" style="s2">suddenly rushed toward her with his</p>
<p begin="04:46:53.760" end="04:46:58.080" style="s2">sword raised. Her entire body stiffened</p>
<p begin="04:46:56.080" end="04:47:00.000" style="s2">as she instinctively realized death was</p>
<p begin="04:46:58.080" end="04:47:02.080" style="s2">approaching. Yet before the blade could</p>
<p begin="04:47:00.000" end="04:47:03.680" style="s2">reach her, Vanil suddenly pushed her</p>
<p begin="04:47:02.080" end="04:47:06.080" style="s2">backward and intercepted the strike with</p>
<p begin="04:47:03.680" end="04:47:08.160" style="s2">his wand. The impact was so overwhelming</p>
<p begin="04:47:06.080" end="04:47:10.878" style="s2">that Vanil was forced down onto one knee</p>
<p begin="04:47:08.160" end="04:47:12.718" style="s2">from the sheer force alone. Even so, he</p>
<p begin="04:47:10.878" end="04:47:14.718" style="s2">still managed to tell Lea not to space</p>
<p begin="04:47:12.718" end="04:47:17.040" style="s2">out on him before releasing a burst of</p>
<p begin="04:47:14.718" end="04:47:19.120" style="s2">wind aura that exploded outward and</p>
<p begin="04:47:17.040" end="04:47:20.718" style="s2">blasted the attacker away from him. But</p>
<p begin="04:47:19.120" end="04:47:22.560" style="s2">before Lea and the others could launch</p>
<p begin="04:47:20.718" end="04:47:24.400" style="s2">any kind of counterattack, the members</p>
<p begin="04:47:22.560" end="04:47:26.560" style="s2">of the Kerberous family immediately</p>
<p begin="04:47:24.400" end="04:47:29.040" style="s2">prepared another assault and activated</p>
<p begin="04:47:26.560" end="04:47:30.798" style="s2">rock bullet. Countless stone projectiles</p>
<p begin="04:47:29.040" end="04:47:33.040" style="s2">rain down toward the group from every</p>
<p begin="04:47:30.798" end="04:47:35.120" style="s2">direction. Edgis and Laya swung their</p>
<p begin="04:47:33.040" end="04:47:37.200" style="s2">weapons to intercept the incoming rocks</p>
<p begin="04:47:35.120" end="04:47:38.560" style="s2">while Sandy and Allan desperately dodged</p>
<p begin="04:47:37.200" end="04:47:41.280" style="s2">and defended themselves from the</p>
<p begin="04:47:38.560" end="04:47:42.718" style="s2">barrage. At the same time, Leica drew</p>
<p begin="04:47:41.280" end="04:47:44.560" style="s2">her great sword and stepped in front of</p>
<p begin="04:47:42.718" end="04:47:46.080" style="s2">Veneil before slamming the blade into</p>
<p begin="04:47:44.560" end="04:47:47.840" style="s2">the ground and releasing her lightning</p>
<p begin="04:47:46.080" end="04:47:50.320" style="s2">ability to shield him from the incoming</p>
<p begin="04:47:47.840" end="04:47:52.400" style="s2">attacks as well. However, the moment the</p>
<p begin="04:47:50.320" end="04:47:54.240" style="s2">enemies saw her using lightning aura,</p>
<p begin="04:47:52.400" end="04:47:56.320" style="s2">several members of the Kerberous family</p>
<p begin="04:47:54.240" end="04:47:58.878" style="s2">immediately intercepted her attacks and</p>
<p begin="04:47:56.320" end="04:48:01.040" style="s2">rushed forward for close combat. Venale</p>
<p begin="04:47:58.878" end="04:48:02.718" style="s2">could only grin bitterly in frustration</p>
<p begin="04:48:01.040" end="04:48:05.120" style="s2">as Leica warned everyone that the</p>
<p begin="04:48:02.718" end="04:48:06.560" style="s2">enemies were already closing in. Sandy</p>
<p begin="04:48:05.120" end="04:48:08.000" style="s2">tightly gripped her great sword and</p>
<p begin="04:48:06.560" end="04:48:09.840" style="s2">declared that they would meet the enemy</p>
<p begin="04:48:08.000" end="04:48:11.920" style="s2">head-on. But when Edges failed to</p>
<p begin="04:48:09.840" end="04:48:14.000" style="s2">respond, she quickly realized something</p>
<p begin="04:48:11.920" end="04:48:15.920" style="s2">was wrong. The distance between them had</p>
<p begin="04:48:14.000" end="04:48:18.240" style="s2">already become too wide and their</p>
<p begin="04:48:15.920" end="04:48:20.320" style="s2">positioning had completely fallen apart.</p>
<p begin="04:48:18.240" end="04:48:21.920" style="s2">Alan glanced towards Sandy and informed</p>
<p begin="04:48:20.320" end="04:48:23.680" style="s2">her that the enemy had intentionally</p>
<p begin="04:48:21.920" end="04:48:25.840" style="s2">separated them. Their group had been</p>
<p begin="04:48:23.680" end="04:48:27.760" style="s2">split into three smaller teams, and each</p>
<p begin="04:48:25.840" end="04:48:30.080" style="s2">pair was now facing a four-star member</p>
<p begin="04:48:27.760" end="04:48:32.160" style="s2">of the Kerberous family alone. Sweat</p>
<p begin="04:48:30.080" end="04:48:34.000" style="s2">rolled down Edges&#39;s face as he directly</p>
<p begin="04:48:32.160" end="04:48:35.680" style="s2">questioned the enemy, asking if they</p>
<p begin="04:48:34.000" end="04:48:37.440" style="s2">truly were members of the Kerberous</p>
<p begin="04:48:35.680" end="04:48:39.360" style="s2">family and whether they had come for the</p>
<p begin="04:48:37.440" end="04:48:40.878" style="s2">magic water. Yet, the leader merely</p>
<p begin="04:48:39.360" end="04:48:42.798" style="s2">coldly responded that he had nothing</p>
<p begin="04:48:40.878" end="04:48:45.600" style="s2">more to say to the likes of him, causing</p>
<p begin="04:48:42.798" end="04:48:47.360" style="s2">Edges to fall silent. Meanwhile, Leica</p>
<p begin="04:48:45.600" end="04:48:49.040" style="s2">remained deeply worried about Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:48:47.360" end="04:48:51.120" style="s2">condition, but she quickly forced</p>
<p begin="04:48:49.040" end="04:48:52.718" style="s2">herself to focus, realizing that</p>
<p begin="04:48:51.120" end="04:48:54.798" style="s2">thinking about him now would only get</p>
<p begin="04:48:52.718" end="04:48:56.878" style="s2">her killed, especially against opponents</p>
<p begin="04:48:54.798" end="04:48:58.878" style="s2">of this level. Four-star fighters</p>
<p begin="04:48:56.878" end="04:49:00.958" style="s2">existed in a completely different realm</p>
<p begin="04:48:58.878" end="04:49:03.040" style="s2">from ordinary people. Through effort</p>
<p begin="04:49:00.958" end="04:49:04.798" style="s2">alone, a normal person could at best</p>
<p begin="04:49:03.040" end="04:49:06.718" style="s2">reach the three-star level, while the</p>
<p begin="04:49:04.798" end="04:49:08.958" style="s2">four-star realm was reserved only for</p>
<p begin="04:49:06.718" end="04:49:10.798" style="s2">those born with genuine talent. Between</p>
<p begin="04:49:08.958" end="04:49:12.638" style="s2">three star and four-star existed an</p>
<p begin="04:49:10.798" end="04:49:14.958" style="s2">absolute gap that could not easily be</p>
<p begin="04:49:12.638" end="04:49:16.480" style="s2">crossed. Lea also confirmed to herself</p>
<p begin="04:49:14.958" end="04:49:18.718" style="s2">that there was no mistake about the</p>
<p begin="04:49:16.480" end="04:49:20.320" style="s2">enemy leader being a five-star fighter.</p>
<p begin="04:49:18.718" end="04:49:22.080" style="s2">Even if they somehow managed to defeat</p>
<p begin="04:49:20.320" end="04:49:24.160" style="s2">the enemies in front of them, the moment</p>
<p begin="04:49:22.080" end="04:49:26.320" style="s2">that leader personally moved, everything</p>
<p begin="04:49:24.160" end="04:49:28.400" style="s2">would be over. On top of that, the</p>
<p begin="04:49:26.320" end="04:49:30.080" style="s2">earlier attack had clearly been magic,</p>
<p begin="04:49:28.400" end="04:49:32.400" style="s2">meaning the enemy leader was most likely</p>
<p begin="04:49:30.080" end="04:49:34.638" style="s2">an incredibly powerful mage as well.</p>
<p begin="04:49:32.400" end="04:49:36.560" style="s2">Just then, the leader casually snapped</p>
<p begin="04:49:34.638" end="04:49:38.320" style="s2">his fingers and ordered his subordinates</p>
<p begin="04:49:36.560" end="04:49:40.400" style="s2">to finish the lizards. The men</p>
<p begin="04:49:38.320" end="04:49:41.600" style="s2">immediately obeyed and purple energy</p>
<p begin="04:49:40.400" end="04:49:43.440" style="s2">erupted from the ground as they</p>
<p begin="04:49:41.600" end="04:49:45.440" style="s2">activated a summoning ability. A</p>
<p begin="04:49:43.440" end="04:49:47.440" style="s2">ferocious beast with glowing purple eyes</p>
<p begin="04:49:45.440" end="04:49:50.240" style="s2">emerged from the magic circle resembling</p>
<p begin="04:49:47.440" end="04:49:52.000" style="s2">a monstrous hound. Leica stared in shock</p>
<p begin="04:49:50.240" end="04:49:53.600" style="s2">while even Edges could not believe that</p>
<p begin="04:49:52.000" end="04:49:55.920" style="s2">the enemy was capable of summoning</p>
<p begin="04:49:53.600" end="04:49:58.000" style="s2">monsters. Sandy also stared at the</p>
<p begin="04:49:55.920" end="04:49:59.920" style="s2">creatures in disbelief and questioned</p>
<p begin="04:49:58.000" end="04:50:01.680" style="s2">whether those things were really dogs.</p>
<p begin="04:49:59.920" end="04:50:03.840" style="s2">But Alan immediately corrected her by</p>
<p begin="04:50:01.680" end="04:50:06.320" style="s2">saying they were clearly monsters and</p>
<p begin="04:50:03.840" end="04:50:08.240" style="s2">three star ones at that. Lea gritted her</p>
<p begin="04:50:06.320" end="04:50:10.000" style="s2">teeth as she realized their situation</p>
<p begin="04:50:08.240" end="04:50:12.080" style="s2">was becoming more hopeless with every</p>
<p begin="04:50:10.000" end="04:50:14.160" style="s2">passing second. Yet at that exact</p>
<p begin="04:50:12.080" end="04:50:16.560" style="s2">moment, Zeke suddenly appeared once</p>
<p begin="04:50:14.160" end="04:50:18.560" style="s2">more. Standing firmly, he casually</p>
<p begin="04:50:16.560" end="04:50:20.560" style="s2">lifted an enormous boulder with a single</p>
<p begin="04:50:18.560" end="04:50:22.320" style="s2">hand, immediately drawing the attention</p>
<p begin="04:50:20.560" end="04:50:24.400" style="s2">of the enemy leader. Without any</p>
<p begin="04:50:22.320" end="04:50:26.320" style="s2">warning, Zeke planted his foot into the</p>
<p begin="04:50:24.400" end="04:50:28.240" style="s2">ground, twisted his body slightly to</p>
<p begin="04:50:26.320" end="04:50:30.240" style="s2">gather momentum, and hurled the massive</p>
<p begin="04:50:28.240" end="04:50:32.080" style="s2">boulder directly toward the leader. The</p>
<p begin="04:50:30.240" end="04:50:34.240" style="s2">enemy leader instantly leapt aside to</p>
<p begin="04:50:32.080" end="04:50:35.760" style="s2">dodge and a deafening explosion erupted</p>
<p begin="04:50:34.240" end="04:50:38.160" style="s2">when the boulder collided with the rock</p>
<p begin="04:50:35.760" end="04:50:39.840" style="s2">wall behind him. Narrowing his eyes, the</p>
<p begin="04:50:38.160" end="04:50:41.840" style="s2">leader questioned how Zeke was still</p>
<p begin="04:50:39.840" end="04:50:44.718" style="s2">capable of moving after taking a direct</p>
<p begin="04:50:41.840" end="04:50:46.798" style="s2">hit from his magic. However, Zeke merely</p>
<p begin="04:50:44.718" end="04:50:48.080" style="s2">responded with disappointment, admitting</p>
<p begin="04:50:46.798" end="04:50:49.840" style="s2">that he had actually been looking</p>
<p begin="04:50:48.080" end="04:50:52.160" style="s2">forward to seeing what this so-called</p>
<p begin="04:50:49.840" end="04:50:53.920" style="s2">magic could really do, casually bouncing</p>
<p begin="04:50:52.160" end="04:50:56.000" style="s2">the giant boulder on one hand as though</p>
<p begin="04:50:53.920" end="04:50:57.760" style="s2">it weighed nothing. Zeke mockingly</p>
<p begin="04:50:56.000" end="04:50:59.680" style="s2">questioned whether throwing tiny rocks</p>
<p begin="04:50:57.760" end="04:51:01.520" style="s2">was truly all they were capable of.</p>
<p begin="04:50:59.680" end="04:51:03.440" style="s2">Leica immediately asked if he was all</p>
<p begin="04:51:01.520" end="04:51:05.920" style="s2">right, and Zeke answered with a wide</p>
<p begin="04:51:03.440" end="04:51:07.600" style="s2">grin. As his eyes faintly glowed, he</p>
<p begin="04:51:05.920" end="04:51:09.120" style="s2">lightly tapped the boulder once more</p>
<p begin="04:51:07.600" end="04:51:10.878" style="s2">before twisting his body again and</p>
<p begin="04:51:09.120" end="04:51:12.878" style="s2">hurling it toward the enemy leader with</p>
<p begin="04:51:10.878" end="04:51:14.400" style="s2">even greater force than before. The</p>
<p begin="04:51:12.878" end="04:51:16.160" style="s2">leader clicked his tongue in surprise</p>
<p begin="04:51:14.400" end="04:51:18.320" style="s2">after seeing the massive rock flying</p>
<p begin="04:51:16.160" end="04:51:19.840" style="s2">toward him at terrifying speed, but he</p>
<p begin="04:51:18.320" end="04:51:21.840" style="s2">still managed to evade it at the last</p>
<p begin="04:51:19.840" end="04:51:23.680" style="s2">second by jumping sideways. After</p>
<p begin="04:51:21.840" end="04:51:25.440" style="s2">dodging the attack, he heard Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:51:23.680" end="04:51:27.360" style="s2">casually remark that if the fight was</p>
<p begin="04:51:25.440" end="04:51:29.360" style="s2">only about throwing rocks around, then</p>
<p begin="04:51:27.360" end="04:51:30.798" style="s2">even he could play that game, too. The</p>
<p begin="04:51:29.360" end="04:51:32.718" style="s2">enemy leader narrowed his eyes</p>
<p begin="04:51:30.798" end="04:51:35.120" style="s2">dangerously as he glared at Zeke and</p>
<p begin="04:51:32.718" end="04:51:36.878" style="s2">cursed him as a little bastard. As Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:51:35.120" end="04:51:38.240" style="s2">stretched his shoulders, the leader of</p>
<p begin="04:51:36.878" end="04:51:40.480" style="s2">their enemies admitted that his</p>
<p begin="04:51:38.240" end="04:51:42.080" style="s2">toughness had been unexpected. However,</p>
<p begin="04:51:40.480" end="04:51:43.920" style="s2">after glancing at the pocket watch in</p>
<p begin="04:51:42.080" end="04:51:46.240" style="s2">his hand, he calmly declared that the</p>
<p begin="04:51:43.920" end="04:51:48.718" style="s2">ending, awaiting Zeke, would remain the</p>
<p begin="04:51:46.240" end="04:51:51.200" style="s2">same. Without hesitation, he activated</p>
<p begin="04:51:48.718" end="04:51:53.120" style="s2">his ability and called forth his summon.</p>
<p begin="04:51:51.200" end="04:51:55.200" style="s2">Violent purple aura surged from the</p>
<p begin="04:51:53.120" end="04:51:56.958" style="s2">ground as a monstrous creature emerged.</p>
<p begin="04:51:55.200" end="04:51:59.600" style="s2">Its glowing eyes immediately locking</p>
<p begin="04:51:56.958" end="04:52:01.840" style="s2">onto Zeke. Yet, instead of showing fear,</p>
<p begin="04:51:59.600" end="04:52:03.360" style="s2">Zeke looked genuinely excited. He</p>
<p begin="04:52:01.840" end="04:52:05.280" style="s2">enthusiastically wondered if there</p>
<p begin="04:52:03.360" end="04:52:07.360" style="s2">really was magic capable of summoning</p>
<p begin="04:52:05.280" end="04:52:09.360" style="s2">monsters and remarked that magic was</p>
<p begin="04:52:07.360" end="04:52:11.360" style="s2">truly fascinating. The enemy leader</p>
<p begin="04:52:09.360" end="04:52:13.360" style="s2">could only stare at him in disbelief,</p>
<p begin="04:52:11.360" end="04:52:15.840" style="s2">saying that his attitude made absolutely</p>
<p begin="04:52:13.360" end="04:52:17.600" style="s2">no sense. Together, the enemy and his</p>
<p begin="04:52:15.840" end="04:52:19.760" style="s2">summoned beast revealed their four-star</p>
<p begin="04:52:17.600" end="04:52:21.600" style="s2">and five-star levels. Questioning</p>
<p begin="04:52:19.760" end="04:52:23.440" style="s2">whether Zeke truly failed to understand</p>
<p begin="04:52:21.600" end="04:52:25.360" style="s2">how hopelessly outmatched he and his</p>
<p begin="04:52:23.440" end="04:52:27.360" style="s2">companions were, Zeke remained silent</p>
<p begin="04:52:25.360" end="04:52:29.360" style="s2">for a moment before admitting that, as</p>
<p begin="04:52:27.360" end="04:52:31.360" style="s2">things currently stood, the situation</p>
<p begin="04:52:29.360" end="04:52:33.920" style="s2">was indeed somewhat unfavorable for him</p>
<p begin="04:52:31.360" end="04:52:35.440" style="s2">and his team. Surprisingly, his response</p>
<p begin="04:52:33.920" end="04:52:37.680" style="s2">caused even the enemy leader to</p>
<p begin="04:52:35.440" end="04:52:39.440" style="s2">momentarily fall silent. Then, Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:52:37.680" end="04:52:40.798" style="s2">simply smiled and looked up toward the</p>
<p begin="04:52:39.440" end="04:52:43.360" style="s2">sky as though he was waiting for</p>
<p begin="04:52:40.798" end="04:52:45.440" style="s2">something. At that exact moment, a loud</p>
<p begin="04:52:43.360" end="04:52:47.680" style="s2">chirp echoed across the battlefield and</p>
<p begin="04:52:45.440" end="04:52:49.280" style="s2">shook the entire area. Both the enemies</p>
<p begin="04:52:47.680" end="04:52:51.440" style="s2">and their monsters instinctively turned</p>
<p begin="04:52:49.280" end="04:52:53.360" style="s2">their eyes upward. Leica and Veneil did</p>
<p begin="04:52:51.440" end="04:52:54.958" style="s2">the same, only for their opponents to</p>
<p begin="04:52:53.360" end="04:52:57.040" style="s2">immediately curse at the sight before</p>
<p begin="04:52:54.958" end="04:52:59.520" style="s2">them. Several birds were descending from</p>
<p begin="04:52:57.040" end="04:53:01.360" style="s2">the sky at incredible speed, their eyes</p>
<p begin="04:52:59.520" end="04:53:03.040" style="s2">shining with a golden glow and their</p>
<p begin="04:53:01.360" end="04:53:05.280" style="s2">movements carrying overwhelming</p>
<p begin="04:53:03.040" end="04:53:07.040" style="s2">momentum. In an instant, each of the</p>
<p begin="04:53:05.280" end="04:53:09.280" style="s2">smaller birds landed directly in front</p>
<p begin="04:53:07.040" end="04:53:11.040" style="s2">of Zeke&#39;s group. Lea was so shocked that</p>
<p begin="04:53:09.280" end="04:53:12.798" style="s2">her jaw nearly dropped as she struggled</p>
<p begin="04:53:11.040" end="04:53:14.480" style="s2">to understand what was happening. The</p>
<p begin="04:53:12.798" end="04:53:16.718" style="s2">enemy leader and his summoned monster</p>
<p begin="04:53:14.480" end="04:53:18.718" style="s2">became visibly wary, maintaining their</p>
<p begin="04:53:16.718" end="04:53:20.320" style="s2">guard as they observed the newcomers.</p>
<p begin="04:53:18.718" end="04:53:22.240" style="s2">Then the mother bird stepped forward</p>
<p begin="04:53:20.320" end="04:53:24.320" style="s2">with sharp and intimidating eyes before</p>
<p begin="04:53:22.240" end="04:53:26.160" style="s2">letting out a powerful chirp, causing</p>
<p begin="04:53:24.320" end="04:53:27.840" style="s2">every member of Zeke&#39;s team to wonder if</p>
<p begin="04:53:26.160" end="04:53:30.000" style="s2">these creatures were really birds at</p>
<p begin="04:53:27.840" end="04:53:32.080" style="s2">all. The enemy leader quickly recognized</p>
<p begin="04:53:30.000" end="04:53:34.240" style="s2">them as native creatures of the rift.</p>
<p begin="04:53:32.080" end="04:53:35.840" style="s2">Meanwhile, Zeke casually reached out and</p>
<p begin="04:53:34.240" end="04:53:37.280" style="s2">patted the mother bird&#39;s feathers,</p>
<p begin="04:53:35.840" end="04:53:39.120" style="s2">telling her that she had returned at</p>
<p begin="04:53:37.280" end="04:53:40.638" style="s2">exactly the right moment. He asked</p>
<p begin="04:53:39.120" end="04:53:42.400" style="s2">whether she and her flock had eaten</p>
<p begin="04:53:40.638" end="04:53:44.320" style="s2">their fill during the hunt, as though</p>
<p begin="04:53:42.400" end="04:53:45.920" style="s2">understanding every word. The mother</p>
<p begin="04:53:44.320" end="04:53:48.320" style="s2">bird happily chirped in confirmation</p>
<p begin="04:53:45.920" end="04:53:49.520" style="s2">that they had indeed eaten plenty. Edges</p>
<p begin="04:53:48.320" end="04:53:51.440" style="s2">could hardly believe what he was</p>
<p begin="04:53:49.520" end="04:53:53.680" style="s2">witnessing and immediately demanded to</p>
<p begin="04:53:51.440" end="04:53:56.320" style="s2">know what was going on with these birds.</p>
<p begin="04:53:53.680" end="04:53:58.000" style="s2">For a moment, Zeke did not answer. Then</p>
<p begin="04:53:56.320" end="04:54:00.320" style="s2">he casually explained that the birds</p>
<p begin="04:53:58.000" end="04:54:02.160" style="s2">were actually his disciples. The smaller</p>
<p begin="04:54:00.320" end="04:54:04.400" style="s2">birds immediately responded with fierce</p>
<p begin="04:54:02.160" end="04:54:06.080" style="s2">chirps of agreement. Sandy and Allan</p>
<p begin="04:54:04.400" end="04:54:08.480" style="s2">could only stare in disbelief after</p>
<p begin="04:54:06.080" end="04:54:09.840" style="s2">hearing such an absurd claim. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="04:54:08.480" end="04:54:11.440" style="s2">explained that while everyone else had</p>
<p begin="04:54:09.840" end="04:54:13.360" style="s2">been away, he had spent some time</p>
<p begin="04:54:11.440" end="04:54:15.440" style="s2">looking after the birds. During that</p>
<p begin="04:54:13.360" end="04:54:17.840" style="s2">period, he trained them by making them</p>
<p begin="04:54:15.440" end="04:54:19.840" style="s2">run while carrying massive boulders on</p>
<p begin="04:54:17.840" end="04:54:21.440" style="s2">their backs. He had also beaten them</p>
<p begin="04:54:19.840" end="04:54:22.798" style="s2">everyday as part of their training</p>
<p begin="04:54:21.440" end="04:54:25.440" style="s2">because they needed to learn how to</p>
<p begin="04:54:22.798" end="04:54:26.958" style="s2">withstand attacks. Aside from that, he</p>
<p begin="04:54:25.440" end="04:54:29.120" style="s2">taught them to eat whenever food was</p>
<p begin="04:54:26.958" end="04:54:31.200" style="s2">available. Since eating was also part of</p>
<p begin="04:54:29.120" end="04:54:33.600" style="s2">becoming stronger compared to when they</p>
<p begin="04:54:31.200" end="04:54:35.760" style="s2">had first met, the birds had become far</p>
<p begin="04:54:33.600" end="04:54:37.680" style="s2">more robust and powerful. The mother</p>
<p begin="04:54:35.760" end="04:54:39.200" style="s2">bird proudly released her golden aura</p>
<p begin="04:54:37.680" end="04:54:41.120" style="s2">and chirped in agreement with every</p>
<p begin="04:54:39.200" end="04:54:43.040" style="s2">word. Leica could not help asking</p>
<p begin="04:54:41.120" end="04:54:44.958" style="s2">whether Zeke had truly taken care of the</p>
<p begin="04:54:43.040" end="04:54:47.200" style="s2">birds and whether they really were his</p>
<p begin="04:54:44.958" end="04:54:49.520" style="s2">disciples just like her and the others.</p>
<p begin="04:54:47.200" end="04:54:50.878" style="s2">Sandy, meanwhile, wondered what exactly</p>
<p begin="04:54:49.520" end="04:54:53.120" style="s2">Zeke had been doing while they were</p>
<p begin="04:54:50.878" end="04:54:54.718" style="s2">gone. Zeke ignored the questions and</p>
<p begin="04:54:53.120" end="04:54:56.878" style="s2">instead turned his attention toward the</p>
<p begin="04:54:54.718" end="04:54:58.638" style="s2">mother bird. He apologized for suddenly</p>
<p begin="04:54:56.878" end="04:54:59.920" style="s2">asking for their help and wondered if</p>
<p begin="04:54:58.638" end="04:55:02.240" style="s2">they would be willing to do a little</p>
<p begin="04:54:59.920" end="04:55:04.480" style="s2">postmeal exercise. All they needed to</p>
<p begin="04:55:02.240" end="04:55:06.320" style="s2">do, according to him, was deal with the</p>
<p begin="04:55:04.480" end="04:55:08.400" style="s2">muts on his behalf. The birds</p>
<p begin="04:55:06.320" end="04:55:10.320" style="s2">immediately chirped in agreement as they</p>
<p begin="04:55:08.400" end="04:55:12.798" style="s2">fixed their menacing gazes on the enemy</p>
<p begin="04:55:10.320" end="04:55:14.560" style="s2">beasts. However, the leader of the mutz</p>
<p begin="04:55:12.798" end="04:55:16.560" style="s2">suddenly let out a loud howl and ordered</p>
<p begin="04:55:14.560" end="04:55:18.798" style="s2">its pack to attack. The mother bird</p>
<p begin="04:55:16.560" end="04:55:20.718" style="s2">refused to be outdone. With a powerful</p>
<p begin="04:55:18.798" end="04:55:22.798" style="s2">chirp of her own, she led the flock</p>
<p begin="04:55:20.718" end="04:55:24.878" style="s2">forward and the birds dashed ahead to</p>
<p begin="04:55:22.798" end="04:55:26.400" style="s2">intercept the charging enemies. As Zeke</p>
<p begin="04:55:24.878" end="04:55:28.480" style="s2">happily watched the battle between the</p>
<p begin="04:55:26.400" end="04:55:30.320" style="s2">birds and the monsters unfold, the enemy</p>
<p begin="04:55:28.480" end="04:55:32.320" style="s2">leader kept his eyes firmly fixed on</p>
<p begin="04:55:30.320" end="04:55:34.878" style="s2">him. While the fierce clash continued</p>
<p begin="04:55:32.320" end="04:55:36.958" style="s2">behind him, Zeke calmly stated that</p>
<p begin="04:55:34.878" end="04:55:39.200" style="s2">thanks to the current situation and the</p>
<p begin="04:55:36.958" end="04:55:40.638" style="s2">assistance of his bird disciples, they</p>
<p begin="04:55:39.200" end="04:55:42.560" style="s2">finally had enough strength to take</p>
<p begin="04:55:40.638" end="04:55:44.560" style="s2">their enemies headon. He then asked</p>
<p begin="04:55:42.560" end="04:55:46.160" style="s2">whether the enemy leader agreed. The</p>
<p begin="04:55:44.560" end="04:55:48.240" style="s2">answer came in the form of a drawn</p>
<p begin="04:55:46.160" end="04:55:49.920" style="s2">sword. The enemy leader slowly advanced</p>
<p begin="04:55:48.240" end="04:55:51.600" style="s2">towards Zeke and questioned what</p>
<p begin="04:55:49.920" end="04:55:53.840" style="s2">difference a few birds could possibly</p>
<p begin="04:55:51.600" end="04:55:55.840" style="s2">make. Calling him a lizard, he warned</p>
<p begin="04:55:53.840" end="04:55:57.680" style="s2">Zeke not to become overconfident before</p>
<p begin="04:55:55.840" end="04:56:00.000" style="s2">suddenly launching forward and thrusting</p>
<p begin="04:55:57.680" end="04:56:01.840" style="s2">his sword straight at him. Fortunately,</p>
<p begin="04:56:00.000" end="04:56:03.920" style="s2">Zeke managed to evade the attack just</p>
<p begin="04:56:01.840" end="04:56:05.600" style="s2">before it connected. Leica immediately</p>
<p begin="04:56:03.920" end="04:56:08.160" style="s2">became alarmed after witnessing a</p>
<p begin="04:56:05.600" end="04:56:10.480" style="s2">five-star opponent attack Zeke directly.</p>
<p begin="04:56:08.160" end="04:56:12.160" style="s2">Seeing her reaction, Vanil called her an</p>
<p begin="04:56:10.480" end="04:56:13.600" style="s2">idiot and reminded her that she should</p>
<p begin="04:56:12.160" end="04:56:15.840" style="s2">be paying attention to the enemy</p>
<p begin="04:56:13.600" end="04:56:18.080" style="s2">standing in front of them instead. Leica</p>
<p begin="04:56:15.840" end="04:56:19.680" style="s2">attempted to argue, but Venil firmly</p>
<p begin="04:56:18.080" end="04:56:21.760" style="s2">pointed out that they would never defeat</p>
<p begin="04:56:19.680" end="04:56:23.920" style="s2">their opponents if she spent the entire</p>
<p begin="04:56:21.760" end="04:56:25.600" style="s2">battle worrying about Zeke. She should</p>
<p begin="04:56:23.920" end="04:56:27.760" style="s2">be concerned about her own survival</p>
<p begin="04:56:25.600" end="04:56:30.400" style="s2">first. Realizing that he was right,</p>
<p begin="04:56:27.760" end="04:56:32.480" style="s2">Leica immediately apologized, refocusing</p>
<p begin="04:56:30.400" end="04:56:34.000" style="s2">her attention on the enemy before her.</p>
<p begin="04:56:32.480" end="04:56:35.760" style="s2">She declared that the first thing they</p>
<p begin="04:56:34.000" end="04:56:37.760" style="s2">needed to do was defeat the opponent</p>
<p begin="04:56:35.760" end="04:56:39.600" style="s2">blocking their path. Their enemy could</p>
<p begin="04:56:37.760" end="04:56:41.520" style="s2">not understand their confidence and</p>
<p begin="04:56:39.600" end="04:56:43.200" style="s2">questioned what was wrong with them. He</p>
<p begin="04:56:41.520" end="04:56:45.680" style="s2">pointed out that if they wasted any more</p>
<p begin="04:56:43.200" end="04:56:47.600" style="s2">time, their friend would die. However,</p>
<p begin="04:56:45.680" end="04:56:49.760" style="s2">Leica confidently stated that she would</p>
<p begin="04:56:47.600" end="04:56:51.840" style="s2">help Zeke after defeating him first.</p>
<p begin="04:56:49.760" end="04:56:53.920" style="s2">Slightly irritated, the enemy dismissed</p>
<p begin="04:56:51.840" end="04:56:56.080" style="s2">her words as childish fantasies.</p>
<p begin="04:56:53.920" end="04:56:57.920" style="s2">Dragging his sword across the ground, he</p>
<p begin="04:56:56.080" end="04:56:59.600" style="s2">unleashed the Earthhound swordstyle</p>
<p begin="04:56:57.920" end="04:57:01.680" style="s2">technique known as landslide and</p>
<p begin="04:56:59.600" end="04:57:03.280" style="s2">launched a powerful attack. Leica</p>
<p begin="04:57:01.680" end="04:57:05.040" style="s2">quickly raised her great sword and</p>
<p begin="04:57:03.280" end="04:57:06.958" style="s2">successfully defended herself against</p>
<p begin="04:57:05.040" end="04:57:09.200" style="s2">the incoming strike. Watching the</p>
<p begin="04:57:06.958" end="04:57:10.878" style="s2">exchange, Veneil gritted his teeth</p>
<p begin="04:57:09.200" end="04:57:13.040" style="s2">before immediately channeling his wind</p>
<p begin="04:57:10.878" end="04:57:15.360" style="s2">aura and launching pierce gale from the</p>
<p begin="04:57:13.040" end="04:57:17.840" style="s2">enemy&#39;s flank. As Veneil&#39;s attack struck</p>
<p begin="04:57:15.360" end="04:57:19.360" style="s2">its target, Leica spotted an opening and</p>
<p begin="04:57:17.840" end="04:57:21.840" style="s2">instantly followed up with her great</p>
<p begin="04:57:19.360" end="04:57:24.000" style="s2">sword art, lightning flash. A burst of</p>
<p begin="04:57:21.840" end="04:57:25.680" style="s2">golden lightning shot forward, slamming</p>
<p begin="04:57:24.000" end="04:57:28.000" style="s2">into their opponent and forcing him</p>
<p begin="04:57:25.680" end="04:57:29.760" style="s2">backward. However, the enemy reacted</p>
<p begin="04:57:28.000" end="04:57:31.760" style="s2">quickly and stabbed his sword into the</p>
<p begin="04:57:29.760" end="04:57:33.440" style="s2">ground to halt his momentum. Through the</p>
<p begin="04:57:31.760" end="04:57:35.600" style="s2">coordinated long-range attacks from</p>
<p begin="04:57:33.440" end="04:57:37.600" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s wind techniques and Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="04:57:35.600" end="04:57:39.600" style="s2">close-range lightning assaults, he</p>
<p begin="04:57:37.600" end="04:57:41.360" style="s2">became certain of one thing. The two</p>
<p begin="04:57:39.600" end="04:57:43.440" style="s2">standing before him were undoubtedly the</p>
<p begin="04:57:41.360" end="04:57:45.440" style="s2">children of the Eldreon family head. On</p>
<p begin="04:57:43.440" end="04:57:47.600" style="s2">the other hand, Leica and Venil were</p>
<p begin="04:57:45.440" end="04:57:49.760" style="s2">both annoyed. Even after receiving their</p>
<p begin="04:57:47.600" end="04:57:52.000" style="s2">combined attacks, the enemy had suffered</p>
<p begin="04:57:49.760" end="04:57:53.520" style="s2">little more than superficial scratches.</p>
<p begin="04:57:52.000" end="04:57:56.560" style="s2">The difference in strength was almost</p>
<p begin="04:57:53.520" end="04:57:58.958" style="s2">unbelievable. Then, unexpectedly, Lea</p>
<p begin="04:57:56.560" end="04:58:00.480" style="s2">turned toward Venil and smiled. She</p>
<p begin="04:57:58.958" end="04:58:02.320" style="s2">confidently declared that as long as</p>
<p begin="04:58:00.480" end="04:58:04.160" style="s2">Vanil was fighting beside her, they</p>
<p begin="04:58:02.320" end="04:58:06.080" style="s2">could defeat their opponent. The sudden</p>
<p begin="04:58:04.160" end="04:58:08.240" style="s2">statement left Vanil stunned for a brief</p>
<p begin="04:58:06.080" end="04:58:10.400" style="s2">moment, causing him to immediately avert</p>
<p begin="04:58:08.240" end="04:58:12.000" style="s2">his gaze and focus back on their enemy.</p>
<p begin="04:58:10.400" end="04:58:13.280" style="s2">While Leica remained completely</p>
<p begin="04:58:12.000" end="04:58:15.360" style="s2">confident that they would eventually</p>
<p begin="04:58:13.280" end="04:58:17.040" style="s2">bring down their opponent, the enemy was</p>
<p begin="04:58:15.360" end="04:58:18.878" style="s2">equally confident that he would kill the</p>
<p begin="04:58:17.040" end="04:58:21.280" style="s2">children of the Lragon family head</p>
<p begin="04:58:18.878" end="04:58:23.440" style="s2">before the battle was over. Meanwhile,</p>
<p begin="04:58:21.280" end="04:58:25.280" style="s2">Edgis engulfed his sword in golden aura</p>
<p begin="04:58:23.440" end="04:58:27.360" style="s2">and charged at their enemy. But the</p>
<p begin="04:58:25.280" end="04:58:29.440" style="s2">attack was easily avoided as the man</p>
<p begin="04:58:27.360" end="04:58:31.040" style="s2">jumped backward. After creating enough</p>
<p begin="04:58:29.440" end="04:58:33.040" style="s2">distance, the enemy immediately</p>
<p begin="04:58:31.040" end="04:58:35.040" style="s2">activated his rock bullet ability and</p>
<p begin="04:58:33.040" end="04:58:37.040" style="s2">launched an attack. Anticipating the</p>
<p begin="04:58:35.040" end="04:58:39.280" style="s2">strike, Edges tightened his grip on his</p>
<p begin="04:58:37.040" end="04:58:41.600" style="s2">sword and prepared to defend himself. At</p>
<p begin="04:58:39.280" end="04:58:43.840" style="s2">that moment, Laya&#39;s wand began glowing</p>
<p begin="04:58:41.600" end="04:58:46.240" style="s2">with purple energy as she activated a</p>
<p begin="04:58:43.840" end="04:58:48.160" style="s2">technique known as heavenly chime arts.</p>
<p begin="04:58:46.240" end="04:58:50.000" style="s2">Powerful shock waves surged toward their</p>
<p begin="04:58:48.160" end="04:58:52.320" style="s2">enemy. But before the attack could reach</p>
<p begin="04:58:50.000" end="04:58:53.840" style="s2">its target, the enemy quickly raised a</p>
<p begin="04:58:52.320" end="04:58:55.840" style="s2">massive rock wall and blocked the</p>
<p begin="04:58:53.840" end="04:58:57.840" style="s2">incoming assault. Without wasting a</p>
<p begin="04:58:55.840" end="04:59:00.000" style="s2">second, the enemy climbed onto the wall</p>
<p begin="04:58:57.840" end="04:59:02.000" style="s2">and leaped from the top. As he descended</p>
<p begin="04:59:00.000" end="04:59:04.160" style="s2">toward Laya, he engulfed his sword with</p>
<p begin="04:59:02.000" end="04:59:05.680" style="s2">the power of his earthhound sword style</p>
<p begin="04:59:04.160" end="04:59:08.320" style="s2">and unleashed a technique called</p>
<p begin="04:59:05.680" end="04:59:10.480" style="s2">landslide slash. However, before the</p>
<p begin="04:59:08.320" end="04:59:12.718" style="s2">attack could reach Laya, Edges rushed to</p>
<p begin="04:59:10.480" end="04:59:15.040" style="s2">the enemy&#39;s side. His sword glowed with</p>
<p begin="04:59:12.718" end="04:59:17.440" style="s2">golden aura once again as he released a</p>
<p begin="04:59:15.040" end="04:59:19.600" style="s2">lightblade attack. Unexpectedly, the</p>
<p begin="04:59:17.440" end="04:59:21.520" style="s2">strike connected, successfully wounding</p>
<p begin="04:59:19.600" end="04:59:23.840" style="s2">their four-star opponent. The enemy</p>
<p begin="04:59:21.520" end="04:59:25.840" style="s2">gritted his teeth in pain and shouted in</p>
<p begin="04:59:23.840" end="04:59:27.920" style="s2">frustration that a low-level brat like</p>
<p begin="04:59:25.840" end="04:59:30.000" style="s2">Edges had actually managed to land a</p>
<p begin="04:59:27.920" end="04:59:31.600" style="s2">hit. He immediately retaliated with</p>
<p begin="04:59:30.000" end="04:59:33.360" style="s2">another rock bullet attack before</p>
<p begin="04:59:31.600" end="04:59:35.760" style="s2">jumping backward to widen the distance</p>
<p begin="04:59:33.360" end="04:59:37.280" style="s2">once more. At the same time, Leela</p>
<p begin="04:59:35.760" end="04:59:38.958" style="s2">rushed forward and attempted to follow</p>
<p begin="04:59:37.280" end="04:59:41.120" style="s2">up with her wave echo staff arts</p>
<p begin="04:59:38.958" end="04:59:43.120" style="s2">technique, rolling wave. Unfortunately,</p>
<p begin="04:59:41.120" end="04:59:44.798" style="s2">their opponent&#39;s senses were sharp. He</p>
<p begin="04:59:43.120" end="04:59:46.718" style="s2">immediately noticed her approach and</p>
<p begin="04:59:44.798" end="04:59:48.400" style="s2">before she could unleash her skill, the</p>
<p begin="04:59:46.718" end="04:59:50.400" style="s2">ground beneath her suddenly trembled.</p>
<p begin="04:59:48.400" end="04:59:52.480" style="s2">Laya&#39;s eyes widened in shock as she</p>
<p begin="04:59:50.400" end="04:59:54.560" style="s2">found herself unable to move. The enemy</p>
<p begin="04:59:52.480" end="04:59:56.240" style="s2">had activated Earthbind, completely</p>
<p begin="04:59:54.560" end="04:59:58.320" style="s2">restricting her movement. Without</p>
<p begin="04:59:56.240" end="05:00:00.400" style="s2">hesitation, he followed up by launching</p>
<p begin="04:59:58.320" end="05:00:02.000" style="s2">a barrage of rock bullets toward her.</p>
<p begin="05:00:00.400" end="05:00:03.840" style="s2">Laya managed to block the incoming</p>
<p begin="05:00:02.000" end="05:00:05.680" style="s2">stones with her staff, but the force</p>
<p begin="05:00:03.840" end="05:00:07.360" style="s2">behind the attacks pushed her backward.</p>
<p begin="05:00:05.680" end="05:00:09.120" style="s2">Edges called out Laya&#39;s name and</p>
<p begin="05:00:07.360" end="05:00:10.958" style="s2">concern, but the enemy showed no</p>
<p begin="05:00:09.120" end="05:00:13.440" style="s2">intention of stopping. He immediately</p>
<p begin="05:00:10.958" end="05:00:15.600" style="s2">activated landslide slash once again and</p>
<p begin="05:00:13.440" end="05:00:17.680" style="s2">charged toward Edgis. Although Edges</p>
<p begin="05:00:15.600" end="05:00:19.760" style="s2">reacted slightly late, he still managed</p>
<p begin="05:00:17.680" end="05:00:21.520" style="s2">to block the attack with his sword. Deep</p>
<p begin="05:00:19.760" end="05:00:23.520" style="s2">down, however, he knew that if the</p>
<p begin="05:00:21.520" end="05:00:25.600" style="s2">battle continued this way, his weapon</p>
<p begin="05:00:23.520" end="05:00:27.280" style="s2">would not last much longer. Visible</p>
<p begin="05:00:25.600" end="05:00:29.200" style="s2">cracks and damage had already begun</p>
<p begin="05:00:27.280" end="05:00:30.798" style="s2">spreading across the blade. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:00:29.200" end="05:00:32.958" style="s2">could hardly believe that Edges had</p>
<p begin="05:00:30.798" end="05:00:34.480" style="s2">managed to withstand another strike. He</p>
<p begin="05:00:32.958" end="05:00:36.798" style="s2">immediately followed up by summoning</p>
<p begin="05:00:34.480" end="05:00:38.400" style="s2">rock needles, causing stone spikes to</p>
<p begin="05:00:36.798" end="05:00:40.638" style="s2">erupt toward Edges from multiple</p>
<p begin="05:00:38.400" end="05:00:42.560" style="s2">directions. The moment Edges noticed the</p>
<p begin="05:00:40.638" end="05:00:44.400" style="s2">surprise attack, he kicked the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:00:42.560" end="05:00:46.000" style="s2">directly in the stomach and used the</p>
<p begin="05:00:44.400" end="05:00:47.840" style="s2">momentum to create distance between</p>
<p begin="05:00:46.000" end="05:00:49.840" style="s2">them, narrowly avoiding the stone</p>
<p begin="05:00:47.840" end="05:00:51.600" style="s2">spikes. As he glanced at his damaged</p>
<p begin="05:00:49.840" end="05:00:53.440" style="s2">sword, Edges muttered that he had</p>
<p begin="05:00:51.600" end="05:00:55.920" style="s2">already expected a four-star opponent to</p>
<p begin="05:00:53.440" end="05:00:57.680" style="s2">be this powerful. Laya quickly agreed.</p>
<p begin="05:00:55.920" end="05:01:00.160" style="s2">Edges then focused his gaze on their</p>
<p begin="05:00:57.680" end="05:01:01.840" style="s2">enemy and began analyzing his attacks.</p>
<p begin="05:01:00.160" end="05:01:04.000" style="s2">He wondered what kind of sword technique</p>
<p begin="05:01:01.840" end="05:01:06.080" style="s2">the man was using. The slashes were</p>
<p begin="05:01:04.000" end="05:01:08.240" style="s2">difficult to read, almost like Veneil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:01:06.080" end="05:01:09.840" style="s2">wind attacks. Yet, they also carried the</p>
<p begin="05:01:08.240" end="05:01:12.560" style="s2">overwhelming weight and impact of</p>
<p begin="05:01:09.840" end="05:01:14.240" style="s2">Leica&#39;s strikes. Even so, Edges could</p>
<p begin="05:01:12.560" end="05:01:16.400" style="s2">not sense any unique power within the</p>
<p begin="05:01:14.240" end="05:01:18.320" style="s2">enemy&#39;s aura. He began to suspect that</p>
<p begin="05:01:16.400" end="05:01:20.480" style="s2">the man was reinforcing his sword with</p>
<p begin="05:01:18.320" end="05:01:22.000" style="s2">magic. And if that was true, then his</p>
<p begin="05:01:20.480" end="05:01:24.320" style="s2">abilities were even more troublesome</p>
<p begin="05:01:22.000" end="05:01:26.320" style="s2">than they already appeared. Immediately,</p>
<p begin="05:01:24.320" end="05:01:28.240" style="s2">Edges began constructing formulas and</p>
<p begin="05:01:26.320" end="05:01:30.160" style="s2">possibilities in his mind, searching for</p>
<p begin="05:01:28.240" end="05:01:32.240" style="s2">a way to overcome their opponent. Just</p>
<p begin="05:01:30.160" end="05:01:34.080" style="s2">then, Laya called out to him and asked</p>
<p begin="05:01:32.240" end="05:01:36.240" style="s2">whether he was all right. Edgis assured</p>
<p begin="05:01:34.080" end="05:01:37.920" style="s2">her that he was fine for now. Laya then</p>
<p begin="05:01:36.240" end="05:01:40.320" style="s2">warned him that their enemy&#39;s sword was</p>
<p begin="05:01:37.920" end="05:01:41.840" style="s2">dangerous. Edgis immediately agreed,</p>
<p begin="05:01:40.320" end="05:01:43.600" style="s2">admitting that he did not know how much</p>
<p begin="05:01:41.840" end="05:01:45.840" style="s2">longer his weapon could withstand those</p>
<p begin="05:01:43.600" end="05:01:47.840" style="s2">attacks. Then, with a serious</p>
<p begin="05:01:45.840" end="05:01:49.760" style="s2">expression, Laya pointed out something</p>
<p begin="05:01:47.840" end="05:01:52.000" style="s2">she had noticed. Whenever the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:01:49.760" end="05:01:54.160" style="s2">activated his magic, the sword seemed to</p>
<p begin="05:01:52.000" end="05:01:56.160" style="s2">return to being an ordinary weapon.</p>
<p begin="05:01:54.160" end="05:01:58.320" style="s2">However, if things continued at this</p>
<p begin="05:01:56.160" end="05:02:00.560" style="s2">pace, Edges&#39;s sword would likely break</p>
<p begin="05:01:58.320" end="05:02:02.638" style="s2">first. As Laya continued observing their</p>
<p begin="05:02:00.560" end="05:02:05.200" style="s2">enemy, a sudden realization struck</p>
<p begin="05:02:02.638" end="05:02:06.560" style="s2">Edges. Immediately, he told her that he</p>
<p begin="05:02:05.200" end="05:02:08.240" style="s2">finally knew how to deal with their</p>
<p begin="05:02:06.560" end="05:02:09.600" style="s2">opponent. The enemy smirked and</p>
<p begin="05:02:08.240" end="05:02:11.440" style="s2">mockingly asked whether they had</p>
<p begin="05:02:09.600" end="05:02:13.600" style="s2">finished their little strategy session.</p>
<p begin="05:02:11.440" end="05:02:15.600" style="s2">In response, Edges simply returned the</p>
<p begin="05:02:13.600" end="05:02:17.280" style="s2">smile with complete confidence. That</p>
<p begin="05:02:15.600" end="05:02:19.280" style="s2">reaction irritated the enemy, who</p>
<p begin="05:02:17.280" end="05:02:21.680" style="s2">demanded to know what was so amusing.</p>
<p begin="05:02:19.280" end="05:02:22.958" style="s2">Still smiling, Edges calmly replied that</p>
<p begin="05:02:21.680" end="05:02:24.878" style="s2">he had just realized something</p>
<p begin="05:02:22.958" end="05:02:27.040" style="s2">important. Their battle was actually</p>
<p begin="05:02:24.878" end="05:02:28.638" style="s2">doable and they could win. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:02:27.040" end="05:02:30.480" style="s2">immediately stepped forward and declared</p>
<p begin="05:02:28.638" end="05:02:32.638" style="s2">that Edges talked far too confidently</p>
<p begin="05:02:30.480" end="05:02:34.320" style="s2">for a mere three-star fighter. As he</p>
<p begin="05:02:32.638" end="05:02:36.798" style="s2">launched another attack, he ordered</p>
<p begin="05:02:34.320" end="05:02:38.798" style="s2">Edges to disappear already. Edges firmly</p>
<p begin="05:02:36.798" end="05:02:40.958" style="s2">raised his sword and blocked. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:02:38.798" end="05:02:42.718" style="s2">poured all of his magic into the strike.</p>
<p begin="05:02:40.958" end="05:02:44.638" style="s2">Further strengthening the attack as he</p>
<p begin="05:02:42.718" end="05:02:46.638" style="s2">mocked Edges for getting cocky and</p>
<p begin="05:02:44.638" end="05:02:48.798" style="s2">called him three star trash. The</p>
<p begin="05:02:46.638" end="05:02:50.560" style="s2">pressure forced EDI onto one knee. He</p>
<p begin="05:02:48.798" end="05:02:52.718" style="s2">gritted his teeth and poured every ounce</p>
<p begin="05:02:50.560" end="05:02:54.878" style="s2">of strength into defending himself. At</p>
<p begin="05:02:52.718" end="05:02:56.718" style="s2">that very moment, Laya leaped toward the</p>
<p begin="05:02:54.878" end="05:02:59.040" style="s2">enemy in an attempt to launch a surprise</p>
<p begin="05:02:56.718" end="05:03:00.878" style="s2">attack. However, the enemy noticed her</p>
<p begin="05:02:59.040" end="05:03:02.480" style="s2">immediately. He reminded her that he</p>
<p begin="05:03:00.878" end="05:03:05.040" style="s2">could see every one of her movements and</p>
<p begin="05:03:02.480" end="05:03:06.320" style="s2">attacks. Then, as the magical energy</p>
<p begin="05:03:05.040" end="05:03:08.320" style="s2">surrounding the enemy&#39;s sword</p>
<p begin="05:03:06.320" end="05:03:10.560" style="s2">disappeared, Edges&#39;s eyes suddenly</p>
<p begin="05:03:08.320" end="05:03:12.400" style="s2">gleamed. The final piece of his plan had</p>
<p begin="05:03:10.560" end="05:03:14.638" style="s2">finally fallen into place. With a</p>
<p begin="05:03:12.400" end="05:03:16.560" style="s2">mocking smile, Edges informed the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:03:14.638" end="05:03:18.400" style="s2">that he could see his movements as well.</p>
<p begin="05:03:16.560" end="05:03:20.400" style="s2">Instantly, he unleashed his full</p>
<p begin="05:03:18.400" end="05:03:22.560" style="s2">strength. The moment the enemy&#39;s sword</p>
<p begin="05:03:20.400" end="05:03:24.320" style="s2">was knocked away, Edges activated the</p>
<p begin="05:03:22.560" end="05:03:26.798" style="s2">secret technique of the thousand blade</p>
<p begin="05:03:24.320" end="05:03:28.320" style="s2">style. Golden aura exploded around his</p>
<p begin="05:03:26.798" end="05:03:30.480" style="s2">sword as he gathered every bit of</p>
<p begin="05:03:28.320" end="05:03:32.320" style="s2">determination he possessed and unleashed</p>
<p begin="05:03:30.480" end="05:03:34.560" style="s2">the fiveedge ultimate blade directly</p>
<p begin="05:03:32.320" end="05:03:36.798" style="s2">toward the enemy&#39;s chest. The impact</p>
<p begin="05:03:34.560" end="05:03:38.638" style="s2">sent the enemy flying as blood poured</p>
<p begin="05:03:36.798" end="05:03:40.480" style="s2">from his mouth. The enemy could hardly</p>
<p begin="05:03:38.638" end="05:03:42.240" style="s2">believe what had happened. A four-star</p>
<p begin="05:03:40.480" end="05:03:44.718" style="s2">fighter had actually been defeated by a</p>
<p begin="05:03:42.240" end="05:03:46.878" style="s2">three-star. Moments later, Edges dropped</p>
<p begin="05:03:44.718" end="05:03:48.320" style="s2">to one knee from exhaustion. Laya</p>
<p begin="05:03:46.878" end="05:03:50.320" style="s2">immediately rushed toward him and asked</p>
<p begin="05:03:48.320" end="05:03:52.160" style="s2">whether he was all right. With a tired</p>
<p begin="05:03:50.320" end="05:03:54.080" style="s2">smile, Edges assured her that he was</p>
<p begin="05:03:52.160" end="05:03:55.680" style="s2">somehow still standing and admitted that</p>
<p begin="05:03:54.080" end="05:03:57.840" style="s2">he was simply relieved they had managed</p>
<p begin="05:03:55.680" end="05:03:59.600" style="s2">to find an opening. Laya questioned what</p>
<p begin="05:03:57.840" end="05:04:01.040" style="s2">he meant by an opening. Edges</p>
<p begin="05:03:59.600" end="05:04:02.878" style="s2">immediately explained that she was</p>
<p begin="05:04:01.040" end="05:04:05.040" style="s2">actually the one who had discovered it.</p>
<p begin="05:04:02.878" end="05:04:06.480" style="s2">Still confused, Laya asked if she had</p>
<p begin="05:04:05.040" end="05:04:08.400" style="s2">truly pointed out something that</p>
<p begin="05:04:06.480" end="05:04:09.920" style="s2">important. Edgis then explained that</p>
<p begin="05:04:08.400" end="05:04:11.840" style="s2">when she noticed the enemy&#39;s sword</p>
<p begin="05:04:09.920" end="05:04:14.000" style="s2">returning to normal, whenever he used</p>
<p begin="05:04:11.840" end="05:04:16.000" style="s2">magic, she had unknowingly revealed his</p>
<p begin="05:04:14.000" end="05:04:18.160" style="s2">weakness. If the enemy could not use</p>
<p begin="05:04:16.000" end="05:04:19.680" style="s2">magic and sword arts simultaneously,</p>
<p begin="05:04:18.160" end="05:04:21.520" style="s2">then there had to be a brief gap</p>
<p begin="05:04:19.680" end="05:04:23.280" style="s2">whenever he switched between the two.</p>
<p begin="05:04:21.520" end="05:04:25.840" style="s2">All Edges had done was wait for that</p>
<p begin="05:04:23.280" end="05:04:28.160" style="s2">exact moment and strike. Understanding</p>
<p begin="05:04:25.840" end="05:04:30.000" style="s2">finally dawned on Laya, and she happily</p>
<p begin="05:04:28.160" end="05:04:31.920" style="s2">clapped her hands. She remarked that</p>
<p begin="05:04:30.000" end="05:04:34.160" style="s2">such a strategy was exactly what she</p>
<p begin="05:04:31.920" end="05:04:36.240" style="s2">expected from a genius like Edgis.</p>
<p begin="05:04:34.160" end="05:04:38.240" style="s2">However, Edgis immediately denied the</p>
<p begin="05:04:36.240" end="05:04:39.920" style="s2">compliment. He insisted that the victory</p>
<p begin="05:04:38.240" end="05:04:42.080" style="s2">was possible only because of her</p>
<p begin="05:04:39.920" end="05:04:44.400" style="s2">observation and sincerely thanked her</p>
<p begin="05:04:42.080" end="05:04:46.160" style="s2">for the help. Afterward, Edges decided</p>
<p begin="05:04:44.400" end="05:04:47.600" style="s2">to check on the rest of their teammates</p>
<p begin="05:04:46.160" end="05:04:49.200" style="s2">and see how their own battles were</p>
<p begin="05:04:47.600" end="05:04:51.200" style="s2">progressing. Elsewhere on the</p>
<p begin="05:04:49.200" end="05:04:52.958" style="s2">battlefield, Sandy was rushing toward</p>
<p begin="05:04:51.200" end="05:04:54.878" style="s2">her opponent while golden lightning</p>
<p begin="05:04:52.958" end="05:04:56.958" style="s2">crackled around her sword. The moment</p>
<p begin="05:04:54.878" end="05:04:59.280" style="s2">she reached him, she unleashed lightning</p>
<p begin="05:04:56.958" end="05:05:00.878" style="s2">flash. A thunderous explosion echoed</p>
<p begin="05:04:59.280" end="05:05:02.638" style="s2">across the battlefield as lightning</p>
<p begin="05:05:00.878" end="05:05:04.400" style="s2">scattered in every direction. Their</p>
<p begin="05:05:02.638" end="05:05:06.560" style="s2">enemy gritted his teeth while defending</p>
<p begin="05:05:04.400" end="05:05:08.798" style="s2">against the attack. At the same time,</p>
<p begin="05:05:06.560" end="05:05:11.280" style="s2">Allan swung his fan and launched a gale</p>
<p begin="05:05:08.798" end="05:05:12.958" style="s2">bullet toward their opponent. However,</p>
<p begin="05:05:11.280" end="05:05:15.120" style="s2">Sandy quickly noticed that Allen&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:05:12.958" end="05:05:16.878" style="s2">attack was not particularly accurate.</p>
<p begin="05:05:15.120" end="05:05:18.560" style="s2">Because of that, she ended up getting</p>
<p begin="05:05:16.878" end="05:05:20.320" style="s2">caught in the attack as well.</p>
<p begin="05:05:18.560" end="05:05:21.760" style="s2">Immediately, she shouted at Allan,</p>
<p begin="05:05:20.320" end="05:05:23.440" style="s2">complaining that he had nearly dragged</p>
<p begin="05:05:21.760" end="05:05:25.280" style="s2">her into the attack alongside their</p>
<p begin="05:05:23.440" end="05:05:27.360" style="s2">enemy and questioning whether he even</p>
<p begin="05:05:25.280" end="05:05:29.120" style="s2">knew what he was doing. Alan&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="05:05:27.360" end="05:05:31.840" style="s2">response was that Sandy spent too much</p>
<p begin="05:05:29.120" end="05:05:33.520" style="s2">time doawling. Annoyed, Sandy demanded</p>
<p begin="05:05:31.840" end="05:05:35.520" style="s2">to know what he meant. Before the</p>
<p begin="05:05:33.520" end="05:05:37.520" style="s2">argument could continue, a massive</p>
<p begin="05:05:35.520" end="05:05:39.680" style="s2">explosion interrupted them both.</p>
<p begin="05:05:37.520" end="05:05:41.520" style="s2">startled Sandy and Allan immediately</p>
<p begin="05:05:39.680" end="05:05:43.120" style="s2">turned their attention forward as their</p>
<p begin="05:05:41.520" end="05:05:44.878" style="s2">enemy informed them that they were</p>
<p begin="05:05:43.120" end="05:05:47.120" style="s2">standing awfully close together and</p>
<p begin="05:05:44.878" end="05:05:49.200" style="s2">should prepare themselves. Both fighters</p>
<p begin="05:05:47.120" end="05:05:51.280" style="s2">quickly raised their defenses. Alan</p>
<p begin="05:05:49.200" end="05:05:53.120" style="s2">created a wind wall while Sandy used her</p>
<p begin="05:05:51.280" end="05:05:55.600" style="s2">great sword to deflect the incoming rock</p>
<p begin="05:05:53.120" end="05:05:57.840" style="s2">bullets. Afterward, Sandy remarked that</p>
<p begin="05:05:55.600" end="05:05:59.840" style="s2">four-star opponents really were tough.</p>
<p begin="05:05:57.840" end="05:06:01.600" style="s2">Alan agreed, but added that the battle</p>
<p begin="05:05:59.840" end="05:06:03.520" style="s2">was becoming increasingly difficult</p>
<p begin="05:06:01.600" end="05:06:06.000" style="s2">because Sandy constantly got in the way</p>
<p begin="05:06:03.520" end="05:06:08.000" style="s2">of his attacks. Naturally, Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:06:06.000" end="05:06:09.760" style="s2">immediately argued back, insisting that</p>
<p begin="05:06:08.000" end="05:06:11.360" style="s2">Allan was the one interfering and</p>
<p begin="05:06:09.760" end="05:06:13.360" style="s2">preventing her attacks from landing</p>
<p begin="05:06:11.360" end="05:06:15.600" style="s2">properly. Alan dismissed her complaint</p>
<p begin="05:06:13.360" end="05:06:17.200" style="s2">as nonsense and reminded her that he had</p>
<p begin="05:06:15.600" end="05:06:20.000" style="s2">been covering for her every time she</p>
<p begin="05:06:17.200" end="05:06:22.240" style="s2">lost focus. Still, Sandy refused to back</p>
<p begin="05:06:20.000" end="05:06:24.080" style="s2">down and continued, insisting that Allan</p>
<p begin="05:06:22.240" end="05:06:25.600" style="s2">was the problem. Their enemy remained</p>
<p begin="05:06:24.080" end="05:06:27.280" style="s2">silent for a moment before launching</p>
<p begin="05:06:25.600" end="05:06:29.520" style="s2">another attack while the two continued</p>
<p begin="05:06:27.280" end="05:06:31.280" style="s2">bickering. Using stone spike, he</p>
<p begin="05:06:29.520" end="05:06:33.760" style="s2">launched a surprise attack directly at</p>
<p begin="05:06:31.280" end="05:06:35.600" style="s2">Sandy. The moment Alan noticed it, he</p>
<p begin="05:06:33.760" end="05:06:37.280" style="s2">immediately activated Stormbblade and</p>
<p begin="05:06:35.600" end="05:06:39.280" style="s2">cut through the stone spikes before they</p>
<p begin="05:06:37.280" end="05:06:41.440" style="s2">could reach her. He then informed Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:06:39.280" end="05:06:43.440" style="s2">that she had lost focus once again and</p>
<p begin="05:06:41.440" end="05:06:45.520" style="s2">warned her to pay closer attention.</p>
<p begin="05:06:43.440" end="05:06:47.360" style="s2">Sandy immediately argued back, claiming</p>
<p begin="05:06:45.520" end="05:06:48.958" style="s2">that she knew exactly what she was doing</p>
<p begin="05:06:47.360" end="05:06:50.718" style="s2">and had already noticed the surprise</p>
<p begin="05:06:48.958" end="05:06:52.160" style="s2">attack herself. The enemy then</p>
<p begin="05:06:50.718" end="05:06:53.520" style="s2">questioned whether the two truly</p>
<p begin="05:06:52.160" end="05:06:55.520" style="s2">believed they could win with such</p>
<p begin="05:06:53.520" end="05:06:57.200" style="s2">half-baked teamwork. He mocked them,</p>
<p begin="05:06:55.520" end="05:06:59.520" style="s2">claiming that lizard brats were all the</p>
<p begin="05:06:57.200" end="05:07:02.080" style="s2">same in the end. For a moment, Sandy and</p>
<p begin="05:06:59.520" end="05:07:04.000" style="s2">Allan fell silent. Deep down, they both</p>
<p begin="05:07:02.080" end="05:07:05.920" style="s2">knew he was right. Their teamwork was</p>
<p begin="05:07:04.000" end="05:07:08.080" style="s2">rough around the edges. They certainly</p>
<p begin="05:07:05.920" end="05:07:10.000" style="s2">did not need him pointing it out. Alan</p>
<p begin="05:07:08.080" end="05:07:11.840" style="s2">reluctantly admitted that using his</p>
<p begin="05:07:10.000" end="05:07:14.638" style="s2">better judgment, he agreed with the</p>
<p begin="05:07:11.840" end="05:07:16.320" style="s2">enemy&#39;s assessment. Then Sandy suddenly</p>
<p begin="05:07:14.638" end="05:07:18.240" style="s2">smirked and mocked their opponent in</p>
<p begin="05:07:16.320" end="05:07:20.000" style="s2">return. She claimed that he was actually</p>
<p begin="05:07:18.240" end="05:07:22.080" style="s2">on the weaker side for a four-star</p>
<p begin="05:07:20.000" end="05:07:24.160" style="s2">fighter and confidently declared that</p>
<p begin="05:07:22.080" end="05:07:25.600" style="s2">even with their imperfect teamwork, they</p>
<p begin="05:07:24.160" end="05:07:27.520" style="s2">still had more than enough of a chance</p>
<p begin="05:07:25.600" end="05:07:29.520" style="s2">to win. Those words immediately</p>
<p begin="05:07:27.520" end="05:07:30.798" style="s2">irritated the enemy. He declared that</p>
<p begin="05:07:29.520" end="05:07:32.400" style="s2">fools like them could not even</p>
<p begin="05:07:30.798" end="05:07:34.480" style="s2">comprehend the gap in strength between</p>
<p begin="05:07:32.400" end="05:07:36.240" style="s2">them. Dark and ominous energy began</p>
<p begin="05:07:34.480" end="05:07:38.320" style="s2">radiating from his body as he charged</p>
<p begin="05:07:36.240" end="05:07:39.920" style="s2">towards Sandy and Allen, promising that</p>
<p begin="05:07:38.320" end="05:07:42.000" style="s2">they would drown in helplessness before</p>
<p begin="05:07:39.920" end="05:07:44.320" style="s2">dying. Sandy immediately called out</p>
<p begin="05:07:42.000" end="05:07:45.920" style="s2">Allen&#39;s name. With a confident smile,</p>
<p begin="05:07:44.320" end="05:07:48.320" style="s2">she declared that she could finish their</p>
<p begin="05:07:45.920" end="05:07:49.840" style="s2">opponent if Alan simply supported her.</p>
<p begin="05:07:48.320" end="05:07:52.000" style="s2">Although clearly irritated and</p>
<p begin="05:07:49.840" end="05:07:54.080" style="s2">reluctant, Alan noticed the rapidly</p>
<p begin="05:07:52.000" end="05:07:55.920" style="s2">approaching enemy and eventually agreed,</p>
<p begin="05:07:54.080" end="05:07:57.520" style="s2">deciding there was no helping it.</p>
<p begin="05:07:55.920" end="05:07:59.680" style="s2">Immediately, Allan activated</p>
<p begin="05:07:57.520" end="05:08:01.520" style="s2">wind-rennding fan arts and unleashed a</p>
<p begin="05:07:59.680" end="05:08:03.440" style="s2">powerful gale bullet. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:08:01.520" end="05:08:05.040" style="s2">dismissed the attack as pointless and</p>
<p begin="05:08:03.440" end="05:08:07.280" style="s2">reminded them that their attacks would</p>
<p begin="05:08:05.040" end="05:08:09.120" style="s2">never work on him. However, before he</p>
<p begin="05:08:07.280" end="05:08:11.040" style="s2">could finish speaking, his expression</p>
<p begin="05:08:09.120" end="05:08:12.480" style="s2">changed completely. The strength of</p>
<p begin="05:08:11.040" end="05:08:14.878" style="s2">Allen&#39;s attack had caught him by</p>
<p begin="05:08:12.480" end="05:08:17.360" style="s2">surprise. His own attack was absorbed by</p>
<p begin="05:08:14.878" end="05:08:19.120" style="s2">the gale bullet. Smiling confidently,</p>
<p begin="05:08:17.360" end="05:08:20.958" style="s2">Alan informed Sandy that he had poured</p>
<p begin="05:08:19.120" end="05:08:22.480" style="s2">additional windora into the technique.</p>
<p begin="05:08:20.958" end="05:08:24.560" style="s2">It was powerful enough to hold their</p>
<p begin="05:08:22.480" end="05:08:26.320" style="s2">enemy in place. He then asked whether</p>
<p begin="05:08:24.560" end="05:08:27.840" style="s2">that would be sufficient. Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:08:26.320" end="05:08:29.920" style="s2">immediately replied that it was more</p>
<p begin="05:08:27.840" end="05:08:31.600" style="s2">than enough. Golden lightning erupted</p>
<p begin="05:08:29.920" end="05:08:33.600" style="s2">around her body as she activated her</p>
<p begin="05:08:31.600" end="05:08:35.520" style="s2">power once more. With electricity</p>
<p begin="05:08:33.600" end="05:08:37.040" style="s2">crackling violently around her, she</p>
<p begin="05:08:35.520" end="05:08:38.958" style="s2">ordered their enemy to receive her</p>
<p begin="05:08:37.040" end="05:08:41.120" style="s2">attack before unleashing a devastating</p>
<p begin="05:08:38.958" end="05:08:43.120" style="s2">lightning slash directly into him.</p>
<p begin="05:08:41.120" end="05:08:45.440" style="s2">Injured and furious, the enemy cursed</p>
<p begin="05:08:43.120" end="05:08:47.360" style="s2">both Sandy and Allen. Alan merely called</p>
<p begin="05:08:45.440" end="05:08:49.840" style="s2">him stubborn before activating Typhoon</p>
<p begin="05:08:47.360" end="05:08:51.760" style="s2">falling to dust. Violent winds engulfed</p>
<p begin="05:08:49.840" end="05:08:54.080" style="s2">their opponent completely, leaving him</p>
<p begin="05:08:51.760" end="05:08:55.760" style="s2">with nothing but agonized screams. When</p>
<p begin="05:08:54.080" end="05:08:58.080" style="s2">the enemy finally collapsed onto the</p>
<p begin="05:08:55.760" end="05:08:59.440" style="s2">ground, Sandy and Allan stood firm,</p>
<p begin="05:08:58.080" end="05:09:01.840" style="s2">realizing that they had actually</p>
<p begin="05:08:59.440" end="05:09:04.000" style="s2">defeated him. Unfortunately, the peace</p>
<p begin="05:09:01.840" end="05:09:06.000" style="s2">between them lasted only a few moments.</p>
<p begin="05:09:04.000" end="05:09:08.240" style="s2">Alan immediately complained that Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:09:06.000" end="05:09:09.600" style="s2">always left things half-finish. If she</p>
<p begin="05:09:08.240" end="05:09:11.360" style="s2">claimed she would defeat the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:09:09.600" end="05:09:13.200" style="s2">herself, then she should have seen the</p>
<p begin="05:09:11.360" end="05:09:15.840" style="s2">battle through to the final blow.</p>
<p begin="05:09:13.200" end="05:09:17.360" style="s2">Naturally, Sandy retaliated at once,</p>
<p begin="05:09:15.840" end="05:09:19.280" style="s2">arguing that Alan should learn how to</p>
<p begin="05:09:17.360" end="05:09:20.958" style="s2">stab properly. For the record, his</p>
<p begin="05:09:19.280" end="05:09:22.718" style="s2">finishing attack had landed only because</p>
<p begin="05:09:20.958" end="05:09:25.120" style="s2">she created the opportunity.</p>
<p begin="05:09:22.718" end="05:09:26.718" style="s2">Exasperated, Alan muttered that despite</p>
<p begin="05:09:25.120" end="05:09:28.718" style="s2">all her boasting about finishing the</p>
<p begin="05:09:26.718" end="05:09:30.878" style="s2">enemy herself, she had still failed to</p>
<p begin="05:09:28.718" end="05:09:33.040" style="s2">do so. As their defeated opponent lay</p>
<p begin="05:09:30.878" end="05:09:34.958" style="s2">unconscious on the ground, Sandy and</p>
<p begin="05:09:33.040" end="05:09:37.040" style="s2">Allan continued their endless bickering</p>
<p begin="05:09:34.958" end="05:09:38.798" style="s2">without showing any signs of stopping.</p>
<p begin="05:09:37.040" end="05:09:40.878" style="s2">The four-star enemy continued to rain</p>
<p begin="05:09:38.798" end="05:09:42.798" style="s2">down rock bullets upon Leica and Venil.</p>
<p begin="05:09:40.878" end="05:09:44.400" style="s2">As the two ran across the battlefield,</p>
<p begin="05:09:42.798" end="05:09:46.638" style="s2">desperately dodging the relentless</p>
<p begin="05:09:44.400" end="05:09:48.560" style="s2">barrage, Veneil cursed their opponent</p>
<p begin="05:09:46.638" end="05:09:50.718" style="s2">and immediately poured his wind aura</p>
<p begin="05:09:48.560" end="05:09:52.958" style="s2">into his staff. Using his Ghost Wind</p>
<p begin="05:09:50.718" end="05:09:55.360" style="s2">umbrella style whirlwind impact, he</p>
<p begin="05:09:52.958" end="05:09:57.200" style="s2">launched a counterattack. However, their</p>
<p begin="05:09:55.360" end="05:09:59.200" style="s2">enemy merely scoffed at the attack,</p>
<p begin="05:09:57.200" end="05:10:01.120" style="s2">dismissing it as petty. While continuing</p>
<p begin="05:09:59.200" end="05:10:03.360" style="s2">to pressure them from both sides, the</p>
<p begin="05:10:01.120" end="05:10:04.638" style="s2">enemy showed no signs of slowing down.</p>
<p begin="05:10:03.360" end="05:10:06.638" style="s2">Seizing what appeared to be an</p>
<p begin="05:10:04.638" end="05:10:08.320" style="s2">opportunity, Leica activated the first</p>
<p begin="05:10:06.638" end="05:10:10.320" style="s2">secret art of her thunder great sword</p>
<p begin="05:10:08.320" end="05:10:11.840" style="s2">arts, heavenly thunder, and leaped</p>
<p begin="05:10:10.320" end="05:10:14.000" style="s2">toward the enemy in an attempt to launch</p>
<p begin="05:10:11.840" end="05:10:16.160" style="s2">a surprise attack. But the enemy noticed</p>
<p begin="05:10:14.000" end="05:10:18.000" style="s2">her immediately. Flipping his sword, he</p>
<p begin="05:10:16.160" end="05:10:20.000" style="s2">summoned a wall of earth beneath him and</p>
<p begin="05:10:18.000" end="05:10:21.680" style="s2">used it as a defensive step to block her</p>
<p begin="05:10:20.000" end="05:10:23.520" style="s2">thunder infused strike. The moment</p>
<p begin="05:10:21.680" end="05:10:25.920" style="s2">Leica&#39;s attack collided with the enemy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:10:23.520" end="05:10:27.760" style="s2">defense, a massive explosion of energy</p>
<p begin="05:10:25.920" end="05:10:29.680" style="s2">erupted across the battlefield. Refusing</p>
<p begin="05:10:27.760" end="05:10:31.600" style="s2">to back down, she poured even more</p>
<p begin="05:10:29.680" end="05:10:33.760" style="s2">golden lightning into her great sword,</p>
<p begin="05:10:31.600" end="05:10:35.520" style="s2">strengthening the attack. In response,</p>
<p begin="05:10:33.760" end="05:10:37.600" style="s2">the enemy activated his earthhound</p>
<p begin="05:10:35.520" end="05:10:39.360" style="s2">swordstyle technique known as earthn</p>
<p begin="05:10:37.600" end="05:10:41.040" style="s2">swordsman. Sand from the surrounding</p>
<p begin="05:10:39.360" end="05:10:43.200" style="s2">ground surged upward and wrapped around</p>
<p begin="05:10:41.040" end="05:10:45.440" style="s2">his body, causing Leica&#39;s eyes to widen</p>
<p begin="05:10:43.200" end="05:10:47.280" style="s2">in surprise. Even so, she continued</p>
<p begin="05:10:45.440" end="05:10:49.280" style="s2">pouring her golden lightning aura into</p>
<p begin="05:10:47.280" end="05:10:51.280" style="s2">her blade, determined to break through.</p>
<p begin="05:10:49.280" end="05:10:53.520" style="s2">Yet, the enemy remained firmly rooted in</p>
<p begin="05:10:51.280" end="05:10:55.200" style="s2">place, defending against her assault. It</p>
<p begin="05:10:53.520" end="05:10:56.878" style="s2">was only then that Leica realized what</p>
<p begin="05:10:55.200" end="05:10:58.480" style="s2">was happening. Her lightning was being</p>
<p begin="05:10:56.878" end="05:11:00.320" style="s2">grounded directly into the earth through</p>
<p begin="05:10:58.480" end="05:11:01.520" style="s2">the enemy&#39;s defense. When she finally</p>
<p begin="05:11:00.320" end="05:11:03.360" style="s2">thought she had managed to break</p>
<p begin="05:11:01.520" end="05:11:04.958" style="s2">through, she was caught off guard by a</p>
<p begin="05:11:03.360" end="05:11:07.440" style="s2">sudden counterattack. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:11:04.958" end="05:11:08.958" style="s2">unleashed landslide slash, forcing Leica</p>
<p begin="05:11:07.440" end="05:11:10.560" style="s2">to grip her great sword tightly to</p>
<p begin="05:11:08.958" end="05:11:12.240" style="s2">defend herself. Before she could</p>
<p begin="05:11:10.560" end="05:11:13.760" style="s2">recover, the enemy followed up by</p>
<p begin="05:11:12.240" end="05:11:15.680" style="s2">driving a powerful kick into her</p>
<p begin="05:11:13.760" end="05:11:17.600" style="s2">stomach. The impact sent her flying</p>
<p begin="05:11:15.680" end="05:11:19.360" style="s2">backward, and as she struggled to regain</p>
<p begin="05:11:17.600" end="05:11:21.040" style="s2">her footing, the enemy prepared to</p>
<p begin="05:11:19.360" end="05:11:22.878" style="s2">finish her off. Before he could strike</p>
<p begin="05:11:21.040" end="05:11:24.878" style="s2">again, however, he sensed something</p>
<p begin="05:11:22.878" end="05:11:27.280" style="s2">approaching from behind. Reacting in the</p>
<p begin="05:11:24.878" end="05:11:29.360" style="s2">nick of time, he narrowly dodged a sneak</p>
<p begin="05:11:27.280" end="05:11:31.280" style="s2">attack coated in wind aura, Venil</p>
<p begin="05:11:29.360" end="05:11:32.958" style="s2">clicked his tongue in irritation, unable</p>
<p begin="05:11:31.280" end="05:11:34.718" style="s2">to believe the enemy had still managed</p>
<p begin="05:11:32.958" end="05:11:36.638" style="s2">to evade an attack launched directly</p>
<p begin="05:11:34.718" end="05:11:38.638" style="s2">from his blind spot. Although the attack</p>
<p begin="05:11:36.638" end="05:11:40.400" style="s2">failed to land, it forced the enemy to</p>
<p begin="05:11:38.638" end="05:11:42.160" style="s2">leap backward and create distance.</p>
<p begin="05:11:40.400" end="05:11:44.160" style="s2">Taking advantage of the brief opening,</p>
<p begin="05:11:42.160" end="05:11:46.400" style="s2">Vanil and Leica quickly retreated behind</p>
<p begin="05:11:44.160" end="05:11:48.400" style="s2">a large boulder. Leica thanked Vanil for</p>
<p begin="05:11:46.400" end="05:11:50.240" style="s2">saving her, but Venil immediately looked</p>
<p begin="05:11:48.400" end="05:11:52.000" style="s2">away and insisted that he had merely</p>
<p begin="05:11:50.240" end="05:11:53.840" style="s2">taken advantage of the enemy&#39;s opening.</p>
<p begin="05:11:52.000" end="05:11:55.760" style="s2">He claimed he had no intention of saving</p>
<p begin="05:11:53.840" end="05:11:57.920" style="s2">her at all. Leica forced herself to</p>
<p begin="05:11:55.760" end="05:12:00.080" style="s2">accept his explanation, but deep down</p>
<p begin="05:11:57.920" end="05:12:01.440" style="s2">she knew the truth. Vanil was simply too</p>
<p begin="05:12:00.080" end="05:12:03.200" style="s2">embarrassed to admit that he had</p>
<p begin="05:12:01.440" end="05:12:04.958" style="s2">genuinely wanted to help her. As she</p>
<p begin="05:12:03.200" end="05:12:07.120" style="s2">peered around the boulder, Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:12:04.958" end="05:12:08.878" style="s2">expression darkened. Their situation was</p>
<p begin="05:12:07.120" end="05:12:11.120" style="s2">worse than she had initially thought.</p>
<p begin="05:12:08.878" end="05:12:12.560" style="s2">The enemy was unbelievably strong, and</p>
<p begin="05:12:11.120" end="05:12:14.320" style="s2">she could already tell that he was</p>
<p begin="05:12:12.560" end="05:12:16.320" style="s2">likely among the strongest individuals</p>
<p begin="05:12:14.320" end="05:12:18.080" style="s2">within the four-star level. Carefully</p>
<p begin="05:12:16.320" end="05:12:19.440" style="s2">observing him, she noticed that the</p>
<p begin="05:12:18.080" end="05:12:21.520" style="s2">technique he used to merge his</p>
<p begin="05:12:19.440" end="05:12:23.520" style="s2">swordsmanship with the earth completely</p>
<p begin="05:12:21.520" end="05:12:25.840" style="s2">neutralized her lightning aura. On top</p>
<p begin="05:12:23.520" end="05:12:27.680" style="s2">of that, his earth magic constantly wore</p>
<p begin="05:12:25.840" end="05:12:29.440" style="s2">down their weapons, leaving almost no</p>
<p begin="05:12:27.680" end="05:12:31.120" style="s2">opportunities to exploit. The only</p>
<p begin="05:12:29.440" end="05:12:32.798" style="s2">opening she could identify appeared</p>
<p begin="05:12:31.120" end="05:12:35.120" style="s2">whenever he switched between magic and</p>
<p begin="05:12:32.798" end="05:12:37.200" style="s2">martial arts. Unfortunately, the gap</p>
<p begin="05:12:35.120" end="05:12:39.120" style="s2">lasted for only a fraction of a second.</p>
<p begin="05:12:37.200" end="05:12:41.040" style="s2">It became obvious to her that the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:12:39.120" end="05:12:43.200" style="s2">had trained specifically to eliminate</p>
<p begin="05:12:41.040" end="05:12:44.560" style="s2">every weakness in his combat style. Even</p>
<p begin="05:12:43.200" end="05:12:46.798" style="s2">though her thunder great sword arts</p>
<p begin="05:12:44.560" end="05:12:48.638" style="s2">excelled in speed, she still wasn&#39;t fast</p>
<p begin="05:12:46.798" end="05:12:50.638" style="s2">enough to consistently capitalize on</p>
<p begin="05:12:48.638" end="05:12:52.560" style="s2">that opening. Venil wasn&#39;t capable of</p>
<p begin="05:12:50.638" end="05:12:54.320" style="s2">doing it either. Veneil eventually broke</p>
<p begin="05:12:52.560" end="05:12:56.240" style="s2">the silence and pointed out that if they</p>
<p begin="05:12:54.320" end="05:12:58.480" style="s2">continued fighting like this, they would</p>
<p begin="05:12:56.240" end="05:13:00.160" style="s2">never defeat him. Leica agreed and asked</p>
<p begin="05:12:58.480" end="05:13:01.840" style="s2">whether he could perhaps use one of his</p>
<p begin="05:13:00.160" end="05:13:03.920" style="s2">poisons against the enemy. The</p>
<p begin="05:13:01.840" end="05:13:06.160" style="s2">suggestion only irritated him further.</p>
<p begin="05:13:03.920" end="05:13:08.160" style="s2">He complained that Zeke had drained his</p>
<p begin="05:13:06.160" end="05:13:09.840" style="s2">entire poison stock before they departed</p>
<p begin="05:13:08.160" end="05:13:11.440" style="s2">for the mission, claiming it wouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="05:13:09.840" end="05:13:13.760" style="s2">real training if Veneil relied on</p>
<p begin="05:13:11.440" end="05:13:15.520" style="s2">poison. To make matters worse, Zeke had</p>
<p begin="05:13:13.760" end="05:13:17.360" style="s2">even forced him to detoxify the true</p>
<p begin="05:13:15.520" end="05:13:19.840" style="s2">killing poison he had secretly stored</p>
<p begin="05:13:17.360" end="05:13:21.600" style="s2">inside his own body. Hearing this, Leica</p>
<p begin="05:13:19.840" end="05:13:23.360" style="s2">could only sigh helplessly and mutter</p>
<p begin="05:13:21.600" end="05:13:25.040" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s name under her breath. She</p>
<p begin="05:13:23.360" end="05:13:26.798" style="s2">pointed out that if that was the case,</p>
<p begin="05:13:25.040" end="05:13:28.798" style="s2">then they truly had no way to exploit</p>
<p begin="05:13:26.798" end="05:13:30.480" style="s2">the enemy&#39;s opening. Still annoyed,</p>
<p begin="05:13:28.798" end="05:13:32.240" style="s2">Venil informed her that they weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="05:13:30.480" end="05:13:34.160" style="s2">completely out of options. The moment</p>
<p begin="05:13:32.240" end="05:13:36.320" style="s2">Leica tried to ask what he meant, the</p>
<p begin="05:13:34.160" end="05:13:38.080" style="s2">enemy located their hiding place and</p>
<p begin="05:13:36.320" end="05:13:40.400" style="s2">mockingly remarked that they seemed</p>
<p begin="05:13:38.080" end="05:13:42.160" style="s2">awfully relaxed. Immediately afterward,</p>
<p begin="05:13:40.400" end="05:13:44.160" style="s2">another barrage of rock bullets came</p>
<p begin="05:13:42.160" end="05:13:46.160" style="s2">flying toward them. As the two sprinted</p>
<p begin="05:13:44.160" end="05:13:48.320" style="s2">away from the attack, Leica shouted and</p>
<p begin="05:13:46.160" end="05:13:50.080" style="s2">demanded to know his plan. Veneil simply</p>
<p begin="05:13:48.320" end="05:13:52.240" style="s2">replied that all she needed to do was</p>
<p begin="05:13:50.080" end="05:13:54.798" style="s2">land her fastest attack directly on</p>
<p begin="05:13:52.240" end="05:13:56.400" style="s2">their enemy. Confused, Lea reminded him</p>
<p begin="05:13:54.798" end="05:13:58.560" style="s2">that she wasn&#39;t fast enough to land a</p>
<p begin="05:13:56.400" end="05:14:00.160" style="s2">decisive blow. Venil casually assured</p>
<p begin="05:13:58.560" end="05:14:02.080" style="s2">her that it would be fine and that he</p>
<p begin="05:14:00.160" end="05:14:04.320" style="s2">would handle that part himself. The</p>
<p begin="05:14:02.080" end="05:14:06.878" style="s2">confidence in his voice surprised her.</p>
<p begin="05:14:04.320" end="05:14:08.958" style="s2">For a brief moment, she remained silent.</p>
<p begin="05:14:06.878" end="05:14:10.638" style="s2">Assuming she doubted him, Vanil told her</p>
<p begin="05:14:08.958" end="05:14:12.638" style="s2">that if she didn&#39;t trust him, they could</p>
<p begin="05:14:10.638" end="05:14:14.400" style="s2">simply abandon the plan. Before he could</p>
<p begin="05:14:12.638" end="05:14:15.920" style="s2">finish speaking, Leica knocked away an</p>
<p begin="05:14:14.400" end="05:14:17.680" style="s2">incoming rock bullet with her great</p>
<p begin="05:14:15.920" end="05:14:19.680" style="s2">sword and firmly declared that she</p>
<p begin="05:14:17.680" end="05:14:22.000" style="s2">trusted him. Then, with unwavering</p>
<p begin="05:14:19.680" end="05:14:23.920" style="s2">conviction, she repeated herself. She</p>
<p begin="05:14:22.000" end="05:14:26.560" style="s2">trusted him completely. Hearing those</p>
<p begin="05:14:23.920" end="05:14:28.798" style="s2">words, Vanil unexpectedly fell silent.</p>
<p begin="05:14:26.560" end="05:14:30.718" style="s2">Moments later, he accelerated using his</p>
<p begin="05:14:28.798" end="05:14:32.240" style="s2">wind aura and widened the distance</p>
<p begin="05:14:30.718" end="05:14:34.240" style="s2">between himself and the incoming</p>
<p begin="05:14:32.240" end="05:14:36.320" style="s2">attacks. While Leica continued defending</p>
<p begin="05:14:34.240" end="05:14:37.920" style="s2">against the barrage, watching them, the</p>
<p begin="05:14:36.320" end="05:14:39.120" style="s2">enemy grimly mocked their efforts and</p>
<p begin="05:14:37.920" end="05:14:40.878" style="s2">declared that no matter what they</p>
<p begin="05:14:39.120" end="05:14:43.040" style="s2">attempted, the outcome would remain the</p>
<p begin="05:14:40.878" end="05:14:44.878" style="s2">same. At that moment, he raised his hand</p>
<p begin="05:14:43.040" end="05:14:46.718" style="s2">and used earth magic to intercept them</p>
<p begin="05:14:44.878" end="05:14:48.400" style="s2">with a field of sharp earth spikes.</p>
<p begin="05:14:46.718" end="05:14:50.320" style="s2">Leica immediately jumped forward and</p>
<p begin="05:14:48.400" end="05:14:52.320" style="s2">sliced through every spike in her path.</p>
<p begin="05:14:50.320" end="05:14:54.240" style="s2">At the same time, Venil unleashed</p>
<p begin="05:14:52.320" end="05:14:56.080" style="s2">another whirlwind impact, forcing the</p>
<p begin="05:14:54.240" end="05:14:58.240" style="s2">enemy to summon a rock wall to defend</p>
<p begin="05:14:56.080" end="05:15:00.240" style="s2">himself. The instant the wall appeared,</p>
<p begin="05:14:58.240" end="05:15:02.798" style="s2">Venil informed Leica that now was the</p>
<p begin="05:15:00.240" end="05:15:04.878" style="s2">time. Without hesitation, she exploded</p>
<p begin="05:15:02.798" end="05:15:06.878" style="s2">forward with all her speed. The enemy</p>
<p begin="05:15:04.878" end="05:15:08.160" style="s2">simply called them fools and declared</p>
<p begin="05:15:06.878" end="05:15:09.840" style="s2">that he would turn them into pin</p>
<p begin="05:15:08.160" end="05:15:12.160" style="s2">cushions before unleashing another</p>
<p begin="05:15:09.840" end="05:15:14.320" style="s2">devastating barrage of rock bullets.</p>
<p begin="05:15:12.160" end="05:15:16.080" style="s2">Vanil immediately responded, declaring</p>
<p begin="05:15:14.320" end="05:15:18.160" style="s2">that such a thing would never happen.</p>
<p begin="05:15:16.080" end="05:15:19.840" style="s2">Using his wind aura, he intercepted the</p>
<p begin="05:15:18.160" end="05:15:21.760" style="s2">barrage and shielded Leica as she</p>
<p begin="05:15:19.840" end="05:15:23.760" style="s2">continued charging forward. Realizing</p>
<p begin="05:15:21.760" end="05:15:25.440" style="s2">her approach could no longer be stopped,</p>
<p begin="05:15:23.760" end="05:15:27.600" style="s2">the enemy prepared his shatter wall</p>
<p begin="05:15:25.440" end="05:15:29.120" style="s2">technique as a final defense. But Veneil</p>
<p begin="05:15:27.600" end="05:15:31.040" style="s2">had anticipated it. with another</p>
<p begin="05:15:29.120" end="05:15:32.638" style="s2">whirlwind impact. He shattered the</p>
<p begin="05:15:31.040" end="05:15:34.320" style="s2">defensive wall before it could fully</p>
<p begin="05:15:32.638" end="05:15:36.638" style="s2">stop her. The enemy&#39;s frustration</p>
<p begin="05:15:34.320" end="05:15:38.718" style="s2">finally became visible. Once again, he</p>
<p begin="05:15:36.638" end="05:15:40.798" style="s2">called them fools and insisted that even</p>
<p begin="05:15:38.718" end="05:15:43.040" style="s2">if they repeated the same strategy a 100</p>
<p begin="05:15:40.798" end="05:15:45.280" style="s2">times, the result would never change.</p>
<p begin="05:15:43.040" end="05:15:46.958" style="s2">Leica continued running, her great sword</p>
<p begin="05:15:45.280" end="05:15:49.520" style="s2">crackling with golden lightning.</p>
<p begin="05:15:46.958" end="05:15:51.440" style="s2">Meanwhile, Vanil activated swift gale</p>
<p begin="05:15:49.520" end="05:15:53.200" style="s2">and directed powerful currents of wind</p>
<p begin="05:15:51.440" end="05:15:55.440" style="s2">behind her. The moment she felt the</p>
<p begin="05:15:53.200" end="05:15:57.840" style="s2">boost, her eyes widened. Understanding</p>
<p begin="05:15:55.440" end="05:16:00.080" style="s2">his plan at last, she focused entirely</p>
<p begin="05:15:57.840" end="05:16:02.160" style="s2">on the enemy ahead. As Vanil used his</p>
<p begin="05:16:00.080" end="05:16:04.240" style="s2">grip wind umbrella arts to distract the</p>
<p begin="05:16:02.160" end="05:16:06.000" style="s2">enemy&#39;s attention, Leica activated her</p>
<p begin="05:16:04.240" end="05:16:07.680" style="s2">lightning greats sword arts. With a</p>
<p begin="05:16:06.000" end="05:16:10.240" style="s2">thunderous shout, she unleashed</p>
<p begin="05:16:07.680" end="05:16:11.920" style="s2">thunderclap rush. This time, the attack</p>
<p begin="05:16:10.240" end="05:16:14.000" style="s2">connected. The enemy could do nothing</p>
<p begin="05:16:11.920" end="05:16:16.080" style="s2">except scream in agony as lightning</p>
<p begin="05:16:14.000" end="05:16:18.080" style="s2">surged through his body. Golden thunder</p>
<p begin="05:16:16.080" end="05:16:20.000" style="s2">continuously ravaged him until his legs</p>
<p begin="05:16:18.080" end="05:16:22.878" style="s2">finally gave out and he collapsed to his</p>
<p begin="05:16:20.000" end="05:16:24.878" style="s2">knees. Moments later, he died. Exhausted</p>
<p begin="05:16:22.878" end="05:16:26.480" style="s2">from pushing herself beyond her limits.</p>
<p begin="05:16:24.878" end="05:16:28.400" style="s2">Leica dropped to one knee and leaned</p>
<p begin="05:16:26.480" end="05:16:30.638" style="s2">heavily against her sword. She asked</p>
<p begin="05:16:28.400" end="05:16:32.240" style="s2">Venil what exactly he had done. Vanil</p>
<p begin="05:16:30.638" end="05:16:34.000" style="s2">explained that neither of them was fast</p>
<p begin="05:16:32.240" end="05:16:36.400" style="s2">enough to reach the enemy alone.</p>
<p begin="05:16:34.000" end="05:16:38.240" style="s2">However, if he used his wind aura to</p>
<p begin="05:16:36.400" end="05:16:40.000" style="s2">accelerate her movements, then together</p>
<p begin="05:16:38.240" end="05:16:41.920" style="s2">they could surpass the enemy&#39;s reaction</p>
<p begin="05:16:40.000" end="05:16:44.320" style="s2">speed. Understanding the simple yet</p>
<p begin="05:16:41.920" end="05:16:46.480" style="s2">effective logic behind the plan, Lea let</p>
<p begin="05:16:44.320" end="05:16:48.400" style="s2">out a relieved sigh. Vineil scratched</p>
<p begin="05:16:46.480" end="05:16:50.400" style="s2">the back of his head awkwardly and asked</p>
<p begin="05:16:48.400" end="05:16:52.000" style="s2">why she had trusted him so readily. He</p>
<p begin="05:16:50.400" end="05:16:54.000" style="s2">reminded her that he had spent years</p>
<p begin="05:16:52.000" end="05:16:56.080" style="s2">playing dirty tricks, constantly</p>
<p begin="05:16:54.000" end="05:16:58.160" style="s2">targeting her. Leica remained silent for</p>
<p begin="05:16:56.080" end="05:16:59.920" style="s2">a moment before finally answering. A lot</p>
<p begin="05:16:58.160" end="05:17:01.680" style="s2">had happened between them. But despite</p>
<p begin="05:16:59.920" end="05:17:03.520" style="s2">everything as the leader of strike team,</p>
<p begin="05:17:01.680" end="05:17:05.600" style="s2">she had chosen Veneil. That alone was</p>
<p begin="05:17:03.520" end="05:17:07.600" style="s2">enough reason for her trust. Simple as</p>
<p begin="05:17:05.600" end="05:17:09.600" style="s2">that. She also pointed out that they had</p>
<p begin="05:17:07.600" end="05:17:11.440" style="s2">only won because of him and sincerely</p>
<p begin="05:17:09.600" end="05:17:13.520" style="s2">thanked him. The gratitude immediately</p>
<p begin="05:17:11.440" end="05:17:15.040" style="s2">sent a strange chill through Venil&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:17:13.520" end="05:17:16.080" style="s2">body. He quickly looked away and</p>
<p begin="05:17:15.040" end="05:17:18.080" style="s2">insisted that she shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="05:17:16.080" end="05:17:19.840" style="s2">misunderstand his intentions. He had</p>
<p begin="05:17:18.080" end="05:17:22.160" style="s2">only helped because he wanted to win,</p>
<p begin="05:17:19.840" end="05:17:23.760" style="s2">nothing more. Leica merely smiled before</p>
<p begin="05:17:22.160" end="05:17:25.760" style="s2">turning her attention toward Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:17:23.760" end="05:17:28.320" style="s2">battle against the five-star enemy. At</p>
<p begin="05:17:25.760" end="05:17:30.400" style="s2">that exact moment, her expression froze.</p>
<p begin="05:17:28.320" end="05:17:32.400" style="s2">To her shock, Zeke had been completely</p>
<p begin="05:17:30.400" end="05:17:34.878" style="s2">engulfed by a forest of massive earth</p>
<p begin="05:17:32.400" end="05:17:37.120" style="s2">spikes. But in the next instant, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:17:34.878" end="05:17:38.878" style="s2">clenched his fist. Every earth spike</p>
<p begin="05:17:37.120" end="05:17:41.120" style="s2">surrounding him shattered into countless</p>
<p begin="05:17:38.878" end="05:17:43.120" style="s2">fragments, landing amidst the debris.</p>
<p begin="05:17:41.120" end="05:17:44.958" style="s2">Zeke burst into loud laughter and</p>
<p begin="05:17:43.120" end="05:17:47.040" style="s2">enthusiastically declared that the</p>
<p begin="05:17:44.958" end="05:17:48.878" style="s2">battle felt incredible. The moment his</p>
<p begin="05:17:47.040" end="05:17:50.638" style="s2">feet touched the ground, he charged</p>
<p begin="05:17:48.878" end="05:17:52.560" style="s2">directly toward the enemy with a wide</p>
<p begin="05:17:50.638" end="05:17:55.120" style="s2">grin, demanding that his opponent show</p>
<p begin="05:17:52.560" end="05:17:57.200" style="s2">him even more magic. Seeing Zeke rush</p>
<p begin="05:17:55.120" end="05:17:59.440" style="s2">forward, the five-star enemy immediately</p>
<p begin="05:17:57.200" end="05:18:01.360" style="s2">coated his sword in hardened earth using</p>
<p begin="05:17:59.440" end="05:18:03.680" style="s2">the shattered stone sword arts technique</p>
<p begin="05:18:01.360" end="05:18:06.000" style="s2">known as rock armor razor edge. Yet the</p>
<p begin="05:18:03.680" end="05:18:07.840" style="s2">result was the same as before. Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:18:06.000" end="05:18:10.000" style="s2">shattered the earthcovered sword with a</p>
<p begin="05:18:07.840" end="05:18:11.840" style="s2">single punch and sent the enemy flying</p>
<p begin="05:18:10.000" end="05:18:13.680" style="s2">through sheer force. He casually</p>
<p begin="05:18:11.840" end="05:18:15.760" style="s2">informed the enemy that covering himself</p>
<p begin="05:18:13.680" end="05:18:17.680" style="s2">in stone was completely useless against</p>
<p begin="05:18:15.760" end="05:18:19.360" style="s2">him. Using his sword to stop his</p>
<p begin="05:18:17.680" end="05:18:21.360" style="s2">momentum, the enemy immediately</p>
<p begin="05:18:19.360" end="05:18:23.440" style="s2">retaliated with an earth magic technique</p>
<p begin="05:18:21.360" end="05:18:25.040" style="s2">called ground ripper. Golden energy</p>
<p begin="05:18:23.440" end="05:18:26.958" style="s2">erupted around him as he slammed his</p>
<p begin="05:18:25.040" end="05:18:29.040" style="s2">fist into the ground. The earth cracked</p>
<p begin="05:18:26.958" end="05:18:30.878" style="s2">apart and surged toward Zeke like a</p>
<p begin="05:18:29.040" end="05:18:32.958" style="s2">giant m. As the ground threatened to</p>
<p begin="05:18:30.878" end="05:18:34.560" style="s2">close around him, Zeke planted both his</p>
<p begin="05:18:32.958" end="05:18:36.798" style="s2">arms and legs against the collapsing</p>
<p begin="05:18:34.560" end="05:18:38.958" style="s2">walls and forcibly held them apart. The</p>
<p begin="05:18:36.798" end="05:18:41.280" style="s2">enemy expected him to become trapped.</p>
<p begin="05:18:38.958" end="05:18:43.360" style="s2">Instead, Zeke launched himself upward</p>
<p begin="05:18:41.280" end="05:18:45.280" style="s2">just before the gap closed completely.</p>
<p begin="05:18:43.360" end="05:18:46.560" style="s2">Laughing once again, he declared that</p>
<p begin="05:18:45.280" end="05:18:48.320" style="s2">the battle was becoming more</p>
<p begin="05:18:46.560" end="05:18:50.160" style="s2">entertaining by the second. As he</p>
