<p begin="05:18:53.120" end="05:18:56.798" style="s2">battles. Nearby, the mother bird</p>
<p begin="05:18:55.200" end="05:18:58.480" style="s2">released a victorious chirp after</p>
<p begin="05:18:56.798" end="05:19:00.240" style="s2">defeating her opponent. The smaller</p>
<p begin="05:18:58.480" end="05:19:01.920" style="s2">birds proudly raised their wings,</p>
<p begin="05:19:00.240" end="05:19:04.000" style="s2">announcing that they too had won their</p>
<p begin="05:19:01.920" end="05:19:06.080" style="s2">respective fights. The enemy&#39;s gaze then</p>
<p begin="05:19:04.000" end="05:19:07.920" style="s2">shifted toward Edgis and Laya. While</p>
<p begin="05:19:06.080" end="05:19:09.840" style="s2">Sandy and Allan continued their usual</p>
<p begin="05:19:07.920" end="05:19:11.520" style="s2">petty bickering, the enemy admitted that</p>
<p begin="05:19:09.840" end="05:19:13.360" style="s2">he would have loved to continue enjoying</p>
<p begin="05:19:11.520" end="05:19:15.200" style="s2">the battle and experiencing Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:19:13.360" end="05:19:17.520" style="s2">strange combat style to his heart&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:19:15.200" end="05:19:19.440" style="s2">content. However, he could never accept</p>
<p begin="05:19:17.520" end="05:19:21.680" style="s2">losing to a lizard and a mere three-star</p>
<p begin="05:19:19.440" end="05:19:23.520" style="s2">brat. As he spoke, Zeke noticed the</p>
<p begin="05:19:21.680" end="05:19:26.080" style="s2">intense determination burning within the</p>
<p begin="05:19:23.520" end="05:19:28.160" style="s2">enemy&#39;s eyes. Then, without warning, the</p>
<p begin="05:19:26.080" end="05:19:30.160" style="s2">enemy drove his own hand into his chest.</p>
<p begin="05:19:28.160" end="05:19:32.718" style="s2">The moment he activated his magic, his</p>
<p begin="05:19:30.160" end="05:19:34.160" style="s2">golden aura exploded skyward. A powerful</p>
<p begin="05:19:32.718" end="05:19:36.240" style="s2">shock wave erupted across the</p>
<p begin="05:19:34.160" end="05:19:38.240" style="s2">battlefield. As his cap was blown away</p>
<p begin="05:19:36.240" end="05:19:40.240" style="s2">by the force, he declared that even if</p>
<p begin="05:19:38.240" end="05:19:42.000" style="s2">it cost him his life, he would see his</p>
<p begin="05:19:40.240" end="05:19:43.760" style="s2">mission through to the very end. The</p>
<p begin="05:19:42.000" end="05:19:45.840" style="s2">ground immediately began to tremble.</p>
<p begin="05:19:43.760" end="05:19:47.200" style="s2">Allen&#39;s expression changed as he warned</p>
<p begin="05:19:45.840" end="05:19:49.280" style="s2">everyone that something was moving</p>
<p begin="05:19:47.200" end="05:19:50.798" style="s2">beneath their feet. Cracks spread across</p>
<p begin="05:19:49.280" end="05:19:52.798" style="s2">the battlefield as countless earth</p>
<p begin="05:19:50.798" end="05:19:54.560" style="s2">spikes erupted from below. Sandy and</p>
