<p begin="05:19:54.560" end="05:19:58.080" style="s2">wondering if this was some kind of</p>
<p begin="05:19:55.840" end="05:20:00.080" style="s2">advanced spell. Edges immediately</p>
<p begin="05:19:58.080" end="05:20:01.600" style="s2">corrected them. This wasn&#39;t a spell.</p>
<p begin="05:20:00.080" end="05:20:03.120" style="s2">Rather than manipulating the terrain</p>
<p begin="05:20:01.600" end="05:20:05.200" style="s2">through a technique, the enemy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:20:03.120" end="05:20:07.120" style="s2">overwhelming magic power was forcibly</p>
<p begin="05:20:05.200" end="05:20:09.680" style="s2">causing the land itself to shift and</p>
<p begin="05:20:07.120" end="05:20:11.280" style="s2">obey his will. Watching carefully, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:20:09.680" end="05:20:12.718" style="s2">noticed that the hardness and sharpness</p>
<p begin="05:20:11.280" end="05:20:14.480" style="s2">of the surrounding earth had increased</p>
<p begin="05:20:12.718" end="05:20:16.320" style="s2">to an entirely different level compared</p>
<p begin="05:20:14.480" end="05:20:18.160" style="s2">to before. He couldn&#39;t help but wonder</p>
<p begin="05:20:16.320" end="05:20:20.718" style="s2">whether the enemy was overloading his</p>
<p begin="05:20:18.160" end="05:20:22.240" style="s2">aura or his magic power. Either way,</p>
<p begin="05:20:20.718" end="05:20:24.240" style="s2">there was no doubt that the enemy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:20:22.240" end="05:20:26.240" style="s2">strength had surged dramatically. At the</p>
<p begin="05:20:24.240" end="05:20:28.080" style="s2">same time, Zeke understood that such</p>
<p begin="05:20:26.240" end="05:20:30.400" style="s2">power would inevitably cause a severe</p>
<p begin="05:20:28.080" end="05:20:33.040" style="s2">backlash. Then Vanil&#39;s eyes widened in</p>
<p begin="05:20:30.400" end="05:20:34.958" style="s2">shock. The enemy slowly raised one hand.</p>
<p begin="05:20:33.040" end="05:20:36.718" style="s2">The earth around him began gathering,</p>
<p begin="05:20:34.958" end="05:20:38.638" style="s2">compressing into a gigantic boulder</p>
<p begin="05:20:36.718" end="05:20:40.560" style="s2">suspended high in the air. Everyone</p>
