<p begin="05:20:50.878" end="05:20:55.120" style="s2">reveal next. While Vanil and Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:20:53.360" end="05:20:57.440" style="s2">stared at the enormous boulder forming</p>
<p begin="05:20:55.120" end="05:20:59.040" style="s2">high in the sky, Sandy loudly wondered</p>
<p begin="05:20:57.440" end="05:21:01.040" style="s2">if their enemy intended to drop it</p>
<p begin="05:20:59.040" end="05:21:02.638" style="s2">directly on top of them. Edges quickly</p>
<p begin="05:21:01.040" end="05:21:04.878" style="s2">informed everyone that their situation</p>
<p begin="05:21:02.638" end="05:21:06.958" style="s2">had become extremely dangerous. They had</p>
<p begin="05:21:04.878" end="05:21:08.798" style="s2">nowhere left to run, and at this rate,</p>
<p begin="05:21:06.958" end="05:21:11.120" style="s2">the Chaos Stone would inevitably be</p>
<p begin="05:21:08.798" end="05:21:12.400" style="s2">destroyed. Hearing this, Laya asked if</p>
<p begin="05:21:11.120" end="05:21:14.718" style="s2">they were not supposed to break the</p>
<p begin="05:21:12.400" end="05:21:16.638" style="s2">Chaos Stone themselves. Edges confirmed</p>
<p begin="05:21:14.718" end="05:21:18.000" style="s2">that they indeed needed to destroy it.</p>
<p begin="05:21:16.638" end="05:21:19.600" style="s2">But the moment the Chaos Stone</p>
<p begin="05:21:18.000" end="05:21:21.680" style="s2">shattered, the rift would begin to</p>
<p begin="05:21:19.600" end="05:21:23.040" style="s2">close. Sandy immediately panicked and</p>
<p begin="05:21:21.680" end="05:21:24.878" style="s2">asked if that meant they would end up</p>
<p begin="05:21:23.040" end="05:21:26.798" style="s2">trapped inside the rift. Covering his</p>
<p begin="05:21:24.878" end="05:21:28.718" style="s2">ears, Vanil told her that if she still</p>
<p begin="05:21:26.798" end="05:21:30.798" style="s2">had enough energy to scream, she should</p>
<p begin="05:21:28.718" end="05:21:32.638" style="s2">use it to help stop their enemy instead.</p>
<p begin="05:21:30.798" end="05:21:34.400" style="s2">Lea agreed that they needed to stop him</p>
<p begin="05:21:32.638" end="05:21:36.240" style="s2">immediately. But the real problem was</p>
<p begin="05:21:34.400" end="05:21:38.000" style="s2">that they could not even get close. The</p>
<p begin="05:21:36.240" end="05:21:39.760" style="s2">violent energy surging around their</p>
<p begin="05:21:38.000" end="05:21:41.600" style="s2">enemy combined with the constantly</p>
<p begin="05:21:39.760" end="05:21:43.520" style="s2">shifting ground near him made any</p>
<p begin="05:21:41.600" end="05:21:45.200" style="s2">approach nearly impossible. At that</p>
<p begin="05:21:43.520" end="05:21:47.440" style="s2">moment, their enemy thrust his sword</p>
<p begin="05:21:45.200" end="05:21:49.440" style="s2">into the ground and confidently declared</p>
<p begin="05:21:47.440" end="05:21:51.280" style="s2">that it was already too late. According</p>
<p begin="05:21:49.440" end="05:21:53.840" style="s2">to him, this was where all of them would</p>
<p begin="05:21:51.280" end="05:21:55.600" style="s2">die. Leica&#39;s eyes widened in shock as</p>
<p begin="05:21:53.840" end="05:21:57.920" style="s2">their enemy activated a spell called</p>
<p begin="05:21:55.600" end="05:21:59.760" style="s2">Fallstar. The massive boulder hanging in</p>
<p begin="05:21:57.920" end="05:22:01.840" style="s2">the sky immediately began descending</p>
<p begin="05:21:59.760" end="05:22:03.840" style="s2">toward the Chaos Stone. While Venil and</p>
<p begin="05:22:01.840" end="05:22:05.760" style="s2">the others froze in panic, Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:22:03.840" end="05:22:07.840" style="s2">expression darkened as he slowly raised</p>
<p begin="05:22:05.760" end="05:22:09.600" style="s2">a hand and clenched it into a fist.</p>
<p begin="05:22:07.840" end="05:22:11.440" style="s2">Leica quickly snapped everyone out of</p>
<p begin="05:22:09.600" end="05:22:13.120" style="s2">their shock and ordered them to destroy</p>
<p begin="05:22:11.440" end="05:22:15.200" style="s2">the massive boulder with everything they</p>
<p begin="05:22:13.120" end="05:22:17.280" style="s2">had. Edges poured his aura into his</p>
<p begin="05:22:15.200" end="05:22:19.360" style="s2">sword and prepared to strike. Laya</p>
<p begin="05:22:17.280" end="05:22:21.680" style="s2">gathered her purple aura into her staff.</p>
<p begin="05:22:19.360" end="05:22:23.760" style="s2">Venil and Alan immediately began casting</p>
<p begin="05:22:21.680" end="05:22:25.440" style="s2">powerful wind spells while Sandy and</p>
<p begin="05:22:23.760" end="05:22:27.360" style="s2">Leica finished charging their lightning</p>
<p begin="05:22:25.440" end="05:22:28.878" style="s2">aura techniques. The moment they were</p>
<p begin="05:22:27.360" end="05:22:30.718" style="s2">ready, all of them unleashed their</p>
<p begin="05:22:28.878" end="05:22:32.400" style="s2">attacks simultaneously toward the</p>
<p begin="05:22:30.718" end="05:22:34.560" style="s2">descending boulder. A tremendous</p>
<p begin="05:22:32.400" end="05:22:36.320" style="s2">explosion erupted in the sky. But as the</p>
<p begin="05:22:34.560" end="05:22:38.240" style="s2">smoke cleared, Leica could hardly</p>
<p begin="05:22:36.320" end="05:22:40.080" style="s2">believe what she was seeing. Sandy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:22:38.240" end="05:22:42.000" style="s2">face was equally filled with worry.</p>
<p begin="05:22:40.080" end="05:22:44.240" style="s2">Despite combining all of their strength,</p>
<p begin="05:22:42.000" end="05:22:46.080" style="s2">the boulder remained completely unharmed</p>
<p begin="05:22:44.240" end="05:22:48.000" style="s2">and continued its relentless descent</p>
<p begin="05:22:46.080" end="05:22:49.600" style="s2">toward the chaos stone. Their enemy</p>
<p begin="05:22:48.000" end="05:22:51.920" style="s2">dropped to one knee from exhaustion.</p>
<p begin="05:22:49.600" end="05:22:53.520" style="s2">Yet, a smug smile remained on his face.</p>
<p begin="05:22:51.920" end="05:22:55.040" style="s2">He revealed that he had poured every</p>
<p begin="05:22:53.520" end="05:22:56.958" style="s2">ounce of his power into the spell,</p>
<p begin="05:22:55.040" end="05:22:59.120" style="s2">enough magical energy to reach the level</p>
<p begin="05:22:56.958" end="05:23:01.440" style="s2">of a sevenstar technique. No matter how</p>
<p begin="05:22:59.120" end="05:23:02.718" style="s2">many three-star fighters joined forces,</p>
<p begin="05:23:01.440" end="05:23:04.718" style="s2">they would never be capable of</p>
