<p begin="05:23:10.320" end="05:23:13.840" style="s2">halt the boulders&#39;s descent, but Laya</p>
<p begin="05:23:12.240" end="05:23:15.600" style="s2">quickly noticed that even the combined</p>
<p begin="05:23:13.840" end="05:23:17.200" style="s2">strength of their wind magic was unable</p>
<p begin="05:23:15.600" end="05:23:19.600" style="s2">to stop it. Throughout the entire</p>
<p begin="05:23:17.200" end="05:23:21.600" style="s2">situation, Zeke remained silent as he</p>
<p begin="05:23:19.600" end="05:23:24.080" style="s2">watched everything unfold. Then, a wide</p>
<p begin="05:23:21.600" end="05:23:25.920" style="s2">grin slowly spread across his face as he</p>
<p begin="05:23:24.080" end="05:23:28.080" style="s2">fixed his gaze on the massive boulder</p>
<p begin="05:23:25.920" end="05:23:29.840" style="s2">above. Leica suddenly shouted Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:23:28.080" end="05:23:31.520" style="s2">name in shock when she saw him launch</p>
<p begin="05:23:29.840" end="05:23:33.280" style="s2">himself into the air with explosive</p>
<p begin="05:23:31.520" end="05:23:34.878" style="s2">force, heading directly toward the</p>
<p begin="05:23:33.280" end="05:23:36.798" style="s2">descending boulder. While soaring</p>
<p begin="05:23:34.878" end="05:23:38.798" style="s2">through the air, Zeke realized that with</p>
<p begin="05:23:36.798" end="05:23:40.560" style="s2">his current twostar strength, simply</p>
<p begin="05:23:38.798" end="05:23:42.000" style="s2">throwing aura attacks at the boulder</p>
<p begin="05:23:40.560" end="05:23:44.240" style="s2">would never be enough to completely</p>
<p begin="05:23:42.000" end="05:23:46.080" style="s2">destroy it. As far as he was concerned,</p>
<p begin="05:23:44.240" end="05:23:48.320" style="s2">the simplest solution was to punch it</p>
<p begin="05:23:46.080" end="05:23:50.160" style="s2">directly. Golden aura erupted around his</p>
<p begin="05:23:48.320" end="05:23:52.080" style="s2">fist as he threw a powerful punch into</p>
<p begin="05:23:50.160" end="05:23:54.320" style="s2">the boulder. The impact only managed to</p>
<p begin="05:23:52.080" end="05:23:56.000" style="s2">leave a scratch. Even so, Zeke burst</p>
<p begin="05:23:54.320" end="05:23:58.000" style="s2">into loud laughter. He knew that with</p>
<p begin="05:23:56.000" end="05:23:59.760" style="s2">his current body, his own fists would</p>
<p begin="05:23:58.000" end="05:24:01.360" style="s2">probably break before the boulder did.</p>
<p begin="05:23:59.760" end="05:24:03.280" style="s2">Yet, that thought never crossed his mind</p>
<p begin="05:24:01.360" end="05:24:05.600" style="s2">as a reason to stop again. and he</p>
<p begin="05:24:03.280" end="05:24:07.280" style="s2">punched the same spot and then again and</p>
<p begin="05:24:05.600" end="05:24:09.360" style="s2">again. Each strike landed with</p>
<p begin="05:24:07.280" end="05:24:11.520" style="s2">overwhelming force as he relentlessly</p>
<p begin="05:24:09.360" end="05:24:13.920" style="s2">targeted the exact same point. As the</p>
<p begin="05:24:11.520" end="05:24:15.680" style="s2">barrage continued, Zeke finally noticed</p>
<p begin="05:24:13.920" end="05:24:17.280" style="s2">visible damage spreading through the</p>
<p begin="05:24:15.680" end="05:24:19.360" style="s2">massive structure, letting out a</p>
<p begin="05:24:17.280" end="05:24:21.200" style="s2">thunderous roar, he gathered every ounce</p>
<p begin="05:24:19.360" end="05:24:23.520" style="s2">of strength remaining in his body and</p>
<p begin="05:24:21.200" end="05:24:25.680" style="s2">unleashed another devastating punch. His</p>
<p begin="05:24:23.520" end="05:24:27.600" style="s2">aura surged wildly as blood rushed</p>
<p begin="05:24:25.680" end="05:24:29.440" style="s2">through his veins. Under the relentless</p>
<p begin="05:24:27.600" end="05:24:31.040" style="s2">assault, cracks spread throughout the</p>
<p begin="05:24:29.440" end="05:24:33.120" style="s2">boulder before its structure finally</p>
<p begin="05:24:31.040" end="05:24:35.120" style="s2">began collapsing. Their enemy, still</p>
<p begin="05:24:33.120" end="05:24:36.638" style="s2">kneeling and clutching his chest, could</p>
<p begin="05:24:35.120" end="05:24:38.958" style="s2">not believe what he was witnessing.</p>
<p begin="05:24:36.638" end="05:24:40.878" style="s2">Without hesitation, Zeke activated world</p>
<p begin="05:24:38.958" end="05:24:42.958" style="s2">crumbling strike in his right hand and</p>
<p begin="05:24:40.878" end="05:24:44.560" style="s2">world bursting strike in his left. By</p>
<p begin="05:24:42.958" end="05:24:46.320" style="s2">combining both techniques, he</p>
<p begin="05:24:44.560" end="05:24:48.400" style="s2">successfully unleashed the second form</p>
<p begin="05:24:46.320" end="05:24:50.240" style="s2">of the dragon destruction combat arts.</p>
<p begin="05:24:48.400" end="05:24:52.160" style="s2">Declaring that this would be the end, he</p>
<p begin="05:24:50.240" end="05:24:54.400" style="s2">launched the world annihilating string.</p>
<p begin="05:24:52.160" end="05:24:56.560" style="s2">The instant the attack exploded outward,</p>
<p begin="05:24:54.400" end="05:24:58.240" style="s2">a violent surge of aura erupted across</p>
<p begin="05:24:56.560" end="05:25:00.240" style="s2">the surrounding area. The massive</p>
<p begin="05:24:58.240" end="05:25:02.320" style="s2">boulder was completely obliterated, and</p>
<p begin="05:25:00.240" end="05:25:03.680" style="s2">at the same moment, Zeke finally broke</p>
<p begin="05:25:02.320" end="05:25:05.600" style="s2">through and reached the three-star</p>
<p begin="05:25:03.680" end="05:25:07.120" style="s2">level. Meanwhile, the eyes of his</p>
<p begin="05:25:05.600" end="05:25:08.320" style="s2">companions nearly popped out of their</p>
<p begin="05:25:07.120" end="05:25:10.320" style="s2">sockets as they witnessed the</p>
<p begin="05:25:08.320" end="05:25:12.480" style="s2">impossible. The same massive boulder</p>
<p begin="05:25:10.320" end="05:25:14.400" style="s2">that had remained untouched despite all</p>
<p begin="05:25:12.480" end="05:25:16.480" style="s2">of their combined attacks had been</p>
<p begin="05:25:14.400" end="05:25:18.400" style="s2">completely destroyed by Zeke alone.</p>
<p begin="05:25:16.480" end="05:25:20.160" style="s2">However, Leica&#39;s shock quickly turned</p>
<p begin="05:25:18.400" end="05:25:21.760" style="s2">into alarm when she noticed countless</p>
<p begin="05:25:20.160" end="05:25:23.920" style="s2">fragments from the shattered boulder</p>
<p begin="05:25:21.760" end="05:25:25.360" style="s2">falling toward the chaos stone. Edgis</p>
<p begin="05:25:23.920" end="05:25:27.440" style="s2">immediately sprinted forward while</p>
<p begin="05:25:25.360" end="05:25:29.440" style="s2">calling Veneil&#39;s name. Venil answered</p>
<p begin="05:25:27.440" end="05:25:31.040" style="s2">without hesitation and declared that he</p>
<p begin="05:25:29.440" end="05:25:32.718" style="s2">would find a way to deal with it.</p>
<p begin="05:25:31.040" end="05:25:34.798" style="s2">Working together with Allan, they</p>
<p begin="05:25:32.718" end="05:25:37.120" style="s2">surrounded the chaos stone with powerful</p>
<p begin="05:25:34.798" end="05:25:38.718" style="s2">wind aura, creating a protective barrier</p>
<p begin="05:25:37.120" end="05:25:40.400" style="s2">against the falling debris. After</p>
<p begin="05:25:38.718" end="05:25:42.638" style="s2">securing the chaos stone&#39;s immediate</p>
<p begin="05:25:40.400" end="05:25:44.638" style="s2">safety, Venil told Edges to handle the</p>
<p begin="05:25:42.638" end="05:25:46.160" style="s2">rest. While running, Edges gathered</p>
<p begin="05:25:44.638" end="05:25:48.240" style="s2">momentum before launching himself into</p>
<p begin="05:25:46.160" end="05:25:50.000" style="s2">the air toward the Chaos Stone. Golden</p>
<p begin="05:25:48.240" end="05:25:51.840" style="s2">aura wrapped around his sword as he</p>
<p begin="05:25:50.000" end="05:25:53.680" style="s2">prepared one of his secret techniques.</p>
<p begin="05:25:51.840" end="05:25:55.440" style="s2">With all his strength, he struck one of</p>
<p begin="05:25:53.680" end="05:25:57.760" style="s2">the largest pieces of debris falling</p>
<p begin="05:25:55.440" end="05:26:00.000" style="s2">toward the Chaos Stone. To his surprise,</p>
<p begin="05:25:57.760" end="05:26:01.840" style="s2">his sword snapped apart. As he stared at</p>
<p begin="05:26:00.000" end="05:26:03.520" style="s2">the broken weapon, Edges could only</p>
<p begin="05:26:01.840" end="05:26:05.520" style="s2">realize that he still had a very long</p>
<p begin="05:26:03.520" end="05:26:07.440" style="s2">way to go. While the others continued</p>
<p begin="05:26:05.520" end="05:26:09.440" style="s2">protecting the Chaos Stone, their</p>
<p begin="05:26:07.440" end="05:26:11.360" style="s2">five-star enemy remained unable to</p>
<p begin="05:26:09.440" end="05:26:13.360" style="s2">comprehend the reality before him.</p>
<p begin="05:26:11.360" end="05:26:15.120" style="s2">Despite everything he had sacrificed,</p>
<p begin="05:26:13.360" end="05:26:17.440" style="s2">Zeke had still managed to destroy</p>
<p begin="05:26:15.120" end="05:26:19.280" style="s2">Fallstar. Zeke calmly walked toward the</p>
<p begin="05:26:17.440" end="05:26:21.200" style="s2">defeated enemy and declared that he was</p>
<p begin="05:26:19.280" end="05:26:23.200" style="s2">now the only remaining problem standing</p>
<p begin="05:26:21.200" end="05:26:24.718" style="s2">in their way. Crossing his arms, he</p>
<p begin="05:26:23.200" end="05:26:26.560" style="s2">casually asked what he planned to do</p>
<p begin="05:26:24.718" end="05:26:28.320" style="s2">next. The enemy pulled his sword from</p>
<p begin="05:26:26.560" end="05:26:30.080" style="s2">the ground and stated that the answer</p>
<p begin="05:26:28.320" end="05:26:31.680" style="s2">should be obvious. Gathering every bit</p>
<p begin="05:26:30.080" end="05:26:33.360" style="s2">of strength he had left, he launched</p>
<p begin="05:26:31.680" end="05:26:34.798" style="s2">himself forward and declared that he</p>
<p begin="05:26:33.360" end="05:26:36.160" style="s2">would carry out his mission until the</p>
<p begin="05:26:34.798" end="05:26:38.480" style="s2">very end. Impressed by his</p>
<p begin="05:26:36.160" end="05:26:40.000" style="s2">determination, Zeke clenched his fist.</p>
<p begin="05:26:38.480" end="05:26:42.240" style="s2">Before the enemy&#39;s attack could even</p>
<p begin="05:26:40.000" end="05:26:44.320" style="s2">land, Zeke drove a devastating punch</p>
<p begin="05:26:42.240" end="05:26:46.080" style="s2">directly into his chest. Blood erupted</p>
<p begin="05:26:44.320" end="05:26:47.520" style="s2">from the enemy&#39;s mouth. His eyes</p>
<p begin="05:26:46.080" end="05:26:49.760" style="s2">immediately turned white from the</p>
<p begin="05:26:47.520" end="05:26:51.440" style="s2">overwhelming impact. As his life faded</p>
<p begin="05:26:49.760" end="05:26:53.040" style="s2">away, he admitted that he could not</p>
<p begin="05:26:51.440" end="05:26:55.040" style="s2">believe there had been a dragon hiding</p>
<p begin="05:26:53.040" end="05:26:56.958" style="s2">among mere lizards. Watching his</p>
<p begin="05:26:55.040" end="05:26:58.958" style="s2">opponent fall, Zeke acknowledged that</p>
<p begin="05:26:56.958" end="05:27:01.200" style="s2">the way he continued standing until the</p>
<p begin="05:26:58.958" end="05:27:03.360" style="s2">very end was truly admirable. After the</p>
<p begin="05:27:01.200" end="05:27:05.360" style="s2">chaos stone had been secured, Leica and</p>
<p begin="05:27:03.360" end="05:27:07.360" style="s2">the others immediately ran toward Zeke.</p>
<p begin="05:27:05.360" end="05:27:09.040" style="s2">Leica quickly asked if he was all right,</p>
<p begin="05:27:07.360" end="05:27:11.200" style="s2">only for Zeke to answer as though the</p>
<p begin="05:27:09.040" end="05:27:12.878" style="s2">question itself was ridiculous. Edges</p>
<p begin="05:27:11.200" end="05:27:15.040" style="s2">smiled and admitted that he never</p>
<p begin="05:27:12.878" end="05:27:17.360" style="s2">expected even Zeke to defeat a five-star</p>
<p begin="05:27:15.040" end="05:27:19.120" style="s2">opponent. Venil, wearing an annoyed</p>
<p begin="05:27:17.360" end="05:27:20.958" style="s2">expression, reminded everyone that</p>
<p begin="05:27:19.120" end="05:27:23.200" style="s2">worrying about Zeke had always been a</p>
<p begin="05:27:20.958" end="05:27:25.520" style="s2">waste of time. At the same time, he</p>
<p begin="05:27:23.200" end="05:27:27.040" style="s2">agreed that Zeke was completely insane.</p>
<p begin="05:27:25.520" end="05:27:28.878" style="s2">Allan then pointed out that if he</p>
<p begin="05:27:27.040" end="05:27:30.718" style="s2">remembered correctly, Zeke had only been</p>
<p begin="05:27:28.878" end="05:27:32.798" style="s2">at the two star level when he fought the</p>
<p begin="05:27:30.718" end="05:27:34.558" style="s2">five-star enemy. Upon realizing that he</p>
<p begin="05:27:32.798" end="05:27:36.638" style="s2">had now reached the three-star level,</p>
<p begin="05:27:34.558" end="05:27:38.558" style="s2">the entire group fell silent. The</p>
<p begin="05:27:36.638" end="05:27:40.958" style="s2">realization only made Zeke seem even</p>
<p begin="05:27:38.558" end="05:27:42.798" style="s2">more monstrous. Laya congratulated him</p>
<p begin="05:27:40.958" end="05:27:44.558" style="s2">on reaching the next rank. Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:27:42.798" end="05:27:46.320" style="s2">admitted that she finally understood why</p>
<p begin="05:27:44.558" end="05:27:48.320" style="s2">everyone called him a monster. In</p>
<p begin="05:27:46.320" end="05:27:50.400" style="s2">response, Zeke simply complained that</p>
<p begin="05:27:48.320" end="05:27:52.000" style="s2">they were being rude. He then smiled and</p>
<p begin="05:27:50.400" end="05:27:53.440" style="s2">praised everyone for fighting well,</p>
<p begin="05:27:52.000" end="05:27:55.520" style="s2">telling them that he was proud of all</p>
<p begin="05:27:53.440" end="05:27:57.440" style="s2">their efforts. At that moment, the birds</p>
<p begin="05:27:55.520" end="05:27:59.280" style="s2">let out a series of cheerful chirps to</p>
<p begin="05:27:57.440" end="05:28:01.120" style="s2">grab his attention. Zeke immediately</p>
<p begin="05:27:59.280" end="05:28:03.440" style="s2">praised them as well and told them that</p>
<p begin="05:28:01.120" end="05:28:05.120" style="s2">their training had clearly paid off. Lea</p>
<p begin="05:28:03.440" end="05:28:06.878" style="s2">approached the birds and admitted that</p>
<p begin="05:28:05.120" end="05:28:08.558" style="s2">she did not know much about them, but</p>
<p begin="05:28:06.878" end="05:28:10.638" style="s2">she sincerely thanked them for holding</p>
<p begin="05:28:08.558" end="05:28:12.558" style="s2">back the monsters so everyone else could</p>
<p begin="05:28:10.638" end="05:28:14.160" style="s2">focus on defeating their enemy. Gently</p>
<p begin="05:28:12.558" end="05:28:16.160" style="s2">patting one of the birds on the head,</p>
<p begin="05:28:14.160" end="05:28:18.400" style="s2">she offered her heartfelt gratitude.</p>
<p begin="05:28:16.160" end="05:28:20.000" style="s2">Meanwhile, Edges remained silent as he</p>
<p begin="05:28:18.400" end="05:28:22.480" style="s2">stared at the corpse of the five-star</p>
<p begin="05:28:20.000" end="05:28:24.718" style="s2">enemy. Eventually, he noticed a necklace</p>
<p begin="05:28:22.480" end="05:28:26.638" style="s2">hanging around the man&#39;s neck. Curious,</p>
<p begin="05:28:24.718" end="05:28:28.878" style="s2">he approached and picked it up. After</p>
<p begin="05:28:26.638" end="05:28:30.798" style="s2">examining it closely, he realized it was</p>
<p begin="05:28:28.878" end="05:28:32.480" style="s2">actually a dog tag. When Edges revealed</p>
<p begin="05:28:30.798" end="05:28:35.280" style="s2">that the name engraved on it was Jack</p>
<p begin="05:28:32.480" end="05:28:36.958" style="s2">Rock, Sandy reacted with surprise as she</p>
<p begin="05:28:35.280" end="05:28:38.400" style="s2">repeated the name. She explained that</p>
<p begin="05:28:36.958" end="05:28:40.718" style="s2">she had once heard her father mention</p>
<p begin="05:28:38.400" end="05:28:42.000" style="s2">Jack Rock before. According to him, Jack</p>
<p begin="05:28:40.718" end="05:28:43.920" style="s2">Rock was an elite member of the</p>
<p begin="05:28:42.000" end="05:28:46.000" style="s2">Kerberous family and was known by the</p>
<p begin="05:28:43.920" end="05:28:47.600" style="s2">nickname the Hound. Sandy immediately</p>
<p begin="05:28:46.000" end="05:28:49.040" style="s2">shouted again as she realized the</p>
<p begin="05:28:47.600" end="05:28:50.798" style="s2">implication. That meant they had</p>
<p begin="05:28:49.040" end="05:28:52.320" style="s2">actually defeated him. Veneil found it</p>
<p begin="05:28:50.798" end="05:28:53.680" style="s2">difficult to believe that someone on a</p>
<p begin="05:28:52.320" end="05:28:55.280" style="s2">covert mission would carry</p>
<p begin="05:28:53.680" end="05:28:57.360" style="s2">identification that could easily reveal</p>
<p begin="05:28:55.280" end="05:28:58.878" style="s2">his identity. Laya questioned whether</p>
<p begin="05:28:57.360" end="05:29:00.718" style="s2">their enemies could really be that</p>
<p begin="05:28:58.878" end="05:29:02.638" style="s2">careless. Edgis offered a different</p>
<p begin="05:29:00.718" end="05:29:04.320" style="s2">explanation. Perhaps it simply never</p>
<p begin="05:29:02.638" end="05:29:06.638" style="s2">occurred to them that they might lose.</p>
<p begin="05:29:04.320" end="05:29:08.160" style="s2">When Vanil asked why, Edges explained</p>
<p begin="05:29:06.638" end="05:29:09.920" style="s2">further. The rift only allowed</p>
<p begin="05:29:08.160" end="05:29:11.760" style="s2">individuals up to the three-star level</p>
<p begin="05:29:09.920" end="05:29:14.000" style="s2">to enter, yet their enemies had still</p>
<p begin="05:29:11.760" end="05:29:16.240" style="s2">sent multiple four-star fighters along</p>
<p begin="05:29:14.000" end="05:29:17.840" style="s2">with an elite five-star combatant. They</p>
<p begin="05:29:16.240" end="05:29:19.840" style="s2">probably never imagined there was any</p>
<p begin="05:29:17.840" end="05:29:21.600" style="s2">possibility of being defeated. Leica</p>
<p begin="05:29:19.840" end="05:29:23.360" style="s2">agreed with the assessment. The enemy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:29:21.600" end="05:29:25.520" style="s2">plan had clearly been to erase them</p>
<p begin="05:29:23.360" end="05:29:27.520" style="s2">completely inside the rift. They simply</p>
<p begin="05:29:25.520" end="05:29:29.760" style="s2">never expected their strength to exceed</p>
<p begin="05:29:27.520" end="05:29:31.520" style="s2">all expectations. Although, as she</p>
<p begin="05:29:29.760" end="05:29:33.920" style="s2">pointed out, most of that credit</p>
<p begin="05:29:31.520" end="05:29:36.000" style="s2">belonged to Zeke. Zeke, however, brushed</p>
<p begin="05:29:33.920" end="05:29:37.600" style="s2">aside the praise. He admitted there were</p>
<p begin="05:29:36.000" end="05:29:39.360" style="s2">many things they could reflect on after</p>
<p begin="05:29:37.600" end="05:29:41.200" style="s2">the battle. But in the end, it had been</p>
<p begin="05:29:39.360" end="05:29:43.120" style="s2">a splendid fight, and everyone had</p>
<p begin="05:29:41.200" end="05:29:44.718" style="s2">performed admirably. As he hugged the</p>
<p begin="05:29:43.120" end="05:29:45.840" style="s2">birds, he asked whether they were</p>
<p begin="05:29:44.718" end="05:29:47.600" style="s2">finally finished with all the</p>
<p begin="05:29:45.840" end="05:29:49.440" style="s2">complicated discussions. Instead of</p>
<p begin="05:29:47.600" end="05:29:51.680" style="s2">answering immediately, everyone fell</p>
<p begin="05:29:49.440" end="05:29:53.920" style="s2">silent for a moment. Eventually, Venil</p>
<p begin="05:29:51.680" end="05:29:55.520" style="s2">remarked that Zeke, a person who solved</p>
<p begin="05:29:53.920" end="05:29:57.600" style="s2">every problem by crushing it with</p>
<p begin="05:29:55.520" end="05:29:59.440" style="s2">overwhelming force, was probably the</p>
<p begin="05:29:57.600" end="05:30:00.958" style="s2">absolute worst opponent their enemies</p>
<p begin="05:29:59.440" end="05:30:02.718" style="s2">could have encountered. Leica then</p>
<p begin="05:30:00.958" end="05:30:04.558" style="s2">admitted that despite their victory,</p>
<p begin="05:30:02.718" end="05:30:06.320" style="s2">they had experienced quite a few close</p>
<p begin="05:30:04.558" end="05:30:07.840" style="s2">calls. She wondered how they were</p>
<p begin="05:30:06.320" end="05:30:09.680" style="s2">supposed to leave the rift now.</p>
<p begin="05:30:07.840" end="05:30:11.440" style="s2">Suddenly, Zeke rushed toward her and</p>
<p begin="05:30:09.680" end="05:30:13.360" style="s2">asked everyone to wait. According to</p>
<p begin="05:30:11.440" end="05:30:15.280" style="s2">him, there was still one important thing</p>
<p begin="05:30:13.360" end="05:30:16.958" style="s2">left for them to do. Leica immediately</p>
<p begin="05:30:15.280" end="05:30:18.958" style="s2">asked if she had forgotten something.</p>
<p begin="05:30:16.958" end="05:30:20.958" style="s2">Zeke confirmed that she had. With a</p>
<p begin="05:30:18.958" end="05:30:22.400" style="s2">mischievous grin, he reminded everyone</p>
<p begin="05:30:20.958" end="05:30:24.558" style="s2">that they still needed to drink the</p>
<p begin="05:30:22.400" end="05:30:26.320" style="s2">magic water before leaving. A small note</p>
<p begin="05:30:24.558" end="05:30:28.638" style="s2">regarding the dragon destruction combat</p>
<p begin="05:30:26.320" end="05:30:30.160" style="s2">arts. This martial art is considered the</p>
<p begin="05:30:28.638" end="05:30:32.320" style="s2">strongest technique possessed by the</p>
<p begin="05:30:30.160" end="05:30:34.160" style="s2">heads of the Eldreon family. Originally</p>
<p begin="05:30:32.320" end="05:30:36.320" style="s2">named after the feat of slaying a divine</p>
<p begin="05:30:34.160" end="05:30:38.558" style="s2">dragon, it has been passed down from one</p>
<p begin="05:30:36.320" end="05:30:40.480" style="s2">family head to the next for generations.</p>
<p begin="05:30:38.558" end="05:30:42.400" style="s2">However, its difficulty is so extreme</p>
<p begin="05:30:40.480" end="05:30:44.878" style="s2">that only the current family head,</p>
<p begin="05:30:42.400" end="05:30:47.200" style="s2">Gilus, and the 15th head have ever</p>
<p begin="05:30:44.878" end="05:30:48.958" style="s2">completely mastered it. In reality, the</p>
<p begin="05:30:47.200" end="05:30:51.360" style="s2">version currently inherited by the</p>
<p begin="05:30:48.958" end="05:30:53.760" style="s2">family is a refined form created by the</p>
<p begin="05:30:51.360" end="05:30:55.760" style="s2">15th head specifically to ensure that</p>
<p begin="05:30:53.760" end="05:30:58.000" style="s2">future descendants would be capable of</p>
<p begin="05:30:55.760" end="05:31:00.320" style="s2">learning it. The art consists of forms 1</p>
<p begin="05:30:58.000" end="05:31:02.400" style="s2">through four, a special form and a final</p>
<p begin="05:31:00.320" end="05:31:04.000" style="s2">form. The first form specializes in</p>
<p begin="05:31:02.400" end="05:31:05.840" style="s2">delivering overwhelming destructive</p>
<p begin="05:31:04.000" end="05:31:07.920" style="s2">power through a single strike, while the</p>
<p begin="05:31:05.840" end="05:31:10.160" style="s2">second form focuses on unleashing rapid</p>
<p begin="05:31:07.920" end="05:31:12.000" style="s2">and continuous attacks. Leica was</p>
<p begin="05:31:10.160" end="05:31:13.680" style="s2">completely bewildered by what Zeke meant</p>
<p begin="05:31:12.000" end="05:31:15.760" style="s2">as all of them stared at the bottles of</p>
<p begin="05:31:13.680" end="05:31:17.280" style="s2">magic water lying before them. Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:31:15.760" end="05:31:19.040" style="s2">asked what exactly Zeke was talking</p>
<p begin="05:31:17.280" end="05:31:21.040" style="s2">about. Instead of answering directly,</p>
<p begin="05:31:19.040" end="05:31:22.878" style="s2">however, Zeke simply asked whether what</p>
<p begin="05:31:21.040" end="05:31:24.878" style="s2">he had said was really that shocking.</p>
<p begin="05:31:22.878" end="05:31:26.798" style="s2">Sandy immediately admitted that it was,</p>
<p begin="05:31:24.878" end="05:31:28.320" style="s2">while Edges and Laya questioned whether</p>
<p begin="05:31:26.798" end="05:31:30.400" style="s2">Zeke had already forgotten the purpose</p>
<p begin="05:31:28.320" end="05:31:31.680" style="s2">of their mission. Zeke calmly replied</p>
<p begin="05:31:30.400" end="05:31:33.520" style="s2">that he remembered their mission</p>
<p begin="05:31:31.680" end="05:31:35.200" style="s2">perfectly well. They had come to obtain</p>
<p begin="05:31:33.520" end="05:31:37.760" style="s2">the magic water and close the special</p>
<p begin="05:31:35.200" end="05:31:39.760" style="s2">rift. Leica quickly agreed, saying that</p>
<p begin="05:31:37.760" end="05:31:41.520" style="s2">was exactly their objective and pointed</p>
<p begin="05:31:39.760" end="05:31:43.600" style="s2">out that drinking the magic water was</p>
<p begin="05:31:41.520" end="05:31:45.680" style="s2">obviously out of the question. However,</p>
<p begin="05:31:43.600" end="05:31:47.360" style="s2">she was left speechless when Zeke asked</p>
<p begin="05:31:45.680" end="05:31:49.040" style="s2">who had actually decided that they were</p>
<p begin="05:31:47.360" end="05:31:51.040" style="s2">forbidden from drinking it. Without</p>
<p begin="05:31:49.040" end="05:31:52.558" style="s2">hesitation, Zeke picked up one of the</p>
<p begin="05:31:51.040" end="05:31:53.920" style="s2">bottles and explained that although they</p>
<p begin="05:31:52.558" end="05:31:55.600" style="s2">had entered the rift because of the</p>
<p begin="05:31:53.920" end="05:31:57.200" style="s2">family&#39;s mission, they were the ones who</p>
<p begin="05:31:55.600" end="05:31:59.440" style="s2">had risked their lives to obtain the</p>
<p begin="05:31:57.200" end="05:32:01.520" style="s2">magic water. Whatever the Lragon family</p>
<p begin="05:31:59.440" end="05:32:03.520" style="s2">wanted had nothing to do with that fact,</p>
<p begin="05:32:01.520" end="05:32:05.520" style="s2">because they alone had fought for it and</p>
<p begin="05:32:03.520" end="05:32:07.200" style="s2">finally claimed it. Simply handing it</p>
<p begin="05:32:05.520" end="05:32:08.958" style="s2">over because it was the mission sounded</p>
<p begin="05:32:07.200" end="05:32:10.958" style="s2">strange to him, and he wondered if the</p>
<p begin="05:32:08.958" end="05:32:12.718" style="s2">others truly agreed with that logic.</p>
<p begin="05:32:10.958" end="05:32:14.638" style="s2">Alan responded by reminding everyone</p>
<p begin="05:32:12.718" end="05:32:16.878" style="s2">that the magic water, which could create</p>
<p begin="05:32:14.638" end="05:32:19.040" style="s2">more mages, was an incredibly valuable</p>
<p begin="05:32:16.878" end="05:32:20.878" style="s2">treasure to the Elragon family. Because</p>
<p begin="05:32:19.040" end="05:32:22.638" style="s2">of that, they could not simply act on</p>
<p begin="05:32:20.878" end="05:32:24.718" style="s2">their own, or they would risk provoking</p>
<p begin="05:32:22.638" end="05:32:26.558" style="s2">the wrath of the family head. Veneil</p>
<p begin="05:32:24.718" end="05:32:27.920" style="s2">agreed with Alan and added that if they</p>
<p begin="05:32:26.558" end="05:32:29.600" style="s2">drank the magic water without</p>
<p begin="05:32:27.920" end="05:32:31.360" style="s2">permission, there was no telling what</p>
<p begin="05:32:29.600" end="05:32:33.280" style="s2">kind of punishment awaited them. In the</p>
<p begin="05:32:31.360" end="05:32:35.440" style="s2">worst case scenario, they could even be</p>
<p begin="05:32:33.280" end="05:32:36.958" style="s2">executed. Zeke merely tossed the bottle</p>
<p begin="05:32:35.440" end="05:32:38.638" style="s2">lightly in his hand before saying that</p>
<p begin="05:32:36.958" end="05:32:41.280" style="s2">none of that was his concern. In the</p>
<p begin="05:32:38.638" end="05:32:42.878" style="s2">Lragon family, strength was everything.</p>
<p begin="05:32:41.280" end="05:32:44.798" style="s2">So, what could possibly be wrong with</p>
<p begin="05:32:42.878" end="05:32:47.040" style="s2">pursuing a new form of power known as</p>
<p begin="05:32:44.798" end="05:32:48.718" style="s2">magic? Edges admitted that Zeke had a</p>
<p begin="05:32:47.040" end="05:32:50.400" style="s2">point, but reminded everyone that</p>
<p begin="05:32:48.718" end="05:32:51.840" style="s2">without this mission, they never would</p>
<p begin="05:32:50.400" end="05:32:53.920" style="s2">have been allowed to enter the special</p>
<p begin="05:32:51.840" end="05:32:55.840" style="s2">rift in the first place. Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="05:32:53.920" end="05:32:58.080" style="s2">brushed that argument aside. If the</p>
<p begin="05:32:55.840" end="05:32:59.840" style="s2">family wanted the magic water so badly,</p>
<p begin="05:32:58.080" end="05:33:01.520" style="s2">then the family head himself should have</p>
<p begin="05:32:59.840" end="05:33:03.280" style="s2">come to retrieve it instead of relying</p>
<p begin="05:33:01.520" end="05:33:04.718" style="s2">on them. Zeke reminded everyone that</p>
<p begin="05:33:03.280" end="05:33:06.638" style="s2">their mission had been to clear the</p>
<p begin="05:33:04.718" end="05:33:08.718" style="s2">special rift and recover the magic</p>
<p begin="05:33:06.638" end="05:33:10.240" style="s2">water. depending entirely on them to</p>
<p begin="05:33:08.718" end="05:33:12.558" style="s2">accomplish something the family head</p>
<p begin="05:33:10.240" end="05:33:14.638" style="s2">himself could not was proof of Balls&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:33:12.558" end="05:33:16.798" style="s2">own limitations. If the family head</p>
<p begin="05:33:14.638" end="05:33:18.000" style="s2">truly desired the magic water that much,</p>
<p begin="05:33:16.798" end="05:33:19.760" style="s2">then he should have possessed the</p>
<p begin="05:33:18.000" end="05:33:21.520" style="s2">strength to accomplish the impossible</p>
<p begin="05:33:19.760" end="05:33:23.440" style="s2">himself. The very fact that he had</p>
<p begin="05:33:21.520" end="05:33:25.200" style="s2">failed to do so meant that without them,</p>
<p begin="05:33:23.440" end="05:33:26.878" style="s2">Balls never would have had any chance of</p>
<p begin="05:33:25.200" end="05:33:29.120" style="s2">obtaining the magic water in the first</p>
<p begin="05:33:26.878" end="05:33:31.280" style="s2">place. A wide grin spread across Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:33:29.120" end="05:33:32.958" style="s2">face as he pointed out one final detail.</p>
<p begin="05:33:31.280" end="05:33:34.718" style="s2">Their mission was simply to recover the</p>
<p begin="05:33:32.958" end="05:33:36.240" style="s2">magic water. Nobody had ever</p>
<p begin="05:33:34.718" end="05:33:38.240" style="s2">specifically ordered them not to drink</p>
<p begin="05:33:36.240" end="05:33:40.080" style="s2">it. Since no one had clearly explained</p>
<p begin="05:33:38.240" end="05:33:41.680" style="s2">how the recovery was supposed to happen,</p>
<p begin="05:33:40.080" end="05:33:43.760" style="s2">they could simply claim that they had</p>
<p begin="05:33:41.680" end="05:33:46.080" style="s2">recovered it by drinking it themselves.</p>
<p begin="05:33:43.760" end="05:33:48.320" style="s2">To him, it was as simple as that. Leica</p>
<p begin="05:33:46.080" end="05:33:50.080" style="s2">stared at Zeke in disbelief. Unable to</p>
<p begin="05:33:48.320" end="05:33:51.680" style="s2">understand what he was implying, while</p>
<p begin="05:33:50.080" end="05:33:53.200" style="s2">Sandy complained that he was clearly</p>
<p begin="05:33:51.680" end="05:33:55.200" style="s2">twisting the meaning of the mission,</p>
<p begin="05:33:53.200" end="05:33:57.120" style="s2">Zeke simply replied that if the family</p>
<p begin="05:33:55.200" end="05:33:58.798" style="s2">wanted to avoid loopholes, then they</p>
<p begin="05:33:57.120" end="05:34:00.558" style="s2">should have made their orders absolutely</p>
<p begin="05:33:58.798" end="05:34:02.160" style="s2">clear from the very beginning. Perhaps</p>
<p begin="05:34:00.558" end="05:34:04.320" style="s2">this would serve as a valuable lesson</p>
<p begin="05:34:02.160" end="05:34:05.920" style="s2">for the adults as well. Finally, he</p>
<p begin="05:34:04.320" end="05:34:07.840" style="s2">asked everyone whether they truly</p>
<p begin="05:34:05.920" end="05:34:09.520" style="s2">intended to let such a rare opportunity</p>
<p begin="05:34:07.840" end="05:34:11.680" style="s2">to become stronger slip through their</p>
<p begin="05:34:09.520" end="05:34:13.520" style="s2">fingers, leaving the decision entirely</p>
<p begin="05:34:11.680" end="05:34:15.760" style="s2">up to them. Holding one of the bottles</p>
<p begin="05:34:13.520" end="05:34:17.600" style="s2">tightly, Lea quietly fell into deep</p>
<p begin="05:34:15.760" end="05:34:19.200" style="s2">thought. If they chose not to drink the</p>
<p begin="05:34:17.600" end="05:34:21.280" style="s2">magic water here, then the chance to</p>
<p begin="05:34:19.200" end="05:34:23.200" style="s2">become a mage might never come again, or</p>
<p begin="05:34:21.280" end="05:34:24.718" style="s2">at the very least, it could take many</p>
<p begin="05:34:23.200" end="05:34:26.718" style="s2">years before another opportunity</p>
<p begin="05:34:24.718" end="05:34:28.480" style="s2">appeared. On the other hand, if they</p>
<p begin="05:34:26.718" end="05:34:30.240" style="s2">faithfully completed the mission and</p>
<p begin="05:34:28.480" end="05:34:32.160" style="s2">brought the bottles back, the magic</p>
<p begin="05:34:30.240" end="05:34:34.240" style="s2">water would undoubtedly be given only to</p>
<p begin="05:34:32.160" end="05:34:36.080" style="s2">the elite members of the Lragon family</p>
<p begin="05:34:34.240" end="05:34:37.840" style="s2">rather than to them. Yet, if they drank</p>
<p begin="05:34:36.080" end="05:34:39.600" style="s2">it now and the family head discovered</p>
<p begin="05:34:37.840" end="05:34:41.920" style="s2">what they had done, they would surely</p>
<p begin="05:34:39.600" end="05:34:44.000" style="s2">suffer severe consequences. As Leica</p>
<p begin="05:34:41.920" end="05:34:45.600" style="s2">slowly turned her head toward Zeke, she</p>
<p begin="05:34:44.000" end="05:34:47.520" style="s2">saw him smiling back at her with</p>
<p begin="05:34:45.600" end="05:34:49.280" style="s2">complete confidence. She could not help</p>
<p begin="05:34:47.520" end="05:34:51.280" style="s2">but remember the mysterious strength he</p>
<p begin="05:34:49.280" end="05:34:53.680" style="s2">had displayed time and time again.</p>
<p begin="05:34:51.280" end="05:34:55.760" style="s2">Perhaps if she drank the magic water,</p>
<p begin="05:34:53.680" end="05:34:57.440" style="s2">she too might someday obtain power like</p>
<p begin="05:34:55.760" end="05:34:59.360" style="s2">his. Without another moment of</p>
<p begin="05:34:57.440" end="05:35:01.200" style="s2">hesitation, Leica declared that she</p>
<p begin="05:34:59.360" end="05:35:03.040" style="s2">wanted to become stronger as well. And</p>
<p begin="05:35:01.200" end="05:35:05.440" style="s2">because of that, she had decided to</p>
<p begin="05:35:03.040" end="05:35:07.360" style="s2">drink the magic water right there. Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:35:05.440" end="05:35:09.200" style="s2">was completely stunned by Leica&#39;s sudden</p>
<p begin="05:35:07.360" end="05:35:11.520" style="s2">announcement and nervously asked whether</p>
<p begin="05:35:09.200" end="05:35:13.520" style="s2">she was truly serious. Lea answered with</p>
<p begin="05:35:11.520" end="05:35:15.440" style="s2">unwavering determination, saying that</p>
<p begin="05:35:13.520" end="05:35:17.280" style="s2">she desired greater strength and the</p>
<p begin="05:35:15.440" end="05:35:19.200" style="s2">only way to obtain it was by drinking</p>
<p begin="05:35:17.280" end="05:35:21.120" style="s2">the magic water. Edges then revealed</p>
<p begin="05:35:19.200" end="05:35:22.878" style="s2">that he had also decided to drink one.</p>
<p begin="05:35:21.120" end="05:35:24.400" style="s2">Ever since he was young, he had always</p>
<p begin="05:35:22.878" end="05:35:26.480" style="s2">wondered what it truly felt like to</p>
<p begin="05:35:24.400" end="05:35:28.798" style="s2">wield magic, and now he finally had the</p>
<p begin="05:35:26.480" end="05:35:30.638" style="s2">chance to find out. Hearing that, Laya</p>
<p begin="05:35:28.798" end="05:35:32.240" style="s2">admitted that her curiosity had also</p>
<p begin="05:35:30.638" end="05:35:34.480" style="s2">gotten the better of her, and she wanted</p>
<p begin="05:35:32.240" end="05:35:36.080" style="s2">to experience magic herself. Leica then</p>
<p begin="05:35:34.480" end="05:35:37.920" style="s2">declared that she needed the power of</p>
<p begin="05:35:36.080" end="05:35:39.680" style="s2">magic because she intended to become the</p>
<p begin="05:35:37.920" end="05:35:41.760" style="s2">next head of the Lragon family, no</p>
<p begin="05:35:39.680" end="05:35:43.600" style="s2">matter what. The moment Vanil heard</p>
<p begin="05:35:41.760" end="05:35:45.360" style="s2">those words, he immediately announced</p>
<p begin="05:35:43.600" end="05:35:47.040" style="s2">that he would drink one as well. He</p>
<p begin="05:35:45.360" end="05:35:48.798" style="s2">firmly declared that Leica would never</p>
<p begin="05:35:47.040" end="05:35:50.558" style="s2">become the family head because that</p>
<p begin="05:35:48.798" end="05:35:52.798" style="s2">position belonged to him. Looking</p>
<p begin="05:35:50.558" end="05:35:54.558" style="s2">directly into Lea&#39;s eyes, Vanale vowed</p>
<p begin="05:35:52.798" end="05:35:56.638" style="s2">that he would surpass even their older</p>
<p begin="05:35:54.558" end="05:35:58.558" style="s2">brothers, and mastering magic was the</p>
<p begin="05:35:56.638" end="05:36:00.558" style="s2">first step toward achieving that goal.</p>
<p begin="05:35:58.558" end="05:36:02.638" style="s2">Alan simply smiled and stated that</p>
<p begin="05:36:00.558" end="05:36:04.718" style="s2">wherever Venil went, he would gladly</p>
<p begin="05:36:02.638" end="05:36:06.558" style="s2">follow. Vanil then turned towards Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:36:04.718" end="05:36:08.400" style="s2">and casually remarked that if she did</p>
<p begin="05:36:06.558" end="05:36:10.400" style="s2">not want to drink the magic water, she</p>
<p begin="05:36:08.400" end="05:36:12.638" style="s2">could simply remain behind and watch.</p>
<p begin="05:36:10.400" end="05:36:14.160" style="s2">Those words immediately irritated Sandy.</p>
<p begin="05:36:12.638" end="05:36:15.920" style="s2">She questioned whether everyone had</p>
<p begin="05:36:14.160" end="05:36:17.760" style="s2">truly thought this through, reminding</p>
<p begin="05:36:15.920" end="05:36:19.760" style="s2">them that if the family had ever learned</p>
<p begin="05:36:17.760" end="05:36:21.440" style="s2">they had consumed the magic water, he</p>
<p begin="05:36:19.760" end="05:36:23.840" style="s2">might kill them without hesitation.</p>
<p begin="05:36:21.440" end="05:36:25.360" style="s2">Leica acknowledged Sandy&#39;s concerns, but</p>
<p begin="05:36:23.840" end="05:36:27.280" style="s2">insisted that she would never let an</p>
<p begin="05:36:25.360" end="05:36:29.840" style="s2">opportunity to become stronger pass her</p>
<p begin="05:36:27.280" end="05:36:31.360" style="s2">by. Venil completely agreed, admitting</p>
<p begin="05:36:29.840" end="05:36:33.520" style="s2">that although he fully understood the</p>
<p begin="05:36:31.360" end="05:36:35.200" style="s2">risks, he still chose strength above</p>
<p begin="05:36:33.520" end="05:36:36.638" style="s2">everything else. Seeing that everyone</p>
<p begin="05:36:35.200" end="05:36:38.400" style="s2">had already made up their minds for</p>
<p begin="05:36:36.638" end="05:36:40.080" style="s2">their own reasons, Sandy could only</p>
<p begin="05:36:38.400" end="05:36:42.080" style="s2">scratch her head with both hands in</p>
<p begin="05:36:40.080" end="05:36:43.920" style="s2">complete frustration. Finally admitting</p>
<p begin="05:36:42.080" end="05:36:45.680" style="s2">defeat, she declared that she had heard</p>
<p begin="05:36:43.920" end="05:36:47.520" style="s2">enough. If everyone else was willing to</p>
<p begin="05:36:45.680" end="05:36:49.440" style="s2">risk their lives, then she would drink</p>
<p begin="05:36:47.520" end="05:36:51.360" style="s2">the magic water as well because she</p>
<p begin="05:36:49.440" end="05:36:53.680" style="s2">refused to let Lea and the others face</p>
<p begin="05:36:51.360" end="05:36:55.440" style="s2">that danger alone. Moments later, each</p>
<p begin="05:36:53.680" end="05:36:57.280" style="s2">of them held a bottle in their hands.</p>
<p begin="05:36:55.440" end="05:36:59.200" style="s2">Without another word, all of them drank</p>
<p begin="05:36:57.280" end="05:37:00.958" style="s2">the magic water together. As the liquid</p>
<p begin="05:36:59.200" end="05:37:03.200" style="s2">flowed through their bodies, faint</p>
<p begin="05:37:00.958" end="05:37:04.638" style="s2">rainbow colored energy slowly enveloped</p>
<p begin="05:37:03.200" end="05:37:06.718" style="s2">each of them. After emptying the</p>
<p begin="05:37:04.638" end="05:37:08.558" style="s2">bottles, silence filled the area as</p>
<p begin="05:37:06.718" end="05:37:10.798" style="s2">everyone waited, trying to sense any</p>
<p begin="05:37:08.558" end="05:37:12.798" style="s2">changes within themselves. After several</p>
<p begin="05:37:10.798" end="05:37:15.120" style="s2">moments, Leica asked whether that was</p>
<p begin="05:37:12.798" end="05:37:16.878" style="s2">really all there was to it. Even Laya</p>
<p begin="05:37:15.120" end="05:37:19.040" style="s2">admitted that she could not feel any</p>
<p begin="05:37:16.878" end="05:37:20.798" style="s2">noticeable difference in her body. Zeke,</p>
<p begin="05:37:19.040" end="05:37:22.400" style="s2">however, assured them that there had</p>
<p begin="05:37:20.798" end="05:37:24.080" style="s2">definitely been a change. He could</p>
<p begin="05:37:22.400" end="05:37:26.558" style="s2">clearly sense something different within</p>
<p begin="05:37:24.080" end="05:37:28.400" style="s2">each of their source powers, a new force</p>
<p begin="05:37:26.558" end="05:37:29.920" style="s2">completely separate from Aura. He was</p>
<p begin="05:37:28.400" end="05:37:31.840" style="s2">certain that what he was sensing was the</p>
<p begin="05:37:29.920" end="05:37:33.680" style="s2">presence of magic itself. So, there was</p>
<p begin="05:37:31.840" end="05:37:35.040" style="s2">no reason for any of them to worry. It</p>
<p begin="05:37:33.680" end="05:37:36.878" style="s2">was then that everyone noticed the</p>
<p begin="05:37:35.040" end="05:37:39.200" style="s2">untouched bottle of magic water still</p>
<p begin="05:37:36.878" end="05:37:41.040" style="s2">resting in front of Zeke. Confused, they</p>
<p begin="05:37:39.200" end="05:37:42.240" style="s2">asked why he had not drunk it yet, and</p>
<p begin="05:37:41.040" end="05:37:44.400" style="s2">whether he intended to leave it</p>
<p begin="05:37:42.240" end="05:37:46.480" style="s2">untouched. Zeke simply told them not to</p>
<p begin="05:37:44.400" end="05:37:48.638" style="s2">worry about him. Raising his hand, he</p>
<p begin="05:37:46.480" end="05:37:50.400" style="s2">casually formed a finger gun gesture.</p>
<p begin="05:37:48.638" end="05:37:52.320" style="s2">Golden aura instantly gathered around</p>
<p begin="05:37:50.400" end="05:37:54.400" style="s2">his fingertips, and after concentrating</p>
<p begin="05:37:52.320" end="05:37:56.320" style="s2">the energy for only a brief moment, a</p>
<p begin="05:37:54.400" end="05:37:58.320" style="s2">massive boulder suddenly materialized</p>
<p begin="05:37:56.320" end="05:38:00.400" style="s2">before his finger. In the next instant,</p>
<p begin="05:37:58.320" end="05:38:02.320" style="s2">the enormous rock shot into the sky with</p>
<p begin="05:38:00.400" end="05:38:04.480" style="s2">explosive force. Turning toward the</p>
<p begin="05:38:02.320" end="05:38:06.558" style="s2">stunned group, Zeke casually introduced</p>
<p begin="05:38:04.480" end="05:38:08.080" style="s2">the technique as rock cannon, proudly</p>
<p begin="05:38:06.558" end="05:38:09.760" style="s2">pointing out that the stone he could</p>
<p begin="05:38:08.080" end="05:38:11.840" style="s2">create was even larger than the ones</p>
<p begin="05:38:09.760" end="05:38:14.240" style="s2">used by their previous enemy. Everyone</p>
<p begin="05:38:11.840" end="05:38:15.920" style="s2">stood frozen in complete shock. Edges</p>
<p begin="05:38:14.240" end="05:38:17.920" style="s2">immediately demanded to know how Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:38:15.920" end="05:38:20.000" style="s2">was using magic despite never drinking</p>
<p begin="05:38:17.920" end="05:38:21.520" style="s2">the magic water. Even Laya pointed out</p>
<p begin="05:38:20.000" end="05:38:23.360" style="s2">that Zeke should not have known how</p>
<p begin="05:38:21.520" end="05:38:25.040" style="s2">magic functioned in the first place.</p>
<p begin="05:38:23.360" end="05:38:26.638" style="s2">Zeke explained that it was no different</p>
<p begin="05:38:25.040" end="05:38:28.878" style="s2">from how he learned Leica&#39;s lightning</p>
<p begin="05:38:26.638" end="05:38:30.638" style="s2">aura and Venil&#39;s wind aura. After</p>
<p begin="05:38:28.878" end="05:38:32.480" style="s2">absorbing enough spells, he had</p>
<p begin="05:38:30.638" end="05:38:34.638" style="s2">naturally begun using magic without</p>
<p begin="05:38:32.480" end="05:38:36.638" style="s2">consciously realizing it. Even he did</p>
<p begin="05:38:34.638" end="05:38:38.718" style="s2">not fully understand the process. But</p>
<p begin="05:38:36.638" end="05:38:40.718" style="s2">thanks to Dragon King&#39;s breath, his body</p>
<p begin="05:38:38.718" end="05:38:42.718" style="s2">had continuously absorbed the magic</p>
<p begin="05:38:40.718" end="05:38:45.120" style="s2">power contained within every spell he</p>
<p begin="05:38:42.718" end="05:38:46.878" style="s2">had endured. Eventually, that magic had</p>
<p begin="05:38:45.120" end="05:38:48.878" style="s2">accumulated inside his source power</p>
<p begin="05:38:46.878" end="05:38:51.120" style="s2">until it naturally transformed into the</p>
<p begin="05:38:48.878" end="05:38:53.040" style="s2">nature of magic itself. As for actually</p>
<p begin="05:38:51.120" end="05:38:54.558" style="s2">casting spells, all he had done was</p>
<p begin="05:38:53.040" end="05:38:56.240" style="s2">imitate the flow of magic he had</p>
<p begin="05:38:54.558" end="05:38:58.080" style="s2">observed from their previous opponent.</p>
<p begin="05:38:56.240" end="05:39:00.240" style="s2">Leica could hardly believe that Zeke had</p>
<p begin="05:38:58.080" end="05:39:01.840" style="s2">copied Magic simply by watching it once,</p>
<p begin="05:39:00.240" end="05:39:03.840" style="s2">while Venil could only stare at him</p>
<p begin="05:39:01.840" end="05:39:05.600" style="s2">before calling him an absolute freak.</p>
<p begin="05:39:03.840" end="05:39:07.280" style="s2">Zeke merely laughed at their reactions</p>
<p begin="05:39:05.600" end="05:39:09.360" style="s2">before explaining that the real reason</p>
<p begin="05:39:07.280" end="05:39:10.878" style="s2">he had not drunk the final bottle was</p>
<p begin="05:39:09.360" end="05:39:12.798" style="s2">because someone needed to bring at least</p>
<p begin="05:39:10.878" end="05:39:14.480" style="s2">one bottle back to the family. It would</p>
<p begin="05:39:12.798" end="05:39:16.080" style="s2">make for a respectable return on the</p>
<p begin="05:39:14.480" end="05:39:18.080" style="s2">family head&#39;s investment. Although</p>
<p begin="05:39:16.080" end="05:39:19.760" style="s2">somewhat reluctant, even Lea admitted</p>
<p begin="05:39:18.080" end="05:39:21.840" style="s2">that Zeke&#39;s reasoning actually made</p>
<p begin="05:39:19.760" end="05:39:23.760" style="s2">sense. Lea then remarked that if they</p>
<p begin="05:39:21.840" end="05:39:25.520" style="s2">continued arguing with Zeke over every</p>
<p begin="05:39:23.760" end="05:39:27.520" style="s2">little detail, they would never leave</p>
<p begin="05:39:25.520" end="05:39:29.520" style="s2">this place. Since they had already drunk</p>
<p begin="05:39:27.520" end="05:39:31.920" style="s2">the magic water, all that remained now</p>
<p begin="05:39:29.520" end="05:39:33.600" style="s2">was escaping the rift. Edgis agreed, but</p>
<p begin="05:39:31.920" end="05:39:35.280" style="s2">pointed out that escaping would be their</p>
<p begin="05:39:33.600" end="05:39:37.040" style="s2">greatest challenge. As they had been</p>
<p begin="05:39:35.280" end="05:39:38.718" style="s2">told before entering, the only way to</p>
<p begin="05:39:37.040" end="05:39:41.280" style="s2">close the rift was by destroying the</p>
<p begin="05:39:38.718" end="05:39:43.280" style="s2">Chaos Stone. However, the time required</p>
<p begin="05:39:41.280" end="05:39:45.360" style="s2">for a rift to collapse depended entirely</p>
<p begin="05:39:43.280" end="05:39:47.600" style="s2">on its size. Judging by the enormous</p>
<p begin="05:39:45.360" end="05:39:49.760" style="s2">chaos stone inside this special rift,</p>
<p begin="05:39:47.600" end="05:39:52.000" style="s2">Edgis estimated it would take at least 3</p>
<p begin="05:39:49.760" end="05:39:53.520" style="s2">days and possibly as long as an entire</p>
<p begin="05:39:52.000" end="05:39:55.520" style="s2">week before the rift completely</p>
<p begin="05:39:53.520" end="05:39:57.680" style="s2">disappeared. Leela commented that the</p>
<p begin="05:39:55.520" end="05:39:59.680" style="s2">time frame was rather awkward, but Leica</p>
<p begin="05:39:57.680" end="05:40:01.680" style="s2">immediately corrected her, saying it was</p>
<p begin="05:39:59.680" end="05:40:03.360" style="s2">far more dangerous than awkward. If they</p>
<p begin="05:40:01.680" end="05:40:04.958" style="s2">encountered as many chaos creatures</p>
<p begin="05:40:03.360" end="05:40:06.558" style="s2">while returning as they had on the way</p>
<p begin="05:40:04.958" end="05:40:08.000" style="s2">in, they would almost certainly need</p>
<p begin="05:40:06.558" end="05:40:10.400" style="s2">more than a week just to reach the</p>
<p begin="05:40:08.000" end="05:40:12.080" style="s2">rift&#39;s exit. Even then, they still had</p>
<p begin="05:40:10.400" end="05:40:14.160" style="s2">no idea how they would climb back into</p>
<p begin="05:40:12.080" end="05:40:15.600" style="s2">the sky, meaning there was a very real</p>
<p begin="05:40:14.160" end="05:40:17.520" style="s2">possibility that none of them would</p>
<p begin="05:40:15.600" end="05:40:19.120" style="s2">escape alive. Almost as though it</p>
<p begin="05:40:17.520" end="05:40:21.120" style="s2">understood their conversation, the</p>
<p begin="05:40:19.120" end="05:40:22.958" style="s2">mother bird suddenly walked towards Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:40:21.120" end="05:40:24.718" style="s2">and called out to him. When Zeke asked</p>
<p begin="05:40:22.958" end="05:40:26.558" style="s2">whether something was wrong, all of the</p>
<p begin="05:40:24.718" end="05:40:28.638" style="s2">giant birds gathered around him and</p>
<p begin="05:40:26.558" end="05:40:30.400" style="s2">repeatedly cried out in unison. In that</p>
<p begin="05:40:28.638" end="05:40:31.760" style="s2">instant, Zeke seemed to understand</p>
<p begin="05:40:30.400" end="05:40:34.080" style="s2">exactly what they were trying to</p>
<p begin="05:40:31.760" end="05:40:35.920" style="s2">communicate. Only a few moments later,</p>
<p begin="05:40:34.080" end="05:40:37.680" style="s2">Sandy&#39;s terrified screams echoed</p>
<p begin="05:40:35.920" end="05:40:39.760" style="s2">throughout the skies as all of them rode</p>
<p begin="05:40:37.680" end="05:40:42.160" style="s2">a top the giant birds, soaring toward</p>
<p begin="05:40:39.760" end="05:40:43.840" style="s2">the rift&#39;s exit at unbelievable speed.</p>
<p begin="05:40:42.160" end="05:40:46.000" style="s2">As they continued soaring through the</p>
<p begin="05:40:43.840" end="05:40:47.680" style="s2">sky at incredible speed, Sandy couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="05:40:46.000" end="05:40:49.680" style="s2">stop screaming as the overwhelming speed</p>
<p begin="05:40:47.680" end="05:40:51.520" style="s2">of their flight filled her with fear.</p>
<p begin="05:40:49.680" end="05:40:53.040" style="s2">Even Lea was starting to feel dizzy from</p>
<p begin="05:40:51.520" end="05:40:54.638" style="s2">how fast they were moving, and she</p>
<p begin="05:40:53.040" end="05:40:56.240" style="s2">wished Sandy would lower her voice a</p>
<p begin="05:40:54.638" end="05:40:58.160" style="s2">little. But Sandy simply couldn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="05:40:56.240" end="05:41:00.080" style="s2">herself. She had never imagined that the</p>
<p begin="05:40:58.160" end="05:41:02.240" style="s2">giant birds were capable of flying this</p>
<p begin="05:41:00.080" end="05:41:04.320" style="s2">fast. Edges admitted that the giant</p>
<p begin="05:41:02.240" end="05:41:06.240" style="s2">bird&#39;s speed was so overwhelming that</p>
<p begin="05:41:04.320" end="05:41:07.920" style="s2">even the chaos monsters chasing them</p>
<p begin="05:41:06.240" end="05:41:09.680" style="s2">could no longer keep up. And at this</p>
<p begin="05:41:07.920" end="05:41:11.520" style="s2">pace, they should be able to reach the</p>
<p begin="05:41:09.680" end="05:41:13.520" style="s2">rift before it completely closed.</p>
<p begin="05:41:11.520" end="05:41:15.200" style="s2">Despite the tremendous speed, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:41:13.520" end="05:41:17.040" style="s2">remained standing calmly on the back of</p>
<p begin="05:41:15.200" end="05:41:19.200" style="s2">the giant mother bird as though nothing</p>
<p begin="05:41:17.040" end="05:41:21.440" style="s2">was happening. When Leica looked at him,</p>
<p begin="05:41:19.200" end="05:41:23.200" style="s2">she smiled to herself, realizing once</p>
<p begin="05:41:21.440" end="05:41:25.440" style="s2">again that there truly seemed to be no</p>
<p begin="05:41:23.200" end="05:41:26.878" style="s2">limit to how unbelievable Zeke could be.</p>
<p begin="05:41:25.440" end="05:41:28.638" style="s2">She never would have imagined that he</p>
<p begin="05:41:26.878" end="05:41:30.878" style="s2">would actually train the monsters living</p>
<p begin="05:41:28.638" end="05:41:32.878" style="s2">inside the rift and then use those very</p>
<p begin="05:41:30.878" end="05:41:34.400" style="s2">monsters as their means of escape.</p>
<p begin="05:41:32.878" end="05:41:36.320" style="s2">Before she could continue thinking about</p>
<p begin="05:41:34.400" end="05:41:37.520" style="s2">it, Leela suddenly interrupted her</p>
<p begin="05:41:36.320" end="05:41:39.600" style="s2">thoughts by commenting that the</p>
<p begin="05:41:37.520" end="05:41:41.920" style="s2">terrifying giant birds everyone feared</p>
<p begin="05:41:39.600" end="05:41:43.840" style="s2">were actually fluffy and adorable. Leica</p>
<p begin="05:41:41.920" end="05:41:45.680" style="s2">reluctantly admitted that she was right,</p>
<p begin="05:41:43.840" end="05:41:47.200" style="s2">adding that thanks to Zeke, the mission</p>
<p begin="05:41:45.680" end="05:41:49.360" style="s2">they had been entrusted with was</p>
<p begin="05:41:47.200" end="05:41:51.280" style="s2">practically already completed. Laya</p>
<p begin="05:41:49.360" end="05:41:53.040" style="s2">happily agreed before praising Zeke even</p>
<p begin="05:41:51.280" end="05:41:55.120" style="s2">further, saying that he had defeated a</p>
<p begin="05:41:53.040" end="05:41:57.040" style="s2">five-star opponent, prepared an escape</p>
<p begin="05:41:55.120" end="05:41:59.040" style="s2">route from the collapsing rift, and even</p>
<p begin="05:41:57.040" end="05:42:01.360" style="s2">shattered the unbelievably durable Chaos</p>
<p begin="05:41:59.040" end="05:42:03.040" style="s2">Stone with a single strike. Leica could</p>
<p begin="05:42:01.360" end="05:42:05.440" style="s2">only smile as she recalled the moment</p>
<p begin="05:42:03.040" end="05:42:06.798" style="s2">Zeke smashed the enormous Chaos Stone.</p>
<p begin="05:42:05.440" end="05:42:08.558" style="s2">Realizing that after witnessing</p>
<p begin="05:42:06.798" end="05:42:10.240" style="s2">something like that, nothing he did</p>
<p begin="05:42:08.558" end="05:42:11.600" style="s2">could surprise her anymore. Thinking</p>
<p begin="05:42:10.240" end="05:42:13.520" style="s2">back on everything that had happened</p>
<p begin="05:42:11.600" end="05:42:15.040" style="s2">during their mission, Leica quietly</p>
<p begin="05:42:13.520" end="05:42:17.360" style="s2">reflected that she had been appointed as</p>
<p begin="05:42:15.040" end="05:42:18.718" style="s2">the team leader. Yet in the end, she</p>
<p begin="05:42:17.360" end="05:42:20.400" style="s2">felt as though she had done nothing</p>
<p begin="05:42:18.718" end="05:42:22.000" style="s2">worthy of leading everyone. Laya</p>
<p begin="05:42:20.400" end="05:42:23.760" style="s2">immediately reassured her that it wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="05:42:22.000" end="05:42:25.280" style="s2">true at all. Without Leica holding</p>
<p begin="05:42:23.760" end="05:42:27.040" style="s2">everyone together, their team never</p>
<p begin="05:42:25.280" end="05:42:29.200" style="s2">would have stayed united until the very</p>
<p begin="05:42:27.040" end="05:42:31.040" style="s2">end. Hearing those comforting words,</p>
<p begin="05:42:29.200" end="05:42:32.558" style="s2">Leica softly whispered Laya&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="05:42:31.040" end="05:42:34.558" style="s2">before embracing her tightly in</p>
<p begin="05:42:32.558" end="05:42:36.638" style="s2">gratitude. At the same time, she made</p>
<p begin="05:42:34.558" end="05:42:38.320" style="s2">another silent promise to herself. She</p>
<p begin="05:42:36.638" end="05:42:40.878" style="s2">would become strong enough to truly lead</p>
<p begin="05:42:38.320" end="05:42:42.638" style="s2">everyone. And one day, without fail, she</p>
<p begin="05:42:40.878" end="05:42:44.718" style="s2">would become the next head of the Lragon</p>
<p begin="05:42:42.638" end="05:42:46.878" style="s2">family. As the giant birds continued</p>
<p begin="05:42:44.718" end="05:42:48.480" style="s2">racing through the skies, Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="05:42:46.878" end="05:42:50.160" style="s2">laughed while telling the giant mother</p>
<p begin="05:42:48.480" end="05:42:52.000" style="s2">bird that she was far faster now than</p>
<p begin="05:42:50.160" end="05:42:53.680" style="s2">when she had first carried him away. He</p>
<p begin="05:42:52.000" end="05:42:54.878" style="s2">remarked that this was the result of all</p>
<p begin="05:42:53.680" end="05:42:56.718" style="s2">the training they had gone through</p>
<p begin="05:42:54.878" end="05:42:58.878" style="s2">together, and the giant mother bird</p>
<p begin="05:42:56.718" end="05:43:01.280" style="s2">happily responded with a cheerful cry,</p>
<p begin="05:42:58.878" end="05:43:03.120" style="s2">proudly confirming his words. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="05:43:01.280" end="05:43:04.718" style="s2">praised her chicks as well, pointing out</p>
<p begin="05:43:03.120" end="05:43:06.798" style="s2">that they were already able to keep up</p>
<p begin="05:43:04.718" end="05:43:08.160" style="s2">with their mother&#39;s incredible speed and</p>
<p begin="05:43:06.798" end="05:43:10.000" style="s2">saying that they had a bright future</p>
<p begin="05:43:08.160" end="05:43:11.920" style="s2">ahead of them. The chicks happily</p>
<p begin="05:43:10.000" end="05:43:14.400" style="s2">chirped in agreement, clearly delighted</p>
<p begin="05:43:11.920" end="05:43:16.638" style="s2">by his praise. However, the giant mother</p>
<p begin="05:43:14.400" end="05:43:18.718" style="s2">bird suddenly became unusually quiet</p>
<p begin="05:43:16.638" end="05:43:20.240" style="s2">before slowly looking back toward Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:43:18.718" end="05:43:22.558" style="s2">as though she was trying to tell him</p>
<p begin="05:43:20.240" end="05:43:24.240" style="s2">something. Curious, Zeke wondered if</p>
<p begin="05:43:22.558" end="05:43:26.080" style="s2">something was wrong. Without warning,</p>
<p begin="05:43:24.240" end="05:43:28.000" style="s2">the giant mother bird began emitting a</p>
<p begin="05:43:26.080" end="05:43:30.240" style="s2">brilliant green aura while the chicks</p>
<p begin="05:43:28.000" end="05:43:32.480" style="s2">simultaneously released a radiant golden</p>
<p begin="05:43:30.240" end="05:43:34.320" style="s2">aura. To everyone&#39;s astonishment, both</p>
<p begin="05:43:32.480" end="05:43:36.160" style="s2">the mother bird and her chicks directed</p>
<p begin="05:43:34.320" end="05:43:38.320" style="s2">those mysterious auras straight toward</p>
<p begin="05:43:36.160" end="05:43:40.080" style="s2">Zeke. Leica gasped in shock as she</p>
<p begin="05:43:38.320" end="05:43:42.080" style="s2">immediately called out his name. Even</p>
<p begin="05:43:40.080" end="05:43:43.840" style="s2">Zeke himself had no idea what had just</p>
<p begin="05:43:42.080" end="05:43:45.760" style="s2">happened or what the giant birds had</p>
<p begin="05:43:43.840" end="05:43:47.760" style="s2">done to him. The birds simply answered</p>
<p begin="05:43:45.760" end="05:43:49.840" style="s2">with cheerful cries as if everything was</p>
<p begin="05:43:47.760" end="05:43:52.080" style="s2">perfectly normal. Still completely</p>
<p begin="05:43:49.840" end="05:43:53.520" style="s2">confused, Zeke remarked that simply</p>
<p begin="05:43:52.080" end="05:43:54.958" style="s2">chirping wouldn&#39;t explain anything</p>
<p begin="05:43:53.520" end="05:43:57.200" style="s2">because he couldn&#39;t understand what they</p>
<p begin="05:43:54.958" end="05:43:59.120" style="s2">were trying to say. At that very moment,</p>
<p begin="05:43:57.200" end="05:44:01.040" style="s2">Laya suddenly drew everyone&#39;s attention</p>
<p begin="05:43:59.120" end="05:44:03.120" style="s2">toward the horizon where the rift had</p>
<p begin="05:44:01.040" end="05:44:05.040" style="s2">finally come into view. Since the Chaos</p>
<p begin="05:44:03.120" end="05:44:07.040" style="s2">Stone had been destroyed by Zeke, the</p>
<p begin="05:44:05.040" end="05:44:09.120" style="s2">rift had been continuously shrinking and</p>
<p begin="05:44:07.040" end="05:44:11.520" style="s2">it was now dangerously close to closing</p>
<p begin="05:44:09.120" end="05:44:13.360" style="s2">completely. Veneil and Allan immediately</p>
<p begin="05:44:11.520" end="05:44:15.200" style="s2">realized how much smaller the rift had</p>
<p begin="05:44:13.360" end="05:44:17.200" style="s2">become, making it obvious that they were</p>
<p begin="05:44:15.200" end="05:44:19.200" style="s2">running out of time. Seeing the rapidly</p>
<p begin="05:44:17.200" end="05:44:20.638" style="s2">collapsing entrance, Edges grimly</p>
<p begin="05:44:19.200" end="05:44:22.878" style="s2">concluded that their situation had</p>
<p begin="05:44:20.638" end="05:44:24.320" style="s2">become extremely dangerous, Leica</p>
<p begin="05:44:22.878" end="05:44:25.840" style="s2">anxiously wondered if they could still</p>
<p begin="05:44:24.320" end="05:44:27.920" style="s2">make it out alive before the rift</p>
<p begin="05:44:25.840" end="05:44:30.240" style="s2">disappeared forever. But Zeke remained</p>
<p begin="05:44:27.920" end="05:44:32.160" style="s2">completely unfazed. Instead of worrying,</p>
<p begin="05:44:30.240" end="05:44:34.000" style="s2">he confidently looked at the giant birds</p>
<p begin="05:44:32.160" end="05:44:35.600" style="s2">and asked if they could still make it.</p>
<p begin="05:44:34.000" end="05:44:37.360" style="s2">The giant bird&#39;s eyes immediately</p>
<p begin="05:44:35.600" end="05:44:39.120" style="s2">sparkled in response, and without</p>
<p begin="05:44:37.360" end="05:44:41.360" style="s2">another moment of hesitation, they</p>
<p begin="05:44:39.120" end="05:44:43.040" style="s2">suddenly accelerated even further. Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:44:41.360" end="05:44:44.718" style="s2">let out an even louder scream as the</p>
<p begin="05:44:43.040" end="05:44:46.798" style="s2">giant birds pushed themselves to their</p>
<p begin="05:44:44.718" end="05:44:49.200" style="s2">absolute limit, racing against time</p>
<p begin="05:44:46.798" end="05:44:51.200" style="s2">toward the rapidly closing rift. Only</p>
<p begin="05:44:49.200" end="05:44:52.958" style="s2">moments later, the giant birds reached</p>
<p begin="05:44:51.200" end="05:44:54.718" style="s2">the collapsing entrance and launched</p>
<p begin="05:44:52.958" end="05:44:56.558" style="s2">everyone toward the narrowing opening</p>
<p begin="05:44:54.718" end="05:44:58.400" style="s2">with perfect precision. While everyone</p>
<p begin="05:44:56.558" end="05:45:00.558" style="s2">else was thrown ahead, Zeke remained</p>
<p begin="05:44:58.400" end="05:45:02.240" style="s2">standing at top the giant mother bird.</p>
<p begin="05:45:00.558" end="05:45:04.000" style="s2">Gently placing his hand against her</p>
<p begin="05:45:02.240" end="05:45:05.840" style="s2">feathers, he admitted that despite</p>
<p begin="05:45:04.000" end="05:45:07.200" style="s2">everything that had happened, he still</p>
<p begin="05:45:05.840" end="05:45:08.878" style="s2">never figured out what the mysterious</p>
<p begin="05:45:07.200" end="05:45:11.040" style="s2">aura they had shared with him actually</p>
<p begin="05:45:08.878" end="05:45:13.360" style="s2">meant. Even so, this was where their</p>
<p begin="05:45:11.040" end="05:45:15.040" style="s2">journey together had to end. The giant</p>
<p begin="05:45:13.360" end="05:45:16.958" style="s2">bird&#39;s expressions immediately became</p>
<p begin="05:45:15.040" end="05:45:19.200" style="s2">sorrowful after hearing that. Noticing</p>
<p begin="05:45:16.958" end="05:45:20.958" style="s2">their sadness, Zeke reassured them that</p>
<p begin="05:45:19.200" end="05:45:23.040" style="s2">as long as they remained alive, they</p>
<p begin="05:45:20.958" end="05:45:25.040" style="s2">would surely meet again someday. Until</p>
<p begin="05:45:23.040" end="05:45:26.480" style="s2">that day came, they should never forget</p>
<p begin="05:45:25.040" end="05:45:28.480" style="s2">everything they had learned during their</p>
<p begin="05:45:26.480" end="05:45:30.718" style="s2">training and continue growing stronger.</p>
<p begin="05:45:28.480" end="05:45:32.320" style="s2">After saying his final farewell, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:45:30.718" end="05:45:34.160" style="s2">leaped from the giant mother bird and</p>
<p begin="05:45:32.320" end="05:45:36.240" style="s2">entered the closing rift, wishing them</p>
<p begin="05:45:34.160" end="05:45:38.160" style="s2">to take good care of themselves. By the</p>
<p begin="05:45:36.240" end="05:45:40.000" style="s2">time the rift completely sealed shut,</p>
<p begin="05:45:38.160" end="05:45:42.320" style="s2">Leica and the others had already landed</p>
<p begin="05:45:40.000" end="05:45:44.320" style="s2">safely back inside the forest. Lying</p>
<p begin="05:45:42.320" end="05:45:46.000" style="s2">exhausted on the grass, Edges wondered</p>
<p begin="05:45:44.320" end="05:45:48.558" style="s2">if they had truly managed to return</p>
<p begin="05:45:46.000" end="05:45:50.240" style="s2">alive. Zeke calmly confirmed that they</p>
<p begin="05:45:48.558" end="05:45:52.320" style="s2">had all made it back safely. Although</p>
<p begin="05:45:50.240" end="05:45:54.080" style="s2">the forest remained dimly lit, everyone</p>
<p begin="05:45:52.320" end="05:45:55.760" style="s2">quickly noticed that the ominous black</p>
<p begin="05:45:54.080" end="05:45:58.240" style="s2">haze covering the area before they</p>
<p begin="05:45:55.760" end="05:45:59.920" style="s2">entered the rift had completely vanished</p>
<p begin="05:45:58.240" end="05:46:02.638" style="s2">along with the suffocating presence of</p>
<p begin="05:45:59.920" end="05:46:04.160" style="s2">chaos itself. Even so, Leica reminded</p>
<p begin="05:46:02.638" end="05:46:06.160" style="s2">everyone that their mission was not over</p>
<p begin="05:46:04.160" end="05:46:07.920" style="s2">yet. They needed to return to camp as</p>
<p begin="05:46:06.160" end="05:46:09.840" style="s2">quickly as possible before members of</p>
<p begin="05:46:07.920" end="05:46:11.920" style="s2">the Kerberous family found them.</p>
<p begin="05:46:09.840" end="05:46:13.760" style="s2">However, just as she finished speaking,</p>
<p begin="05:46:11.920" end="05:46:15.360" style="s2">everyone suddenly sensed an overwhelming</p>
<p begin="05:46:13.760" end="05:46:17.120" style="s2">and oppressive presence approaching.</p>
<p begin="05:46:15.360" end="05:46:18.878" style="s2">Leica immediately questioned what kind</p>
<p begin="05:46:17.120" end="05:46:20.320" style="s2">of presence they were feeling, and Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:46:18.878" end="05:46:21.920" style="s2">calmly concluded that they were most</p>
<p begin="05:46:20.320" end="05:46:23.920" style="s2">likely soldiers from the Kerberus</p>
<p begin="05:46:21.920" end="05:46:25.760" style="s2">family. Leica couldn&#39;t believe they had</p>
<p begin="05:46:23.920" end="05:46:27.920" style="s2">been discovered so quickly, forcing</p>
<p begin="05:46:25.760" end="05:46:30.000" style="s2">herself to stand despite her exhaustion,</p>
<p begin="05:46:27.920" end="05:46:31.840" style="s2">she urged everyone to move immediately.</p>
<p begin="05:46:30.000" end="05:46:33.520" style="s2">But the moment she tried to take a step,</p>
<p begin="05:46:31.840" end="05:46:35.200" style="s2">her legs gave out beneath her as she</p>
<p begin="05:46:33.520" end="05:46:36.958" style="s2">collapsed back onto the ground.</p>
<p begin="05:46:35.200" end="05:46:39.040" style="s2">Realizing that every ounce of strength</p>
<p begin="05:46:36.958" end="05:46:40.798" style="s2">had completely left her body, Edgis</p>
<p begin="05:46:39.040" end="05:46:42.718" style="s2">explained that while the recovery potion</p>
<p begin="05:46:40.798" end="05:46:44.798" style="s2">had healed all of their injuries, it</p>
<p begin="05:46:42.718" end="05:46:47.040" style="s2">hadn&#39;t restored their stamina. Even he</p>
<p begin="05:46:44.798" end="05:46:48.718" style="s2">could barely remain standing. Leela</p>
<p begin="05:46:47.040" end="05:46:50.480" style="s2">suddenly admitted that now that they had</p>
<p begin="05:46:48.718" end="05:46:52.080" style="s2">finally escaped the rift. All the</p>
<p begin="05:46:50.480" end="05:46:54.240" style="s2">tension that had been keeping them going</p>
<p begin="05:46:52.080" end="05:46:55.760" style="s2">had disappeared at once. Leica knew they</p>
<p begin="05:46:54.240" end="05:46:57.360" style="s2">couldn&#39;t afford to relax because the</p>
<p begin="05:46:55.760" end="05:46:59.520" style="s2">presence approaching them belonged to</p>
<p begin="05:46:57.360" end="05:47:01.520" style="s2">enemies they had absolutely no chance of</p>
<p begin="05:46:59.520" end="05:47:02.958" style="s2">defeating in their current condition.</p>
<p begin="05:47:01.520" end="05:47:05.360" style="s2">She believed that if they could somehow</p>
<p begin="05:47:02.958" end="05:47:07.120" style="s2">reach Eldreon territory, Lady Freya and</p>
<p begin="05:47:05.360" end="05:47:09.280" style="s2">the others would surely protect them.</p>
<p begin="05:47:07.120" end="05:47:10.958" style="s2">Unfortunately, Alan pointed out that in</p>
<p begin="05:47:09.280" end="05:47:12.798" style="s2">their current state, escaping was</p>
<p begin="05:47:10.958" end="05:47:15.120" style="s2">practically impossible. Yet fighting</p>
<p begin="05:47:12.798" end="05:47:16.718" style="s2">here would only guarantee their deaths.</p>
<p begin="05:47:15.120" end="05:47:17.920" style="s2">Sandy continued panicking as she</p>
<p begin="05:47:16.718" end="05:47:19.840" style="s2">desperately asked what they were</p>
<p begin="05:47:17.920" end="05:47:21.360" style="s2">supposed to do now. While Venil cursed</p>
<p begin="05:47:19.840" end="05:47:23.040" style="s2">the terrible timing of their complete</p>
<p begin="05:47:21.360" end="05:47:24.878" style="s2">exhaustion, looking toward the direction</p>
<p begin="05:47:23.040" end="05:47:27.040" style="s2">of the approaching enemies, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:47:24.878" end="05:47:28.878" style="s2">carefully assessed their strength. Among</p>
<p begin="05:47:27.040" end="05:47:30.718" style="s2">them was one six-star opponent</p>
<p begin="05:47:28.878" end="05:47:32.798" style="s2">accompanied by several five-star</p>
<p begin="05:47:30.718" end="05:47:35.040" style="s2">warriors along with an equal number of</p>
<p begin="05:47:32.798" end="05:47:36.638" style="s2">powerful monsters. Even if Leica and the</p>
<p begin="05:47:35.040" end="05:47:38.320" style="s2">others were still at full strength,</p>
<p begin="05:47:36.638" end="05:47:41.200" style="s2">escaping such a force would be nearly</p>
<p begin="05:47:38.320" end="05:47:42.718" style="s2">impossible. Realizing this, Zeke calmly</p>
<p begin="05:47:41.200" end="05:47:44.240" style="s2">decided that he would remain behind</p>
<p begin="05:47:42.718" end="05:47:46.160" style="s2">while everyone else escaped ahead</p>
<p begin="05:47:44.240" end="05:47:47.680" style="s2">without him. Both Leica and Sandy</p>
<p begin="05:47:46.160" end="05:47:49.520" style="s2">immediately questioned what he meant,</p>
<p begin="05:47:47.680" end="05:47:51.920" style="s2">wondering if he was seriously joking at</p>
<p begin="05:47:49.520" end="05:47:53.280" style="s2">a time like this. Zeke calmly explained</p>
<p begin="05:47:51.920" end="05:47:54.718" style="s2">that with everyone in their current</p>
<p begin="05:47:53.280" end="05:47:56.638" style="s2">condition, they would be caught no</p>
<p begin="05:47:54.718" end="05:47:58.400" style="s2">matter how fast they tried to run.</p>
<p begin="05:47:56.638" end="05:48:00.320" style="s2">Because of that, he intended to stay</p>
<p begin="05:47:58.400" end="05:48:02.638" style="s2">behind as a decoy and buy everyone</p>
<p begin="05:48:00.320" end="05:48:04.480" style="s2">enough time to escape. Edgis immediately</p>
<p begin="05:48:02.638" end="05:48:06.000" style="s2">rejected the idea, knowing better than</p>
<p begin="05:48:04.480" end="05:48:07.520" style="s2">anyone that the enemies approaching them</p>
<p begin="05:48:06.000" end="05:48:09.440" style="s2">were nothing like Jack and the others</p>
<p begin="05:48:07.520" end="05:48:11.280" style="s2">they had fought inside the rift. Leica</p>
<p begin="05:48:09.440" end="05:48:13.680" style="s2">also refused, insisting that they</p>
<p begin="05:48:11.280" end="05:48:15.920" style="s2">couldn&#39;t simply abandon Zeke behind. In</p>
<p begin="05:48:13.680" end="05:48:17.520" style="s2">response, Zeke calmly called Leica&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:48:15.920" end="05:48:19.600" style="s2">name before reminding her of her dream</p>
<p begin="05:48:17.520" end="05:48:21.840" style="s2">of becoming the next head of the Eldreon</p>
<p begin="05:48:19.600" end="05:48:23.520" style="s2">family. If that truly was her goal, then</p>
<p begin="05:48:21.840" end="05:48:25.360" style="s2">she needed to learn how to judge her own</p>
<p begin="05:48:23.520" end="05:48:27.680" style="s2">limits and understand what had to be</p>
<p begin="05:48:25.360" end="05:48:29.440" style="s2">prioritized above everything else. that</p>
<p begin="05:48:27.680" end="05:48:30.798" style="s2">judgment was something she absolutely</p>
<p begin="05:48:29.440" end="05:48:32.718" style="s2">needed to develop if she wished to</p>
<p begin="05:48:30.798" end="05:48:34.320" style="s2">become a true leader. He continued by</p>
<p begin="05:48:32.718" end="05:48:36.400" style="s2">telling her that with her current</p>
<p begin="05:48:34.320" end="05:48:38.160" style="s2">strength, successfully completing this</p>
<p begin="05:48:36.400" end="05:48:40.240" style="s2">mission was already the very limit of</p>
<p begin="05:48:38.160" end="05:48:42.240" style="s2">what she could accomplish. Even after</p>
<p begin="05:48:40.240" end="05:48:44.320" style="s2">hearing all of that, Leica still refused</p>
<p begin="05:48:42.240" end="05:48:46.160" style="s2">to leave him behind. Zeke simply placed</p>
<p begin="05:48:44.320" end="05:48:48.240" style="s2">a hand on her shoulder and calmly</p>
<p begin="05:48:46.160" end="05:48:49.760" style="s2">reassured her not to worry. He promised</p>
<p begin="05:48:48.240" end="05:48:51.520" style="s2">that he would hold the enemy&#39;s back for</p>
<p begin="05:48:49.760" end="05:48:54.000" style="s2">a while before catching up with everyone</p>
<p begin="05:48:51.520" end="05:48:56.080" style="s2">later. However, Leica suddenly turned</p>
<p begin="05:48:54.000" end="05:48:57.600" style="s2">around with unwavering determination,</p>
<p begin="05:48:56.080" end="05:48:59.760" style="s2">declaring that she would stay behind</p>
<p begin="05:48:57.600" end="05:49:01.760" style="s2">with him no matter what. Sandy stared at</p>
<p begin="05:48:59.760" end="05:49:03.920" style="s2">her in complete disbelief, but Leica</p>
<p begin="05:49:01.760" end="05:49:05.520" style="s2">apologized, saying that even if it was</p>
<p begin="05:49:03.920" end="05:49:07.760" style="s2">for the sake of the mission, she could</p>
<p begin="05:49:05.520" end="05:49:09.920" style="s2">never abandon one of her friends. She</p>
<p begin="05:49:07.760" end="05:49:11.920" style="s2">simply couldn&#39;t abandon Zeke. Without</p>
<p begin="05:49:09.920" end="05:49:13.600" style="s2">waiting another second, Leica instructed</p>
<p begin="05:49:11.920" end="05:49:15.440" style="s2">everyone else to leave immediately.</p>
<p begin="05:49:13.600" end="05:49:16.958" style="s2">Watching her stubborn determination,</p>
<p begin="05:49:15.440" end="05:49:19.440" style="s2">Zeke couldn&#39;t help thinking that she</p>
<p begin="05:49:16.958" end="05:49:21.280" style="s2">truly was impossible to reason with. In</p>
<p begin="05:49:19.440" end="05:49:22.958" style="s2">the very next instant, he delivered a</p>
<p begin="05:49:21.280" end="05:49:24.558" style="s2">precise blow to Leica&#39;s stomach,</p>
<p begin="05:49:22.958" end="05:49:26.320" style="s2">knocking her unconscious before she</p>
<p begin="05:49:24.558" end="05:49:28.638" style="s2">could resist, catching her as she</p>
<p begin="05:49:26.320" end="05:49:30.480" style="s2">collapsed. Zeke called out to Edgis and</p>
