<p begin="05:49:34.320" end="05:49:38.558" style="s2">certain about staying behind alone. Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:49:36.638" end="05:49:40.320" style="s2">simply smiled and replied that it was a</p>
<p begin="05:49:38.558" end="05:49:42.638" style="s2">foolish question. If he said everything</p>
<p begin="05:49:40.320" end="05:49:44.558" style="s2">would be fine, then it would be fine.</p>
<p begin="05:49:42.638" end="05:49:46.080" style="s2">Zeke ordered them to leave immediately,</p>
