<p begin="05:50:06.400" end="05:50:10.320" style="s2">reassuring smile and confidently</p>
<p begin="05:50:08.320" end="05:50:12.480" style="s2">insisted that he would be all right.</p>
<p begin="05:50:10.320" end="05:50:14.080" style="s2">Finally accepting his decision, Edgis</p>
<p begin="05:50:12.480" end="05:50:16.000" style="s2">nodded before promising that they would</p>
<p begin="05:50:14.080" end="05:50:17.440" style="s2">hurry back with reinforcements. As</p>
