<p begin="05:50:17.440" end="05:50:21.760" style="s2">territory, each of them silently prayed</p>
<p begin="05:50:19.440" end="05:50:23.920" style="s2">that Zeke would survive no matter what.</p>
<p begin="05:50:21.760" end="05:50:25.680" style="s2">Meanwhile, Zeke couldn&#39;t help finding it</p>
<p begin="05:50:23.920" end="05:50:28.080" style="s2">strange that people now worried so much</p>
