<p begin="05:52:21.520" end="05:52:26.160" style="s2">himself. To the enemy&#39;s surprise, Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:52:24.160" end="05:52:27.840" style="s2">dismissed that idea entirely, declaring</p>
<p begin="05:52:26.160" end="05:52:30.080" style="s2">that buying time had never been his</p>
<p begin="05:52:27.840" end="05:52:31.520" style="s2">intention. Instead, he admitted that he</p>
