<p begin="05:52:35.840" end="05:52:39.760" style="s2">intended to keep every one of them there</p>
<p begin="05:52:37.520" end="05:52:41.760" style="s2">until he was completely satisfied. Those</p>
<p begin="05:52:39.760" end="05:52:43.680" style="s2">unexpected words left the enemy leader</p>
<p begin="05:52:41.760" end="05:52:46.240" style="s2">utterly bewildered, unable to understand</p>
<p begin="05:52:43.680" end="05:52:48.400" style="s2">what kind of person Zeke truly was. Just</p>
<p begin="05:52:46.240" end="05:52:50.638" style="s2">as both sides were about to clash, a</p>
<p begin="05:52:48.400" end="05:52:52.558" style="s2">blazing crimson aura suddenly erupted</p>
