<p begin="05:53:45.920" end="05:53:49.520" style="s2">specifically to retrieve Master Zeke.</p>
<p begin="05:53:48.240" end="05:53:51.360" style="s2">Although Zeke admitted that he was</p>
<p begin="05:53:49.520" end="05:53:53.440" style="s2">grateful, he could only let out a long</p>
<p begin="05:53:51.360" end="05:53:55.040" style="s2">sigh, making Freya point out that he</p>
