<p begin="05:55:24.480" end="05:55:29.200" style="s2">no presence or trace of true star ether</p>
<p begin="05:55:26.878" end="05:55:31.040" style="s2">whatsoever. Even Lady Freya&#39;s stealth</p>
<p begin="05:55:29.200" end="05:55:33.360" style="s2">technique seemed inferior when compared</p>
<p begin="05:55:31.040" end="05:55:35.360" style="s2">to Luden&#39;s flawless concealment. On top</p>
<p begin="05:55:33.360" end="05:55:37.200" style="s2">of that, the effortless way Luden</p>
<p begin="05:55:35.360" end="05:55:39.440" style="s2">manipulated his dagger clearly</p>
<p begin="05:55:37.200" end="05:55:41.840" style="s2">demonstrated a level of mastery that was</p>
<p begin="05:55:39.440" end="05:55:43.600" style="s2">nothing short of exceptional. As Luden</p>
<p begin="05:55:41.840" end="05:55:45.360" style="s2">casually twirled his dagger around his</p>
<p begin="05:55:43.600" end="05:55:46.798" style="s2">fingers, he remarked that he had heard</p>
<p begin="05:55:45.360" end="05:55:48.958" style="s2">rumors about the patriarch&#39;s</p>
<p begin="05:55:46.798" end="05:55:50.958" style="s2">illegitimate child being rather unusual,</p>
<p begin="05:55:48.958" end="05:55:52.798" style="s2">but after seeing him in person, he found</p>
<p begin="05:55:50.958" end="05:55:54.958" style="s2">Zeke to be a surprisingly interesting</p>
<p begin="05:55:52.798" end="05:55:56.718" style="s2">individual. The Kerberous leader then</p>
<p begin="05:55:54.958" end="05:55:58.480" style="s2">answered Freya&#39;s earlier question,</p>
<p begin="05:55:56.718" end="05:56:00.718" style="s2">admitting that Luden&#39;s appearance had</p>
<p begin="05:55:58.480" end="05:56:02.400" style="s2">certainly been unexpected. However, he</p>
<p begin="05:56:00.718" end="05:56:04.320" style="s2">insisted that their chances of victory</p>
<p begin="05:56:02.400" end="05:56:06.320" style="s2">were still not zero. Hearing such</p>
