<p begin="05:56:14.638" end="05:56:17.760" style="s2">carried away. He reminded them that the</p>
<p begin="05:56:16.558" end="05:56:19.520" style="s2">only reason their heads were still</p>
<p begin="05:56:17.760" end="05:56:21.840" style="s2">attached to their bodies was because he</p>
<p begin="05:56:19.520" end="05:56:23.680" style="s2">had intentionally held back. if he truly</p>
<p begin="05:56:21.840" end="05:56:25.280" style="s2">wished to. He claimed that he could snap</p>
<p begin="05:56:23.680" end="05:56:27.680" style="s2">every single one of their necks in an</p>
<p begin="05:56:25.280" end="05:56:29.520" style="s2">instant. His overwhelming confidence</p>
<p begin="05:56:27.680" end="05:56:31.680" style="s2">visibly shook several members of the</p>
<p begin="05:56:29.520" end="05:56:33.440" style="s2">Kerberus family, although their leader</p>
<p begin="05:56:31.680" end="05:56:35.920" style="s2">boldly challenged him to prove those</p>
<p begin="05:56:33.440" end="05:56:37.920" style="s2">words if he was truly capable. Luden</p>
<p begin="05:56:35.920" end="05:56:39.440" style="s2">simply apologized for disappointing them</p>
<p begin="05:56:37.920" end="05:56:40.958" style="s2">before revealing that he was not the</p>
<p begin="05:56:39.440" end="05:56:42.958" style="s2">only reinforcement who had arrived</p>
<p begin="05:56:40.958" end="05:56:44.718" style="s2">either. The very next moment, a</p>
