<p begin="05:56:44.718" end="05:56:48.480" style="s2">view, accompanied by an overwhelming</p>
<p begin="05:56:46.638" end="05:56:50.000" style="s2">golden dragon aura that descended upon</p>
<p begin="05:56:48.480" end="05:56:52.160" style="s2">the battlefield with terrifying</p>
<p begin="05:56:50.000" end="05:56:53.840" style="s2">pressure. The crushing aura forced every</p>
<p begin="05:56:52.160" end="05:56:55.840" style="s2">member of the Kerberous family onto</p>
<p begin="05:56:53.840" end="05:56:57.600" style="s2">their knees as disbelief filled their</p>
<p begin="05:56:55.840" end="05:56:59.280" style="s2">faces. They could hardly believe that</p>
<p begin="05:56:57.600" end="05:57:01.200" style="s2">even Menick, the educator, had</p>
<p begin="05:56:59.280" end="05:57:02.638" style="s2">personally appeared. Luden mockingly</p>
<p begin="05:57:01.200" end="05:57:04.320" style="s2">reminded the enemies that they had been</p>
