<p begin="05:57:04.320" end="05:57:08.638" style="s2">force only moments ago before asking</p>
<p begin="05:57:06.878" end="05:57:10.320" style="s2">what they intended to do now. If they</p>
<p begin="05:57:08.638" end="05:57:12.240" style="s2">still wish to fight, then he would</p>
<p begin="05:57:10.320" end="05:57:14.000" style="s2">gladly become their opponent. With a</p>
<p begin="05:57:12.240" end="05:57:16.000" style="s2">grin, he added that if anyone was going</p>
<p begin="05:57:14.000" end="05:57:18.160" style="s2">to disappear today, it certainly would</p>
<p begin="05:57:16.000" end="05:57:20.558" style="s2">not be him. The leader of the Kerrous</p>
<p begin="05:57:18.160" end="05:57:22.160" style="s2">family silently evaluated the situation,</p>
<p begin="05:57:20.558" end="05:57:24.000" style="s2">although they still held the numerical</p>
<p begin="05:57:22.160" end="05:57:26.080" style="s2">advantage. Facing both the Phantom</p>
<p begin="05:57:24.000" end="05:57:27.600" style="s2">Shadow and the Educator at the same time</p>
<p begin="05:57:26.080" end="05:57:29.680" style="s2">completely shifted the odds against</p>
<p begin="05:57:27.600" end="05:57:31.520" style="s2">them. Realizing that continuing the</p>
<p begin="05:57:29.680" end="05:57:32.878" style="s2">battle would only lead to disaster, he</p>
<p begin="05:57:31.520" end="05:57:34.558" style="s2">reluctantly admitted that it was</p>
<p begin="05:57:32.878" end="05:57:36.080" style="s2">unfortunate, but announced that they</p>
<p begin="05:57:34.558" end="05:57:37.520" style="s2">would withdraw for now. Luden</p>
<p begin="05:57:36.080" end="05:57:38.878" style="s2">immediately questioned whether they</p>
<p begin="05:57:37.520" end="05:57:41.040" style="s2">actually believed they would simply be</p>
<p begin="05:57:38.878" end="05:57:42.798" style="s2">allowed to leave peacefully. However,</p>
<p begin="05:57:41.040" end="05:57:44.558" style="s2">before he could finish speaking, his</p>
<p begin="05:57:42.798" end="05:57:46.320" style="s2">expression changed ever so slightly</p>
<p begin="05:57:44.558" end="05:57:48.320" style="s2">after noticing the enemy leader pulling</p>
<p begin="05:57:46.320" end="05:57:50.400" style="s2">out a small purple bead. While Zeke</p>
<p begin="05:57:48.320" end="05:57:52.400" style="s2">wondered what the mysterious object was,</p>
<p begin="05:57:50.400" end="05:57:54.000" style="s2">Luden instantly dashed forward with</p>
<p begin="05:57:52.400" end="05:57:56.080" style="s2">every intention of stopping them from</p>
<p begin="05:57:54.000" end="05:57:58.000" style="s2">escaping. Unfortunately, the enemy</p>
<p begin="05:57:56.080" end="05:57:59.760" style="s2">leader coldly remarked that Luden was</p>
<p begin="05:57:58.000" end="05:58:02.160" style="s2">already too late before crushing the</p>
<p begin="05:57:59.760" end="05:58:04.000" style="s2">purple bead in his hand. In an instant,</p>
<p begin="05:58:02.160" end="05:58:06.080" style="s2">a brilliant explosion of purple light</p>
<p begin="05:58:04.000" end="05:58:07.760" style="s2">engulfed the entire area, forcing</p>
<p begin="05:58:06.080" end="05:58:10.240" style="s2">everyone to shield their eyes from the</p>
<p begin="05:58:07.760" end="05:58:12.080" style="s2">blinding flash. By the time Zeke finally</p>
<p begin="05:58:10.240" end="05:58:13.680" style="s2">opened his eyes again, every single</p>
<p begin="05:58:12.080" end="05:58:15.600" style="s2">member of the Kerberous family had</p>
<p begin="05:58:13.680" end="05:58:18.000" style="s2">already vanished without leaving behind</p>
<p begin="05:58:15.600" end="05:58:19.840" style="s2">a single trace. Scratching his head in</p>
<p begin="05:58:18.000" end="05:58:21.360" style="s2">disappointment, Luden admitted that he</p>
<p begin="05:58:19.840" end="05:58:22.798" style="s2">had never expected those enemies to</p>
<p begin="05:58:21.360" end="05:58:24.798" style="s2">possess something as rare as a</p>
<p begin="05:58:22.798" end="05:58:27.280" style="s2">teleportation orb. Curious about the</p>
<p begin="05:58:24.798" end="05:58:30.000" style="s2">mysterious item, Zeke immediately asked</p>
<p begin="05:58:27.280" end="05:58:31.760" style="s2">what exactly a teleportation orb was.</p>
<p begin="05:58:30.000" end="05:58:34.000" style="s2">Freya explained that it was a magical</p>
<p begin="05:58:31.760" end="05:58:35.760" style="s2">tool infused with magic, capable of</p>
<p begin="05:58:34.000" end="05:58:37.760" style="s2">instantly transporting its user to a</p>
