<p begin="05:58:37.760" end="05:58:41.840" style="s2">destroyed. She further explained that</p>
<p begin="05:58:39.680" end="05:58:44.240" style="s2">such magic tools were incredibly rare</p>
<p begin="05:58:41.840" end="05:58:45.920" style="s2">and extremely difficult to obtain. The</p>
<p begin="05:58:44.240" end="05:58:48.080" style="s2">instant Zeke learned about the existence</p>
<p begin="05:58:45.920" end="05:58:50.320" style="s2">of such a mysterious item, his eyes</p>
<p begin="05:58:48.080" end="05:58:52.558" style="s2">sparkled with excitement. However, only</p>
<p begin="05:58:50.320" end="05:58:54.240" style="s2">a second later, tears suddenly welled up</p>
<p begin="05:58:52.558" end="05:58:55.840" style="s2">in his eyes. Even though he had just</p>
<p begin="05:58:54.240" end="05:58:57.600" style="s2">discovered an entirely new type of</p>
<p begin="05:58:55.840" end="05:58:59.920" style="s2">magical item, the enemies had still</p>
<p begin="05:58:57.600" end="05:59:01.840" style="s2">managed to escape right before his eyes.</p>
<p begin="05:58:59.920" end="05:59:03.280" style="s2">Freya agreed with his frustration,</p>
<p begin="05:59:01.840" end="05:59:04.958" style="s2">explaining that if they had captured</p>
<p begin="05:59:03.280" end="05:59:06.638" style="s2">those enemies alive, they could have</p>
