<p begin="05:59:06.638" end="05:59:10.240" style="s2">information from them. Before she could</p>
<p begin="05:59:08.320" end="05:59:12.000" style="s2">finish speaking, however, Zeke admitted</p>
<p begin="05:59:10.240" end="05:59:13.680" style="s2">that the only thing he truly regretted</p>
<p begin="05:59:12.000" end="05:59:16.000" style="s2">was not getting the chance to fight them</p>
<p begin="05:59:13.680" end="05:59:17.920" style="s2">properly. Those words immediately caused</p>
<p begin="05:59:16.000" end="05:59:19.680" style="s2">Luden to burst into uncontrollable</p>
<p begin="05:59:17.920" end="05:59:21.200" style="s2">laughter, clutching his stomach as he</p>
<p begin="05:59:19.680" end="05:59:23.440" style="s2">declared that Zeke was absolutely</p>
<p begin="05:59:21.200" end="05:59:25.200" style="s2">hilarious. Menrich then calmly stated</p>
<p begin="05:59:23.440" end="05:59:27.280" style="s2">that it seemed the enemy had ultimately</p>
<p begin="05:59:25.200" end="05:59:29.440" style="s2">escaped after all, and Freya could only</p>
<p begin="05:59:27.280" end="05:59:30.798" style="s2">nod in agreement, admitting that she</p>
<p begin="05:59:29.440" end="05:59:32.798" style="s2">never imagined they had prepared</p>
<p begin="05:59:30.798" end="05:59:35.360" style="s2">something as rare as a teleportation orb</p>
<p begin="05:59:32.798" end="05:59:36.878" style="s2">in advance. Even so, Menrich reminded</p>
<p begin="05:59:35.360" end="05:59:38.878" style="s2">everyone that although the enemies had</p>
<p begin="05:59:36.878" end="05:59:41.120" style="s2">fled, the Kerberous family&#39;s territory</p>
<p begin="05:59:38.878" end="05:59:42.798" style="s2">was located nearby, meaning they could</p>
