<p begin="06:00:09.200" end="06:00:13.120" style="s2">worry. Zeke acknowledged that having</p>
<p begin="06:00:11.120" end="06:00:14.798" style="s2">them there was certainly reassuring, but</p>
<p begin="06:00:13.120" end="06:00:17.280" style="s2">the expression on his face remained</p>
<p begin="06:00:14.798" end="06:00:19.280" style="s2">strangely dissatisfied. Noticing this,</p>
<p begin="06:00:17.280" end="06:00:21.680" style="s2">Freya could not help but ask once again</p>
<p begin="06:00:19.280" end="06:00:23.760" style="s2">why he still looked so displeased. Just</p>
<p begin="06:00:21.680" end="06:00:25.120" style="s2">then, Mench called out to Zeke and</p>
<p begin="06:00:23.760" end="06:00:27.280" style="s2">explained that there was something he</p>
<p begin="06:00:25.120" end="06:00:28.798" style="s2">wished to ask regarding the magic water.</p>
<p begin="06:00:27.280" end="06:00:30.958" style="s2">However, instead of showing any</p>
<p begin="06:00:28.798" end="06:00:32.558" style="s2">particular reaction, Zeke simply looked</p>
<p begin="06:00:30.958" end="06:00:34.958" style="s2">back at Menrich as though the matter was</p>
<p begin="06:00:32.558" end="06:00:36.718" style="s2">completely ordinary to him. Leica felt a</p>
<p begin="06:00:34.958" end="06:00:38.638" style="s2">huge sense of relief the moment she saw</p>
<p begin="06:00:36.718" end="06:00:40.320" style="s2">Zeke and the others return. She</p>
<p begin="06:00:38.638" end="06:00:42.240" style="s2">immediately called out his name while</p>
<p begin="06:00:40.320" end="06:00:43.680" style="s2">Zeke simply waved at them with a smile</p>
<p begin="06:00:42.240" end="06:00:45.520" style="s2">and said that he was glad to see</p>
<p begin="06:00:43.680" end="06:00:47.360" style="s2">everyone had made it back safely. Just</p>
<p begin="06:00:45.520" end="06:00:49.680" style="s2">as Leica was about to say something,</p>
<p begin="06:00:47.360" end="06:00:52.160" style="s2">Zeke suddenly apologized, leaving her</p>
<p begin="06:00:49.680" end="06:00:53.680" style="s2">completely confused. He apologized once</p>
<p begin="06:00:52.160" end="06:00:55.600" style="s2">again for knocking her out earlier and</p>
<p begin="06:00:53.680" end="06:00:57.040" style="s2">asked if she had been hurt anywhere. Lea</p>
<p begin="06:00:55.600" end="06:00:58.878" style="s2">quickly shook her head and assured him</p>
<p begin="06:00:57.040" end="06:01:00.958" style="s2">that she was completely fine. But in the</p>
<p begin="06:00:58.878" end="06:01:03.040" style="s2">very next moment, tears began streaming</p>
<p begin="06:01:00.958" end="06:01:04.638" style="s2">down her face as she cried out that what</p>
<p begin="06:01:03.040" end="06:01:06.638" style="s2">she wanted to say had nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="06:01:04.638" end="06:01:08.320" style="s2">the punch. She was blaming herself</p>
<p begin="06:01:06.638" end="06:01:10.160" style="s2">because she had run away and left Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:01:08.320" end="06:01:12.320" style="s2">behind all alone. Yet, he never got</p>
<p begin="06:01:10.160" end="06:01:14.000" style="s2">angry with her. Instead, Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="06:01:12.320" end="06:01:15.680" style="s2">reached over and gently patted her on</p>
<p begin="06:01:14.000" end="06:01:17.360" style="s2">the head before telling her that nothing</p>
<p begin="06:01:15.680" end="06:01:19.520" style="s2">had happened to him either, which meant</p>
<p begin="06:01:17.360" end="06:01:20.878" style="s2">everything had turned out just fine. He</p>
<p begin="06:01:19.520" end="06:01:22.558" style="s2">added that if what had happened was</p>
<p begin="06:01:20.878" end="06:01:24.480" style="s2">still weighing on her heart, then she</p>
<p begin="06:01:22.558" end="06:01:26.638" style="s2">should stop dwelling on it and focus on</p>
<p begin="06:01:24.480" end="06:01:28.558" style="s2">becoming stronger from that day forward.</p>
<p begin="06:01:26.638" end="06:01:30.958" style="s2">Hearing those words, Leica fell silent.</p>
<p begin="06:01:28.558" end="06:01:33.200" style="s2">After wiping away her tears, she quietly</p>
<p begin="06:01:30.958" end="06:01:34.718" style="s2">nodded in agreement. Edges then admitted</p>
<p begin="06:01:33.200" end="06:01:37.200" style="s2">that he was honestly relieved to see</p>
<p begin="06:01:34.718" end="06:01:38.798" style="s2">Zeke unharmed. Sandy, on the other hand,</p>
<p begin="06:01:37.200" end="06:01:40.878" style="s2">confessed that when she heard Zeke was</p>
<p begin="06:01:38.798" end="06:01:42.638" style="s2">planning to stay behind by himself, she</p>
<p begin="06:01:40.878" end="06:01:45.120" style="s2">genuinely thought he had completely lost</p>
<p begin="06:01:42.638" end="06:01:46.480" style="s2">his mind. Leela also spoke up, saying</p>
<p begin="06:01:45.120" end="06:01:48.798" style="s2">she was simply thankful that</p>
<p begin="06:01:46.480" end="06:01:50.558" style="s2">reinforcements had arrived in time. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:01:48.798" end="06:01:52.240" style="s2">nodded in agreement, saying that he</p>
<p begin="06:01:50.558" end="06:01:54.638" style="s2">appreciated everyone for worrying about</p>
<p begin="06:01:52.240" end="06:01:55.600" style="s2">him. However, he jokingly added that</p>
<p begin="06:01:54.638" end="06:01:57.440" style="s2">they should have delayed the</p>
<p begin="06:01:55.600" end="06:01:59.120" style="s2">reinforcements just a little longer</p>
<p begin="06:01:57.440" end="06:02:00.638" style="s2">because Freya and the others had shown</p>
<p begin="06:01:59.120" end="06:02:03.040" style="s2">up before he even got the chance to</p>
<p begin="06:02:00.638" end="06:02:05.360" style="s2">fight the enemies himself. Sandy stared</p>
<p begin="06:02:03.040" end="06:02:06.718" style="s2">at him in complete disbelief while Edges</p>
<p begin="06:02:05.360" end="06:02:08.718" style="s2">immediately asked if he had actually</p>
<p begin="06:02:06.718" end="06:02:10.638" style="s2">been planning to fight a six-star expert</p>
<p begin="06:02:08.718" end="06:02:12.798" style="s2">along with several five-star enemies</p>
<p begin="06:02:10.638" end="06:02:14.480" style="s2">completely on his own. Zeke merely</p>
<p begin="06:02:12.798" end="06:02:16.320" style="s2">looked back at them and casually asked</p>
<p begin="06:02:14.480" end="06:02:18.558" style="s2">if that was really impossible. Hearing</p>
<p begin="06:02:16.320" end="06:02:20.160" style="s2">such a ridiculous response, Venal could</p>
<p begin="06:02:18.558" end="06:02:23.040" style="s2">only stare at him before declaring that</p>
<p begin="06:02:20.160" end="06:02:25.200" style="s2">Zeke truly was insane. At that moment,</p>
<p begin="06:02:23.040" end="06:02:26.958" style="s2">Freya suddenly interrupted, saying that</p>
<p begin="06:02:25.200" end="06:02:28.798" style="s2">this was the very first time she had</p>
