<p begin="06:02:57.520" end="06:03:00.878" style="s2">expression turned to complete shock as</p>
<p begin="06:02:59.200" end="06:03:03.520" style="s2">he noticed the rainbow colored liquid</p>
<p begin="06:03:00.878" end="06:03:05.280" style="s2">inside. Confused, Lea asked what he</p>
