<p begin="06:04:05.360" end="06:04:09.600" style="s2">traces of the rainbow magic waters power</p>
<p begin="06:04:07.520" end="06:04:11.760" style="s2">flowing through their bodies. Hearing</p>
<p begin="06:04:09.600" end="06:04:14.000" style="s2">that, Edges silently admitted to himself</p>
<p begin="06:04:11.760" end="06:04:15.840" style="s2">that deceiving a Sevenstar expert truly</p>
<p begin="06:04:14.000" end="06:04:17.360" style="s2">was impossible. Freya immediately</p>
<p begin="06:04:15.840" end="06:04:18.798" style="s2">shouted at Zeke and the others,</p>
<p begin="06:04:17.360" end="06:04:21.040" style="s2">demanding to know what they had been</p>
<p begin="06:04:18.798" end="06:04:22.480" style="s2">thinking. Zeke simply tilted his head</p>
<p begin="06:04:21.040" end="06:04:24.080" style="s2">and asked what she meant before</p>
<p begin="06:04:22.480" end="06:04:26.160" style="s2">questioning whether drinking the magic</p>
