<p begin="06:04:50.400" end="06:04:55.120" style="s2">more than sophistry. Zeke calmly denied</p>
<p begin="06:04:53.120" end="06:04:57.520" style="s2">the accusation, insisting that he was</p>
<p begin="06:04:55.120" end="06:04:59.760" style="s2">simply stating the facts. Besides, they</p>
<p begin="06:04:57.520" end="06:05:01.600" style="s2">had still left one bottle untouched, so</p>
<p begin="06:04:59.760" end="06:05:03.920" style="s2">he genuinely failed to see where the</p>
<p begin="06:05:01.600" end="06:05:05.840" style="s2">problem was. Those words left Freya</p>
<p begin="06:05:03.920" end="06:05:07.600" style="s2">completely speechless and even caused</p>
<p begin="06:05:05.840" end="06:05:09.520" style="s2">Menrich to let out another exhausted</p>
<p begin="06:05:07.600" end="06:05:11.760" style="s2">sigh. still constantly changing</p>
