<p begin="06:05:17.840" end="06:05:21.520" style="s2">He apologized to Zeke and the others for</p>
<p begin="06:05:19.760" end="06:05:23.600" style="s2">that mistake. Freya immediately</p>
<p begin="06:05:21.520" end="06:05:25.840" style="s2">protested, arguing that such reasoning</p>
