<p begin="06:06:11.600" end="06:06:15.280" style="s2">nothing was wrong. Mentric immediately</p>
<p begin="06:06:13.760" end="06:06:17.200" style="s2">lowered his head and sincerely</p>
<p begin="06:06:15.280" end="06:06:19.040" style="s2">apologized, admitting that the</p>
