<p begin="06:06:38.080" end="06:06:41.680" style="s2">for the children to be shown mercy.</p>
<p begin="06:06:39.840" end="06:06:43.440" style="s2">Before he could even finish speaking,</p>
<p begin="06:06:41.680" end="06:06:45.680" style="s2">Menri&lt;unk&gt;&#39;s eyes suddenly widened in</p>
<p begin="06:06:43.440" end="06:06:47.760" style="s2">horror. Balsa instantly released his</p>
