<p begin="06:07:42.160" end="06:07:45.920" style="s2">terrifying pressure. Standing there as</p>
<p begin="06:07:44.320" end="06:07:48.160" style="s2">though nothing serious was happening at</p>
<p begin="06:07:45.920" end="06:07:49.920" style="s2">all. Zeke casually remarked that Balsza</p>
<p begin="06:07:48.160" end="06:07:51.440" style="s2">was just as intimidating as ever.</p>
<p begin="06:07:49.920" end="06:07:53.760" style="s2">Although he had not changed even a</p>
