<p begin="06:07:59.600" end="06:08:03.360" style="s2">with rage. Yet Zeke acted as though none</p>
<p begin="06:08:01.760" end="06:08:05.200" style="s2">of it affected him in the slightest.</p>
<p begin="06:08:03.360" end="06:08:08.000" style="s2">While casually cleaning the wax from his</p>
<p begin="06:08:05.200" end="06:08:09.760" style="s2">ear, he calmly asked Balsza what exactly</p>
<p begin="06:08:08.000" end="06:08:11.360" style="s2">he had to be upset about. They had</p>
