<p begin="06:08:26.480" end="06:08:30.400" style="s2">powerful individuals who had earned it,</p>
<p begin="06:08:28.400" end="06:08:32.798" style="s2">allowing House Eldreon to reach even</p>
<p begin="06:08:30.400" end="06:08:34.798" style="s2">greater heights. Instead, according to</p>
<p begin="06:08:32.798" end="06:08:36.480" style="s2">Balsa, a group of worthless weaklings</p>
<p begin="06:08:34.798" end="06:08:38.798" style="s2">had wasted such an irreplaceable</p>
<p begin="06:08:36.480" end="06:08:40.638" style="s2">treasure. Zeke, however, calmly replied</p>
<p begin="06:08:38.798" end="06:08:42.400" style="s2">that Leica and the others were more than</p>
<p begin="06:08:40.638" end="06:08:44.400" style="s2">capable of becoming the very strength</p>
<p begin="06:08:42.400" end="06:08:47.120" style="s2">that would one day bring unparalleled</p>
<p begin="06:08:44.400" end="06:08:49.200" style="s2">prosperity to House Eldreon. At that</p>
<p begin="06:08:47.120" end="06:08:51.040" style="s2">moment, Menrich hurriedly tried to stop</p>
<p begin="06:08:49.200" end="06:08:53.040" style="s2">Zeke from continuing to argue with the</p>
<p begin="06:08:51.040" end="06:08:55.040" style="s2">patriarch. Still maintaining his dragon</p>
<p begin="06:08:53.040" end="06:08:57.600" style="s2">aura, Balsa demanded to know exactly</p>
<p begin="06:08:55.040" end="06:08:59.200" style="s2">what kind of person Zeke truly was. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:08:57.600" end="06:09:01.040" style="s2">simply shrugged before asking what</p>
<p begin="06:08:59.200" end="06:09:03.120" style="s2">difference it would make. Regardless of</p>
<p begin="06:09:01.040" end="06:09:04.878" style="s2">what Balsa believed, the single bottle</p>
<p begin="06:09:03.120" end="06:09:06.798" style="s2">sitting on the table was now all that</p>
<p begin="06:09:04.878" end="06:09:09.120" style="s2">remained. Those words caused the room to</p>
<p begin="06:09:06.798" end="06:09:11.360" style="s2">fall silent as Balsa and Zeke stared</p>
<p begin="06:09:09.120" end="06:09:13.440" style="s2">directly into each other&#39;s eyes. After a</p>
<p begin="06:09:11.360" end="06:09:15.360" style="s2">long moment, Balsza finally lowered his</p>
<p begin="06:09:13.440" end="06:09:17.200" style="s2">gaze and closed his eyes before calmly</p>
<p begin="06:09:15.360" end="06:09:18.878" style="s2">stating that Zeke was free to justify</p>
<p begin="06:09:17.200" end="06:09:20.718" style="s2">his actions however he wished.</p>
<p begin="06:09:18.878" end="06:09:22.240" style="s2">Nevertheless, he had deliberately</p>
<p begin="06:09:20.718" end="06:09:24.320" style="s2">twisted the mission&#39;s purpose through</p>
<p begin="06:09:22.240" end="06:09:26.638" style="s2">absurd reasoning and had obstructed the</p>
<p begin="06:09:24.320" end="06:09:28.320" style="s2">prosperity of House Eldreon. Because of</p>
<p begin="06:09:26.638" end="06:09:30.160" style="s2">that, they would all have to pay for</p>
<p begin="06:09:28.320" end="06:09:32.160" style="s2">their crime. Edgis and the others were</p>
<p begin="06:09:30.160" end="06:09:34.080" style="s2">immediately horrified. But Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="06:09:32.160" end="06:09:36.160" style="s2">let out a long sigh before calmly</p>
<p begin="06:09:34.080" end="06:09:37.760" style="s2">telling Balsa that if he truly wanted to</p>
<p begin="06:09:36.160" end="06:09:40.400" style="s2">punish someone, then he should punish</p>
<p begin="06:09:37.760" end="06:09:42.718" style="s2">him alone. Once again, Balsa fell</p>
<p begin="06:09:40.400" end="06:09:44.240" style="s2">silent. Lea nervously called out Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:09:42.718" end="06:09:45.840" style="s2">name and asked what he meant. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:09:44.240" end="06:09:47.600" style="s2">calmly explained that he had been the</p>
<p begin="06:09:45.840" end="06:09:49.520" style="s2">one who convinced Lea and the others in</p>
<p begin="06:09:47.600" end="06:09:51.360" style="s2">the first place. Since everything had</p>
<p begin="06:09:49.520" end="06:09:53.280" style="s2">started with him, then punishing only</p>
<p begin="06:09:51.360" end="06:09:54.958" style="s2">him should be enough. He even asked</p>
<p begin="06:09:53.280" end="06:09:56.958" style="s2">Balsza if that wasn&#39;t the most</p>
<p begin="06:09:54.958" end="06:09:58.878" style="s2">reasonable conclusion. Menrix stared at</p>
<p begin="06:09:56.958" end="06:10:00.798" style="s2">him in complete disbelief before</p>
<p begin="06:09:58.878" end="06:10:03.280" style="s2">immediately asking whether what Zeke had</p>
<p begin="06:10:00.798" end="06:10:05.520" style="s2">just said was actually true. Desperate</p>
<p begin="06:10:03.280" end="06:10:07.280" style="s2">to protect him, Leica quickly denied it,</p>
<p begin="06:10:05.520" end="06:10:09.120" style="s2">insisting that drinking the magic water</p>
<p begin="06:10:07.280" end="06:10:10.958" style="s2">had been their own decision. But Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:10:09.120" end="06:10:12.878" style="s2">calmly insisted that everything he had</p>
<p begin="06:10:10.958" end="06:10:15.360" style="s2">said was the truth. After hearing the</p>
