<p begin="06:10:15.360" end="06:10:18.638" style="s2">front of the children and respectfully</p>
<p begin="06:10:16.958" end="06:10:20.320" style="s2">declared that he would personally accept</p>
<p begin="06:10:18.638" end="06:10:22.400" style="s2">whatever punishment had originally been</p>
<p begin="06:10:20.320" end="06:10:24.798" style="s2">meant for them as well. He asked if that</p>
<p begin="06:10:22.400" end="06:10:26.638" style="s2">would satisfy Balsza. Just as always,</p>
<p begin="06:10:24.798" end="06:10:28.400" style="s2">Balsa remained silent while carefully</p>
<p begin="06:10:26.638" end="06:10:30.080" style="s2">considering the matter, whereas Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:10:28.400" end="06:10:32.320" style="s2">simply continued smiling at him without</p>
<p begin="06:10:30.080" end="06:10:34.320" style="s2">the slightest trace of fear. Finally,</p>
<p begin="06:10:32.320" end="06:10:35.920" style="s2">Balsa agreed. He declared that he would</p>
<p begin="06:10:34.320" end="06:10:38.000" style="s2">inflict the entirety of their punishment</p>
<p begin="06:10:35.920" end="06:10:40.080" style="s2">upon Menric alone. Leica immediately</p>
<p begin="06:10:38.000" end="06:10:41.920" style="s2">tried to object, but Balsa cut her off</p>
<p begin="06:10:40.080" end="06:10:43.840" style="s2">before she could continue. Since they</p>
<p begin="06:10:41.920" end="06:10:45.360" style="s2">had already consumed the rainbow magic</p>
<p begin="06:10:43.840" end="06:10:47.200" style="s2">water, they would now have to prove</p>
<p begin="06:10:45.360" end="06:10:49.280" style="s2">themselves useful as pawns of House</p>
<p begin="06:10:47.200" end="06:10:51.280" style="s2">Eldreon. Should any of them eventually</p>
<p begin="06:10:49.280" end="06:10:53.920" style="s2">prove worthless, they would all face the</p>
<p begin="06:10:51.280" end="06:10:55.600" style="s2">consequences. Hearing those words, Lea</p>
<p begin="06:10:53.920" end="06:10:57.760" style="s2">immediately bowed her head and declared</p>
<p begin="06:10:55.600" end="06:10:59.280" style="s2">that she understood. Balsa then ordered</p>
<p begin="06:10:57.760" end="06:11:00.878" style="s2">that the children be escorted to the</p>
<p begin="06:10:59.280" end="06:11:02.480" style="s2">second floor of the Dragon Hall,</p>
<p begin="06:11:00.878" end="06:11:04.878" style="s2">instructing everyone to carry out his</p>
<p begin="06:11:02.480" end="06:11:06.718" style="s2">orders immediately. Somewhat surprised,</p>
<p begin="06:11:04.878" end="06:11:08.558" style="s2">Menrich cautiously asked whether Lord</p>
<p begin="06:11:06.718" end="06:11:10.400" style="s2">Balsa was truly certain about this</p>
<p begin="06:11:08.558" end="06:11:11.840" style="s2">decision. Balsa simply replied that</p>
<p begin="06:11:10.400" end="06:11:13.600" style="s2">Menrich had misunderstood his</p>
<p begin="06:11:11.840" end="06:11:15.440" style="s2">intentions. This was not an act of</p>
<p begin="06:11:13.600" end="06:11:17.440" style="s2">kindness toward the children. It was</p>
<p begin="06:11:15.440" end="06:11:19.280" style="s2">merely a way to ensure the rainbow magic</p>
<p begin="06:11:17.440" end="06:11:21.200" style="s2">water would not go to waste. Upon</p>
<p begin="06:11:19.280" end="06:11:23.040" style="s2">hearing that explanation, Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:11:21.200" end="06:11:24.958" style="s2">finally nodded, saying that he now</p>
<p begin="06:11:23.040" end="06:11:26.798" style="s2">understood. The moment Zeke heard the</p>
<p begin="06:11:24.958" end="06:11:28.958" style="s2">words Dragon Hall, he immediately</p>
<p begin="06:11:26.798" end="06:11:30.718" style="s2">grinned and jokingly asked if Balsa was</p>
<p begin="06:11:28.958" end="06:11:32.160" style="s2">actually rewarding him. He even</p>
<p begin="06:11:30.718" end="06:11:34.080" style="s2">mentioned that he had already visited</p>
<p begin="06:11:32.160" end="06:11:35.840" style="s2">the second floor before, so perhaps</p>
<p begin="06:11:34.080" end="06:11:38.160" style="s2">Balsa should simply allow him to enter</p>
<p begin="06:11:35.840" end="06:11:40.240" style="s2">the dragon treasury instead. Seizing the</p>
<p begin="06:11:38.160" end="06:11:42.000" style="s2">opportunity, Zeke boldly added that</p>
<p begin="06:11:40.240" end="06:11:44.160" style="s2">Balsa might as well let him visit the</p>
<p begin="06:11:42.000" end="06:11:45.680" style="s2">third floor while he was at it. Balsa</p>
<p begin="06:11:44.160" end="06:11:47.600" style="s2">simply stared at him with a firm</p>
<p begin="06:11:45.680" end="06:11:49.760" style="s2">expression before a faint smirk slowly</p>
<p begin="06:11:47.600" end="06:11:51.360" style="s2">appeared on his face. He calmly replied</p>
<p begin="06:11:49.760" end="06:11:52.958" style="s2">that Zeke would not be going to the</p>
<p begin="06:11:51.360" end="06:11:54.558" style="s2">third floor. Instead, he would</p>
<p begin="06:11:52.958" end="06:11:57.360" style="s2">personally send him somewhere far more</p>
<p begin="06:11:54.558" end="06:11:59.200" style="s2">special. Completely confused, Zeke asked</p>
<p begin="06:11:57.360" end="06:12:01.120" style="s2">what he meant. While even Menrich looked</p>
<p begin="06:11:59.200" end="06:12:03.280" style="s2">toward Balsa in surprise without</p>
<p begin="06:12:01.120" end="06:12:05.440" style="s2">changing his expression, Balsa solemnly</p>
<p begin="06:12:03.280" end="06:12:07.200" style="s2">declared his final order. Zeke would be</p>
<p begin="06:12:05.440" end="06:12:09.200" style="s2">exiled to the valley of the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:12:07.200" end="06:12:11.280" style="s2">dragon. The moment those words echoed</p>
<p begin="06:12:09.200" end="06:12:13.200" style="s2">throughout the room, both Menrich and A</p>
<p begin="06:12:11.280" end="06:12:15.120" style="s2">were visibly shocked by the severity of</p>
<p begin="06:12:13.200" end="06:12:17.200" style="s2">the sentence. Yet, despite being</p>
<p begin="06:12:15.120" end="06:12:18.878" style="s2">condemned to such a terrifying place,</p>
<p begin="06:12:17.200" end="06:12:21.280" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s confident smile never</p>
<p begin="06:12:18.878" end="06:12:23.120" style="s2">disappeared. Again, Zeke remained</p>
<p begin="06:12:21.280" end="06:12:24.878" style="s2">completely confident while everyone else</p>
<p begin="06:12:23.120" end="06:12:26.638" style="s2">grew tense the moment they heard Balsa</p>
<p begin="06:12:24.878" end="06:12:28.638" style="s2">order him to go to the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:12:26.638" end="06:12:30.400" style="s2">Valley. Menrix stuttered as he asked</p>
<p begin="06:12:28.638" end="06:12:32.558" style="s2">Balsa if what he had just heard was</p>
<p begin="06:12:30.400" end="06:12:34.480" style="s2">really true. Zeke, on the other hand,</p>
<p begin="06:12:32.558" end="06:12:36.480" style="s2">simply asked if Balsa had really said</p>
<p begin="06:12:34.480" end="06:12:38.798" style="s2">the abandoned Dragon Valley before</p>
<p begin="06:12:36.480" end="06:12:40.958" style="s2">Balsza could even answer. Zeke excitedly</p>
<p begin="06:12:38.798" end="06:12:42.638" style="s2">responded himself, telling Balsa that it</p>
<p begin="06:12:40.958" end="06:12:44.878" style="s2">sounded perfectly fine to him, and that</p>
<p begin="06:12:42.638" end="06:12:46.558" style="s2">he had no problem going there. Balsa</p>
<p begin="06:12:44.878" end="06:12:48.400" style="s2">silently stared at Zeke for a moment</p>
<p begin="06:12:46.558" end="06:12:50.000" style="s2">before asking if he had any idea what</p>
<p begin="06:12:48.400" end="06:12:52.000" style="s2">kind of place the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:12:50.000" end="06:12:54.080" style="s2">Valley actually was. Shouting without</p>
<p begin="06:12:52.000" end="06:12:56.000" style="s2">the slightest hesitation, Zeke admitted</p>
<p begin="06:12:54.080" end="06:12:58.240" style="s2">that he had absolutely no idea what kind</p>
<p begin="06:12:56.000" end="06:13:00.320" style="s2">of place it was. However, that was</p>
<p begin="06:12:58.240" end="06:13:02.160" style="s2">exactly what made it exciting for him.</p>
<p begin="06:13:00.320" end="06:13:04.240" style="s2">The less he knew and the more dangerous</p>
<p begin="06:13:02.160" end="06:13:06.320" style="s2">the place was, the more excited he</p>
<p begin="06:13:04.240" end="06:13:07.600" style="s2">became. Unable to understand why Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:13:06.320" end="06:13:09.760" style="s2">was so thrilled by the thought of</p>
<p begin="06:13:07.600" end="06:13:11.680" style="s2">entering such a deadly place, Balsza</p>
<p begin="06:13:09.760" end="06:13:14.080" style="s2">remained silent while staring firmly at</p>
<p begin="06:13:11.680" end="06:13:15.760" style="s2">him. Zeke then confidently declared that</p>
<p begin="06:13:14.080" end="06:13:17.840" style="s2">it did not matter what kind of place the</p>
<p begin="06:13:15.760" end="06:13:19.200" style="s2">abandoned dragon valley was because he</p>
<p begin="06:13:17.840" end="06:13:21.120" style="s2">would simply continue being the</p>
<p begin="06:13:19.200" end="06:13:23.360" style="s2">strongest. Hearing those words caused</p>
<p begin="06:13:21.120" end="06:13:25.200" style="s2">Balsa&#39;s eyes to narrow before he firmly</p>
<p begin="06:13:23.360" end="06:13:27.360" style="s2">announced that the meeting was over and</p>
<p begin="06:13:25.200" end="06:13:29.200" style="s2">everyone was dismissed. As soon as they</p>
<p begin="06:13:27.360" end="06:13:31.280" style="s2">left Ballsa&#39;s office, Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:13:29.200" end="06:13:33.360" style="s2">immediately called out Zeke&#39;s name. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:13:31.280" end="06:13:35.600" style="s2">remained silent, prompting Leica to call</p>
<p begin="06:13:33.360" end="06:13:37.200" style="s2">him again. This time, Zeke finally</p>
<p begin="06:13:35.600" end="06:13:38.798" style="s2">responded by asking if there was a</p>
<p begin="06:13:37.200" end="06:13:41.760" style="s2">problem and why everyone was wearing</p>
<p begin="06:13:38.798" end="06:13:43.520" style="s2">such long faces. Concerned for him, Lea</p>
<p begin="06:13:41.760" end="06:13:45.920" style="s2">asked why he insisted on taking all the</p>
<p begin="06:13:43.520" end="06:13:47.440" style="s2">responsibility upon himself. Zeke calmly</p>
<p begin="06:13:45.920" end="06:13:49.120" style="s2">explained that it was because he had</p>
<p begin="06:13:47.440" end="06:13:51.680" style="s2">been the one who encouraged everyone to</p>
<p begin="06:13:49.120" end="06:13:53.520" style="s2">drink the magic water. However, Leica</p>
<p begin="06:13:51.680" end="06:13:55.520" style="s2">immediately reminded him that even if he</p>
<p begin="06:13:53.520" end="06:13:57.440" style="s2">had been the catalyst, everyone had made</p>
<p begin="06:13:55.520" end="06:13:59.200" style="s2">the decision to drink the magic water of</p>
<p begin="06:13:57.440" end="06:14:01.040" style="s2">their own free will. Yet, he was the</p>
<p begin="06:13:59.200" end="06:14:03.360" style="s2">only one being exiled to the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:14:01.040" end="06:14:04.798" style="s2">Dragon Valley. Zeke simply smiled at</p>
<p begin="06:14:03.360" end="06:14:06.320" style="s2">them before saying that instead of</p>
<p begin="06:14:04.798" end="06:14:07.920" style="s2">dwelling on what had already happened,</p>
<p begin="06:14:06.320" end="06:14:10.320" style="s2">it would be far better to focus on</p>
<p begin="06:14:07.920" end="06:14:12.160" style="s2">becoming stronger from now on. Leica</p>
<p begin="06:14:10.320" end="06:14:13.840" style="s2">insisted that she was missing the point,</p>
<p begin="06:14:12.160" end="06:14:15.520" style="s2">but before she could finish speaking,</p>
<p begin="06:14:13.840" end="06:14:17.120" style="s2">Zeke reminded everyone that they still</p>
<p begin="06:14:15.520" end="06:14:19.360" style="s2">get the chance to enter the second floor</p>
<p begin="06:14:17.120" end="06:14:20.718" style="s2">of the Dragon Hall, while he himself get</p>
<p begin="06:14:19.360" end="06:14:22.718" style="s2">the chance to enter the dragon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:14:20.718" end="06:14:24.400" style="s2">treasury. He then jokingly asked if</p>
<p begin="06:14:22.718" end="06:14:26.320" style="s2">receiving that reward was not already</p>
<p begin="06:14:24.400" end="06:14:28.240" style="s2">enough. Leica was caught off guard by</p>
<p begin="06:14:26.320" end="06:14:29.920" style="s2">his response and reluctantly admitted</p>
<p begin="06:14:28.240" end="06:14:31.920" style="s2">that he had a point, though she still</p>
<p begin="06:14:29.920" end="06:14:34.160" style="s2">wanted to continue arguing. Throughout</p>
<p begin="06:14:31.920" end="06:14:36.558" style="s2">the entire conversation, Edges remained</p>
<p begin="06:14:34.160" end="06:14:37.920" style="s2">silent. As he watched Zeke, he finally</p>
<p begin="06:14:36.558" end="06:14:40.000" style="s2">realized that regardless of how</p>
<p begin="06:14:37.920" end="06:14:42.000" style="s2">recklessly Zeke acted, there was always</p>
<p begin="06:14:40.000" end="06:14:44.638" style="s2">a strong sense of responsibility behind</p>
<p begin="06:14:42.000" end="06:14:46.718" style="s2">those actions. That was why even this</p>
<p begin="06:14:44.638" end="06:14:49.040" style="s2">time, Zeke naturally tried to shoulder</p>
<p begin="06:14:46.718" end="06:14:50.958" style="s2">all the blame by himself. Until now,</p>
<p begin="06:14:49.040" end="06:14:53.360" style="s2">Edges had focused only on Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:14:50.958" end="06:14:55.120" style="s2">outrageous behavior. But perhaps Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:14:53.360" end="06:14:57.200" style="s2">possessed the qualities of a patriarch</p>
<p begin="06:14:55.120" end="06:14:59.120" style="s2">more than anyone else. Menrix scratched</p>
<p begin="06:14:57.200" end="06:15:00.958" style="s2">his head before calling out to Zeke once</p>
<p begin="06:14:59.120" end="06:15:02.878" style="s2">more. He warned him that the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:15:00.958" end="06:15:05.120" style="s2">Dragon Valley was far from an ordinary</p>
<p begin="06:15:02.878" end="06:15:06.958" style="s2">place. When Zeke asked what he meant,</p>
<p begin="06:15:05.120" end="06:15:09.040" style="s2">Menrich explained that Zeke probably did</p>
<p begin="06:15:06.958" end="06:15:10.878" style="s2">not know this. But for countless years,</p>
<p begin="06:15:09.040" end="06:15:12.480" style="s2">the abandoned Dragon Valley had served</p>
<p begin="06:15:10.878" end="06:15:14.400" style="s2">as the place where criminals received</p>
<p begin="06:15:12.480" end="06:15:16.000" style="s2">their punishment. It was an execution</p>
<p begin="06:15:14.400" end="06:15:18.080" style="s2">ground where countless people had met</p>
<p begin="06:15:16.000" end="06:15:20.160" style="s2">their end. Before Menick could finish</p>
<p begin="06:15:18.080" end="06:15:21.920" style="s2">explaining, Zeke casually interrupted</p>
<p begin="06:15:20.160" end="06:15:24.000" style="s2">him, saying that whatever kind of place</p>
<p begin="06:15:21.920" end="06:15:25.680" style="s2">it was made no difference to him. No</p>
<p begin="06:15:24.000" end="06:15:27.680" style="s2">matter where he was sent, he would</p>
<p begin="06:15:25.680" end="06:15:29.520" style="s2">simply remain who he was, and that was</p>
<p begin="06:15:27.680" end="06:15:31.440" style="s2">all there was to it. Hearing such</p>
<p begin="06:15:29.520" end="06:15:33.200" style="s2">unwavering confidence left Menrix</p>
<p begin="06:15:31.440" end="06:15:35.600" style="s2">speechless. Zeke then turned toward</p>
<p begin="06:15:33.200" end="06:15:37.520" style="s2">Venil and apologized. Placing a hand on</p>
<p begin="06:15:35.600" end="06:15:39.200" style="s2">Venil&#39;s shoulder, he explained that he</p>
<p begin="06:15:37.520" end="06:15:41.120" style="s2">would no longer have many opportunities</p>
<p begin="06:15:39.200" end="06:15:42.878" style="s2">to personally oversee his training.</p>
<p begin="06:15:41.120" end="06:15:44.480" style="s2">Venil immediately replied that it was</p>
<p begin="06:15:42.878" end="06:15:46.638" style="s2">not as if he had ever wanted Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:15:44.480" end="06:15:48.958" style="s2">guidance in the first place. Even so,</p>
<p begin="06:15:46.638" end="06:15:50.638" style="s2">Zeke simply smiled and told him not to</p>
<p begin="06:15:48.958" end="06:15:52.400" style="s2">worry. He instructed Vanil to keep</p>
<p begin="06:15:50.638" end="06:15:53.680" style="s2">training while he was away and assured</p>
<p begin="06:15:52.400" end="06:15:56.000" style="s2">him that he would prepare everything</p>
<p begin="06:15:53.680" end="06:15:57.840" style="s2">Vanil needed before leaving. His words</p>
<p begin="06:15:56.000" end="06:15:59.760" style="s2">made everyone burst into laughter while</p>
<p begin="06:15:57.840" end="06:16:01.600" style="s2">Venil simply remained silent as he</p>
<p begin="06:15:59.760" end="06:16:02.958" style="s2">stared at Zeke. Zeke then reminded</p>
<p begin="06:16:01.600" end="06:16:04.878" style="s2">everyone that what had already happened</p>
<p begin="06:16:02.958" end="06:16:06.718" style="s2">could no longer be changed. Instead of</p>
<p begin="06:16:04.878" end="06:16:08.480" style="s2">worrying about the past, they should all</p>
<p begin="06:16:06.718" end="06:16:10.958" style="s2">focus on studying hard and becoming</p>
<p begin="06:16:08.480" end="06:16:12.638" style="s2">stronger. As for himself, he promised</p>
<p begin="06:16:10.958" end="06:16:14.878" style="s2">that he would also continue training</p>
<p begin="06:16:12.638" end="06:16:16.958" style="s2">properly. Meanwhile, inside Balsza&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:16:14.878" end="06:16:18.798" style="s2">office, A, the commander of the Black</p>
<p begin="06:16:16.958" end="06:16:20.718" style="s2">Core, called out to his lord and asked</p>
<p begin="06:16:18.798" end="06:16:22.958" style="s2">if he truly intended to send Lord Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:16:20.718" end="06:16:24.718" style="s2">to the abandoned Dragon Valley. Balsa</p>
<p begin="06:16:22.958" end="06:16:26.000" style="s2">calmly answered that Zeke himself had</p>
<p begin="06:16:24.718" end="06:16:27.920" style="s2">declared he would take full</p>
<p begin="06:16:26.000" end="06:16:30.400" style="s2">responsibility and he was simply making</p>
<p begin="06:16:27.920" end="06:16:31.920" style="s2">him answer for those words. However, A</p>
<p begin="06:16:30.400" end="06:16:33.600" style="s2">insisted that the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:16:31.920" end="06:16:35.840" style="s2">Valley was a land of death where even</p>
<p begin="06:16:33.600" end="06:16:37.600" style="s2">sevenst star warriors could not survive.</p>
<p begin="06:16:35.840" end="06:16:39.440" style="s2">For someone like Zeke, who had only</p>
<p begin="06:16:37.600" end="06:16:41.280" style="s2">recently reached the three star level,</p>
<p begin="06:16:39.440" end="06:16:43.600" style="s2">it was practically a death sentence.</p>
<p begin="06:16:41.280" end="06:16:44.958" style="s2">Before A could continue, Balsa&#39;s eyes</p>
<p begin="06:16:43.600" end="06:16:46.958" style="s2">sharpened as he glared at him and</p>
<p begin="06:16:44.958" end="06:16:49.280" style="s2">ordered him to stop talking. He reminded</p>
<p begin="06:16:46.958" end="06:16:50.878" style="s2">A that his commands were absolute and</p>
<p begin="06:16:49.280" end="06:16:52.718" style="s2">warned that if he spoke another word</p>
<p begin="06:16:50.878" end="06:16:55.920" style="s2">regarding the matter, he would show no</p>
<p begin="06:16:52.718" end="06:16:58.160" style="s2">mercy, even toward A himself. Those cold</p>
<p begin="06:16:55.920" end="06:17:00.400" style="s2">words immediately silenced him. After a</p>
<p begin="06:16:58.160" end="06:17:02.080" style="s2">brief pause, A asked why Balsza had at</p>
<p begin="06:17:00.400" end="06:17:04.400" style="s2">least granted Zeke permission to enter</p>
<p begin="06:17:02.080" end="06:17:05.760" style="s2">the dragon&#39;s treasury. Balsa calmly</p>
<p begin="06:17:04.400" end="06:17:07.360" style="s2">explained that regardless of the</p>
<p begin="06:17:05.760" end="06:17:09.040" style="s2">outcome, if those who completed a</p>
<p begin="06:17:07.360" end="06:17:10.798" style="s2">mission received no reward, the</p>
<p begin="06:17:09.040" end="06:17:13.040" style="s2">organization itself would eventually</p>
<p begin="06:17:10.798" end="06:17:14.400" style="s2">cease to function. However, whether Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:17:13.040" end="06:17:16.000" style="s2">could actually bring anything out of the</p>
<p begin="06:17:14.400" end="06:17:18.000" style="s2">dragon&#39;s treasury was an entirely</p>
<p begin="06:17:16.000" end="06:17:20.000" style="s2">different matter. Balsa explained that</p>
<p begin="06:17:18.000" end="06:17:21.760" style="s2">although Zeke had somehow used a strange</p>
<p begin="06:17:20.000" end="06:17:23.760" style="s2">power to endure his overwhelming</p>
<p begin="06:17:21.760" end="06:17:25.760" style="s2">pressure, such tricks would never work</p>
<p begin="06:17:23.760" end="06:17:27.520" style="s2">inside the dragon&#39;s treasury. The deeper</p>
<p begin="06:17:25.760" end="06:17:29.280" style="s2">someone ventured, the stronger the</p>
<p begin="06:17:27.520" end="06:17:31.440" style="s2">influence of the relics left behind by</p>
<p begin="06:17:29.280" end="06:17:33.120" style="s2">the previous patriarchs became. Their</p>
<p begin="06:17:31.440" end="06:17:35.040" style="s2">lingering power made advancing through</p>
<p begin="06:17:33.120" end="06:17:36.718" style="s2">the treasury nearly impossible. Even</p>
<p begin="06:17:35.040" end="06:17:38.558" style="s2">Balsa himself could not reach the</p>
<p begin="06:17:36.718" end="06:17:40.320" style="s2">deepest part of the treasury, so someone</p>
<p begin="06:17:38.558" end="06:17:42.718" style="s2">of Zeke&#39;s level would be fortunate just</p>
<p begin="06:17:40.320" end="06:17:45.280" style="s2">to wander around near the entrance. A</p>
<p begin="06:17:42.718" end="06:17:46.558" style="s2">once again fell silent. Deep inside, he</p>
<p begin="06:17:45.280" end="06:17:48.400" style="s2">could not help thinking that he had</p>
<p begin="06:17:46.558" end="06:17:50.240" style="s2">never seen Lord Balsza behave like this</p>
<p begin="06:17:48.400" end="06:17:52.080" style="s2">before. Before he could continue his</p>
<p begin="06:17:50.240" end="06:17:54.320" style="s2">thoughts, Balsza added that no matter</p>
<p begin="06:17:52.080" end="06:17:56.240" style="s2">what treasure Zeke managed to obtain, it</p>
<p begin="06:17:54.320" end="06:17:58.480" style="s2">would ultimately be useless inside the</p>
<p begin="06:17:56.240" end="06:18:00.080" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. That place</p>
<p begin="06:17:58.480" end="06:18:02.080" style="s2">contained a despair that no amount of</p>
<p begin="06:18:00.080" end="06:18:03.840" style="s2">strength or effort could ever overcome.</p>
<p begin="06:18:02.080" end="06:18:05.280" style="s2">Because of that, Balsa was actually</p>
<p begin="06:18:03.840" end="06:18:07.520" style="s2">looking forward to seeing how someone</p>
<p begin="06:18:05.280" end="06:18:09.840" style="s2">like Zeke, who constantly overestimated</p>
<p begin="06:18:07.520" end="06:18:12.160" style="s2">his own abilities, would react when he</p>
<p begin="06:18:09.840" end="06:18:14.080" style="s2">was finally confronted by true despair.</p>
<p begin="06:18:12.160" end="06:18:16.080" style="s2">At the same time, Zeke had already</p>
<p begin="06:18:14.080" end="06:18:18.160" style="s2">entered the Lragon family&#39;s dragon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:18:16.080" end="06:18:20.080" style="s2">treasury. Along the way, he encountered</p>
<p begin="06:18:18.160" end="06:18:22.160" style="s2">the overwhelming lingering powers left</p>
<p begin="06:18:20.080" end="06:18:24.320" style="s2">behind by the previous patriarchs. Yet,</p>
<p begin="06:18:22.160" end="06:18:26.320" style="s2">he appeared completely unaffected.</p>
<p begin="06:18:24.320" end="06:18:28.000" style="s2">Looking around with disappointment, he</p>
<p begin="06:18:26.320" end="06:18:29.840" style="s2">casually wondered if this was really the</p>
<p begin="06:18:28.000" end="06:18:31.200" style="s2">end of the dragon&#39;s treasury, because he</p>
<p begin="06:18:29.840" end="06:18:33.600" style="s2">had expected something much more</p>
<p begin="06:18:31.200" end="06:18:35.200" style="s2">impressive. A few hours earlier, Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:18:33.600" end="06:18:36.718" style="s2">had personally escorted Zeke to the</p>
<p begin="06:18:35.200" end="06:18:38.480" style="s2">entrance of the dragon&#39;s treasury.</p>
<p begin="06:18:36.718" end="06:18:40.958" style="s2">Waiting, there were two guards standing</p>
<p begin="06:18:38.480" end="06:18:43.120" style="s2">before a long, dark passageway. Before</p>
<p begin="06:18:40.958" end="06:18:45.120" style="s2">entering, Zeke immediately noticed that</p>
<p begin="06:18:43.120" end="06:18:47.280" style="s2">both guards possessed seven star</p>
<p begin="06:18:45.120" end="06:18:48.878" style="s2">cultivation. Just like the dragon hall,</p>
<p begin="06:18:47.280" end="06:18:51.040" style="s2">even this place was protected by</p>
<p begin="06:18:48.878" end="06:18:52.878" style="s2">sevenstar experts, proving just how</p>
<p begin="06:18:51.040" end="06:18:55.120" style="s2">important the dragon&#39;s treasury was to</p>
<p begin="06:18:52.878" end="06:18:56.958" style="s2">the current Lragon family. Zeke then</p>
<p begin="06:18:55.120" end="06:18:58.958" style="s2">asked Menrich how far inside he was</p>
<p begin="06:18:56.958" end="06:19:00.638" style="s2">allowed to go. One of the guards calmly</p>
<p begin="06:18:58.958" end="06:19:02.558" style="s2">answered that he could go as far as he</p>
<p begin="06:19:00.638" end="06:19:04.320" style="s2">wished. Menrich further explained that</p>
<p begin="06:19:02.558" end="06:19:05.680" style="s2">unlike the dragon hall, there were no</p>
<p begin="06:19:04.320" end="06:19:08.160" style="s2">movement restrictions inside the</p>
<p begin="06:19:05.680" end="06:19:09.600" style="s2">dragon&#39;s treasury. Furthermore, among</p>
<p begin="06:19:08.160" end="06:19:11.840" style="s2">all the countless treasures stored</p>
<p begin="06:19:09.600" end="06:19:14.160" style="s2">within, Zeke had permission to take any</p>
<p begin="06:19:11.840" end="06:19:15.840" style="s2">single item he wanted. However, whether</p>
<p begin="06:19:14.160" end="06:19:17.440" style="s2">he was actually capable of reaching the</p>
<p begin="06:19:15.840" end="06:19:19.520" style="s2">deeper parts of the treasury was another</p>
<p begin="06:19:17.440" end="06:19:21.120" style="s2">matter entirely. When Zeke asked what he</p>
<p begin="06:19:19.520" end="06:19:22.638" style="s2">meant, Menrich explained that the</p>
<p begin="06:19:21.120" end="06:19:24.958" style="s2">treasury contained all kinds of</p>
<p begin="06:19:22.638" end="06:19:27.120" style="s2">treasures, including powerful elixirs,</p>
<p begin="06:19:24.958" end="06:19:29.200" style="s2">rare weapons, and countless priceless</p>
<p begin="06:19:27.120" end="06:19:30.878" style="s2">artifacts. Deep within the treasury</p>
<p begin="06:19:29.200" end="06:19:33.040" style="s2">rested the relics once used by the</p>
<p begin="06:19:30.878" end="06:19:35.200" style="s2">previous patriarchs. The immense energy</p>
<p begin="06:19:33.040" end="06:19:36.798" style="s2">lingering within those relics created</p>
<p begin="06:19:35.200" end="06:19:38.400" style="s2">tremendous pressure, making it</p>
<p begin="06:19:36.798" end="06:19:40.160" style="s2">incredibly difficult for anyone to</p>
<p begin="06:19:38.400" end="06:19:42.320" style="s2">advance deeper into the treasury.</p>
<p begin="06:19:40.160" end="06:19:44.400" style="s2">Hearing that explanation only made Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:19:42.320" end="06:19:45.760" style="s2">even more excited. Mentric continued by</p>
<p begin="06:19:44.400" end="06:19:47.840" style="s2">saying that there might be an item</p>
<p begin="06:19:45.760" end="06:19:49.840" style="s2">hidden deep inside that could greatly</p>
<p begin="06:19:47.840" end="06:19:52.320" style="s2">improve Zeke&#39;s chances of surviving the</p>
<p begin="06:19:49.840" end="06:19:53.760" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. Even so,</p>
<p begin="06:19:52.320" end="06:19:55.760" style="s2">retrieving such an item would be</p>
<p begin="06:19:53.760" end="06:19:57.520" style="s2">extremely difficult. Therefore, he</p>
<p begin="06:19:55.760" end="06:19:59.440" style="s2">advised Zeke to simply obtain the</p>
<p begin="06:19:57.520" end="06:20:01.200" style="s2">strongest elixir he could find because</p>
<p begin="06:19:59.440" end="06:20:03.520" style="s2">that alone would greatly increase his</p>
<p begin="06:20:01.200" end="06:20:05.520" style="s2">chances of survival. Before Menick could</p>
<p begin="06:20:03.520" end="06:20:07.280" style="s2">finish his advice, Zeke thanked him but</p>
<p begin="06:20:05.520" end="06:20:09.280" style="s2">calmly stated that what he chose to take</p>
<p begin="06:20:07.280" end="06:20:11.520" style="s2">was entirely his own decision. Hearing</p>
<p begin="06:20:09.280" end="06:20:13.360" style="s2">that answer left Menrix stunned as he</p>
<p begin="06:20:11.520" end="06:20:14.798" style="s2">silently wondered whether Zeke truly</p>
<p begin="06:20:13.360" end="06:20:17.040" style="s2">believed he could reach the deepest</p>
<p begin="06:20:14.798" end="06:20:19.200" style="s2">parts of the dragon&#39;s treasury. Now that</p>
<p begin="06:20:17.040" end="06:20:21.120" style="s2">he was finally inside, Zeke had expected</p>
<p begin="06:20:19.200" end="06:20:23.280" style="s2">the dragon&#39;s treasury to be a far more</p>
<p begin="06:20:21.120" end="06:20:25.200" style="s2">dangerous place after everything Mench</p>
<p begin="06:20:23.280" end="06:20:27.040" style="s2">had told him. Instead, he found it</p>
<p begin="06:20:25.200" end="06:20:28.718" style="s2">rather underwhelming. Although countless</p>
<p begin="06:20:27.040" end="06:20:30.638" style="s2">weapons once wielded by the previous</p>
<p begin="06:20:28.718" end="06:20:32.718" style="s2">patriarchs were indeed stored there,</p>
<p begin="06:20:30.638" end="06:20:34.878" style="s2">none of them were of any use to him.</p>
<p begin="06:20:32.718" end="06:20:36.638" style="s2">Still, what surprised him the most was</p>
<p begin="06:20:34.878" end="06:20:38.958" style="s2">that the deepest part of the treasury</p>
<p begin="06:20:36.638" end="06:20:41.440" style="s2">did not contain some legendary weapon,</p>
<p begin="06:20:38.958" end="06:20:43.520" style="s2">but instead a massive stone wall that</p>
<p begin="06:20:41.440" end="06:20:45.440" style="s2">had been cleanly split apart by a single</p>
<p begin="06:20:43.520" end="06:20:47.280" style="s2">sword strike. As he carefully examined</p>
<p begin="06:20:45.440" end="06:20:48.798" style="s2">it, Zeke immediately realized that the</p>
<p begin="06:20:47.280" end="06:20:50.878" style="s2">sword mark had been left behind by</p>
<p begin="06:20:48.798" end="06:20:52.558" style="s2">someone at the ninestar level. That</p>
<p begin="06:20:50.878" end="06:20:54.160" style="s2">discovery made him wonder if someone had</p>
<p begin="06:20:52.558" end="06:20:56.080" style="s2">actually reached the ninestar realm</p>
<p begin="06:20:54.160" end="06:20:58.160" style="s2">after his death. The moment he touched</p>
<p begin="06:20:56.080" end="06:20:59.840" style="s2">the sword mark, a wave of nostalgia</p>
<p begin="06:20:58.160" end="06:21:01.600" style="s2">washed over him. If he remembered</p>
<p begin="06:20:59.840" end="06:21:03.680" style="s2">correctly, this was none other than the</p>
<p begin="06:21:01.600" end="06:21:05.440" style="s2">Emperor Stonewall that he himself had</p>
<p begin="06:21:03.680" end="06:21:07.440" style="s2">once used for training back when he had</p>
<p begin="06:21:05.440" end="06:21:09.120" style="s2">reached the nine-star realm. That</p>
<p begin="06:21:07.440" end="06:21:10.958" style="s2">realization made him wonder if one of</p>
<p begin="06:21:09.120" end="06:21:13.040" style="s2">the previous patriarchs had also left</p>
<p begin="06:21:10.958" end="06:21:15.440" style="s2">behind this sword mark. Standing before</p>
<p begin="06:21:13.040" end="06:21:17.040" style="s2">the enormous wall, Zeke quietly muttered</p>
<p begin="06:21:15.440" end="06:21:18.958" style="s2">to himself that if the person who had</p>
<p begin="06:21:17.040" end="06:21:20.480" style="s2">left that mark were still alive, he</p>
<p begin="06:21:18.958" end="06:21:22.718" style="s2">would have loved the chance to spar with</p>
<p begin="06:21:20.480" end="06:21:24.638" style="s2">them. Unfortunately, it seemed that</p>
<p begin="06:21:22.718" end="06:21:26.878" style="s2">person had already passed away as well.</p>
<p begin="06:21:24.638" end="06:21:28.718" style="s2">Even so, Zeke had to admit that they had</p>
<p begin="06:21:26.878" end="06:21:30.718" style="s2">gathered an impressive collection inside</p>
<p begin="06:21:28.718" end="06:21:32.878" style="s2">this treasury. It contained not only</p>
<p begin="06:21:30.718" end="06:21:34.798" style="s2">powerful elixirs and legendary weapons,</p>
<p begin="06:21:32.878" end="06:21:37.040" style="s2">but also countless mysterious tools</p>
<p begin="06:21:34.798" end="06:21:38.878" style="s2">whose purposes were completely unknown.</p>
<p begin="06:21:37.040" end="06:21:40.558" style="s2">Looking around, he could not help but</p>
<p begin="06:21:38.878" end="06:21:42.480" style="s2">wonder what exactly they had hoped to</p>
<p begin="06:21:40.558" end="06:21:45.120" style="s2">accomplish by collecting so many strange</p>
<p begin="06:21:42.480" end="06:21:46.638" style="s2">items in one place. Unfortunately, there</p>
<p begin="06:21:45.120" end="06:21:48.638" style="s2">did not seem to be anything here that</p>
<p begin="06:21:46.638" end="06:21:50.558" style="s2">truly interested him. Since he had no</p>
<p begin="06:21:48.638" end="06:21:53.040" style="s2">need for a weapon, he decided to simply</p>
<p begin="06:21:50.558" end="06:21:54.958" style="s2">grab a random elixir and leave. However,</p>
<p begin="06:21:53.040" end="06:21:57.040" style="s2">just as he turned around, he suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:21:54.958" end="06:21:59.120" style="s2">noticed a glowing box behind him. The</p>
<p begin="06:21:57.040" end="06:22:01.440" style="s2">moment he saw what was inside, his eyes</p>
<p begin="06:21:59.120" end="06:22:02.878" style="s2">widened in complete shock. After Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:22:01.440" end="06:22:04.718" style="s2">saw the glowing treasure that even</p>
<p begin="06:22:02.878" end="06:22:06.240" style="s2">managed to shock him, he immediately</p>
<p begin="06:22:04.718" end="06:22:07.840" style="s2">stepped out of the treasure hall and</p>
<p begin="06:22:06.240" end="06:22:09.840" style="s2">told Menrich that he had already made</p>
<p begin="06:22:07.840" end="06:22:11.520" style="s2">his choice. Menrich asked if he was</p>
<p begin="06:22:09.840" end="06:22:13.200" style="s2">sure. And just as he was about to</p>
<p begin="06:22:11.520" end="06:22:15.360" style="s2">question what on earth Zeke was talking</p>
<p begin="06:22:13.200" end="06:22:17.360" style="s2">about, Zeke happily showed him the green</p>
<p begin="06:22:15.360" end="06:22:19.280" style="s2">bangle and anklet. When Menick asked</p>
<p begin="06:22:17.360" end="06:22:20.798" style="s2">what those items were, Zeke explained</p>
<p begin="06:22:19.280" end="06:22:22.638" style="s2">that they were treasures he had brought</p>
<p begin="06:22:20.798" end="06:22:24.558" style="s2">out from the vault. Menrich remained</p>
<p begin="06:22:22.638" end="06:22:26.080" style="s2">silent for a moment as he stared at Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:22:24.558" end="06:22:28.240" style="s2">and the unfamiliar treasures in his</p>
<p begin="06:22:26.080" end="06:22:30.320" style="s2">hands. But his expression soon darkened.</p>
<p begin="06:22:28.240" end="06:22:32.320" style="s2">After adjusting his cap, he immediately</p>
<p begin="06:22:30.320" end="06:22:34.000" style="s2">scolded Zeke harshly, questioning what</p>
<p begin="06:22:32.320" end="06:22:35.920" style="s2">in the world he was thinking and why he</p>
<p begin="06:22:34.000" end="06:22:37.520" style="s2">was lying since everyone knew that the</p>
<p begin="06:22:35.920" end="06:22:39.680" style="s2">treasure hall had severe restrictions</p>
<p begin="06:22:37.520" end="06:22:41.200" style="s2">and tremendous pressure inside. Yet,</p>
<p begin="06:22:39.680" end="06:22:43.040" style="s2">Zeke was claiming that he had actually</p>
<p begin="06:22:41.200" end="06:22:45.360" style="s2">obtained treasures from the vault, which</p>
<p begin="06:22:43.040" end="06:22:47.200" style="s2">made no sense to Men. He also questioned</p>
<p begin="06:22:45.360" end="06:22:48.878" style="s2">why Zeke had not chosen a potion that</p>
<p begin="06:22:47.200" end="06:22:51.520" style="s2">could help him survive in the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:22:48.878" end="06:22:53.200" style="s2">Dragon Valley. Zeke, however, simply</p>
<p begin="06:22:51.520" end="06:22:55.120" style="s2">explained that he had found a wonderful</p>
<p begin="06:22:53.200" end="06:22:57.200" style="s2">item and was thoroughly satisfied with</p>
<p begin="06:22:55.120" end="06:22:59.440" style="s2">his choice. Mentric then admitted that</p>
<p begin="06:22:57.200" end="06:23:01.680" style="s2">even he did not know every single item</p>
<p begin="06:22:59.440" end="06:23:03.280" style="s2">inside the dragon&#39;s treasury, but he had</p>
<p begin="06:23:01.680" end="06:23:05.040" style="s2">never seen anything like those treasures</p>
<p begin="06:23:03.280" end="06:23:07.120" style="s2">within the range that fourstar to</p>
<p begin="06:23:05.040" end="06:23:08.958" style="s2">sevenstar ranks could handle or even</p>
<p begin="06:23:07.120" end="06:23:10.958" style="s2">pass through inside the treasury.</p>
<p begin="06:23:08.958" end="06:23:12.798" style="s2">Suddenly, another possibility crossed</p>
<p begin="06:23:10.958" end="06:23:14.480" style="s2">his mind, and he wondered if perhaps the</p>
<p begin="06:23:12.798" end="06:23:16.558" style="s2">treasures Zeke was holding were simply</p>
<p begin="06:23:14.480" end="06:23:17.840" style="s2">items he did not know about, meaning</p>
<p begin="06:23:16.558" end="06:23:19.680" style="s2">they could have come from the deepest</p>
<p begin="06:23:17.840" end="06:23:21.520" style="s2">reaches of the treasury. But Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:23:19.680" end="06:23:23.280" style="s2">quickly dismissed the idea, explaining</p>
<p begin="06:23:21.520" end="06:23:25.200" style="s2">that the bangal and anklet had simply</p>
<p begin="06:23:23.280" end="06:23:26.958" style="s2">been rolling around near the entrance.</p>
<p begin="06:23:25.200" end="06:23:28.798" style="s2">Beads of sweat immediately appeared on</p>
<p begin="06:23:26.958" end="06:23:30.480" style="s2">Menri&#39;s face as he struggled to</p>
<p begin="06:23:28.798" end="06:23:32.400" style="s2">understand how that could possibly be</p>
<p begin="06:23:30.480" end="06:23:34.718" style="s2">true. Looking carefully at the treasures</p>
<p begin="06:23:32.400" end="06:23:36.558" style="s2">Zeke was holding, Menrich noticed that</p>
<p begin="06:23:34.718" end="06:23:38.638" style="s2">they did indeed appear to be a bangal</p>
<p begin="06:23:36.558" end="06:23:40.400" style="s2">and an anklet. And he questioned whether</p>
<p begin="06:23:38.638" end="06:23:42.320" style="s2">Zeke even knew what those items were in</p>
<p begin="06:23:40.400" end="06:23:44.000" style="s2">the first place. Zeke confirmed that he</p>
<p begin="06:23:42.320" end="06:23:45.760" style="s2">did, then immediately put the bangle</p>
<p begin="06:23:44.000" end="06:23:47.760" style="s2">around his wrist. As he clenched his</p>
<p begin="06:23:45.760" end="06:23:49.680" style="s2">fist, the bangle seemed to adjust its</p>
<p begin="06:23:47.760" end="06:23:51.680" style="s2">size on its own, fitting perfectly</p>
<p begin="06:23:49.680" end="06:23:54.000" style="s2">around his wrist. And the moment he wore</p>
<p begin="06:23:51.680" end="06:23:55.920" style="s2">it, Zeke immediately felt an intense</p>
<p begin="06:23:54.000" end="06:23:57.760" style="s2">pressure weighing down on him. Mench</p>
<p begin="06:23:55.920" end="06:23:59.920" style="s2">remained completely silent as he watched</p>
<p begin="06:23:57.760" end="06:24:01.920" style="s2">everything unfold, expecting to witness</p>
<p begin="06:23:59.920" end="06:24:03.680" style="s2">something unbelievable. However, the</p>
<p begin="06:24:01.920" end="06:24:05.680" style="s2">result was the complete opposite of what</p>
<p begin="06:24:03.680" end="06:24:07.840" style="s2">he expected because nothing unusual</p>
<p begin="06:24:05.680" end="06:24:09.920" style="s2">happened after Zeke put the Bengal on.</p>
<p begin="06:24:07.840" end="06:24:11.440" style="s2">Internally though, Zeke could hardly</p>
<p begin="06:24:09.920" end="06:24:13.200" style="s2">believe that these treasures were still</p>
<p begin="06:24:11.440" end="06:24:15.200" style="s2">inside the treasury of the Lragon</p>
<p begin="06:24:13.200" end="06:24:16.958" style="s2">family. The bangles were called source</p>
<p begin="06:24:15.200" end="06:24:18.718" style="s2">absorbing ore bangles, training</p>
<p begin="06:24:16.958" end="06:24:20.638" style="s2">equipment that Zeke had used before his</p>
<p begin="06:24:18.718" end="06:24:23.120" style="s2">reincarnation. They were made from</p>
<p begin="06:24:20.638" end="06:24:25.360" style="s2">source absorbing ore, a special material</p>
<p begin="06:24:23.120" end="06:24:27.200" style="s2">capable of absorbing true star ether.</p>
<p begin="06:24:25.360" end="06:24:28.878" style="s2">Once worn, the bangles would absorb all</p>
<p begin="06:24:27.200" end="06:24:30.958" style="s2">of the wearer&#39;s true star ether,</p>
<p begin="06:24:28.878" end="06:24:32.878" style="s2">preventing them from using their aura.</p>
<p begin="06:24:30.958" end="06:24:34.480" style="s2">Furthermore, the bangals would gradually</p>
<p begin="06:24:32.878" end="06:24:36.798" style="s2">become heavier in proportion to the</p>
<p begin="06:24:34.480" end="06:24:38.400" style="s2">amount of true star ether they absorbed,</p>
<p begin="06:24:36.798" end="06:24:40.480" style="s2">essentially functioning like shackles</p>
<p begin="06:24:38.400" end="06:24:42.000" style="s2">used to bind criminals. Depending on how</p>
<p begin="06:24:40.480" end="06:24:43.840" style="s2">one looked at them, they were either</p>
<p begin="06:24:42.000" end="06:24:46.080" style="s2">brutal restraints or incredibly</p>
<p begin="06:24:43.840" end="06:24:47.920" style="s2">effective training equipment. Zeke was</p>
<p begin="06:24:46.080" end="06:24:49.680" style="s2">amazed that such wonderful treasures had</p>
<p begin="06:24:47.920" end="06:24:51.680" style="s2">simply been left rolling around near the</p>
<p begin="06:24:49.680" end="06:24:53.360" style="s2">entrance of the treasury. He had no idea</p>
<p begin="06:24:51.680" end="06:24:55.360" style="s2">who was responsible for organizing the</p>
<p begin="06:24:53.360" end="06:24:57.760" style="s2">inside of that treasury, but whoever it</p>
<p begin="06:24:55.360" end="06:25:00.240" style="s2">was clearly had absolutely no eye for</p>
<p begin="06:24:57.760" end="06:25:01.840" style="s2">value. Zeke then asked Menrich if he</p>
<p begin="06:25:00.240" end="06:25:04.160" style="s2">would be sent off to the so-called</p>
<p begin="06:25:01.840" end="06:25:06.240" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley immediately.</p>
<p begin="06:25:04.160" end="06:25:08.160" style="s2">Mench quickly confirmed it and explained</p>
<p begin="06:25:06.240" end="06:25:10.000" style="s2">that this was precisely why he had hoped</p>
<p begin="06:25:08.160" end="06:25:11.680" style="s2">Zeke would obtain a decent elixir from</p>
<p begin="06:25:10.000" end="06:25:13.440" style="s2">the treasury as it would greatly</p>
<p begin="06:25:11.680" end="06:25:14.798" style="s2">increase his chances of survival. But</p>
<p begin="06:25:13.440" end="06:25:16.958" style="s2">before Menri could finish his</p>
<p begin="06:25:14.798" end="06:25:19.040" style="s2">explanation, Zeke told him that from his</p>
<p begin="06:25:16.958" end="06:25:21.120" style="s2">perspective, whether he had an elixir or</p>
<p begin="06:25:19.040" end="06:25:23.120" style="s2">not made no difference. More</p>
<p begin="06:25:21.120" end="06:25:24.718" style="s2">importantly, Zeke asked Menrich if he</p>
<p begin="06:25:23.120" end="06:25:26.480" style="s2">could do him a favor. After Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:25:24.718" end="06:25:28.240" style="s2">departed, Menrich immediately looked</p>
<p begin="06:25:26.480" end="06:25:30.080" style="s2">into the favor Zeke had asked of him. He</p>
<p begin="06:25:28.240" end="06:25:31.920" style="s2">had never expected Zeke to entrust him</p>
<p begin="06:25:30.080" end="06:25:34.080" style="s2">with letters concerning Leica and the</p>
<p begin="06:25:31.920" end="06:25:36.240" style="s2">others training. However, as he read</p>
<p begin="06:25:34.080" end="06:25:38.000" style="s2">through the letters one by one, Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:25:36.240" end="06:25:39.440" style="s2">soon realized that the contents of the</p>
<p begin="06:25:38.000" end="06:25:41.520" style="s2">training instructions were utterly</p>
<p begin="06:25:39.440" end="06:25:43.360" style="s2">absurd, leaving him wondering if Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:25:41.520" end="06:25:45.600" style="s2">had truly been making them undergo such</p>
<p begin="06:25:43.360" end="06:25:47.360" style="s2">training all this time. Internally,</p>
<p begin="06:25:45.600" end="06:25:48.878" style="s2">Menrich began wondering if the strange</p>
<p begin="06:25:47.360" end="06:25:50.558" style="s2">training methods described in those</p>
<p begin="06:25:48.878" end="06:25:52.558" style="s2">letters were actually the secret behind</p>
<p begin="06:25:50.558" end="06:25:54.080" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s abnormal strength. He also</p>
<p begin="06:25:52.558" end="06:25:56.000" style="s2">questioned whether training regimens</p>
<p begin="06:25:54.080" end="06:25:58.240" style="s2">with such extreme effectiveness could</p>
<p begin="06:25:56.000" end="06:26:00.160" style="s2">truly exist. Even if everything written</p>
<p begin="06:25:58.240" end="06:26:01.520" style="s2">in the letters was true, Menrix still</p>
<p begin="06:26:00.160" end="06:26:03.360" style="s2">wondered whether Lea and the others</p>
<p begin="06:26:01.520" end="06:26:05.120" style="s2">could endure such training. But thinking</p>
<p begin="06:26:03.360" end="06:26:06.878" style="s2">about it would not get him anywhere. So</p>
<p begin="06:26:05.120" end="06:26:09.200" style="s2">he eventually decided to simply deliver</p>
<p begin="06:26:06.878" end="06:26:10.798" style="s2">the papers as Zeke had requested. Even</p>
<p begin="06:26:09.200" end="06:26:12.480" style="s2">then, he could not help but wonder</p>
<p begin="06:26:10.798" end="06:26:14.558" style="s2">whether Zeke himself would be able to</p>
<p begin="06:26:12.480" end="06:26:16.798" style="s2">survive the abandoned Dragon Valley.</p>
<p begin="06:26:14.558" end="06:26:18.718" style="s2">After some time, the guard informed Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:26:16.798" end="06:26:20.400" style="s2">that they had finally arrived. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:26:18.718" end="06:26:22.160" style="s2">immediately became fascinated as he</p>
<p begin="06:26:20.400" end="06:26:23.920" style="s2">looked around the deserted place where</p>
<p begin="06:26:22.160" end="06:26:26.080" style="s2">countless dragon bones were scattered</p>
<p begin="06:26:23.920" end="06:26:28.000" style="s2">across the land. He wondered if this was</p>
<p begin="06:26:26.080" end="06:26:29.920" style="s2">truly the place known as the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:26:28.000" end="06:26:31.600" style="s2">dragon valley. Zeke then noticed that</p>
<p begin="06:26:29.920" end="06:26:33.440" style="s2">the aura of death in the area was</p>
<p begin="06:26:31.600" end="06:26:35.360" style="s2">overwhelmingly strong and he could</p>
<p begin="06:26:33.440" end="06:26:37.280" style="s2">finally understand why this place was</p>
<p begin="06:26:35.360" end="06:26:38.958" style="s2">known as the land of fatality.</p>
<p begin="06:26:37.280" end="06:26:40.400" style="s2">Originally, they had planned to travel</p>
<p begin="06:26:38.958" end="06:26:42.480" style="s2">by carriage so they could reach the</p>
<p begin="06:26:40.400" end="06:26:44.718" style="s2">abandoned dragon valley much sooner. But</p>
<p begin="06:26:42.480" end="06:26:46.480" style="s2">for some strange reason, every time Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:26:44.718" end="06:26:48.400" style="s2">stepped into the carriage, the wheels</p>
<p begin="06:26:46.480" end="06:26:50.718" style="s2">broke and the horse refused to move even</p>
<p begin="06:26:48.400" end="06:26:52.558" style="s2">a single step. In the end, they had no</p>
<p begin="06:26:50.718" end="06:26:54.400" style="s2">choice but to travel on foot. And</p>
<p begin="06:26:52.558" end="06:26:56.320" style="s2">somehow they had finally reached their</p>
<p begin="06:26:54.400" end="06:26:58.160" style="s2">destination. Because Zeke could not see</p>
<p begin="06:26:56.320" end="06:27:00.240" style="s2">the bottom of the enormous cliff, he</p>
<p begin="06:26:58.160" end="06:27:01.760" style="s2">immediately ran toward the edge. Since a</p>
<p begin="06:27:00.240" end="06:27:03.680" style="s2">place like this had not existed a</p>
<p begin="06:27:01.760" end="06:27:05.440" style="s2">thousand years ago, making him wonder</p>
<p begin="06:27:03.680" end="06:27:07.120" style="s2">when the valley had been created. The</p>
<p begin="06:27:05.440" end="06:27:08.718" style="s2">guard was shocked when Zeke suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:27:07.120" end="06:27:10.240" style="s2">started running, and he fell silent</p>
<p begin="06:27:08.718" end="06:27:12.160" style="s2">after seeing the ground shake beneath</p>
<p begin="06:27:10.240" end="06:27:14.160" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s footsteps, wondering if the</p>
<p begin="06:27:12.160" end="06:27:16.320" style="s2">supposedly slim young man was actually a</p>
<p begin="06:27:14.160" end="06:27:18.240" style="s2">ridiculously heavy child hiding his true</p>
<p begin="06:27:16.320" end="06:27:20.000" style="s2">weight beneath his clothes. The guard</p>
<p begin="06:27:18.240" end="06:27:21.360" style="s2">then called out to Master Zeke and</p>
<p begin="06:27:20.000" end="06:27:23.200" style="s2">informed him that he would be spending</p>
<p begin="06:27:21.360" end="06:27:25.040" style="s2">his time in this place where naturally</p>
<p begin="06:27:23.200" end="06:27:27.440" style="s2">there would be no provisions for food,</p>
<p begin="06:27:25.040" end="06:27:29.360" style="s2">clothing, or shelter whatsoever. Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:27:27.440" end="06:27:30.958" style="s2">simply told him that he did not mind and</p>
<p begin="06:27:29.360" end="06:27:33.040" style="s2">then asked how long he would need to</p>
<p begin="06:27:30.958" end="06:27:34.798" style="s2">remain in the abandoned dragon valley.</p>
<p begin="06:27:33.040" end="06:27:36.240" style="s2">The guard immediately answered that</p>
<p begin="06:27:34.798" end="06:27:38.160" style="s2">according to what he had heard from his</p>
<p begin="06:27:36.240" end="06:27:40.160" style="s2">superiors. Zeke was required to stay</p>
<p begin="06:27:38.160" end="06:27:42.240" style="s2">there until the graduation ceremony. But</p>
<p begin="06:27:40.160" end="06:27:44.240" style="s2">Zeke suddenly speak and said about 3</p>
<p begin="06:27:42.240" end="06:27:46.160" style="s2">years. Then the guard fell silent and</p>
<p begin="06:27:44.240" end="06:27:47.840" style="s2">looked at Zeke with pity after realizing</p>
<p begin="06:27:46.160" end="06:27:50.000" style="s2">that this kid Zeke would be staying</p>
<p begin="06:27:47.840" end="06:27:52.000" style="s2">there for three entire years. Deep</p>
<p begin="06:27:50.000" end="06:27:54.000" style="s2">inside, the guard believed that if Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:27:52.000" end="06:27:56.160" style="s2">was extremely lucky, he might survive in</p>
<p begin="06:27:54.000" end="06:27:58.160" style="s2">that place for at least 3 days, while at</p>
<p begin="06:27:56.160" end="06:28:00.798" style="s2">worst, he could die on the very day they</p>
<p begin="06:27:58.160" end="06:28:02.160" style="s2">arrived. After all, not a single person</p>
<p begin="06:28:00.798" end="06:28:04.080" style="s2">had ever returned alive from the</p>
<p begin="06:28:02.160" end="06:28:05.760" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. The guard then</p>
<p begin="06:28:04.080" end="06:28:07.120" style="s2">called out to Zeke again and began</p>
<p begin="06:28:05.760" end="06:28:08.798" style="s2">explaining the route toward the bottom</p>
<p begin="06:28:07.120" end="06:28:10.400" style="s2">of the valley, pointing out that Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:28:08.798" end="06:28:12.478" style="s2">could descend using the stairs built</p>
<p begin="06:28:10.400" end="06:28:13.920" style="s2">along the side of the cliff. He also</p>
<p begin="06:28:12.478" end="06:28:15.680" style="s2">warned that the stairs were already</p>
<p begin="06:28:13.920" end="06:28:17.360" style="s2">decaying. Meaning whether Zeke could</p>
<p begin="06:28:15.680" end="06:28:19.200" style="s2">reach the bottom safely would depend</p>
<p begin="06:28:17.360" end="06:28:20.958" style="s2">entirely on his luck. But before he</p>
<p begin="06:28:19.200" end="06:28:23.040" style="s2">could finish explaining, he was stunned</p>
<p begin="06:28:20.958" end="06:28:24.558" style="s2">when Zeke suddenly waved goodbye and</p>
<p begin="06:28:23.040" end="06:28:26.558" style="s2">thanked him for guiding and escorting</p>
<p begin="06:28:24.558" end="06:28:28.160" style="s2">him to the valley. Zeke then jumped</p>
<p begin="06:28:26.558" end="06:28:30.160" style="s2">straight from the cliff, leaving the</p>
<p begin="06:28:28.160" end="06:28:31.920" style="s2">guard completely frozen in place. The</p>
<p begin="06:28:30.160" end="06:28:33.840" style="s2">guard could barely process what he was</p>
<p begin="06:28:31.920" end="06:28:36.000" style="s2">seeing as Zeke had already fallen. Yet</p>
<p begin="06:28:33.840" end="06:28:37.440" style="s2">Zeke simply wore a wide smile and told</p>
<p begin="06:28:36.000" end="06:28:39.360" style="s2">him that they would see each other again</p>
<p begin="06:28:37.440" end="06:28:40.958" style="s2">in 3 years. The guard immediately</p>
<p begin="06:28:39.360" end="06:28:42.798" style="s2">crouched toward the edge of the cliff.</p>
<p begin="06:28:40.958" end="06:28:44.320" style="s2">Unable to believe that Zeke actually had</p>
<p begin="06:28:42.798" end="06:28:46.478" style="s2">the courage to descend all the way to</p>
<p begin="06:28:44.320" end="06:28:48.240" style="s2">the bottom by simply jumping. As Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:28:46.478" end="06:28:50.080" style="s2">fell toward the bottom of the valley, he</p>
<p begin="06:28:48.240" end="06:28:51.600" style="s2">could feel that the closer he got, the</p>
<p begin="06:28:50.080" end="06:28:53.280" style="s2">thicker and heavier the presence of</p>
<p begin="06:28:51.600" end="06:28:55.120" style="s2">death became. Before reaching the</p>
<p begin="06:28:53.280" end="06:28:56.638" style="s2">bottom, Zeke wondered how things would</p>
<p begin="06:28:55.120" end="06:28:59.120" style="s2">turn out and what kind of journey</p>
<p begin="06:28:56.638" end="06:29:01.520" style="s2">awaited him in this place. Then, the</p>
<p begin="06:28:59.120" end="06:29:03.200" style="s2">moment he landed, a golden aura exploded</p>
<p begin="06:29:01.520" end="06:29:05.200" style="s2">around him as the ground beneath him</p>
<p begin="06:29:03.200" end="06:29:07.120" style="s2">crumbled and shattered from the impact.</p>
<p begin="06:29:05.200" end="06:29:08.638" style="s2">Afterward, Zeke declared that he was</p>
<p begin="06:29:07.120" end="06:29:10.958" style="s2">looking forward to this so-called</p>
<p begin="06:29:08.638" end="06:29:12.718" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. He stretched</p>
<p begin="06:29:10.958" end="06:29:14.400" style="s2">his body and noticed that aside from the</p>
<p begin="06:29:12.718" end="06:29:16.558" style="s2">weight of the Bengals, falling from such</p>
<p begin="06:29:14.400" end="06:29:18.240" style="s2">a height without using True Star, Ether</p>
<p begin="06:29:16.558" end="06:29:20.240" style="s2">had been a slightly too hasty decision</p>
<p begin="06:29:18.240" end="06:29:22.478" style="s2">for his current body, as the impact had</p>
<p begin="06:29:20.240" end="06:29:24.160" style="s2">rattled his bones. Zeke then wondered if</p>
<p begin="06:29:22.478" end="06:29:25.680" style="s2">this was truly the bottom of the valley</p>
<p begin="06:29:24.160" end="06:29:27.760" style="s2">while looking at the countless bones</p>
<p begin="06:29:25.680" end="06:29:29.440" style="s2">scattered throughout the area. He also</p>
<p begin="06:29:27.760" end="06:29:31.120" style="s2">noticed that the surrounding landscape</p>
<p begin="06:29:29.440" end="06:29:33.280" style="s2">was quite impressive, yet this</p>
<p begin="06:29:31.120" end="06:29:35.360" style="s2">particular place was especially gloomy.</p>
<p begin="06:29:33.280" end="06:29:36.958" style="s2">Zeke genuinely disliked such a gloomy</p>
<p begin="06:29:35.360" end="06:29:38.478" style="s2">atmosphere. And although he welcomed</p>
<p begin="06:29:36.958" end="06:29:40.080" style="s2">dangerous places, he would have</p>
<p begin="06:29:38.478" end="06:29:42.320" style="s2">preferred somewhere a little brighter if</p>
<p begin="06:29:40.080" end="06:29:44.160" style="s2">given the choice. At that very moment,</p>
<p begin="06:29:42.320" end="06:29:46.400" style="s2">just as Zeke seemed to notice something,</p>
<p begin="06:29:44.160" end="06:29:48.080" style="s2">a gigantic tail suddenly struck him,</p>
<p begin="06:29:46.400" end="06:29:49.520" style="s2">sending him flying straight toward the</p>
<p begin="06:29:48.080" end="06:29:52.000" style="s2">cliff wall and causing a massive</p>
<p begin="06:29:49.520" end="06:29:54.080" style="s2">explosion upon impact. Before Zeke could</p>
<p begin="06:29:52.000" end="06:29:55.680" style="s2">even recover, a giant claw suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:29:54.080" end="06:29:57.760" style="s2">appeared and stomped him into the ground</p>
<p begin="06:29:55.680" end="06:29:59.760" style="s2">with tremendous force, causing the earth</p>
<p begin="06:29:57.760" end="06:30:02.080" style="s2">beneath him to crack and shatter. Just</p>
<p begin="06:29:59.760" end="06:30:04.160" style="s2">then, a blue dragon suddenly flew toward</p>
<p begin="06:30:02.080" end="06:30:05.920" style="s2">them, excited by the fresh prey that had</p>
<p begin="06:30:04.160" end="06:30:07.840" style="s2">finally entered their territory, and</p>
<p begin="06:30:05.920" end="06:30:09.840" style="s2">warned the red dragon not to kill Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:30:07.840" end="06:30:11.440" style="s2">so easily. But the red dragon&#39;s eyes</p>
<p begin="06:30:09.840" end="06:30:13.280" style="s2">suddenly lit up as it told the blue</p>
<p begin="06:30:11.440" end="06:30:14.958" style="s2">dragon to be quiet, reasoning that a</p>
<p begin="06:30:13.280" end="06:30:17.040" style="s2">tiny human like Zeke would not be enough</p>
<p begin="06:30:14.958" end="06:30:19.120" style="s2">to satisfy its hunger. Anyway, before</p>
<p begin="06:30:17.040" end="06:30:20.558" style="s2">the red dragon could continue, however,</p>
<p begin="06:30:19.120" end="06:30:22.400" style="s2">it suddenly felt something moving</p>
<p begin="06:30:20.558" end="06:30:24.400" style="s2">underneath its claw. The blue dragon</p>
<p begin="06:30:22.400" end="06:30:26.080" style="s2">noticed the red dragon&#39;s sudden silence</p>
<p begin="06:30:24.400" end="06:30:27.920" style="s2">and wondered what was wrong. The red</p>
<p begin="06:30:26.080" end="06:30:29.920" style="s2">dragon insisted that nothing was wrong,</p>
<p begin="06:30:27.920" end="06:30:31.920" style="s2">but its claw suddenly began trembling.</p>
<p begin="06:30:29.920" end="06:30:33.840" style="s2">Before either dragon could react, a</p>
<p begin="06:30:31.920" end="06:30:35.840" style="s2">brilliant golden aura surged toward the</p>
<p begin="06:30:33.840" end="06:30:37.760" style="s2">sky as Zeke unleashed a devastating</p>
<p begin="06:30:35.840" end="06:30:40.080" style="s2">punch directly against the red dragon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:30:37.760" end="06:30:41.680" style="s2">claw. Both dragons were momentarily</p>
<p begin="06:30:40.080" end="06:30:43.440" style="s2">shocked and frozen by what had just</p>
<p begin="06:30:41.680" end="06:30:45.520" style="s2">happened. Blood began dripping from</p>
<p begin="06:30:43.440" end="06:30:47.680" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s face as he clutched his chest.</p>
<p begin="06:30:45.520" end="06:30:49.360" style="s2">Yet, instead of showing fear, he could</p>
<p begin="06:30:47.680" end="06:30:51.680" style="s2">not hide his excitement at finally</p>
<p begin="06:30:49.360" end="06:30:53.360" style="s2">finding such a fine training ground. The</p>
<p begin="06:30:51.680" end="06:30:55.200" style="s2">blue dragon was stunned by Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:30:53.360" end="06:30:56.798" style="s2">reaction. While the red dragon could not</p>
<p begin="06:30:55.200" end="06:30:58.558" style="s2">accept the fact that Zeke actually</p>
<p begin="06:30:56.798" end="06:31:00.160" style="s2">considered them and the abandoned dragon</p>
<p begin="06:30:58.558" end="06:31:01.760" style="s2">valley to be nothing more than a</p>
<p begin="06:31:00.160" end="06:31:03.920" style="s2">training ground. Enraged by the</p>
<p begin="06:31:01.760" end="06:31:06.080" style="s2">humiliation, the red dragon roared</p>
<p begin="06:31:03.920" end="06:31:08.400" style="s2">furiously as a fierce red aura erupted</p>
<p begin="06:31:06.080" end="06:31:10.240" style="s2">from its body. Zeke remained silent,</p>
<p begin="06:31:08.400" end="06:31:12.320" style="s2">firmly observing the dragon standing</p>
<p begin="06:31:10.240" end="06:31:14.478" style="s2">before him. Saliva dripped from the</p>
<p begin="06:31:12.320" end="06:31:16.798" style="s2">dragon&#39;s enormous fangs as it warned</p>
<p begin="06:31:14.478" end="06:31:18.478" style="s2">Zeke not to misunderstand the situation.</p>
<p begin="06:31:16.798" end="06:31:20.000" style="s2">More dragons began appearing from the</p>
<p begin="06:31:18.478" end="06:31:21.840" style="s2">surrounding cliffs. And with their</p>
<p begin="06:31:20.000" end="06:31:23.440" style="s2">numbers steadily increasing, the red</p>
<p begin="06:31:21.840" end="06:31:25.680" style="s2">dragon declared that this place would</p>
<p begin="06:31:23.440" end="06:31:28.240" style="s2">become Zeke&#39;s graveyard. Meanwhile, back</p>
<p begin="06:31:25.680" end="06:31:29.920" style="s2">at Lragon Academy, Mench handed over the</p>
<p begin="06:31:28.240" end="06:31:32.000" style="s2">individual training regimens that Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:31:29.920" end="06:31:33.760" style="s2">had asked him to deliver. Leica remained</p>
<p begin="06:31:32.000" end="06:31:35.760" style="s2">silent as she carefully browsed through</p>
<p begin="06:31:33.760" end="06:31:37.360" style="s2">the training instructions while Alan</p>
<p begin="06:31:35.760" end="06:31:39.280" style="s2">wondered why he had also received a</p>
<p begin="06:31:37.360" end="06:31:41.040" style="s2">training regimen from Zeke. Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:31:39.280" end="06:31:42.638" style="s2">explained that according to Zeke, since</p>
<p begin="06:31:41.040" end="06:31:44.320" style="s2">he was already preparing training for</p>
<p begin="06:31:42.638" end="06:31:46.400" style="s2">them, he might as well train everyone</p>
<p begin="06:31:44.320" end="06:31:47.600" style="s2">while he was at it. Laya then wondered</p>
<p begin="06:31:46.400" end="06:31:48.958" style="s2">whether they would actually become</p>
<p begin="06:31:47.600" end="06:31:50.878" style="s2">stronger if they followed everything</p>
<p begin="06:31:48.958" end="06:31:52.878" style="s2">written in the letters, but Menrich was</p>
<p begin="06:31:50.878" end="06:31:54.478" style="s2">not certain. He had no idea whether the</p>
<p begin="06:31:52.878" end="06:31:56.240" style="s2">training would work for them as well,</p>
<p begin="06:31:54.478" end="06:31:58.160" style="s2">although to be honest, the training</p>
<p begin="06:31:56.240" end="06:32:00.160" style="s2">methods detailed in the regimens were</p>
<p begin="06:31:58.160" end="06:32:01.920" style="s2">the same techniques that Veneil and Laya</p>
<p begin="06:32:00.160" end="06:32:03.200" style="s2">had learned from Zeke. Menrich then</p>
<p begin="06:32:01.920" end="06:32:04.798" style="s2">reminded them to look at how much</p>
<p begin="06:32:03.200" end="06:32:06.558" style="s2">stronger they had already become after</p>
<p begin="06:32:04.798" end="06:32:08.400" style="s2">training under Zeke, and he immediately</p>
<p begin="06:32:06.558" end="06:32:10.400" style="s2">asked Leica and Venil whether he was</p>
<p begin="06:32:08.400" end="06:32:12.558" style="s2">wrong about it. Instead of answering,</p>
<p begin="06:32:10.400" end="06:32:14.320" style="s2">Lea asked Menrich how long Zeke would be</p>
<p begin="06:32:12.558" end="06:32:15.840" style="s2">staying in the abandoned Dragon Valley.</p>
<p begin="06:32:14.320" end="06:32:17.280" style="s2">Everyone was shocked when Menrich</p>
<p begin="06:32:15.840" end="06:32:19.360" style="s2">informed them that Zeke would remain</p>
<p begin="06:32:17.280" end="06:32:21.600" style="s2">there for three years, all the way until</p>
<p begin="06:32:19.360" end="06:32:23.360" style="s2">his graduation from the Dragon&#39;s Nest.</p>
<p begin="06:32:21.600" end="06:32:25.440" style="s2">Vanil then asked what exactly the</p>
<p begin="06:32:23.360" end="06:32:26.958" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley was, explaining</p>
<p begin="06:32:25.440" end="06:32:28.798" style="s2">that although he understood that it was</p>
<p begin="06:32:26.958" end="06:32:30.878" style="s2">a dangerous place, he wanted to know</p>
<p begin="06:32:28.798" end="06:32:32.798" style="s2">more about it. Menrich remained silent</p>
<p begin="06:32:30.878" end="06:32:34.400" style="s2">for a moment before finally telling them</p>
<p begin="06:32:32.798" end="06:32:36.400" style="s2">everything he knew about the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:32:34.400" end="06:32:38.000" style="s2">Dragon Valley. He explained that the</p>
<p begin="06:32:36.400" end="06:32:39.600" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley was the place</p>
<p begin="06:32:38.000" end="06:32:41.520" style="s2">where dragons who had lost the power</p>
<p begin="06:32:39.600" end="06:32:42.878" style="s2">struggle were sealed away. Edges could</p>
<p begin="06:32:41.520" end="06:32:44.638" style="s2">hardly believe what he had just heard</p>
<p begin="06:32:42.878" end="06:32:46.000" style="s2">and immediately asked Menrich if there</p>
<p begin="06:32:44.638" end="06:32:48.160" style="s2">were really dragons living in that</p>
<p begin="06:32:46.000" end="06:32:50.320" style="s2">place. Menrich confirmed it without</p>
<p begin="06:32:48.160" end="06:32:52.558" style="s2">hesitation, explaining that dragons were</p>
<p begin="06:32:50.320" end="06:32:54.320" style="s2">inherently powerful beings, and even the</p>
<p begin="06:32:52.558" end="06:32:56.000" style="s2">weakest among them could go toe-to-toe</p>
<p begin="06:32:54.320" end="06:32:58.000" style="s2">with someone at the sevenstar level,</p>
<p begin="06:32:56.000" end="06:32:59.680" style="s2">including himself. The abandoned dragon</p>
<p begin="06:32:58.000" end="06:33:01.840" style="s2">valley was a place filled with countless</p>
<p begin="06:32:59.680" end="06:33:03.600" style="s2">dragons like that. Edgis then asked</p>
<p begin="06:33:01.840" end="06:33:05.360" style="s2">whether Zeke, who had been sent to such</p>
<p begin="06:33:03.600" end="06:33:07.600" style="s2">a place, would actually be able to</p>
<p begin="06:33:05.360" end="06:33:09.120" style="s2">return alive. Menrich remained silent</p>
<p begin="06:33:07.600" end="06:33:11.040" style="s2">once again before admitting that it</p>
<p begin="06:33:09.120" end="06:33:12.638" style="s2">would be extremely difficult for Zeke to</p>
<p begin="06:33:11.040" end="06:33:14.000" style="s2">return alive and it might even be</p>
<p begin="06:33:12.638" end="06:33:16.478" style="s2">difficult for them to recover his</p>
<p begin="06:33:14.000" end="06:33:18.878" style="s2">remains. Hearing this, everyone fell</p>
<p begin="06:33:16.478" end="06:33:20.718" style="s2">into a deep silence, especially Leica,</p>
<p begin="06:33:18.878" end="06:33:22.558" style="s2">who was now deeply worried about her</p>
<p begin="06:33:20.718" end="06:33:24.080" style="s2">brother. However, as she continued</p>
<p begin="06:33:22.558" end="06:33:25.760" style="s2">browsing through the training regimen</p>
<p begin="06:33:24.080" end="06:33:27.600" style="s2">Zeke had given them. She suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:33:25.760" end="06:33:29.600" style="s2">noticed a hidden letter from him.</p>
<p begin="06:33:27.600" end="06:33:31.040" style="s2">Inside, Zeke told her that he was</p>
<p begin="06:33:29.600" end="06:33:32.558" style="s2">looking forward to seeing just how much</p>
<p begin="06:33:31.040" end="06:33:34.638" style="s2">stronger she would become by the time</p>
<p begin="06:33:32.558" end="06:33:36.638" style="s2">they met again. Leica read Zeke&#39;s letter</p>
<p begin="06:33:34.638" end="06:33:38.638" style="s2">over and over again before suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:33:36.638" end="06:33:41.040" style="s2">shocking everyone with the loud sound of</p>
<p begin="06:33:38.638" end="06:33:42.638" style="s2">her slapping herself. She then gritted</p>
<p begin="06:33:41.040" end="06:33:44.478" style="s2">her teeth and declared that if it was</p>
<p begin="06:33:42.638" end="06:33:46.558" style="s2">Zeke, then he would definitely come back</p>
<p begin="06:33:44.478" end="06:33:48.638" style="s2">alive. With tears beginning to fall from</p>
<p begin="06:33:46.558" end="06:33:50.718" style="s2">her eyes, Leica encouraged everyone to</p>
<p begin="06:33:48.638" end="06:33:52.160" style="s2">become stronger before Zeke returned so</p>
<p begin="06:33:50.718" end="06:33:54.638" style="s2">that they could surprise him with how</p>
<p begin="06:33:52.160" end="06:33:56.400" style="s2">much they had grown. Laya fell silent</p>
<p begin="06:33:54.638" end="06:33:58.320" style="s2">after hearing Leica&#39;s determination,</p>
<p begin="06:33:56.400" end="06:34:00.240" style="s2">while Edges simply smiled and agreed</p>
<p begin="06:33:58.320" end="06:34:02.400" style="s2">that she was right. Zeke had always been</p>
<p begin="06:34:00.240" end="06:34:04.160" style="s2">the one surprising them up until now, so</p>
<p begin="06:34:02.400" end="06:34:06.080" style="s2">this time they should be the ones to</p>
<p begin="06:34:04.160" end="06:34:07.520" style="s2">surprise him instead. They needed to</p>
<p begin="06:34:06.080" end="06:34:09.360" style="s2">grow strong enough to leave Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:34:07.520" end="06:34:11.360" style="s2">astonished when he finally returned.</p>
<p begin="06:34:09.360" end="06:34:12.958" style="s2">Alan unexpectedly agreed with them.</p>
<p begin="06:34:11.360" end="06:34:14.798" style="s2">Although he pointed out that by the time</p>
<p begin="06:34:12.958" end="06:34:16.638" style="s2">Master Zeke returned, they would have</p>
<p begin="06:34:14.798" end="06:34:18.718" style="s2">already graduated. Those words</p>
<p begin="06:34:16.638" end="06:34:20.718" style="s2">immediately irritated Sandy, who asked</p>
<p begin="06:34:18.718" end="06:34:22.240" style="s2">Alan not to throw cold water on everyone</p>
<p begin="06:34:20.718" end="06:34:24.080" style="s2">just when they were getting fired up.</p>
<p begin="06:34:22.240" end="06:34:26.000" style="s2">Allan argued that he was merely stating</p>
<p begin="06:34:24.080" end="06:34:27.840" style="s2">the facts. And as the two continued</p>
<p begin="06:34:26.000" end="06:34:30.400" style="s2">arguing, Menrich could not help but</p>
<p begin="06:34:27.840" end="06:34:32.558" style="s2">smile at their reactions. Deep inside,</p>
<p begin="06:34:30.400" end="06:34:34.638" style="s2">he was relieved, realizing that perhaps</p>
<p begin="06:34:32.558" end="06:34:36.558" style="s2">all of his worries had been unnecessary</p>
<p begin="06:34:34.638" end="06:34:38.400" style="s2">after all. Meanwhile, back in the</p>
<p begin="06:34:36.558" end="06:34:40.000" style="s2">abandoned dragon valley, the dragons</p>
<p begin="06:34:38.400" end="06:34:42.160" style="s2">continued wondering what was wrong with</p>
<p begin="06:34:40.000" end="06:34:44.558" style="s2">the tiny human. As Zeke kept laughing</p>
<p begin="06:34:42.160" end="06:34:46.478" style="s2">maniacally, the dragons stared at him in</p>
<p begin="06:34:44.558" end="06:34:48.320" style="s2">confusion, wondering why he was laughing</p>
<p begin="06:34:46.478" end="06:34:50.160" style="s2">like that before immediately launching</p>
<p begin="06:34:48.320" end="06:34:51.680" style="s2">themselves toward him. Zeke simply</p>
<p begin="06:34:50.160" end="06:34:53.600" style="s2">explained that the sensation of his</p>
<p begin="06:34:51.680" end="06:34:55.840" style="s2">bones crying out in pain was incredibly</p>
<p begin="06:34:53.600" end="06:34:57.840" style="s2">nostalgic. Before one of the dragons</p>
<p begin="06:34:55.840" end="06:34:59.760" style="s2">could land a tail attack on him, Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:34:57.840" end="06:35:01.360" style="s2">firmly planted his foot into the ground</p>
<p begin="06:34:59.760" end="06:35:03.360" style="s2">and caught the dragon&#39;s tail with his</p>
<p begin="06:35:01.360" end="06:35:04.878" style="s2">bare hand. He then firmly urged the</p>
<p begin="06:35:03.360" end="06:35:06.798" style="s2">dragons to make sure they entertained</p>
<p begin="06:35:04.878" end="06:35:08.400" style="s2">him even more before swinging the dragon</p>
<p begin="06:35:06.798" end="06:35:10.478" style="s2">around and throwing it high into the</p>
<p begin="06:35:08.400" end="06:35:12.240" style="s2">air. Every dragon&#39;s eyes widened in</p>
<p begin="06:35:10.478" end="06:35:14.080" style="s2">disbelief. They could not comprehend how</p>
<p begin="06:35:12.240" end="06:35:15.760" style="s2">a mere human could swing a dragon like</p>
<p begin="06:35:14.080" end="06:35:17.040" style="s2">them around as if it weighed nothing,</p>
<p begin="06:35:15.760" end="06:35:19.600" style="s2">leaving them wondering what kind of</p>
<p begin="06:35:17.040" end="06:35:21.280" style="s2">ridiculous joke this was. However, the</p>
<p begin="06:35:19.600" end="06:35:23.040" style="s2">dragon that had been thrown by Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:35:21.280" end="06:35:24.798" style="s2">quickly recovered and immediately told</p>
<p begin="06:35:23.040" end="06:35:26.718" style="s2">the other dragon to stop wasting time</p>
<p begin="06:35:24.798" end="06:35:28.558" style="s2">talking if it had enough time to flap</p>
<p begin="06:35:26.718" end="06:35:30.400" style="s2">its jaws. Then it should use that time</p>
<p begin="06:35:28.558" end="06:35:32.558" style="s2">to attack the monster instead. The</p>
<p begin="06:35:30.400" end="06:35:34.638" style="s2">monster the dragon was referring to was</p>
<p begin="06:35:32.558" end="06:35:36.240" style="s2">none other than Zeke. The dragon then</p>
<p begin="06:35:34.638" end="06:35:38.080" style="s2">launched itself toward the so-called</p>
<p begin="06:35:36.240" end="06:35:40.000" style="s2">little monster with all of its strength.</p>
<p begin="06:35:38.080" end="06:35:41.760" style="s2">But Zeke successfully defended himself</p>
<p begin="06:35:40.000" end="06:35:44.000" style="s2">against the attack. Rather than being</p>
<p begin="06:35:41.760" end="06:35:45.920" style="s2">frightened, Zeke was excited as he could</p>
<p begin="06:35:44.000" end="06:35:48.160" style="s2">finally feel the immense strength he had</p>
<p begin="06:35:45.920" end="06:35:49.920" style="s2">expected from the dragons. Even as the</p>
<p begin="06:35:48.160" end="06:35:51.840" style="s2">dragon&#39;s hands continued trembling from</p>
<p begin="06:35:49.920" end="06:35:53.440" style="s2">the impact, Zeke observed that the</p>
<p begin="06:35:51.840" end="06:35:55.760" style="s2">amount of true star ether coming from</p>
<p begin="06:35:53.440" end="06:35:58.000" style="s2">the dragon was only around the six-star</p>
<p begin="06:35:55.760" end="06:35:59.840" style="s2">level. Yet, compared to human standards,</p>
<p begin="06:35:58.000" end="06:36:01.920" style="s2">its actual physical power reached the</p>
<p begin="06:35:59.840" end="06:36:03.760" style="s2">sevenstar level. The dragon clicked its</p>
<p begin="06:36:01.920" end="06:36:06.160" style="s2">tongue in disbelief and wondered what</p>
<p begin="06:36:03.760" end="06:36:07.760" style="s2">the hell Zeke actually was, pointing out</p>
<p begin="06:36:06.160" end="06:36:09.680" style="s2">that he was nothing more than a tiny</p>
<p begin="06:36:07.760" end="06:36:11.360" style="s2">human and questioning how someone like</p>
<p begin="06:36:09.680" end="06:36:13.680" style="s2">him could possibly possess such</p>
<p begin="06:36:11.360" end="06:36:15.360" style="s2">overwhelming power. Zeke remained silent</p>
<p begin="06:36:13.680" end="06:36:17.120" style="s2">before suddenly releasing a massive</p>
<p begin="06:36:15.360" end="06:36:19.200" style="s2">golden aura that spread throughout the</p>
<p begin="06:36:17.120" end="06:36:21.520" style="s2">entire area. The moment the dragons felt</p>
<p begin="06:36:19.200" end="06:36:23.360" style="s2">Zeke&#39;s golden aura, buckets of sweat</p>
<p begin="06:36:21.520" end="06:36:24.958" style="s2">began pouring down their faces as they</p>
<p begin="06:36:23.360" end="06:36:26.478" style="s2">desperately tried to convince themselves</p>
<p begin="06:36:24.958" end="06:36:28.878" style="s2">that the pressure coming from a mere</p>
<p begin="06:36:26.478" end="06:36:30.558" style="s2">human&#39;s aura could not possibly be real.</p>
<p begin="06:36:28.878" end="06:36:32.160" style="s2">Zeke, however, spoke with a grim</p>
<p begin="06:36:30.558" end="06:36:34.638" style="s2">expression as he made it clear that what</p>
<p begin="06:36:32.160" end="06:36:36.240" style="s2">he was did not matter. At that moment,</p>
<p begin="06:36:34.638" end="06:36:38.478" style="s2">all he wanted was to enjoy this</p>
<p begin="06:36:36.240" end="06:36:40.878" style="s2">bloodping sensation and experience a</p>
<p begin="06:36:38.478" end="06:36:42.878" style="s2">heart-racing battle. As he spoke, his</p>
<p begin="06:36:40.878" end="06:36:45.520" style="s2">golden aura began taking the shape of a</p>
<p begin="06:36:42.878" end="06:36:47.120" style="s2">gigantic, piercing golden dragon. The</p>
<p begin="06:36:45.520" end="06:36:48.958" style="s2">red dragon could not understand the</p>
<p begin="06:36:47.120" end="06:36:51.040" style="s2">presence it was sensing. Wondering what</p>
<p begin="06:36:48.958" end="06:36:53.360" style="s2">kind of monstrous existence Zeke truly</p>
<p begin="06:36:51.040" end="06:36:55.280" style="s2">was, and why the entire dragon race was</p>
<p begin="06:36:53.360" end="06:36:56.878" style="s2">trembling before a mere human, one of</p>
<p begin="06:36:55.280" end="06:36:58.558" style="s2">the dragons then warned the others that</p>
<p begin="06:36:56.878" end="06:37:00.320" style="s2">if they allowed Zeke to continue having</p>
<p begin="06:36:58.558" end="06:37:01.920" style="s2">his way with them, no one could predict</p>
<p begin="06:37:00.320" end="06:37:04.000" style="s2">what the elder dragons would say about</p>
<p begin="06:37:01.920" end="06:37:06.000" style="s2">their failure. The red dragon admitted</p>
<p begin="06:37:04.000" end="06:37:08.000" style="s2">that it already knew that and questioned</p>
<p begin="06:37:06.000" end="06:37:09.840" style="s2">what exactly the elder dragons expected</p>
<p begin="06:37:08.000" end="06:37:11.920" style="s2">them to do. Before it could continue,</p>
<p begin="06:37:09.840" end="06:37:13.520" style="s2">however, Zeke suddenly jumped toward the</p>
<p begin="06:37:11.920" end="06:37:15.280" style="s2">red dragon with his eyes glowing</p>
<p begin="06:37:13.520" end="06:37:16.638" style="s2">brightly. He wondered what was wrong</p>
<p begin="06:37:15.280" end="06:37:18.400" style="s2">with them and why they were having a</p>
<p begin="06:37:16.638" end="06:37:20.320" style="s2">meeting without including him since</p>
<p begin="06:37:18.400" end="06:37:22.400" style="s2">being left out made him feel lonely.</p>
<p begin="06:37:20.320" end="06:37:24.400" style="s2">With that, he launched a golden aura</p>
<p begin="06:37:22.400" end="06:37:26.240" style="s2">infused punch toward the red dragon,</p>
<p begin="06:37:24.400" end="06:37:28.798" style="s2">which narrowly avoided the attack before</p>
<p begin="06:37:26.240" end="06:37:30.160" style="s2">it landed. While still in midair, Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:37:28.798" end="06:37:32.160" style="s2">suddenly noticed something rushing</p>
<p begin="06:37:30.160" end="06:37:34.000" style="s2">toward him. Before he could even react,</p>
<p begin="06:37:32.160" end="06:37:36.320" style="s2">a massive breath of fire struck him</p>
<p begin="06:37:34.000" end="06:37:38.478" style="s2">head-on. An attack so powerful that even</p>
<p begin="06:37:36.320" end="06:37:40.718" style="s2">the surrounding dragons were shocked.</p>
<p begin="06:37:38.478" end="06:37:42.638" style="s2">Just then, a massive dragon emerged and</p>
<p begin="06:37:40.718" end="06:37:44.400" style="s2">complained about how noisy everyone was</p>
<p begin="06:37:42.638" end="06:37:46.558" style="s2">being. The red dragon immediately</p>
<p begin="06:37:44.400" end="06:37:48.718" style="s2">recognized the newcomer as Elder Dusk.</p>
<p begin="06:37:46.558" end="06:37:50.320" style="s2">Elder Dusk questioned what was going on</p>
<p begin="06:37:48.718" end="06:37:52.400" style="s2">and whether they were really being toyed</p>
<p begin="06:37:50.320" end="06:37:53.840" style="s2">with by a mere human. The dragons</p>
<p begin="06:37:52.400" end="06:37:56.320" style="s2">immediately bowed their heads toward</p>
<p begin="06:37:53.840" end="06:37:58.320" style="s2">Elder Dusk and begged for forgiveness,</p>
<p begin="06:37:56.320" end="06:38:00.400" style="s2">explaining that Zeke was not an ordinary</p>
<p begin="06:37:58.320" end="06:38:02.400" style="s2">human at all. This only angered Elder</p>
<p begin="06:38:00.400" end="06:38:04.400" style="s2">Dusk, who immediately shouted at every</p>
<p begin="06:38:02.400" end="06:38:06.478" style="s2">dragon in the area, making it clear that</p>
<p begin="06:38:04.400" end="06:38:08.558" style="s2">he did not want to hear any excuses.</p>
<p begin="06:38:06.478" end="06:38:10.080" style="s2">With a grim expression, Elder Dusk</p>
<p begin="06:38:08.558" end="06:38:12.000" style="s2">reminded them that even though they were</p>
<p begin="06:38:10.080" end="06:38:13.840" style="s2">dragons who had fallen into this land,</p>
<p begin="06:38:12.000" end="06:38:15.760" style="s2">failing to kill a mere human was still</p>
<p begin="06:38:13.840" end="06:38:17.600" style="s2">unacceptable. He then questioned whether</p>
<p begin="06:38:15.760" end="06:38:19.680" style="s2">they intended to disgrace the dignity of</p>
<p begin="06:38:17.600" end="06:38:21.200" style="s2">Lord Lunarex. The ordinary dragons</p>
<p begin="06:38:19.680" end="06:38:22.798" style="s2">immediately denied that they had any</p>
<p begin="06:38:21.200" end="06:38:24.798" style="s2">intention of doing such a thing, but</p>
<p begin="06:38:22.798" end="06:38:26.878" style="s2">Elder Dusk ordered them to stop arguing.</p>
<p begin="06:38:24.798" end="06:38:28.718" style="s2">He speculated that perhaps fewer dragons</p>
<p begin="06:38:26.878" end="06:38:30.718" style="s2">have fallen into this land recently,</p>
<p begin="06:38:28.718" end="06:38:32.958" style="s2">causing them to grow somewhat slack and</p>
<p begin="06:38:30.718" end="06:38:34.240" style="s2">complacent. Because of that, he declared</p>
<p begin="06:38:32.958" end="06:38:36.160" style="s2">that they would personally receive</p>
<p begin="06:38:34.240" end="06:38:37.680" style="s2">discipline in the near future. The red</p>
<p begin="06:38:36.160" end="06:38:39.600" style="s2">dragon immediately acknowledged the</p>
<p begin="06:38:37.680" end="06:38:41.200" style="s2">order, and Elder Dusk turned around to</p>
<p begin="06:38:39.600" end="06:38:43.360" style="s2">leave. But before he could even take</p>
<p begin="06:38:41.200" end="06:38:45.200" style="s2">another step, Zeke suddenly interrupted</p>
<p begin="06:38:43.360" end="06:38:47.360" style="s2">them, expressing his interest in the</p>
<p begin="06:38:45.200" end="06:38:49.840" style="s2">personal discipline and finding the idea</p>
<p begin="06:38:47.360" end="06:38:51.680" style="s2">incredibly fun. Elder Dusk turned around</p>
<p begin="06:38:49.840" end="06:38:53.520" style="s2">once again and stared toward Zeke,</p>
<p begin="06:38:51.680" end="06:38:55.120" style="s2">questioning what he meant. still covered</p>
<p begin="06:38:53.520" end="06:38:57.280" style="s2">in raging flames from the previous</p>
<p begin="06:38:55.120" end="06:38:59.040" style="s2">attack. Zeke calmly stretched out his</p>
<p begin="06:38:57.280" end="06:39:00.878" style="s2">hand and made it clear that he wanted to</p>
<p begin="06:38:59.040" end="06:39:03.040" style="s2">join in on the disciplinary action as</p>
<p begin="06:39:00.878" end="06:39:05.680" style="s2">well. At that exact moment, the fourth</p>
<p begin="06:39:03.040" end="06:39:07.680" style="s2">star within Zeke&#39;s body suddenly lit up.</p>
<p begin="06:39:05.680" end="06:39:09.200" style="s2">Meanwhile, in the house of Lazardi,</p>
<p begin="06:39:07.680" end="06:39:11.120" style="s2">countless corpses were scattered</p>
<p begin="06:39:09.200" end="06:39:13.520" style="s2">throughout the area with blood covering</p>
<p begin="06:39:11.120" end="06:39:15.120" style="s2">the floors and walls. A gay-haired man</p>
<p begin="06:39:13.520" end="06:39:17.280" style="s2">stared at the horrifying scene in</p>
<p begin="06:39:15.120" end="06:39:18.878" style="s2">disbelief, unable to comprehend what had</p>
<p begin="06:39:17.280" end="06:39:20.798" style="s2">happened to his family. This man was</p>
<p begin="06:39:18.878" end="06:39:23.280" style="s2">Calon, the patriarch of the house of</p>
<p begin="06:39:20.798" end="06:39:25.120" style="s2">Lazardi, and sweat rolled down his face</p>
<p begin="06:39:23.280" end="06:39:27.040" style="s2">as he struggled to accept that the elite</p>
<p begin="06:39:25.120" end="06:39:29.040" style="s2">forces of his house had been defeated so</p>
<p begin="06:39:27.040" end="06:39:30.718" style="s2">easily, and that his entire family had</p>
<p begin="06:39:29.040" end="06:39:32.558" style="s2">been destroyed by a single woman. The</p>
<p begin="06:39:30.718" end="06:39:33.920" style="s2">white-haired woman then addressed Callen</p>
<p begin="06:39:32.558" end="06:39:36.400" style="s2">as the patriarch of the House of</p>
<p begin="06:39:33.920" end="06:39:37.760" style="s2">Lazardi, and with a firm voice, she</p>
<p begin="06:39:36.400" end="06:39:39.920" style="s2">accused him of colluding with the</p>
<p begin="06:39:37.760" end="06:39:42.000" style="s2">Kerberous family and leaking information</p>
<p begin="06:39:39.920" end="06:39:43.520" style="s2">concerning the house of Elragon before</p>
<p begin="06:39:42.000" end="06:39:46.000" style="s2">asking whether he admitted to his</p>
<p begin="06:39:43.520" end="06:39:47.600" style="s2">mistakes. However, Calli shouted back at</p>
<p begin="06:39:46.000" end="06:39:49.280" style="s2">the white-haired woman, demanding to</p>
<p begin="06:39:47.600" end="06:39:51.440" style="s2">know what she was talking about, while</p>
<p begin="06:39:49.280" end="06:39:53.440" style="s2">also asking if she had any idea what she</p>
<p begin="06:39:51.440" end="06:39:55.360" style="s2">had done to his Lazardi family. With a</p>
<p begin="06:39:53.440" end="06:39:56.958" style="s2">trembling voice, Kalion could not</p>
<p begin="06:39:55.360" end="06:39:58.798" style="s2">believe that the House of Lazardi had</p>
<p begin="06:39:56.958" end="06:40:00.320" style="s2">fallen like this after supporting the</p>
<p begin="06:39:58.798" end="06:40:02.478" style="s2">House of Elragon for countless</p>
<p begin="06:40:00.320" end="06:40:04.400" style="s2">generations. But the white-haired woman</p>
<p begin="06:40:02.478" end="06:40:06.558" style="s2">simply told Kalon that he seemed to have</p>
<p begin="06:40:04.400" end="06:40:08.478" style="s2">underestimated the House of Elragon. In</p>
<p begin="06:40:06.558" end="06:40:10.160" style="s2">the next moment, Kalion was shocked when</p>
<p begin="06:40:08.478" end="06:40:12.080" style="s2">the woman threw countless papers into</p>
<p begin="06:40:10.160" end="06:40:14.240" style="s2">the air, each one containing evidence</p>
<p begin="06:40:12.080" end="06:40:16.160" style="s2">against the House of Lazardi. Callen</p>
<p begin="06:40:14.240" end="06:40:17.920" style="s2">immediately fell silent, his sweating</p>
<p begin="06:40:16.160" end="06:40:19.680" style="s2">becoming even heavier as he stared at</p>
<p begin="06:40:17.920" end="06:40:21.280" style="s2">the papers raining down around him</p>
<p begin="06:40:19.680" end="06:40:23.440" style="s2">before asking the white-haired woman</p>
<p begin="06:40:21.280" end="06:40:25.200" style="s2">what all those documents were. The woman</p>
<p begin="06:40:23.440" end="06:40:26.878" style="s2">responded by explaining that they were</p>
<p begin="06:40:25.200" end="06:40:28.878" style="s2">documents regarding his deals with the</p>
<p begin="06:40:26.878" end="06:40:30.798" style="s2">Kerberous family, documents that he had</p>
<p begin="06:40:28.878" end="06:40:32.558" style="s2">hidden with great care. She added that</p>
<p begin="06:40:30.798" end="06:40:34.320" style="s2">the House of Elragon possessed various</p>
<p begin="06:40:32.558" end="06:40:36.000" style="s2">other pieces of evidence as well,</p>
<p begin="06:40:34.320" end="06:40:38.320" style="s2">although she doubted that any more would</p>
<p begin="06:40:36.000" end="06:40:39.760" style="s2">be necessary. Hearing this, Callen</p>
<p begin="06:40:38.320" end="06:40:41.440" style="s2">gritted his teeth and immediately</p>
<p begin="06:40:39.760" end="06:40:43.360" style="s2">charged toward the woman, drawing his</p>
<p begin="06:40:41.440" end="06:40:45.280" style="s2">sword as he cursed her. He raised his</p>
<p begin="06:40:43.360" end="06:40:46.958" style="s2">sword and launched his attack, but the</p>
<p begin="06:40:45.280" end="06:40:49.040" style="s2">woman simply remained where she stood</p>
<p begin="06:40:46.958" end="06:40:51.440" style="s2">without even budging as an intense ice</p>
<p begin="06:40:49.040" end="06:40:53.520" style="s2">aura began to spread from her body. In</p>
<p begin="06:40:51.440" end="06:40:56.400" style="s2">the next instant, her icy power covered</p>
<p begin="06:40:53.520" end="06:40:57.840" style="s2">the entire area, freezing Kalon himself</p>
<p begin="06:40:56.400" end="06:40:59.840" style="s2">along with everything surrounding the</p>
<p begin="06:40:57.840" end="06:41:01.760" style="s2">house of Lazardi. Afterward, she</p>
<p begin="06:40:59.840" end="06:41:03.760" style="s2">informed Kalion that in accordance with</p>
<p begin="06:41:01.760" end="06:41:06.000" style="s2">the laws of the House of L Dragon, he</p>
<p begin="06:41:03.760" end="06:41:08.160" style="s2">was to be executed. The woman then drew</p>
<p begin="06:41:06.000" end="06:41:10.160" style="s2">her sword and swiftly cut Kalian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:41:08.160" end="06:41:11.760" style="s2">frozen body into pieces. As his</p>
<p begin="06:41:10.160" end="06:41:13.520" style="s2">shattered body began to fall to the</p>
<p begin="06:41:11.760" end="06:41:15.600" style="s2">ground, she reminded him that no matter</p>
<p begin="06:41:13.520" end="06:41:17.680" style="s2">how prestigious a house might be, anyone</p>
<p begin="06:41:15.600" end="06:41:19.600" style="s2">who broke the laws of the House of Lagon</p>
<p begin="06:41:17.680" end="06:41:21.360" style="s2">would face nothing but annihilation. The</p>
<p begin="06:41:19.600" end="06:41:23.440" style="s2">woman was then introduced as Sulana</p>
<p begin="06:41:21.360" end="06:41:25.440" style="s2">Nidhog Elragon, the captain of the</p>
<p begin="06:41:23.440" end="06:41:27.920" style="s2">Silver Dragon Corps. Outside the House</p>
<p begin="06:41:25.440" end="06:41:29.280" style="s2">of Lazardi, Silana&#39;s subordinate praised</p>
<p begin="06:41:27.920" end="06:41:30.958" style="s2">her for completing the mission so</p>
<p begin="06:41:29.280" end="06:41:32.718" style="s2">efficiently, adding that although the</p>
<p begin="06:41:30.958" end="06:41:34.878" style="s2">House of Lazardi had already lost much</p>
<p begin="06:41:32.718" end="06:41:36.958" style="s2">of its former strength, single-handedly</p>
<p begin="06:41:34.878" end="06:41:39.200" style="s2">destroying a once prestigious family,</p>
<p begin="06:41:36.958" end="06:41:41.840" style="s2">was still an incredible feat. However,</p>
<p begin="06:41:39.200" end="06:41:43.600" style="s2">as Sana calmly smoked her cigarette, she</p>
<p begin="06:41:41.840" end="06:41:46.080" style="s2">explained that a house led by a mere</p>
<p begin="06:41:43.600" end="06:41:48.080" style="s2">six-star patriarch posed no real threat</p>
<p begin="06:41:46.080" end="06:41:50.240" style="s2">at all before asking whether anything</p>
<p begin="06:41:48.080" end="06:41:51.920" style="s2">had happened while she was away. Rey,</p>
<p begin="06:41:50.240" end="06:41:54.240" style="s2">the vice captain of the Silver Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:41:51.920" end="06:41:56.000" style="s2">Corps, then informed Lady Silana that</p>
<p begin="06:41:54.240" end="06:41:58.000" style="s2">Lady Leica and the others who had headed</p>
<p begin="06:41:56.000" end="06:42:00.558" style="s2">to the special rift had all returned</p>
<p begin="06:41:58.000" end="06:42:02.240" style="s2">safely. Silana was slightly surprised to</p>
<p begin="06:42:00.558" end="06:42:04.000" style="s2">hear this, as she had expected the</p>
<p begin="06:42:02.240" end="06:42:06.160" style="s2">Kerberous family to make some sort of</p>
<p begin="06:42:04.000" end="06:42:08.080" style="s2">move. Ry then explained that just as</p>
<p begin="06:42:06.160" end="06:42:09.680" style="s2">Sana had predicted, there had indeed</p>
<p begin="06:42:08.080" end="06:42:11.600" style="s2">been interference from the Kerberous</p>
<p begin="06:42:09.680" end="06:42:13.520" style="s2">family, but Lea and the others had</p>
<p begin="06:42:11.600" end="06:42:15.520" style="s2">successfully repelled them and safely</p>
<p begin="06:42:13.520" end="06:42:17.200" style="s2">retrieved the magic water. Sana</p>
<p begin="06:42:15.520" end="06:42:18.878" style="s2">acknowledged this and remarked that it</p>
<p begin="06:42:17.200" end="06:42:20.558" style="s2">was a shame because if Leica and the</p>
<p begin="06:42:18.878" end="06:42:21.760" style="s2">others were truly that capable, she</p>
<p begin="06:42:20.558" end="06:42:24.160" style="s2">would have chosen them during the</p>
<p begin="06:42:21.760" end="06:42:25.840" style="s2">graduation ceremony. Ry agreed and</p>
<p begin="06:42:24.160" end="06:42:27.280" style="s2">explained that almost all of the members</p>
<p begin="06:42:25.840" end="06:42:28.798" style="s2">this time came from prestigious</p>
<p begin="06:42:27.280" end="06:42:30.638" style="s2">families, meaning that during the</p>
<p begin="06:42:28.798" end="06:42:32.638" style="s2">graduation ceremony, they would most</p>
<p begin="06:42:30.638" end="06:42:34.400" style="s2">likely be assigned to units led by their</p>
<p begin="06:42:32.638" end="06:42:36.080" style="s2">respective patriarchs. The only</p>
<p begin="06:42:34.400" end="06:42:38.638" style="s2">exception was Master Zeke, the</p>
<p begin="06:42:36.080" end="06:42:40.400" style="s2">patriarch&#39;s illegitimate child. Ry then</p>
<p begin="06:42:38.638" end="06:42:42.478" style="s2">suddenly remembered that Master Zeke was</p>
<p begin="06:42:40.400" end="06:42:44.400" style="s2">in deep trouble. And when Sana asked</p>
<p begin="06:42:42.478" end="06:42:46.240" style="s2">what she meant, Rey explained that</p>
<p begin="06:42:44.400" end="06:42:48.160" style="s2">during their rift mission, Zeke has</p>
<p begin="06:42:46.240" end="06:42:49.840" style="s2">deliberately instigated Leica and the</p>
<p begin="06:42:48.160" end="06:42:51.600" style="s2">others to drink the magic water from the</p>
<p begin="06:42:49.840" end="06:42:53.920" style="s2">rift. And upon learning about what had</p>
<p begin="06:42:51.600" end="06:42:55.680" style="s2">happened, the patriarch became furious</p>
<p begin="06:42:53.920" end="06:42:58.000" style="s2">and banished Zeke to the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:42:55.680" end="06:42:59.600" style="s2">Dragon Valley. Hearing this, Sana&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:42:58.000" end="06:43:01.360" style="s2">expression suddenly darkened as she</p>
<p begin="06:42:59.600" end="06:43:03.760" style="s2">asked Rey whether what she had heard was</p>
<p begin="06:43:01.360" end="06:43:05.840" style="s2">really true. As they continued walking,</p>
<p begin="06:43:03.760" end="06:43:07.520" style="s2">Ry confirmed it and added that Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:43:05.840" end="06:43:09.120" style="s2">seemed to be taking the consequences of</p>
<p begin="06:43:07.520" end="06:43:10.718" style="s2">misunderstanding the mission and</p>
<p begin="06:43:09.120" end="06:43:13.040" style="s2">drinking the magic water extremely</p>
<p begin="06:43:10.718" end="06:43:14.558" style="s2">seriously. Silana simply snorted and</p>
<p begin="06:43:13.040" end="06:43:16.320" style="s2">remarked that there had been rumors that</p>
<p begin="06:43:14.558" end="06:43:18.400" style="s2">the patriarch&#39;s illegitimate child</p>
<p begin="06:43:16.320" end="06:43:19.760" style="s2">possessed quite a bit of backbone, but</p>
<p begin="06:43:18.400" end="06:43:21.520" style="s2">if he had truly been sent to the</p>
<p begin="06:43:19.760" end="06:43:23.840" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley, then he would</p>
<p begin="06:43:21.520" end="06:43:25.680" style="s2">not survive. Still, she added that if</p>
<p begin="06:43:23.840" end="06:43:27.760" style="s2">Zeke somehow managed to emerge from the</p>
<p begin="06:43:25.680" end="06:43:30.080" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley alive, she would</p>
<p begin="06:43:27.760" end="06:43:31.680" style="s2">not mind taking him under her wing. Rey</p>
<p begin="06:43:30.080" end="06:43:33.600" style="s2">was immediately shocked and asked</p>
<p begin="06:43:31.680" end="06:43:35.360" style="s2">whether Lady Sana truly thought that was</p>
<p begin="06:43:33.600" end="06:43:37.280" style="s2">a good idea, explaining that from what</p>
<p begin="06:43:35.360" end="06:43:38.958" style="s2">she had heard, Zeke did not get along</p>
<p begin="06:43:37.280" end="06:43:40.478" style="s2">well with the patriarch and taking</p>
<p begin="06:43:38.958" end="06:43:42.558" style="s2">someone like him under her protection</p>
<p begin="06:43:40.478" end="06:43:44.400" style="s2">could easily embroil her in trouble.</p>
<p begin="06:43:42.558" end="06:43:46.478" style="s2">Sana simply questioned why she should</p>
<p begin="06:43:44.400" end="06:43:48.160" style="s2">care, especially since there was hardly</p>
<p begin="06:43:46.478" end="06:43:50.320" style="s2">anyone who actually got along with the</p>
<p begin="06:43:48.160" end="06:43:52.320" style="s2">patriarch in the first place. Ry still</p>
<p begin="06:43:50.320" end="06:43:54.558" style="s2">urged Lady Sana to be careful with her</p>
<p begin="06:43:52.320" end="06:43:56.240" style="s2">words and watch her tongue. But Sana</p>
<p begin="06:43:54.558" end="06:43:58.400" style="s2">smuggly replied that she was merely</p>
<p begin="06:43:56.240" end="06:44:00.400" style="s2">stating the truth. Ry then asked whether</p>
<p begin="06:43:58.400" end="06:44:02.320" style="s2">the abandoned Dragon Valley was truly as</p>
<p begin="06:44:00.400" end="06:44:04.160" style="s2">dangerous as everyone claimed since she</p>
<p begin="06:44:02.320" end="06:44:06.160" style="s2">had heard about the place many times.</p>
<p begin="06:44:04.160" end="06:44:08.478" style="s2">Sana answered that someone like Ry would</p>
<p begin="06:44:06.160" end="06:44:10.638" style="s2">not last even a few seconds there. Rey</p>
<p begin="06:44:08.478" end="06:44:12.240" style="s2">became even more curious and asked what</p>
<p begin="06:44:10.638" end="06:44:14.080" style="s2">could possibly be inside such a</p>
<p begin="06:44:12.240" end="06:44:16.000" style="s2">terrifying place. And her question</p>
<p begin="06:44:14.080" end="06:44:18.080" style="s2">caused Sulana to fall silent for a</p>
<p begin="06:44:16.000" end="06:44:19.920" style="s2">moment. Sana then explained that within</p>
<p begin="06:44:18.080" end="06:44:22.400" style="s2">the land known as the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:44:19.920" end="06:44:25.040" style="s2">Valley, terrifying and legendary dragons</p>
<p begin="06:44:22.400" end="06:44:27.280" style="s2">truly existed. Meanwhile, deep inside</p>
<p begin="06:44:25.040" end="06:44:28.958" style="s2">the abandoned Dragon Valley, Elder Dusk</p>
<p begin="06:44:27.280" end="06:44:31.200" style="s2">reminded Zeke that he had deliberately</p>
<p begin="06:44:28.958" end="06:44:32.558" style="s2">held back his previous attack. Yet, even</p>
<p begin="06:44:31.200" end="06:44:34.558" style="s2">that attack should have been powerful</p>
<p begin="06:44:32.558" end="06:44:37.040" style="s2">enough to reduce a mere human like Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:44:34.558" end="06:44:39.040" style="s2">to cinders. Zeke simply smirked and</p>
<p begin="06:44:37.040" end="06:44:40.478" style="s2">agreed with Elder Dusk&#39;s assessment,</p>
<p begin="06:44:39.040" end="06:44:42.400" style="s2">acknowledging that his fire was</p>
<p begin="06:44:40.478" end="06:44:44.000" style="s2">certainly hot, but insisting that it was</p>
<p begin="06:44:42.400" end="06:44:45.920" style="s2">nowhere near hot enough to burn him to</p>
<p begin="06:44:44.000" end="06:44:47.760" style="s2">ashes. This response immediately</p>
<p begin="06:44:45.920" end="06:44:49.680" style="s2">intrigued Elder Dusk, who found it</p>
<p begin="06:44:47.760" end="06:44:51.440" style="s2">remarkable that a human sent to such a</p>
<p begin="06:44:49.680" end="06:44:54.000" style="s2">land could still possess enough spirit</p>
<p begin="06:44:51.440" end="06:44:55.840" style="s2">to make such bold remarks. At the same</p>
<p begin="06:44:54.000" end="06:44:57.760" style="s2">time, the other dragons noticed Elder</p>
<p begin="06:44:55.840" end="06:44:59.680" style="s2">Dusk&#39;s growing anger as flames began</p>
<p begin="06:44:57.760" end="06:45:01.440" style="s2">gathering around his mouth once again,</p>
<p begin="06:44:59.680" end="06:45:03.120" style="s2">prompting them to quickly fly away and</p>
<p begin="06:45:01.440" end="06:45:05.520" style="s2">put as much distance between themselves</p>
<p begin="06:45:03.120" end="06:45:07.200" style="s2">and Elder Dusk as possible. Elder Dusk</p>
