<p begin="06:45:07.200" end="06:45:10.638" style="s2">their territory before immediately</p>
<p begin="06:45:08.798" end="06:45:12.638" style="s2">unleashing a powerful breath of fire</p>
<p begin="06:45:10.638" end="06:45:14.320" style="s2">toward him. The attack was so tremendous</p>
<p begin="06:45:12.638" end="06:45:16.160" style="s2">that even the other dragons were forced</p>
<p begin="06:45:14.320" end="06:45:18.160" style="s2">to close their eyes and brace themselves</p>
<p begin="06:45:16.160" end="06:45:19.920" style="s2">against the immense force. With the</p>
<p begin="06:45:18.160" end="06:45:21.840" style="s2">staggering heat of Elder Dusk&#39;s flames</p>
<p begin="06:45:19.920" end="06:45:23.920" style="s2">engulfing the area, they assumed that</p>
<p begin="06:45:21.840" end="06:45:25.840" style="s2">Zeke had already been melted and reduced</p>
<p begin="06:45:23.920" end="06:45:27.760" style="s2">to ashes. But when the smoke finally</p>
<p begin="06:45:25.840" end="06:45:29.760" style="s2">began to clear, Elder Dusk was shocked</p>
<p begin="06:45:27.760" end="06:45:31.360" style="s2">to see Zeke still standing, already</p>
<p begin="06:45:29.760" end="06:45:34.080" style="s2">gathering his source power into his</p>
<p begin="06:45:31.360" end="06:45:35.920" style="s2">fist. Zeke then leapt toward Elder Dusk</p>
<p begin="06:45:34.080" end="06:45:38.080" style="s2">while continuously concentrating more of</p>
<p begin="06:45:35.920" end="06:45:39.920" style="s2">his source power into his fist. And as</p>
<p begin="06:45:38.080" end="06:45:41.680" style="s2">he attacked, he acknowledged that Elder</p>
<p begin="06:45:39.920" end="06:45:43.920" style="s2">Dusk&#39;s fire breath had some impressive</p>
<p begin="06:45:41.680" end="06:45:45.840" style="s2">heat this time. Elder Dusk believed that</p>
<p begin="06:45:43.920" end="06:45:47.840" style="s2">he had already avoided Zeke&#39;s attack.</p>
<p begin="06:45:45.840" end="06:45:49.840" style="s2">But to his surprise, Zeke managed to</p>
<p begin="06:45:47.840" end="06:45:51.760" style="s2">land a direct hit that tore into the</p>
<p begin="06:45:49.840" end="06:45:53.520" style="s2">side of his body. At the same moment,</p>
<p begin="06:45:51.760" end="06:45:55.120" style="s2">the other dragons noticed that Zeke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="06:45:53.520" end="06:45:57.120" style="s2">burned body was already beginning to</p>
<p begin="06:45:55.120" end="06:45:59.120" style="s2">heal. Zeke then explained that he took</p>
<p begin="06:45:57.120" end="06:46:01.360" style="s2">great pride in his vitality and healing</p>
<p begin="06:45:59.120" end="06:46:03.200" style="s2">capabilities, revealing that the dragon</p>
<p begin="06:46:01.360" end="06:46:05.040" style="s2">king&#39;s breath drew the surrounding true</p>
<p begin="06:46:03.200" end="06:46:06.958" style="s2">star ether into his body while</p>
<p begin="06:46:05.040" end="06:46:08.798" style="s2">simultaneously enhancing his natural</p>
<p begin="06:46:06.958" end="06:46:10.558" style="s2">healing abilities. This was the reason</p>
<p begin="06:46:08.798" end="06:46:12.798" style="s2">Zeke could display such extraordinary</p>
<p begin="06:46:10.558" end="06:46:14.958" style="s2">regeneration. Elder Dusk immediately</p>
<p begin="06:46:12.798" end="06:46:16.638" style="s2">recognized Zeke as a dangerous human and</p>
<p begin="06:46:14.958" end="06:46:18.958" style="s2">decided that he needed to be eliminated</p>
<p begin="06:46:16.638" end="06:46:20.958" style="s2">on the spot. He flew toward Zeke and</p>
<p begin="06:46:18.958" end="06:46:23.440" style="s2">suddenly seized him between his jaws.</p>
<p begin="06:46:20.958" end="06:46:24.958" style="s2">Trapped inside Elder Dusk&#39;s mouth, Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:46:23.440" end="06:46:27.280" style="s2">desperately tried to prevent himself</p>
<p begin="06:46:24.958" end="06:46:29.200" style="s2">from being bitten and eaten alive. But</p>
<p begin="06:46:27.280" end="06:46:31.120" style="s2">Elder Dusk suddenly unleashed another</p>
<p begin="06:46:29.200" end="06:46:33.040" style="s2">blast of fire breath directly at him.</p>
<p begin="06:46:31.120" end="06:46:34.878" style="s2">The attack struck Zeke headon and sent</p>
<p begin="06:46:33.040" end="06:46:37.360" style="s2">him crashing toward the ground, causing</p>
<p begin="06:46:34.878" end="06:46:39.360" style="s2">a massive and deafening explosion. Yet,</p>
<p begin="06:46:37.360" end="06:46:41.440" style="s2">even after such a devastating attack,</p>
<p begin="06:46:39.360" end="06:46:43.440" style="s2">Zeke managed to survive. And as his</p>
<p begin="06:46:41.440" end="06:46:45.200" style="s2">wounds began healing once again, he</p>
<p begin="06:46:43.440" end="06:46:47.280" style="s2">praised Elder Dusk&#39;s fire breath for</p>
<p begin="06:46:45.200" end="06:46:49.360" style="s2">becoming hotter every time. This only</p>
<p begin="06:46:47.280" end="06:46:50.958" style="s2">enraged Elder Dusk further, and he</p>
<p begin="06:46:49.360" end="06:46:52.958" style="s2">immediately attacked Zeke with his</p>
<p begin="06:46:50.958" end="06:46:55.440" style="s2">massive claws, pinning him against the</p>
<p begin="06:46:52.958" end="06:46:57.440" style="s2">ground with overwhelming force. But Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:46:55.440" end="06:46:59.440" style="s2">managed to defend himself and suddenly</p>
<p begin="06:46:57.440" end="06:47:01.680" style="s2">released a tremendous burst of aura,</p>
<p begin="06:46:59.440" end="06:47:03.280" style="s2">shocking Elder Dusk once again. After</p>
<p begin="06:47:01.680" end="06:47:05.520" style="s2">successfully pushing back the Elder</p>
<p begin="06:47:03.280" end="06:47:07.920" style="s2">Dragon&#39;s massive claws, Zeke gathered</p>
<p begin="06:47:05.520" end="06:47:10.240" style="s2">his golden aura into his fist and this</p>
<p begin="06:47:07.920" end="06:47:12.320" style="s2">time struck Elder Dusk directly in the</p>
<p begin="06:47:10.240" end="06:47:14.478" style="s2">face with tremendous force, sending the</p>
<p begin="06:47:12.320" end="06:47:16.000" style="s2">Elder Dragon flying backward. The other</p>
<p begin="06:47:14.478" end="06:47:17.920" style="s2">dragons could do nothing but call out</p>
<p begin="06:47:16.000" end="06:47:19.920" style="s2">Elder Dusk&#39;s name, unable to believe</p>
<p begin="06:47:17.920" end="06:47:22.160" style="s2">that Zeke had actually managed to land</p>
<p begin="06:47:19.920" end="06:47:24.080" style="s2">such a devastating blow. As Elder Dusk</p>
<p begin="06:47:22.160" end="06:47:26.240" style="s2">recovered from the attack, he stared at</p>
<p begin="06:47:24.080" end="06:47:28.000" style="s2">Zeke in disbelief and declared that he</p>
<p begin="06:47:26.240" end="06:47:30.240" style="s2">could not believe such strength belonged</p>
<p begin="06:47:28.000" end="06:47:33.120" style="s2">to a human before demanding to know who</p>
<p begin="06:47:30.240" end="06:47:34.878" style="s2">Zeke truly was. Suddenly, a six-winged</p>
<p begin="06:47:33.120" end="06:47:36.798" style="s2">dragon flew toward them and ordered</p>
<p begin="06:47:34.878" end="06:47:38.798" style="s2">Elder Dusk to stop, declaring that</p>
<p begin="06:47:36.798" end="06:47:40.958" style="s2">enough was enough. It was then revealed</p>
<p begin="06:47:38.798" end="06:47:42.478" style="s2">that in the abandoned Dragon Valley, a</p>
<p begin="06:47:40.958" end="06:47:44.320" style="s2">fierce battle had once been fought</p>
<p begin="06:47:42.478" end="06:47:45.840" style="s2">against the current dragon king. A</p>
<p begin="06:47:44.320" end="06:47:47.680" style="s2">battle that had been waged over the</p>
<p begin="06:47:45.840" end="06:47:49.680" style="s2">throne, where a silver dragon had</p>
<p begin="06:47:47.680" end="06:47:51.200" style="s2">ultimately been sealed away. Elder Dusk</p>
<p begin="06:47:49.680" end="06:47:53.120" style="s2">looked up at the six-winged dragon and</p>
<p begin="06:47:51.200" end="06:47:55.840" style="s2">called out his name, recognizing him as</p>
<p begin="06:47:53.120" end="06:47:57.600" style="s2">Lord Lunarex, the Silver Dragon. Three</p>
<p begin="06:47:55.840" end="06:47:59.680" style="s2">years have passed since Zeke was sent to</p>
<p begin="06:47:57.600" end="06:48:02.240" style="s2">the abandoned dragon valley. Somewhere</p>
<p begin="06:47:59.680" end="06:48:04.240" style="s2">within Lragon territory, a man wearing a</p>
<p begin="06:48:02.240" end="06:48:05.840" style="s2">cape walked through the halls, and as he</p>
<p begin="06:48:04.240" end="06:48:07.920" style="s2">approached the other high-ranking nobles</p>
<p begin="06:48:05.840" end="06:48:09.680" style="s2">and soldiers of the Lragon family, he</p>
<p begin="06:48:07.920" end="06:48:11.280" style="s2">greeted them with a wave and a laugh,</p>
<p begin="06:48:09.680" end="06:48:12.958" style="s2">remarking that it had been a long time</p>
<p begin="06:48:11.280" end="06:48:14.798" style="s2">since they had last seen each other.</p>
<p begin="06:48:12.958" end="06:48:16.718" style="s2">This man was Zetel Tupon, the head of</p>
<p begin="06:48:14.798" end="06:48:18.320" style="s2">House Tupon. The moment the other</p>
<p begin="06:48:16.718" end="06:48:20.160" style="s2">high-ranking nobles turned to look at</p>
<p begin="06:48:18.320" end="06:48:22.240" style="s2">him, mixed reactions appeared on their</p>
<p begin="06:48:20.160" end="06:48:24.160" style="s2">faces, the red-haired man recognized him</p>
<p begin="06:48:22.240" end="06:48:26.000" style="s2">as old man Zetle, while the blue-haired</p>
<p begin="06:48:24.160" end="06:48:28.240" style="s2">man wearing glasses politely greeted</p>
<p begin="06:48:26.000" end="06:48:30.240" style="s2">Lord Zetle and wished him a good day.</p>
<p begin="06:48:28.240" end="06:48:32.240" style="s2">Meanwhile, the balding man simply looked</p>
<p begin="06:48:30.240" end="06:48:34.080" style="s2">at Zetle in silence, showing no</p>
<p begin="06:48:32.240" end="06:48:35.440" style="s2">intention of saying anything. Zetle</p>
<p begin="06:48:34.080" end="06:48:37.360" style="s2">laughed again as he remarked that</p>
<p begin="06:48:35.440" end="06:48:39.440" style="s2">everyone seemed to be doing well before</p>
<p begin="06:48:37.360" end="06:48:41.680" style="s2">asking how things had been lately. The</p>
<p begin="06:48:39.440" end="06:48:43.520" style="s2">red-haired man, Freyos, captain of the</p>
<p begin="06:48:41.680" end="06:48:45.120" style="s2">Red Dragon Corps, explained that on</p>
<p begin="06:48:43.520" end="06:48:47.120" style="s2">their end, rifts had been opening</p>
<p begin="06:48:45.120" end="06:48:48.878" style="s2">everywhere, making them a real pain to</p>
<p begin="06:48:47.120" end="06:48:50.400" style="s2">deal with. Freyos could only wish that</p>
<p begin="06:48:48.878" end="06:48:52.478" style="s2">those rifts had a little more kick to</p>
<p begin="06:48:50.400" end="06:48:54.000" style="s2">them, but unfortunately, every single</p>
<p begin="06:48:52.478" end="06:48:56.320" style="s2">one of them was filled with nothing but</p>
<p begin="06:48:54.000" end="06:48:57.760" style="s2">boring small fry. The blue-haired man</p>
<p begin="06:48:56.320" end="06:48:59.680" style="s2">then explained that things on his end</p>
<p begin="06:48:57.760" end="06:49:01.360" style="s2">were relatively quiet, with only a few</p>
<p begin="06:48:59.680" end="06:49:03.680" style="s2">minor skirmishes against the mermaid</p>
<p begin="06:49:01.360" end="06:49:06.320" style="s2">house. This man was Walter, captain of</p>
<p begin="06:49:03.680" end="06:49:08.000" style="s2">the Blue Dragon Corps. As for Berg, the</p>
<p begin="06:49:06.320" end="06:49:09.920" style="s2">balding man and captain of the yellow</p>
<p begin="06:49:08.000" end="06:49:11.760" style="s2">dragon corps, he remained completely</p>
<p begin="06:49:09.920" end="06:49:13.280" style="s2">silent, looking as though he had no</p>
<p begin="06:49:11.760" end="06:49:15.520" style="s2">intention of sharing any information</p>
<p begin="06:49:13.280" end="06:49:17.840" style="s2">with Zetle. Seeing this, Walter and</p>
<p begin="06:49:15.520" end="06:49:19.760" style="s2">Freyos sighed, immediately urging Berg</p>
<p begin="06:49:17.840" end="06:49:22.160" style="s2">to say something. But even then, he</p>
<p begin="06:49:19.760" end="06:49:23.760" style="s2">continued to remain silent. Zetle simply</p>
<p begin="06:49:22.160" end="06:49:26.000" style="s2">laughed and remarked that Berg was as</p>
<p begin="06:49:23.760" end="06:49:27.920" style="s2">tacatern as ever. Freyos, however,</p>
<p begin="06:49:26.000" end="06:49:30.080" style="s2">pointed out that being Tacitturn was not</p>
<p begin="06:49:27.920" end="06:49:31.840" style="s2">even the real issue, and Walter agreed,</p>
<p begin="06:49:30.080" end="06:49:33.520" style="s2">adding that he genuinely wished Berg</p>
<p begin="06:49:31.840" end="06:49:35.200" style="s2">could at least communicate with them,</p>
<p begin="06:49:33.520" end="06:49:37.280" style="s2">because at this rate, they would never</p>
<p begin="06:49:35.200" end="06:49:39.280" style="s2">be able to coordinate properly if a</p>
<p begin="06:49:37.280" end="06:49:41.200" style="s2">crisis ever occurred. Instead of</p>
<p begin="06:49:39.280" end="06:49:42.558" style="s2">answering them, Zetel rubbed his beard</p>
<p begin="06:49:41.200" end="06:49:44.080" style="s2">and asked why the three of them were</p>
<p begin="06:49:42.558" end="06:49:46.160" style="s2">here in the first place. Without</p>
<p begin="06:49:44.080" end="06:49:48.080" style="s2">hesitation, Freyos explained that the</p>
<p begin="06:49:46.160" end="06:49:50.000" style="s2">reason was obvious, as they had all come</p>
<p begin="06:49:48.080" end="06:49:52.160" style="s2">to watch the graduation ceremony.</p>
<p begin="06:49:50.000" end="06:49:54.240" style="s2">Hearing this, Zedle remarked that he</p>
<p begin="06:49:52.160" end="06:49:56.000" style="s2">never expected Freyos, who usually</p>
<p begin="06:49:54.240" end="06:49:58.240" style="s2">dumped this sort of occasion on his vice</p>
<p begin="06:49:56.000" end="06:50:00.000" style="s2">captain, to actually show up in person.</p>
<p begin="06:49:58.240" end="06:50:01.680" style="s2">Freyos simply looked to the side and</p>
<p begin="06:50:00.000" end="06:50:03.360" style="s2">explained that his original plan had</p>
<p begin="06:50:01.680" end="06:50:05.360" style="s2">indeed been to let his vice captain</p>
<p begin="06:50:03.360" end="06:50:07.440" style="s2">attend, but he had been told that it was</p>
<p begin="06:50:05.360" end="06:50:09.360" style="s2">about time he came personally and picked</p>
<p begin="06:50:07.440" end="06:50:11.040" style="s2">out recruits for himself. Walter then</p>
<p begin="06:50:09.360" end="06:50:13.040" style="s2">remarked that choosing talent with his</p>
<p begin="06:50:11.040" end="06:50:14.558" style="s2">own eyes was probably for the best,</p>
<p begin="06:50:13.040" end="06:50:17.040" style="s2">especially considering how splendid</p>
<p begin="06:50:14.558" end="06:50:18.958" style="s2">Veneil&#39;s class had been 3 years ago.</p>
<p begin="06:50:17.040" end="06:50:21.040" style="s2">After all, four students had reached the</p>
<p begin="06:50:18.958" end="06:50:22.400" style="s2">four-star rank before graduation.</p>
<p begin="06:50:21.040" end="06:50:24.400" style="s2">Hearing about the four-st star students</p>
<p begin="06:50:22.400" end="06:50:26.000" style="s2">who were about to graduate, Freyos</p>
<p begin="06:50:24.400" end="06:50:27.920" style="s2">remarked that Zatell&#39;s young lady had</p>
<p begin="06:50:26.000" end="06:50:29.840" style="s2">great potential as well. Zetel</p>
<p begin="06:50:27.920" end="06:50:31.840" style="s2">immediately agreed, proudly stating that</p>
<p begin="06:50:29.840" end="06:50:33.920" style="s2">Leica was a genius, and he firmly</p>
<p begin="06:50:31.840" end="06:50:35.680" style="s2">believed that just like Vanil&#39;s group,</p>
<p begin="06:50:33.920" end="06:50:37.680" style="s2">Leica had already reached the four-star</p>
<p begin="06:50:35.680" end="06:50:39.360" style="s2">rank by now. Walter admitted that it</p>
<p begin="06:50:37.680" end="06:50:40.798" style="s2">should not be a problem, but pointed out</p>
<p begin="06:50:39.360" end="06:50:42.478" style="s2">that they probably would not be as</p>
<p begin="06:50:40.798" end="06:50:45.200" style="s2">blessed with talent as the graduates</p>
<p begin="06:50:42.478" end="06:50:47.200" style="s2">from 3 years ago. Hearing this, Freyos</p>
<p begin="06:50:45.200" end="06:50:49.280" style="s2">made an indirect remark about how unfair</p>
<p begin="06:50:47.200" end="06:50:51.360" style="s2">the Elder Houses were, considering how</p>
<p begin="06:50:49.280" end="06:50:53.440" style="s2">they seemed capable of securing geniuses</p>
<p begin="06:50:51.360" end="06:50:55.040" style="s2">without fail. Walter agreed with him and</p>
<p begin="06:50:53.440" end="06:50:56.958" style="s2">directly pointed out that prestigious</p>
<p begin="06:50:55.040" end="06:50:58.558" style="s2">families had it easy, especially since</p>
<p begin="06:50:56.958" end="06:51:00.558" style="s2">each of them was permitted to maintain</p>
<p begin="06:50:58.558" end="06:51:02.400" style="s2">their own private force. The remarks</p>
<p begin="06:51:00.558" end="06:51:04.160" style="s2">struck Zetle hard, and he immediately</p>
<p begin="06:51:02.400" end="06:51:06.080" style="s2">defended them by explaining that even</p>
<p begin="06:51:04.160" end="06:51:07.920" style="s2">though they maintained private forces,</p>
<p begin="06:51:06.080" end="06:51:10.478" style="s2">their affiliation with House Elragon</p>
<p begin="06:51:07.920" end="06:51:11.920" style="s2">remained unchanged. Besides, he added</p>
<p begin="06:51:10.478" end="06:51:13.840" style="s2">that all three of them should be more</p>
<p begin="06:51:11.920" end="06:51:16.160" style="s2">than qualified to command private forces</p>
<p begin="06:51:13.840" end="06:51:18.320" style="s2">of their own. Freyos, however, reminded</p>
<p begin="06:51:16.160" end="06:51:19.760" style="s2">Zetle that commanding private forces was</p>
<p begin="06:51:18.320" end="06:51:21.280" style="s2">something they could only do after</p>
<p begin="06:51:19.760" end="06:51:23.680" style="s2">retiring from their positions as</p>
<p begin="06:51:21.280" end="06:51:25.200" style="s2">captains. Naturally, doing so while they</p>
<p begin="06:51:23.680" end="06:51:27.520" style="s2">were still serving as captains was</p>
<p begin="06:51:25.200" end="06:51:29.680" style="s2">impossible. With that, Zetle could no</p>
<p begin="06:51:27.520" end="06:51:31.760" style="s2">longer argue. At that moment, Berg</p>
<p begin="06:51:29.680" end="06:51:33.440" style="s2">suddenly spoke about the rumors. Zetle</p>
<p begin="06:51:31.760" end="06:51:35.200" style="s2">turned toward him and asked what rumors</p>
<p begin="06:51:33.440" end="06:51:36.638" style="s2">he was talking about. Berg explained</p>
<p begin="06:51:35.200" end="06:51:38.718" style="s2">that he was referring to the rumors</p>
<p begin="06:51:36.638" end="06:51:40.400" style="s2">surrounding the abandoned Dragon Valley.</p>
<p begin="06:51:38.718" end="06:51:42.400" style="s2">The moment he mentioned it, everyone</p>
<p begin="06:51:40.400" end="06:51:44.798" style="s2">fell silent and the expressions on their</p>
<p begin="06:51:42.400" end="06:51:46.240" style="s2">faces immediately became serious. Freyos</p>
<p begin="06:51:44.798" end="06:51:47.920" style="s2">then confirmed that there really were</p>
<p begin="06:51:46.240" end="06:51:50.080" style="s2">rumors regarding the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:51:47.920" end="06:51:51.840" style="s2">Valley. When Zetle asked what the rumor</p>
<p begin="06:51:50.080" end="06:51:54.080" style="s2">was and whether something had happened,</p>
<p begin="06:51:51.840" end="06:51:55.760" style="s2">Freyos remarked that Zetle, being an old</p>
<p begin="06:51:54.080" end="06:51:57.760" style="s2">man who had been out of the loop for so</p>
<p begin="06:51:55.760" end="06:51:59.600" style="s2">long, was far too uninformed about what</p>
<p begin="06:51:57.760" end="06:52:02.080" style="s2">had happened. Walter then explained that</p>
<p begin="06:51:59.600" end="06:52:03.920" style="s2">it had happened precisely 3 years ago.</p>
<p begin="06:52:02.080" end="06:52:05.760" style="s2">Apparently, there had been a minor issue</p>
<p begin="06:52:03.920" end="06:52:07.600" style="s2">involving the rift that Lady Leica had</p>
<p begin="06:52:05.760" end="06:52:09.280" style="s2">led and conquered. And because of that</p>
<p begin="06:52:07.600" end="06:52:11.520" style="s2">incident, one of the members of her</p>
<p begin="06:52:09.280" end="06:52:12.958" style="s2">team, an illegitimate child named Zeke,</p>
<p begin="06:52:11.520" end="06:52:15.040" style="s2">had reportedly been sent to the</p>
<p begin="06:52:12.958" end="06:52:16.878" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. Hearing this</p>
<p begin="06:52:15.040" end="06:52:18.558" style="s2">shocked Zeal, who immediately asked</p>
<p begin="06:52:16.878" end="06:52:20.320" style="s2">whether the kid named Zeke had really</p>
<p begin="06:52:18.558" end="06:52:21.680" style="s2">been sent there, and what on earth the</p>
<p begin="06:52:20.320" end="06:52:23.680" style="s2">boy had done to deserve such a</p>
<p begin="06:52:21.680" end="06:52:25.680" style="s2">punishment. Walter explained that</p>
<p begin="06:52:23.680" end="06:52:27.120" style="s2">according to what he had heard, Zeke had</p>
<p begin="06:52:25.680" end="06:52:29.200" style="s2">consumed magic water without</p>
<p begin="06:52:27.120" end="06:52:31.440" style="s2">authorization, and Lord Balsza had been</p>
<p begin="06:52:29.200" end="06:52:33.760" style="s2">furious over his reckless actions. As</p>
<p begin="06:52:31.440" end="06:52:35.440" style="s2">the head of the Lragon family, Balsza</p>
<p begin="06:52:33.760" end="06:52:37.280" style="s2">had held Zeke, the one who had</p>
<p begin="06:52:35.440" end="06:52:39.440" style="s2">instigated the act, entirely</p>
<p begin="06:52:37.280" end="06:52:41.280" style="s2">responsible. To Zeetle, all of this was</p>
<p begin="06:52:39.440" end="06:52:43.280" style="s2">completely new information, as he had</p>
<p begin="06:52:41.280" end="06:52:45.200" style="s2">never heard anything about the incident.</p>
<p begin="06:52:43.280" end="06:52:47.040" style="s2">Walter then explained that supposedly</p>
<p begin="06:52:45.200" end="06:52:49.280" style="s2">the deadline for Zeke&#39;s punishment was</p>
<p begin="06:52:47.040" end="06:52:51.120" style="s2">set until today&#39;s graduation ceremony.</p>
<p begin="06:52:49.280" end="06:52:53.040" style="s2">Freyos, however, immediately dismissed</p>
<p begin="06:52:51.120" end="06:52:55.040" style="s2">the possibility, stating that there was</p>
<p begin="06:52:53.040" end="06:52:56.558" style="s2">no way Zeke could still be alive after</p>
<p begin="06:52:55.040" end="06:52:58.478" style="s2">spending three whole years in the</p>
<p begin="06:52:56.558" end="06:53:00.400" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. As they</p>
<p begin="06:52:58.478" end="06:53:02.478" style="s2">continued walking, Walter admitted that</p>
<p begin="06:53:00.400" end="06:53:04.320" style="s2">he supposed that was true and that Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:53:02.478" end="06:53:06.240" style="s2">had probably already died. But what</p>
<p begin="06:53:04.320" end="06:53:08.080" style="s2">mattered to him now was finding out what</p>
<p begin="06:53:06.240" end="06:53:09.840" style="s2">kind of students were about to graduate,</p>
<p begin="06:53:08.080" end="06:53:11.600" style="s2">as he wanted to inspect them as soon as</p>
<p begin="06:53:09.840" end="06:53:13.200" style="s2">possible. Freyos then looked back</p>
<p begin="06:53:11.600" end="06:53:14.878" style="s2">towards Zetle and pointed out that he</p>
<p begin="06:53:13.200" end="06:53:16.558" style="s2">had probably already sent his examiner</p>
<p begin="06:53:14.878" end="06:53:18.160" style="s2">ahead as well, and if they did not</p>
<p begin="06:53:16.558" end="06:53:20.320" style="s2">hurry, they would end up getting chewed</p>
<p begin="06:53:18.160" end="06:53:21.840" style="s2">out. Zetle agreed, and the four of them</p>
<p begin="06:53:20.320" end="06:53:23.520" style="s2">continued towards the graduation</p>
<p begin="06:53:21.840" end="06:53:25.600" style="s2">ceremony that is about to happen.</p>
<p begin="06:53:23.520" end="06:53:27.120" style="s2">Meanwhile, inside the arena, the</p>
<p begin="06:53:25.600" end="06:53:28.958" style="s2">graduating students had gathered</p>
<p begin="06:53:27.120" end="06:53:31.040" style="s2">together. Beads of sweat rolled down</p>
<p begin="06:53:28.958" end="06:53:33.200" style="s2">Ranges&#39;s face as he tightly clutched his</p>
<p begin="06:53:31.040" end="06:53:35.280" style="s2">spear. Overwhelmed by nervousness,</p>
<p begin="06:53:33.200" end="06:53:36.878" style="s2">Seline reassured him, reminding him that</p>
<p begin="06:53:35.280" end="06:53:38.558" style="s2">everything was fine and that he should</p>
<p begin="06:53:36.878" end="06:53:40.638" style="s2">remember how hard he had worked up until</p>
<p begin="06:53:38.558" end="06:53:42.478" style="s2">this moment. Ranges admitted that he</p>
<p begin="06:53:40.638" end="06:53:44.240" style="s2">knew how hard he had worked. But looking</p>
<p begin="06:53:42.478" end="06:53:46.080" style="s2">at all the nobles, high-ranking</p>
<p begin="06:53:44.240" end="06:53:48.478" style="s2">officials of the family, and countless</p>
<p begin="06:53:46.080" end="06:53:50.478" style="s2">VIPs gathered around the arena made him</p>
<p begin="06:53:48.478" end="06:53:52.080" style="s2">even more nervous. There were even more</p>
<p begin="06:53:50.478" end="06:53:53.920" style="s2">people present than during the entrance</p>
<p begin="06:53:52.080" end="06:53:55.840" style="s2">ceremony, and all of them were staring</p>
<p begin="06:53:53.920" end="06:53:57.760" style="s2">directly at the graduating students.</p>
<p begin="06:53:55.840" end="06:53:59.440" style="s2">Rangus could feel himself becoming sick</p>
<p begin="06:53:57.760" end="06:54:01.040" style="s2">from the pressure and wondered what he</p>
<p begin="06:53:59.440" end="06:54:02.798" style="s2">was supposed to do. Raymon then</p>
<p begin="06:54:01.040" end="06:54:05.120" style="s2">approached him and asked whether he was</p>
<p begin="06:54:02.798" end="06:54:06.798" style="s2">all right. Rangus assured Raymon that he</p>
<p begin="06:54:05.120" end="06:54:08.400" style="s2">was hanging in there before pointing out</p>
<p begin="06:54:06.798" end="06:54:10.160" style="s2">that both Raymond and Seline were</p>
<p begin="06:54:08.400" end="06:54:11.920" style="s2">amazing because neither of them seemed</p>
<p begin="06:54:10.160" end="06:54:13.840" style="s2">nervous at all. Raymond immediately</p>
<p begin="06:54:11.920" end="06:54:16.080" style="s2">agreed with him, seemingly unaware of</p>
<p begin="06:54:13.840" end="06:54:17.760" style="s2">the irony. Selene, however, explained</p>
<p begin="06:54:16.080" end="06:54:19.440" style="s2">that perhaps their continued training</p>
<p begin="06:54:17.760" end="06:54:21.120" style="s2">using the regimen Master Zeke had</p>
<p begin="06:54:19.440" end="06:54:23.200" style="s2">prepared for them was what gave them</p>
<p begin="06:54:21.120" end="06:54:24.718" style="s2">confidence. Hearing this caused Ranges</p>
<p begin="06:54:23.200" end="06:54:26.240" style="s2">to fall silent for a moment before he</p>
<p begin="06:54:24.718" end="06:54:27.840" style="s2">asked Raymond and Seline whether they</p>
<p begin="06:54:26.240" end="06:54:29.920" style="s2">thought Master Zeke would come to attend</p>
<p begin="06:54:27.840" end="06:54:31.760" style="s2">their graduation. Before either of them</p>
<p begin="06:54:29.920" end="06:54:33.600" style="s2">could answer, Leica approached and</p>
<p begin="06:54:31.760" end="06:54:35.440" style="s2">confidently assured them that Zeke would</p>
<p begin="06:54:33.600" end="06:54:36.798" style="s2">surely come. She told them that they did</p>
<p begin="06:54:35.440" end="06:54:39.120" style="s2">not need to worry because he would</p>
<p begin="06:54:36.798" end="06:54:41.840" style="s2">definitely make it in time. Lea&#39;s firm</p>
<p begin="06:54:39.120" end="06:54:43.680" style="s2">words caused Raymond, Seline, and Rangis</p>
<p begin="06:54:41.840" end="06:54:45.440" style="s2">to fall silent for a moment before they</p>
<p begin="06:54:43.680" end="06:54:47.360" style="s2">eventually smiled and agreed with her.</p>
<p begin="06:54:45.440" end="06:54:48.958" style="s2">Deep inside, however, Leica could not</p>
<p begin="06:54:47.360" end="06:54:50.878" style="s2">help but wonder whether Zeke was really</p>
<p begin="06:54:48.958" end="06:54:52.958" style="s2">all right after spending 3 years in the</p>
<p begin="06:54:50.878" end="06:54:54.878" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley. At the same</p>
<p begin="06:54:52.958" end="06:54:56.878" style="s2">time, the other students preparing for</p>
<p begin="06:54:54.878" end="06:54:58.558" style="s2">graduation suddenly became shocked when</p>
<p begin="06:54:56.878" end="06:55:00.478" style="s2">they noticed several important figures</p>
<p begin="06:54:58.558" end="06:55:02.160" style="s2">entering the arena. As the newcomers</p>
<p begin="06:55:00.478" end="06:55:03.600" style="s2">approached, the students could hardly</p>
<p begin="06:55:02.160" end="06:55:06.080" style="s2">believe who had come to attend their</p>
<p begin="06:55:03.600" end="06:55:07.840" style="s2">graduation. Even Rangus and Leica were</p>
<p begin="06:55:06.080" end="06:55:09.760" style="s2">momentarily stunned into silence when</p>
<p begin="06:55:07.840" end="06:55:11.600" style="s2">they saw Captain Sana walking toward</p>
<p begin="06:55:09.760" end="06:55:13.440" style="s2">them, the captain of the Silver Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:55:11.600" end="06:55:15.120" style="s2">Corps. The students began whispering</p>
<p begin="06:55:13.440" end="06:55:17.520" style="s2">among themselves, immediately</p>
<p begin="06:55:15.120" end="06:55:20.000" style="s2">recognizing Sulana as the executioner of</p>
<p begin="06:55:17.520" end="06:55:22.080" style="s2">House Lragon. They had heard that Sulana</p>
<p begin="06:55:20.000" end="06:55:24.080" style="s2">rarely appeared at public events, making</p>
<p begin="06:55:22.080" end="06:55:26.080" style="s2">her presence at the graduation ceremony</p>
<p begin="06:55:24.080" end="06:55:28.240" style="s2">all the more surprising. Zetle greeted</p>
<p begin="06:55:26.080" end="06:55:30.080" style="s2">Sulana with a smile and remarked that he</p>
<p begin="06:55:28.240" end="06:55:32.638" style="s2">never expected Lady Sana to come in</p>
<p begin="06:55:30.080" end="06:55:33.920" style="s2">person. Sana took a seat beside Zetel</p>
<p begin="06:55:32.638" end="06:55:36.080" style="s2">and explained that there was something</p>
<p begin="06:55:33.920" end="06:55:37.520" style="s2">she had become curious about. Zetle</p>
<p begin="06:55:36.080" end="06:55:39.600" style="s2">asked what exactly had caught her</p>
<p begin="06:55:37.520" end="06:55:40.958" style="s2">interest, but Sana remained silent as</p>
<p begin="06:55:39.600" end="06:55:43.120" style="s2">she stared toward the graduating</p>
<p begin="06:55:40.958" end="06:55:44.638" style="s2">students. Deep inside, she wondered</p>
<p begin="06:55:43.120" end="06:55:46.400" style="s2">whether the people she was looking for</p>
<p begin="06:55:44.638" end="06:55:48.240" style="s2">were still not here yet, and whether</p>
<p begin="06:55:46.400" end="06:55:50.478" style="s2">coming to this ceremony had simply been</p>
<p begin="06:55:48.240" end="06:55:52.478" style="s2">a pointless endeavor. Then, without</p>
<p begin="06:55:50.478" end="06:55:54.080" style="s2">warning, an immense and overwhelming</p>
<p begin="06:55:52.478" end="06:55:55.840" style="s2">pressure descended upon the entire</p>
<p begin="06:55:54.080" end="06:55:57.440" style="s2">arena. The graduating students were</p>
<p begin="06:55:55.840" end="06:55:59.200" style="s2">immediately struck by the terrifying</p>
<p begin="06:55:57.440" end="06:56:01.200" style="s2">force of the aura, causing them to</p>
<p begin="06:55:59.200" end="06:56:03.120" style="s2">experience intense pain and difficulty</p>
<p begin="06:56:01.200" end="06:56:04.558" style="s2">breathing. None of them understood what</p>
<p begin="06:56:03.120" end="06:56:06.320" style="s2">was happening as they struggled under</p>
<p begin="06:56:04.558" end="06:56:08.000" style="s2">the crushing pressure. As the source of</p>
<p begin="06:56:06.320" end="06:56:09.920" style="s2">the pressure approached, the students</p>
<p begin="06:56:08.000" end="06:56:11.920" style="s2">were left completely stunned when they</p>
<p begin="06:56:09.920" end="06:56:14.080" style="s2">saw a gigantic dragon descending upon</p>
<p begin="06:56:11.920" end="06:56:15.600" style="s2">the arena. Riding on the dragon&#39;s back</p>
<p begin="06:56:14.080" end="06:56:18.400" style="s2">was none other than the current dragon</p>
<p begin="06:56:15.600" end="06:56:20.478" style="s2">king, Lord Tart, also known as Balsa,</p>
<p begin="06:56:18.400" end="06:56:22.400" style="s2">the head of the Lragon family. Seeing</p>
<p begin="06:56:20.478" end="06:56:24.878" style="s2">Lord Balza arrive at the graduation</p>
<p begin="06:56:22.400" end="06:56:26.558" style="s2">ceremony while riding a dragon, Sana</p>
<p begin="06:56:24.878" end="06:56:29.040" style="s2">remarked to Zetle that Balsza was as</p>
<p begin="06:56:26.558" end="06:56:31.120" style="s2">ostentatious as ever for absolutely no</p>
<p begin="06:56:29.040" end="06:56:32.798" style="s2">reason. The dragon landed directly in</p>
<p begin="06:56:31.120" end="06:56:34.638" style="s2">front of the graduating students and</p>
<p begin="06:56:32.798" end="06:56:36.878" style="s2">carefully observed every single one of</p>
<p begin="06:56:34.638" end="06:56:38.718" style="s2">them. After examining the students, its</p>
<p begin="06:56:36.878" end="06:56:41.120" style="s2">gaze eventually settled on Rangess and</p>
<p begin="06:56:38.718" end="06:56:43.360" style="s2">Raymond before it snorted and informed</p>
<p begin="06:56:41.120" end="06:56:45.040" style="s2">Balsa that this year&#39;s graduating class</p>
<p begin="06:56:43.360" end="06:56:47.360" style="s2">seemed to be slightly better than last</p>
<p begin="06:56:45.040" end="06:56:48.798" style="s2">year&#39;s. Balsa remained silent for a</p>
<p begin="06:56:47.360" end="06:56:50.638" style="s2">moment before climbing down from the</p>
<p begin="06:56:48.798" end="06:56:52.320" style="s2">dragon. The moment his feet touched the</p>
<p begin="06:56:50.638" end="06:56:54.400" style="s2">ground, another wave of pressure</p>
<p begin="06:56:52.320" end="06:56:56.160" style="s2">descended upon the graduating students,</p>
<p begin="06:56:54.400" end="06:56:58.080" style="s2">forcing them to endure the terrifying</p>
<p begin="06:56:56.160" end="06:56:59.840" style="s2">weight of his presence. Balsa then</p>
<p begin="06:56:58.080" end="06:57:01.920" style="s2">declared that from that moment onward,</p>
<p begin="06:56:59.840" end="06:57:04.000" style="s2">the graduation ceremony would begin.</p>
<p begin="06:57:01.920" end="06:57:05.920" style="s2">Meanwhile, deep within the abandoned</p>
<p begin="06:57:04.000" end="06:57:07.360" style="s2">dragon valley, two soldiers approached</p>
<p begin="06:57:05.920" end="06:57:08.638" style="s2">the entrance. While one of them</p>
<p begin="06:57:07.360" end="06:57:10.878" style="s2">questioned whether they were really</p>
<p begin="06:57:08.638" end="06:57:12.718" style="s2">going inside, his companion simply</p>
<p begin="06:57:10.878" end="06:57:14.400" style="s2">reminded him that it was an order, so</p>
<p begin="06:57:12.718" end="06:57:15.920" style="s2">there was no point questioning it. The</p>
<p begin="06:57:14.400" end="06:57:17.520" style="s2">first soldier complained that traveling</p>
<p begin="06:57:15.920" end="06:57:19.440" style="s2">all the way into the abandoned Dragon</p>
<p begin="06:57:17.520" end="06:57:21.200" style="s2">Valley just to deliver news about the</p>
<p begin="06:57:19.440" end="06:57:23.440" style="s2">graduation ceremony was completely</p>
<p begin="06:57:21.200" end="06:57:25.360" style="s2">pointless, especially since there was no</p>
<p begin="06:57:23.440" end="06:57:27.520" style="s2">way Zeke could still be alive. His</p>
<p begin="06:57:25.360" end="06:57:29.440" style="s2">companion, however, reminded him that</p>
<p begin="06:57:27.520" end="06:57:31.440" style="s2">even if that was true, there was always</p>
<p begin="06:57:29.440" end="06:57:33.840" style="s2">that one ina- million chance that Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:57:31.440" end="06:57:35.600" style="s2">had somehow survived. The other soldier</p>
<p begin="06:57:33.840" end="06:57:37.600" style="s2">argued that there was absolutely no way</p>
<p begin="06:57:35.600" end="06:57:39.520" style="s2">that could have happened. Besides, if</p>
<p begin="06:57:37.600" end="06:57:41.280" style="s2">the higher-ups genuinely believed Zeke</p>
<p begin="06:57:39.520" end="06:57:43.120" style="s2">was still alive, they should have sent</p>
<p begin="06:57:41.280" end="06:57:44.798" style="s2">someone to retrieve him days ago rather</p>
<p begin="06:57:43.120" end="06:57:47.200" style="s2">than sending them on the very day of the</p>
<p begin="06:57:44.798" end="06:57:49.280" style="s2">graduation ceremony. At this rate, even</p>
<p begin="06:57:47.200" end="06:57:51.360" style="s2">if Zeke were alive, there was no way he</p>
<p begin="06:57:49.280" end="06:57:53.200" style="s2">could arrive in time. His companion</p>
<p begin="06:57:51.360" end="06:57:54.638" style="s2">simply told him to shut up and reminded</p>
<p begin="06:57:53.200" end="06:57:57.040" style="s2">him that they only needed to keep their</p>
<p begin="06:57:54.638" end="06:57:58.478" style="s2">mouths shut and follow orders. As the</p>
<p begin="06:57:57.040" end="06:58:00.718" style="s2">two soldiers approached the rift,</p>
<p begin="06:57:58.478" end="06:58:03.120" style="s2">however, the entire area suddenly began</p>
<p begin="06:58:00.718" end="06:58:04.958" style="s2">to shake violently. The ground trembled,</p>
<p begin="06:58:03.120" end="06:58:07.120" style="s2">the surrounding environment shook, and</p>
<p begin="06:58:04.958" end="06:58:08.798" style="s2">both soldiers froze in terror as beads</p>
<p begin="06:58:07.120" end="06:58:10.558" style="s2">of sweat immediately rolled down their</p>
<p begin="06:58:08.798" end="06:58:12.160" style="s2">faces. They desperately wondered what</p>
<p begin="06:58:10.558" end="06:58:14.320" style="s2">had just happened. Deep within the</p>
<p begin="06:58:12.160" end="06:58:16.558" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley, the answer soon</p>
<p begin="06:58:14.320" end="06:58:18.798" style="s2">became clear. Zeke had just unleashed a</p>
<p begin="06:58:16.558" end="06:58:20.798" style="s2">terrifying blow against Lord Lunarex,</p>
<p begin="06:58:18.798" end="06:58:22.638" style="s2">sending the mighty dragon crashing into</p>
<p begin="06:58:20.798" end="06:58:24.558" style="s2">the ground along with all the other</p>
<p begin="06:58:22.638" end="06:58:26.718" style="s2">dragons throughout the abandoned dragon</p>
<p begin="06:58:24.558" end="06:58:28.798" style="s2">valley. Zeke stood at the center of the</p>
<p begin="06:58:26.718" end="06:58:31.040" style="s2">fallen dragons, blood dripping from his</p>
<p begin="06:58:28.798" end="06:58:33.120" style="s2">fist after defeating them all. His eyes</p>
<p begin="06:58:31.040" end="06:58:34.878" style="s2">burned with a terrifying golden glow as</p>
<p begin="06:58:33.120" end="06:58:37.040" style="s2">he silently stood among the defeated</p>
<p begin="06:58:34.878" end="06:58:38.958" style="s2">dragons, revealing just how drastically</p>
<p begin="06:58:37.040" end="06:58:42.320" style="s2">he had changed after three years in the</p>
<p begin="06:58:38.958" end="06:58:42.320" style="s2">abandoned Dragon Valley.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
